{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_10","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine repository was cloned successfully. The current commit matches 49ef2ba exactly.\n\nI will read MAKE_A_GAME.md and starter.rs to understand the engine architecture. I will also download hub files in parallel. I am weighing whether to use subagents to explore the large codebase while designing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58293a0d-1c2c-4baa-8495-f7e56ebc332b-9","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/MAKE_A_GAME.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58293a0d-1c2c-4baa-8495-f7e56ebc332b-10","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58293a0d-1c2c-4baa-8495-f7e56ebc332b-11","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"set -euo pipefail\nHUB=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub\"\ncd \"$HUB\"\nfor f in session.js harness.html bridge.js round.js README.md; do\n  curl -fsSL -o \"$f\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/$f\"\n  echo \"$f $(wc -c < \"$f\")\"\ndone\n# fonts\nFONTDIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/fonts-pack\"\nmkdir -p \"$FONTDIR\"\ncd \"$FONTDIR\"\nnpm pack @expo-google-fonts/fredoka @expo-google-fonts/nunito --silent\nls -la\necho FONTS_OK","description":"Download AI Hub client and font packages"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1230,"output_tokens":682,"cache_read_input_to