{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-121a7c0a-f729-4a0c-a70c-417401f12b34-101","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# The starter game's level: a room file (every field: rooms/_template.toml). Column = x (east),\\n# row = z (south), 1 cell = 1 m. `o` cells are shards and `P` is the start (legend markers,\\n# read by starter.rs with `scenes::markers`); the slimes are [[npc]] entries the game drives.\\n# Check it with `pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml`.\\n\\nname = \\\"Starter\\\"\\nabout = \\\"Collect every shard while slimes chase you.\\\"\\nentrance = { at = [8, 12], facing = \\\"south\\\" }   # required by the format; the `P` marker is the start\\n\\n10→# The rules' numbers (starter.rs `Rules`). Running from the repository, `pav` reads this file at\\n# each `load`: edit, then `load scene=starter` or `play bot=true seeds=10`, no rebuild.\\n[game]\\nlives = 3\\nslime_speed = 0.5\\nslime_sight = 9.0\\ncatch = 0.8\\npick = 0.9\\ngrace = 2.0\\n\\n20→[camera]\\ntilt = 58.0\\ndistance = 17.0\\n\\n[layout]\\norigin = [-9.0, 0.0, -6.5]\\n\\n[[layout.layer]]\\ny = 0\\nmap = '''\\n30→##################\\n#o......#.......o#\\n#.......#........#\\n#..##.......##...#\\n#..#.........#...#\\n#.......o........#\\n#....#.....#.....#\\n#.......P........#\\n#..#.........#...#\\n#..##.......##...#\\n40→#.......#........#\\n#o......#.......o#\\n##################\\n'''\\n\\n[layout.legend.'.']\\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \\\"#3b4a5c\\\" }]\\n\\n[layout.legend.'#']\\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \\\"#3b4a5c\\\" }, { y0 = 0, y1 = 1.2, color = \\\"#8a6f9e\\\", rounded = true }]\\n50→\\n[layout.legend.'o']\\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \\\"#3b4a5c\\\" }]\\nmarker = \\\"shard\\\"\\n\\n[layout.legend.'P']\\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \\\"#3b4a5c\\\" }]\\nmarker = \\\"player\\\"\\n\\n[[npc]]\\n60→name = \\\"slime\\\"\\nkind = \\\"blob\\\