{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_62","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Text shapes are collected. Painter.text or ui.label will be used so readings see prompts.\n\nFonts must be installed before the first run_ui to avoid a panic. Headless creates a new context every frame, so set_fonts only takes effect on the next pass. The plan is to install fonts in App::new and Headless::frame.\n\nHeadless runs three passes per frame. The plan notes that set_fonts only takes effect on the next pass, but since Headless creates a new context each frame, no next pass exists. The first pass may panic if it immediately references the newly installed font family.\n\nThe default proportional font already exists, so using it avoids the same-pass panic. The custom font replaces it on the next pass. Headless runs three passes per frame, so passes one and two will render with the new font. The final reading comes from the last output.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-02c0e5c4-1bc4-4bea-a35a-ab99829c94e0-126","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"egui_ctx|Context::default","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":680,"output_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":191488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b623114e-26bd-4915-8eb9-b73fae90d04b"}
