{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_74","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I need to complete all tasks in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer and ensure everything TASK.md requires is present.\n\nResearch for the Wii Fit-inspired game \"Wobble Minutes\" is complete. I will check the current file state, write PROGRESS.md, and begin implementation now.\n\nI will implement the game myself without review subagents. I am mapping out the most efficient build order: engine seams first, then FitGame core, then UI and audio, followed by tests and HTML build. I may use subagents for independent parallel pieces if allowed.\n\nI will read the critical engine files first to ensure accurate edits. Then I will write the game code directly, working in parallel where possible.\n\nI have mapped out the exact engine patches needed. These cover input constants, simulation state, audio events, and UI hooks. I will apply these minimal changes first.\n\nI have mapped the remaining engine patches for pav_app, pav_view, and pav_tools. The FitGame module will be extensive, so I am checking PLAN.md for exact formulas before writing code. Scene keys like fit/medley and fit/event/name are valid.\n\nI will write the core game in large files. I am checking PLAN.md for exact audio event names, UI details, and hub JavaScript. I will unpack font tarballs and review the egui 0.36 API from existing engine code. I will read the target files in a batch before writing PROGRESS.md and starting implementation.\n\nI am designing the game flow to be bot-friendly. The bot must finish the entire game in under 60 minutes with five stamps and three seeds. I will write all game source in one large fit module, patch the engine, then compile and fix errors.\n\nI am calculating the bot's exact time budget. Sixty sim-minutes equals 216,000 ticks. I am estimating event durations to ensure the full playthrough stays under this limit.\n\nI estimated the bot's total sim time at roughly 20 minutes. That is well under the 60-minute limit. I also noted that cargo test runs three full playthroughs, which means 216,000 simulation steps.\n\nI must keep FitGame lightweight for tests. History snapshots are small, but state cloning every 20 ticks still costs time. I will avoid storing large vectors. The direct event tests alone require roughly 20 minutes of simulation, so events must be short enough for bots yet still satisfying for humans.\n\nI am checking PLAN.md for exact event durations. I am also weighing whether events should end early when the star threshold is met, which would speed up bot playthroughs without breaking human gameplay.\n\nEvents will end early once the star threshold is reached or the timer expires. The Plank event needs roughly 12,000 ticks across five seeds to reach two stars. Morning check yields age rather than stars, so it may not count as a scored event.\n\nMorning check will score by skill so the bot can earn stars while idle stays below one. Big Stand will be tested as a full event with five seeds. Idle input must score under 400 points to guarantee a single star. I am reading PLAN.md scoring details now.\n\nI am checking how to add a character and spawn objects in the simulation. I will read sim.rs, games/mod.rs, and room templates to understand the build system. I will also look at input button definitions.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Title is already drawn as Wobble Minutes. I’ll write the progress note and start the engine seams and game sim."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5b45d3cf-59fc-40fa-a2bb-758041e8f160-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"title-setup","content":"Pick title with RNG from 50 riffs, record draw, clone engine, keep PROGRESS.md","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"shell","content":"Register game, hide chrome, lean input, title/pause shell, save, hub tags, boot smoke","status":"pending"},{"id":"balance-loop","content":"Shared balance model, morning check, island day loop, one full event + sim tests","status":"pending"},{"id":"events","content":"Remaining events, day unlocks, Big Stand, endings, free play, bot playthrough","status":"pending"},{"id":"audio-ui","content":"Synth music/SFX/voices, attract, settings, dev sliders, touch-only card","status":"pending"},{"id":"multiplayer","content":"Wardrobe, flip-flops, Yesterday You, Play Together, hub ghost medley","status":"pending"},{"id":"handin","content":"Script, About, exit-interview, single HTML, tests twice, captures, delete caches","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5b45d3cf-59fc-40fa-a2bb-758041e8f160-1","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn step_inner|fn play_pre|fn frame\\(|history_seconds|struct HudFrame|enum SimEvent|struct InputFrame|fn frozen|const BTN_","glob":"**/{sim.rs,frame.rs,input.rs,games/mod.rs,puppet.rs}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5b45d3cf-59fc-40fa-a2bb-758041e8f160-2","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18466,"output_tokens":2768,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"41348200-8a83-466b-af02-dd642d23c068"}
