{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_78","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a massive implementation.\n\nI will read PLAN.md to identify the essential formulas and verification checklist. I also need to examine how Sim::new routes scenes, Tunable, and app input so I can patch correctly. The implementation will be a single large module that handles all game flow in FitGame. Simple visual boxes will represent the island. All required events must be included.\n\nI will also check pav_app input bindings, the audio Mixer, headless UI, and web index.html. The scope is too large for a single perfect pass, so I will ship a compact architecture with minimal engine patches. The first changes target input.rs and frame.rs.\n\nThe patch list now covers games/mod.rs, sim.rs, puppet.rs, parts.rs, pav_audio, pav_ui, pav_app, and pav_view. Adding SimEvent variants requires updating every match on that enum. I will locate all of them first. The game module structure is next.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8f7b99-ef9c-4815-9a76-595dadd4887a-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"SimEvent::Travel|SimEvent::","glob":"**/*.rs","head_limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8f7b99-ef9c-4815-9a76-595dadd4887a-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn new\\(|scene.split|games::find","glob":"**/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8f7b99-ef9c-4815-9a76-595dadd4887a-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"match ev|SimEvent::","glob":"**/pav_view/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d8f7b99-ef9c-4815-9a76-595dadd4887a-24","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct Bindings|fn poll_gamepad|fn game\\(","glob":"**/pav_app/src/input.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":50318,"output_tokens":582,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"5382