-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\"## 0. How to read this plan\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\"## 1. The game in one page\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"## 2. Structure of play\"},{\"line_number\":74,\"content\":\"## 3. Controls\"},{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\"## 4. The Balance Core\"},{\"line_number\":119,\"content\":\"## 5. Events\"},{\"line_number\":125,\"content\":\"### Stillness Studio (Posey). Set: `studio`, a round white deck on a calm dawn lagoon. Camera: mirror view (yaw 0, tilt 12, distance 8.5, fov 36; the figure faces +Z, toward the camera, and stick right is screen right).\"},{\"line_number\":131,\"content\":\"### Iron Gazebo (Big Kettle). Set: `gazebo`, a white iron gazebo at golden hour. Camera: 3/4 front.\"},{\"line_number\":137,\"content\":\"### Boardwalk (Bounce). Set: `boardwalk`, a beach boardwalk at bright midday.\"},{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"### Lagoon (Commodore Gull). Sets: `tide`, `channel`, `pier`, `tower`.\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"### The Big Stand (finale, about 2.5 minutes). Set: `bay`, a tiny post in the bay at sunset, with the whole cast watching from rafts.\"},{\"line_number\":166,\"content\":\"### Morning Wobble Check. Set: `studio`. About 70 s, four micro-tests, Pip presiding.\"},{\"line_number\":181,\"content\":\"## 6. Meta systems\"},{\"line_number\":192,\"content\":\"## 7. World, cast and writing\"},{\"line_number\":227,\"content\":\"## 8. Art direction\"},{\"line_number\":283,\"content\":\"## 9. Animation\"},{\"line_number\":308,\"content\":\"## 10. Audio\"},{\"line_number\":333,\"content\":\"## 11. UI and UX\"},{\"line_number\":371,\"content\":\"## 12. Attract mode\"},{\"line_number\":377,\"content\":\"## 13. Multiplayer\"},{\"line_number\":443,\"content\":\"## 14. Architecture\"},{\"line_number\":520,\"content\":\"## 15. Verified facts and traps\"},{\"line_number\":557,\"content\":\"## 16. Testing\"},{\"line_number\":582,\"content\":\"## 17. Build order\"},{\"line_number\":600,\"content\":\"## 18. Finishing\"},{\"line_number\":608,\"content\":\"### What each brief item maps to\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"905ffd6d-4a23-4674-9091-179353136867"}
