{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_91","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting implementation now. The game will be comprehensive but tight.\n\nWork will proceed in six stages: engine patches, asset generation, Rust modules, UI and audio, tests, and compilation. The Rust game will be organized into core.rs, intent.rs, events.rs, ui_model.rs, and mod.rs. FitGame must implement Clone, Serialize, and Deserialize; UiFrame is built each frame.\n\nUiFrame will be built each frame from state inside the game module. The Game trait will expose a ui_frame method returning Option<Arc<UiFrame>> to avoid cyclic dependencies between sim and game.\n\nTo avoid cyclic dependencies, UiFrame will be placed in a neutral `pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs` module so both the game and UI renderer can use it. The Game trait method will return this structured data directly.\n\nThe Game trait will expose `fit_ui` returning `Option<crate::fit_ui::FitUi>`, and `HudFrame` will store it as `Option<Arc<FitUi>>`. The game logic may reach roughly 2500 lines across `events.rs` and `mod.rs`. Tests will use real time with no internal fast paths, relying on cargo's default parallel test execution.\n\nTo avoid running out of memory during parallel test execution, the test runner will use `--test-threads=2` and group tests into fewer functions. Playthroughs will run sequentially in one test, and event tests will loop through seeds within a single function. This keeps memory usage low while still exercising the full game logic.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aef571e6-7899-4620-be18-d6a5dc372e68-70","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":370,"limit":35}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aef571e6-7899-4620-be18-d6a5dc372e68-71","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct PuppetDef|pub shirt|pub skin|pub gear","glob":"**/puppet.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aef571e6-7899-4620-be18-d6a5dc372e68-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/headless.rs","offset":100,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1643,"output_tokens":1089,"cache_read_input_tokens":125568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cafacf9e-c986-4818-85f1-7907c6faf323"}
