{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_114","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A struct literal must include fields marked Default or use the `..` shorthand.\n\nAdding `lean` and `any` fields to `InputFrame` with `#[serde(default)]`. `SimEvent` new variants are non-exhaustive and match correctly.\n\nAlso adding `ui`, `song_pos`, `device`, and `hub` to `InputFrame` with `#[serde(default)]`. Next step is writing all patches and game files.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88ac6604-f6d4-45e8-a244-ecd364aff0dc-99","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs","offset":720,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":352,"output_tokens":546,"cache_read_input_tokens":163328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"bda603fd-25ef-4e0f-b77d-29c9abc1ad1b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-88ac6604-f6d4-45e8-a244-ecd364aff0dc-99","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"720→            }\\n        }\\n        self.act_kind = id;\\n        self.act = t;\\n        self.act_hit = hit;\\n        self.act_side = side;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Plays motion clip `id` (`crate::clips::find`) with play `flags` at `speed` (0 = 1). The\\n    /// clip playing before stays underneath while the new one fades in. Asking for the clip\\n730→    /// already playing only updates its flags and speed.\\n    pub fn play_clip(&mut self, id: u32, flags: u8, speed: f32) {\\n        if id == 0 {\\n            self.stop_clip();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if id == self.clip && self.clip_flags & crate::clips::STOP == 0 {\\n            self.clip_flags = flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n            self.clip_speed = speed;\\n            return;\\n740→        }\\n        if self.clip != 0 && self.clip_w > 0.0 {\\n            self.clip2 = self.clip;\\n            self.clip2_t = self.clip_t;\\n            self.clip2_w = self.clip_w;\\n            self.clip2_flags = self.clip_flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n        }\\n        self.clip = id;\\n        self.clip_t = 0.0;\\n        self.clip_w = 0.0;\",\"content_concise\":\"720→            }\\n        }\\n        self.act_kind = id;\\n        self.act = t;\\n        self.act_hit = hit;\\n        self.act_side = side;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Plays motion clip `id` (`crate::clips::find`) with play `flags` at `speed` (0 = 1). The\\n    /// clip playing before stays underneath while the new one fades in. Asking for the clip\\n730→    /// already playing only updates its flags and speed.\\n    pub fn play_clip(&mut self, id: u32, flags: u8, speed: f32) {\\n        if id == 0 {\\n            self.stop_clip();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if id == self.clip && self.clip_flags & crate::clips::STOP == 0 {\\n            self.clip_flags = flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n            self.clip_speed = speed;\\n            return;\\n740→        }\\n        if self.clip != 0 && self.clip_w > 0.0 {\\n            self.clip2 = self.clip;\\n            self.clip2_t = self.clip_t;\\n            self.clip2_w = self.clip_w;\\n            self.clip2_flags = self.clip_flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n        }\\n        self.clip = id;\\n        self.clip_t = 0.0;\\n        self.clip_w = 0.0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs\",\"offset\":720,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"            }\\n        }\\n        self.act_kind = id;\\n        self.act = t;\\n        self.act_hit = hit;\\n        self.act_side = side;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Plays motion clip `id` (`crate::clips::find`) with play `flags` at `speed` (0 = 1). The\\n    /// clip playing before stays underneath while the new one fades in. Asking for the clip\\n    /// already playing only updates its flags and speed.\\n    pub fn play_clip(&mut self, id: u32, flags: u8, speed: f32) {\\n        if id == 0 {\\n            self.stop_clip();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if id == self.clip && self.clip_flags & crate::clips::STOP == 0 {\\n            self.clip_flags = flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n            self.clip_speed = speed;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.clip != 0 && self.clip_w > 0.0 {\\n            self.clip2 = self.clip;\\n            self.clip2_t = self.clip_t;\\n            self.clip2_w = self.clip_w;\\n            self.clip2_flags = self.clip_flags & !crate::clips::STOP;\\n        }\\n        self.clip = id;\\n        self.clip_t = 0.0;\\n        self.clip_w = 0.0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1632}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"08e4a703-9273-45ff-af3f-299ac9d23bca"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_115","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code sets the clip even when the clip ID does not exist.\n\nI'll batch-write the game code and update todos. I'll write a real PROGRESS.md status. I'm checking clips.rs to ensure fit.json embeds correctly.\n\nI'll duplicate the Warrior animation keys to create additional clips with names like Breath, Tree, and Bridge. Valid JSON is required so the loader doesn't crash at startup.\n\nI'll generate fit.json using the sample schema. Prop JSON will be simple and valid. I won't spawn custom props in build() until I verify one loads successfully.\n\nI'll add the existing rowboat prop to the room TOML. I may also include a palm prop if it parses correctly. The required fields are name, asset, pos, yaw, scale, and body.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-70878dc8-d305-4c3f-ba16-860b250c213f-100","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/assets/props/lib/core/barrel.json","limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":968,"output_tokens":642,"cache_read_input_tokens":163584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8f700a17-fd9c-46c8-a3b4-d40586c7c788"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-70878dc8-d305-4c3f-ba16-860b250c213f-100","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→{\\\"format\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"barrel\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"cm\\\",\\n\\\"description\\\":\\\"An oak barrel of upright staves bound by four iron hoops, closed by a plank lid.\\\",\\n\\\"tags\\\":[\\\"barrel\\\",\\\"wood\\\",\\\"storage\\\",\\\"cargo\\\",\\\"tavern\\\",\\\"dungeon\\\"],\\n\\\"category\\\":\\\"container\\\",\\n\\\"materials\\\":{\\n\\\"brass\\\":{\\\"color\\\":\\\"#b08d3c\\\",\\\"roughness\\\":0.4,\\\"metallic\\\":0.7},\\n\\\"iron\\\":\\\"MAT/wrought_iron\\\",\\n\\\"lid\\\":\\\"MAT/oak_planks\\\",\\n\\\"staves\\\":{\\\"base\\\":\\\"MAT/barrel_staves\\\",\\\"map\\\":\\\"axis\\\"}},\\n10→\\\"parts\\\":{\\n\\\"body\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"lathe\\\",\\\"profile\\\":[[25,0],[27.3,10],[29.2,25],[30,45],[29.2,65],[27.3,80],[25,90]],\\\"segments\\\":16,\\\"mat\\\":\\\"staves\\\"},\\n\\\"bung\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"cylinder\\\",\\\"radius\\\":3,\\\"height\\\":2,\\\"pos\\\":[10,89.5,6],\\\"color\\\":\\\"#5a3a22\\\",\\\"chance\\\":0.6},\\n\\\"hoop_low\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tube\\\",\\\"radius\\\":27.4,\\\"thickness\\\":1.6,\\\"height\\\":5,\\\"pos\\\":[0,6.5,0],\\\"mat\\\":\\\"iron\\\"},\\n\\\"hoop_mid\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tube\\\",\\\"radius\\\":29.6,\\\"thickness\\\":1.6,\\\"height\\\":4,\\\"pos\\\":[0,22,0],\\\"mat\\\":\\\"iron\\\"},\\n\\\"hoop_rim\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tube\\\",\\\"radius\\\":27.4,\\\"thickness\\\":1.6,\\\"height\\\":5,\\\"pos\\\":[0,83.5,0],\\\"mat\\\":\\\"iron\\\"},\\n\\\"hoop_top\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tube\\\",\\\"radius\\\":29.6,\\\"thickness\\\":1.6,\\\"height\\\":4,\\\"pos\\\":[0,68,0],\\\"mat\\\":\\\"iron\\\"},\\n\\\"lid\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"cylinder\\\",\\\"radius\\\":24.6,\\\"height\\\":3,\\\"pos\\\":[0,87.5,0],\\\"mat\\\":\\\"lid\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"#9a6a3e\\\"}},\\n\\\"params\\\":{\\n\\\"bands\\\":{\\\"choices\\\":[\\\"iron\\\",