66\\nat 0.8 held 0.9514498925544491\\nafter release 0.8 -0.03215222437265726\\nfull 3s (0.9199992447167857, 0.9632499629486623, False, 0.8602762327661161, 0.9632499629486623)\\nwander (-0.047903247384074955, 0.05719841074689844, False, 0.029756923656287012, 0.05719841074689844)\\nwander nokick (-0.047866402695064605, 0.05382981901185876, False, 0.029502965136440698, 0.05382981901185876)\\ngust (1.6681208313091542, 1.7485080849176808, True, 1.39843454729679, 1.7485080849176808)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"python3 - << 'PY'\\nimport math\\nk,d,reach,dt=40,8.5,0.92,1/60\\ndef run(secs, lean, amp=0, gust=0, kicks=False):\\n    cob=vel=0\\n    tip_t=0\\n    tipped=False\\n    peak=0\\n    t=0\\n    kick_in=1.2\\n    samples=[]\\n    while t<secs:\\n        w=amp*(0.7*math.sin(2*math.pi*1.3*t)+0.3*math.sin(2*math.pi*2.9*t+1.7))\\n        acc=(lean*reach+w-cob)*k - vel*d + gust\\n        if kicks:\\n            kick_in-=dt\\n            if kick_in<=0:\\n                vel+=0.1\\n                kick_in=1.5\\n        vel+=acc*dt\\n        cob+=vel*dt\\n        if abs(cob)>1:\\n            tip_t+=dt\\n            if tip_t>=0.35:\\n                tipped=True\\n        else:\\n            tip_t=0\\n        peak=max(peak,abs(cob))\\n        samples.append(abs(cob))\\n        t+=dt\\n    return cob, peak, tipped, sum(samples)/len(samples), max(samples)\\n\\n# reach 90%\\ncob=vel=0\\nt=0\\nhit=None\\npeak=0\\nwhile t<2:\\n    acc=(1*reach-cob)*k - vel*d\\n    vel+=acc*dt; cob+=vel*dt\\n    if hit is None and cob>=0.90: hit=t\\n    peak=max(peak,cob)\\n    t+=dt\\nprint('hit90', hit, 'peak', peak, 'overshoot', (peak-reach)/reach)\\n\\ncob=vel=0\\nfor i in range(int(0.8*60)):\\n    acc=(reach-cob)*k-vel*d\\n    vel+=acc*dt; cob+=vel*dt\\nprint('at 0.8 held', cob)\\n# release from steady-ish\\nfor i in range(int(0.8*60)):\\n    acc=(0-cob)*k-vel*d\\n    vel+=acc*dt; cob+=vel*dt\\nprint('after release 0.8', cob)\\n\\nprint('full 3s', run(3,1))\\nprint('wander', run(10,0,0.12,0,True))\\nprint('wander nokick', run(10,0,0.12,0,False))\\nprint('gust', run(1.2,1,0,30,False))\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Numerically check the balance model\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-1b504cbe-0cc6-480b-9f1b-e2372a419c45-134.log\",\"total_bytes\":548}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"df72b92d-f8bd-446f-8ecf-f5a1e623723f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_128","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The model matches the plan at 90% accuracy.\n\nRelease settles at -0.03 under the 0.05 limit. Lean peak is 0.963. Wander stays within plan bounds. A 25-tip gust will be used for testing. The semi-implicit Euler integration in core.rs is ready. Writing all game files now.\n\nEvents.rs, mod.rs, fit_ui.rs, and the room TOML are being written. A Python script will generate test data. A shared layout function in fit_ui.rs ensures UI and tests use identical normalized menu rectangles.\n\nMenu items will be 0.42 by 0.1 normalized rectangles with a 0.02 gap, centered vertically. Focus scaling is purely visual. I am also adding Ord to EventId so it can be stored in a BTreeSet.\n\nHash is being added to EventId. The mod.rs borrow checker will be handled by extracting fields before passing the mutable sim reference. events::tick will use only Activity, Balance, rules, input, sim, and rng. Age calculation will happen when a check completes.\n\nPhase 0 still metric will use cob length and a velocity nudged at t=5. The idle skill clamp is being adjusted because the 2D vector length of two independent wobbles differs from the 1D test's ~0.03 mean.\n\nThe 2D idle wander mean is estimated at 0.04–0.05, giving a still metric of about 0.375. A bot with 0.9 scores across all phases reaches roughly 0.887 skill and three stars. The 5-second velocity nudge may make the still threshold too harsh for the bot.\n\nThe still metric stays high because the bot recovers from the 5-second nudge within one second at distance 0.2, keeping the mean near 0.03.\n\nTarget test scoring will be hits divided by three. A fully successful run scores one and an idle run scores zero.\n\nSteps test scoring will be hits divided by eight. Eight beats alternate left and right starting at 0.6 seconds with a 0.6-second interval. A press within 0.12 seconds of a beat on the right side counts as a hit.\n\nBlind phase lasts six seconds without the still-phase nudge. The bot will aim at target_x with a PD controller and press STEP_L or STEP_R on beats. A two-second intro card before each phase would extend total check time to roughly forty-two seconds, keeping it well under the seventy-second plan target.\n\nThe check duration will be about seventy seconds. An eight-second skippable intro card will be added at the start, but idle players will wait through it while the bot skips it. The four phases themselves remain the fixed timing contract.\n\nThe final plank phase lasts exactly thirty seconds. A press forfeits the check before that time.\n\nThe bot must survive the plank. The wobble amplitude grows to 0.36 by sixty seconds. The shrinking ring is only 0.20. The bot's PD should cancel the known wobble and keep the cob inside. Kick residual pushes may still push the cob out. I will test this and adjust the kick or bot gain if needed.\n\nThe step-party duration is fixed at sixty-four seconds per the plan. The full playthrough will last about thirteen minutes, which is well under the sixty-second limit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4543d702-0c7f-4caf-824e-732cc507a51f-135","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/rng.rs","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4543d702-0c7f-4caf-824e-732cc507a51f-136","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs","old_string":"","new_string":"//! Painter description for Wobble Minutes. The simulation builds it; `pav_ui` only draws it.\n\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\n/// One clickable row. `rect` is normalized (x, y, w, h), origin top-left, y down.\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct FitItem {\n    pub id: u16,\n    pub label: String,\n    pub rect: [f32; 4],\n}\n\n/// What the 10-foot UI draws this frame.\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct FitUi {\n    pub screen: String,\n    pub title: String,\n    pub lines: Vec<String>,\n    pub items: Vec<FitItem>,\n    pub focus: u16,\n    pub device: u8,\n    pub xbox: bool,\n    /// Short name of the glyph for the primary action (\"Cross\", \"A\", \"Space\", \"Click\").\n    pub glyph: String,\n    pub action: String,\n    pub demo: bool,\n    pub touch_card: bool,\n    /// Balance puck: cob x, cob y, ring radius, target radius. None hides it.\n    pub puck: Option<[f32; 4]>,\n    pub big: String,\n    pub footer: String,\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\n}\n\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\n    match action {\n        \"confirm\" if pad && xbox => \"A\".into(),\n        \"confirm\" if pad => \"Cross\".into(),\n        \"confirm\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \"Click\".into(),\n        \"confirm\" => \"Space\".into(),\n        \"back\" if pad && xbox => \"B\".into(),\n        \"back\" if pad => \"Circle\".into(),\n        \"back\" if device == 3 => \"Right click\".into(),\n        \"back\" => \"Esc\".into(),\n        \"schedule\" if pad && xbox => \"Y\".into(),\n        \"schedule\" if pad => \"Triangle\".into(),\n        \"schedule\" => \"Tab\".into(),\n        \"wave\" if pad && xbox => \"X\".into(),\n        \"wave\" if pad => \"Square\".into(),\n        \"wave\" => \"F\".into(),\n        \"pause\" if pad && xbox => \"Menu\".into(),\n        \"pause\" if pad => \"Options\".into(),\n        \"pause\" => \"Esc\".into(),\n        \"step_l\" if pad && xbox => \"LB\".into(),\n        \"step_l\" if pad => \"L1\".into(),\n        \"step_l\" if device == 3 => \"Left click\".into(),\n        \"step_l\" => \"Q\".into(),\n        \"step_r\" if pad && xbox => \"RB\".into(),\n        \"step_r\" if pad => \"R1\".into(),\n        \"step_r\" if device == 3 => \"Right click\".into(),\n        \"step_r\" => \"E\".into(),\n        \"brace\" if pad && xbox => \"LT+RT\".into(),\n        \"brace\" if pad => \"L2+R2\".into(),\n        \"brace\" => \"Q+E\".into(),\n        \"lean\" if pad => \"Left stick\".into(),\n        \"lean\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \"Mouse\".into(),\n        \"lean\" => \"WASD\".into(),\n        other => other.into(),\n    }\n}\n\n/// Up to six stacked cards, centred.\npub fn stack_rects(n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 4]> {\n    let n = n.min(6);\n    let h = 0.09;\n    let gap = 0.018;\n    let w = 0.46;\n    let total = n as f32 * h + (n.saturating_sub(1) as f32) * gap;\n    let y0 = (1.0 - total) * 0.55;\n    (0..n)\n        .map(|i| {\n            let y = y0 + i as f32 * (h + gap);\n            [0.27, y, w, h]\n        })\n        .collect()\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4550,"output_tokens":3332,"cache_read_input_tokens":184704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c0f01bb3-61c9-4375-93e9-196f92a0a037"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4543d702-0c7f-4caf-824e-732cc507a51f-135","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Small deterministic RNG (PCG32) that lives inside snapshots.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Rng {\\n    state: u64,\\n    inc: u64,\\n}\\n10→\\nimpl Rng {\\n    pub fn new(seed: u64) -> Self {\\n        let mut r = Rng { state: 0, inc: (seed << 1) | 1 };\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r.state = r.state.wrapping_add(seed ^ 0x853c_49e6_748f_ea9b);\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r\\n    }\\n    pub fn next_u32(&mut self) -> u32 {\\n20→        let old = self.state;\\n        self.state = old.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(self.inc);\\n        let xorshifted = (((old >> 18) ^ old) >> 27) as u32;\\n        let rot = (old >> 59) as u32;\\n        xorshifted.rotate_right(rot)\\n    }\\n    /// Uniform in [0, 1).\\n    pub fn f32(&mut self) -> f32 {\\n        (self.next_u32() >> 8) as f32 / (1u32 << 24) as f32\\n    }\\n30→    pub fn range(&mut self, lo: f32, hi: f32) -> f32 {\\n        lo + (hi - lo) * self.f32()\\n    }\\n    pub fn below(&mut self, n: u32) -> u32 {\\n        if n == 0 { 0 } else { self.next_u32() % n }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Stateless hash for seed-derived procedural content (terrain, placement).\\npub fn hash3(seed: u64, x: i32, y: i32, z: i32) -> u64 {\\n40→    let mut h = seed ^ 0x9E37_79B9_7F4A_7C15;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Small deterministic RNG (PCG32) that lives inside snapshots.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Rng {\\n    state: u64,\\n    inc: u64,\\n}\\n10→\\nimpl Rng {\\n    pub fn new(seed: u64) -> Self {\\n        let mut r = Rng { state: 0, inc: (seed << 1) | 1 };\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r.state = r.state.wrapping_add(seed ^ 0x853c_49e6_748f_ea9b);\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r\\n    }\\n    pub fn next_u32(&mut self) -> u32 {\\n20→        let old = self.state;\\n        self.state = old.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(self.inc);\\n        let xorshifted = (((old >> 18) ^ old) >> 27) as u32;\\n        let rot = (old >> 59) as u32;\\n        xorshifted.rotate_right(rot)\\n    }\\n    /// Uniform in [0, 1).\\n    pub fn f32(&mut self) -> f32 {\\n        (self.next_u32() >> 8) as f32 / (1u32 << 24) as f32\\n    }\\n30→    pub fn range(&mut self, lo: f32, hi: f32) -> f32 {\\n        lo + (hi - lo) * self.f32()\\n    }\\n    pub fn below(&mut self, n: u32) -> u32 {\\n        if n == 0 { 0 } else { self.next_u32() % n }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Stateless hash for seed-derived procedural content (terrain, placement).\\npub fn hash3(seed: u64, x: i32, y: i32, z: i32) -> u64 {\\n40→    let mut h = seed ^ 0x9E37_79B9_7F4A_7C15;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/rng.rs\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"//! Small deterministic RNG (PCG32) that lives inside snapshots.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Rng {\\n    state: u64,\\n    inc: u64,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Rng {\\n    pub fn new(seed: u64) -> Self {\\n        let mut r = Rng { state: 0, inc: (seed << 1) | 1 };\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r.state = r.state.wrapping_add(seed ^ 0x853c_49e6_748f_ea9b);\\n        r.next_u32();\\n        r\\n    }\\n    pub fn next_u32(&mut self) -> u32 {\\n        let old = self.state;\\n        self.state = old.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(self.inc);\\n        let xorshifted = (((old >> 18) ^ old) >> 27) as u32;\\n        let rot = (old >> 59) as u32;\\n        xorshifted.rotate_right(rot)\\n    }\\n    /// Uniform in [0, 1).\\n    pub fn f32(&mut self) -> f32 {\\n        (self.next_u32() >> 8) as f32 / (1u32 << 24) as f32\\n    }\\n    pub fn range(&mut self, lo: f32, hi: f32) -> f32 {\\n        lo + (hi - lo) * self.f32()\\n    }\\n    pub fn below(&mut self, n: u32) -> u32 {\\n        if n == 0 { 0 } else { self.next_u32() % n }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Stateless hash for seed-derived procedural content (terrain, placement).\\npub fn hash3(seed: u64, x: i32, y: i32, z: i32) -> u64 {\\n    let mut h = seed ^ 0x9E37_79B9_7F4A_7C15;\\n\",\"total_lines\":52}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4543d702-0c7f-4caf-824e-732cc507a51f-136","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Painter description for Wobble Minutes. The simulation builds it; `pav_ui` only draws it.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n/// One clickable row. `rect` is normalized (x, y, w, h), origin top-left, y down.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitItem {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub label: String,\\n    pub rect: [f32; 4],\\n}\\n\\n/// What the 10-foot UI draws this frame.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitUi {\\n    pub screen: String,\\n    pub title: String,\\n    pub lines: Vec<String>,\\n    pub items: Vec<FitItem>,\\n    pub focus: u16,\\n    pub device: u8,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    /// Short name of the glyph for the primary action (\\\"Cross\\\", \\\"A\\\", \\\"Space\\\", \\\"Click\\\").\\n    pub glyph: String,\\n    pub action: String,\\n    pub demo: bool,\\n    pub touch_card: bool,\\n    /// Balance puck: cob x, cob y, ring radius, target radius. None hides it.\\n    pub puck: Option<[f32; 4]>,\\n    pub big: String,\\n    pub footer: String,\\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\\n    match action {\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"A\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad => \\\"Cross\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" => \\\"Space\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"B\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad => \\\"Circle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Y\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad => \\\"Triangle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" => \\\"Tab\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"X\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad => \\\"Square\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" => \\\"F\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Menu\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad => \\\"Options\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad => \\\"L1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Left click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" => \\\"Q\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"RB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad => \\\"R1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" => \\\"E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LT+RT\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad => \\\"L2+R2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" => \\\"Q+E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if pad => \\\"Left stick\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Mouse\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" => \\\"WASD\\\".into(),\\n        other => other.into(),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Up to six stacked cards, centred.\\npub fn stack_rects(n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 4]> {\\n    let n = n.min(6);\\n    let h = 0.09;\\n    let gap = 0.018;\\n    let w = 0.46;\\n    let total = n as f32 * h + (n.saturating_sub(1) as f32) * gap;\\n    let y0 = (1.0 - total) * 0.55;\\n    (0..n)\\n        .map(|i| {\\n            let y = y0 + i as f32 * (h + gap);\\n            [0.27, y, w, h]\\n        })\\n        .collect()\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Painter description for Wobble Minutes. The simulation builds it; `pav_ui` only draws it.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n/// One clickable row. `rect` is normalized (x, y, w, h), origin top-left, y down.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitItem {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub label: String,\\n    pub rect: [f32; 4],\\n}\\n\\n/// What the 10-foot UI draws this frame.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitUi {\\n    pub screen: String,\\n    pub title: String,\\n    pub lines: Vec<String>,\\n    pub items: Vec<FitItem>,\\n    pub focus: u16,\\n    pub device: u8,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    /// Short name of the glyph for the primary action (\\\"Cross\\\", \\\"A\\\", \\\"Space\\\", \\\"Click\\\").\\n    pub glyph: String,\\n    pub action: String,\\n    pub demo: bool,\\n    pub touch_card: bool,\\n    /// Balance puck: cob x, cob y, ring radius, target radius. None hides it.\\n    pub puck: Option<[f32; 4]>,\\n    pub big: String,\\n    pub footer: String,\\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\\n    match action {\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"A\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad => \\\"Cross\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" => \\\"Space\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"B\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad => \\\"Circle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Y\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad => \\\"Triangle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" => \\\"Tab\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"X\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad => \\\"Square\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" => \\\"F\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Menu\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad => \\\"Options\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad => \\\"L1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Left click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" => \\\"Q\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"RB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad => \\\"R1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" => \\\"E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LT+RT\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad => \\\"L2+R2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" => \\\"Q+E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if pad => \\\"Left stick\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Mouse\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" => \\\"WASD\\\".into(),\\n        other => other.into(),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Up to six stacked cards, centred.\\npub fn stack_rects(n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 4]> {\\n    let n = n.min(6);\\n    let h = 0.09;\\n    let gap = 0.018;\\n    let w = 0.46;\\n    let total = n as f32 * h + (n.saturating_sub(1) as f32) * gap;\\n    let y0 = (1.0 - total) * 0.55;\\n    (0..n)\\n        .map(|i| {\\n            let y = y0 + i as f32 * (h + gap);\\n            [0.27, y, w, h]\\n        })\\n        .collect()\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"0be6e9c4-c9e0-4eb3-b754-e59c643d5325"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_129","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing core.rs, intent.rs, events.rs, and mod.rs.\n\nAlso writing rules.toml, a room, and Python scripts for charts. Resolved borrow checker issues by passing both the simulation state and events vector mutably to tick functions.\n\nSfx events will be pushed but audio will remain silent until sound assets are added. The mod.rs flow is being outlined with functions for build, FitGame, Game methods, menu items, dialogs, camera, and look. A Flow enum is being defined.\n\nThe Flow enum now lists every game state from Title through Credits. The frozen check is being refined so that Reveal and Check are not frozen, while Island, Countdown, Event, Finale, Attract, and other active flows remain frozen.\n\nHub wait logic is being defined. Hub input 1 triggers a wait state that blocks physics while pre still counts. Input 2 or HUB_GO exits the wait and activates hub mode. Medley starts immediately if no hub input is set. The web link will supply hub input later. The initial medley flow begins at Card.\n\nThe Card flow will pause when hub_mode is active and hub_wait is true. Hub mode activates as soon as input.hub is non-zero. The browser sets boot.scene before WASM loads and initializes __hub.go to false, so the game may advance briefly before the hub signal arrives.\n\nThe web link reads `__hub` and sets `hub=1` when the hub is active but not yet started. The script ordering ensures this value exists before WASM loads. Medley will begin at Card with `hub_wait` initially false, then wait for the first tick to see hub input.\n\nThe web link will read `__hub` and set `input.hub` each frame. In hub mode, pause is not frozen so the world keeps running behind the menu.\n\nThe frozen check now returns true for hub_wait, paused state, or menu flows. Hub pause keeps the world running so post still advances events while the menu is drawn. Non-hub pause freezes correctly. Dev mode is hidden during hub mode.\n\nA `paused_flow` field will store the flow to return to after pause. A `time_scale` multiplier will adjust delta time in post and live pre timers, defaulting to 1 and controlled by a dev slider. Slider IDs will map to float parameters via `UiEvent::Slider(300+i, value)`. The reset button will restore default rules and time scale. Rules will implement `visit` in a fixed order so parameter indices stay stable.\n\nRules will use default values from the plan. Event difficulty numbers are being added.\n\nGhost samples will be pushed every six ticks, capped at eighty per event. If a score beats the stored best, the ghost data is saved in a BTreeMap keyed by event name. The clone cost is small.\n\nWhen an event starts on day three or later and a prior best exists, ghost lane mode activates. This tinting requires spawning a second character.\n\nA ghost NPC will be spawned at the side when prior samples exist. Its position updates from the sample data each frame in post while the event is active, and tinting applies to that entity ID. The spawn is skipped during demo mode to avoid saving a ghost.\n\nFlip flops will appear at five positions relative to the player spawn. Collecting them on the island within 1.2 units triggers a golden shoes bonus after all five are gathered. This logic runs in post during the Island flow, which is not frozen.\n\nSchedule is frozen during selection so the player cannot walk while choosing. Fast travel will teleport to a marker and trigger a camera cue. The room will use a single player marker for all events, with each event offset slightly by index to avoid overlap.\n\nWriting hub.toml. The room will include water and sand to avoid a blank space. Existing assets like barrel and rowboat will be placed as objects, with the rowboat scaled down if needed. Camera cues will vary per event. RoomDef requires entrance, layout, and name fields.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b1f6edac-75c4-4dd1-b5b7-baf21e320b9e-137","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs","old_string":"","new_string":"//! One balance model for every event. Semi-implicit Euler at the sim tick.\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\nuse crate::params::{ParamVisitor, Tunable};\n\n/// Tunable numbers. Progress lives on [`super::FitGame`], not here, so Reset restores feel only.\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(default)]\npub struct Rules {\n    pub stiffness: f32,\n    pub damping: f32,\n    pub reach: f32,\n    pub tip_time: f32,\n    pub wobble: f32,\n    pub stick_curve: f32,\n    pub key_rate: f32,\n    pub key_return: f32,\n    pub breath_secs: f32,\n    pub pose_secs: f32,\n    pub pose_ring: f32,\n    pub squat_reps: i32,\n    pub plank_secs: f32,\n    pub step_secs: f32,\n    pub floatie_secs: f32,\n    pub spin_lo: f32,\n    pub spin_hi: f32,\n    pub spin_band_scale: f32,\n    pub lap_secs: f32,\n    pub tide_secs: f32,\n    pub paddle_secs: f32,\n    pub paddle_par: f32,\n    pub tray_secs: f32,\n    pub cannon_secs: f32,\n    pub gust: f32,\n    pub bounce_gain: f32,\n    pub big_gust: f32,\n    pub rhythm_perfect: f32,\n    pub rhythm_good: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Default for Rules {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            stiffness: 40.0,\n            damping: 8.5,\n            reach: 0.92,\n            tip_time: 0.35,\n            wobble: 0.12,\n            stick_curve: 1.5,\n            key_rate: 1.6,\n            key_return: 1.2,\n            breath_secs: 45.0,\n            pose_secs: 20.0,\n            pose_ring: 0.30,\n            squat_reps: 10,\n            plank_secs: 60.0,\n            step_secs: 64.0,\n            floatie_secs: 50.0,\n            spin_lo: 6.0,\n            spin_hi: 9.0,\n            spin_band_scale: 1.35,\n            lap_secs: 90.0,\n            tide_secs: 20.0,\n            paddle_secs: 45.0,\n            paddle_par: 28.0,\n            tray_secs: 50.0,\n            cannon_secs: 40.0,\n            gust: 18.0,\n            bounce_gain: 1.0,\n            big_gust: 22.0,\n            rhythm_perfect: 0.055,\n            rhythm_good: 0.120,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Tunable for Rules {\n    fn visit(&mut self, v: &mut dyn ParamVisitor) {\n        v.float(\"stiffness\", &mut self.stiffness, 5.0, 80.0, \"How fast the dot chases your lean\");\n        v.float(\"damping\", &mut self.damping, 1.0, 20.0, \"How quickly the chase settles\");\n        v.float(\"reach\", &mut self.reach, 0.4, 1.0, \"Where a full lean comes to rest\");\n        v.float(\"tip_time\", &mut self.tip_time, 0.1, 1.0, \"Seconds outside the disc before a tip\");\n        v.float(\"wobble\", &mut self.wobble, 0.0, 0.4, \"Idle wander of the dot\");\n        v.float(\"stick_curve\", &mut self.stick_curve, 1.0, 3.0, \"Stick response exponent\");\n        v.float(\"key_rate\", &mut self.key_rate, 0.2, 4.0, \"Keyboard lean speed\");\n        v.float(\"key_return\", &mut self.key_return, 0.2, 4.0, \"Keyboard return speed\");\n        v.float(\"breath_secs\", &mut self.breath_secs, 10.0, 90.0, \"Breath Bloom length\");\n        v.float(\"pose_secs\", &mut self.pose_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \"Seconds for one pose\");\n        v.float(\"pose_ring\", &mut self.pose_ring, 0.1, 0.6, \"Pose ring start radius\");\n        v.float(\"plank_secs\", &mut self.plank_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \"Plank length\");\n        v.float(\"step_secs\", &mut self.step_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \"Step Party length\");\n        v.float(\"floatie_secs\", &mut self.floatie_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \"Floatie Spin length\");\n        v.float(\"spin_lo\", &mut self.spin_lo, 2.0, 12.0, \"Spin band low\");\n        v.float(\"spin_hi\", &mut self.spin_hi, 4.0, 16.0, \"Spin band high\");\n        v.float(\"spin_band_scale\", &mut self.spin_band_scale, 1.0, 2.0, \"Keyboard spin band scale\");\n        v.float(\"lap_secs\", &mut self.lap_secs, 30.0, 120.0, \"Morning Lap length\");\n        v.float(\"tide_secs\", &mut self.tide_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \"Seconds per tide board\");\n        v.float(\"paddle_secs\", &mut self.paddle_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \"Paddle time limit\");\n        v.float(\"paddle_par\", &mut self.paddle_par, 12.0, 50.0, \"Paddle par time\");\n        v.float(\"tray_secs\", &mut self.tray_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \"Tray Trek length\");\n        v.float(\"cannon_secs\", &mut self.cannon_secs, 15.0, 70.0, \"Cannonball Cup length\");\n        v.float(\"gust\", &mut self.gust, 0.0, 40.0, \"Gust strength\");\n        v.float(\"bounce_gain\", &mut self.bounce_gain, 0.4, 2.0, \"Board bounce gain\");\n        v.float(\"big_gust\", &mut self.big_gust, 0.0, 40.0, \"Big Stand gusts\");\n        v.float(\"rhythm_perfect\", &mut self.rhythm_perfect, 0.02, 0.12, \"Perfect window\");\n        v.float(\"rhythm_good\", &mut self.rhythm_good, 0.06, 0.2, \"Good window\");\n        let _ = v.int(\"squat_reps\", &mut self.squat_reps, 4, 20, \"Squat count\");\n    }\n}\n\n/// Centre of pressure. `tipped` is true only on the tick a tip happens.\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct BalanceCore {\n    pub cob: Vec2,\n    pub vel: Vec2,\n    pub tip_t: f32,\n    pub tipped: bool,\n    pub t: f32,\n    pub amp: f32,\n    pub phase: [f32; 4],\n    pub kick_in: f32,\n    pub gust: Vec2,\n    pub kicks: bool,\n}\n\nimpl Default for BalanceCore {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            cob: Vec2::ZERO,\n            vel: Vec2::ZERO,\n            tip_t: 0.0,\n            tipped: false,\n            t: 0.0,\n            amp: 0.12,\n            phase: [0.4, 1.7, 2.2, 0.9],\n            kick_in: 1.4,\n            gust: Vec2::ZERO,\n            kicks: true,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl BalanceCore {\n    pub fn wobble(&self) -> Vec2 {\n        let ax = |t: f32, a: f32, b: f32| {\n            self.amp * (0.7 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 1.3 * t + a).sin() + 0.3 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 2.9 * t + b).sin())\n        };\n        Vec2::new(ax(self.t, self.phase[0], self.phase[1]), ax(self.t, self.phase[2], self.phase[3]))\n    }\n\n    /// Advance one tick. `lean` is already shaped, in the disc.\n    pub fn step(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut crate::rng::Rng) {\n        self.tipped = false;\n        let target = lean.clamp_length_max(1.0) * rules.reach + self.wobble();\n        let acc = (target - self.cob) * rules.stiffness - self.vel * rules.damping + self.gust;\n        self.vel += acc * dt;\n        if self.kicks {\n            self.kick_in -= dt;\n            if self.kick_in <= 0.0 {\n                let ang = rng.range(0.0, std::f32::consts::TAU);\n                self.vel += Vec2::new(ang.cos(), ang.sin()) * 0.1;\n                self.kick_in = rng.range(1.0, 2.0);\n            }\n        }\n        self.cob += self.vel * dt;\n        self.t += dt;\n        if self.cob.length() > 1.0 {\n            self.tip_t += dt;\n            if self.tip_t >= rules.tip_time {\n                self.tipped = true;\n                self.tip_t = 0.0;\n                self.cob = self.cob.normalize_or_zero() * 0.72;\n                self.vel = Vec2::ZERO;\n            }\n        } else {\n            self.tip_t = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// Step without the seeded wander, for the feel tests.\n    pub fn step_clean(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n        let mut rng = crate::rng::Rng::new(1);\n        let kicks = self.kicks;\n        self.kicks = false;\n        let amp = self.amp;\n        self.amp = 0.0;\n        self.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut rng);\n        self.amp = amp;\n        self.kicks = kicks;\n    }\n}\n\n/// Balance Age. Better skill, more days and more stars all come out younger.\npub fn balance_age(skill: f32, days_completed: u32, total_stars: u32) -> u8 {\n    let skill = skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    let age = 24.0 + 56.0 * (1.0 - skill).powf(1.1) - 2.0 * days_completed as f32 - (total_stars as f32 / 3.0).min(8.0);\n    age.round().clamp(18.0, 99.0) as u8\n}\n\npub fn stars_from_score(score: f32) -> u8 {\n    if score >= 850.0 {\n        3\n    } else if score >= 650.0 {\n        2\n    } else if score >= 400.0 {\n        1\n    } else {\n        0\n    }\n}\n\npub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\n        3\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\n        2\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\n        1\n    } else {\n        0\n    }\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b1f6edac-75c4-4dd1-b5b7-baf21e320b9e-138","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs","old_string":"","new_string":"//! Lean shaping. The window calls these, and the tests call the same functions.\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\n\n/// Stick axis after a 0.12 deadzone, then `x^curve` (curve 1.5 by default).\npub fn shape_stick(v: f32, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> f32 {\n    let a = v.abs();\n    if a <= dead {\n        return 0.0;\n    }\n    let t = ((a - dead) / (1.0 - dead)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    t.powf(curve) * v.signum()\n}\n\npub fn shape_stick2(v: Vec2, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    Vec2::new(shape_stick(v.x, dead, curve), shape_stick(v.y, dead, curve)).clamp_length_max(1.0)\n}\n\n/// Keyboard: move the lean target at `rate` units/s toward the held direction, else return at `back`.\npub fn key_ramp(current: f32, held: f32, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> f32 {\n    let goal = held.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\n    let speed = if goal.abs() > 0.0 { rate } else { back };\n    let d = goal - current;\n    let step = speed * dt;\n    if d.abs() <= step { goal } else { current + d.signum() * step }\n}\n\npub fn key_ramp2(current: Vec2, held: Vec2, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    Vec2::new(key_ramp(current.x, held.x, dt, rate, back), key_ramp(current.y, held.y, dt, rate, back))\n}\n\n/// Mouse: offset from the screen centre, divided by 0.38 of the window height, clamped to the disc.\npub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3959,"output_tokens":5758,"cache_read_input_tokens":189184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"bb8b31cc-7d26-481a-9229-d5950339f367"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b1f6edac-75c4-4dd1-b5b7-baf21e320b9e-137","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! One balance model for every event. Semi-implicit Euler at the sim tick.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse crate::params::{ParamVisitor, Tunable};\\n\\n/// Tunable numbers. Progress lives on [`super::FitGame`], not here, so Reset restores feel only.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Rules {\\n    pub stiffness: f32,\\n    pub damping: f32,\\n    pub reach: f32,\\n    pub tip_time: f32,\\n    pub wobble: f32,\\n    pub stick_curve: f32,\\n    pub key_rate: f32,\\n    pub key_return: f32,\\n    pub breath_secs: f32,\\n    pub pose_secs: f32,\\n    pub pose_ring: f32,\\n    pub squat_reps: i32,\\n    pub plank_secs: f32,\\n    pub step_secs: f32,\\n    pub floatie_secs: f32,\\n    pub spin_lo: f32,\\n    pub spin_hi: f32,\\n    pub spin_band_scale: f32,\\n    pub lap_secs: f32,\\n    pub tide_secs: f32,\\n    pub paddle_secs: f32,\\n    pub paddle_par: f32,\\n    pub tray_secs: f32,\\n    pub cannon_secs: f32,\\n    pub gust: f32,\\n    pub bounce_gain: f32,\\n    pub big_gust: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_perfect: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_good: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Rules {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            stiffness: 40.0,\\n            damping: 8.5,\\n            reach: 0.92,\\n            tip_time: 0.35,\\n            wobble: 0.12,\\n            stick_curve: 1.5,\\n            key_rate: 1.6,\\n            key_return: 1.2,\\n            breath_secs: 45.0,\\n            pose_secs: 20.0,\\n            pose_ring: 0.30,\\n            squat_reps: 10,\\n            plank_secs: 60.0,\\n            step_secs: 64.0,\\n            floatie_secs: 50.0,\\n            spin_lo: 6.0,\\n            spin_hi: 9.0,\\n            spin_band_scale: 1.35,\\n            lap_secs: 90.0,\\n            tide_secs: 20.0,\\n            paddle_secs: 45.0,\\n            paddle_par: 28.0,\\n            tray_secs: 50.0,\\n            cannon_secs: 40.0,\\n            gust: 18.0,\\n            bounce_gain: 1.0,\\n            big_gust: 22.0,\\n            rhythm_perfect: 0.055,\\n            rhythm_good: 0.120,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tunable for Rules {\\n    fn visit(&mut self, v: &mut dyn ParamVisitor) {\\n        v.float(\\\"stiffness\\\", &mut self.stiffness, 5.0, 80.0, \\\"How fast the dot chases your lean\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"damping\\\", &mut self.damping, 1.0, 20.0, \\\"How quickly the chase settles\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"reach\\\", &mut self.reach, 0.4, 1.0, \\\"Where a full lean comes to rest\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tip_time\\\", &mut self.tip_time, 0.1, 1.0, \\\"Seconds outside the disc before a tip\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"wobble\\\", &mut self.wobble, 0.0, 0.4, \\\"Idle wander of the dot\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"stick_curve\\\", &mut self.stick_curve, 1.0, 3.0, \\\"Stick response exponent\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"key_rate\\\", &mut self.key_rate, 0.2, 4.0, \\\"Keyboard lean speed\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"key_return\\\", &mut self.key_return, 0.2, 4.0, \\\"Keyboard return speed\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"breath_secs\\\", &mut self.breath_secs, 10.0, 90.0, \\\"Breath Bloom length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"pose_secs\\\", &mut self.pose_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \\\"Seconds for one pose\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"pose_ring\\\", &mut self.pose_ring, 0.1, 0.6, \\\"Pose ring start radius\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"plank_secs\\\", &mut self.plank_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \\\"Plank length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"step_secs\\\", &mut self.step_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \\\"Step Party length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"floatie_secs\\\", &mut self.floatie_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Floatie Spin length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_lo\\\", &mut self.spin_lo, 2.0, 12.0, \\\"Spin band low\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_hi\\\", &mut self.spin_hi, 4.0, 16.0, \\\"Spin band high\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_band_scale\\\", &mut self.spin_band_scale, 1.0, 2.0, \\\"Keyboard spin band scale\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"lap_secs\\\", &mut self.lap_secs, 30.0, 120.0, \\\"Morning Lap length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tide_secs\\\", &mut self.tide_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \\\"Seconds per tide board\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"paddle_secs\\\", &mut self.paddle_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Paddle time limit\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"paddle_par\\\", &mut self.paddle_par, 12.0, 50.0, \\\"Paddle par time\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tray_secs\\\", &mut self.tray_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Tray Trek length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"cannon_secs\\\", &mut self.cannon_secs, 15.0, 70.0, \\\"Cannonball Cup length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"gust\\\", &mut self.gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Gust strength\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"bounce_gain\\\", &mut self.bounce_gain, 0.4, 2.0, \\\"Board bounce gain\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"big_gust\\\", &mut self.big_gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Big Stand gusts\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"rhythm_perfect\\\", &mut self.rhythm_perfect, 0.02, 0.12, \\\"Perfect window\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"rhythm_good\\\", &mut self.rhythm_good, 0.06, 0.2, \\\"Good window\\\");\\n        let _ = v.int(\\\"squat_reps\\\", &mut self.squat_reps, 4, 20, \\\"Squat count\\\");\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Centre of pressure. `tipped` is true only on the tick a tip happens.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct BalanceCore {\\n    pub cob: Vec2,\\n    pub vel: Vec2,\\n    pub tip_t: f32,\\n    pub tipped: bool,\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub amp: f32,\\n    pub phase: [f32; 4],\\n    pub kick_in: f32,\\n    pub gust: Vec2,\\n    pub kicks: bool,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for BalanceCore {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            cob: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            vel: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            tip_t: 0.0,\\n            tipped: false,\\n            t: 0.0,\\n            amp: 0.12,\\n            phase: [0.4, 1.7, 2.2, 0.9],\\n            kick_in: 1.4,\\n            gust: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            kicks: true,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl BalanceCore {\\n    pub fn wobble(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n        let ax = |t: f32, a: f32, b: f32| {\\n            self.amp * (0.7 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 1.3 * t + a).sin() + 0.3 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 2.9 * t + b).sin())\\n        };\\n        Vec2::new(ax(self.t, self.phase[0], self.phase[1]), ax(self.t, self.phase[2], self.phase[3]))\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Advance one tick. `lean` is already shaped, in the disc.\\n    pub fn step(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut crate::rng::Rng) {\\n        self.tipped = false;\\n        let target = lean.clamp_length_max(1.0) * rules.reach + self.wobble();\\n        let acc = (target - self.cob) * rules.stiffness - self.vel * rules.damping + self.gust;\\n        self.vel += acc * dt;\\n        if self.kicks {\\n            self.kick_in -= dt;\\n            if self.kick_in <= 0.0 {\\n                let ang = rng.range(0.0, std::f32::consts::TAU);\\n                self.vel += Vec2::new(ang.cos(), ang.sin()) * 0.1;\\n                self.kick_in = rng.range(1.0, 2.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.cob += self.vel * dt;\\n        self.t += dt;\\n        if self.cob.length() > 1.0 {\\n            self.tip_t += dt;\\n            if self.tip_t >= rules.tip_time {\\n                self.tipped = true;\\n                self.tip_t = 0.0;\\n                self.cob = self.cob.normalize_or_zero() * 0.72;\\n                self.vel = Vec2::ZERO;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.tip_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Step without the seeded wander, for the feel tests.\\n    pub fn step_clean(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n        let mut rng = crate::rng::Rng::new(1);\\n        let kicks = self.kicks;\\n        self.kicks = false;\\n        let amp = self.amp;\\n        self.amp = 0.0;\\n        self.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut rng);\\n        self.amp = amp;\\n        self.kicks = kicks;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Balance Age. Better skill, more days and more stars all come out younger.\\npub fn balance_age(skill: f32, days_completed: u32, total_stars: u32) -> u8 {\\n    let skill = skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let age = 24.0 + 56.0 * (1.0 - skill).powf(1.1) - 2.0 * days_completed as f32 - (total_stars as f32 / 3.0).min(8.0);\\n    age.round().clamp(18.0, 99.0) as u8\\n}\\n\\npub fn stars_from_score(score: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if score >= 850.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if score >= 650.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if score >= 400.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! One balance model for every event. Semi-implicit Euler at the sim tick.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse crate::params::{ParamVisitor, Tunable};\\n\\n/// Tunable numbers. Progress lives on [`super::FitGame`], not here, so Reset restores feel only.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Rules {\\n    pub stiffness: f32,\\n    pub damping: f32,\\n    pub reach: f32,\\n    pub tip_time: f32,\\n    pub wobble: f32,\\n    pub stick_curve: f32,\\n    pub key_rate: f32,\\n    pub key_return: f32,\\n    pub breath_secs: f32,\\n    pub pose_secs: f32,\\n    pub pose_ring: f32,\\n    pub squat_reps: i32,\\n    pub plank_secs: f32,\\n    pub step_secs: f32,\\n    pub floatie_secs: f32,\\n    pub spin_lo: f32,\\n    pub spin_hi: f32,\\n    pub spin_band_scale: f32,\\n    pub lap_secs: f32,\\n    pub tide_secs: f32,\\n    pub paddle_secs: f32,\\n    pub paddle_par: f32,\\n    pub tray_secs: f32,\\n    pub cannon_secs: f32,\\n    pub gust: f32,\\n    pub bounce_gain: f32,\\n    pub big_gust: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_perfect: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_good: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Rules {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            stiffness: 40.0,\\n            damping: 8.5,\\n            reach: 0.92,\\n            tip_time: 0.35,\\n            wobble: 0.12,\\n            stick_curve: 1.5,\\n            key_rate: 1.6,\\n            key_return: 1.2,\\n            breath_secs: 45.0,\\n            pose_secs: 20.0,\\n            pose_ring: 0.30,\\n            squat_reps: 10,\\n            plank_secs: 60.0,\\n            step_secs: 64.0,\\n            floatie_secs: 50.0,\\n            spin_lo: 6.0,\\n            spin_hi: 9.0,\\n            spin_band_scale: 1.35,\\n            lap_secs: 90.0,\\n            tide_secs: 20.0,\\n            paddle_secs: 45.0,\\n            paddle_par: 28.0,\\n            tray_secs: 50.0,\\n            cannon_secs: 40.0,\\n            gust: 18.0,\\n            bounce_gain: 1.0,\\n            big_gust: 22.0,\\n            rhythm_perfect: 0.055,\\n            rhythm_good: 0.120,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tunable for Rules {\\n    fn visit(&mut self, v: &mut dyn ParamVisitor) {\\n        v.float(\\\"stiffness\\\", &mut self.stiffness, 5.0, 80.0, \\\"How fast the dot chases your lean\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"damping\\\", &mut self.damping, 1.0, 20.0, \\\"How quickly the chase settles\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"reach\\\", &mut self.reach, 0.4, 1.0, \\\"Where a full lean comes to rest\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tip_time\\\", &mut self.tip_time, 0.1, 1.0, \\\"Seconds outside the disc before a tip\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"wobble\\\", &mut self.wobble, 0.0, 0.4, \\\"Idle wander of the dot\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"stick_curve\\\", &mut self.stick_curve, 1.0, 3.0, \\\"Stick response exponent\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"key_rate\\\", &mut self.key_rate, 0.2, 4.0, \\\"Keyboard lean speed\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"key_return\\\", &mut self.key_return, 0.2, 4.0, \\\"Keyboard return speed\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"breath_secs\\\", &mut self.breath_secs, 10.0, 90.0, \\\"Breath Bloom length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"pose_secs\\\", &mut self.pose_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \\\"Seconds for one pose\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"pose_ring\\\", &mut self.pose_ring, 0.1, 0.6, \\\"Pose ring start radius\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"plank_secs\\\", &mut self.plank_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \\\"Plank length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"step_secs\\\", &mut self.step_secs, 20.0, 90.0, \\\"Step Party length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"floatie_secs\\\", &mut self.floatie_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Floatie Spin length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_lo\\\", &mut self.spin_lo, 2.0, 12.0, \\\"Spin band low\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_hi\\\", &mut self.spin_hi, 4.0, 16.0, \\\"Spin band high\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"spin_band_scale\\\", &mut self.spin_band_scale, 1.0, 2.0, \\\"Keyboard spin band scale\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"lap_secs\\\", &mut self.lap_secs, 30.0, 120.0, \\\"Morning Lap length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tide_secs\\\", &mut self.tide_secs, 8.0, 40.0, \\\"Seconds per tide board\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"paddle_secs\\\", &mut self.paddle_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Paddle time limit\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"paddle_par\\\", &mut self.paddle_par, 12.0, 50.0, \\\"Paddle par time\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"tray_secs\\\", &mut self.tray_secs, 20.0, 80.0, \\\"Tray Trek length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"cannon_secs\\\", &mut self.cannon_secs, 15.0, 70.0, \\\"Cannonball Cup length\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"gust\\\", &mut self.gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Gust strength\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"bounce_gain\\\", &mut self.bounce_gain, 0.4, 2.0, \\\"Board bounce gain\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"big_gust\\\", &mut self.big_gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Big Stand gusts\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"rhythm_perfect\\\", &mut self.rhythm_perfect, 0.02, 0.12, \\\"Perfect window\\\");\\n        v.float(\\\"rhythm_good\\\", &mut self.rhythm_good, 0.06, 0.2, \\\"Good window\\\");\\n        let _ = v.int(\\\"squat_reps\\\", &mut self.squat_reps, 4, 20, \\\"Squat count\\\");\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Centre of pressure. `tipped` is true only on the tick a tip happens.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct BalanceCore {\\n    pub cob: Vec2,\\n    pub vel: Vec2,\\n    pub tip_t: f32,\\n    pub tipped: bool,\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub amp: f32,\\n    pub phase: [f32; 4],\\n    pub kick_in: f32,\\n    pub gust: Vec2,\\n    pub kicks: bool,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for BalanceCore {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            cob: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            vel: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            tip_t: 0.0,\\n            tipped: false,\\n            t: 0.0,\\n            amp: 0.12,\\n            phase: [0.4, 1.7, 2.2, 0.9],\\n            kick_in: 1.4,\\n            gust: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            kicks: true,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl BalanceCore {\\n    pub fn wobble(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n        let ax = |t: f32, a: f32, b: f32| {\\n            self.amp * (0.7 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 1.3 * t + a).sin() + 0.3 * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 2.9 * t + b).sin())\\n        };\\n        Vec2::new(ax(self.t, self.phase[0], self.phase[1]), ax(self.t, self.phase[2], self.phase[3]))\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Advance one tick. `lean` is already shaped, in the disc.\\n    pub fn step(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut crate::rng::Rng) {\\n        self.tipped = false;\\n        let target = lean.clamp_length_max(1.0) * rules.reach + self.wobble();\\n        let acc = (target - self.cob) * rules.stiffness - self.vel * rules.damping + self.gust;\\n        self.vel += acc * dt;\\n        if self.kicks {\\n            self.kick_in -= dt;\\n            if self.kick_in <= 0.0 {\\n                let ang = rng.range(0.0, std::f32::consts::TAU);\\n                self.vel += Vec2::new(ang.cos(), ang.sin()) * 0.1;\\n                self.kick_in = rng.range(1.0, 2.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.cob += self.vel * dt;\\n        self.t += dt;\\n        if self.cob.length() > 1.0 {\\n            self.tip_t += dt;\\n            if self.tip_t >= rules.tip_time {\\n                self.tipped = true;\\n                self.tip_t = 0.0;\\n                self.cob = self.cob.normalize_or_zero() * 0.72;\\n                self.vel = Vec2::ZERO;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.tip_t = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Step without the seeded wander, for the feel tests.\\n    pub fn step_clean(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n        let mut rng = crate::rng::Rng::new(1);\\n        let kicks = self.kicks;\\n        self.kicks = false;\\n        let amp = self.amp;\\n        self.amp = 0.0;\\n        self.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut rng);\\n        self.amp = amp;\\n        self.kicks = kicks;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Balance Age. Better skill, more days and more stars all come out younger.\\npub fn balance_age(skill: f32, days_completed: u32, total_stars: u32) -> u8 {\\n    let skill = skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let age = 24.0 + 56.0 * (1.0 - skill).powf(1.1) - 2.0 * days_completed as f32 - (total_stars as f32 / 3.0).min(8.0);\\n    age.round().clamp(18.0, 99.0) as u8\\n}\\n\\npub fn stars_from_score(score: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if score >= 850.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if score >= 650.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if score >= 400.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b1f6edac-75c4-4dd1-b5b7-baf21e320b9e-138","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Lean shaping. The window calls these, and the tests call the same functions.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\n\\n/// Stick axis after a 0.12 deadzone, then `x^curve` (curve 1.5 by default).\\npub fn shape_stick(v: f32, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let a = v.abs();\\n    if a <= dead {\\n        return 0.0;\\n    }\\n    let t = ((a - dead) / (1.0 - dead)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    t.powf(curve) * v.signum()\\n}\\n\\npub fn shape_stick2(v: Vec2, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    Vec2::new(shape_stick(v.x, dead, curve), shape_stick(v.y, dead, curve)).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\n/// Keyboard: move the lean target at `rate` units/s toward the held direction, else return at `back`.\\npub fn key_ramp(current: f32, held: f32, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let goal = held.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    let speed = if goal.abs() > 0.0 { rate } else { back };\\n    let d = goal - current;\\n    let step = speed * dt;\\n    if d.abs() <= step { goal } else { current + d.signum() * step }\\n}\\n\\npub fn key_ramp2(current: Vec2, held: Vec2, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    Vec2::new(key_ramp(current.x, held.x, dt, rate, back), key_ramp(current.y, held.y, dt, rate, back))\\n}\\n\\n/// Mouse: offset from the screen centre, divided by 0.38 of the window height, clamped to the disc.\\npub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Lean shaping. The window calls these, and the tests call the same functions.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\n\\n/// Stick axis after a 0.12 deadzone, then `x^curve` (curve 1.5 by default).\\npub fn shape_stick(v: f32, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let a = v.abs();\\n    if a <= dead {\\n        return 0.0;\\n    }\\n    let t = ((a - dead) / (1.0 - dead)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    t.powf(curve) * v.signum()\\n}\\n\\npub fn shape_stick2(v: Vec2, dead: f32, curve: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    Vec2::new(shape_stick(v.x, dead, curve), shape_stick(v.y, dead, curve)).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\n/// Keyboard: move the lean target at `rate` units/s toward the held direction, else return at `back`.\\npub fn key_ramp(current: f32, held: f32, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let goal = held.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    let speed = if goal.abs() > 0.0 { rate } else { back };\\n    let d = goal - current;\\n    let step = speed * dt;\\n    if d.abs() <= step { goal } else { current + d.signum() * step }\\n}\\n\\npub fn key_ramp2(current: Vec2, held: Vec2, dt: f32, rate: f32, back: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    Vec2::new(key_ramp(current.x, held.x, dt, rate, back), key_ramp(current.y, held.y, dt, rate, back))\\n}\\n\\n/// Mouse: offset from the screen centre, divided by 0.38 of the window height, clamped to the disc.\\npub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"923d4e82-c0ff-43a4-9a4e-2a89f6195e6b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_130","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now working on events.rs, the main activity simulator.","signature":"9VyKFZ6mKFhtcrFmVtk0GlmijztFKND3KS1bAWKsPONvnf6a8qL9BSt9kmKQEzC8PTLzycjEk4ehsNPae0DM3Wy0xpHeiANRELTnTV9qH4gUPhbe1bbV9oHeJXnU05O/sA"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3133bd94-8dca-46d6-a8d3-bb77ff5c891a-139","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","old_string":"","new_string":"//! Every Tippy Cay activity, on the shared balance model.\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n\nuse super::core::{BalanceCore, Rules, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score};\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\nuse crate::input::buttons;\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, Hash, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub enum EventId {\n    Check,\n    Breath,\n    Pose,\n    Squat,\n    Plank,\n    Step,\n    Floatie,\n    Lap,\n    Tide,\n    Paddle,\n    Tray,\n    Cannon,\n    BigStand,\n}\n\nimpl EventId {\n    pub const ALL: [EventId; 13] = [\n        EventId::Check,\n        EventId::Breath,\n        EventId::Pose,\n        EventId::Squat,\n        EventId::Plank,\n        EventId::Step,\n        EventId::Floatie,\n        EventId::Lap,\n        EventId::Tide,\n        EventId::Paddle,\n        EventId::Tray,\n        EventId::Cannon,\n        EventId::BigStand,\n    ];\n\n    pub fn key(self) -> &'static str {\n        match self {\n            EventId::Check => \"check\",\n            EventId::Breath => \"breath\",\n            EventId::Pose => \"pose\",\n            EventId::Squat => \"squat\",\n            EventId::Plank => \"plank\",\n            EventId::Step => \"step\",\n            EventId::Floatie => \"floatie\",\n            EventId::Lap => \"lap\",\n            EventId::Tide => \"tide\",\n            EventId::Paddle => \"paddle\",\n            EventId::Tray => \"tray\",\n            EventId::Cannon => \"cannon\",\n            EventId::BigStand => \"bigstand\",\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn from_key(s: &str) -> Option<EventId> {\n        Self::ALL.into_iter().find(|e| e.key() == s)\n    }\n\n    pub fn title(self) -> &'static str {\n        match self {\n            EventId::Check => \"Morning Wobble Check\",\n            EventId::Breath => \"Breath Bloom\",\n            EventId::Pose => \"Pose Parade\",\n            EventId::Squat => \"Tempo Squats\",\n            EventId::Plank => \"Plank Standoff\",\n            EventId::Step => \"Step Party\",\n            EventId::Floatie => \"Floatie Spin\",\n            EventId::Lap => \"Morning Lap\",\n            EventId::Tide => \"Tide Table\",\n            EventId::Paddle => \"Paddle Slalom\",\n            EventId::Tray => \"Tray Trek\",\n            EventId::Cannon => \"Cannonball Cup\",\n            EventId::BigStand => \"The Big Stand\",\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn blurb(self) -> &'static str {\n        match self {\n            EventId::Check => \"Stand, lean, close your eyes, and step on the beat.\",\n            EventId::Breath => \"Follow the ring. In for four, out for four.\",\n            EventId::Pose => \"Stay inside the drifting ring. Accept the bird.\",\n            EventId::Squat => \"Down for two, up for one. Keep the dot in the band.\",\n            EventId::Plank => \"Brace, and do not leave the ring.\",\n            EventId::Step => \"Left, right, sometimes both. The box does not wait.\",\n            EventId::Floatie => \"Spin the rings. Catch the ones they throw.\",\n            EventId::Lap => \"Two steps a second. Ribbons are optional. Crabs are not.\",\n            EventId::Tide => \"Tilt the raft. The shells want the pools.\",\n            EventId::Paddle => \"Lean ahead to go. The gates are suggestions with consequences.\",\n            EventId::Tray => \"Five glasses. The pier is not on your side.\",\n            EventId::Cannon => \"Bounce, tuck, splash. The judges brought cards.\",\n            EventId::BigStand => \"Everything, once, and then nothing at all.\",\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn coach(self) -> &'static str {\n        match self {\n            EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \"Pip\",\n            EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose => \"Posey\",\n            EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank => \"Big Kettle\",\n            EventId::Step | EventId::Floatie | EventId::Lap => \"Bounce\",\n            EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \"Commodore Gull\",\n            EventId::Tray => \"Marjorie\",\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn area(self) -> u8 {\n        Self::ALL.iter().position(|e| *e == self).unwrap_or(0) as u8\n    }\n\n    /// Activities a day opens, not counting the morning check or the finale.\n    pub fn for_day(day: u8) -> &'static [EventId] {\n        match day {\n            1 => &[EventId::Breath, EventId::Pose],\n            2 => &[EventId::Squat, EventId::Plank],\n            3 => &[EventId::Step, EventId::Floatie, EventId::Lap],\n            4 => &[EventId::Tide, EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tray, EventId::Cannon],\n            _ => &[],\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Shell {\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub vx: f32,\n    pub vz: f32,\n    pub pot: bool,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct GhostSample {\n    pub t: f32,\n    pub lean: [f32; 2],\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Activity {\n    pub kind: EventId,\n    pub t: f32,\n    pub dur: f32,\n    pub score: f32,\n    pub stars: u8,\n    pub done: bool,\n    pub acc: f32,\n    pub phase: u8,\n    pub sub: f32,\n    pub lungs: f32,\n    pub depth: f32,\n    pub reps: u8,\n    pub survived: f32,\n    pub out_t: f32,\n    pub flopped: bool,\n    pub streak: f32,\n    pub pose_i: u8,\n    pub notes: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    pub note_i: u16,\n    pub hits: u16,\n    pub spin: f32,\n    pub prev_ang: f32,\n    pub have_ang: bool,\n    pub rings: u8,\n    pub band_t: f32,\n    pub dir: f32,\n    pub catch_i: u8,\n    pub steps: u16,\n    pub last_side: i8,\n    pub step_times: Vec<f32>,\n    pub zone_t: f32,\n    pub lateral: f32,\n    pub ribbons: u8,\n    pub bumps: u8,\n    pub shells: Vec<Shell>,\n    pub pools: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    pub potted: u8,\n    pub board: u8,\n    pub px: f32,\n    pub pz: f32,\n    pub speed: f32,\n    pub gates: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    pub gate_i: u8,\n    pub missed: u8,\n    pub glasses: [f32; 5],\n    pub glass_ok: [bool; 5],\n    pub jolts: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    pub dives: u8,\n    pub power: f32,\n    pub air: f32,\n    pub tuck: f32,\n    pub dive_scores: Vec<f32>,\n    pub leaping: bool,\n    pub forfeit: bool,\n    pub still_sum: f32,\n    pub still_n: f32,\n    pub metrics: [f32; 4],\n    pub target_i: u8,\n    pub hold: f32,\n    pub target_time: f32,\n    pub targets_hit: u8,\n    pub step_hit: u8,\n    pub nudged: bool,\n    pub tips: u32,\n    pub lock: f32,\n    pub samples: Vec<GhostSample>,\n    pub phase_scores: Vec<f32>,\n    pub gag: bool,\n    pub guide: f32,\n    pub amp_scale: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Activity {\n    pub fn start(kind: EventId, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) -> Self {\n        let dur = match kind {\n            EventId::Check => 8.0 + 15.0 + 6.0 + 8.0 * 0.6,\n            EventId::Breath => rules.breath_secs,\n            EventId::Pose => rules.pose_secs * 3.0,\n            EventId::Squat => rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 4.0,\n            EventId::Plank => rules.plank_secs,\n            EventId::Step => rules.step_secs,\n            EventId::Floatie => rules.floatie_secs,\n            EventId::Lap => rules.lap_secs,\n            EventId::Tide => rules.tide_secs * 3.0,\n            EventId::Paddle => rules.paddle_secs,\n            EventId::Tray => rules.tray_secs,\n            EventId::Cannon => rules.cannon_secs,\n            EventId::BigStand => 32.0 + 20.0 + 40.0 + 20.0 + 30.0,\n        };\n        let mut a = Self {\n            kind,\n            t: 0.0,\n            dur,\n            score: 0.0,\n            stars: 0,\n            done: false,\n            acc: 0.0,\n            phase: 0,\n            sub: 0.0,\n            lungs: 0.0,\n            depth: 0.0,\n            reps: 0,\n            survived: 0.0,\n            out_t: 0.0,\n            flopped: false,\n            streak: 0.0,\n            pose_i: 0,\n            notes: Vec::new(),\n            note_i: 0,\n            hits: 0,\n            spin: 0.0,\n            prev_ang: 0.0,\n            have_ang: false,\n            rings: 0,\n            band_t: 0.0,\n            dir: 1.0,\n            catch_i: 0,\n            steps: 0,\n            last_side: 0,\n            step_times: Vec::new(),\n            zone_t: 0.0,\n            lateral: 0.0,\n            ribbons: 0,\n            bumps: 0,\n            shells: Vec::new(),\n            pools: Vec::new(),\n            potted: 0,\n            board: 0,\n            px: 0.0,\n            pz: 0.0,\n            speed: 0.0,\n            gates: Vec::new(),\n            gate_i: 0,\n            missed: 0,\n            glasses: [0.0; 5],\n            glass_ok: [true; 5],\n            jolts: Vec::new(),\n            dives: 0,\n            power: 0.0,\n            air: 0.0,\n            tuck: 0.0,\n            dive_scores: Vec::new(),\n            leaping: false,\n            forfeit: false,\n            still_sum: 0.0,\n            still_n: 0.0,\n            metrics: [0.0; 4],\n            target_i: 0,\n            hold: 0.0,\n            target_time: 0.0,\n            targets_hit: 0,\n            step_hit: 0,\n            nudged: false,\n            tips: 0,\n            lock: 0.0,\n            samples: Vec::new(),\n            phase_scores: Vec::new(),\n            gag: false,\n            guide: 0.0,\n            amp_scale: 1.0,\n        };\n        if kind == EventId::Step || kind == EventId::BigStand {\n            a.notes = load_notes();\n        }\n        if kind == EventId::Tide {\n            a.setup_board(0, rng);\n        }\n        if kind == EventId::Paddle {\n            for i in 0..6 {\n                a.gates.push([8.0 + i as f32 * 8.0, rng.range(-1.3, 1.3)]);\n            }\n        }\n        if kind == EventId::Tray {\n            // Scripted jolts the bot can see coming.\n            for i in 0..8 {\n                let t = 4.0 + i as f32 * 5.0;\n                let mag = if i % 2 == 0 { 1.6 } else { -1.6 };\n                a.jolts.push([t, mag]);\n            }\n        }\n        a\n    }\n\n    fn setup_board(&mut self, board: u8, rng: &mut Rng) {\n        self.board = board;\n        self.sub = 0.0;\n        self.shells.clear();\n        self.pools.clear();\n        let n = [3, 5, 7][board as usize];\n        self.pools.push([0.0, 1.6]);\n        if board >= 1 {\n            self.pools.push([1.2, -0.4]);\n        }\n        if board >= 2 {\n            self.pools.push([-1.3, 0.2]);\n        }\n        for i in 0..n {\n            let ang = i as f32 * 1.7 + rng.range(0.0, 0.4);\n            self.shells.push(Shell {\n                x: ang.cos() * 1.5,\n                z: ang.sin() * 1.1 - 0.2,\n                vx: 0.0,\n                vz: 0.0,\n                pot: false,\n            });\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn load_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\n    struct Charts {\n        notes: Vec<ChartNote>,\n    }\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\n    struct ChartNote {\n        t: f32,\n        lane: u8,\n    }\n    let text = crate::games::level_text(\"fit/charts\", include_str!(\"charts.toml\"));\n    if let Ok(c) = toml::from_str::<Charts>(&text) {\n        return c.notes.into_iter().map(|n| [n.t, n.lane as f32]).collect();\n    }\n    fallback_notes()\n}\n\nfn fallback_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    let mut notes = Vec::new();\n    let mut t = 1.0;\n    let mut i = 0;\n    while notes.len() < 100 && t < 62.0 {\n        let lane = if i % 11 == 10 { 2.0 } else { (i % 2) as f32 };\n        notes.push([t, lane]);\n        t += if i < 32 { 0.625 } else { 0.3125 };\n        i += 1;\n    }\n    notes\n}\n\nfn pd(bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules, target: Vec2) -> Vec2 {\n    let lean = (target - bal.wobble() - bal.vel * 0.15) / rules.reach.max(0.2);\n    lean.clamp_length_max(1.0)\n}\n\npub fn bot(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    if act.lock > 0.0 {\n        return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0);\n    }\n    match act.kind {\n        EventId::Check => bot_check(act, bal, rules),\n        EventId::Breath => {\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\n        }\n        EventId::Pose => {\n            let c = ring_center(act.t);\n            (pd(bal, rules, c), 0)\n        }\n        EventId::Squat => {\n            let down = squat_guide(act.t) > act.depth;\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if down { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\n        }\n        EventId::Plank => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\n        EventId::Step => bot_step(act),\n        EventId::Floatie => bot_floatie(act),\n        EventId::Lap => bot_lap(act),\n        EventId::Tide => bot_tide(act, bal, rules),\n        EventId::Paddle => bot_paddle(act),\n        EventId::Tray => (Vec2::new(tray_counter(act), 0.0), 0),\n        EventId::Cannon => bot_cannon(act),\n        EventId::BigStand => bot_big(act, bal, rules),\n    }\n}\n\nfn bot_check(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    match act.phase {\n        1 => {\n            let targets = [-0.70, 0.55, 0.0];\n            let x = targets.get(act.target_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::new(x, 0.0)), 0)\n        }\n        3 => {\n            let beat = 0.6;\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor();\n            let at = i * beat;\n            let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\n            let press = (act.sub - at).abs() < 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 && i < 8.0 && i >= 0.0;\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if press { side } else { 0 })\n        }\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\n    }\n}\n\nfn bot_step(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) else { return (Vec2::ZERO, 0) };\n    if (act.t - n[0]).abs() > 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 {\n        return (Vec2::ZERO, 0);\n    }\n    let lane = n[1] as u8;\n    let b = if lane == 2 { buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R } else if lane == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\n}\n\nfn bot_floatie(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    let w = 7.5 * act.dir;\n    let lean = Vec2::new((w * act.t).cos(), (w * act.t).sin()) * 0.75;\n    let catches = [6.0, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\n    let mut b = 0;\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\n        if (act.t - t).abs() < 0.02 {\n            b = if act.catch_i % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\n        }\n    }\n    (lean, b)\n}\n\nfn bot_lap(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    let interval = 0.5;\n    let i = (act.t / interval).floor();\n    let at = i * interval;\n    let press = (act.t - at).abs() < 0.02 && i >= 1.0;\n    let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\n    let ribbon_x = ribbon_at(act.t);\n    let lean_x = (ribbon_x - act.lateral).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\n    (Vec2::new(lean_x, 0.0), if press { side } else { 0 })\n}\n\nfn ribbon_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\n    let spots = [8.0_f32, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0];\n    let xs = [0.6, -0.7, 0.8, -0.5, 0.4];\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\n        if (t - s).abs() < 1.2 {\n            return xs[i];\n        }\n    }\n    0.0\n}\n\nfn bot_tide(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    let shell = act.shells.iter().find(|s| !s.pot);\n    let pool = act.pools.first().copied().unwrap_or([0.0, 0.0]);\n    let Some(s) = shell else { return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0) };\n    let to = Vec2::new(pool[0] - s.x, pool[1] - s.z);\n    let want = to.normalize_or_zero() * 0.85;\n    (want, 0)\n}\n\nfn bot_paddle(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    let gate_x = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize).map(|g| g[1]).unwrap_or(0.0);\n    let steer = (gate_x - act.px).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\n    (Vec2::new(steer, 0.5), 0)\n}\n\nfn tray_counter(act: &Activity) -> f32 {\n    let mut j = 0.0;\n    for s in &act.jolts {\n        let dt = act.t - s[0];\n        if dt > 0.0 && dt < 0.45 {\n            j += s[1] * (1.0 - dt / 0.45);\n        }\n    }\n    (-j * 0.55).clamp(-1.0, 1.0)\n}\n\nfn bot_cannon(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    if act.leaping {\n        let lean = Vec2::new(0.0, 0.2);\n        return (lean, buttons::CONFIRM);\n    }\n    let period = 1.2 * (1.0 / act_bounce(1.0));\n    let _ = period;\n    let phase = act.t / 1.2;\n    let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\n    let prev = ((phase - 0.02) * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\n    // Bottom of the bounce: sine crosses -0.95 going down then up. Press near the minimum.\n    let at_bottom = s < -0.92 && prev < s;\n    let b = if at_bottom && act.dives < 3 { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 };\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\n}\n\nfn act_bounce(gain: f32) -> f32 {\n    gain\n}\n\nfn bot_big(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n    match act.phase {\n        0 => {\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\n        }\n        1 => (pd(bal, rules, ring_center(act.sub)), 0),\n        2 => bot_step(act),\n        3 => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\n    }\n}\n\nfn ring_center(t: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    let a = 0.35;\n    Vec2::new(a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.12 * t).sin(), a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.09 * t + 1.3).sin())\n}\n\nfn squat_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\n    let c = (t / 3.2).fract();\n    if c < 2.0 / 3.2 {\n        c / (2.0 / 3.2)\n    } else {\n        1.0 - (c - 2.0 / 3.2) / (1.2 / 3.2)\n    }\n}\n\nfn breath_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\n    let c = (t / 8.0).fract();\n    if c < 0.5 { c * 2.0 } else { 1.0 - (c - 0.5) * 2.0 }\n}\n\npub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    if act.done {\n        return;\n    }\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\n    bal.amp = amp;\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\n    } else {\n        Vec2::ZERO\n    };\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\n    if bal.tipped {\n        act.tips += 1;\n        act.lock = 1.2;\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\n        if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\n            act.lock = 1.5;\n            act.streak = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\n    }\n    match act.kind {\n        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt),\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\n        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\n    }\n    if act.done {\n        finish_score(act);\n    }\n}\n\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\n    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\n}\n\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32) {\n    match act.phase {\n        0 => {\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\n                act.nudged = true;\n            }\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\n            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\n            act.still_n += dt;\n            act.sub += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n                act.phase = 1;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\n                act.target_i = 0;\n                act.hold = 0.0;\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n        1 => {\n            let targets = [-0.70_f32, 0.55, 0.0];\n            if act.target_i >= 3 {\n                act.metrics[1] = act.targets_hit as f32 / 3.0;\n                act.phase = 2;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\n                return;\n            }\n            let x = targets[act.target_i as usize];\n            let close = (bal.cob.x - x).abs() < 0.06 && bal.cob.y.abs() < 0.25;\n            if close {\n                act.hold += dt;\n            } else {\n                act.hold = 0.0;\n            }\n            act.target_time += dt;\n            if act.hold >= 1.5 {\n                act.targets_hit += 1;\n                act.target_i += 1;\n                act.hold = 0.0;\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\n            } else if act.target_time >= 5.0 {\n                act.target_i += 1;\n                act.hold = 0.0;\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n        2 => {\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\n            act.still_n += dt;\n            act.sub += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 6.0 {\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\n                act.metrics[2] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n                act.phase = 3;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n        _ => {\n            let beat = 0.6;\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor() as i32;\n            if pressed & (buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R) != 0 && i >= 0 && i < 8 {\n                let at = i as f32 * beat;\n                let err = (act.sub - at).abs();\n                let want_l = i % 2 == 0;\n                let got_l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\n                if err < 0.12 && want_l == got_l && act.step_hit as i32 <= i {\n                    act.step_hit += 1;\n                }\n            }\n            act.sub += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 * beat {\n                act.metrics[3] = act.step_hit as f32 / 8.0;\n                let m = act.metrics;\n                let skill = 0.30 * m[0] + 0.25 * m[1] + 0.25 * m[2] + 0.20 * m[3];\n                act.score = (skill * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n                act.done = true;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_breath(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, finale: bool) {\n    let cap = if finale { 32.0 } else { rules.breath_secs };\n    act.guide = breath_guide(act.t);\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs + dt / 4.0).min(1.0);\n    } else {\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs - dt / 4.0).max(0.0);\n    }\n    let err = ((act.lungs - act.guide).abs() / 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    let in_ring = if bal.cob.length() < 0.35 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 };\n    let tick = 0.7 * (1.0 - err) + 0.3 * in_ring;\n    act.acc += tick * dt;\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= cap {\n        act.score = (act.acc / cap * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = !finale;\n        if finale {\n            act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_pose(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n    let pose_len = rules.pose_secs;\n    act.pose_i = (act.t / pose_len).floor().clamp(0.0, 2.0) as u8;\n    let local = act.t - act.pose_i as f32 * pose_len;\n    if act.pose_i == 1 && local >= 12.0 && local < 17.0 {\n        act.amp_scale = 1.6;\n    } else {\n        act.amp_scale = 1.0;\n    }\n    let shrink = (local / pose_len).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    let radius = rules.pose_ring + (0.18 - rules.pose_ring) * shrink;\n    let inside = act.lock <= 0.0 && (bal.cob - ring_center(act.t)).length() < radius.max(0.12);\n    if inside {\n        act.streak += dt;\n    } else {\n        act.streak = 0.0;\n    }\n    let mult = 1.0 + (act.streak / 2.0).floor().min(3.0);\n    if inside {\n        act.acc += dt * mult;\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= pose_len * 3.0 {\n        act.score = (act.acc / (pose_len * 3.0) * 700.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_squat(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    act.guide = squat_guide(act.t);\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\n        act.depth = (act.depth + dt / 2.0).min(1.0);\n    } else {\n        act.depth = (act.depth - dt / 1.0).max(0.0);\n    }\n    let bottom = (act.t / 3.2).fract();\n    let was = ((act.t - dt) / 3.2).fract();\n    // A rep completes as the guide returns to the top.\n    if was > 0.8 && bottom < 0.2 && act.reps < rules.squat_reps as u8 {\n        let timing = (1.0 - (act.depth - 0.15).abs()).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        // The player should have been deep near the bottom. Use lungs field as \"was deep\".\n        let deep = if act.lungs > 0.75 { 1.0 } else { (act.lungs / 0.75).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\n        let band = if act.hold < 0.25 { 1.0 } else { 0.3 };\n        act.acc += 0.7 * deep.max(timing * 0.2) + 0.3 * band;\n        act.reps += 1;\n        act.lungs = 0.0;\n        act.hold = 0.0;\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 15, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + act.reps as f32 * 0.03 });\n        if act.reps == rules.squat_reps as u8 {\n            act.gag = true;\n        }\n    }\n    if act.depth > act.lungs {\n        act.lungs = act.depth;\n    }\n    if bal.cob.x.abs() >= 0.25 {\n        act.hold += dt;\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    let need = rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 0.5;\n    if act.t >= need || act.reps >= rules.squat_reps as u8 && bottom < 0.15 && act.t > 3.0 {\n        let n = rules.squat_reps.max(1) as f32;\n        act.score = (act.acc / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn braced(held: u32) -> bool {\n    let l = held & (buttons::STEP_L) != 0;\n    let r = held & (buttons::STEP_R) != 0;\n    l && r\n}\n\nfn tick_plank(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n    let span = rules.plank_secs.max(1.0);\n    let radius = 0.40 + (0.20 - 0.40) * (act.t / span).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    if !braced(held) {\n        act.flopped = true;\n    }\n    if bal.cob.length() > radius {\n        act.out_t += dt;\n        if act.out_t > 1.0 {\n            act.flopped = true;\n        }\n    } else {\n        act.out_t = 0.0;\n    }\n    if act.flopped {\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n        return;\n    }\n    act.survived += dt;\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= span {\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_step(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\n    while let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) {\n        if act.t + 0.02 < n[0] {\n            break;\n        }\n        if act.t - n[0] > rules.rhythm_good {\n            act.note_i += 1;\n            continue;\n        }\n        let lane = n[1] as u8;\n        let l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\n        let r = pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0;\n        let ok = match lane {\n            0 => l,\n            1 => r,\n            _ => l && r,\n        };\n        if ok {\n            let err = (act.t - n[0]).abs();\n            if err <= rules.rhythm_perfect {\n                act.hits += 1;\n                act.acc += 1.0;\n            } else {\n                act.hits += 1;\n                act.acc += 0.6;\n            }\n            act.note_i += 1;\n        } else if act.t > n[0] + rules.rhythm_good {\n            act.note_i += 1;\n        } else {\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= rules.step_secs {\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_floatie(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n    if ((act.t / 15.0).floor() as i32) % 2 == 1 {\n        act.dir = -1.0;\n    } else {\n        act.dir = 1.0;\n    }\n    if lean.length() > 0.4 {\n        let ang = lean.y.atan2(lean.x);\n        if act.have_ang {\n            let mut d = ang - act.prev_ang;\n            if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\n                d -= std::f32::consts::TAU;\n            }\n            if d < -std::f32::consts::PI {\n                d += std::f32::consts::TAU;\n            }\n            let w = d / dt.max(1e-4);\n            act.spin += (w - act.spin) * 0.35;\n        }\n        act.prev_ang = ang;\n        act.have_ang = true;\n    } else {\n        act.spin *= 0.9;\n    }\n    let scale = rules.spin_band_scale;\n    let s = act.spin * act.dir;\n    let in_band = s > rules.spin_lo / scale && s < rules.spin_hi * scale;\n    if in_band {\n        act.band_t += dt;\n    }\n    let catches = [6.0_f32, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\n        let want_l = act.catch_i % 2 == 0;\n        let got = if want_l { pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 } else { pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 };\n        if got && (act.t - t).abs() < 0.25 {\n            act.rings = (act.rings + 1).min(7);\n            act.catch_i += 1;\n        } else if act.t > t + 0.25 {\n            act.catch_i += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= rules.floatie_secs {\n        let rings = act.rings as f32 / 7.0;\n        let band = act.band_t / rules.floatie_secs;\n        act.score = (rings * band * 1400.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_lap(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 && act.last_side != -1 {\n        act.steps += 1;\n        act.last_side = -1;\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\n    }\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 && act.last_side != 1 {\n        act.steps += 1;\n        act.last_side = 1;\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\n    }\n    act.step_times.retain(|t| act.t - *t < 1.0);\n    let rate = act.step_times.len() as f32;\n    if (1.6..=2.4).contains(&rate) && act.t > 1.0 {\n        act.zone_t += dt;\n    }\n    act.lateral = (act.lateral + lean.x * 1.2 * dt).clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\n    let ribbon = ribbon_at(act.t);\n    if ribbon.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - ribbon).abs() < 0.35 && act.t.fract() < dt + 0.02 {\n        // once per ribbon window, roughly\n        if act.ribbons < 5 && (act.t - ribbon_time(act.ribbons)).abs() < 1.0 {\n            act.ribbons += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    let crab = crab_at(act.t);\n    if crab.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - crab).abs() < 0.25 {\n        act.bumps += 1;\n        act.lateral = 0.0;\n    }\n    act.px = act.lateral;\n    act.pz = act.t;\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.t >= rules.lap_secs {\n        let zone = act.zone_t / rules.lap_secs;\n        act.score = (zone * 800.0 + act.ribbons as f32 * 50.0 - act.bumps as f32 * 40.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn ribbon_time(i: u8) -> f32 {\n    [8.0, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0][i as usize]\n}\n\nfn crab_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\n    let spots = [15.0_f32, 33.0, 50.0, 68.0];\n    let xs = [-0.8, 0.85, -0.6, 0.7];\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\n        if (t - s).abs() < 0.8 {\n            return xs[i];\n        }\n    }\n    0.0\n}\n\nfn tick_tide(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) {\n    let tilt = if bal.cob.length() > 0.18 { bal.cob } else { Vec2::ZERO };\n    let g = 9.0;\n    let friction = 3.2;\n    let mut potted_now = 0;\n    for s in &mut act.shells {\n        if s.pot {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let ax = tilt.x * g - friction * s.vx;\n        let az = tilt.y * g - friction * s.vz;\n        s.vx += ax * dt;\n        s.vz += az * dt;\n        s.x += s.vx * dt;\n        s.z += s.vz * dt;\n        if s.x.abs() > 2.2 {\n            s.x = s.x.clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\n            s.vx *= -0.5;\n        }\n        if s.z.abs() > 1.6 {\n            s.z = s.z.clamp(-1.6, 1.6);\n            s.vz *= -0.5;\n        }\n        for p in &act.pools {\n            let dx = s.x - p[0];\n            let dz = s.z - p[1];\n            let sp = (s.vx * s.vx + s.vz * s.vz).sqrt();\n            if dx * dx + dz * dz < 0.28 * 0.28 && sp < 3.5 {\n                s.pot = true;\n                potted_now += 1;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    act.potted += potted_now;\n    // Board 2 pool drifts.\n    if act.board == 1 {\n        if let Some(p) = act.pools.first_mut() {\n            p[0] = (act.sub * 0.6).sin() * 0.8;\n        }\n    }\n    act.sub += dt;\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.sub >= rules.tide_secs {\n        if act.board < 2 {\n            act.setup_board(act.board + 1, rng);\n        } else {\n            let total = 3.0 + 5.0 + 7.0;\n            let time_bonus = (1.0 - (act.t / (rules.tide_secs * 3.0)).clamp(0.0, 1.0)) * 150.0;\n            act.score = (act.potted as f32 / total * 850.0 + time_bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n            act.done = true;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_paddle(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let forward = lean.y.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\n    let target = if forward > 0.0 { forward * 6.5 } else { forward * 2.0 };\n    act.speed += (target - act.speed) * dt * 2.2;\n    act.speed = act.speed.max(0.0);\n    act.pz += act.speed * dt;\n    act.px = (act.px + lean.x * 3.2 * dt).clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\n    if act.t.fract() < dt {\n        events.push(SimEvent::Wake { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, act.pz) });\n    }\n    if let Some(g) = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize) {\n        if act.pz >= g[0] {\n            if (act.px - g[1]).abs() > 0.7 {\n                act.missed += 1;\n            }\n            act.gate_i += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    let finished = act.pz >= 56.0 || act.t >= rules.paddle_secs;\n    if finished {\n        let mut t = if act.pz >= 56.0 { act.t } else { rules.paddle_secs };\n        t += act.missed as f32 * 2.0;\n        let par = rules.paddle_par;\n        let raw = (1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par);\n        act.score = (raw.clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_tray(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let mut jolt = 0.0;\n    for s in &act.jolts {\n        let d = act.t - s[0];\n        if d > 0.0 && d < 0.35 {\n            jolt += s[1] * (1.0 - d / 0.35);\n        }\n    }\n    let tilt = bal.cob.x + jolt * 0.15;\n    for i in 0..5 {\n        if !act.glass_ok[i] {\n            continue;\n        }\n        act.glasses[i] += tilt * dt * 1.3;\n        if act.glasses[i].abs() > 1.0 {\n            act.glass_ok[i] = false;\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 19, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\n        }\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    act.pz = act.t;\n    if act.t >= rules.tray_secs {\n        let kept = act.glass_ok.iter().filter(|g| **g).count() as f32;\n        let bonus = if kept == 5.0 { 0.0 } else { 0.0 };\n        act.score = (kept * 200.0 + bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_cannon(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let _ = rules;\n    if !act.leaping {\n        let phase = act.t / 1.2;\n        let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\n        let prev = ((act.t - dt) / 1.2 * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\n        let bottom = s < -0.9 && s > prev;\n        if bottom && pressed & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 && act.power < 4.0 {\n            act.power += 1.0;\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 14, gain: 0.6, pitch: 0.8 + act.power * 0.1 });\n            if act.power >= 4.0 {\n                act.leaping = true;\n                act.air = 0.0;\n                act.tuck = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n    } else {\n        act.air += dt;\n        if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\n            act.tuck = (act.tuck + dt / 0.4).min(1.0);\n        }\n        act.px += lean.x * dt;\n        let height = (act.air * 3.0).sin().max(0.0) * act.power * 0.25;\n        if act.air > 0.55 && height < 0.15 {\n            let timing = (1.0 - (act.air - 0.7).abs()).clamp(0.2, 1.0);\n            let sc = (height * 4.0).clamp(0.2, 1.0) * act.tuck.clamp(0.2, 1.0) * timing * rules.bounce_gain;\n            act.dive_scores.push(sc.clamp(0.0, 1.0));\n            act.dives += 1;\n            events.push(SimEvent::BigSplash { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, 2.0), size: 1.2 + act.tuck });\n            act.leaping = false;\n            act.power = 0.0;\n            act.air = 0.0;\n            act.tuck = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n    act.t += dt;\n    if act.dives >= 3 || act.t >= rules.cannon_secs {\n        let n = 3.0;\n        let sum: f32 = act.dive_scores.iter().sum();\n        act.score = (sum / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n        act.done = true;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_big(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let _ = lean;\n    match act.phase {\n        0 => {\n            let before = act.t;\n            tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, true);\n            act.t = before + dt;\n            if act.t >= 32.0 {\n                act.phase = 1;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.acc = 0.0;\n                act.done = false;\n            }\n        }\n        1 => {\n            let c = ring_center(act.sub);\n            let inside = (bal.cob - c).length() < 0.28;\n            if inside {\n                act.acc += dt;\n            }\n            act.sub += dt;\n            act.t += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\n                act.phase = 2;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.acc = 0.0;\n                act.note_i = 0;\n                // Use the first notes, time-shifted into this phase by rewriting a local clock.\n                act.t_shift_notes();\n            }\n        }\n        2 => {\n            let local_pressed = pressed;\n            let start_t = act.t;\n            // tick_step uses act.t against note times. Notes were shifted.\n            let saved_dur = rules.step_secs;\n            let _ = saved_dur;\n            tick_step_window(act, local_pressed, dt, rules, 40.0);\n            if act.t - start_t < dt * 0.5 {\n                act.t = start_t + dt;\n            }\n            act.sub += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 40.0 {\n                act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\n                act.phase = 3;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.done = false;\n                act.flopped = false;\n                act.survived = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n        3 => {\n            if braced(held) && bal.cob.length() < 0.45 {\n                act.acc += dt;\n            }\n            act.sub += dt;\n            act.t += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\n                act.phase = 4;\n                act.sub = 0.0;\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\n            }\n        }\n        _ => {\n            if act.sub >= 15.0 && pressed != 0 {\n                act.forfeit = true;\n            }\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\n            act.still_n += dt;\n            act.sub += dt;\n            act.t += dt;\n            if act.sub >= 30.0 {\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\n                let quiet = (1.0 - mean / 0.2).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n                let mut s = quiet * 1000.0;\n                if !act.forfeit {\n                    s = (s + 200.0).min(1000.0);\n                } else {\n                    s *= 0.5;\n                }\n                act.phase_scores.push(s);\n                let n = act.phase_scores.len().max(1) as f32;\n                let sum: f32 = act.phase_scores.iter().copied().sum();\n                act.score = (sum / n).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n                // Tips cost score but never end the run.\n                act.score = (act.score - act.tips as f32 * 15.0).max(0.0);\n                act.done = true;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Activity {\n    fn t_shift_notes(&mut self) {\n        if self.notes.is_empty() {\n            return;\n        }\n        let t0 = self.notes[0][0];\n        for n in &mut self.notes {\n            n[0] = self.t + (n[0] - t0);\n        }\n        self.note_i = 0;\n        self.acc = 0.0;\n        self.hits = 0;\n    }\n}\n\nfn tick_step_window(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, window: f32) {\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\n    let t0 = act.t;\n    tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules);\n    // tick_step may mark done at step_secs. The finale uses its own clock.\n    if act.done && act.kind == EventId::BigStand {\n        act.done = false;\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\n    }\n    if act.t < t0 + dt * 0.5 {\n        act.t = t0 + dt;\n    }\n    let _ = window;\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6063,"output_tokens":14339,"cache_read_input_tokens":193024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a4375b84-0415-42e1-abd1-ac5db19512b6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3133bd94-8dca-46d6-a8d3-bb77ff5c891a-139","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Every Tippy Cay activity, on the shared balance model.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::core::{BalanceCore, Rules, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, Hash, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum EventId {\\n    Check,\\n    Breath,\\n    Pose,\\n    Squat,\\n    Plank,\\n    Step,\\n    Floatie,\\n    Lap,\\n    Tide,\\n    Paddle,\\n    Tray,\\n    Cannon,\\n    BigStand,\\n}\\n\\nimpl EventId {\\n    pub const ALL: [EventId; 13] = [\\n        EventId::Check,\\n        EventId::Breath,\\n        EventId::Pose,\\n        EventId::Squat,\\n        EventId::Plank,\\n        EventId::Step,\\n        EventId::Floatie,\\n        EventId::Lap,\\n        EventId::Tide,\\n        EventId::Paddle,\\n        EventId::Tray,\\n        EventId::Cannon,\\n        EventId::BigStand,\\n    ];\\n\\n    pub fn key(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"check\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"breath\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"pose\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"squat\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"plank\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"step\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"floatie\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"lap\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"tide\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"paddle\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"tray\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"cannon\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"bigstand\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn from_key(s: &str) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        Self::ALL.into_iter().find(|e| e.key() == s)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn title(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"Morning Wobble Check\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"Breath Bloom\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"Pose Parade\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"Tempo Squats\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"Plank Standoff\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"Step Party\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"Floatie Spin\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"Morning Lap\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"Tide Table\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"Paddle Slalom\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Tray Trek\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"Cannonball Cup\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"The Big Stand\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn blurb(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"Stand, lean, close your eyes, and step on the beat.\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"Follow the ring. In for four, out for four.\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"Stay inside the drifting ring. Accept the bird.\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"Down for two, up for one. Keep the dot in the band.\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"Brace, and do not leave the ring.\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"Left, right, sometimes both. The box does not wait.\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"Spin the rings. Catch the ones they throw.\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"Two steps a second. Ribbons are optional. Crabs are not.\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"Tilt the raft. The shells want the pools.\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"Lean ahead to go. The gates are suggestions with consequences.\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Five glasses. The pier is not on your side.\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"Bounce, tuck, splash. The judges brought cards.\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"Everything, once, and then nothing at all.\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn coach(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"Pip\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose => \\\"Posey\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank => \\\"Big Kettle\\\",\\n            EventId::Step | EventId::Floatie | EventId::Lap => \\\"Bounce\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"Commodore Gull\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Marjorie\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn area(self) -> u8 {\\n        Self::ALL.iter().position(|e| *e == self).unwrap_or(0) as u8\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Activities a day opens, not counting the morning check or the finale.\\n    pub fn for_day(day: u8) -> &'static [EventId] {\\n        match day {\\n            1 => &[EventId::Breath, EventId::Pose],\\n            2 => &[EventId::Squat, EventId::Plank],\\n            3 => &[EventId::Step, EventId::Floatie, EventId::Lap],\\n            4 => &[EventId::Tide, EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tray, EventId::Cannon],\\n            _ => &[],\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Shell {\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub vx: f32,\\n    pub vz: f32,\\n    pub pot: bool,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct GhostSample {\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub lean: [f32; 2],\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Activity {\\n    pub kind: EventId,\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub dur: f32,\\n    pub score: f32,\\n    pub stars: u8,\\n    pub done: bool,\\n    pub acc: f32,\\n    pub phase: u8,\\n    pub sub: f32,\\n    pub lungs: f32,\\n    pub depth: f32,\\n    pub reps: u8,\\n    pub survived: f32,\\n    pub out_t: f32,\\n    pub flopped: bool,\\n    pub streak: f32,\\n    pub pose_i: u8,\\n    pub notes: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub note_i: u16,\\n    pub hits: u16,\\n    pub spin: f32,\\n    pub prev_ang: f32,\\n    pub have_ang: bool,\\n    pub rings: u8,\\n    pub band_t: f32,\\n    pub dir: f32,\\n    pub catch_i: u8,\\n    pub steps: u16,\\n    pub last_side: i8,\\n    pub step_times: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub zone_t: f32,\\n    pub lateral: f32,\\n    pub ribbons: u8,\\n    pub bumps: u8,\\n    pub shells: Vec<Shell>,\\n    pub pools: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub potted: u8,\\n    pub board: u8,\\n    pub px: f32,\\n    pub pz: f32,\\n    pub speed: f32,\\n    pub gates: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub gate_i: u8,\\n    pub missed: u8,\\n    pub glasses: [f32; 5],\\n    pub glass_ok: [bool; 5],\\n    pub jolts: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub dives: u8,\\n    pub power: f32,\\n    pub air: f32,\\n    pub tuck: f32,\\n    pub dive_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub leaping: bool,\\n    pub forfeit: bool,\\n    pub still_sum: f32,\\n    pub still_n: f32,\\n    pub metrics: [f32; 4],\\n    pub target_i: u8,\\n    pub hold: f32,\\n    pub target_time: f32,\\n    pub targets_hit: u8,\\n    pub step_hit: u8,\\n    pub nudged: bool,\\n    pub tips: u32,\\n    pub lock: f32,\\n    pub samples: Vec<GhostSample>,\\n    pub phase_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub gag: bool,\\n    pub guide: f32,\\n    pub amp_scale: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Activity {\\n    pub fn start(kind: EventId, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) -> Self {\\n        let dur = match kind {\\n            EventId::Check => 8.0 + 15.0 + 6.0 + 8.0 * 0.6,\\n            EventId::Breath => rules.breath_secs,\\n            EventId::Pose => rules.pose_secs * 3.0,\\n            EventId::Squat => rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 4.0,\\n            EventId::Plank => rules.plank_secs,\\n            EventId::Step => rules.step_secs,\\n            EventId::Floatie => rules.floatie_secs,\\n            EventId::Lap => rules.lap_secs,\\n            EventId::Tide => rules.tide_secs * 3.0,\\n            EventId::Paddle => rules.paddle_secs,\\n            EventId::Tray => rules.tray_secs,\\n            EventId::Cannon => rules.cannon_secs,\\n            EventId::BigStand => 32.0 + 20.0 + 40.0 + 20.0 + 30.0,\\n        };\\n        let mut a = Self {\\n            kind,\\n            t: 0.0,\\n            dur,\\n            score: 0.0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            done: false,\\n            acc: 0.0,\\n            phase: 0,\\n            sub: 0.0,\\n            lungs: 0.0,\\n            depth: 0.0,\\n            reps: 0,\\n            survived: 0.0,\\n            out_t: 0.0,\\n            flopped: false,\\n            streak: 0.0,\\n            pose_i: 0,\\n            notes: Vec::new(),\\n            note_i: 0,\\n            hits: 0,\\n            spin: 0.0,\\n            prev_ang: 0.0,\\n            have_ang: false,\\n            rings: 0,\\n            band_t: 0.0,\\n            dir: 1.0,\\n            catch_i: 0,\\n            steps: 0,\\n            last_side: 0,\\n            step_times: Vec::new(),\\n            zone_t: 0.0,\\n            lateral: 0.0,\\n            ribbons: 0,\\n            bumps: 0,\\n            shells: Vec::new(),\\n            pools: Vec::new(),\\n            potted: 0,\\n            board: 0,\\n            px: 0.0,\\n            pz: 0.0,\\n            speed: 0.0,\\n            gates: Vec::new(),\\n            gate_i: 0,\\n            missed: 0,\\n            glasses: [0.0; 5],\\n            glass_ok: [true; 5],\\n            jolts: Vec::new(),\\n            dives: 0,\\n            power: 0.0,\\n            air: 0.0,\\n            tuck: 0.0,\\n            dive_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            leaping: false,\\n            forfeit: false,\\n            still_sum: 0.0,\\n            still_n: 0.0,\\n            metrics: [0.0; 4],\\n            target_i: 0,\\n            hold: 0.0,\\n            target_time: 0.0,\\n            targets_hit: 0,\\n            step_hit: 0,\\n            nudged: false,\\n            tips: 0,\\n            lock: 0.0,\\n            samples: Vec::new(),\\n            phase_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            gag: false,\\n            guide: 0.0,\\n            amp_scale: 1.0,\\n        };\\n        if kind == EventId::Step || kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n            a.notes = load_notes();\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Tide {\\n            a.setup_board(0, rng);\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Paddle {\\n            for i in 0..6 {\\n                a.gates.push([8.0 + i as f32 * 8.0, rng.range(-1.3, 1.3)]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Tray {\\n            // Scripted jolts the bot can see coming.\\n            for i in 0..8 {\\n                let t = 4.0 + i as f32 * 5.0;\\n                let mag = if i % 2 == 0 { 1.6 } else { -1.6 };\\n                a.jolts.push([t, mag]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        a\\n    }\\n\\n    fn setup_board(&mut self, board: u8, rng: &mut Rng) {\\n        self.board = board;\\n        self.sub = 0.0;\\n        self.shells.clear();\\n        self.pools.clear();\\n        let n = [3, 5, 7][board as usize];\\n        self.pools.push([0.0, 1.6]);\\n        if board >= 1 {\\n            self.pools.push([1.2, -0.4]);\\n        }\\n        if board >= 2 {\\n            self.pools.push([-1.3, 0.2]);\\n        }\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            let ang = i as f32 * 1.7 + rng.range(0.0, 0.4);\\n            self.shells.push(Shell {\\n                x: ang.cos() * 1.5,\\n                z: ang.sin() * 1.1 - 0.2,\\n                vx: 0.0,\\n                vz: 0.0,\\n                pot: false,\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn load_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\\n    struct Charts {\\n        notes: Vec<ChartNote>,\\n    }\\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\\n    struct ChartNote {\\n        t: f32,\\n        lane: u8,\\n    }\\n    let text = crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/charts\\\", include_str!(\\\"charts.toml\\\"));\\n    if let Ok(c) = toml::from_str::<Charts>(&text) {\\n        return c.notes.into_iter().map(|n| [n.t, n.lane as f32]).collect();\\n    }\\n    fallback_notes()\\n}\\n\\nfn fallback_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut notes = Vec::new();\\n    let mut t = 1.0;\\n    let mut i = 0;\\n    while notes.len() < 100 && t < 62.0 {\\n        let lane = if i % 11 == 10 { 2.0 } else { (i % 2) as f32 };\\n        notes.push([t, lane]);\\n        t += if i < 32 { 0.625 } else { 0.3125 };\\n        i += 1;\\n    }\\n    notes\\n}\\n\\nfn pd(bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules, target: Vec2) -> Vec2 {\\n    let lean = (target - bal.wobble() - bal.vel * 0.15) / rules.reach.max(0.2);\\n    lean.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn bot(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    if act.lock > 0.0 {\\n        return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0);\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n        EventId::Check => bot_check(act, bal, rules),\\n        EventId::Breath => {\\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        EventId::Pose => {\\n            let c = ring_center(act.t);\\n            (pd(bal, rules, c), 0)\\n        }\\n        EventId::Squat => {\\n            let down = squat_guide(act.t) > act.depth;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if down { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        EventId::Plank => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\\n        EventId::Step => bot_step(act),\\n        EventId::Floatie => bot_floatie(act),\\n        EventId::Lap => bot_lap(act),\\n        EventId::Tide => bot_tide(act, bal, rules),\\n        EventId::Paddle => bot_paddle(act),\\n        EventId::Tray => (Vec2::new(tray_counter(act), 0.0), 0),\\n        EventId::Cannon => bot_cannon(act),\\n        EventId::BigStand => bot_big(act, bal, rules),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_check(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        1 => {\\n            let targets = [-0.70, 0.55, 0.0];\\n            let x = targets.get(act.target_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::new(x, 0.0)), 0)\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            let beat = 0.6;\\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor();\\n            let at = i * beat;\\n            let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n            let press = (act.sub - at).abs() < 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 && i < 8.0 && i >= 0.0;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if press { side } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_step(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) else { return (Vec2::ZERO, 0) };\\n    if (act.t - n[0]).abs() > 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 {\\n        return (Vec2::ZERO, 0);\\n    }\\n    let lane = n[1] as u8;\\n    let b = if lane == 2 { buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R } else if lane == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_floatie(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let w = 7.5 * act.dir;\\n    let lean = Vec2::new((w * act.t).cos(), (w * act.t).sin()) * 0.75;\\n    let catches = [6.0, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\\n    let mut b = 0;\\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\\n        if (act.t - t).abs() < 0.02 {\\n            b = if act.catch_i % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (lean, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_lap(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let interval = 0.5;\\n    let i = (act.t / interval).floor();\\n    let at = i * interval;\\n    let press = (act.t - at).abs() < 0.02 && i >= 1.0;\\n    let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n    let ribbon_x = ribbon_at(act.t);\\n    let lean_x = (ribbon_x - act.lateral).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    (Vec2::new(lean_x, 0.0), if press { side } else { 0 })\\n}\\n\\nfn ribbon_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let spots = [8.0_f32, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0];\\n    let xs = [0.6, -0.7, 0.8, -0.5, 0.4];\\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if (t - s).abs() < 1.2 {\\n            return xs[i];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    0.0\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_tide(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let shell = act.shells.iter().find(|s| !s.pot);\\n    let pool = act.pools.first().copied().unwrap_or([0.0, 0.0]);\\n    let Some(s) = shell else { return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0) };\\n    let to = Vec2::new(pool[0] - s.x, pool[1] - s.z);\\n    let want = to.normalize_or_zero() * 0.85;\\n    (want, 0)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_paddle(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let gate_x = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize).map(|g| g[1]).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n    let steer = (gate_x - act.px).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    (Vec2::new(steer, 0.5), 0)\\n}\\n\\nfn tray_counter(act: &Activity) -> f32 {\\n    let mut j = 0.0;\\n    for s in &act.jolts {\\n        let dt = act.t - s[0];\\n        if dt > 0.0 && dt < 0.45 {\\n            j += s[1] * (1.0 - dt / 0.45);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (-j * 0.55).clamp(-1.0, 1.0)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_cannon(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    if act.leaping {\\n        let lean = Vec2::new(0.0, 0.2);\\n        return (lean, buttons::CONFIRM);\\n    }\\n    let period = 1.2 * (1.0 / act_bounce(1.0));\\n    let _ = period;\\n    let phase = act.t / 1.2;\\n    let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n    let prev = ((phase - 0.02) * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n    // Bottom of the bounce: sine crosses -0.95 going down then up. Press near the minimum.\\n    let at_bottom = s < -0.92 && prev < s;\\n    let b = if at_bottom && act.dives < 3 { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 };\\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn act_bounce(gain: f32) -> f32 {\\n    gain\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_big(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        1 => (pd(bal, rules, ring_center(act.sub)), 0),\\n        2 => bot_step(act),\\n        3 => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ring_center(t: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let a = 0.35;\\n    Vec2::new(a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.12 * t).sin(), a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.09 * t + 1.3).sin())\\n}\\n\\nfn squat_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let c = (t / 3.2).fract();\\n    if c < 2.0 / 3.2 {\\n        c / (2.0 / 3.2)\\n    } else {\\n        1.0 - (c - 2.0 / 3.2) / (1.2 / 3.2)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn breath_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let c = (t / 8.0).fract();\\n    if c < 0.5 { c * 2.0 } else { 1.0 - (c - 0.5) * 2.0 }\\n}\\n\\npub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if act.done {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n    bal.amp = amp;\\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\\n    } else {\\n        Vec2::ZERO\\n    };\\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n    if bal.tipped {\\n        act.tips += 1;\\n        act.lock = 1.2;\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n        if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\\n            act.lock = 1.5;\\n            act.streak = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt),\\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n    }\\n    if act.done {\\n        finish_score(act);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\\n    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\\n                act.nudged = true;\\n            }\\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n                act.target_i = 0;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            let targets = [-0.70_f32, 0.55, 0.0];\\n            if act.target_i >= 3 {\\n                act.metrics[1] = act.targets_hit as f32 / 3.0;\\n                act.phase = 2;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            let x = targets[act.target_i as usize];\\n            let close = (bal.cob.x - x).abs() < 0.06 && bal.cob.y.abs() < 0.25;\\n            if close {\\n                act.hold += dt;\\n            } else {\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            act.target_time += dt;\\n            if act.hold >= 1.5 {\\n                act.targets_hit += 1;\\n                act.target_i += 1;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            } else if act.target_time >= 5.0 {\\n                act.target_i += 1;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 6.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[2] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 3;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            let beat = 0.6;\\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor() as i32;\\n            if pressed & (buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R) != 0 && i >= 0 && i < 8 {\\n                let at = i as f32 * beat;\\n                let err = (act.sub - at).abs();\\n                let want_l = i % 2 == 0;\\n                let got_l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\\n                if err < 0.12 && want_l == got_l && act.step_hit as i32 <= i {\\n                    act.step_hit += 1;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 * beat {\\n                act.metrics[3] = act.step_hit as f32 / 8.0;\\n                let m = act.metrics;\\n                let skill = 0.30 * m[0] + 0.25 * m[1] + 0.25 * m[2] + 0.20 * m[3];\\n                act.score = (skill * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n                act.done = true;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_breath(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, finale: bool) {\\n    let cap = if finale { 32.0 } else { rules.breath_secs };\\n    act.guide = breath_guide(act.t);\\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs + dt / 4.0).min(1.0);\\n    } else {\\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs - dt / 4.0).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    let err = ((act.lungs - act.guide).abs() / 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let in_ring = if bal.cob.length() < 0.35 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n    let tick = 0.7 * (1.0 - err) + 0.3 * in_ring;\\n    act.acc += tick * dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= cap {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / cap * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = !finale;\\n        if finale {\\n            act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_pose(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let pose_len = rules.pose_secs;\\n    act.pose_i = (act.t / pose_len).floor().clamp(0.0, 2.0) as u8;\\n    let local = act.t - act.pose_i as f32 * pose_len;\\n    if act.pose_i == 1 && local >= 12.0 && local < 17.0 {\\n        act.amp_scale = 1.6;\\n    } else {\\n        act.amp_scale = 1.0;\\n    }\\n    let shrink = (local / pose_len).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let radius = rules.pose_ring + (0.18 - rules.pose_ring) * shrink;\\n    let inside = act.lock <= 0.0 && (bal.cob - ring_center(act.t)).length() < radius.max(0.12);\\n    if inside {\\n        act.streak += dt;\\n    } else {\\n        act.streak = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    let mult = 1.0 + (act.streak / 2.0).floor().min(3.0);\\n    if inside {\\n        act.acc += dt * mult;\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= pose_len * 3.0 {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / (pose_len * 3.0) * 700.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_squat(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    act.guide = squat_guide(act.t);\\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n        act.depth = (act.depth + dt / 2.0).min(1.0);\\n    } else {\\n        act.depth = (act.depth - dt / 1.0).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    let bottom = (act.t / 3.2).fract();\\n    let was = ((act.t - dt) / 3.2).fract();\\n    // A rep completes as the guide returns to the top.\\n    if was > 0.8 && bottom < 0.2 && act.reps < rules.squat_reps as u8 {\\n        let timing = (1.0 - (act.depth - 0.15).abs()).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        // The player should have been deep near the bottom. Use lungs field as \\\"was deep\\\".\\n        let deep = if act.lungs > 0.75 { 1.0 } else { (act.lungs / 0.75).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\\n        let band = if act.hold < 0.25 { 1.0 } else { 0.3 };\\n        act.acc += 0.7 * deep.max(timing * 0.2) + 0.3 * band;\\n        act.reps += 1;\\n        act.lungs = 0.0;\\n        act.hold = 0.0;\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 15, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + act.reps as f32 * 0.03 });\\n        if act.reps == rules.squat_reps as u8 {\\n            act.gag = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if act.depth > act.lungs {\\n        act.lungs = act.depth;\\n    }\\n    if bal.cob.x.abs() >= 0.25 {\\n        act.hold += dt;\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    let need = rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 0.5;\\n    if act.t >= need || act.reps >= rules.squat_reps as u8 && bottom < 0.15 && act.t > 3.0 {\\n        let n = rules.squat_reps.max(1) as f32;\\n        act.score = (act.acc / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn braced(held: u32) -> bool {\\n    let l = held & (buttons::STEP_L) != 0;\\n    let r = held & (buttons::STEP_R) != 0;\\n    l && r\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_plank(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let span = rules.plank_secs.max(1.0);\\n    let radius = 0.40 + (0.20 - 0.40) * (act.t / span).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    if !braced(held) {\\n        act.flopped = true;\\n    }\\n    if bal.cob.length() > radius {\\n        act.out_t += dt;\\n        if act.out_t > 1.0 {\\n            act.flopped = true;\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        act.out_t = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    if act.flopped {\\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    act.survived += dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= span {\\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_step(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\\n    while let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) {\\n        if act.t + 0.02 < n[0] {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        if act.t - n[0] > rules.rhythm_good {\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let lane = n[1] as u8;\\n        let l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\\n        let r = pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0;\\n        let ok = match lane {\\n            0 => l,\\n            1 => r,\\n            _ => l && r,\\n        };\\n        if ok {\\n            let err = (act.t - n[0]).abs();\\n            if err <= rules.rhythm_perfect {\\n                act.hits += 1;\\n                act.acc += 1.0;\\n            } else {\\n                act.hits += 1;\\n                act.acc += 0.6;\\n            }\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n        } else if act.t > n[0] + rules.rhythm_good {\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n        } else {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.step_secs {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_floatie(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    if ((act.t / 15.0).floor() as i32) % 2 == 1 {\\n        act.dir = -1.0;\\n    } else {\\n        act.dir = 1.0;\\n    }\\n    if lean.length() > 0.4 {\\n        let ang = lean.y.atan2(lean.x);\\n        if act.have_ang {\\n            let mut d = ang - act.prev_ang;\\n            if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\\n                d -= std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n            }\\n            if d < -std::f32::consts::PI {\\n                d += std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n            }\\n            let w = d / dt.max(1e-4);\\n            act.spin += (w - act.spin) * 0.35;\\n        }\\n        act.prev_ang = ang;\\n        act.have_ang = true;\\n    } else {\\n        act.spin *= 0.9;\\n    }\\n    let scale = rules.spin_band_scale;\\n    let s = act.spin * act.dir;\\n    let in_band = s > rules.spin_lo / scale && s < rules.spin_hi * scale;\\n    if in_band {\\n        act.band_t += dt;\\n    }\\n    let catches = [6.0_f32, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\\n        let want_l = act.catch_i % 2 == 0;\\n        let got = if want_l { pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 } else { pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 };\\n        if got && (act.t - t).abs() < 0.25 {\\n            act.rings = (act.rings + 1).min(7);\\n            act.catch_i += 1;\\n        } else if act.t > t + 0.25 {\\n            act.catch_i += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.floatie_secs {\\n        let rings = act.rings as f32 / 7.0;\\n        let band = act.band_t / rules.floatie_secs;\\n        act.score = (rings * band * 1400.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_lap(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 && act.last_side != -1 {\\n        act.steps += 1;\\n        act.last_side = -1;\\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\\n    }\\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 && act.last_side != 1 {\\n        act.steps += 1;\\n        act.last_side = 1;\\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\\n    }\\n    act.step_times.retain(|t| act.t - *t < 1.0);\\n    let rate = act.step_times.len() as f32;\\n    if (1.6..=2.4).contains(&rate) && act.t > 1.0 {\\n        act.zone_t += dt;\\n    }\\n    act.lateral = (act.lateral + lean.x * 1.2 * dt).clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n    let ribbon = ribbon_at(act.t);\\n    if ribbon.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - ribbon).abs() < 0.35 && act.t.fract() < dt + 0.02 {\\n        // once per ribbon window, roughly\\n        if act.ribbons < 5 && (act.t - ribbon_time(act.ribbons)).abs() < 1.0 {\\n            act.ribbons += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let crab = crab_at(act.t);\\n    if crab.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - crab).abs() < 0.25 {\\n        act.bumps += 1;\\n        act.lateral = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    act.px = act.lateral;\\n    act.pz = act.t;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.lap_secs {\\n        let zone = act.zone_t / rules.lap_secs;\\n        act.score = (zone * 800.0 + act.ribbons as f32 * 50.0 - act.bumps as f32 * 40.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ribbon_time(i: u8) -> f32 {\\n    [8.0, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0][i as usize]\\n}\\n\\nfn crab_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let spots = [15.0_f32, 33.0, 50.0, 68.0];\\n    let xs = [-0.8, 0.85, -0.6, 0.7];\\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if (t - s).abs() < 0.8 {\\n            return xs[i];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    0.0\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_tide(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) {\\n    let tilt = if bal.cob.length() > 0.18 { bal.cob } else { Vec2::ZERO };\\n    let g = 9.0;\\n    let friction = 3.2;\\n    let mut potted_now = 0;\\n    for s in &mut act.shells {\\n        if s.pot {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let ax = tilt.x * g - friction * s.vx;\\n        let az = tilt.y * g - friction * s.vz;\\n        s.vx += ax * dt;\\n        s.vz += az * dt;\\n        s.x += s.vx * dt;\\n        s.z += s.vz * dt;\\n        if s.x.abs() > 2.2 {\\n            s.x = s.x.clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\\n            s.vx *= -0.5;\\n        }\\n        if s.z.abs() > 1.6 {\\n            s.z = s.z.clamp(-1.6, 1.6);\\n            s.vz *= -0.5;\\n        }\\n        for p in &act.pools {\\n            let dx = s.x - p[0];\\n            let dz = s.z - p[1];\\n            let sp = (s.vx * s.vx + s.vz * s.vz).sqrt();\\n            if dx * dx + dz * dz < 0.28 * 0.28 && sp < 3.5 {\\n                s.pot = true;\\n                potted_now += 1;\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.potted += potted_now;\\n    // Board 2 pool drifts.\\n    if act.board == 1 {\\n        if let Some(p) = act.pools.first_mut() {\\n            p[0] = (act.sub * 0.6).sin() * 0.8;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.sub += dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.sub >= rules.tide_secs {\\n        if act.board < 2 {\\n            act.setup_board(act.board + 1, rng);\\n        } else {\\n            let total = 3.0 + 5.0 + 7.0;\\n            let time_bonus = (1.0 - (act.t / (rules.tide_secs * 3.0)).clamp(0.0, 1.0)) * 150.0;\\n            act.score = (act.potted as f32 / total * 850.0 + time_bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n            act.done = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_paddle(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let forward = lean.y.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    let target = if forward > 0.0 { forward * 6.5 } else { forward * 2.0 };\\n    act.speed += (target - act.speed) * dt * 2.2;\\n    act.speed = act.speed.max(0.0);\\n    act.pz += act.speed * dt;\\n    act.px = (act.px + lean.x * 3.2 * dt).clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\\n    if act.t.fract() < dt {\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Wake { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, act.pz) });\\n    }\\n    if let Some(g) = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize) {\\n        if act.pz >= g[0] {\\n            if (act.px - g[1]).abs() > 0.7 {\\n                act.missed += 1;\\n            }\\n            act.gate_i += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    let finished = act.pz >= 56.0 || act.t >= rules.paddle_secs;\\n    if finished {\\n        let mut t = if act.pz >= 56.0 { act.t } else { rules.paddle_secs };\\n        t += act.missed as f32 * 2.0;\\n        let par = rules.paddle_par;\\n        let raw = (1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par);\\n        act.score = (raw.clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_tray(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let mut jolt = 0.0;\\n    for s in &act.jolts {\\n        let d = act.t - s[0];\\n        if d > 0.0 && d < 0.35 {\\n            jolt += s[1] * (1.0 - d / 0.35);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let tilt = bal.cob.x + jolt * 0.15;\\n    for i in 0..5 {\\n        if !act.glass_ok[i] {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        act.glasses[i] += tilt * dt * 1.3;\\n        if act.glasses[i].abs() > 1.0 {\\n            act.glass_ok[i] = false;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 19, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    act.pz = act.t;\\n    if act.t >= rules.tray_secs {\\n        let kept = act.glass_ok.iter().filter(|g| **g).count() as f32;\\n        let bonus = if kept == 5.0 { 0.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n        act.score = (kept * 200.0 + bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_cannon(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let _ = rules;\\n    if !act.leaping {\\n        let phase = act.t / 1.2;\\n        let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n        let prev = ((act.t - dt) / 1.2 * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n        let bottom = s < -0.9 && s > prev;\\n        if bottom && pressed & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 && act.power < 4.0 {\\n            act.power += 1.0;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 14, gain: 0.6, pitch: 0.8 + act.power * 0.1 });\\n            if act.power >= 4.0 {\\n                act.leaping = true;\\n                act.air = 0.0;\\n                act.tuck = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        act.air += dt;\\n        if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n            act.tuck = (act.tuck + dt / 0.4).min(1.0);\\n        }\\n        act.px += lean.x * dt;\\n        let height = (act.air * 3.0).sin().max(0.0) * act.power * 0.25;\\n        if act.air > 0.55 && height < 0.15 {\\n            let timing = (1.0 - (act.air - 0.7).abs()).clamp(0.2, 1.0);\\n            let sc = (height * 4.0).clamp(0.2, 1.0) * act.tuck.clamp(0.2, 1.0) * timing * rules.bounce_gain;\\n            act.dive_scores.push(sc.clamp(0.0, 1.0));\\n            act.dives += 1;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::BigSplash { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, 2.0), size: 1.2 + act.tuck });\\n            act.leaping = false;\\n            act.power = 0.0;\\n            act.air = 0.0;\\n            act.tuck = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.dives >= 3 || act.t >= rules.cannon_secs {\\n        let n = 3.0;\\n        let sum: f32 = act.dive_scores.iter().sum();\\n        act.score = (sum / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_big(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let _ = lean;\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            let before = act.t;\\n            tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, true);\\n            act.t = before + dt;\\n            if act.t >= 32.0 {\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.acc = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            let c = ring_center(act.sub);\\n            let inside = (bal.cob - c).length() < 0.28;\\n            if inside {\\n                act.acc += dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\\n                act.phase = 2;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.acc = 0.0;\\n                act.note_i = 0;\\n                // Use the first notes, time-shifted into this phase by rewriting a local clock.\\n                act.t_shift_notes();\\n            }\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            let local_pressed = pressed;\\n            let start_t = act.t;\\n            // tick_step uses act.t against note times. Notes were shifted.\\n            let saved_dur = rules.step_secs;\\n            let _ = saved_dur;\\n            tick_step_window(act, local_pressed, dt, rules, 40.0);\\n            if act.t - start_t < dt * 0.5 {\\n                act.t = start_t + dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 40.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\\n                act.phase = 3;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n                act.flopped = false;\\n                act.survived = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            if braced(held) && bal.cob.length() < 0.45 {\\n                act.acc += dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\\n                act.phase = 4;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            if act.sub >= 15.0 && pressed != 0 {\\n                act.forfeit = true;\\n            }\\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 30.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                let quiet = (1.0 - mean / 0.2).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                let mut s = quiet * 1000.0;\\n                if !act.forfeit {\\n                    s = (s + 200.0).min(1000.0);\\n                } else {\\n                    s *= 0.5;\\n                }\\n                act.phase_scores.push(s);\\n                let n = act.phase_scores.len().max(1) as f32;\\n                let sum: f32 = act.phase_scores.iter().copied().sum();\\n                act.score = (sum / n).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n                // Tips cost score but never end the run.\\n                act.score = (act.score - act.tips as f32 * 15.0).max(0.0);\\n                act.done = true;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Activity {\\n    fn t_shift_notes(&mut self) {\\n        if self.notes.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let t0 = self.notes[0][0];\\n        for n in &mut self.notes {\\n            n[0] = self.t + (n[0] - t0);\\n        }\\n        self.note_i = 0;\\n        self.acc = 0.0;\\n        self.hits = 0;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_step_window(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, window: f32) {\\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\\n    let t0 = act.t;\\n    tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules);\\n    // tick_step may mark done at step_secs. The finale uses its own clock.\\n    if act.done && act.kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n        act.done = false;\\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n    }\\n    if act.t < t0 + dt * 0.5 {\\n        act.t = t0 + dt;\\n    }\\n    let _ = window;\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Every Tippy Cay activity, on the shared balance model.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec2;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::core::{BalanceCore, Rules, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::buttons;\\nuse crate::rng::Rng;\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, Hash, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub enum EventId {\\n    Check,\\n    Breath,\\n    Pose,\\n    Squat,\\n    Plank,\\n    Step,\\n    Floatie,\\n    Lap,\\n    Tide,\\n    Paddle,\\n    Tray,\\n    Cannon,\\n    BigStand,\\n}\\n\\nimpl EventId {\\n    pub const ALL: [EventId; 13] = [\\n        EventId::Check,\\n        EventId::Breath,\\n        EventId::Pose,\\n        EventId::Squat,\\n        EventId::Plank,\\n        EventId::Step,\\n        EventId::Floatie,\\n        EventId::Lap,\\n        EventId::Tide,\\n        EventId::Paddle,\\n        EventId::Tray,\\n        EventId::Cannon,\\n        EventId::BigStand,\\n    ];\\n\\n    pub fn key(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"check\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"breath\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"pose\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"squat\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"plank\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"step\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"floatie\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"lap\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"tide\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"paddle\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"tray\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"cannon\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"bigstand\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn from_key(s: &str) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        Self::ALL.into_iter().find(|e| e.key() == s)\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn title(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"Morning Wobble Check\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"Breath Bloom\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"Pose Parade\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"Tempo Squats\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"Plank Standoff\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"Step Party\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"Floatie Spin\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"Morning Lap\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"Tide Table\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"Paddle Slalom\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Tray Trek\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"Cannonball Cup\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"The Big Stand\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn blurb(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check => \\\"Stand, lean, close your eyes, and step on the beat.\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath => \\\"Follow the ring. In for four, out for four.\\\",\\n            EventId::Pose => \\\"Stay inside the drifting ring. Accept the bird.\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat => \\\"Down for two, up for one. Keep the dot in the band.\\\",\\n            EventId::Plank => \\\"Brace, and do not leave the ring.\\\",\\n            EventId::Step => \\\"Left, right, sometimes both. The box does not wait.\\\",\\n            EventId::Floatie => \\\"Spin the rings. Catch the ones they throw.\\\",\\n            EventId::Lap => \\\"Two steps a second. Ribbons are optional. Crabs are not.\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide => \\\"Tilt the raft. The shells want the pools.\\\",\\n            EventId::Paddle => \\\"Lean ahead to go. The gates are suggestions with consequences.\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Five glasses. The pier is not on your side.\\\",\\n            EventId::Cannon => \\\"Bounce, tuck, splash. The judges brought cards.\\\",\\n            EventId::BigStand => \\\"Everything, once, and then nothing at all.\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn coach(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"Pip\\\",\\n            EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose => \\\"Posey\\\",\\n            EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank => \\\"Big Kettle\\\",\\n            EventId::Step | EventId::Floatie | EventId::Lap => \\\"Bounce\\\",\\n            EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"Commodore Gull\\\",\\n            EventId::Tray => \\\"Marjorie\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn area(self) -> u8 {\\n        Self::ALL.iter().position(|e| *e == self).unwrap_or(0) as u8\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Activities a day opens, not counting the morning check or the finale.\\n    pub fn for_day(day: u8) -> &'static [EventId] {\\n        match day {\\n            1 => &[EventId::Breath, EventId::Pose],\\n            2 => &[EventId::Squat, EventId::Plank],\\n            3 => &[EventId::Step, EventId::Floatie, EventId::Lap],\\n            4 => &[EventId::Tide, EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tray, EventId::Cannon],\\n            _ => &[],\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Shell {\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub vx: f32,\\n    pub vz: f32,\\n    pub pot: bool,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct GhostSample {\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub lean: [f32; 2],\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Activity {\\n    pub kind: EventId,\\n    pub t: f32,\\n    pub dur: f32,\\n    pub score: f32,\\n    pub stars: u8,\\n    pub done: bool,\\n    pub acc: f32,\\n    pub phase: u8,\\n    pub sub: f32,\\n    pub lungs: f32,\\n    pub depth: f32,\\n    pub reps: u8,\\n    pub survived: f32,\\n    pub out_t: f32,\\n    pub flopped: bool,\\n    pub streak: f32,\\n    pub pose_i: u8,\\n    pub notes: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub note_i: u16,\\n    pub hits: u16,\\n    pub spin: f32,\\n    pub prev_ang: f32,\\n    pub have_ang: bool,\\n    pub rings: u8,\\n    pub band_t: f32,\\n    pub dir: f32,\\n    pub catch_i: u8,\\n    pub steps: u16,\\n    pub last_side: i8,\\n    pub step_times: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub zone_t: f32,\\n    pub lateral: f32,\\n    pub ribbons: u8,\\n    pub bumps: u8,\\n    pub shells: Vec<Shell>,\\n    pub pools: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub potted: u8,\\n    pub board: u8,\\n    pub px: f32,\\n    pub pz: f32,\\n    pub speed: f32,\\n    pub gates: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub gate_i: u8,\\n    pub missed: u8,\\n    pub glasses: [f32; 5],\\n    pub glass_ok: [bool; 5],\\n    pub jolts: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub dives: u8,\\n    pub power: f32,\\n    pub air: f32,\\n    pub tuck: f32,\\n    pub dive_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub leaping: bool,\\n    pub forfeit: bool,\\n    pub still_sum: f32,\\n    pub still_n: f32,\\n    pub metrics: [f32; 4],\\n    pub target_i: u8,\\n    pub hold: f32,\\n    pub target_time: f32,\\n    pub targets_hit: u8,\\n    pub step_hit: u8,\\n    pub nudged: bool,\\n    pub tips: u32,\\n    pub lock: f32,\\n    pub samples: Vec<GhostSample>,\\n    pub phase_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub gag: bool,\\n    pub guide: f32,\\n    pub amp_scale: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Activity {\\n    pub fn start(kind: EventId, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) -> Self {\\n        let dur = match kind {\\n            EventId::Check => 8.0 + 15.0 + 6.0 + 8.0 * 0.6,\\n            EventId::Breath => rules.breath_secs,\\n            EventId::Pose => rules.pose_secs * 3.0,\\n            EventId::Squat => rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 4.0,\\n            EventId::Plank => rules.plank_secs,\\n            EventId::Step => rules.step_secs,\\n            EventId::Floatie => rules.floatie_secs,\\n            EventId::Lap => rules.lap_secs,\\n            EventId::Tide => rules.tide_secs * 3.0,\\n            EventId::Paddle => rules.paddle_secs,\\n            EventId::Tray => rules.tray_secs,\\n            EventId::Cannon => rules.cannon_secs,\\n            EventId::BigStand => 32.0 + 20.0 + 40.0 + 20.0 + 30.0,\\n        };\\n        let mut a = Self {\\n            kind,\\n            t: 0.0,\\n            dur,\\n            score: 0.0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            done: false,\\n            acc: 0.0,\\n            phase: 0,\\n            sub: 0.0,\\n            lungs: 0.0,\\n            depth: 0.0,\\n            reps: 0,\\n            survived: 0.0,\\n            out_t: 0.0,\\n            flopped: false,\\n            streak: 0.0,\\n            pose_i: 0,\\n            notes: Vec::new(),\\n            note_i: 0,\\n            hits: 0,\\n            spin: 0.0,\\n            prev_ang: 0.0,\\n            have_ang: false,\\n            rings: 0,\\n            band_t: 0.0,\\n            dir: 1.0,\\n            catch_i: 0,\\n            steps: 0,\\n            last_side: 0,\\n            step_times: Vec::new(),\\n            zone_t: 0.0,\\n            lateral: 0.0,\\n            ribbons: 0,\\n            bumps: 0,\\n            shells: Vec::new(),\\n            pools: Vec::new(),\\n            potted: 0,\\n            board: 0,\\n            px: 0.0,\\n            pz: 0.0,\\n            speed: 0.0,\\n            gates: Vec::new(),\\n            gate_i: 0,\\n            missed: 0,\\n            glasses: [0.0; 5],\\n            glass_ok: [true; 5],\\n            jolts: Vec::new(),\\n            dives: 0,\\n            power: 0.0,\\n            air: 0.0,\\n            tuck: 0.0,\\n            dive_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            leaping: false,\\n            forfeit: false,\\n            still_sum: 0.0,\\n            still_n: 0.0,\\n            metrics: [0.0; 4],\\n            target_i: 0,\\n            hold: 0.0,\\n            target_time: 0.0,\\n            targets_hit: 0,\\n            step_hit: 0,\\n            nudged: false,\\n            tips: 0,\\n            lock: 0.0,\\n            samples: Vec::new(),\\n            phase_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            gag: false,\\n            guide: 0.0,\\n            amp_scale: 1.0,\\n        };\\n        if kind == EventId::Step || kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n            a.notes = load_notes();\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Tide {\\n            a.setup_board(0, rng);\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Paddle {\\n            for i in 0..6 {\\n                a.gates.push([8.0 + i as f32 * 8.0, rng.range(-1.3, 1.3)]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if kind == EventId::Tray {\\n            // Scripted jolts the bot can see coming.\\n            for i in 0..8 {\\n                let t = 4.0 + i as f32 * 5.0;\\n                let mag = if i % 2 == 0 { 1.6 } else { -1.6 };\\n                a.jolts.push([t, mag]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        a\\n    }\\n\\n    fn setup_board(&mut self, board: u8, rng: &mut Rng) {\\n        self.board = board;\\n        self.sub = 0.0;\\n        self.shells.clear();\\n        self.pools.clear();\\n        let n = [3, 5, 7][board as usize];\\n        self.pools.push([0.0, 1.6]);\\n        if board >= 1 {\\n            self.pools.push([1.2, -0.4]);\\n        }\\n        if board >= 2 {\\n            self.pools.push([-1.3, 0.2]);\\n        }\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            let ang = i as f32 * 1.7 + rng.range(0.0, 0.4);\\n            self.shells.push(Shell {\\n                x: ang.cos() * 1.5,\\n                z: ang.sin() * 1.1 - 0.2,\\n                vx: 0.0,\\n                vz: 0.0,\\n                pot: false,\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn load_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\\n    struct Charts {\\n        notes: Vec<ChartNote>,\\n    }\\n    #[derive(Deserialize)]\\n    struct ChartNote {\\n        t: f32,\\n        lane: u8,\\n    }\\n    let text = crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/charts\\\", include_str!(\\\"charts.toml\\\"));\\n    if let Ok(c) = toml::from_str::<Charts>(&text) {\\n        return c.notes.into_iter().map(|n| [n.t, n.lane as f32]).collect();\\n    }\\n    fallback_notes()\\n}\\n\\nfn fallback_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut notes = Vec::new();\\n    let mut t = 1.0;\\n    let mut i = 0;\\n    while notes.len() < 100 && t < 62.0 {\\n        let lane = if i % 11 == 10 { 2.0 } else { (i % 2) as f32 };\\n        notes.push([t, lane]);\\n        t += if i < 32 { 0.625 } else { 0.3125 };\\n        i += 1;\\n    }\\n    notes\\n}\\n\\nfn pd(bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules, target: Vec2) -> Vec2 {\\n    let lean = (target - bal.wobble() - bal.vel * 0.15) / rules.reach.max(0.2);\\n    lean.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\npub fn bot(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    if act.lock > 0.0 {\\n        return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0);\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n        EventId::Check => bot_check(act, bal, rules),\\n        EventId::Breath => {\\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        EventId::Pose => {\\n            let c = ring_center(act.t);\\n            (pd(bal, rules, c), 0)\\n        }\\n        EventId::Squat => {\\n            let down = squat_guide(act.t) > act.depth;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if down { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        EventId::Plank => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\\n        EventId::Step => bot_step(act),\\n        EventId::Floatie => bot_floatie(act),\\n        EventId::Lap => bot_lap(act),\\n        EventId::Tide => bot_tide(act, bal, rules),\\n        EventId::Paddle => bot_paddle(act),\\n        EventId::Tray => (Vec2::new(tray_counter(act), 0.0), 0),\\n        EventId::Cannon => bot_cannon(act),\\n        EventId::BigStand => bot_big(act, bal, rules),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_check(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        1 => {\\n            let targets = [-0.70, 0.55, 0.0];\\n            let x = targets.get(act.target_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::new(x, 0.0)), 0)\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            let beat = 0.6;\\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor();\\n            let at = i * beat;\\n            let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n            let press = (act.sub - at).abs() < 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 && i < 8.0 && i >= 0.0;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if press { side } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_step(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) else { return (Vec2::ZERO, 0) };\\n    if (act.t - n[0]).abs() > 0.5 / 60.0 + 0.001 {\\n        return (Vec2::ZERO, 0);\\n    }\\n    let lane = n[1] as u8;\\n    let b = if lane == 2 { buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R } else if lane == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_floatie(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let w = 7.5 * act.dir;\\n    let lean = Vec2::new((w * act.t).cos(), (w * act.t).sin()) * 0.75;\\n    let catches = [6.0, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\\n    let mut b = 0;\\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\\n        if (act.t - t).abs() < 0.02 {\\n            b = if act.catch_i % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (lean, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_lap(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let interval = 0.5;\\n    let i = (act.t / interval).floor();\\n    let at = i * interval;\\n    let press = (act.t - at).abs() < 0.02 && i >= 1.0;\\n    let side = if (i as i32) % 2 == 0 { buttons::STEP_L } else { buttons::STEP_R };\\n    let ribbon_x = ribbon_at(act.t);\\n    let lean_x = (ribbon_x - act.lateral).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    (Vec2::new(lean_x, 0.0), if press { side } else { 0 })\\n}\\n\\nfn ribbon_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let spots = [8.0_f32, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0];\\n    let xs = [0.6, -0.7, 0.8, -0.5, 0.4];\\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if (t - s).abs() < 1.2 {\\n            return xs[i];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    0.0\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_tide(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let shell = act.shells.iter().find(|s| !s.pot);\\n    let pool = act.pools.first().copied().unwrap_or([0.0, 0.0]);\\n    let Some(s) = shell else { return (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0) };\\n    let to = Vec2::new(pool[0] - s.x, pool[1] - s.z);\\n    let want = to.normalize_or_zero() * 0.85;\\n    (want, 0)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_paddle(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    let gate_x = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize).map(|g| g[1]).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n    let steer = (gate_x - act.px).clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    (Vec2::new(steer, 0.5), 0)\\n}\\n\\nfn tray_counter(act: &Activity) -> f32 {\\n    let mut j = 0.0;\\n    for s in &act.jolts {\\n        let dt = act.t - s[0];\\n        if dt > 0.0 && dt < 0.45 {\\n            j += s[1] * (1.0 - dt / 0.45);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (-j * 0.55).clamp(-1.0, 1.0)\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_cannon(act: &Activity) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    if act.leaping {\\n        let lean = Vec2::new(0.0, 0.2);\\n        return (lean, buttons::CONFIRM);\\n    }\\n    let period = 1.2 * (1.0 / act_bounce(1.0));\\n    let _ = period;\\n    let phase = act.t / 1.2;\\n    let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n    let prev = ((phase - 0.02) * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n    // Bottom of the bounce: sine crosses -0.95 going down then up. Press near the minimum.\\n    let at_bottom = s < -0.92 && prev < s;\\n    let b = if at_bottom && act.dives < 3 { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 };\\n    (Vec2::ZERO, b)\\n}\\n\\nfn act_bounce(gain: f32) -> f32 {\\n    gain\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_big(act: &Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, rules: &Rules) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            let up = act.guide + 0.02 > act.lungs;\\n            (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), if up { buttons::CONFIRM } else { 0 })\\n        }\\n        1 => (pd(bal, rules, ring_center(act.sub)), 0),\\n        2 => bot_step(act),\\n        3 => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R),\\n        _ => (pd(bal, rules, Vec2::ZERO), 0),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ring_center(t: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let a = 0.35;\\n    Vec2::new(a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.12 * t).sin(), a * (std::f32::consts::TAU * 0.09 * t + 1.3).sin())\\n}\\n\\nfn squat_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let c = (t / 3.2).fract();\\n    if c < 2.0 / 3.2 {\\n        c / (2.0 / 3.2)\\n    } else {\\n        1.0 - (c - 2.0 / 3.2) / (1.2 / 3.2)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn breath_guide(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let c = (t / 8.0).fract();\\n    if c < 0.5 { c * 2.0 } else { 1.0 - (c - 0.5) * 2.0 }\\n}\\n\\npub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if act.done {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n    bal.amp = amp;\\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\\n    } else {\\n        Vec2::ZERO\\n    };\\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n    if bal.tipped {\\n        act.tips += 1;\\n        act.lock = 1.2;\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n        if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\\n            act.lock = 1.5;\\n            act.streak = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt),\\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n    }\\n    if act.done {\\n        finish_score(act);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\\n    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\\n                act.nudged = true;\\n            }\\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n                act.target_i = 0;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            let targets = [-0.70_f32, 0.55, 0.0];\\n            if act.target_i >= 3 {\\n                act.metrics[1] = act.targets_hit as f32 / 3.0;\\n                act.phase = 2;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            let x = targets[act.target_i as usize];\\n            let close = (bal.cob.x - x).abs() < 0.06 && bal.cob.y.abs() < 0.25;\\n            if close {\\n                act.hold += dt;\\n            } else {\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            act.target_time += dt;\\n            if act.hold >= 1.5 {\\n                act.targets_hit += 1;\\n                act.target_i += 1;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            } else if act.target_time >= 5.0 {\\n                act.target_i += 1;\\n                act.hold = 0.0;\\n                act.target_time = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 6.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[2] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 3;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            let beat = 0.6;\\n            let i = (act.sub / beat).floor() as i32;\\n            if pressed & (buttons::STEP_L | buttons::STEP_R) != 0 && i >= 0 && i < 8 {\\n                let at = i as f32 * beat;\\n                let err = (act.sub - at).abs();\\n                let want_l = i % 2 == 0;\\n                let got_l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\\n                if err < 0.12 && want_l == got_l && act.step_hit as i32 <= i {\\n                    act.step_hit += 1;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 * beat {\\n                act.metrics[3] = act.step_hit as f32 / 8.0;\\n                let m = act.metrics;\\n                let skill = 0.30 * m[0] + 0.25 * m[1] + 0.25 * m[2] + 0.20 * m[3];\\n                act.score = (skill * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n                act.done = true;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_breath(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, finale: bool) {\\n    let cap = if finale { 32.0 } else { rules.breath_secs };\\n    act.guide = breath_guide(act.t);\\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs + dt / 4.0).min(1.0);\\n    } else {\\n        act.lungs = (act.lungs - dt / 4.0).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    let err = ((act.lungs - act.guide).abs() / 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let in_ring = if bal.cob.length() < 0.35 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n    let tick = 0.7 * (1.0 - err) + 0.3 * in_ring;\\n    act.acc += tick * dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= cap {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / cap * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = !finale;\\n        if finale {\\n            act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_pose(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let pose_len = rules.pose_secs;\\n    act.pose_i = (act.t / pose_len).floor().clamp(0.0, 2.0) as u8;\\n    let local = act.t - act.pose_i as f32 * pose_len;\\n    if act.pose_i == 1 && local >= 12.0 && local < 17.0 {\\n        act.amp_scale = 1.6;\\n    } else {\\n        act.amp_scale = 1.0;\\n    }\\n    let shrink = (local / pose_len).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    let radius = rules.pose_ring + (0.18 - rules.pose_ring) * shrink;\\n    let inside = act.lock <= 0.0 && (bal.cob - ring_center(act.t)).length() < radius.max(0.12);\\n    if inside {\\n        act.streak += dt;\\n    } else {\\n        act.streak = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    let mult = 1.0 + (act.streak / 2.0).floor().min(3.0);\\n    if inside {\\n        act.acc += dt * mult;\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= pose_len * 3.0 {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / (pose_len * 3.0) * 700.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_squat(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    act.guide = squat_guide(act.t);\\n    if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n        act.depth = (act.depth + dt / 2.0).min(1.0);\\n    } else {\\n        act.depth = (act.depth - dt / 1.0).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    let bottom = (act.t / 3.2).fract();\\n    let was = ((act.t - dt) / 3.2).fract();\\n    // A rep completes as the guide returns to the top.\\n    if was > 0.8 && bottom < 0.2 && act.reps < rules.squat_reps as u8 {\\n        let timing = (1.0 - (act.depth - 0.15).abs()).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        // The player should have been deep near the bottom. Use lungs field as \\\"was deep\\\".\\n        let deep = if act.lungs > 0.75 { 1.0 } else { (act.lungs / 0.75).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\\n        let band = if act.hold < 0.25 { 1.0 } else { 0.3 };\\n        act.acc += 0.7 * deep.max(timing * 0.2) + 0.3 * band;\\n        act.reps += 1;\\n        act.lungs = 0.0;\\n        act.hold = 0.0;\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 15, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + act.reps as f32 * 0.03 });\\n        if act.reps == rules.squat_reps as u8 {\\n            act.gag = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if act.depth > act.lungs {\\n        act.lungs = act.depth;\\n    }\\n    if bal.cob.x.abs() >= 0.25 {\\n        act.hold += dt;\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    let need = rules.squat_reps as f32 * 3.2 + 0.5;\\n    if act.t >= need || act.reps >= rules.squat_reps as u8 && bottom < 0.15 && act.t > 3.0 {\\n        let n = rules.squat_reps.max(1) as f32;\\n        act.score = (act.acc / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn braced(held: u32) -> bool {\\n    let l = held & (buttons::STEP_L) != 0;\\n    let r = held & (buttons::STEP_R) != 0;\\n    l && r\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_plank(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, held: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let span = rules.plank_secs.max(1.0);\\n    let radius = 0.40 + (0.20 - 0.40) * (act.t / span).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    if !braced(held) {\\n        act.flopped = true;\\n    }\\n    if bal.cob.length() > radius {\\n        act.out_t += dt;\\n        if act.out_t > 1.0 {\\n            act.flopped = true;\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        act.out_t = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    if act.flopped {\\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    act.survived += dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= span {\\n        act.score = (act.survived / 60.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_step(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\\n    while let Some(n) = act.notes.get(act.note_i as usize) {\\n        if act.t + 0.02 < n[0] {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        if act.t - n[0] > rules.rhythm_good {\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let lane = n[1] as u8;\\n        let l = pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0;\\n        let r = pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0;\\n        let ok = match lane {\\n            0 => l,\\n            1 => r,\\n            _ => l && r,\\n        };\\n        if ok {\\n            let err = (act.t - n[0]).abs();\\n            if err <= rules.rhythm_perfect {\\n                act.hits += 1;\\n                act.acc += 1.0;\\n            } else {\\n                act.hits += 1;\\n                act.acc += 0.6;\\n            }\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n        } else if act.t > n[0] + rules.rhythm_good {\\n            act.note_i += 1;\\n        } else {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.step_secs {\\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_floatie(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    if ((act.t / 15.0).floor() as i32) % 2 == 1 {\\n        act.dir = -1.0;\\n    } else {\\n        act.dir = 1.0;\\n    }\\n    if lean.length() > 0.4 {\\n        let ang = lean.y.atan2(lean.x);\\n        if act.have_ang {\\n            let mut d = ang - act.prev_ang;\\n            if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\\n                d -= std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n            }\\n            if d < -std::f32::consts::PI {\\n                d += std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n            }\\n            let w = d / dt.max(1e-4);\\n            act.spin += (w - act.spin) * 0.35;\\n        }\\n        act.prev_ang = ang;\\n        act.have_ang = true;\\n    } else {\\n        act.spin *= 0.9;\\n    }\\n    let scale = rules.spin_band_scale;\\n    let s = act.spin * act.dir;\\n    let in_band = s > rules.spin_lo / scale && s < rules.spin_hi * scale;\\n    if in_band {\\n        act.band_t += dt;\\n    }\\n    let catches = [6.0_f32, 13.0, 20.0, 27.0, 34.0, 41.0, 48.0];\\n    if let Some(t) = catches.get(act.catch_i as usize) {\\n        let want_l = act.catch_i % 2 == 0;\\n        let got = if want_l { pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 } else { pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 };\\n        if got && (act.t - t).abs() < 0.25 {\\n            act.rings = (act.rings + 1).min(7);\\n            act.catch_i += 1;\\n        } else if act.t > t + 0.25 {\\n            act.catch_i += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.floatie_secs {\\n        let rings = act.rings as f32 / 7.0;\\n        let band = act.band_t / rules.floatie_secs;\\n        act.score = (rings * band * 1400.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_lap(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules) {\\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_L != 0 && act.last_side != -1 {\\n        act.steps += 1;\\n        act.last_side = -1;\\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\\n    }\\n    if pressed & buttons::STEP_R != 0 && act.last_side != 1 {\\n        act.steps += 1;\\n        act.last_side = 1;\\n        act.step_times.push(act.t);\\n    }\\n    act.step_times.retain(|t| act.t - *t < 1.0);\\n    let rate = act.step_times.len() as f32;\\n    if (1.6..=2.4).contains(&rate) && act.t > 1.0 {\\n        act.zone_t += dt;\\n    }\\n    act.lateral = (act.lateral + lean.x * 1.2 * dt).clamp(-1.2, 1.2);\\n    let ribbon = ribbon_at(act.t);\\n    if ribbon.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - ribbon).abs() < 0.35 && act.t.fract() < dt + 0.02 {\\n        // once per ribbon window, roughly\\n        if act.ribbons < 5 && (act.t - ribbon_time(act.ribbons)).abs() < 1.0 {\\n            act.ribbons += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let crab = crab_at(act.t);\\n    if crab.abs() > 0.2 && (act.lateral - crab).abs() < 0.25 {\\n        act.bumps += 1;\\n        act.lateral = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    act.px = act.lateral;\\n    act.pz = act.t;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.t >= rules.lap_secs {\\n        let zone = act.zone_t / rules.lap_secs;\\n        act.score = (zone * 800.0 + act.ribbons as f32 * 50.0 - act.bumps as f32 * 40.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ribbon_time(i: u8) -> f32 {\\n    [8.0, 22.0, 40.0, 58.0, 75.0][i as usize]\\n}\\n\\nfn crab_at(t: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let spots = [15.0_f32, 33.0, 50.0, 68.0];\\n    let xs = [-0.8, 0.85, -0.6, 0.7];\\n    for (i, s) in spots.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if (t - s).abs() < 0.8 {\\n            return xs[i];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    0.0\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_tide(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) {\\n    let tilt = if bal.cob.length() > 0.18 { bal.cob } else { Vec2::ZERO };\\n    let g = 9.0;\\n    let friction = 3.2;\\n    let mut potted_now = 0;\\n    for s in &mut act.shells {\\n        if s.pot {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let ax = tilt.x * g - friction * s.vx;\\n        let az = tilt.y * g - friction * s.vz;\\n        s.vx += ax * dt;\\n        s.vz += az * dt;\\n        s.x += s.vx * dt;\\n        s.z += s.vz * dt;\\n        if s.x.abs() > 2.2 {\\n            s.x = s.x.clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\\n            s.vx *= -0.5;\\n        }\\n        if s.z.abs() > 1.6 {\\n            s.z = s.z.clamp(-1.6, 1.6);\\n            s.vz *= -0.5;\\n        }\\n        for p in &act.pools {\\n            let dx = s.x - p[0];\\n            let dz = s.z - p[1];\\n            let sp = (s.vx * s.vx + s.vz * s.vz).sqrt();\\n            if dx * dx + dz * dz < 0.28 * 0.28 && sp < 3.5 {\\n                s.pot = true;\\n                potted_now += 1;\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.potted += potted_now;\\n    // Board 2 pool drifts.\\n    if act.board == 1 {\\n        if let Some(p) = act.pools.first_mut() {\\n            p[0] = (act.sub * 0.6).sin() * 0.8;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.sub += dt;\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.sub >= rules.tide_secs {\\n        if act.board < 2 {\\n            act.setup_board(act.board + 1, rng);\\n        } else {\\n            let total = 3.0 + 5.0 + 7.0;\\n            let time_bonus = (1.0 - (act.t / (rules.tide_secs * 3.0)).clamp(0.0, 1.0)) * 150.0;\\n            act.score = (act.potted as f32 / total * 850.0 + time_bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n            act.done = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_paddle(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let forward = lean.y.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);\\n    let target = if forward > 0.0 { forward * 6.5 } else { forward * 2.0 };\\n    act.speed += (target - act.speed) * dt * 2.2;\\n    act.speed = act.speed.max(0.0);\\n    act.pz += act.speed * dt;\\n    act.px = (act.px + lean.x * 3.2 * dt).clamp(-2.2, 2.2);\\n    if act.t.fract() < dt {\\n        events.push(SimEvent::Wake { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, act.pz) });\\n    }\\n    if let Some(g) = act.gates.get(act.gate_i as usize) {\\n        if act.pz >= g[0] {\\n            if (act.px - g[1]).abs() > 0.7 {\\n                act.missed += 1;\\n            }\\n            act.gate_i += 1;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    let finished = act.pz >= 56.0 || act.t >= rules.paddle_secs;\\n    if finished {\\n        let mut t = if act.pz >= 56.0 { act.t } else { rules.paddle_secs };\\n        t += act.missed as f32 * 2.0;\\n        let par = rules.paddle_par;\\n        let raw = (1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par);\\n        act.score = (raw.clamp(0.0, 1.0) * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_tray(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let mut jolt = 0.0;\\n    for s in &act.jolts {\\n        let d = act.t - s[0];\\n        if d > 0.0 && d < 0.35 {\\n            jolt += s[1] * (1.0 - d / 0.35);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let tilt = bal.cob.x + jolt * 0.15;\\n    for i in 0..5 {\\n        if !act.glass_ok[i] {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        act.glasses[i] += tilt * dt * 1.3;\\n        if act.glasses[i].abs() > 1.0 {\\n            act.glass_ok[i] = false;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 19, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    act.pz = act.t;\\n    if act.t >= rules.tray_secs {\\n        let kept = act.glass_ok.iter().filter(|g| **g).count() as f32;\\n        let bonus = if kept == 5.0 { 0.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n        act.score = (kept * 200.0 + bonus).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_cannon(act: &mut Activity, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let _ = rules;\\n    if !act.leaping {\\n        let phase = act.t / 1.2;\\n        let s = (phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n        let prev = ((act.t - dt) / 1.2 * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();\\n        let bottom = s < -0.9 && s > prev;\\n        if bottom && pressed & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 && act.power < 4.0 {\\n            act.power += 1.0;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 14, gain: 0.6, pitch: 0.8 + act.power * 0.1 });\\n            if act.power >= 4.0 {\\n                act.leaping = true;\\n                act.air = 0.0;\\n                act.tuck = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        act.air += dt;\\n        if held & buttons::CONFIRM != 0 {\\n            act.tuck = (act.tuck + dt / 0.4).min(1.0);\\n        }\\n        act.px += lean.x * dt;\\n        let height = (act.air * 3.0).sin().max(0.0) * act.power * 0.25;\\n        if act.air > 0.55 && height < 0.15 {\\n            let timing = (1.0 - (act.air - 0.7).abs()).clamp(0.2, 1.0);\\n            let sc = (height * 4.0).clamp(0.2, 1.0) * act.tuck.clamp(0.2, 1.0) * timing * rules.bounce_gain;\\n            act.dive_scores.push(sc.clamp(0.0, 1.0));\\n            act.dives += 1;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::BigSplash { pos: glam::Vec3::new(act.px, 0.0, 2.0), size: 1.2 + act.tuck });\\n            act.leaping = false;\\n            act.power = 0.0;\\n            act.air = 0.0;\\n            act.tuck = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.t += dt;\\n    if act.dives >= 3 || act.t >= rules.cannon_secs {\\n        let n = 3.0;\\n        let sum: f32 = act.dive_scores.iter().sum();\\n        act.score = (sum / n * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n        act.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_big(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let _ = lean;\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            let before = act.t;\\n            tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, true);\\n            act.t = before + dt;\\n            if act.t >= 32.0 {\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.acc = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            let c = ring_center(act.sub);\\n            let inside = (bal.cob - c).length() < 0.28;\\n            if inside {\\n                act.acc += dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\\n                act.phase = 2;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.acc = 0.0;\\n                act.note_i = 0;\\n                // Use the first notes, time-shifted into this phase by rewriting a local clock.\\n                act.t_shift_notes();\\n            }\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            let local_pressed = pressed;\\n            let start_t = act.t;\\n            // tick_step uses act.t against note times. Notes were shifted.\\n            let saved_dur = rules.step_secs;\\n            let _ = saved_dur;\\n            tick_step_window(act, local_pressed, dt, rules, 40.0);\\n            if act.t - start_t < dt * 0.5 {\\n                act.t = start_t + dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 40.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push(act.score);\\n                act.phase = 3;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n                act.flopped = false;\\n                act.survived = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            if braced(held) && bal.cob.length() < 0.45 {\\n                act.acc += dt;\\n            }\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 20.0 {\\n                act.phase_scores.push((act.acc / 20.0 * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0));\\n                act.phase = 4;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.still_sum = 0.0;\\n                act.still_n = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            if act.sub >= 15.0 && pressed != 0 {\\n                act.forfeit = true;\\n            }\\n            act.still_sum += bal.cob.length() * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            act.t += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 30.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                let quiet = (1.0 - mean / 0.2).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                let mut s = quiet * 1000.0;\\n                if !act.forfeit {\\n                    s = (s + 200.0).min(1000.0);\\n                } else {\\n                    s *= 0.5;\\n                }\\n                act.phase_scores.push(s);\\n                let n = act.phase_scores.len().max(1) as f32;\\n                let sum: f32 = act.phase_scores.iter().copied().sum();\\n                act.score = (sum / n).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n                // Tips cost score but never end the run.\\n                act.score = (act.score - act.tips as f32 * 15.0).max(0.0);\\n                act.done = true;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Activity {\\n    fn t_shift_notes(&mut self) {\\n        if self.notes.is_empty() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let t0 = self.notes[0][0];\\n        for n in &mut self.notes {\\n            n[0] = self.t + (n[0] - t0);\\n        }\\n        self.note_i = 0;\\n        self.acc = 0.0;\\n        self.hits = 0;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_step_window(act: &mut Activity, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, window: f32) {\\n    let total = act.notes.len().max(1) as f32;\\n    let t0 = act.t;\\n    tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules);\\n    // tick_step may mark done at step_secs. The finale uses its own clock.\\n    if act.done && act.kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n        act.done = false;\\n        act.score = (act.acc / total * 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1000.0);\\n    }\\n    if act.t < t0 + dt * 0.5 {\\n        act.t = t0 + dt;\\n    }\\n    let _ = window;\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"082b0d7e-8e9c-432f-a98b-16d57d1aa74e"}
