-1.6 };\\n                a.jolts.push([t, mag]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n330→        a\\n    }\\n\\n    fn setup_board(&mut self, board: u8, rng: &mut Rng) {\\n        self.board = board;\\n        self.sub = 0.0;\\n        self.shells.clear();\\n        self.pools.clear();\\n        let n = [3, 5, 7][board as usize];\\n        self.pools.push([0.0, 1.6]);\\n340→        if board >= 1 {\\n            self.pools.push([1.2, -0.4]);\\n        }\\n        if board >= 2 {\\n            self.pools.push([-1.3, 0.2]);\\n        }\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            let ang = i as f32 * 1.7 + rng.range(0.0, 0.4);\\n            self.shells.push(Shell {\\n                x: ang.cos() * 1.5,\\n350→                z: ang.sin() * 1.1 - 0.2,\\n                vx: 0.0,\\n                vz: 0.0,\\n                pot: false,\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn load_notes() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":160,\"raw_output\":\"    pub tuck: f32,\\n    pub dive_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub leaping: bool,\\n    pub forfeit: bool,\\n    pub still_sum: f32,\\n    pub still_n: f32,\\n    pub metrics: [f32; 4],\\n    pub target_i: u8,\\n    pub hold: f32,\\n    pub target_time: f32,\\n    pub targets_hit: u8,\\n    pub step_hit: u8,\\n    pub nudged: bool,\\n    pub tips: u32,\\n    pub lock: f32,\\n    pub samples: Vec<GhostSample>,\\n    pub phase_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    pub gag: bool,\\n    pub guide: f32,\\n    pub amp_scale: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Activity {\\n    pub fn start(kind: EventId, rules: &Rules, rng: &mut Rng) -> Self {\\n        let dur = match kind {\\n            EventId::Check => 8.0 + 15.0 + 6.0 + 8.0 * 0.6,\\n            EventId::Breath => rules.breath_secs,\\n            EventId::Pose => rules.pose_secs * 3.0,\\n            EventId::