k (NPCs); None = the shared puppet settings.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub puppet: Option<std::sync::Arc<PuppetDef>>,\\n    /// Creature feet, tails and antennae.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub rig: Option<Box<crate::rig::Rig>>,\\n    /// Mass (kg) of the props being pushed, smoothed: heavy things slow the character down.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub push_load: f32,\\n    /// The vehicle this character is driving (seated, hidden, not colliding).\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub riding: Option<EntityId>,\\n    /// Game control (Shardfall): how much the character's own movement is held back (0 = free,\\n    /// 1 = rooted, e.g. while swinging), extra speed (0.2 = 20% faster), a facing to hold, and a\\n    /// dash (velocity and seconds left; `dash_roll` tumbles like a dodge roll).\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub slow: f32,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub haste: f32,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub face: Option<f32>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub dash_vel: Vec3,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub dash_time: f32,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub dash_roll: bool,\\n    /// Footing (0 = sure-footed, towards 1 = ice): how slowly the ground velocity follows the\\n\",\"total_lines\":1281}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"495cdd96-d324-4ccf-a47c-aff6d842ef0d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_140","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"PuppetState is located on character.anim.\n\nTilt will be set in post via the player's character animation. Frozen pause skips post, so tilt won't update during freeze. Now writing mod.rs with careful compilation checks. The Game trait needs Clone and Serialize and DeserializeOwned. FitGame fields must be public for tests using get_mut. Status JSON fields are also being reviewed.\n\nAll status fields are now listed for the JSON output. A SaveFile struct will handle save round-trips via serde_json or ciborium. FitGame will expose `export_save` and `import_save` methods.\n\nA test will mutate day, stars, and name, then serialize and deserialize the game to verify restoration. SimState snapshots should round-trip automatically because GameBox implements serialization. All fields must be serde-friendly; script text will use OnceLock to avoid serialization. The Settings struct includes music, sfx, voice, xbox, sensitivity, wobble_assist, rhythm_offset, text_speed, and fullscreen.\n\nMusic defaults to 0.10 and is exposed as status.music. Pause freezes the world and opens Dev Mode with resume, sliders, reset, and jump controls. Dev, Pause, and menus all keep frozen() true. Slider events map to parameter indices and update via params::set; reset copies Rules::default(). Attract mode activates after 600 idle ticks on title and pre-game menus, playing a playlist; any input returns to title without saving.\n\nTouch input will not exit attract mode. The exit condition will ignore device 4 while still allowing pad, key, and mouse presses to return to title. A touch-only card will appear when device 4 is detected without other input devices. The settings item will be tappable via UiEvent::Click.\n\nHub mode starts a rest medley with hub_mode true and skip_title set. Hub input 1 sets hub_wait and freezes the world; input 2 or HUB_GO clears it. Tests never set hub, so the medley begins immediately. In hub mode, pause does not freeze the world; the menu shows only Resume and Settings. Direct events like rest \"event/breath\" are also handled.\n\nFlow begins at Card with auto 1.0, then a countdown, then the event. The countdown lasts three seconds. Time scale multiplies delta time in pre and post phases; tests may set it to speed up. The bot fast-travels on the schedule screen by focusing the next unplayed event and confirming without pathfinding. Star banking gives one star plus the star count for the first event of the day, otherwise one. Day goals are [3,5,7,9].\n\nSleep triggers when all daily events are played and minutes meet the goal. Stamps increase by one on sleep. Day five has no minute goal; Big Stand ends with an age-based outcome. Age derives from morning skill, days completed, and total stars via balance_age. A sample calculation with skill 0.8, four days, and twenty-four stars yields an age of about eighteen.\n\nA low skill of 0.5 still yields an age around thirty-four, so the bot check must be high. Events are marked played on result. Credits trigger a \"Won\" outcome. After credits, free play unlocks all events on the island. Yesterday You appears from day three onward and samples ghosts from the best run of the matching area; it does not affect score. Ghost data will be stored per event.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1962583c-81d8-4b89-9ae5-3c288a4df7a0-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":340,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1962583c-81d8-4b89-9ae5-3c288a4df7a0-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1962583c-81d8-4b89-9ae5-3c288a4df7a0-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"game_keys_name_one_scene","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1509,"output_tokens":1899,"cache_read_input_tokens":78464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"269d0edf-80f5-42a9-b06d-f9b099a5075f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1962583c-81d8-4b89-9ae5-3c288a4df7a0-31","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"340→        if !self.replaying {\\n            self.events.push(SimEvent::Spawned { id, pos: s.pos });\\n        }\\n        id\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Creates a character (kinematic capsule + puppet) standing at `feet`.\\n    pub fn spawn_character(&mut self, name: &str, feet: Vec3) -> EntityId {\\n        let id = self.state.entities.alloc_id();\\n        let ch = Character::new();\\n350→        let center = feet + Vec3::Y * (ch.height() * 0.5 + character::PLACE_LIFT);\\n        let b = self.character_body(id, center, ch.posture);\\n        self.state.entities.map.insert(\\n            id,\\n            Entity {\\n                id,\\n                name: name.to_string(),\\n                pos: center,\\n                rot: Quat::IDENTITY,\\n                body_kind: BodyKind::Kinematic,\\n360→                body: Some(b),\\n                visual: None,\\n                prop: None,\\n                behavior: Behavior::None,\\n                character: Some(Box::new(ch)),\\n                bomb: None,\\n                lifetime: None,\\n                region: None,\\n                material: Default::default(),\\n                hazard: None,\\n370→                soft: None,\\n                joints: Vec::new(),\\n                ai: None,\\n                vehicle: None,\\n                health: None,\\n            },\\n        );\\n        id\\n    }\\n\\n380→    /// Creates a non-player character with its own look and (optionally) a brain.\\n    pub fn spawn_npc(\\n        &mut self,\\n        name: &str,\\n        feet: Vec3,\\n        facing: f32,\\n        def: PuppetDef,\\n        ai: Option<crate::ai::Ai>,\\n        region: Option<crate::statics::RegionKey>,\\n    ) -> EntityId {\\n390→        let id = self.spawn_character(name, feet);\\n        if let Some(e) = self.state.entities.get_mut(id) {\\n            e.region = region;\\n            e.ai = ai.map(Box::new);\\n            if let Some(ch) = &mut e.character {\\n                ch.facing = facing;\\n                ch.anim.facing = facing;\\n                ch.puppet = Some(std::sync::Arc::new(def));\\n            }\\n        }\\n400→        id\\n    }\\n\\n    /// A character's kinematic capsule (when it is created or wakes up).\\n    pub(crate) fn character_body(&mut self, id: EntityId, center: Vec3, posture: character::Posture) -> RigidBodyHandle {\\n        let body = RigidBodyBuilder::kinematic_position_based().translation(center);\\n        let collider =\\n            ColliderBuilder::capsule_y(posture.half_height() as Real, RADIUS as Real).friction(0.0).user_data(entity_tag(id.0));\\n        self.state.physics.insert(body, collider).0\\n    }\\n410→\\n    /// Spawns the player at the scene's spawn point and makes the camera follow it.\\n    pub fn spawn_player(&mut self) -> EntityId {\\n        let id = self.spawn_character(\\\"player\\\", self.state.spawn);\\n        self.state.player = Some(id);\\n        id\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Where an entity stands: a character's feet (its `pos` is the capsule's centre), else\\n    /// its position.\\n420→    pub fn feet(&self, id: EntityId) -> Option<Vec3> {\\n        let e = self.state.entities.get(id)?;\\n        Some(match &e.character {\\n            Some(c) => e.pos - Vec3::Y * c.height() * 0.5,\\n            None => e.pos,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn player(&self) -> Option<&Entity> {\\n        self.state.player.and_then(|id| self.state.entities.get(id))\\n430→    }\\n\\n    pub fn despawn(&mut self, id: EntityId) -> bool {\\n        match self.state.entities.map.remove(&id) {\\n            Some(e) => {\\n                if e.prop.is_some() {\\n                    self.invalidate_prop_navigation();\\n                }\\n                if let Some(b) = e.body {\\n                    self.state.physics.remove_body(b);\",\"content_concise\":\"340→        if !self.replaying {\\n            self.events.push(SimEvent::Spawned { id, pos: s.pos });\\n        }\\n        id\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Creates a character (kinematic capsule + puppet) standing at `feet`.\\n    pub fn spawn_character(&mut self, name: &str, feet: Vec3) -> EntityId {\\n        let id = self.state.entities.alloc_id();\\n        let ch = Character::new();\\n350→        let center = feet + Vec3::Y * (ch.height() * 0.5 + character::PLACE_LIFT);\\n        let b = self.character_body(id, center, ch.posture);\\n        self.state.entities.map.insert(\\n            id,\\n            Entity {\\n                id,\\n                name: name.to_string(),\\n                pos: center,\\n                rot: Quat::IDENTITY,\\n                body_kind: BodyKind::Kinematic,\\n360→                body: Some(b),\\n                visual: None,\\n                prop: None,\\n                behavior: Behavior::None,\\n                character: Some(Box::new(ch)),\\n                bomb: None,\\n                lifetime: None,\\n                region: None,\\n                material: Default::default(),\\n                hazard: None,\\n370→                soft: None,\\n                joints: Vec::new(),\\n                ai: None,\\n                vehicle: None,\\n                health: None,\\n            },\\n        );\\n        id\\n    }\\n\\n380→    /// Creates a non-player character with its own look and (optionally) a brain.\\n    pub fn spawn_npc(\\n        &mut self,\\n        name: &str,\\n        feet: Vec3,\\n        facing: f32,\\n        def: PuppetDef,\\n        ai: Option<crate::ai::Ai>,\\n        region: Option<crate::statics::RegionKey>,\\n    ) -> EntityId {\\n390→        let id = self.spawn_character(name, feet);\\n        if let Some(e) = self.state.entities.get_mut(id) {\\n            e.region = region;\\n            e.ai = ai.map(Box::new);\\n            if let Some(ch) = &