32,112,117,98,32,102,110,32,115,116,97,116,101,95,104,97,115,104,40,38,115,101,108,102,41,32,45,62,32,117,54,52,32,123,10,49,49,57,48,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,108,101,116,32,95,32,61,32,99,105,98,111,114,105,117,109,58,58,105,110,116,111,95,119,114,105,116,101,114,40,118,97,108,117,101,44,32,38,109,117,116,32,42,115,101,108,102,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":5,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":247,\"content\":\"    pub fn snapshot(&self) -> SimState {\"},{\"line_number\":887,\"content\":\"        ciborium::into_writer(&self.snapshot(), &mut bytes).context(\\\"serializing state\\\")?;\"},{\"line_number\":896,\"content\":\"        let state: SimState = ciborium::from_reader(&bytes[..]).context(\\\"snapshot file is invalid or from another version\\\")?;\"},{\"line_number\":1132,\"content\":\"    pub fn state_hash(&self) -> u64 {\"},{\"line_number\":1190,\"content\":\"        let _ = ciborium::into_writer(value, &mut *self);\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"6ae138ad-9b90-43e0-961a-d56b1d3f4564"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_144","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Save round-trip can use simulation.\n\nImplementing JSON save and restore alongside snapshot support. FitGame must be serializable. GameBox serialization needs verification. New fields will use `#[serde(default)]`. No old snapshots exist. Script OnceLock can be deferred.\n\nSlider IDs map to rule paths for immediate parameter updates. DEV_RESET resets rules to default. Dev jump buttons teleport to specific events. Time scale slider uses ID 59 and reset uses ID 60. Tests will inject UiEvent::Slider.\n\nWriting an `apply_ui` method to handle slider events. Slider IDs starting at 300 map to parameter indices via `params::list`. The UI sends raw values, so the code must decide whether to map them from 0..1 or use them directly.\n\nSlider values are normalized 0..1 across each parameter's range. Tests will inject UiEvent::Slider with these normalized values, and reset restores defaults.\n\nTests will verify stiffness reaches 80 at maximum slider and resets to 40. Music volume defaults to 0.10. The attract mode test runs 599 idle steps, then triggers demo mode, exits via confirm, and checks the save serial remains unchanged.\n\nIdle ticks increment at the start of each pre-step. The 600th idle tick triggers attract mode. Exiting attract without saving leaves save_serial at zero. Pause freezes world time and records player position.\n\nA pause test will walk the player on the island, pause, and confirm both world time and position remain frozen. A content lint test will scan source files for forbidden terms like TODO, Nintendo, or BMI. Game text must avoid those words except in the About source line, and no TODO comments should be written.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b6e030ff-b7af-4ae4-822e-f1a425faa187-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"MAX_RECORDING_TICKS","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b6e030ff-b7af-4ae4-822e-f1a425faa187-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/params.rs","offset":1,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3332,"output_tokens":1350,"cache_read_input_tokens":86400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"2f98789d-be68-435d-b811-b6e7102c4658"}
