{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_151","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The run_bot function halts when the outcome is Won.\n\nThe bot will stop once credits start. The test budget is 3600 seconds of non-frozen play. All five stamps should be used.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77450fb2-c3b2-4aee-81e1-8e4408585407-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":238,"limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":688,"output_tokens":384,"cache_read_input_tokens":103424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"fb277cf5-f141-4e8c-b32f-28046857268b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-77450fb2-c3b2-4aee-81e1-8e4408585407-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"238→    pub fn dt(&self) -> f32 {\\n        1.0 / self.config.tick_rate.hz() as f32\\n240→    }\\n\\n    pub fn time(&self) -> f64 {\\n        self.state.tick as f64 * self.dt() as f64\\n    }\\n\\n    /// The state, carrying exactly the prop definitions its placed copies use.\\n    pub fn snapshot(&self) -> SimState {\\n        let mut state = self.state.clone();\\n        state.rebuild_prop_defs();\\n250→        state\\n    }\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"238→    pub fn dt(&self) -> f32 {\\n        1.0 / self.config.tick_rate.hz() as f32\\n240→    }\\n\\n    pub fn time(&self) -> f64 {\\n        self.state.tick as f64 * self.dt() as f64\\n    }\\n\\n    /// The state, carrying exactly the prop definitions its placed copies use.\\n    pub fn snapshot(&self) -> SimState {\\n        let mut state = self.state.clone();\\n        state.rebuild_prop_defs();\\n250→        state\\n    }\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs\",\"offset\":238,\"limit\":15,\"raw_output\":\"    pub fn dt(&self) -> f32 {\\n        1.0 / self.config.tick_rate.hz() as f32\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn time(&self) -> f64 {\\n        self.state.tick as f64 * self.dt() as f64\\n    }\\n\\n    /// The state, carrying exactly the prop definitions its placed copies use.\\n    pub fn snapshot(&self) -> SimState {\\n        let mut state = self.state.clone();\\n        state.rebuild_prop_defs();\\n        state\\n    }\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":1210}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"2e69af4b-73b8-4f08-9285-0c973b23f1f7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_152","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tick increments continue even when frozen.\n\n60 minutes equals 216,000 ticks. Title menus add only a few ticks; events are the bulk. Tests will disable history recording by setting `history_seconds` to zero before the loop. This avoids cloning `FitGame` on every snapshot when history is off. Now writing `mod.rs`.\n\nScript content will include 40 names, six skin colors, and eight outfits. Each look is stored as an index pair.\n\nA `line(speaker, key, i)` helper will generate dialogue vectors. The script will be written as a real `script.toml` file with varied pip lines instead of placeholders. Tests can verify the file contains enough content by reading it directly.\n\nTwelve conversation topics will guide the script content. Roughly eighty unique short sentences will be generated programmatically, yielding about two hundred fifty lines of text. A Python script will write both `script.toml` and `charts.toml`, while `mod.rs` is written directly with care for its length.\n\nBody tilt is set to the center of mass multiplied by fourteen degrees. Camera yaw will increase with time during lap events.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5cf7e1a4-5c4d-4e4f-82bf-371f23a72317-51","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hud.fit|fit_ui|camera_yaw","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":559,"output_tokens":990,"cache_read_input_tokens":104064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"eee9f82e-f75c-424d-807c-4a66863274fd"}
