{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_154","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Status is confirmed as a JSON string.\n\nUsing play().status() directly avoids parsing HUD status. Game::status and fit_ui both take &self, so slider changes will be handled in pre from stored input rather than inside fit_ui.\n\nMenu state updates in pre. post ticks activity and transitions to Result when done. Card timers run in pre because frozen menus prevent post from running. Card flow counts up to 1 second then switches to Countdown. Countdown counts down to 3 seconds then resolves to Check or Event.\n\nBoth Check and Event activities will use Flow::Event. The phase field in status will indicate the screen flow. Morning check starts with begin(EventId::Check) and flow set to Card. After the card timer finishes, the flow resolves to Check if the activity kind is Check, otherwise to Event.\n\npost ticks the demo activity inside Flow::Attract without banking score. A 12-segment attract sequence loops through island, cannon, paddle, step, pose, tide, floatie, tray, plank, lap, bigstand, and title card. Each segment lasts 8 to 15 seconds. Event segments begin their activity while keeping the flow on Attract.\n\nAttract segments without activities will tick in post without calling finish_event. Island and title card segments have no activity. Exiting attract returns to Title with an unchanged save_serial and no outcome set. The demo flag is active whenever flow equals Attract. Music will be controlled by a song id field that emits Music events on change; tests only verify the settings value, not the actual song. A Slot struct is being designed to track used slots, names, and looks.\n\nThe Slot struct will hold skin, outfit, day, minutes today, total stars, stamps, bests, ages, flips, played events, ghosts, days completed, age, free play, and ending state. Progress will live on FitGame directly and be mirrored into a slots array on save. On continue, the selected slot will be copied back into the active fields.\n\nA `touch_save` method will increment the save serial and store the current slot whenever the game is not in demo mode. The save format will be a JSON `SaveFile` containing version, slots, settings, last day, and serial. Live progress such as day, minutes, and today's bests will be included so mid-day continues work correctly.\n\n`today_played` resets each morning. `ever_played` tracks every event including check and big stand for the \"every event\" test. Total stars sum banked earnings and feed into the age formula. Day minutes are stored in `day_minutes`. Goals are `[3,5,7,9,0]` per day. Age displays on reveal. Rowboat ending for age 40 or below; extended otherwise. Both lead to the ending screen and credits.\n\nAge will initialize to 80 before the first morning check so the extended ending is reachable even if the check is skipped. The ending choice is automatic based on age, not a menu. Both endings exist, and a dev-mode cheat could force the extended path for test coverage.\n\nA unit test will cover the ending picker function. After credits, pressing confirm returns to Island with free play enabled and all events scheduled. The How To screen is added to the title menu. Settings items include music, sfx, voices, glyphs toggle, sensitivity, wobble, rhythm, text, fullscreen, and reset save; sliders use ids above 600, the glyphs toggle is a button, and resetting save requires two confirmations.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-26149ef0-923a-4643-ae97-de2438de4cde-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct EntityId","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/entity.rs","-A":5}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":856,"output_tokens":1922,"cache_read_input_tokens":105728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a12374ef-5735-479e-9175-391a346159a0"}
