{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1a0f6908-c1a9-43a8-89db-f13cf7997e20-69","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n210→    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n220→        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n230→        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\n240→pub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\",\"content_concise\":\"200→        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n210→    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n220→        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n230→        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\n240→pub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":45,\"raw_output\":\"        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\npub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\\n\",\"total_lines\":333}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cc81ec98-7a33-4536-84f7-43561a5577ce"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_168","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Song 0 stops. Songs 1 through 7 will be used.\n\nWriting script.toml, charts.toml, rules.toml, hub.toml, and Rust files. Focus will clamp to valid indices when items shrink. The dev screen will use Resume, Reset, and fewer sliders.\n\nDev screen items will be Resume, Reset, and four slider readouts. Slider values appear in item labels. TAB switches pages. Settings will include music, sfx, voice, xbox glyphs, sensitivity, wobble, rhythm, and text sliders.\n\nSettings will be split into two pages of six items each. The first page covers Music, Sfx, Voices, Glyphs, Sensitivity, and Back. The second page covers Wobble, Rhythm, Text, Fullscreen, Reset save, and Back. The glyph toggle flips the Xbox setting. Fullscreen toggles a boolean flag. Reset save requires a second click to clear slots. A lean sensitivity slider will affect last_lean.\n\nSettings, Slot, Flow, and Run will all derive serde. The Run enum covers Story, Medley, Together, Direct, and Demo. Entering attract mode saves the current run and switches to Demo; exiting restores the saved run or falls back to Story. Direct events will not trigger attract mode.\n\nHub medley will trigger immediately without a pregame menu. Attract mode will be suppressed when hub_mode is active. The Python generator and Rust files will be split into smaller helpers to avoid one large function. Public visibility is confirmed for ParamKind, set, and list. All Game trait methods are implemented. The outcome method returns the stored outcome. The hud method returns a few short lines for the engine HUD.\n\nThe hud method will return an empty vector so engine text does not appear in captures until the fit UI hides it. A tint method is being added to render the ghost entity with a blueish tint.\n\nA `maybe_ghost` helper spawns a ghost NPC in story mode on day three or later. It despawns any existing ghost first, checks that the area has a registered ghost event, and spawns an NPC named \"yesterday\" at a small offset from the spawn point.\n\nThe ghost helper stores the new NPC id in `self.ghost_id`. Ghosts are saved on every best, so day-three events can match ghosts from earlier days. Each event has a unique area index, meaning \"area-matched\" refers to the same event rather than a group.\n\nGhost matching will use event keys rather than area indices. A `zone` method is being added to group events into resort areas such as studio, deck, and lagoon.\n\nThe zone method maps events to resort areas: studio for Breath through Step and Check, path for Lap and Tray, and lagoon for Floatie, Tide, Paddle, and Cannon. Yesterday ghosts will appear only if any ghost sample exists in the same zone. The visual ghost stands beside the player without affecting score. A README for adding new events will be added later, and PROGRESS.md will be updated after compilation.\n\nPuppetDef is imported from crate::puppet. The extra ghost body adds negligible performance cost. Ghost spawning uses no random number generation, so it does not affect determinism. Medley mode correctly skips ghost spawning.\n\nFitGame will derive Clone and Default. Slot needs Default for the four-slot array, so FitGame gets a manual Default implementation. Activity is Clone. The large derive on FitGame may slow compilation slightly.\n\nOptional fields will be omitted if they cause issues. Strings in the hot path are acceptable. Rules.toml will provide Default values so edits load correctly, but tests expect the plan's numbers; if parsing fails, the code falls back to Default. The file must include squat_reps = 10 to avoid float-to-int type mismatches. Charts.toml follows the same loading pattern.\n\nThe script.toml path resolves correctly to `crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.toml`. A Rust parser will be written to parse and cache the script data. The plan requires keeping dialogue in TOML files rather than embedding it directly in Rust.\n\nThe script parser will deserialize TOML into a `Raw` struct with default empty vectors for names, titles, skins, outfits, and lines. Each line is a table with speaker, tag, and text fields. A test in `pav_core/tests` will verify line counts via a public `script::counts()` function.\n\nA public `script_stats()` function will expose line counts for the external integration test. Cargo integration tests run with the crate package directory as their working directory, so relative paths to the TOML files resolve correctly.\n\nThe integration test will read the fit module source directly via `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR` to scan for text and verify the about string, rather than relying on runtime file paths.\n\nThe lint scanner will skip lines containing \"Source:\" and ban the words \"placeholder\", \"TODO\", \"diet\", \"BMI\", and \"weight\". The about string will reference the resort spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo, but only in that specific line.\n\nThe word \"calories\" is also banned. Balance tests will be appended to core.rs and a small test added to intent.rs. The integration test will be written immediately after compilation succeeds, so the first cargo test run can catch logic errors early. A long-running skill check will be done in parallel with writing.\n\nThe skill check will be read when cargo starts. TOML files will be written with a shell script and Rust code with the Write tool, keeping mod.rs compact. Movement simulation will be configured so space input is irrelevant because island movement replaces player input. During pregame, `sim.state.play` is None, so `play_pre` cannot call `sim.play()` directly; it will use `self` instead.\n\n`spawn_npc` and `post` do not need mutable access to the game or simulation. `fit_ui` and `status` borrow `&self`, so they can safely call `screen_items`. The `post` method applies tilt, scales delta time, and branches on flow to tick play.\n\nThe `post` method branches on flow: `Attract` calls `tick_attract`, `Island` advances world time and picks flops, and other flows do nothing. In `tick_play`, the code borrows `self.act` mutably, so it cannot call `finish` while that borrow is active. The method will be restructured to avoid this borrow conflict by reading `scaled_rules()` and `last_lean` first.\n\nThe borrow conflict in `tick_play` is resolved by reading `last_held`, `last_pressed`, and `done` before mutably borrowing `self.act`. `finish_play` is called only after that borrow ends. `scaled_rules` clones the rules and applies wobble assist. The attract tick advances the demo without finishing play or adding world time. `pick_flops` uses `last_pressed`.\n\nWorld time will advance inside `tick_play` for non-demo runs, using unscaled simulation delta time to prevent the 60-minute budget from inflating. Check events count toward this total. Island time is negligible. A potential borrow conflict between `scaled_rules()` and `self.act.as_mut()` is noted, though `scaled_rules()` only reads immutable fields.\n\nThe borrow conflict in `tick_play` is resolved by taking the activity out of `self.act` with `.take()`. This avoids borrowing both `self.act` and `self.bal` mutably at once.\n\nThe same `.take()` pattern will be applied to the attract tick to avoid borrow conflicts. A `sync_song` helper is being added to pregame to update the background music when the desired song changes.\n\n`desired_song` maps each game state to a specific background track: lobby, event pads, step, big stand, lap, credits, and attract. Song 0 stops music; 1 is the default so playback starts immediately. A `speaker_id` helper will map dialogue names to speaker IDs for syllable events. The implementation is ready to be written.\n\nA `notes/decisions.md` file will be added to the dev folder. A brief PROGRESS.md will be written immediately so the hand-in folder reflects current status. The script module will stay private with public functions re-exported where needed. A `content_line_counts` function will return line counts for tests, and a `script_report` method on the game module will expose it.\n\nThe public `script_line_count` function will be exported from the fit module. The `TITLE` constant will be placed in `mod.rs`. The implementation will be written via the Write tool, with a fallback to splitting into `stay.rs` if it grows too large. Unit tests for balance will also be added to `core.rs`.\n\n`Flow` will default to `Title` in `paused_from` to avoid initialization issues. `FitGame` will derive `Serialize` and `Deserialize`, and no fields will be skipped. An `idle: u32` field will be added. The code will stay in a single file rather than splitting into `stay.rs`.\n\nFlip flop positions will be stored as a Vec rather than an array to simplify serde. A `golden_shoes` boolean flag is also being added. The shell script for data files and the Rust source write will run in parallel. Coach dialogue sentences will be generated programmatically from indexed templates with real variety instead of placeholder text.\n\nCoach dialogue will total 100 short sentences, split into 25 per coach in the Python script. Pip's lines will cover resort life, balance, guests, and encouragement without mentioning weight. Marjorie, Tom, and the Twins each get about eight lines.\n\nThirty-two titles and forty names are planned. Six skins and eight outfits will be defined. The about text will live in Rust constants to avoid banned content. A brief honest feedback note will be added now and expanded later.\n\nThe about text will avoid the word \"weight\" entirely to prevent linting issues, using alternatives like \"scales\" and \"meal plans\" instead. The Source line referencing Nintendo and Wii is permitted by the lint rules.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The stay has to live in the simulation so tests can drive it. I’m adding that loop and the data files next."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-70","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs","old_string":"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\n        3\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\n        2\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\n        1\n    } else {\n        0\n    }\n}","new_string":"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\n        3\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\n        2\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\n        1\n    } else {\n        0\n    }\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn full_lean_settles_inside_the_disc() {\n        let rules = Rules::default();\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\n        b.kicks = false;\n        b.amp = 0.0;\n        let lean = Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0);\n        let mut peak = 0.0_f32;\n        for _ in 0..180 {\n            b.step_clean(lean, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n            peak = peak.max(b.cob.length());\n        }\n        assert!(peak < 1.0, \"peak {peak}\");\n        assert!(b.cob.x > 0.85, \"settled at {}\", b.cob.x);\n        assert!(!b.tipped);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\n        let rules = Rules::default();\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\n        b.kicks = false;\n        b.amp = 0.0;\n        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\n        let mut tipped = false;\n        for _ in 0..120 {\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n            tipped |= b.tipped;\n        }\n        assert!(tipped, \"gust should tip within 2s\");\n        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\n        for _ in 0..180 {\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n        }\n        assert!(b.cob.length() < 0.2, \"returned to {}\", b.cob);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn age_moves_the_right_way_and_stays_in_range() {\n        let young = balance_age(1.0, 4, 30);\n        let older = balance_age(0.0, 0, 0);\n        assert!(young < older);\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&young));\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&older));\n        assert_eq!(balance_age(1.0, 0, 0), 24);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(399.0), 0);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(400.0), 1);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(650.0), 2);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(850.0), 3);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(24.0), 0);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(25.0), 1);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(40.0), 2);\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(55.0), 3);\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs","old_string":"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\n}","new_string":"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn stick_deadzone_and_curve() {\n        assert_eq!(shape_stick(0.1, 0.12, 1.5), 0.0);\n        let v = shape_stick(1.0, 0.12, 1.5);\n        assert!((v - 1.0).abs() < 1e-4);\n        let mid = shape_stick(0.5, 0.12, 1.5);\n        assert!(mid > 0.0 && mid < 0.5);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn keys_ramp_and_mouse_clamps() {\n        let mut x = 0.0;\n        for _ in 0..60 {\n            x = key_ramp(x, 1.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\n        }\n        assert!(x > 0.9, \"{x}\");\n        x = key_ramp(x, 0.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\n        assert!(x < 1.0);\n        let m = mouse_lean(Vec2::new(10_000.0, 0.0), 1080.0);\n        assert!((m.length() - 1.0).abs() < 1e-3);\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-72","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit\")\n\n# charts: 100 notes, 96 BPM, quarters then eighths, lane 2 on every 11th\nnotes = []\nt = 1.0\ni = 0\nwhile len(notes) < 100 and t < 62.0:\n    lane = 2 if i % 11 == 10 else (i % 2)\n    notes.append((round(t, 4), lane))\n    t += 0.625 if i < 32 else 0.3125\n    i += 1\nlines = [\"# Step Party chart. 96 BPM. lane 0 left, 1 right, 2 both.\", \"\"]\nfor t, lane in notes:\n    lines.append(\"[[notes]]\")\n    lines.append(f\"t = {t}\")\n    lines.append(f\"lane = {lane}\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n(root / \"charts.toml\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines))\n\nrules = '''# Feel numbers for Tippy Cay. Reset restores these.\nstiffness = 40.0\ndamping = 8.5\nreach = 0.92\ntip_time = 0.35\nwobble = 0.12\nstick_curve = 1.5\nkey_rate = 1.6\nkey_return = 1.2\nbreath_secs = 45.0\npose_secs = 20.0\npose_ring = 0.30\nsquat_reps = 10\nplank_secs = 60.0\nstep_secs = 64.0\nfloatie_secs = 50.0\nspin_lo = 6.0\nspin_hi = 9.0\nspin_band_scale = 1.35\nlap_secs = 90.0\ntide_secs = 20.0\npaddle_secs = 45.0\npaddle_par = 28.0\ntray_secs = 50.0\ncannon_secs = 40.0\ngust = 18.0\nbounce_gain = 1.0\nbig_gust = 22.0\nrhythm_perfect = 0.055\nrhythm_good = 0.120\n'''\n(root / \"rules.toml\").write_text(rules)\n\nnames = [\"Avery\",\"Blair\",\"Casey\",\"Devon\",\"Eden\",\"Finley\",\"Gray\",\"Harper\",\"Indigo\",\"Jules\",\"Kai\",\"Lane\",\"Marlow\",\"Nico\",\"Oak\",\"Piper\",\"Quinn\",\"Reese\",\"Sage\",\"Tatum\",\"Umber\",\"Vesper\",\"Winter\",\"Yael\",\"Zephyr\",\"Ash\",\"Bay\",\"Cove\",\"Dell\",\"Echo\",\"Fern\",\"Glen\",\"Haze\",\"Isle\",\"Jory\",\"Kit\",\"Lark\",\"Moss\",\"Nell\",\"Orla\"]\ntitles = [\"Human Soup\",\"Acceptable Human\",\"Certified Lean-To\",\"Wobble Enthusiast\",\"Seasoned Tilter\",\"Stillness Intern\",\"Professional Standing Person\",\"Alarmingly Balanced\",\"Soft Architecture\",\"Temporary Tower\",\"Polite Collapse\",\"Almost a Statue\",\"Guest of Gravity\",\"Mildly Vertical\",\"The Lean Years\",\"Upright Citizen\",\"Foam and Fortune\",\"Unbothered\",\"Quiet Furniture\",\"Balance Curious\",\"Practised Sway\",\"Harbour of Knees\",\"Steady Enough\",\"The Long Blink\",\"Kind to the Floor\",\"Not a Statue Yet\",\"Vertical-ish\",\"Champion of Standing Around\",\"Inner Puddle\",\"Buoyant Citizen\",\"Resort-Grade Upright\",\"Golden Pause\"]\nskins = [\"Sand\",\"Seafoam\",\"Coral\",\"Dusk\",\"Foam\",\"Kelp\"]\noutfits = [\"Linen\",\"Rash Guard\",\"Resort Stripe\",\"Evening\",\"Coach\",\"Guest\",\"Swim\",\"Golden\"]\n\npip = [\n\"Welcome ashore. The mat remembers nothing yet.\",\"The deck is warm. You do not have to be.\",\"Hold the rail if you like. It does not judge.\",\n\"Morning. I saved you the shady side of the board.\",\"Breathe like the tide is a suggestion, not a boss.\",\"Your feet are doing a conversation. Let them finish.\",\n\"We measure balance here, and then we stop measuring.\",\"A tip is a comma. The stay continues.\",\"Stars are compliments. Minutes are the rent.\",\n\"The rowboat leaves when the week says you can stand in it.\",\"If the week is not finished with you, the hammock is.\",\n\"I am a small coach with a large belief in standing.\",\"Posey will ask you to pose. The pose can be ordinary.\",\n\"Kettle counts reps the way a kettle counts boils. Patiently, then suddenly.\",\n\"Bounce thinks every heartbeat is a party invitation.\",\"The Commodore has never been on time and never been wrong about water.\",\n\"Marjorie will hand you a tray. The tray has opinions.\",\"Tom is writing the brochure. He is on sentence one.\",\n\"The twins are sharing one pair of sunglasses and two plans.\",\"Flip-flops wander off. If you find five, the gold pair finds you.\",\n\"Yesterday you left a faint copy on the deck. It does not keep score.\",\n\"Close your eyes when I ask. I will keep mine open.\",\"The dot in the disc is your centre, not your worth.\",\n\"Lean is the whole verb. The island supplies the nouns.\",\"Guests come and go. The mat stays slightly damp.\",\n\"Stamp the day when the minutes are met, not when you are tired of me.\",\n\"I will not hurry the last half-minute. Stillness is the trick question.\",\n\"If a button says skip, it is a liar with a nice font.\",\"The gull is not a coach. The gull is a weather system.\",\n\"Tea is at four. Tea does not care about your personal best.\",\"The lagoon is a sports field that apologises in waves.\",\n\"Paddle as if the gates were polite. They are not.\",\"Shells want the pools. You are only the tide's assistant.\",\n\"A cannonball is a conversation with the surface. Tuck, then listen.\",\n\"Step on the beat the box believes in. It believes in ninety-six.\",\n\"Two steps a second is a walk, not a rescue.\",\"Ribbons are optional. Crabs are a footnote with claws.\",\n\"Spin the ring the way a slow record spins. Catch what they throw.\",\n\"Brace means both hands on the day. One hand is a nap.\",\n\"Down for two, up for one. The band is a small country. Stay in it.\",\n\"The ring will shrink. You may shrink your plans to match.\",\"Accept the bird. It has no ticket and excellent timing.\",\n\"In for four, out for four. The flower is a clock.\",\"If your lungs and the guide disagree, believe the slower one.\",\n\"I kept your name on a shell. Shells are the filing system.\",\"Four hammocks, four names, one very calm ledger.\",\n\"Play Together is one mat and a queue of brave people.\",\"Pass the pad like a relay baton made of plastic and trust.\",\n\"The medley is three water games and one shared seed of chaos.\",\n\"Dev mode is the broom closet. The sliders are labelled. Reset is a promise.\",\n\"Music sits low, like a band behind a hedge. You can invite it closer.\",\n\"Glyphs follow the last thing you touched. The mat does not play favourites.\",\n\"A keyboard leans the way a tide comes in. Release, and it goes home.\",\n\"The mouse is a long arm. The centre of the glass is neutral.\",\n\"Touch is for the settings card and nothing else. Bring a controller when you can.\",\n\"Attract mode is the island showing off. It saves nothing, not even a blush.\",\n\"Ten quiet seconds and the brochure plays itself. Any real input sends it away.\",\n\"I do not own a scale. I own a mat, a whistle, and office hours.\",\n\"Age here is a party trick with a formula. Lower is calmer, not smaller.\",\n\"Days open in order: still, strong, quick, then the lagoon.\",\n\"Day five is everything once, and then a long nothing. Do the nothing.\",\n\"Inner peace is a bonus, not a doorway. Pressing skips the bonus, not the stay.\",\n\"You can retry a game. You cannot retry a kindness. We only stock the first.\",\n\"Personal bests live in the slot with your name. They wave at Yesterday.\",\n\"If you were gone, I noticed. The pier kept your spot anyway.\",\n\"Free play means the schedule unlocks. The coaches still want to chat.\",\n\"Credits roll for the rowboat and for the extended hammock. Both are a finish.\",\n\"I will be here in the morning whether you check out or not.\",\n\"Stand on the disc. I will stand on the sentence.\",\"The pastel is intentional. The wobble is also intentional.\",\n\"When the dot hunts you, that is physics. When you hunt it, that is practice.\",\n\"A good rep sounds like a small bell. A bad rep sounds like me being kind.\",\n\"The tray holds five glasses. The pier holds a grudge.\",\"Judges at the pool brought cards. Their faces brought nothing.\",\n\"Big Kettle's plank is a dare with a soft landing. Tips cost time, not the week.\",\n\"Pose three is when the bird arrives. Pose four does not exist. Breathe.\",\n\"I counted your stamps. I did not count your sighs.\",\"The golden shoes are a rumour until the fifth flip-flop.\",\n\"Wave at a coach if you have a spare thumb. They live for it.\",\n\"Schedule is the map. The island is the long way, and it is allowed.\",\n\"End the day when the minutes say so. The sunset is not on the payroll.\",\n\"You are doing a rare sport called remaining upright near water.\",\n\"That is the whole lesson. The rest is company.\",\n]\nassert len(pip) >= 80, len(pip)\n\nposey = [\n\"Soften the knees. The pose is a place, not a test.\",\"The ring drifts like a polite ghost. Stay inside it.\",\n\"Chin easy. Shoulders down. The bird is not a grade.\",\n\"Hold the shape you already have. I am not collecting new ones.\",\n\"Breathe into the side that feels forgotten.\",\"If you wobble, you are still in the pose. Motion is allowed.\",\n\"Arms where they rest. Heroic arms are a different class.\",\n\"The flower opens on your breath, not on my whistle.\",\"In for four. The room can wait.\",\n\"Out for four. The room can also wait.\",\"Match the guide. Do not race it. It has nowhere to be.\",\n\"Eyes soft. The mirror is a suggestion box.\",\"Pose two is the same pose with more faith.\",\n\"When the ring shrinks, you shrink the extra. Keep the centre.\",\n\"I brought a towel. I did not bring a correction.\",\"The gull is a guest. Guests land. We continue.\",\n\"Your stillness has a texture. I like this one.\",\"Switch sides when I nod, not when you panic.\",\n\"Balance is a duet. You lead. The dot follows late, on purpose.\",\n\"Beautiful is the wrong word. Present will do.\",\"Stay. The pose finishes itself if you let the clock help.\",\n\"I will count in flowers, not in faults.\",\"Shoulders over hips, hips over the kind part of the mat.\",\n\"If a tip comes, we restart the breath, not the friendship.\",\n\"There. That ordinary shape is the one I wrote down.\",\n]\nkettle = [\n\"Ten squats. Down two, up one. I have boiled water with less fuss.\",\n\"Keep the dot in the band or the rep is a rumour.\",\n\"Brace. Both sides. A plank with one oar is a swim.\",\n\"I am not shouting. This is my indoor voice. It fills a bay.\",\n\"Tempo is a promise you made to the bell.\",\"If you flop, you flop. The mat is the landing and the lesson.\",\n\"Depth, then stand. Do not live in the basement of the rep.\",\n\"The ring gets smaller because comfort is a thief.\",\"Hold. Holding is the exercise. Shaking is just weather.\",\n\"Rep four is where people invent a new hobby. Stay here.\",\n\"I count a rep when it is finished, not when it is hoped.\",\n\"Elbows soft. The floor is not a suspect.\",\"Breathe out on the way up. The kettle whistles, you do not have to.\",\n\"Again. Again is the whole speech.\",\"A tip costs you a second and a little pride. Spend both.\",\n\"The standoff ends when time says, or when you set the brace down.\",\n\"I brought one bell. It only knows how to be proud of you.\",\n\"Keep the knees tracking the same rumour as the toes.\",\n\"Slow is not weak. Slow is how the count stays honest.\",\n\"Last rep. Make it look like the first one paid tuition.\",\n\"Brace like you are carrying a sleeping gull. No sudden heroics.\",\n\"I will not add reps. I will add silence. Use it.\",\n\"The band is narrow. So is the path to the kettle. You are on it.\",\n\"Done is a number, not a feeling. You can have the feeling after.\",\n\"Good. Put the day down gently. It is hot.\",\n]\nbounce = [\n\"Left, right, sometimes both. The box has a social life.\",\"Ninety-six beats. Your feet are invited to all of them.\",\n\"Miss a step and the song forgives you faster than I do. I forgive you immediately.\",\n\"Spin. Not a sprint. A spin. The ring is the dance floor.\",\n\"Catch the hoop they throw. It is a compliment with physics.\",\n\"Two steps a second. Think of a song you can hum without gasping.\",\n\"Ribbons are for showing off. Crabs are for humility.\",\"The lagoon path is a lap. The lap is a party with a dress code of shoes.\",\n\"If your rate leaves the zone, come back. The zone left the light on.\",\n\"Both feet means both feet. The chart is not being metaphorical.\",\n\"I clapped. That was a perfect. Perfects make me louder.\",\"Direction change! The floatie does not do encores the same way.\",\n\"Lean in a circle. Your centre is the record spindle.\",\"The crab has unionised. Give it the lane.\",\n\"Almost. Almost is my favourite genre. Then we do it again.\",\n\"Step party rule one: the box does not wait. Rule two: I do.\",\n\"You are on beat. I am on a different, worse beat. Ignore me.\",\n\"Catch seven and I will tell the Commodore you are seaworthy.\",\n\"A bump is a crab handshake. You do not have to return it.\",\n\"Keep the spin inside the band. Too fast is just falling with style.\",\n\"Lap ribbon ahead. Optional. Your pride is not optional. Mine is.\",\n\"Left. Right. Left. The song is a very small novel.\",\"I brought confetti and then I remembered it was morning. Imaginary confetti.\",\n\"The beat missed you and would like to try again.\",\"There. That was a run. Smile with your ankles.\",\n]\ngull = [\n\"The shells desire the pools. Tilt the world until desire becomes geography.\",\n\"A moving pool is still a pool. It simply has ambitions.\",\"Paddle. The gates are suggestions with consequences.\",\n\"Lean ahead to go. Lean aside to apologise to a gate.\",\"Par is a rumour I started. Beat the rumour.\",\n\"Wind on the straight. It is not personal. It is Tuesday.\",\n\"Three boards. More shells each time, because I am a host.\",\n\"Do not scoop the shells. You are a tide, not a waiter. Marjorie is the waiter.\",\n\"The splash is the exam. The bounce is the study hall.\",\"Four presses at the bottom. Then leave the board. Commit.\",\n\"Tuck is a moral stance. Hold it until the water agrees.\",\n\"Judges have cards and no adjectives. Splash loudly enough to earn a number.\",\n\"My hat is the only uniform. The lagoon is the only field.\",\n\"Miss a gate and I add two seconds to your legend. Choose.\",\n\"The wake behind you should look like you meant it.\",\n\"Board two drifts. Drift with it. Heroes fight tides and eat sand.\",\n\"I have never lost a shell. I have misplaced several oceans.\",\n\"Cannonball scoring is secret. The secret is: be round, be brave, be done.\",\n\"Three dives. The third one is the one the brochure uses.\",\n\"If you tip the raft off the map, the map tips back. Stay aboard.\",\n\"Stars on the water still count. I checked with the resort.\",\n\"The slalom is straight if you are. This is unfair and traditional.\",\n\"I salute your splash. I salute it from a safe, dry, higher rock.\",\n\"Bring the shells home. Then bring yourself. In that order.\",\n\"Commodore Gull, signing the wind. Try not to capsize the signature.\",\n]\nmarjorie = [\n\"Five glasses. They are smoothies in the way a story is a smoothie. Vaguely.\",\n\"The pier jolts. I did not design the pier. I designed the glasses.\",\n\"Keep them upright and I will keep your secret, which is that you are trying.\",\n\"A spilled glass is a small tragedy with a straw. We continue.\",\n\"Walk the length. The view is free. The balance is not.\",\n\"I named the glasses. You do not need the names. They need you.\",\n\"If all five arrive, the kitchen owes you nothing and I owe you a nod.\",\n\"The jolt is on a schedule. So am I. The glasses are the only innocents.\",\n]\ntom = [\n\"Brochure sentence: Tippy Cay, where standing is a leisure activity.\",\n\"I wrote 'azure'. The water wrote back 'not quite'.\",\"Hold still. I am sketching the idea of you, not the wobble.\",\n\"The slogan cannot be 'please do not tip'. Legal said so.\",\"Day four sells itself. I am only here to hold the adjectives.\",\n\"If you look majestic, blink twice. The pamphlet needs a masthead.\",\n\"I will not write about speed. I will write about the pause before it.\",\n\"Quote me as saying the lagoon was cooperative. It was not. Print it anyway.\",\n]\ntwins = [\n\"We brought one plan and a spare.\",\"Left twin says lean. Right twin says later. Split the difference.\",\n\"We are not lost. We are auditing the path.\",\"The crab knows us. We respect the crab.\",\n\"Pass us the pad when the story gets good.\",\"We counted the flip-flops. We will not say the number. It is five.\",\n\"Our sunglasses have two opinions.\",\"Tell Pip we waved. We did. It counted.\",\n]\n\ndef tables(speaker, tag, lines_):\n    out = []\n    for text in lines_:\n        out.append(\"[[lines]]\")\n        out.append(f'speaker = \"{speaker}\"')\n        out.append(f'tag = \"{tag}\"')\n        out.append(f'text = \"{text}\"')\n        out.append(\"\")\n    return out\n\nbody = []\nbody.append(\"# Tippy Cay script. Speakers, preset names, titles, looks.\")\nbody.append(\"names = [\" + \", \".join(f'\"{n}\"' for n in names) + \"]\")\nbody.append(\"titles = [\" + \", \".join(f'\"{t}\"' for t in titles) + \"]\")\nbody.append(\"skins = [\" + \", \".join(f'\"{s}\"' for s in skins) + \"]\")\nbody.append(\"outfits = [\" + \", \".join(f'\"{o}\"' for o in outfits) + \"]\")\nbody.append(\"\")\n# spread pip lines across tags so screens have something to say\ntags_cycle = [\"intro\",\"wake1\",\"wake2\",\"wake3\",\"wake4\",\"wake5\",\"sleep\",\"reveal\",\"ending\",\"credits\",\"pip\"]\nfor i, text in enumerate(pip):\n    tag = tags_cycle[i] if i < 8 else (\"pip\" if i > 20 else tags_cycle[i % 8])\n    # first lines of each wake/intro are the early ones; also keep a big pip pool\n    if i < 16:\n        tag = [\"intro\",\"intro\",\"intro\",\"intro\",\"wake1\",\"wake1\",\"wake2\",\"wake2\",\"wake3\",\"wake3\",\"wake4\",\"wake4\",\"wake5\",\"wake5\",\"sleep\",\"sleep\"][i]\n    elif i < 24:\n        tag = [\"reveal\",\"reveal\",\"ending\",\"ending\",\"credits\",\"credits\",\"credits\",\"credits\"][i-16]\n    else:\n        tag = \"pip\"\n    body.append(\"[[lines]]\")\n    body.append('speaker = \"Pip\"')\n    body.append(f'tag = \"{tag}\"')\n    body.append(f'text = \"{text}\"')\n    body.append(\"\")\nbody += tables(\"Posey\",\"card\", posey)\nbody += tables(\"Kettle\",\"card\", kettle)\nbody += tables(\"Bounce\",\"card\", bounce)\nbody += tables(\"Gull\",\"card\", gull)\nbody += tables(\"Marjorie\",\"card\", marjorie)\nbody += tables(\"Tom\",\"card\", tom)\nbody += tables(\"Twins\",\"card\", twins)\n(root / \"script.toml\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(body) + \"\\n\")\nprint(\"charts\", len(notes), \"pip\", len(pip), \"script bytes\", (root/\"script.toml\").stat().st_size)\nPY","description":"Write charts, rules, and the Tippy Cay script"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":570,"output_tokens":11708,"cache_read_input_tokens":141824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"f9163194-990c-42aa-a3d4-0cc5b89eb6ce"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-70","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn full_lean_settles_inside_the_disc() {\\n        let rules = Rules::default();\\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\\n        b.kicks = false;\\n        b.amp = 0.0;\\n        let lean = Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0);\\n        let mut peak = 0.0_f32;\\n        for _ in 0..180 {\\n            b.step_clean(lean, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n            peak = peak.max(b.cob.length());\\n        }\\n        assert!(peak < 1.0, \\\"peak {peak}\\\");\\n        assert!(b.cob.x > 0.85, \\\"settled at {}\\\", b.cob.x);\\n        assert!(!b.tipped);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\\n        let rules = Rules::default();\\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\\n        b.kicks = false;\\n        b.amp = 0.0;\\n        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\\n        let mut tipped = false;\\n        for _ in 0..120 {\\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n            tipped |= b.tipped;\\n        }\\n        assert!(tipped, \\\"gust should tip within 2s\\\");\\n        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\\n        for _ in 0..180 {\\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n        }\\n        assert!(b.cob.length() < 0.2, \\\"returned to {}\\\", b.cob);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn age_moves_the_right_way_and_stays_in_range() {\\n        let young = balance_age(1.0, 4, 30);\\n        let older = balance_age(0.0, 0, 0);\\n        assert!(young < older);\\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&young));\\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&older));\\n        assert_eq!(balance_age(1.0, 0, 0), 24);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(399.0), 0);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(400.0), 1);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(650.0), 2);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(850.0), 3);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(24.0), 0);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(25.0), 1);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(40.0), 2);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(55.0), 3);\\n    }\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\",\"old_line\":214,\"new_string\":\"pub fn stars_from_plank(secs: f32) -> u8 {\\n    if secs >= 55.0 {\\n        3\\n    } else if secs >= 40.0 {\\n        2\\n    } else if secs >= 25.0 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn full_lean_settles_inside_the_disc() {\\n        let rules = Rules::default();\\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\\n        b.kicks = false;\\n        b.amp = 0.0;\\n        let lean = Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0);\\n        let mut peak = 0.0_f32;\\n        for _ in 0..180 {\\n            b.step_clean(lean, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n            peak = peak.max(b.cob.length());\\n        }\\n        assert!(peak < 1.0, \\\"peak {peak}\\\");\\n        assert!(b.cob.x > 0.85, \\\"settled at {}\\\", b.cob.x);\\n        assert!(!b.tipped);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\\n        let rules = Rules::default();\\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\\n        b.kicks = false;\\n        b.amp = 0.0;\\n        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\\n        let mut tipped = false;\\n        for _ in 0..120 {\\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n            tipped |= b.tipped;\\n        }\\n        assert!(tipped, \\\"gust should tip within 2s\\\");\\n        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\\n        for _ in 0..180 {\\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\\n        }\\n        assert!(b.cob.length() < 0.2, \\\"returned to {}\\\", b.cob);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn age_moves_the_right_way_and_stays_in_range() {\\n        let young = balance_age(1.0, 4, 30);\\n        let older = balance_age(0.0, 0, 0);\\n        assert!(young < older);\\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&young));\\n        assert!((18..=99).contains(&older));\\n        assert_eq!(balance_age(1.0, 0, 0), 24);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(399.0), 0);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(400.0), 1);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(650.0), 2);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_score(850.0), 3);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(24.0), 0);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(25.0), 1);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(40.0), 2);\\n        assert_eq!(stars_from_plank(55.0), 3);\\n    }\\n}\",\"new_line\":214,\"context_before\":\"    }\\n}\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-71","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn stick_deadzone_and_curve() {\\n        assert_eq!(shape_stick(0.1, 0.12, 1.5), 0.0);\\n        let v = shape_stick(1.0, 0.12, 1.5);\\n        assert!((v - 1.0).abs() < 1e-4);\\n        let mid = shape_stick(0.5, 0.12, 1.5);\\n        assert!(mid > 0.0 && mid < 0.5);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn keys_ramp_and_mouse_clamps() {\\n        let mut x = 0.0;\\n        for _ in 0..60 {\\n            x = key_ramp(x, 1.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\\n        }\\n        assert!(x > 0.9, \\\"{x}\\\");\\n        x = key_ramp(x, 0.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\\n        assert!(x < 1.0);\\n        let m = mouse_lean(Vec2::new(10_000.0, 0.0), 1080.0);\\n        assert!((m.length() - 1.0).abs() < 1e-3);\\n    }\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\",\"old_line\":33,\"new_string\":\"pub fn mouse_lean(offset: Vec2, height_px: f32) -> Vec2 {\\n    let s = (0.38 * height_px).max(1.0);\\n    (offset / s).clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn stick_deadzone_and_curve() {\\n        assert_eq!(shape_stick(0.1, 0.12, 1.5), 0.0);\\n        let v = shape_stick(1.0, 0.12, 1.5);\\n        assert!((v - 1.0).abs() < 1e-4);\\n        let mid = shape_stick(0.5, 0.12, 1.5);\\n        assert!(mid > 0.0 && mid < 0.5);\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn keys_ramp_and_mouse_clamps() {\\n        let mut x = 0.0;\\n        for _ in 0..60 {\\n            x = key_ramp(x, 1.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\\n        }\\n        assert!(x > 0.9, \\\"{x}\\\");\\n        x = key_ramp(x, 0.0, 1.0 / 60.0, 1.6, 1.2);\\n        assert!(x < 1.0);\\n        let m = mouse_lean(Vec2::new(10_000.0, 0.0), 1080.0);\\n        assert!((m.length() - 1.0).abs() < 1e-3);\\n    }\\n}\",\"new_line\":33,\"context_before\":\"}\\n\\n/// Mouse: offset from the screen centre, divided by 0.38 of the window height, clamped to the disc.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-72","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[99,104,97,114,116,115,32,49,48,48,32,112,105,112,32,56,51,32,115,99,114,105,112,116,32,98,121,116,101,115,32,50,51,55,53,56,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\ncharts 100 pip 83 script bytes 23758\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"python3 << 'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot = Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit\\\")\\n\\n# charts: 100 notes, 96 BPM, quarters then eighths, lane 2 on every 11th\\nnotes = []\\nt = 1.0\\ni = 0\\nwhile len(notes) < 100 and t < 62.0:\\n    lane = 2 if i % 11 == 10 else (i % 2)\\n    notes.append((round(t, 4), lane))\\n    t += 0.625 if i < 32 else 0.3125\\n    i += 1\\nlines = [\\\"# Step Party chart. 96 BPM. lane 0 left, 1 right, 2 both.\\\", \\\"\\\"]\\nfor t, lane in notes:\\n    lines.append(\\\"[[notes]]\\\")\\n    lines.append(f\\\"t = {t}\\\")\\n    lines.append(f\\\"lane = {lane}\\\")\\n    lines.append(\\\"\\\")\\n(root / \\\"charts.toml\\\").write_text(\\\"\\\\n\\\".join(lines))\\n\\nrules = '''# Feel numbers for Tippy Cay. Reset restores these.\\nstiffness = 40.0\\ndamping = 8.5\\nreach = 0.92\\ntip_time = 0.35\\nwobble = 0.12\\nstick_curve = 1.5\\nkey_rate = 1.6\\nkey_return = 1.2\\nbreath_secs = 45.0\\npose_secs = 20.0\\npose_ring = 0.30\\nsquat_reps = 10\\nplank_secs = 60.0\\nstep_secs = 64.0\\nfloatie_secs = 50.0\\nspin_lo = 6.0\\nspin_hi = 9.0\\nspin_band_scale = 1.35\\nlap_secs = 90.0\\ntide_secs = 20.0\\npaddle_secs = 45.0\\npaddle_par = 28.0\\ntray_secs = 50.0\\ncannon_secs = 40.0\\ngust = 18.0\\nbounce_gain = 1.0\\nbig_gust = 22.0\\nrhythm_perfect = 0.055\\nrhythm_good = 0.120\\n'''\\n(root / \\\"rules.toml\\\").write_text(rules)\\n\\nnames = [\\\"Avery\\\",\\\"Blair\\\",\\\"Casey\\\",\\\"Devon\\\",\\\"Eden\\\",\\\"Finley\\\",\\\"Gray\\\",\\\"Harper\\\",\\\"Indigo\\\",\\\"Jules\\\",\\\"Kai\\\",\\\"Lane\\\",\\\"Marlow\\\",\\\"Nico\\\",\\\"Oak\\\",\\\"Piper\\\",\\\"Quinn\\\",\\\"Reese\\\",\\\"Sage\\\",\\\"Tatum\\\",\\\"Umber\\\",\\\"Vesper\\\",\\\"Winter\\\",\\\"Yael\\\",\\\"Zephyr\\\",\\\"Ash\\\",\\\"Bay\\\",\\\"Cove\\\",\\\"Dell\\\",\\\"Echo\\\",\\\"Fern\\\",\\\"Glen\\\",\\\"Haze\\\",\\\"Isle\\\",\\\"Jory\\\",\\\"Kit\\\",\\\"Lark\\\",\\\"Moss\\\",\\\"Nell\\\",\\\"Orla\\\"]\\ntitles = [\\\"Human Soup\\\",\\\"Acceptable Human\\\",\\\"Certified Lean-To\\\",\\\"Wobble Enthusiast\\\",\\\"Seasoned Tilter\\\",\\\"Stillness Intern\\\",\\\"Professional Standing Person\\\",\\\"Alarmingly Balanced\\\",\\\"Soft Architecture\\\",\\\"Temporary Tower\\\",\\\"Polite Collapse\\\",\\\"Almost a Statue\\\",\\\"Guest of Gravity\\\",\\\"Mildly Vertical\\\",\\\"The Lean Years\\\",\\\"Upright Citizen\\\",\\\"Foam and Fortune\\\",\\\"Unbothered\\\",\\\"Quiet Furniture\\\",\\\"Balance Curious\\\",\\\"Practised Sway\\\",\\\"Harbour of Knees\\\",\\\"Steady Enough\\\",\\\"The Long Blink\\\",\\\"Kind to the Floor\\\",\\\"Not a Statue Yet\\\",\\\"Vertical-ish\\\",\\\"Champion of Standing Around\\\",\\\"Inner Puddle\\\",\\\"Buoyant Citizen\\\",\\\"Resort-Grade Upright\\\",\\\"Golden Pause\\\"]\\nskins = [\\\"Sand\\\",\\\"Seafoam\\\",\\\"Coral\\\",\\\"Dusk\\\",\\\"Foam\\\",\\\"Kelp\\\"]\\noutfits = [\\\"Linen\\\",\\\"Rash Guard\\\",\\\"Resort Stripe\\\",\\\"Evening\\\",\\\"Coach\\\",\\\"Guest\\\",\\\"Swim\\\",\\\"Golden\\\"]\\n\\npip = [\\n\\\"Welcome ashore. The mat remembers nothing yet.\\\",\\\"The deck is warm. You do not have to be.\\\",\\\"Hold the rail if you like. It does not judge.\\\",\\n\\\"Morning. I saved you the shady side of the board.\\\",\\\"Breathe like the tide is a suggestion, not a boss.\\\",\\\"Your feet are doing a conversation. Let them finish.\\\",\\n\\\"We measure balance here, and then we stop measuring.\\\",\\\"A tip is a comma. The stay continues.\\\",\\\"Stars are compliments. Minutes are the rent.\\\",\\n\\\"The rowboat leaves when the week says you can stand in it.\\\",\\\"If the week is not finished with you, the hammock is.\\\",\\n\\\"I am a small coach with a large belief in standing.\\\",\\\"Posey will ask you to pose. The pose can be ordinary.\\\",\\n\\\"Kettle counts reps the way a kettle counts boils. Patiently, then suddenly.\\\",\\n\\\"Bounce thinks every heartbeat is a party invitation.\\\",\\\"The Commodore has never been on time and never been wrong about water.\\\",\\n\\\"Marjorie will hand you a tray. The tray has opinions.\\\",\\\"Tom is writing the brochure. He is on sentence one.\\\",\\n\\\"The twins are sharing one pair of sunglasses and two plans.\\\",\\\"Flip-flops wander off. If you find five, the gold pair finds you.\\\",\\n\\\"Yesterday you left a faint copy on the deck. It does not keep score.\\\",\\n\\\"Close your eyes when I ask. I will keep mine open.\\\",\\\"The dot in the disc is your centre, not your worth.\\\",\\n\\\"Lean is the whole verb. The island supplies the nouns.\\\",\\\"Guests come and go. The mat stays slightly damp.\\\",\\n\\\"Stamp the day when the minutes are met, not when you are tired of me.\\\",\\n\\\"I will not hurry the last half-minute. Stillness is the trick question.\\\",\\n\\\"If a button says skip, it is a liar with a nice font.\\\",\\\"The gull is not a coach. The gull is a weather system.\\\",\\n\\\"Tea is at four. Tea does not care about your personal best.\\\",\\\"The lagoon is a sports field that apologises in waves.\\\",\\n\\\"Paddle as if the gates were polite. They are not.\\\",\\\"Shells want the pools. You are only the tide's assistant.\\\",\\n\\\"A cannonball is a conversation with the surface. Tuck, then listen.\\\",\\n\\\"Step on the beat the box believes in. It believes in ninety-six.\\\",\\n\\\"Two steps a second is a walk, not a rescue.\\\",\\\"Ribbons are optional. Crabs are a footnote with claws.\\\",\\n\\\"Spin the ring the way a slow record spins. Catch what they throw.\\\",\\n\\\"Brace means both hands on the day. One hand is a nap.\\\",\\n\\\"Down for two, up for one. The band is a small country. Stay in it.\\\",\\n\\\"The ring will shrink. You may shrink your plans to match.\\\",\\\"Accept the bird. It has no ticket and excellent timing.\\\",\\n\\\"In for four, out for four. The flower is a clock.\\\",\\\"If your lungs and the guide disagree, believe the slower one.\\\",\\n\\\"I kept your name on a shell. Shells are the filing system.\\\",\\\"Four hammocks, four names, one very calm ledger.\\\",\\n\\\"Play Together is one mat and a queue of brave people.\\\",\\\"Pass the pad like a relay baton made of plastic and trust.\\\",\\n\\\"The medley is three water games and one shared seed of chaos.\\\",\\n\\\"Dev mode is the broom closet. The sliders are labelled. Reset is a promise.\\\",\\n\\\"Music sits low, like a band behind a hedge. You can invite it closer.\\\",\\n\\\"Glyphs follow the last thing you touched. The mat does not play favourites.\\\",\\n\\\"A keyboard leans the way a tide comes in. Release, and it goes home.\\\",\\n\\\"The mouse is a long arm. The centre of the glass is neutral.\\\",\\n\\\"Touch is for the settings card and nothing else. Bring a controller when you can.\\\",\\n\\\"Attract mode is the island showing off. It saves nothing, not even a blush.\\\",\\n\\\"Ten quiet seconds and the brochure plays itself. Any real input sends it away.\\\",\\n\\\"I do not own a scale. I own a mat, a whistle, and office hours.\\\",\\n\\\"Age here is a party trick with a formula. Lower is calmer, not smaller.\\\",\\n\\\"Days open in order: still, strong, quick, then the lagoon.\\\",\\n\\\"Day five is everything once, and then a long nothing. Do the nothing.\\\",\\n\\\"Inner peace is a bonus, not a doorway. Pressing skips the bonus, not the stay.\\\",\\n\\\"You can retry a game. You cannot retry a kindness. We only stock the first.\\\",\\n\\\"Personal bests live in the slot with your name. They wave at Yesterday.\\\",\\n\\\"If you were gone, I noticed. The pier kept your spot anyway.\\\",\\n\\\"Free play means the schedule unlocks. The coaches still want to chat.\\\",\\n\\\"Credits roll for the rowboat and for the extended hammock. Both are a finish.\\\",\\n\\\"I will be here in the morning whether you check out or not.\\\",\\n\\\"Stand on the disc. I will stand on the sentence.\\\",\\\"The pastel is intentional. The wobble is also intentional.\\\",\\n\\\"When the dot hunts you, that is physics. When you hunt it, that is practice.\\\",\\n\\\"A good rep sounds like a small bell. A bad rep sounds like me being kind.\\\",\\n\\\"The tray holds five glasses. The pier holds a grudge.\\\",\\\"Judges at the pool brought cards. Their faces brought nothing.\\\",\\n\\\"Big Kettle's plank is a dare with a soft landing. Tips cost time, not the week.\\\",\\n\\\"Pose three is when the bird arrives. Pose four does not exist. Breathe.\\\",\\n\\\"I counted your stamps. I did not count your sighs.\\\",\\\"The golden shoes are a rumour until the fifth flip-flop.\\\",\\n\\\"Wave at a coach if you have a spare thumb. They live for it.\\\",\\n\\\"Schedule is the map. The island is the long way, and it is allowed.\\\",\\n\\\"End the day when the minutes say so. The sunset is not on the payroll.\\\",\\n\\\"You are doing a rare sport called remaining upright near water.\\\",\\n\\\"That is the whole lesson. The rest is company.\\\",\\n]\\nassert len(pip) >= 80, len(pip)\\n\\nposey = [\\n\\\"Soften the knees. The pose is a place, not a test.\\\",\\\"The ring drifts like a polite ghost. Stay inside it.\\\",\\n\\\"Chin easy. Shoulders down. The bird is not a grade.\\\",\\n\\\"Hold the shape you already have. I am not collecting new ones.\\\",\\n\\\"Breathe into the side that feels forgotten.\\\",\\\"If you wobble, you are still in the pose. Motion is allowed.\\\",\\n\\\"Arms where they rest. Heroic arms are a different class.\\\",\\n\\\"The flower opens on your breath, not on my whistle.\\\",\\\"In for four. The room can wait.\\\",\\n\\\"Out for four. The room can also wait.\\\",\\\"Match the guide. Do not race it. It has nowhere to be.\\\",\\n\\\"Eyes soft. The mirror is a suggestion box.\\\",\\\"Pose two is the same pose with more faith.\\\",\\n\\\"When the ring shrinks, you shrink the extra. Keep the centre.\\\",\\n\\\"I brought a towel. I did not bring a correction.\\\",\\\"The gull is a guest. Guests land. We continue.\\\",\\n\\\"Your stillness has a texture. I like this one.\\\",\\\"Switch sides when I nod, not when you panic.\\\",\\n\\\"Balance is a duet. You lead. The dot follows late, on purpose.\\\",\\n\\\"Beautiful is the wrong word. Present will do.\\\",\\\"Stay. The pose finishes itself if you let the clock help.\\\",\\n\\\"I will count in flowers, not in faults.\\\",\\\"Shoulders over hips, hips over the kind part of the mat.\\\",\\n\\\"If a tip comes, we restart the breath, not the friendship.\\\",\\n\\\"There. That ordinary shape is the one I wrote down.\\\",\\n]\\nkettle = [\\n\\\"Ten squats. Down two, up one. I have boiled water with less fuss.\\\",\\n\\\"Keep the dot in the band or the rep is a rumour.\\\",\\n\\\"Brace. Both sides. A plank with one oar is a swim.\\\",\\n\\\"I am not shouting. This is my indoor voice. It fills a bay.\\\",\\n\\\"Tempo is a promise you made to the bell.\\\",\\\"If you flop, you flop. The mat is the landing and the lesson.\\\",\\n\\\"Depth, then stand. Do not live in the basement of the rep.\\\",\\n\\\"The ring gets smaller because comfort is a thief.\\\",\\\"Hold. Holding is the exercise. Shaking is just weather.\\\",\\n\\\"Rep four is where people invent a new hobby. Stay here.\\\",\\n\\\"I count a rep when it is finished, not when it is hoped.\\\",\\n\\\"Elbows soft. The floor is not a suspect.\\\",\\\"Breathe out on the way up. The kettle whistles, you do not have to.\\\",\\n\\\"Again. Again is the whole speech.\\\",\\\"A tip costs you a second and a little pride. Spend both.\\\",\\n\\\"The standoff ends when time says, or when you set the brace down.\\\",\\n\\\"I brought one bell. It only knows how to be proud of you.\\\",\\n\\\"Keep the knees tracking the same rumour as the toes.\\\",\\n\\\"Slow is not weak. Slow is how the count stays honest.\\\",\\n\\\"Last rep. Make it look like the first one paid tuition.\\\",\\n\\\"Brace like you are carrying a sleeping gull. No sudden heroics.\\\",\\n\\\"I will not add reps. I will add silence. Use it.\\\",\\n\\\"The band is narrow. So is the path to the kettle. You are on it.\\\",\\n\\\"Done is a number, not a feeling. You can have the feeling after.\\\",\\n\\\"Good. Put the day down gently. It is hot.\\\",\\n]\\nbounce = [\\n\\\"Left, right, sometimes both. The box has a social life.\\\",\\\"Ninety-six beats. Your feet are invited to all of them.\\\",\\n\\\"Miss a step and the song forgives you faster than I do. I forgive you immediately.\\\",\\n\\\"Spin. Not a sprint. A spin. The ring is the dance floor.\\\",\\n\\\"Catch the hoop they throw. It is a compliment with physics.\\\",\\n\\\"Two steps a second. Think of a song you can hum without gasping.\\\",\\n\\\"Ribbons are for showing off. Crabs are for humility.\\\",\\\"The lagoon path is a lap. The lap is a party with a dress code of shoes.\\\",\\n\\\"If your rate leaves the zone, come back. The zone left the light on.\\\",\\n\\\"Both feet means both feet. The chart is not being metaphorical.\\\",\\n\\\"I clapped. That was a perfect. Perfects make me louder.\\\",\\\"Direction change! The floatie does not do encores the same way.\\\",\\n\\\"Lean in a circle. Your centre is the record spindle.\\\",\\\"The crab has unionised. Give it the lane.\\\",\\n\\\"Almost. Almost is my favourite genre. Then we do it again.\\\",\\n\\\"Step party rule one: the box does not wait. Rule two: I do.\\\",\\n\\\"You are on beat. I am on a different, worse beat. Ignore me.\\\",\\n\\\"Catch seven and I will tell the Commodore you are seaworthy.\\\",\\n\\\"A bump is a crab handshake. You do not have to return it.\\\",\\n\\\"Keep the spin inside the band. Too fast is just falling with style.\\\",\\n\\\"Lap ribbon ahead. Optional. Your pride is not optional. Mine is.\\\",\\n\\\"Left. Right. Left. The song is a very small novel.\\\",\\\"I brought confetti and then I remembered it was morning. Imaginary confetti.\\\",\\n\\\"The beat missed you and would like to try again.\\\",\\\"There. That was a run. Smile with your ankles.\\\",\\n]\\ngull = [\\n\\\"The shells desire the pools. Tilt the world until desire becomes geography.\\\",\\n\\\"A moving pool is still a pool. It simply has ambitions.\\\",\\\"Paddle. The gates are suggestions with consequences.\\\",\\n\\\"Lean ahead to go. Lean aside to apologise to a gate.\\\",\\\"Par is a rumour I started. Beat the rumour.\\\",\\n\\\"Wind on the straight. It is not personal. It is Tuesday.\\\",\\n\\\"Three boards. More shells each time, because I am a host.\\\",\\n\\\"Do not scoop the shells. You are a tide, not a waiter. Marjorie is the waiter.\\\",\\n\\\"The splash is the exam. The bounce is the study hall.\\\",\\\"Four presses at the bottom. Then leave the board. Commit.\\\",\\n\\\"Tuck is a moral stance. Hold it until the water agrees.\\\",\\n\\\"Judges have cards and no adjectives. Splash loudly enough to earn a number.\\\",\\n\\\"My hat is the only uniform. The lagoon is the only field.\\\",\\n\\\"Miss a gate and I add two seconds to your legend. Choose.\\\",\\n\\\"The wake behind you should look like you meant it.\\\",\\n\\\"Board two drifts. Drift with it. Heroes fight tides and eat sand.\\\",\\n\\\"I have never lost a shell. I have misplaced several oceans.\\\",\\n\\\"Cannonball scoring is secret. The secret is: be round, be brave, be done.\\\",\\n\\\"Three dives. The third one is the one the brochure uses.\\\",\\n\\\"If you tip the raft off the map, the map tips back. Stay aboard.\\\",\\n\\\"Stars on the water still count. I checked with the resort.\\\",\\n\\\"The slalom is straight if you are. This is unfair and traditional.\\\",\\n\\\"I salute your splash. I salute it from a safe, dry, higher rock.\\\",\\n\\\"Bring the shells home. Then bring yourself. In that order.\\\",\\n\\\"Commodore Gull, signing the wind. Try not to capsize the signature.\\\",\\n]\\nmarjorie = [\\n\\\"Five glasses. They are smoothies in the way a story is a smoothie. Vaguely.\\\",\\n\\\"The pier jolts. I did not design the pier. I designed the glasses.\\\",\\n\\\"Keep them upright and I will keep your secret, which is that you are trying.\\\",\\n\\\"A spilled glass is a small tragedy with a straw. We continue.\\\",\\n\\\"Walk the length. The view is free. The balance is not.\\\",\\n\\\"I named the glasses. You do not need the names. They need you.\\\",\\n\\\"If all five arrive, the kitchen owes you nothing and I owe you a nod.\\\",\\n\\\"The jolt is on a schedule. So am I. The glasses are the only innocents.\\\",\\n]\\ntom = [\\n\\\"Brochure sentence: Tippy Cay, where standing is a leisure activity.\\\",\\n\\\"I wrote 'azure'. The water wrote back 'not quite'.\\\",\\\"Hold still. I am sketching the idea of you, not the wobble.\\\",\\n\\\"The slogan cannot be 'please do not tip'. Legal said so.\\\",\\\"Day four sells itself. I am only here to hold the adjectives.\\\",\\n\\\"If you look majestic, blink twice. The pamphlet needs a masthead.\\\",\\n\\\"I will not write about speed. I will write about the pause before it.\\\",\\n\\\"Quote me as saying the lagoon was cooperative. It was not. Print it anyway.\\\",\\n]\\ntwins = [\\n\\\"We brought one plan and a spare.\\\",\\\"Left twin says lean. Right twin says later. Split the difference.\\\",\\n\\\"We are not lost. We are auditing the path.\\\",\\\"The crab knows us. We respect the crab.\\\",\\n\\\"Pass us the pad when the story gets good.\\\",\\\"We counted the flip-flops. We will not say the number. It is five.\\\",\\n\\\"Our sunglasses have two opinions.\\\",\\\"Tell Pip we waved. We did. It counted.\\\",\\n]\\n\\ndef tables(speaker, tag, lines_):\\n    out = []\\n    for text in lines_:\\n        out.append(\\\"[[lines]]\\\")\\n        out.append(f'speaker = \\\"{speaker}\\\"')\\n        out.append(f'tag = \\\"{tag}\\\"')\\n        out.append(f'text = \\\"{text}\\\"')\\n        out.append(\\\"\\\")\\n    return out\\n\\nbody = []\\nbody.append(\\\"# Tippy Cay script. Speakers, preset names, titles, looks.\\\")\\nbody.append(\\\"names = [\\\" + \\\", \\\".join(f'\\\"{n}\\\"' for n in names) + \\\"]\\\")\\nbody.append(\\\"titles = [\\\" + \\\", \\\".join(f'\\\"{t}\\\"' for t in titles) + \\\"]\\\")\\nbody.append(\\\"skins = [\\\" + \\\", \\\".join(f'\\\"{s}\\\"' for s in skins) + \\\"]\\\")\\nbody.append(\\\"outfits = [\\\" + \\\", \\\".join(f'\\\"{o}\\\"' for o in outfits) + \\\"]\\\")\\nbody.append(\\\"\\\")\\n# spread pip lines across tags so screens have something to say\\ntags_cycle = [\\\"intro\\\",\\\"wake1\\\",\\\"wake2\\\",\\\"wake3\\\",\\\"wake4\\\",\\\"wake5\\\",\\\"sleep\\\",\\\"reveal\\\",\\\"ending\\\",\\\"credits\\\",\\\"pip\\\"]\\nfor i, text in enumerate(pip):\\n    tag = tags_cycle[i] if i < 8 else (\\\"pip\\\" if i > 20 else tags_cycle[i % 8])\\n    # first lines of each wake/intro are the early ones; also keep a big pip pool\\n    if i < 16:\\n        tag = [\\\"intro\\\",\\\"intro\\\",\\\"intro\\\",\\\"intro\\\",\\\"wake1\\\",\\\"wake1\\\",\\\"wake2\\\",\\\"wake2\\\",\\\"wake3\\\",\\\"wake3\\\",\\\"wake4\\\",\\\"wake4\\\",\\\"wake5\\\",\\\"wake5\\\",\\\"sleep\\\",\\\"sleep\\\"][i]\\n    elif i < 24:\\n        tag = [\\\"reveal\\\",\\\"reveal\\\",\\\"ending\\\",\\\"ending\\\",\\\"credits\\\",\\\"credits\\\",\\\"credits\\\",\\\"credits\\\"][i-16]\\n    else:\\n        tag = \\\"pip\\\"\\n    body.append(\\\"[[lines]]\\\")\\n    body.append('speaker = \\\"Pip\\\"')\\n    body.append(f'tag = \\\"{tag}\\\"')\\n    body.append(f'text = \\\"{text}\\\"')\\n    body.append(\\\"\\\")\\nbody += tables(\\\"Posey\\\",\\\"card\\\", posey)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Kettle\\\",\\\"card\\\", kettle)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Bounce\\\",\\\"card\\\", bounce)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Gull\\\",\\\"card\\\", gull)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Marjorie\\\",\\\"card\\\", marjorie)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Tom\\\",\\\"card\\\", tom)\\nbody += tables(\\\"Twins\\\",\\\"card\\\", twins)\\n(root / \\\"script.toml\\\").write_text(\\\"\\\\n\\\".join(body) + \\\"\\\\n\\\")\\nprint(\\\"charts\\\", len(notes), \\\"pip\\\", len(pip), \\\"script bytes\\\", (root/\\\"script.toml\\\").stat().st_size)\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Write charts, rules, and the Tippy Cay script\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-7a58cd02-e8fb-4fda-a83c-2f05907a7ebf-72.log\",\"total_bytes\":37}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"caa1563a-5188-4313-8aa0-7792d400d289"}
