{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_171","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The balance_age function returns 24 for the given inputs.\n\nbalance_age(1.0, 4, 30) yields 18 for the younger side and 80 for the older side. The gust test passes because step_clean preserves the gust value across ticks. Settle behavior looks correct with a lean peak near 0.963 that settles above 0.85 after 180 ticks. Next I will write hub.toml, script.rs, and mod.rs.\n\nI am writing mod.rs in one pass. I verified the balance_age test math and noted the PuppetDef path, params imports, fit_ui stack_rects, prompt, and button modules. I will keep the code compiling. Rules deserializes from TOML with all fields present. script.rs needs OnceLock.\n\nGhostSample fields are public and saved. The age test is exact because powf(0) evaluates to 0. I am checking whether the sustained gust after tip could keep the robot tipped past the return loop.\n\nStiffness 40 and damping 8.5 should settle the robot from 0.72 lean within three seconds, with cob below 0.2. I am drafting a small room layout for \"Tippy Cay\" with camera tilt, distance, and sky settings.\n\nThe room layout now defines a 20×11 grid with a grass floor, a red-tiled wall, and a blue water area. The player spawn point is marked.\n\nThe player spawn block is defined with a beige color and a marker. Grass parameters are set to default values. The rounded flag is valid. Room parsing happens at runtime, so any grass field errors will surface during the fit test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-588c126d-9a5f-4491-aa35-edbb3cdb8bc7-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/level.rs","offset":250,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1000,"output_tokens":1