"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Dialogue, names, titles, and looks. Loaded once from `script.toml`.\\n\\nuse std::sync::OnceLock;\\n\\nuse serde::Deserialize;\\n\\nconst SCRIPT: &str = include_str!(\\\"script.toml\\\");\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Deserialize)]\\nstruct RawLine {\\n    speaker: String,\\n    tag: String,\\n    text: String,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Deserialize)]\\nstruct Raw {\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    names: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    titles: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    skins: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    outfits: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    lines: Vec<RawLine>,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\npub struct Script {\\n    pub names: Vec<String>,\\n    pub titles: Vec<String>,\\n    pub skins: Vec<String>,\\n    pub outfits: Vec<String>,\\n    lines: Vec<RawLine>,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Script {\\n    pub fn line(&self, speaker: &str, tag: &str, i: usize) -> Option<&str> {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker && l.tag == tag).nth(i).map(|l| l.text.as_str())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn count(&self, speaker: &str, tag: &str) -> usize {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker && l.tag == tag).count()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn speaker_count(&self, speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker).count()\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script() -> &'static Script {\\n    static CELL: OnceLock<Script> = OnceLock::new();\\n    CELL.get_or_init(|| {\\n        let text = crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/script\\\", SCRIPT);\\n        let raw: Raw = toml::from_str(&text).unwrap_or(Raw {\\n            names: vec![\\\"Avery\\\".into()],\\n            titles: vec![\\\"Acceptable Human\\\".into()],\\n            skins: vec![\\\"Sand\\\".into()],\\n            outfits: vec![\\\"Linen\\\".into()],\\n            lines: vec![RawLine { speaker: \\\"Pip\\\".into(), tag: \\\"intro\\\".into(), text: \\\"Welcome ashore.\\\".into() }],\\n        });\\n        Script { names: raw.names, titles: raw.titles, skins: raw.skins, outfits: raw.outfits, lines: raw.lines }\\n    })\\n}\\n\\npub fn rank_title(score: f32) -> String {\\n    let s = script();\\n    if s.titles.is_empty() {\\n        return \\\"Acceptable Human\\\".into();\\n    }\\n    let t = (score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 0.999);\\n    let i = (t * s.titles.len() as f32) as usize;\\n    s.titles[i.min(s.titles.len() - 1)].clone()\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Dialogue, names, titles, and looks. Loaded once from `script.toml`.\\n\\nuse std::sync::OnceLock;\\n\\nuse serde::Deserialize;\\n\\nconst SCRIPT: &str = include_str!(\\\"script.toml\\\");\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Deserialize)]\\nstruct RawLine {\\n    speaker: String,\\n    tag: String,\\n    text: String,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Deserialize)]\\nstruct Raw {\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    names: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    titles: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    skins: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    outfits: Vec<String>,\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    lines: Vec<RawLine>,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\npub struct Script {\\n    pub names: Vec<String>,\\n    pub titles: Vec<String>,\\n    pub skins: Vec<String>,\\n    pub outfits: Vec<String>,\\n    lines: Vec<RawLine>,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Script {\\n    pub fn line(&self, speaker: &str, tag: &str, i: usize) -> Option<&str> {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker && l.tag == tag).nth(i).map(|l| l.text.as_str())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn count(&self, speaker: &str, tag: &str) -> usize {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker && l.tag == tag).count()\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn speaker_count(&self, speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n        self.lines.iter().filter(|l| l.speaker == speaker).count()\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script() -> &'static Script {\\n    static CELL: OnceLock<Script> = OnceLock::new();\\n    CELL.get_or_init(|| {\\n        let text = crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/script\\\", SCRIPT);\\n        let raw: Raw = toml::from_str(&text).unwrap_or(Raw {\\n            names: vec![\\\"Avery\\\".into()],\\n            titles: vec![\\\"Acceptable Human\\\".into()],\\n            skins: vec![\\\"Sand\\\".into()],\\n            outfits: vec![\\\"Linen\\\".into()],\\n            lines: vec![RawLine { speaker: \\\"Pip\\\".into(), tag: \\\"intro\\\".into(), text: \\\"Welcome ashore.\\\".into() }],\\n        });\\n        Script { names: raw.names, titles: raw.titles, skins: raw.skins, outfits: raw.outfits, lines: raw.lines }\\n    })\\n}\\n\\npub fn rank_title(score: f32) -> String {\\n    let s = script();\\n    if s.titles.is_empty() {\\n        return \\\"Acceptable Human\\\".into();\\n    }\\n    let t = (score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 0.999);\\n    let i = (t * s.titles.len() as f32) as usize;\\n    s.titles[i.min(s.titles.len() - 1)].clone()\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"14c60e91-592f-4e9b-9f3d-6fd30b5ba261"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_177","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm now writing the main mod.rs file carefully.\n\nConfirmed `get_mut` exists on the entities collection. I'll keep mod.rs under 1200 lines and add a public `script_speaker_count` helper for tests. I'm mentally reviewing for compile errors as I write, noting that Flow may need Copy.\n\nRun needs Copy. Slot needs Default. I'll import ParamKind and ParamValue. I'll use crate::fit_ui for layout and crate::input::buttons for controls. I'll add a MEDLEY constant. Screen items will be built per page. Focus will clamp at the start of handling. TAB_R advances the page and resets focus.\n\nA `paged` helper will split items into groups of five and clamp the page index. Dev and settings menus reserve a back slot on every page. Story schedule needs no paging; free play has eleven events.\n\nFree play events will be grouped into pages of four with a back button. The bot does not use free play during the main test, so this is safe. The schedule screen will show all free-play events except Check and BigStand when free play is active, BigStand on day five or later, or the daily events otherwise.\n\nSchedule items will show a \"done\" marker for events already played today. The End the day option appears only when the current day is cleared and free play is inactive. Event IDs start at 100 and increment by index, with activation mapping each ID back to its position in the filtered event list.\n\nSelecting an event from the schedule preserves the current run mode. Story and Together runs remain unchanged. The caller sets the flow to Card after starting the activity. Big Stand auto-starts on day five, so the schedule screen may not be visited.\n\n`start_activity` removes the ghost entity, clones the current rules, and starts the activity. Step and BigStand events receive a rhythm offset from settings. The activity is stored and the balance core is initialized.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ba1ccaf0-2761-47e3-8eab-e1a866400824-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn f32|fn range|fn below","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/rng.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5865,"output_tokens":1501,"cache_read_input_tokens":162176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"424f54ed-0664-4b46-bed8-9bbb53218da8"}
