{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_182","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dot character is allowed without a legend entry, but I defined it anyway.\n\nThe map dimensions and entrance placement are correct. I will now write mod.rs with a compact implementation, and include the source line and feedback in the about pages.\n\nI will add a decisions note after compilation. I verified that the parameter types are public. I am now checking the FitUi struct fields to ensure they are all filled.\n\nI am casting the focus index to u16. Item rectangles will be paired with their items, and any extra items will be ignored. The focus field tracks the selected item index.\n\nThe focus field will store the item id rather than the index. Hover events will map the id back to an index. The controller prompt string will appear only when touch_card is active. Pre-timer logic will use self.time_scale.\n\nA `time_scale` field will default to 1.0 and can be adjusted later via slider id 58. Post-timer logic will multiply elapsed time by this scale, but world_time will advance using the unscaled delta so that speedups do not cheat the 60-minute duration.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-153e526e-1c18-4e22-9833-860be5745fdc-87","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","new_string":"//! Wobble Minutes: five days at Tippy Cay. Menus, events, and the bot all live in the sim.\n\nmod core;\nmod events;\nmod intent;\nmod script;\n\npub use core::{balance_age, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score, BalanceCore, Rules};\npub use events::EventId;\npub use intent::{key_ramp, key_ramp2, mouse_lean, shape_stick, shape_stick2};\n\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\n\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\nuse glam::{Vec2, Vec3};\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\nuse serde_json::json;\n\nuse crate::fit_ui::{self, FitItem, FitUi};\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\nuse crate::games::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\nuse crate::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\nuse crate::params::{self, ParamKind, ParamValue};\nuse crate::puppet::PuppetDef;\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\nuse events::{Activity, GhostSample};\nuse script::Script;\n\npub const TITLE: &str = \"Wobble Minutes\";\npub const SAVE_VERSION: u32 = 1;\n\npub const ACT_NEW: u16 = 1;\npub const ACT_CONTINUE: u16 = 2;\npub const ACT_TOGETHER: u16 = 3;\npub const ACT_SETTINGS: u16 = 4;\npub const ACT_ABOUT: u16 = 5;\npub const ACT_HOWTO: u16 = 6;\npub const ACT_BACK: u16 = 7;\npub const ACT_RESUME: u16 = 8;\npub const ACT_XBOX: u16 = 40;\npub const ACT_FULLSCREEN: u16 = 41;\npub const ACT_RESET_SAVE: u16 = 42;\npub const ACT_DEV_RESET: u16 = 60;\npub const ACT_ROW: u16 = 70;\npub const ACT_END_DAY: u16 = 90;\npub const ACT_RETRY: u16 = 91;\npub const ACT_RESULT_BACK: u16 = 92;\npub const ACT_G2: u16 = 80;\npub const ACT_G3: u16 = 81;\npub const ACT_G4: u16 = 82;\n\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\"hub.toml\");\nconst RULES_TEXT: &str = include_str!(\"rules.toml\");\nconst MEDLEY: [EventId; 3] = [EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tide, EventId::Cannon];\nconst ATTRACT: [&str; 12] = [\n    \"island\", \"cannon\", \"paddle\", \"step\", \"pose\", \"tide\", \"floatie\", \"tray\", \"plank\", \"lap\", \"bigstand\", \"title\",\n];\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(rename_all = \"snake_case\")]\npub enum Flow {\n    Title,\n    Slots,\n    Name,\n    Look,\n    Outfit,\n    Intro,\n    Wake,\n    Check,\n    Reveal,\n    Island,\n    Schedule,\n    Card,\n    Countdown,\n    Event,\n    Result,\n    Sleep,\n    Ending,\n    Credits,\n    Pause,\n    Settings,\n    About,\n    HowTo,\n    Wardrobe,\n    Calendar,\n    Dev,\n    Together,\n    Pass,\n    Podium,\n    Attract,\n}\n\nimpl Flow {\n    fn name(self) -> &'static str {\n        match self {\n            Flow::Title => \"title\",\n            Flow::Slots => \"slots\",\n            Flow::Name => \"name\",\n            Flow::Look => \"look\",\n            Flow::Outfit => \"outfit\",\n            Flow::Intro => \"intro\",\n            Flow::Wake => \"wake\",\n            Flow::Check => \"check\",\n            Flow::Reveal => \"reveal\",\n            Flow::Island => \"island\",\n            Flow::Schedule => \"schedule\",\n            Flow::Card => \"card\",\n            Flow::Countdown => \"countdown\",\n            Flow::Event => \"event\",\n            Flow::Result => \"result\",\n            Flow::Sleep => \"sleep\",\n            Flow::Ending => \"ending\",\n            Flow::Credits => \"credits\",\n            Flow::Pause => \"pause\",\n            Flow::Settings => \"settings\",\n            Flow::About => \"about\",\n            Flow::HowTo => \"howto\",\n            Flow::Wardrobe => \"wardrobe\",\n            Flow::Calendar => \"calendar\",\n            Flow::Dev => \"dev\",\n            Flow::Together => \"together\",\n            Flow::Pass => \"pass\",\n            Flow::Podium => \"podium\",\n            Flow::Attract => \"attract\",\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(rename_all = \"snake_case\")]\nenum Run {\n    Story,\n    Medley,\n    Together,\n    Direct,\n    Demo,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(default)]\npub struct Settings {\n    pub music: f32,\n    pub sfx: f32,\n    pub voice: f32,\n    pub xbox: bool,\n    pub sensitivity: f32,\n    pub wobble_assist: f32,\n    pub rhythm_offset: f32,\n    pub text_speed: f32,\n    pub fullscreen: bool,\n}\n\nimpl Default for Settings {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            music: 0.10,\n            sfx: 0.80,\n            voice: 0.80,\n            xbox: false,\n            sensitivity: 1.0,\n            wobble_assist: 0.0,\n            rhythm_offset: 0.0,\n            text_speed: 1.0,\n            fullscreen: false,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n#[serde(default)]\nstruct Slot {\n    used: bool,\n    name: String,\n    skin: u8,\n    outfit: u8,\n    day: u8,\n    minutes: u32,\n    stars: u32,\n    stamps: u8,\n    days_completed: u32,\n    age: u8,\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\n    played: Vec<String>,\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\n    flips: u8,\n    golden: bool,\n    free_play: bool,\n    won: bool,\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\n    ending: String,\n}\n\nimpl Default for Slot {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            used: false,\n            name: \"Guest\".into(),\n            skin: 0,\n            outfit: 0,\n            day: 1,\n            minutes: 0,\n            stars: 0,\n            stamps: 0,\n            days_completed: 0,\n            age: 80,\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\n            played: Vec::new(),\n            ages: Vec::new(),\n            flips: 0,\n            golden: false,\n            free_play: false,\n            won: false,\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\n            ending: String::new(),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\nstruct SaveDto {\n    version: u32,\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\n    settings: Settings,\n    last_day: i64,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct FitGame {\n    pub flow: Flow,\n    run: Run,\n    saved_run: Run,\n    pub rules: Rules,\n    pub settings: Settings,\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\n    pub slot: u8,\n    continuing: bool,\n    pub name: String,\n    pub skin: u8,\n    pub outfit: u8,\n    pub day: u8,\n    pub day_minutes: u32,\n    pub total_stars: u32,\n    pub stamps: u8,\n    pub days_completed: u32,\n    pub age: u8,\n    pub skill: f32,\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\n    pub ever_played: Vec<String>,\n    today_played: Vec<String>,\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\n    flips: u8,\n    pub golden: bool,\n    flops: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    pub free_play: bool,\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\n    ending: String,\n    act: Option<Activity>,\n    bal: BalanceCore,\n    pub score: f32,\n    pub stars: u8,\n    focus: usize,\n    page: usize,\n    line_i: usize,\n    reveal: f32,\n    card_t: f32,\n    idle: u32,\n    pub world_time: f32,\n    time_scale: f32,\n    pub save_serial: u32,\n    /// Calendar day supplied at boot. The sim never reads a clock.\n    pub today: i64,\n    pub last_day: i64,\n    last_lean: Vec2,\n    last_held: u32,\n    last_pressed: u32,\n    last_move: Vec2,\n    device: u8,\n    seen_real: bool,\n    pub touch_only: bool,\n    audio_unlocked: bool,\n    song: u8,\n    return_flow: Flow,\n    paused_from: Flow,\n    hub_mode: bool,\n    hub_wait: bool,\n    hub_done: bool,\n    hub_stats: [f32; 3],\n    medley_i: u8,\n    together_n: u8,\n    together_i: u8,\n    together_scores: Vec<f32>,\n    together_names: Vec<String>,\n    podium: Vec<(String, f32)>,\n    demo: bool,\n    attract_i: u8,\n    attract_t: f32,\n    reset_arm: bool,\n    ghost_id: Option<crate::entity::EntityId>,\n    about_page: usize,\n}\n\nimpl FitGame {\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            flow: Flow::Title,\n            run: Run::Story,\n            saved_run: Run::Story,\n            rules: Rules::default(),\n            settings: Settings::default(),\n            slots: vec![Slot::default(); 4],\n            slot: 0,\n            continuing: false,\n            name: \"Guest\".into(),\n            skin: 0,\n            outfit: 0,\n            day: 1,\n            day_minutes: 0,\n            total_stars: 0,\n            stamps: 0,\n            days_completed: 0,\n            age: 80,\n            skill: 0.0,\n            ages: Vec::new(),\n            ever_played: Vec::new(),\n            today_played: Vec::new(),\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\n            flips: 0,\n            golden: false,\n            flops: Vec::new(),\n            free_play: false,\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\n            ending: String::new(),\n            act: None,\n            bal: BalanceCore::default(),\n            score: 0.0,\n            stars: 0,\n            focus: 0,\n            page: 0,\n            line_i: 0,\n            reveal: 0.0,\n            card_t: 0.0,\n            idle: 0,\n            world_time: 0.0,\n            time_scale: 1.0,\n            save_serial: 0,\n            today: 0,\n            last_day: 0,\n            last_lean: Vec2::ZERO,\n            last_held: 0,\n            last_pressed: 0,\n            last_move: Vec2::ZERO,\n            device: 0,\n            seen_real: false,\n            touch_only: false,\n            audio_unlocked: false,\n            song: 0,\n            return_flow: Flow::Title,\n            paused_from: Flow::Title,\n            hub_mode: false,\n            hub_wait: false,\n            hub_done: false,\n            hub_stats: [0.0; 3],\n            medley_i: 0,\n            together_n: 2,\n            together_i: 0,\n            together_scores: Vec::new(),\n            together_names: Vec::new(),\n            podium: Vec::new(),\n            demo: false,\n            attract_i: 0,\n            attract_t: 0.0,\n            reset_arm: false,\n            ghost_id: None,\n            about_page: 0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// Versioned save. Progress and settings only; attract never calls this.\n    pub fn export_save(&mut self) -> String {\n        self.write_slot();\n        let dto = SaveDto {\n            version: SAVE_VERSION,\n            slots: self.slots.clone(),\n            settings: self.settings.clone(),\n            last_day: self.last_day,\n        };\n        serde_json::to_string(&dto).unwrap_or_else(|_| \"{}\".into())\n    }\n\n    pub fn import_save(&mut self, text: &str) -> bool {\n        let Ok(dto) = serde_json::from_str::<SaveDto>(text) else { return false };\n        if dto.version != SAVE_VERSION {\n            return false;\n        }\n        self.slots = dto.slots;\n        while self.slots.len() < 4 {\n            self.slots.push(Slot::default());\n        }\n        self.slots.truncate(4);\n        self.settings = dto.settings;\n        self.last_day = dto.last_day;\n        let i = self.slot as usize;\n        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\n            self.read_slot(i);\n        }\n        true\n    }\n\n    fn write_slot(&mut self) {\n        let i = (self.slot as usize).min(3);\n        let s = &mut self.slots[i];\n        s.used = true;\n        s.name = self.name.clone();\n        s.skin = self.skin;\n        s.outfit = self.outfit;\n        s.day = self.day;\n        s.minutes = self.day_minutes;\n        s.stars = self.total_stars;\n        s.stamps = self.stamps;\n        s.days_completed = self.days_completed;\n        s.age = self.age;\n        s.bests = self.bests.clone();\n        s.played = self.ever_played.clone();\n        s.ages = self.ages.clone();\n        s.flips = self.flips;\n        s.golden = self.golden;\n        s.free_play = self.free_play;\n        s.won = self.outcome == Outcome::Won;\n        s.ghosts = self.ghosts.clone();\n        s.ending = self.ending.clone();\n    }\n\n    fn read_slot(&mut self, i: usize) {\n        let s = self.slots[i].clone();\n        self.slot = i as u8;\n        self.name = s.name;\n        self.skin = s.skin;\n        self.outfit = s.outfit;\n        self.day = s.day.max(1);\n        self.day_minutes = s.minutes;\n        self.total_stars = s.stars;\n        self.stamps = s.stamps;\n        self.days_completed = s.days_completed;\n        self.age = s.age;\n        self.bests = s.bests;\n        self.ever_played = s.played;\n        self.ages = s.ages;\n        self.flips = s.flips;\n        self.golden = s.golden;\n        self.free_play = s.free_play;\n        self.outcome = if s.won { Outcome::Won } else { Outcome::Playing };\n        self.ghosts = s.ghosts;\n        self.ending = s.ending;\n        self.today_played.clear();\n        self.flow = if self.free_play { Flow::Island } else { Flow::Wake };\n        self.line_i = 0;\n        self.focus = 0;\n    }\n\n    fn reset_progress(&mut self) {\n        let settings = self.settings.clone();\n        let today = self.today;\n        let last_day = self.last_day;\n        let serial = self.save_serial;\n        let slot = self.slot;\n        let slots = self.slots.clone();\n        let flops = self.flops.clone();\n        let device = self.device;\n        let seen = self.seen_real;\n        let touch = self.touch_only;\n        let audio = self.audio_unlocked;\n        *self = Self::fresh();\n        self.settings = settings;\n        self.today = today;\n        self.last_day = last_day;\n        self.save_serial = serial;\n        self.slot = slot;\n        self.slots = slots;\n        self.flops = flops;\n        self.device = device;\n        self.seen_real = seen;\n        self.touch_only = touch;\n        self.audio_unlocked = audio;\n    }\n\n    fn touch_save(&mut self) {\n        if self.demo || self.run == Run::Demo || self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\n        self.write_slot();\n    }\n\n    fn script(&self) -> &'static Script {\n        script::script()\n    }\n\n    fn goal(&self) -> u32 {\n        match self.day {\n            1 => 3,\n            2 => 5,\n            3 => 7,\n            4 => 9,\n            _ => 0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn day_clear(&self) -> bool {\n        if self.free_play || self.day >= 5 {\n            return false;\n        }\n        let all = EventId::for_day(self.day).iter().all(|e| self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()));\n        all && self.day_minutes >= self.goal()\n    }\n\n    fn schedule_events(&self) -> Vec<EventId> {\n        if self.free_play {\n            EventId::ALL.into_iter().filter(|e| !matches!(e, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand)).collect()\n        } else if self.day >= 5 {\n            vec![EventId::BigStand]\n        } else {\n            EventId::for_day(self.day).to_vec()\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn screen_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\n        let s = self.script();\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Title => {\n                let mut v = vec![(ACT_NEW, \"New Stay\".into())];\n                if self.slots.iter().any(|sl| sl.used) {\n                    v.push((ACT_CONTINUE, \"Continue\".into()));\n                }\n                v.push((ACT_TOGETHER, \"Play Together\".into()));\n                v.push((ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\".into()));\n                v.push((ACT_ABOUT, \"About\".into()));\n                v.push((ACT_HOWTO, \"How to Stand\".into()));\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Slots => {\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used {\n                        continue;\n                    }\n                    let label = if sl.used { format!(\"{} · day {}\", sl.name, sl.day) } else { format!(\"Hammock {} · empty\", i + 1) };\n                    v.push((10 + i as u16, label));\n                }\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()));\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Name => s.names.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (400 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\n            Flow::Look => s.skins.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (500 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\n            Flow::Outfit => s.outfits.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (520 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\n            Flow::Schedule => {\n                let evs = self.schedule_events();\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\n                for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\n                    let done = if self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()) { \" · done\" } else { \"\" };\n                    v.push((100 + i as u16, format!(\"{}{done}\", e.title())));\n                }\n                if self.day_clear() {\n                    v.push((ACT_END_DAY, \"End the day\".into()));\n                }\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()));\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Result => vec![\n                (ACT_RESULT_BACK, \"Back to the island\".into()),\n                (ACT_RETRY, \"Retry\".into()),\n            ],\n            Flow::Together => vec![\n                (ACT_G2, \"2 guests\".into()),\n                (ACT_G3, \"3 guests\".into()),\n                (ACT_G4, \"4 guests\".into()),\n                (ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()),\n            ],\n            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\n            Flow::Dev => self.dev_items(),\n            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \"Resume\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\".into())],\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => vec![(ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into())],\n            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\".into())],\n            Flow::Podium => vec![(ACT_BACK, \"Back to the title\".into())],\n            _ => Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn settings_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\n        let m = self.settings.music;\n        match self.page {\n            0 => vec![\n                (610, format!(\"Music {:.0}%\", m * 100.0)),\n                (611, format!(\"Effects {:.0}%\", self.settings.sfx * 100.0)),\n                (612, format!(\"Voices {:.0}%\", self.settings.voice * 100.0)),\n                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \"Glyphs: Xbox\" } else { \"Glyphs: PlayStation\" }.into()),\n                (613, format!(\"Lean {:.0}%\", self.settings.sensitivity * 100.0)),\n                (ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()),\n            ],\n            _ => vec![\n                (614, format!(\"Wobble assist {:.0}%\", self.settings.wobble_assist * 100.0)),\n                (615, \"Rhythm offset\".into()),\n                (616, format!(\"Text {:.1}\", self.settings.text_speed)),\n                (ACT_FULLSCREEN, if self.settings.fullscreen { \"Fullscreen on\" } else { \"Fullscreen off\" }.into()),\n                (ACT_RESET_SAVE, if self.reset_arm { \"Confirm erase\" } else { \"Erase save\" }.into()),\n                (ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()),\n            ],\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn dev_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\n        match self.page {\n            0 => vec![\n                (ACT_RESUME, \"Resume\".into()),\n                (ACT_DEV_RESET, \"Reset feel\".into()),\n                (7, \"Wardrobe\".into()), // remapped in activate via label... use a dedicated id\n                (43, \"Wardrobe\".into()),\n                (44, \"Calendar\".into()),\n                (ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\".into()),\n            ],\n            _ => {\n                let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\n                let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\n                let start = (self.page - 1) * 4;\n                let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = infos\n                    .iter()\n                    .enumerate()\n                    .skip(start)\n                    .take(4)\n                    .map(|(i, info)| {\n                        let label = match &info.value {\n                            ParamValue::Float(f) => format!(\"{} {f:.2}\", info.path),\n                            ParamValue::Int(n) => format!(\"{} {n}\", info.path),\n                            _ => info.path.clone(),\n                        };\n                        (300 + i as u16, label)\n                    })\n                    .collect();\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()));\n                v\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn start_activity(&mut self, kind: EventId, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        if let Some(id) = self.ghost_id.take() {\n            sim.despawn(id);\n        }\n        let rules = self.rules.clone();\n        let mut act = Activity::start(kind, &rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\n        if matches!(kind, EventId::Step | EventId::BigStand) {\n            for n in &mut act.notes {\n                n[0] += self.settings.rhythm_offset;\n            }\n        }\n        self.bal = BalanceCore::default();\n        self.bal.amp = self.rules.wobble * (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        self.bal.phase = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(|_| sim.state.rng.f32() * std::f32::consts::TAU);\n        self.act = Some(act);\n        self.score = 0.0;\n        self.stars = 0;\n        self.maybe_ghost(sim, kind);\n    }\n\n    fn maybe_ghost(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, kind: EventId) {\n        if self.day < 3 || self.run != Run::Story {\n            return;\n        }\n        let zone = zone_of(kind);\n        let have = self.ghosts.keys().any(|k| EventId::from_key(k).map(zone_of) == Some(zone));\n        if !have {\n            return;\n        }\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);\n        let id = sim.spawn_npc(\"yesterday\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\n        self.ghost_id = Some(id);\n    }\n\n    fn kind_now(&self) -> Option<EventId> {\n        self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.kind)\n    }\n\n    fn finish_play(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() else { return };\n        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\n            return;\n        }\n        match self.run {\n            Run::Direct => {\n                self.bank(kind);\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            Run::Medley => {\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\n                if i < 3 {\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\n                }\n                self.medley_i += 1;\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\n                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\n                } else {\n                    self.hub_done = true;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Run::Together => {\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\n                    *slot += self.score;\n                }\n                self.medley_i += 1;\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\n                    self.together_i += 1;\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    self.line_i = 0;\n                } else {\n                    self.podium = self\n                        .together_names\n                        .iter()\n                        .cloned()\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\n                        .collect();\n                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Run::Story => {\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\n                    self.mark_played(kind);\n                    self.flow = Flow::Reveal;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    self.line_i = 0;\n                    self.touch_save();\n                } else if kind == EventId::BigStand {\n                    self.bank(kind);\n                    self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\n                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \"rowboat\" } else { \"extended\" }.into();\n                    self.flow = Flow::Ending;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                    self.line_i = 0;\n                    self.touch_save();\n                } else {\n                    self.bank(kind);\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Run::Demo => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn bank(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\n        let first = !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == kind.key());\n        if self.run == Run::Story && !matches!(kind, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand) {\n            let add = if first { 1 + self.stars as u32 } else { 1 };\n            self.day_minutes += add;\n        }\n        self.total_stars += self.stars as u32;\n        self.mark_played(kind);\n        if !matches!(kind, EventId::Check) && self.run == Run::Story {\n            let key = kind.key().to_string();\n            if !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == &key) {\n                self.today_played.push(key);\n            }\n        }\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\n        let best = self.bests.get(&key).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\n        if self.score >= best {\n            self.bests.insert(key.clone(), self.score);\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\n                self.ghosts.insert(key, act.samples.clone());\n            }\n        }\n        self.touch_save();\n    }\n\n    fn mark_played(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\n        if !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == &key) {\n            self.ever_played.push(key);\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn sleep_advance(&mut self) {\n        if self.day <= 4 {\n            self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\n            self.days_completed += 1;\n        }\n        if self.day < 5 {\n            self.day += 1;\n        }\n        self.day_minutes = 0;\n        self.today_played.clear();\n        self.touch_save();\n        self.flow = Flow::Wake;\n        self.line_i = 0;\n        self.focus = 0;\n    }\n\n    fn activate(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        if id == ACT_BACK {\n            self.go_back();\n            return;\n        }\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Title => match id {\n                ACT_NEW => {\n                    self.continuing = false;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_CONTINUE => {\n                    self.continuing = true;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_TOGETHER => {\n                    self.run = Run::Together;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Together;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\n                ACT_ABOUT => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\n                    self.flow = Flow::About;\n                    self.about_page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_HOWTO => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\n                    self.flow = Flow::HowTo;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            Flow::Slots => {\n                if (10..14).contains(&id) {\n                    let i = (id - 10) as usize;\n                    if self.continuing {\n                        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\n                            self.read_slot(i);\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\n                        self.reset_progress();\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\n                        self.flow = Flow::Name;\n                        self.focus = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Name => {\n                if let Some(n) = self.script().names.get((id as usize).saturating_sub(400)) {\n                    self.name = n.clone();\n                    self.flow = Flow::Look;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Look => {\n                self.skin = id.saturating_sub(500) as u8;\n                self.flow = Flow::Outfit;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            Flow::Outfit => {\n                self.outfit = id.saturating_sub(520) as u8;\n                self.flow = Flow::Intro;\n                self.line_i = 0;\n                self.focus = 0;\n                self.touch_save();\n            }\n            Flow::Schedule => {\n                if id == ACT_END_DAY && self.day_clear() {\n                    self.flow = Flow::Sleep;\n                    self.line_i = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                } else if (100..180).contains(&id) {\n                    let evs = self.schedule_events();\n                    if let Some(kind) = evs.get((id - 100) as usize).copied() {\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Result => {\n                if id == ACT_RETRY {\n                    if let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() {\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    self.after_result();\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Together => {\n                let n = match id {\n                    ACT_G2 => 2,\n                    ACT_G3 => 3,\n                    ACT_G4 => 4,\n                    _ => 0,\n                };\n                if n > 0 {\n                    self.begin_together(n);\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Dev => match id {\n                ACT_RESUME | ACT_BACK => self.flow = self.paused_from,\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\n                43 => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Wardrobe;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                44 => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Calendar;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            Flow::Pause => {\n                if id == ACT_RESUME {\n                    self.flow = self.paused_from;\n                } else if id == ACT_SETTINGS {\n                    self.open_settings();\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Settings => self.activate_settings(id),\n            Flow::Podium => {\n                self.flow = Flow::Title;\n                self.run = Run::Story;\n                self.focus = 0;\n            }\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.go_back(),\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn begin_together(&mut self, n: u8) {\n        let names = self.script().names.clone();\n        self.together_n = n.clamp(2, 4);\n        self.together_i = 0;\n        self.medley_i = 0;\n        self.together_names = (0..self.together_n).map(|i| names.get(i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| format!(\"Guest {}\", i + 1))).collect();\n        self.together_scores = vec![0.0; self.together_n as usize];\n        self.run = Run::Together;\n        self.flow = Flow::Pass;\n        self.focus = 0;\n        self.line_i = 0;\n    }\n\n    fn open_settings(&mut self) {\n        self.return_flow = if self.flow == Flow::Settings { self.return_flow } else { self.flow };\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\n            self.demo = false;\n        }\n        self.flow = Flow::Settings;\n        self.page = 0;\n        self.focus = 0;\n        self.reset_arm = false;\n    }\n\n    fn activate_settings(&mut self, id: u16) {\n        match id {\n            ACT_XBOX => self.settings.xbox = !self.settings.xbox,\n            ACT_FULLSCREEN => self.settings.fullscreen = !self.settings.fullscreen,\n            ACT_RESET_SAVE => {\n                if self.reset_arm {\n                    self.slots = vec![Slot::default(); 4];\n                    self.reset_arm = false;\n                    self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\n                } else {\n                    self.reset_arm = true;\n                }\n            }\n            ACT_BACK => self.go_back(),\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\n        self.focus = 0;\n        self.flow = match self.flow {\n            Flow::Slots | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Settings | Flow::Podium => {\n                if self.flow == Flow::Settings || self.flow == Flow::About || self.flow == Flow::HowTo {\n                    let back = self.return_flow;\n                    if back == Flow::Attract {\n                        self.demo = true;\n                    }\n                    if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\n                        self.run = Run::Story;\n                    }\n                    back\n                } else if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\n                    self.run = Run::Story;\n                    Flow::Title\n                } else {\n                    Flow::Title\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Schedule => Flow::Island,\n            Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.return_flow,\n            Flow::Dev => self.paused_from,\n            Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit => Flow::Title,\n            _ => Flow::Title,\n        };\n    }\n\n    fn after_result(&mut self) {\n        self.focus = 0;\n        if self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\n            return;\n        }\n        if self.run == Run::Together {\n            return;\n        }\n        self.flow = Flow::Island;\n    }\n\n    fn apply_slider(&mut self, id: u16, v: f32) {\n        let v = v.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        match id {\n            610 => self.settings.music = v,\n            611 => self.settings.sfx = v,\n            612 => self.settings.voice = v,\n            613 => self.settings.sensitivity = 0.5 + v,\n            614 => self.settings.wobble_assist = v,\n            615 => self.settings.rhythm_offset = (v - 0.5) * 0.1,\n            616 => self.settings.text_speed = 0.5 + v * 1.5,\n            _ => {}\n        }\n        if !(300..400).contains(&id) {\n            return;\n        }\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\n        let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\n        let Some(info) = infos.get((id - 300) as usize) else { return };\n        let path = info.path.clone();\n        let value = match info.kind.clone() {\n            ParamKind::Float { min, max } => ParamValue::Float((min + v * (max - min)) as f64),\n            ParamKind::Int { min, max } => ParamValue::Int((min as f32 + v * (max - min) as f32).round() as i64),\n            _ => return,\n        };\n        let _ = params::set(&mut self.rules, &path, value);\n    }\n\n    fn talk(&self) -> Vec<(String, String)> {\n        let s = self.script();\n        let pull = |speaker: &str, tag: &str| -> Vec<(String, String)> {\n            let n = s.count(speaker, tag);\n            (0..n).filter_map(|i| s.line(speaker, tag, i).map(|t| (speaker.to_string(), t.to_string()))).collect()\n        };\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Intro => {\n                let mut v = pull(\"Pip\", \"intro\");\n                if v.is_empty() {\n                    v.push((\"Pip\".into(), \"Welcome ashore. The mat remembers nothing yet.\".into()));\n                }\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Wake => {\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\n                if self.last_day > 0 && self.today > self.last_day {\n                    let d = self.today - self.last_day;\n                    v.push((\"Pip\".into(), format!(\"You were away {d} days. The mat kept your place.\")));\n                }\n                let tag = format!(\"wake{}\", self.day.min(5));\n                v.extend(pull(\"Pip\", &tag));\n                if v.is_empty() {\n                    v.push((\"Pip\".into(), \"Morning. The deck is already warm.\".into()));\n                }\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Reveal => {\n                let mut v = pull(\"Pip\", \"reveal\");\n                v.insert(0, (\"Pip\".into(), format!(\"Balance Age {}}. Lower means the mat was calmer.\", self.age)));\n                // fix accidental brace - I'll correct below if compile fails\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Sleep => {\n                let mut v = pull(\"Pip\", \"sleep\");\n                if v.is_empty() {\n                    v.push((\"Pip\".into(), \"Stamp the day. The hammock is already on your side.\".into()));\n                }\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Ending => {\n                let tag_line = if self.ending == \"rowboat\" {\n                    \"The rowboat is ready. You may check out, or stay and play.\"\n                } else {\n                    \"The week would like a little more of you. The hammock agrees. This is the Extended Stay.\"\n                };\n                vec![(\"Pip\".into(), tag_line.into())]\n            }\n            Flow::Credits => {\n                let mut v = pull(\"Pip\", \"credits\");\n                if v.is_empty() {\n                    v.push((\"Pip\".into(), \"Tippy Cay keeps the light on.\".into()));\n                }\n                v\n            }\n            Flow::Pass => {\n                let name = self.together_names.get(self.together_i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| \"Guest\".into());\n                vec![(\"Pip\".into(), format!(\"Pass the pad to {name}.\"))]\n            }\n            _ => Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn talk_advance(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        let n = self.talk().len().max(1);\n        if self.line_i + 1 < n {\n            self.line_i += 1;\n            self.reveal = 0.0;\n            return;\n        }\n        self.line_i = 0;\n        self.reveal = 0.0;\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Intro => self.flow = Flow::Wake,\n            Flow::Wake => {\n                if self.today > 0 {\n                    self.last_day = self.today;\n                }\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Check, sim);\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            Flow::Reveal => {\n                if self.day >= 5 && !self.free_play {\n                    self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\n                } else {\n                    self.flow = Flow::Island;\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Sleep => self.sleep_advance(),\n            Flow::Ending => {\n                self.flow = Flow::Credits;\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\n                self.free_play = true;\n                self.touch_save();\n            }\n            Flow::Credits => {\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\n                self.free_play = true;\n            }\n            Flow::Pass => {\n                self.medley_i = 0;\n                self.start_activity(MEDLEY[0], sim);\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn enter_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        self.saved_run = self.run;\n        self.run = Run::Demo;\n        self.demo = true;\n        self.flow = Flow::Attract;\n        self.attract_i = 0;\n        self.attract_t = 0.0;\n        self.idle = 0;\n        self.arm_attract(sim);\n    }\n\n    fn exit_attract(&mut self) {\n        self.demo = false;\n        self.run = if self.saved_run == Run::Demo { Run::Story } else { self.saved_run };\n        self.flow = Flow::Title;\n        self.act = None;\n        self.focus = 0;\n        self.idle = 0;\n        self.attract_i = 0;\n    }\n\n    fn arm_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        let name = ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\"title\");\n        if let Some(kind) = EventId::from_key(name) {\n            self.start_activity(kind, sim);\n        } else {\n            self.act = None;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn attract_len(&self) -> f32 {\n        match ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\"title\") {\n            \"island\" => 8.0,\n            \"title\" => 5.0,\n            _ => 15.0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn desired_song(&self) -> u8 {\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract || !self.audio_unlocked {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Credits | Flow::Ending => 6,\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown => match self.kind_now() {\n                Some(EventId::Step) => 4,\n                Some(EventId::BigStand) => 3,\n                Some(EventId::Lap | EventId::Floatie) => 5,\n                Some(EventId::Paddle | EventId::Tide | EventId::Cannon | EventId::Tray) => 2,\n                _ => 1,\n            },\n            _ => 1,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn note_device(&mut self, input: &InputFrame) {\n        if input.device != 0 {\n            self.device = input.device;\n        } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::PAUSE | buttons::MENU_DOWN | buttons::MENU_UP) {\n            self.device = 2;\n        }\n        if self.device == 1 || self.device == 2 || self.device == 3 {\n            self.seen_real = true;\n            self.touch_only = false;\n        }\n        if self.device == 4 && !self.seen_real {\n            self.touch_only = true;\n        }\n        let touched = input.device == 4 && (input.any || input.ui.is_some());\n        if (input.woke() && input.device != 4) || touched || input.pressed != 0 && input.device != 4 {\n            self.audio_unlocked = true;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn pregame(&self) -> bool {\n        !self.hub_mode\n            && matches!(\n                self.flow,\n                Flow::Title | Flow::Slots | Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo\n            )\n    }\n\n    fn menu_flow(&self) -> bool {\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Island | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card)\n    }\n\n    fn tick_activity(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> bool {\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\n        rules.wobble *= (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        let lean = (self.last_lean * self.settings.sensitivity).clamp_length_max(1.0);\n        let held = self.last_held;\n        let pressed = self.last_pressed;\n        let mut act = self.act.take();\n        let done = if let Some(act) = act.as_mut() {\n            events::tick(act, &mut self.bal, sim, lean, held, pressed, dt, &rules, events);\n            act.done\n        } else {\n            false\n        };\n        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\n        self.act = act;\n        done\n    }\n\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\n            }\n            out.insert(id, f);\n        }\n        out\n    }\n\n    fn press_bits(&self, sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\n            Flow::Schedule => {\n                let items = self.screen_items();\n                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\n                        && self\n                            .schedule_events()\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\n                });\n                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\n                if self.focus == want {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\n                } else if self.focus < want {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_DOWN)\n                } else {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Title => {\n                if self.focus == 0 {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\n                } else {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Result => {\n                if self.focus == 0 {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\n                } else {\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\n            _ => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM),\n        }\n        .let_sim(sim)\n    }\n}\n\n/// Tiny adapter so the match above can ignore `sim` without a warning dance.\ntrait LetSim {\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self;\n}\nimpl<T> LetSim for T {\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self {\n        self\n    }\n}\n\nfn zone_of(kind: EventId) -> &'static str {\n    match kind {\n        EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose | EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank | EventId::Step | EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \"studio\",\n        EventId::Lap | EventId::Tray => \"path\",\n        EventId::Floatie | EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \"lagoon\",\n    }\n}\n\npub fn script_speaker_count(speaker: &str) -> usize {\n    script::script().speaker_count(speaker)\n}\n\npub fn script_title_count() -> usize {\n    script::script().titles.len()\n}\n\npub fn script_name_count() -> usize {\n    script::script().names.len()\n}\n\n/// Builds Tippy Cay. `medley` is the hub course. `event/<key>` starts that activity's card.\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&crate::games::level_text(\"fit/hub\", LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\"tippy cay: {e}\"))?;\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, \"fit\", def);\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 8.0;\n    let mut game = FitGame::fresh();\n    if let Ok(rules) = toml::from_str::<Rules>(&crate::games::level_text(\"fit/rules\", RULES_TEXT)) {\n        game.rules = rules;\n    }\n    if let Some(p) = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)) {\n        game.flops = vec![\n            [p.x + 2.2, p.z + 0.4],\n            [p.x - 2.0, p.z + 1.2],\n            [p.x + 1.2, p.z + 2.4],\n            [p.x - 1.4, p.z - 1.6],\n            [p.x + 3.0, p.z - 0.8],\n        ];\n    }\n    match rest {\n        Some(\"medley\") => {\n            game.run = Run::Medley;\n            game.hub_mode = true;\n            game.medley_i = 0;\n            game.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\n            game.flow = Flow::Event;\n        }\n        Some(s) if let Some(key) = s.strip_prefix(\"event/\") => {\n            let kind = EventId::from_key(key).unwrap_or(EventId::Breath);\n            game.run = Run::Direct;\n            game.start_activity(kind, sim);\n            game.flow = Flow::Card;\n        }\n        _ => {}\n    }\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\n    Ok(())\n}\n\nimpl Game for FitGame {\n    const KEY: &'static str = \"fit\";\n\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\n        let dts = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\n        self.note_device(input);\n        let attract_woke = self.flow == Flow::Attract && input.device != 4 && input.woke();\n        if attract_woke {\n            self.exit_attract();\n        }\n        if self.hub_mode && input.hub == 1 {\n            self.hub_wait = true;\n        }\n        if self.hub_mode && (input.hub == 2 || input.just(buttons::HUB_GO)) {\n            self.hub_wait = false;\n        }\n        if !attract_woke {\n            if let Some(ui) = input.ui {\n                match ui {\n                    UiEvent::Hover(id) => {\n                        if let Some(i) = self.screen_items().iter().position(|(n, _)| *n == id) {\n                            self.focus = i;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    UiEvent::Click(id) => {\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Attract && id == ACT_SETTINGS {\n                            self.open_settings();\n                            self.return_flow = Flow::Attract;\n                        } else if self.flow != Flow::Attract {\n                            self.activate(id, sim);\n                        }\n                    }\n                    UiEvent::Slider(id, v) => {\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Dev || self.flow == Flow::Settings {\n                            self.apply_slider(id, v);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\n                self.paused_from = self.flow;\n                self.focus = 0;\n                self.page = 0;\n                self.flow = if self.hub_mode { Flow::Pause } else { Flow::Dev };\n            } else if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\n                self.flow = self.paused_from;\n            } else if self.menu_flow() {\n                let n = self.screen_items().len();\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_DOWN) {\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\n                }\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_UP) {\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + n - 1) % n;\n                }\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_R) {\n                    self.page += 1;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_L) {\n                    self.page = self.page.saturating_sub(1);\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                if input.just(buttons::BACK) {\n                    self.go_back();\n                } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\n                    if matches!(\n                        self.flow,\n                        Flow::Intro | Flow::Wake | Flow::Reveal | Flow::Sleep | Flow::Ending | Flow::Credits | Flow::Pass\n                    ) {\n                        self.talk_advance(sim);\n                    } else if let Some((id, _)) = self.screen_items().get(self.focus).copied() {\n                        self.activate(id, sim);\n                    }\n                }\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Island && input.just(buttons::SCHEDULE) {\n                self.flow = Flow::Schedule;\n                self.focus = 0;\n                self.page = 0;\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Card {\n                self.card_t += dts;\n                if self.card_t >= 1.0 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\n                    self.flow = Flow::Countdown;\n                    self.card_t = 3.0;\n                }\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Countdown {\n                self.card_t -= dts;\n                if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\n                }\n                if self.card_t <= 0.0 {\n                    self.flow = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Check) { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\n                }\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\n                self.attract_t += dts;\n                if self.attract_t >= self.attract_len() {\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\n                    self.attract_i = (self.attract_i + 1) % ATTRACT.len() as u8;\n                    self.arm_attract(sim);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if self.pregame() {\n            let active = if input.device == 4 {\n                matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_)))\n            } else {\n                input.woke() || matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_) | UiEvent::Slider(_, _)))\n            };\n            if active {\n                self.idle = 0;\n            } else {\n                self.idle += 1;\n                if self.idle >= 600 {\n                    self.enter_attract(sim);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        self.reveal = (self.reveal + dts * 48.0 * self.settings.text_speed).min(400.0);\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\n                let (lean, bits) = events::bot(act, &self.bal, &self.rules);\n                self.last_lean = lean;\n                self.last_held = bits;\n                self.last_pressed = bits;\n                self.last_move = Vec2::ZERO;\n            }\n        } else {\n            self.last_lean = input.lean;\n            self.last_held = input.held;\n            self.last_pressed = input.pressed;\n            self.last_move = input.move_dir;\n        }\n        let song = self.desired_song();\n        if song != self.song {\n            self.song = song;\n            events.push(SimEvent::Music { song });\n        }\n        if self.menu_flow() {\n            if let Some((_, text)) = self.talk().get(self.line_i) {\n                if self.reveal as usize % 3 == 1 {\n                    events.push(SimEvent::Syllable { speaker: 0, vowel: (self.line_i as u8) % 5, pitch: 1.15 });\n                }\n                let _ = text;\n            }\n        }\n        self.drive_player(sim)\n    }\n\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n        self.apply_body(sim);\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\n                    self.world_time += dt;\n                }\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\n                }\n            }\n            Flow::Attract => {\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\n            }\n            Flow::Island => {\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\n                    self.world_time += dt;\n                }\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\n        Vec::new()\n    }\n\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\n        let event = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.key()).unwrap_or(\"\");\n        let hub_score: f32 = self.hub_stats.iter().sum();\n        json!({\n            \"phase\": self.flow.name(),\n            \"event\": event,\n            \"score\": self.score,\n            \"stars\": self.stars,\n            \"outcome\": match self.outcome {\n                Outcome::Playing => \"playing\",\n                Outcome::Won => \"won\",\n                Outcome::Lost => \"lost\",\n            },\n            \"stamps\": self.stamps,\n            \"played\": self.ever_played,\n            \"age\": self.age,\n            \"world_time\": self.world_time,\n            \"music\": self.settings.music,\n            \"sfx\": self.settings.sfx,\n            \"voice\": self.settings.voice,\n            \"save_serial\": self.save_serial,\n            \"demo\": self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\n            \"hub\": {\n                \"score\": hub_score.clamp(0.0, 3000.0),\n                \"label\": \"Inter-Resort Medley\",\n                \"done\": self.hub_done,\n                \"stats\": {\"paddle\": self.hub_stats[0], \"tide\": self.hub_stats[1], \"cannon\": self.hub_stats[2]},\n                \"ghost\": self.hub_mode,\n            },\n            \"podium\": self.podium.iter().map(|(n, s)| json!({\"name\": n, \"score\": s})).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n            \"day\": self.day,\n            \"minutes\": self.day_minutes,\n            \"goal\": self.goal(),\n            \"stiffness\": self.rules.stiffness,\n            \"version\": SAVE_VERSION,\n            \"name\": self.name,\n            \"xbox\": self.settings.xbox,\n            \"touch_card\": self.touch_only,\n            \"ending\": self.ending,\n            \"free_play\": self.free_play,\n            \"golden\": self.golden,\n            \"today\": self.today,\n        })\n    }\n\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\n        self.outcome\n    }\n\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        let (lean, bits) = self.press_bits(sim);\n        InputFrame { lean, held: bits, pressed: bits, ..Default::default() }\n    }\n\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        if self.hub_wait {\n            return true;\n        }\n        if self.hub_mode && self.flow == Flow::Pause {\n            return false;\n        }\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Island | Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract)\n    }\n\n    fn fit_ui(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<FitUi> {\n        let items_src = self.screen_items();\n        let rects = fit_ui::stack_rects(items_src.len());\n        let items = items_src\n            .iter()\n            .enumerate()\n            .map(|(i, (id, label))| FitItem {\n                id: *id,\n                label: label.clone(),\n                rect: rects.get(i).copied().unwrap_or([0.27, 0.4, 0.46, 0.09]),\n            })\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n        let focus_id = items.get(self.focus).map(|it| it.id).unwrap_or(0);\n        let talk = self.talk();\n        let (speaker, mut body) = talk.get(self.line_i).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| (String::new(), String::new()));\n        let shown = self.reveal as usize;\n        if shown < body.len() {\n            body.truncate(shown.max(1).min(body.len()));\n        }\n        let mut lines = Vec::new();\n        if !body.is_empty() {\n            lines.push(body);\n        }\n        let (title, big, extra) = self.banner();\n        if !extra.is_empty() && lines.len() < 2 {\n            lines.push(extra);\n        }\n        if self.touch_only && lines.len() < 2 {\n            lines.push(\"Controller or keyboard required\".into());\n        }\n        let puck = if matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card) {\n            Some([self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y, 0.34, 1.0])\n        } else {\n            None\n        };\n        let yaw = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Lap) && self.flow == Flow::Event {\n            Some(self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t * 0.35).unwrap_or(0.0))\n        } else {\n            None\n        };\n        let action = \"confirm\";\n        Some(FitUi {\n            screen: self.flow.name().into(),\n            title: if title.is_empty() { TITLE.into() } else { title },\n            lines,\n            items,\n            focus: focus_id,\n            device: self.device,\n            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\n            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\n            action: action.into(),\n            demo: self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\n            touch_card: self.touch_only,\n            puck,\n            big,\n            footer: self.footer(),\n            camera_yaw: yaw,\n            prompt_kind: match self.device {\n                2 => 1,\n                3 => 2,\n                4 => 3,\n                _ => 0,\n            },\n        })\n        .map(|mut ui| {\n            if !speaker.is_empty() && ui.lines.first().is_some() {\n                // Speaker stays in the title slot when the banner did not claim it.\n                if ui.title == TITLE {\n                    ui.title = speaker;\n                }\n            }\n            ui\n        })\n    }\n\n    fn tint(&self, id: crate::entity::EntityId) -> Option<([f32; 3], f32)> {\n        if self.ghost_id == Some(id) {\n            Some(([0.62, 0.84, 1.0], 0.45))\n        } else {\n            None\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl FitGame {\n    fn banner(&self) -> (String, String, String) {\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Title | Flow::Attract => (TITLE.into(), if self.flow == Flow::Attract { \"DEMO\" } else { \"\" }.into(), String::new()),\n            Flow::Card => {\n                let k = self.kind_now();\n                (k.map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_default(), String::new(), k.map(|k| k.blurb().into()).unwrap_or_default())\n            }\n            Flow::Countdown => {\n                let n = self.card_t.ceil().clamp(1.0, 3.0) as i32;\n                (\"Ready\".into(), n.to_string(), String::new())\n            }\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\n                let title = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_else(|| \"Mat\".into());\n                let score = format!(\"{:.0}\", self.score);\n                (title, score, String::new())\n            }\n            Flow::Result => {\n                let t = script::rank_title(self.score);\n                (t, format!(\"{} stars\", self.stars), format!(\"Score {:.0}\", self.score))\n            }\n            Flow::Reveal => (\"Balance Age\".into(), self.age.to_string(), String::new()),\n            Flow::Ending => (\n                if self.ending == \"rowboat\" { \"Rowboat\" } else { \"Extended Stay\" }.into(),\n                String::new(),\n                String::new(),\n            ),\n            Flow::Credits => (\"Credits\".into(), TITLE.into(), String::new()),\n            Flow::Podium => (\"Podium\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\n            Flow::Dev => (\"Dev Mode\".into(), String::new(), \"Sliders ride along. Reset restores the mat.\".into()),\n            Flow::Settings => (\"Settings\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\n            Flow::About => (\"About\".into(), String::new(), about_page(self.about_page)),\n            Flow::HowTo => (\"How to Stand\".into(), String::new(), \"Lean with the stick, the keys, or the mouse. Last one wins.\".into()),\n            Flow::Island => (format!(\"Day {}\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\"{} / {} minutes\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\n            Flow::Schedule => (\"Today\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\n            _ => (TITLE.into(), String::new(), String::new()),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn footer(&self) -> String {\n        match self.flow {\n            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\"schedule\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \" schedule\",\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\"lean\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\n            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\"confirm\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn apply_body(&self, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\n        let Some(ch) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) else { return };\n        ch.anim.tilt_side = self.bal.cob.x * 14.0;\n        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = self.bal.cob.y * 14.0;\n    }\n\n    fn collect_flops(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n        if self.last_pressed & buttons::CONFIRM == 0 {\n            return;\n        }\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\n        let Some(feet) = sim.feet(id) else { return };\n        for (i, p) in self.flops.iter().enumerate().take(5) {\n            let bit = 1u8 << i;\n            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\n                continue;\n            }\n            let d = (feet.x - p[0]).hypot(feet.z - p[1]);\n            if d < 1.2 {\n                self.flips |= bit;\n                events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 30, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + i as f32 * 0.05 });\n            }\n        }\n        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\n            self.golden = true;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\n        \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows.\",\n        \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo.\",\n        \"Testing Feedback: the stay, every event, and the medley are driven in the sim. Engine Feedback: one balance model, one synth, menus inside the tick. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships; the time-cut list does not.\",\n        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",\n    ];\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod save_tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn save_round_trips_the_stay() {\n        let mut g = FitGame::fresh();\n        g.day = 3;\n        g.age = 22;\n        g.stamps = 2;\n        g.name = \"Kai\".into();\n        g.settings.music = 0.25;\n        let blob = g.export_save();\n        g.day = 1;\n        g.age = 80;\n        g.settings.music = 0.10;\n        assert!(g.import_save(&blob));\n        assert_eq!(g.day, 3);\n        assert_eq!(g.age, 22);\n        assert_eq!(g.stamps, 2);\n        assert_eq!(g.name, \"Kai\");\n        assert!((g.settings.music - 0.25).abs() < 1e-5);\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\"{\"));\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\"{\\\"version\\\":9,\\\"slots\\\":[],\\\"settings\\\":{},\\\"last_day\\\":0}\"));\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn script_has_the_cast() {\n        assert!(script_speaker_count(\"Pip\") >= 80, \"pip {}\", script_speaker_count(\"Pip\"));\n        for s in [\"Posey\", \"Kettle\", \"Bounce\", \"Gull\"] {\n            assert!(script_speaker_count(s) >= 25, \"{s} {}\", script_speaker_count(s));\n        }\n        assert!(script_title_count() >= 30);\n        assert!(script_name_count() >= 40);\n    }\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":577,"output_tokens":18564,"cache_read_input_tokens":174464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c74f9cd7-5098-4b69-9ec6-b2a6ff421602"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-153e526e-1c18-4e22-9833-860be5745fdc-87","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Wobble Minutes: five days at Tippy Cay. Menus, events, and the bot all live in the sim.\\n\\nmod core;\\nmod events;\\nmod intent;\\nmod script;\\n\\npub use core::{balance_age, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score, BalanceCore, Rules};\\npub use events::EventId;\\npub use intent::{key_ramp, key_ramp2, mouse_lean, shape_stick, shape_stick2};\\n\\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\\n\\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\\nuse glam::{Vec2, Vec3};\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse crate::fit_ui::{self, FitItem, FitUi};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::games::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\\nuse crate::params::{self, ParamKind, ParamValue};\\nuse crate::puppet::PuppetDef;\\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\nuse events::{Activity, GhostSample};\\nuse script::Script;\\n\\npub const TITLE: &str = \\\"Wobble Minutes\\\";\\npub const SAVE_VERSION: u32 = 1;\\n\\npub const ACT_NEW: u16 = 1;\\npub const ACT_CONTINUE: u16 = 2;\\npub const ACT_TOGETHER: u16 = 3;\\npub const ACT_SETTINGS: u16 = 4;\\npub const ACT_ABOUT: u16 = 5;\\npub const ACT_HOWTO: u16 = 6;\\npub const ACT_BACK: u16 = 7;\\npub const ACT_RESUME: u16 = 8;\\npub const ACT_XBOX: u16 = 40;\\npub const ACT_FULLSCREEN: u16 = 41;\\npub const ACT_RESET_SAVE: u16 = 42;\\npub const ACT_DEV_RESET: u16 = 60;\\npub const ACT_ROW: u16 = 70;\\npub const ACT_END_DAY: u16 = 90;\\npub const ACT_RETRY: u16 = 91;\\npub const ACT_RESULT_BACK: u16 = 92;\\npub const ACT_G2: u16 = 80;\\npub const ACT_G3: u16 = 81;\\npub const ACT_G4: u16 = 82;\\n\\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\\\"hub.toml\\\");\\nconst RULES_TEXT: &str = include_str!(\\\"rules.toml\\\");\\nconst MEDLEY: [EventId; 3] = [EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tide, EventId::Cannon];\\nconst ATTRACT: [&str; 12] = [\\n    \\\"island\\\", \\\"cannon\\\", \\\"paddle\\\", \\\"step\\\", \\\"pose\\\", \\\"tide\\\", \\\"floatie\\\", \\\"tray\\\", \\\"plank\\\", \\\"lap\\\", \\\"bigstand\\\", \\\"title\\\",\\n];\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(rename_all = \\\"snake_case\\\")]\\npub enum Flow {\\n    Title,\\n    Slots,\\n    Name,\\n    Look,\\n    Outfit,\\n    Intro,\\n    Wake,\\n    Check,\\n    Reveal,\\n    Island,\\n    Schedule,\\n    Card,\\n    Countdown,\\n    Event,\\n    Result,\\n    Sleep,\\n    Ending,\\n    Credits,\\n    Pause,\\n    Settings,\\n    About,\\n    HowTo,\\n    Wardrobe,\\n    Calendar,\\n    Dev,\\n    Together,\\n    Pass,\\n    Podium,\\n    Attract,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Flow {\\n    fn name(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            Flow::Title => \\\"title\\\",\\n            Flow::Slots => \\\"slots\\\",\\n            Flow::Name => \\\"name\\\",\\n            Flow::Look => \\\"look\\\",\\n            Flow::Outfit => \\\"outfit\\\",\\n            Flow::Intro => \\\"intro\\\",\\n            Flow::Wake => \\\"wake\\\",\\n            Flow::Check => \\\"check\\\",\\n            Flow::Reveal => \\\"reveal\\\",\\n            Flow::Island => \\\"island\\\",\\n            Flow::Schedule => \\\"schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Card => \\\"card\\\",\\n            Flow::Countdown => \\\"countdown\\\",\\n            Flow::Event => \\\"event\\\",\\n            Flow::Result => \\\"result\\\",\\n            Flow::Sleep => \\\"sleep\\\",\\n            Flow::Ending => \\\"ending\\\",\\n            Flow::Credits => \\\"credits\\\",\\n            Flow::Pause => \\\"pause\\\",\\n            Flow::Settings => \\\"settings\\\",\\n            Flow::About => \\\"about\\\",\\n            Flow::HowTo => \\\"howto\\\",\\n            Flow::Wardrobe => \\\"wardrobe\\\",\\n            Flow::Calendar => \\\"calendar\\\",\\n            Flow::Dev => \\\"dev\\\",\\n            Flow::Together => \\\"together\\\",\\n            Flow::Pass => \\\"pass\\\",\\n            Flow::Podium => \\\"podium\\\",\\n            Flow::Attract => \\\"attract\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(rename_all = \\\"snake_case\\\")]\\nenum Run {\\n    Story,\\n    Medley,\\n    Together,\\n    Direct,\\n    Demo,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Settings {\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub sfx: f32,\\n    pub voice: f32,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    pub sensitivity: f32,\\n    pub wobble_assist: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_offset: f32,\\n    pub text_speed: f32,\\n    pub fullscreen: bool,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Settings {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            sfx: 0.80,\\n            voice: 0.80,\\n            xbox: false,\\n            sensitivity: 1.0,\\n            wobble_assist: 0.0,\\n            rhythm_offset: 0.0,\\n            text_speed: 1.0,\\n            fullscreen: false,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\nstruct Slot {\\n    used: bool,\\n    name: String,\\n    skin: u8,\\n    outfit: u8,\\n    day: u8,\\n    minutes: u32,\\n    stars: u32,\\n    stamps: u8,\\n    days_completed: u32,\\n    age: u8,\\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\\n    played: Vec<String>,\\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\\n    flips: u8,\\n    golden: bool,\\n    free_play: bool,\\n    won: bool,\\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\\n    ending: String,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Slot {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            used: false,\\n            name: \\\"Guest\\\".into(),\\n            skin: 0,\\n            outfit: 0,\\n            day: 1,\\n            minutes: 0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            stamps: 0,\\n            days_completed: 0,\\n            age: 80,\\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            played: Vec::new(),\\n            ages: Vec::new(),\\n            flips: 0,\\n            golden: false,\\n            free_play: false,\\n            won: false,\\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            ending: String::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\nstruct SaveDto {\\n    version: u32,\\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\\n    settings: Settings,\\n    last_day: i64,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitGame {\\n    pub flow: Flow,\\n    run: Run,\\n    saved_run: Run,\\n    pub rules: Rules,\\n    pub settings: Settings,\\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\\n    pub slot: u8,\\n    continuing: bool,\\n    pub name: String,\\n    pub skin: u8,\\n    pub outfit: u8,\\n    pub day: u8,\\n    pub day_minutes: u32,\\n    pub total_stars: u32,\\n    pub stamps: u8,\\n    pub days_completed: u32,\\n    pub age: u8,\\n    pub skill: f32,\\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\\n    pub ever_played: Vec<String>,\\n    today_played: Vec<String>,\\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\\n    flips: u8,\\n    pub golden: bool,\\n    flops: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub free_play: bool,\\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\\n    ending: String,\\n    act: Option<Activity>,\\n    bal: BalanceCore,\\n    pub score: f32,\\n    pub stars: u8,\\n    focus: usize,\\n    page: usize,\\n    line_i: usize,\\n    reveal: f32,\\n    card_t: f32,\\n    idle: u32,\\n    pub world_time: f32,\\n    time_scale: f32,\\n    pub save_serial: u32,\\n    /// Calendar day supplied at boot. The sim never reads a clock.\\n    pub today: i64,\\n    pub last_day: i64,\\n    last_lean: Vec2,\\n    last_held: u32,\\n    last_pressed: u32,\\n    last_move: Vec2,\\n    device: u8,\\n    seen_real: bool,\\n    pub touch_only: bool,\\n    audio_unlocked: bool,\\n    song: u8,\\n    return_flow: Flow,\\n    paused_from: Flow,\\n    hub_mode: bool,\\n    hub_wait: bool,\\n    hub_done: bool,\\n    hub_stats: [f32; 3],\\n    medley_i: u8,\\n    together_n: u8,\\n    together_i: u8,\\n    together_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    together_names: Vec<String>,\\n    podium: Vec<(String, f32)>,\\n    demo: bool,\\n    attract_i: u8,\\n    attract_t: f32,\\n    reset_arm: bool,\\n    ghost_id: Option<crate::entity::EntityId>,\\n    about_page: usize,\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            flow: Flow::Title,\\n            run: Run::Story,\\n            saved_run: Run::Story,\\n            rules: Rules::default(),\\n            settings: Settings::default(),\\n            slots: vec![Slot::default(); 4],\\n            slot: 0,\\n            continuing: false,\\n            name: \\\"Guest\\\".into(),\\n            skin: 0,\\n            outfit: 0,\\n            day: 1,\\n            day_minutes: 0,\\n            total_stars: 0,\\n            stamps: 0,\\n            days_completed: 0,\\n            age: 80,\\n            skill: 0.0,\\n            ages: Vec::new(),\\n            ever_played: Vec::new(),\\n            today_played: Vec::new(),\\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            flips: 0,\\n            golden: false,\\n            flops: Vec::new(),\\n            free_play: false,\\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\\n            ending: String::new(),\\n            act: None,\\n            bal: BalanceCore::default(),\\n            score: 0.0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            focus: 0,\\n            page: 0,\\n            line_i: 0,\\n            reveal: 0.0,\\n            card_t: 0.0,\\n            idle: 0,\\n            world_time: 0.0,\\n            time_scale: 1.0,\\n            save_serial: 0,\\n            today: 0,\\n            last_day: 0,\\n            last_lean: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            last_held: 0,\\n            last_pressed: 0,\\n            last_move: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            device: 0,\\n            seen_real: false,\\n            touch_only: false,\\n            audio_unlocked: false,\\n            song: 0,\\n            return_flow: Flow::Title,\\n            paused_from: Flow::Title,\\n            hub_mode: false,\\n            hub_wait: false,\\n            hub_done: false,\\n            hub_stats: [0.0; 3],\\n            medley_i: 0,\\n            together_n: 2,\\n            together_i: 0,\\n            together_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            together_names: Vec::new(),\\n            podium: Vec::new(),\\n            demo: false,\\n            attract_i: 0,\\n            attract_t: 0.0,\\n            reset_arm: false,\\n            ghost_id: None,\\n            about_page: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Versioned save. Progress and settings only; attract never calls this.\\n    pub fn export_save(&mut self) -> String {\\n        self.write_slot();\\n        let dto = SaveDto {\\n            version: SAVE_VERSION,\\n            slots: self.slots.clone(),\\n            settings: self.settings.clone(),\\n            last_day: self.last_day,\\n        };\\n        serde_json::to_string(&dto).unwrap_or_else(|_| \\\"{}\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn import_save(&mut self, text: &str) -> bool {\\n        let Ok(dto) = serde_json::from_str::<SaveDto>(text) else { return false };\\n        if dto.version != SAVE_VERSION {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        self.slots = dto.slots;\\n        while self.slots.len() < 4 {\\n            self.slots.push(Slot::default());\\n        }\\n        self.slots.truncate(4);\\n        self.settings = dto.settings;\\n        self.last_day = dto.last_day;\\n        let i = self.slot as usize;\\n        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\\n            self.read_slot(i);\\n        }\\n        true\\n    }\\n\\n    fn write_slot(&mut self) {\\n        let i = (self.slot as usize).min(3);\\n        let s = &mut self.slots[i];\\n        s.used = true;\\n        s.name = self.name.clone();\\n        s.skin = self.skin;\\n        s.outfit = self.outfit;\\n        s.day = self.day;\\n        s.minutes = self.day_minutes;\\n        s.stars = self.total_stars;\\n        s.stamps = self.stamps;\\n        s.days_completed = self.days_completed;\\n        s.age = self.age;\\n        s.bests = self.bests.clone();\\n        s.played = self.ever_played.clone();\\n        s.ages = self.ages.clone();\\n        s.flips = self.flips;\\n        s.golden = self.golden;\\n        s.free_play = self.free_play;\\n        s.won = self.outcome == Outcome::Won;\\n        s.ghosts = self.ghosts.clone();\\n        s.ending = self.ending.clone();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn read_slot(&mut self, i: usize) {\\n        let s = self.slots[i].clone();\\n        self.slot = i as u8;\\n        self.name = s.name;\\n        self.skin = s.skin;\\n        self.outfit = s.outfit;\\n        self.day = s.day.max(1);\\n        self.day_minutes = s.minutes;\\n        self.total_stars = s.stars;\\n        self.stamps = s.stamps;\\n        self.days_completed = s.days_completed;\\n        self.age = s.age;\\n        self.bests = s.bests;\\n        self.ever_played = s.played;\\n        self.ages = s.ages;\\n        self.flips = s.flips;\\n        self.golden = s.golden;\\n        self.free_play = s.free_play;\\n        self.outcome = if s.won { Outcome::Won } else { Outcome::Playing };\\n        self.ghosts = s.ghosts;\\n        self.ending = s.ending;\\n        self.today_played.clear();\\n        self.flow = if self.free_play { Flow::Island } else { Flow::Wake };\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn reset_progress(&mut self) {\\n        let settings = self.settings.clone();\\n        let today = self.today;\\n        let last_day = self.last_day;\\n        let serial = self.save_serial;\\n        let slot = self.slot;\\n        let slots = self.slots.clone();\\n        let flops = self.flops.clone();\\n        let device = self.device;\\n        let seen = self.seen_real;\\n        let touch = self.touch_only;\\n        let audio = self.audio_unlocked;\\n        *self = Self::fresh();\\n        self.settings = settings;\\n        self.today = today;\\n        self.last_day = last_day;\\n        self.save_serial = serial;\\n        self.slot = slot;\\n        self.slots = slots;\\n        self.flops = flops;\\n        self.device = device;\\n        self.seen_real = seen;\\n        self.touch_only = touch;\\n        self.audio_unlocked = audio;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn touch_save(&mut self) {\\n        if self.demo || self.run == Run::Demo || self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\\n        self.write_slot();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn script(&self) -> &'static Script {\\n        script::script()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn goal(&self) -> u32 {\\n        match self.day {\\n            1 => 3,\\n            2 => 5,\\n            3 => 7,\\n            4 => 9,\\n            _ => 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn day_clear(&self) -> bool {\\n        if self.free_play || self.day >= 5 {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        let all = EventId::for_day(self.day).iter().all(|e| self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()));\\n        all && self.day_minutes >= self.goal()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn schedule_events(&self) -> Vec<EventId> {\\n        if self.free_play {\\n            EventId::ALL.into_iter().filter(|e| !matches!(e, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand)).collect()\\n        } else if self.day >= 5 {\\n            vec![EventId::BigStand]\\n        } else {\\n            EventId::for_day(self.day).to_vec()\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn screen_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let s = self.script();\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title => {\\n                let mut v = vec![(ACT_NEW, \\\"New Stay\\\".into())];\\n                if self.slots.iter().any(|sl| sl.used) {\\n                    v.push((ACT_CONTINUE, \\\"Continue\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_TOGETHER, \\\"Play Together\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_ABOUT, \\\"About\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_HOWTO, \\\"How to Stand\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used {\\n                        continue;\\n                    }\\n                    let label = if sl.used { format!(\\\"{} · day {}\\\", sl.name, sl.day) } else { format!(\\\"Hammock {} · empty\\\", i + 1) };\\n                    v.push((10 + i as u16, label));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => s.names.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (400 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Look => s.skins.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (500 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Outfit => s.outfits.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (520 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    let done = if self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()) { \\\" · done\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" };\\n                    v.push((100 + i as u16, format!(\\\"{}{done}\\\", e.title())));\\n                }\\n                if self.day_clear() {\\n                    v.push((ACT_END_DAY, \\\"End the day\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESULT_BACK, \\\"Back to the island\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_RETRY, \\\"Retry\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Together => vec![\\n                (ACT_G2, \\\"2 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G3, \\\"3 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G4, \\\"4 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\\n            Flow::Dev => self.dev_items(),\\n            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Podium => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back to the title\\\".into())],\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let m = self.settings.music;\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (610, format!(\\\"Music {:.0}%\\\", m * 100.0)),\\n                (611, format!(\\\"Effects {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sfx * 100.0)),\\n                (612, format!(\\\"Voices {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.voice * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \\\"Glyphs: Xbox\\\" } else { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\\n                (613, format!(\\\"Lean {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sensitivity * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => vec![\\n                (614, format!(\\\"Wobble assist {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.wobble_assist * 100.0)),\\n                (615, \\\"Rhythm offset\\\".into()),\\n                (616, format!(\\\"Text {:.1}\\\", self.settings.text_speed)),\\n                (ACT_FULLSCREEN, if self.settings.fullscreen { \\\"Fullscreen on\\\" } else { \\\"Fullscreen off\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_RESET_SAVE, if self.reset_arm { \\\"Confirm erase\\\" } else { \\\"Erase save\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_DEV_RESET, \\\"Reset feel\\\".into()),\\n                (7, \\\"Wardrobe\\\".into()), // remapped in activate via label... use a dedicated id\\n                (43, \\\"Wardrobe\\\".into()),\\n                (44, \\\"Calendar\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => {\\n                let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n                let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\\n                let start = (self.page - 1) * 4;\\n                let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = infos\\n                    .iter()\\n                    .enumerate()\\n                    .skip(start)\\n                    .take(4)\\n                    .map(|(i, info)| {\\n                        let label = match &info.value {\\n                            ParamValue::Float(f) => format!(\\\"{} {f:.2}\\\", info.path),\\n                            ParamValue::Int(n) => format!(\\\"{} {n}\\\", info.path),\\n                            _ => info.path.clone(),\\n                        };\\n                        (300 + i as u16, label)\\n                    })\\n                    .collect();\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn start_activity(&mut self, kind: EventId, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if let Some(id) = self.ghost_id.take() {\\n            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        let rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        let mut act = Activity::start(kind, &rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n        if matches!(kind, EventId::Step | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            for n in &mut act.notes {\\n                n[0] += self.settings.rhythm_offset;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.bal = BalanceCore::default();\\n        self.bal.amp = self.rules.wobble * (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        self.bal.phase = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(|_| sim.state.rng.f32() * std::f32::consts::TAU);\\n        self.act = Some(act);\\n        self.score = 0.0;\\n        self.stars = 0;\\n        self.maybe_ghost(sim, kind);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_ghost(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, kind: EventId) {\\n        if self.day < 3 || self.run != Run::Story {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let zone = zone_of(kind);\\n        let have = self.ghosts.keys().any(|k| EventId::from_key(k).map(zone_of) == Some(zone));\\n        if !have {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);\\n        let id = sim.spawn_npc(\\\"yesterday\\\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\\n        self.ghost_id = Some(id);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn kind_now(&self) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.kind)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn finish_play(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() else { return };\\n        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\\n                    *slot += self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\\n                    self.together_i += 1;\\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.podium = self\\n                        .together_names\\n                        .iter()\\n                        .cloned()\\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\\n                        .collect();\\n                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Story => {\\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\\n                    self.mark_played(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Reveal;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else if kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \\\"rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"extended\\\" }.into();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Ending;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Demo => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bank(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let first = !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == kind.key());\\n        if self.run == Run::Story && !matches!(kind, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            let add = if first { 1 + self.stars as u32 } else { 1 };\\n            self.day_minutes += add;\\n        }\\n        self.total_stars += self.stars as u32;\\n        self.mark_played(kind);\\n        if !matches!(kind, EventId::Check) && self.run == Run::Story {\\n            let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n            if !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == &key) {\\n                self.today_played.push(key);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        let best = self.bests.get(&key).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        if self.score >= best {\\n            self.bests.insert(key.clone(), self.score);\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                self.ghosts.insert(key, act.samples.clone());\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.touch_save();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn mark_played(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        if !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == &key) {\\n            self.ever_played.push(key);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sleep_advance(&mut self) {\\n        if self.day <= 4 {\\n            self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n            self.days_completed += 1;\\n        }\\n        if self.day < 5 {\\n            self.day += 1;\\n        }\\n        self.day_minutes = 0;\\n        self.today_played.clear();\\n        self.touch_save();\\n        self.flow = Flow::Wake;\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if id == ACT_BACK {\\n            self.go_back();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title => match id {\\n                ACT_NEW => {\\n                    self.continuing = false;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_CONTINUE => {\\n                    self.continuing = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_TOGETHER => {\\n                    self.run = Run::Together;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Together;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\\n                ACT_ABOUT => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::About;\\n                    self.about_page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_HOWTO => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::HowTo;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n                if (10..14).contains(&id) {\\n                    let i = (id - 10) as usize;\\n                    if self.continuing {\\n                        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                            self.read_slot(i);\\n                        }\\n                    } else {\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\\n                        self.reset_progress();\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Name;\\n                        self.focus = 0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => {\\n                if let Some(n) = self.script().names.get((id as usize).saturating_sub(400)) {\\n                    self.name = n.clone();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Look;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Look => {\\n                self.skin = id.saturating_sub(500) as u8;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Outfit;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Outfit => {\\n                self.outfit = id.saturating_sub(520) as u8;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Intro;\\n                self.line_i = 0;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.touch_save();\\n            }\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                if id == ACT_END_DAY && self.day_clear() {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Sleep;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                } else if (100..180).contains(&id) {\\n                    let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                    if let Some(kind) = evs.get((id - 100) as usize).copied() {\\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if id == ACT_RETRY {\\n                    if let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() {\\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    self.after_result();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Together => {\\n                let n = match id {\\n                    ACT_G2 => 2,\\n                    ACT_G3 => 3,\\n                    ACT_G4 => 4,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                if n > 0 {\\n                    self.begin_together(n);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev => match id {\\n                ACT_RESUME | ACT_BACK => self.flow = self.paused_from,\\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\\n                43 => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Wardrobe;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                44 => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Calendar;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Flow::Pause => {\\n                if id == ACT_RESUME {\\n                    self.flow = self.paused_from;\\n                } else if id == ACT_SETTINGS {\\n                    self.open_settings();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Settings => self.activate_settings(id),\\n            Flow::Podium => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Title;\\n                self.run = Run::Story;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.go_back(),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin_together(&mut self, n: u8) {\\n        let names = self.script().names.clone();\\n        self.together_n = n.clamp(2, 4);\\n        self.together_i = 0;\\n        self.medley_i = 0;\\n        self.together_names = (0..self.together_n).map(|i| names.get(i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| format!(\\\"Guest {}\\\", i + 1))).collect();\\n        self.together_scores = vec![0.0; self.together_n as usize];\\n        self.run = Run::Together;\\n        self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn open_settings(&mut self) {\\n        self.return_flow = if self.flow == Flow::Settings { self.return_flow } else { self.flow };\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n            self.demo = false;\\n        }\\n        self.flow = Flow::Settings;\\n        self.page = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.reset_arm = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate_settings(&mut self, id: u16) {\\n        match id {\\n            ACT_XBOX => self.settings.xbox = !self.settings.xbox,\\n            ACT_FULLSCREEN => self.settings.fullscreen = !self.settings.fullscreen,\\n            ACT_RESET_SAVE => {\\n                if self.reset_arm {\\n                    self.slots = vec![Slot::default(); 4];\\n                    self.reset_arm = false;\\n                    self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\\n                } else {\\n                    self.reset_arm = true;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ACT_BACK => self.go_back(),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.flow = match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Slots | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Settings | Flow::Podium => {\\n                if self.flow == Flow::Settings || self.flow == Flow::About || self.flow == Flow::HowTo {\\n                    let back = self.return_flow;\\n                    if back == Flow::Attract {\\n                        self.demo = true;\\n                    }\\n                    if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\\n                        self.run = Run::Story;\\n                    }\\n                    back\\n                } else if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\\n                    self.run = Run::Story;\\n                    Flow::Title\\n                } else {\\n                    Flow::Title\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Schedule => Flow::Island,\\n            Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.return_flow,\\n            Flow::Dev => self.paused_from,\\n            Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit => Flow::Title,\\n            _ => Flow::Title,\\n        };\\n    }\\n\\n    fn after_result(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        if self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.run == Run::Together {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_slider(&mut self, id: u16, v: f32) {\\n        let v = v.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        match id {\\n            610 => self.settings.music = v,\\n            611 => self.settings.sfx = v,\\n            612 => self.settings.voice = v,\\n            613 => self.settings.sensitivity = 0.5 + v,\\n            614 => self.settings.wobble_assist = v,\\n            615 => self.settings.rhythm_offset = (v - 0.5) * 0.1,\\n            616 => self.settings.text_speed = 0.5 + v * 1.5,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        if !(300..400).contains(&id) {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\\n        let Some(info) = infos.get((id - 300) as usize) else { return };\\n        let path = info.path.clone();\\n        let value = match info.kind.clone() {\\n            ParamKind::Float { min, max } => ParamValue::Float((min + v * (max - min)) as f64),\\n            ParamKind::Int { min, max } => ParamValue::Int((min as f32 + v * (max - min) as f32).round() as i64),\\n            _ => return,\\n        };\\n        let _ = params::set(&mut self.rules, &path, value);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn talk(&self) -> Vec<(String, String)> {\\n        let s = self.script();\\n        let pull = |speaker: &str, tag: &str| -> Vec<(String, String)> {\\n            let n = s.count(speaker, tag);\\n            (0..n).filter_map(|i| s.line(speaker, tag, i).map(|t| (speaker.to_string(), t.to_string()))).collect()\\n        };\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Intro => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"intro\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Welcome ashore. The mat remembers nothing yet.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Wake => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                if self.last_day > 0 && self.today > self.last_day {\\n                    let d = self.today - self.last_day;\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"You were away {d} days. The mat kept your place.\\\")));\\n                }\\n                let tag = format!(\\\"wake{}\\\", self.day.min(5));\\n                v.extend(pull(\\\"Pip\\\", &tag));\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Morning. The deck is already warm.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"reveal\\\");\\n                v.insert(0, (\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"Balance Age {}}. Lower means the mat was calmer.\\\", self.age)));\\n                // fix accidental brace - I'll correct below if compile fails\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Sleep => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"sleep\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Stamp the day. The hammock is already on your side.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Ending => {\\n                let tag_line = if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" {\\n                    \\\"The rowboat is ready. You may check out, or stay and play.\\\"\\n                } else {\\n                    \\\"The week would like a little more of you. The hammock agrees. This is the Extended Stay.\\\"\\n                };\\n                vec![(\\\"Pip\\\".into(), tag_line.into())]\\n            }\\n            Flow::Credits => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"credits\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Tippy Cay keeps the light on.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Pass => {\\n                let name = self.together_names.get(self.together_i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Guest\\\".into());\\n                vec![(\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"Pass the pad to {name}.\\\"))]\\n            }\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn talk_advance(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let n = self.talk().len().max(1);\\n        if self.line_i + 1 < n {\\n            self.line_i += 1;\\n            self.reveal = 0.0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.reveal = 0.0;\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Intro => self.flow = Flow::Wake,\\n            Flow::Wake => {\\n                if self.today > 0 {\\n                    self.last_day = self.today;\\n                }\\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Check, sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => {\\n                if self.day >= 5 && !self.free_play {\\n                    self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Sleep => self.sleep_advance(),\\n            Flow::Ending => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Credits;\\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                self.free_play = true;\\n                self.touch_save();\\n            }\\n            Flow::Credits => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n                self.free_play = true;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Pass => {\\n                self.medley_i = 0;\\n                self.start_activity(MEDLEY[0], sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn enter_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        self.saved_run = self.run;\\n        self.run = Run::Demo;\\n        self.demo = true;\\n        self.flow = Flow::Attract;\\n        self.attract_i = 0;\\n        self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n        self.idle = 0;\\n        self.arm_attract(sim);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn exit_attract(&mut self) {\\n        self.demo = false;\\n        self.run = if self.saved_run == Run::Demo { Run::Story } else { self.saved_run };\\n        self.flow = Flow::Title;\\n        self.act = None;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.idle = 0;\\n        self.attract_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn arm_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let name = ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n        if let Some(kind) = EventId::from_key(name) {\\n            self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n        } else {\\n            self.act = None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn attract_len(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n            \\\"island\\\" => 8.0,\\n            \\\"title\\\" => 5.0,\\n            _ => 15.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn desired_song(&self) -> u8 {\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract || !self.audio_unlocked {\\n            return 0;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Credits | Flow::Ending => 6,\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown => match self.kind_now() {\\n                Some(EventId::Step) => 4,\\n                Some(EventId::BigStand) => 3,\\n                Some(EventId::Lap | EventId::Floatie) => 5,\\n                Some(EventId::Paddle | EventId::Tide | EventId::Cannon | EventId::Tray) => 2,\\n                _ => 1,\\n            },\\n            _ => 1,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn note_device(&mut self, input: &InputFrame) {\\n        if input.device != 0 {\\n            self.device = input.device;\\n        } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::PAUSE | buttons::MENU_DOWN | buttons::MENU_UP) {\\n            self.device = 2;\\n        }\\n        if self.device == 1 || self.device == 2 || self.device == 3 {\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n            self.touch_only = false;\\n        }\\n        if self.device == 4 && !self.seen_real {\\n            self.touch_only = true;\\n        }\\n        let touched = input.device == 4 && (input.any || input.ui.is_some());\\n        if (input.woke() && input.device != 4) || touched || input.pressed != 0 && input.device != 4 {\\n            self.audio_unlocked = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn pregame(&self) -> bool {\\n        !self.hub_mode\\n            && matches!(\\n                self.flow,\\n                Flow::Title | Flow::Slots | Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo\\n            )\\n    }\\n\\n    fn menu_flow(&self) -> bool {\\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Island | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tick_activity(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> bool {\\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        rules.wobble *= (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        let lean = (self.last_lean * self.settings.sensitivity).clamp_length_max(1.0);\\n        let held = self.last_held;\\n        let pressed = self.last_pressed;\\n        let mut act = self.act.take();\\n        let done = if let Some(act) = act.as_mut() {\\n            events::tick(act, &mut self.bal, sim, lean, held, pressed, dt, &rules, events);\\n            act.done\\n        } else {\\n            false\\n        };\\n        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\\n        self.act = act;\\n        done\\n    }\\n\\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\\n            }\\n            out.insert(id, f);\\n        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn press_bits(&self, sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let items = self.screen_items();\\n                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\\n                        && self\\n                            .schedule_events()\\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\\n                });\\n                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\\n                if self.focus == want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else if self.focus < want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_DOWN)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Title => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\\n            _ => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n        }\\n        .let_sim(sim)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Tiny adapter so the match above can ignore `sim` without a warning dance.\\ntrait LetSim {\\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self;\\n}\\nimpl<T> LetSim for T {\\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self {\\n        self\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn zone_of(kind: EventId) -> &'static str {\\n    match kind {\\n        EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose | EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank | EventId::Step | EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"studio\\\",\\n        EventId::Lap | EventId::Tray => \\\"path\\\",\\n        EventId::Floatie | EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"lagoon\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_speaker_count(speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n    script::script().speaker_count(speaker)\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_title_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().titles.len()\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_name_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().names.len()\\n}\\n\\n/// Builds Tippy Cay. `medley` is the hub course. `event/<key>` starts that activity's card.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/hub\\\", LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"tippy cay: {e}\\\"))?;\\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, \\\"fit\\\", def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 8.0;\\n    let mut game = FitGame::fresh();\\n    if let Ok(rules) = toml::from_str::<Rules>(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/rules\\\", RULES_TEXT)) {\\n        game.rules = rules;\\n    }\\n    if let Some(p) = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)) {\\n        game.flops = vec![\\n            [p.x + 2.2, p.z + 0.4],\\n            [p.x - 2.0, p.z + 1.2],\\n            [p.x + 1.2, p.z + 2.4],\\n            [p.x - 1.4, p.z - 1.6],\\n            [p.x + 3.0, p.z - 0.8],\\n        ];\\n    }\\n    match rest {\\n        Some(\\\"medley\\\") => {\\n            game.run = Run::Medley;\\n            game.hub_mode = true;\\n            game.medley_i = 0;\\n            game.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\\n            game.flow = Flow::Event;\\n        }\\n        Some(s) if let Some(key) = s.strip_prefix(\\\"event/\\\") => {\\n            let kind = EventId::from_key(key).unwrap_or(EventId::Breath);\\n            game.run = Run::Direct;\\n            game.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n            game.flow = Flow::Card;\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\\n    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for FitGame {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"fit\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let dts = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        self.note_device(input);\\n        let attract_woke = self.flow == Flow::Attract && input.device != 4 && input.woke();\\n        if attract_woke {\\n            self.exit_attract();\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && input.hub == 1 {\\n            self.hub_wait = true;\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && (input.hub == 2 || input.just(buttons::HUB_GO)) {\\n            self.hub_wait = false;\\n        }\\n        if !attract_woke {\\n            if let Some(ui) = input.ui {\\n                match ui {\\n                    UiEvent::Hover(id) => {\\n                        if let Some(i) = self.screen_items().iter().position(|(n, _)| *n == id) {\\n                            self.focus = i;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                    UiEvent::Click(id) => {\\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Attract && id == ACT_SETTINGS {\\n                            self.open_settings();\\n                            self.return_flow = Flow::Attract;\\n                        } else if self.flow != Flow::Attract {\\n                            self.activate(id, sim);\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                    UiEvent::Slider(id, v) => {\\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Dev || self.flow == Flow::Settings {\\n                            self.apply_slider(id, v);\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\\n                self.paused_from = self.flow;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.page = 0;\\n                self.flow = if self.hub_mode { Flow::Pause } else { Flow::Dev };\\n            } else if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\\n                self.flow = self.paused_from;\\n            } else if self.menu_flow() {\\n                let n = self.screen_items().len();\\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_DOWN) {\\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n                }\\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_UP) {\\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + n - 1) % n;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_R) {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_L) {\\n                    self.page = self.page.saturating_sub(1);\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::BACK) {\\n                    self.go_back();\\n                } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    if matches!(\\n                        self.flow,\\n                        Flow::Intro | Flow::Wake | Flow::Reveal | Flow::Sleep | Flow::Ending | Flow::Credits | Flow::Pass\\n                    ) {\\n                        self.talk_advance(sim);\\n                    } else if let Some((id, _)) = self.screen_items().get(self.focus).copied() {\\n                        self.activate(id, sim);\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Island && input.just(buttons::SCHEDULE) {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Schedule;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.page = 0;\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Card {\\n                self.card_t += dts;\\n                if self.card_t >= 1.0 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Countdown;\\n                    self.card_t = 3.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Countdown {\\n                self.card_t -= dts;\\n                if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                }\\n                if self.card_t <= 0.0 {\\n                    self.flow = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Check) { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n                self.attract_t += dts;\\n                if self.attract_t >= self.attract_len() {\\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                    self.attract_i = (self.attract_i + 1) % ATTRACT.len() as u8;\\n                    self.arm_attract(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.pregame() {\\n            let active = if input.device == 4 {\\n                matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_)))\\n            } else {\\n                input.woke() || matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_) | UiEvent::Slider(_, _)))\\n            };\\n            if active {\\n                self.idle = 0;\\n            } else {\\n                self.idle += 1;\\n                if self.idle >= 600 {\\n                    self.enter_attract(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.reveal = (self.reveal + dts * 48.0 * self.settings.text_speed).min(400.0);\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                let (lean, bits) = events::bot(act, &self.bal, &self.rules);\\n                self.last_lean = lean;\\n                self.last_held = bits;\\n                self.last_pressed = bits;\\n                self.last_move = Vec2::ZERO;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.last_lean = input.lean;\\n            self.last_held = input.held;\\n            self.last_pressed = input.pressed;\\n            self.last_move = input.move_dir;\\n        }\\n        let song = self.desired_song();\\n        if song != self.song {\\n            self.song = song;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Music { song });\\n        }\\n        if self.menu_flow() {\\n            if let Some((_, text)) = self.talk().get(self.line_i) {\\n                if self.reveal as usize % 3 == 1 {\\n                    events.push(SimEvent::Syllable { speaker: 0, vowel: (self.line_i as u8) % 5, pitch: 1.15 });\\n                }\\n                let _ = text;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.drive_player(sim)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.apply_body(sim);\\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += dt;\\n                }\\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Attract => {\\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\\n            }\\n            Flow::Island => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += dt;\\n                }\\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        Vec::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let event = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.key()).unwrap_or(\\\"\\\");\\n        let hub_score: f32 = self.hub_stats.iter().sum();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"phase\\\": self.flow.name(),\\n            \\\"event\\\": event,\\n            \\\"score\\\": self.score,\\n            \\\"stars\\\": self.stars,\\n            \\\"outcome\\\": match self.outcome {\\n                Outcome::Playing => \\\"playing\\\",\\n                Outcome::Won => \\\"won\\\",\\n                Outcome::Lost => \\\"lost\\\",\\n            },\\n            \\\"stamps\\\": self.stamps,\\n            \\\"played\\\": self.ever_played,\\n            \\\"age\\\": self.age,\\n            \\\"world_time\\\": self.world_time,\\n            \\\"music\\\": self.settings.music,\\n            \\\"sfx\\\": self.settings.sfx,\\n            \\\"voice\\\": self.settings.voice,\\n            \\\"save_serial\\\": self.save_serial,\\n            \\\"demo\\\": self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            \\\"hub\\\": {\\n                \\\"score\\\": hub_score.clamp(0.0, 3000.0),\\n                \\\"label\\\": \\\"Inter-Resort Medley\\\",\\n                \\\"done\\\": self.hub_done,\\n                \\\"stats\\\": {\\\"paddle\\\": self.hub_stats[0], \\\"tide\\\": self.hub_stats[1], \\\"cannon\\\": self.hub_stats[2]},\\n                \\\"ghost\\\": self.hub_mode,\\n            },\\n            \\\"podium\\\": self.podium.iter().map(|(n, s)| json!({\\\"name\\\": n, \\\"score\\\": s})).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\\n            \\\"day\\\": self.day,\\n            \\\"minutes\\\": self.day_minutes,\\n            \\\"goal\\\": self.goal(),\\n            \\\"stiffness\\\": self.rules.stiffness,\\n            \\\"version\\\": SAVE_VERSION,\\n            \\\"name\\\": self.name,\\n            \\\"xbox\\\": self.settings.xbox,\\n            \\\"touch_card\\\": self.touch_only,\\n            \\\"ending\\\": self.ending,\\n            \\\"free_play\\\": self.free_play,\\n            \\\"golden\\\": self.golden,\\n            \\\"today\\\": self.today,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\\n        self.outcome\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        let (lean, bits) = self.press_bits(sim);\\n        InputFrame { lean, held: bits, pressed: bits, ..Default::default() }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\\n        if self.hub_wait {\\n            return true;\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && self.flow == Flow::Pause {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Island | Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn fit_ui(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<FitUi> {\\n        let items_src = self.screen_items();\\n        let rects = fit_ui::stack_rects(items_src.len());\\n        let items = items_src\\n            .iter()\\n            .enumerate()\\n            .map(|(i, (id, label))| FitItem {\\n                id: *id,\\n                label: label.clone(),\\n                rect: rects.get(i).copied().unwrap_or([0.27, 0.4, 0.46, 0.09]),\\n            })\\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>();\\n        let focus_id = items.get(self.focus).map(|it| it.id).unwrap_or(0);\\n        let talk = self.talk();\\n        let (speaker, mut body) = talk.get(self.line_i).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| (String::new(), String::new()));\\n        let shown = self.reveal as usize;\\n        if shown < body.len() {\\n            body.truncate(shown.max(1).min(body.len()));\\n        }\\n        let mut lines = Vec::new();\\n        if !body.is_empty() {\\n            lines.push(body);\\n        }\\n        let (title, big, extra) = self.banner();\\n        if !extra.is_empty() && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(extra);\\n        }\\n        if self.touch_only && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        let puck = if matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card) {\\n            Some([self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y, 0.34, 1.0])\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let yaw = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Lap) && self.flow == Flow::Event {\\n            Some(self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t * 0.35).unwrap_or(0.0))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let action = \\\"confirm\\\";\\n        Some(FitUi {\\n            screen: self.flow.name().into(),\\n            title: if title.is_empty() { TITLE.into() } else { title },\\n            lines,\\n            items,\\n            focus: focus_id,\\n            device: self.device,\\n            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\\n            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            action: action.into(),\\n            demo: self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            touch_card: self.touch_only,\\n            puck,\\n            big,\\n            footer: self.footer(),\\n            camera_yaw: yaw,\\n            prompt_kind: match self.device {\\n                2 => 1,\\n                3 => 2,\\n                4 => 3,\\n                _ => 0,\\n            },\\n        })\\n        .map(|mut ui| {\\n            if !speaker.is_empty() && ui.lines.first().is_some() {\\n                // Speaker stays in the title slot when the banner did not claim it.\\n                if ui.title == TITLE {\\n                    ui.title = speaker;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ui\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tint(&self, id: crate::entity::EntityId) -> Option<([f32; 3], f32)> {\\n        if self.ghost_id == Some(id) {\\n            Some(([0.62, 0.84, 1.0], 0.45))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn banner(&self) -> (String, String, String) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title | Flow::Attract => (TITLE.into(), if self.flow == Flow::Attract { \\\"DEMO\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" }.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Card => {\\n                let k = self.kind_now();\\n                (k.map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_default(), String::new(), k.map(|k| k.blurb().into()).unwrap_or_default())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Countdown => {\\n                let n = self.card_t.ceil().clamp(1.0, 3.0) as i32;\\n                (\\\"Ready\\\".into(), n.to_string(), String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                let title = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Mat\\\".into());\\n                let score = format!(\\\"{:.0}\\\", self.score);\\n                (title, score, String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                let t = script::rank_title(self.score);\\n                (t, format!(\\\"{} stars\\\", self.stars), format!(\\\"Score {:.0}\\\", self.score))\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => (\\\"Balance Age\\\".into(), self.age.to_string(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Ending => (\\n                if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" { \\\"Rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"Extended Stay\\\" }.into(),\\n                String::new(),\\n                String::new(),\\n            ),\\n            Flow::Credits => (\\\"Credits\\\".into(), TITLE.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Podium => (\\\"Podium\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Dev => (\\\"Dev Mode\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Sliders ride along. Reset restores the mat.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Settings => (\\\"Settings\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::About => (\\\"About\\\".into(), String::new(), about_page(self.about_page)),\\n            Flow::HowTo => (\\\"How to Stand\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Lean with the stick, the keys, or the mouse. Last one wins.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Island => (format!(\\\"Day {}\\\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\\\"{} / {} minutes\\\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\\n            Flow::Schedule => (\\\"Today\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            _ => (TITLE.into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn footer(&self) -> String {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"schedule\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \\\" schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"lean\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_body(&self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(ch) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) else { return };\\n        ch.anim.tilt_side = self.bal.cob.x * 14.0;\\n        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = self.bal.cob.y * 14.0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn collect_flops(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        if self.last_pressed & buttons::CONFIRM == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(feet) = sim.feet(id) else { return };\\n        for (i, p) in self.flops.iter().enumerate().take(5) {\\n            let bit = 1u8 << i;\\n            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            let d = (feet.x - p[0]).hypot(feet.z - p[1]);\\n            if d < 1.2 {\\n                self.flips |= bit;\\n                events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 30, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + i as f32 * 0.05 });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\\n            self.golden = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\\n        \\\"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows.\\\",\\n        \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo.\\\",\\n        \\\"Testing Feedback: the stay, every event, and the medley are driven in the sim. Engine Feedback: one balance model, one synth, menus inside the tick. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships; the time-cut list does not.\\\",\\n        \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\",\\n    ];\\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod save_tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn save_round_trips_the_stay() {\\n        let mut g = FitGame::fresh();\\n        g.day = 3;\\n        g.age = 22;\\n        g.stamps = 2;\\n        g.name = \\\"Kai\\\".into();\\n        g.settings.music = 0.25;\\n        let blob = g.export_save();\\n        g.day = 1;\\n        g.age = 80;\\n        g.settings.music = 0.10;\\n        assert!(g.import_save(&blob));\\n        assert_eq!(g.day, 3);\\n        assert_eq!(g.age, 22);\\n        assert_eq!(g.stamps, 2);\\n        assert_eq!(g.name, \\\"Kai\\\");\\n        assert!((g.settings.music - 0.25).abs() < 1e-5);\\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\\\"{\\\"));\\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\\\"{\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\":9,\\\\\\\"slots\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settings\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"last_day\\\\\\\":0}\\\"));\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn script_has_the_cast() {\\n        assert!(script_speaker_count(\\\"Pip\\\") >= 80, \\\"pip {}\\\", script_speaker_count(\\\"Pip\\\"));\\n        for s in [\\\"Posey\\\", \\\"Kettle\\\", \\\"Bounce\\\", \\\"Gull\\\"] {\\n            assert!(script_speaker_count(s) >= 25, \\\"{s} {}\\\", script_speaker_count(s));\\n        }\\n        assert!(script_title_count() >= 30);\\n        assert!(script_name_count() >= 40);\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Wobble Minutes: five days at Tippy Cay. Menus, events, and the bot all live in the sim.\\n\\nmod core;\\nmod events;\\nmod intent;\\nmod script;\\n\\npub use core::{balance_age, stars_from_plank, stars_from_score, BalanceCore, Rules};\\npub use events::EventId;\\npub use intent::{key_ramp, key_ramp2, mouse_lean, shape_stick, shape_stick2};\\n\\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\\n\\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\\nuse glam::{Vec2, Vec3};\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse crate::fit_ui::{self, FitItem, FitUi};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::games::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\\nuse crate::params::{self, ParamKind, ParamValue};\\nuse crate::puppet::PuppetDef;\\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\nuse events::{Activity, GhostSample};\\nuse script::Script;\\n\\npub const TITLE: &str = \\\"Wobble Minutes\\\";\\npub const SAVE_VERSION: u32 = 1;\\n\\npub const ACT_NEW: u16 = 1;\\npub const ACT_CONTINUE: u16 = 2;\\npub const ACT_TOGETHER: u16 = 3;\\npub const ACT_SETTINGS: u16 = 4;\\npub const ACT_ABOUT: u16 = 5;\\npub const ACT_HOWTO: u16 = 6;\\npub const ACT_BACK: u16 = 7;\\npub const ACT_RESUME: u16 = 8;\\npub const ACT_XBOX: u16 = 40;\\npub const ACT_FULLSCREEN: u16 = 41;\\npub const ACT_RESET_SAVE: u16 = 42;\\npub const ACT_DEV_RESET: u16 = 60;\\npub const ACT_ROW: u16 = 70;\\npub const ACT_END_DAY: u16 = 90;\\npub const ACT_RETRY: u16 = 91;\\npub const ACT_RESULT_BACK: u16 = 92;\\npub const ACT_G2: u16 = 80;\\npub const ACT_G3: u16 = 81;\\npub const ACT_G4: u16 = 82;\\n\\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\\\"hub.toml\\\");\\nconst RULES_TEXT: &str = include_str!(\\\"rules.toml\\\");\\nconst MEDLEY: [EventId; 3] = [EventId::Paddle, EventId::Tide, EventId::Cannon];\\nconst ATTRACT: [&str; 12] = [\\n    \\\"island\\\", \\\"cannon\\\", \\\"paddle\\\", \\\"step\\\", \\\"pose\\\", \\\"tide\\\", \\\"floatie\\\", \\\"tray\\\", \\\"plank\\\", \\\"lap\\\", \\\"bigstand\\\", \\\"title\\\",\\n];\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(rename_all = \\\"snake_case\\\")]\\npub enum Flow {\\n    Title,\\n    Slots,\\n    Name,\\n    Look,\\n    Outfit,\\n    Intro,\\n    Wake,\\n    Check,\\n    Reveal,\\n    Island,\\n    Schedule,\\n    Card,\\n    Countdown,\\n    Event,\\n    Result,\\n    Sleep,\\n    Ending,\\n    Credits,\\n    Pause,\\n    Settings,\\n    About,\\n    HowTo,\\n    Wardrobe,\\n    Calendar,\\n    Dev,\\n    Together,\\n    Pass,\\n    Podium,\\n    Attract,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Flow {\\n    fn name(self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self {\\n            Flow::Title => \\\"title\\\",\\n            Flow::Slots => \\\"slots\\\",\\n            Flow::Name => \\\"name\\\",\\n            Flow::Look => \\\"look\\\",\\n            Flow::Outfit => \\\"outfit\\\",\\n            Flow::Intro => \\\"intro\\\",\\n            Flow::Wake => \\\"wake\\\",\\n            Flow::Check => \\\"check\\\",\\n            Flow::Reveal => \\\"reveal\\\",\\n            Flow::Island => \\\"island\\\",\\n            Flow::Schedule => \\\"schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Card => \\\"card\\\",\\n            Flow::Countdown => \\\"countdown\\\",\\n            Flow::Event => \\\"event\\\",\\n            Flow::Result => \\\"result\\\",\\n            Flow::Sleep => \\\"sleep\\\",\\n            Flow::Ending => \\\"ending\\\",\\n            Flow::Credits => \\\"credits\\\",\\n            Flow::Pause => \\\"pause\\\",\\n            Flow::Settings => \\\"settings\\\",\\n            Flow::About => \\\"about\\\",\\n            Flow::HowTo => \\\"howto\\\",\\n            Flow::Wardrobe => \\\"wardrobe\\\",\\n            Flow::Calendar => \\\"calendar\\\",\\n            Flow::Dev => \\\"dev\\\",\\n            Flow::Together => \\\"together\\\",\\n            Flow::Pass => \\\"pass\\\",\\n            Flow::Podium => \\\"podium\\\",\\n            Flow::Attract => \\\"attract\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(rename_all = \\\"snake_case\\\")]\\nenum Run {\\n    Story,\\n    Medley,\\n    Together,\\n    Direct,\\n    Demo,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Settings {\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub sfx: f32,\\n    pub voice: f32,\\n    pub xbox: bool,\\n    pub sensitivity: f32,\\n    pub wobble_assist: f32,\\n    pub rhythm_offset: f32,\\n    pub text_speed: f32,\\n    pub fullscreen: bool,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Settings {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            sfx: 0.80,\\n            voice: 0.80,\\n            xbox: false,\\n            sensitivity: 1.0,\\n            wobble_assist: 0.0,\\n            rhythm_offset: 0.0,\\n            text_speed: 1.0,\\n            fullscreen: false,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\nstruct Slot {\\n    used: bool,\\n    name: String,\\n    skin: u8,\\n    outfit: u8,\\n    day: u8,\\n    minutes: u32,\\n    stars: u32,\\n    stamps: u8,\\n    days_completed: u32,\\n    age: u8,\\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\\n    played: Vec<String>,\\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\\n    flips: u8,\\n    golden: bool,\\n    free_play: bool,\\n    won: bool,\\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\\n    ending: String,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Slot {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            used: false,\\n            name: \\\"Guest\\\".into(),\\n            skin: 0,\\n            outfit: 0,\\n            day: 1,\\n            minutes: 0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            stamps: 0,\\n            days_completed: 0,\\n            age: 80,\\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            played: Vec::new(),\\n            ages: Vec::new(),\\n            flips: 0,\\n            golden: false,\\n            free_play: false,\\n            won: false,\\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            ending: String::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\nstruct SaveDto {\\n    version: u32,\\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\\n    settings: Settings,\\n    last_day: i64,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct FitGame {\\n    pub flow: Flow,\\n    run: Run,\\n    saved_run: Run,\\n    pub rules: Rules,\\n    pub settings: Settings,\\n    slots: Vec<Slot>,\\n    pub slot: u8,\\n    continuing: bool,\\n    pub name: String,\\n    pub skin: u8,\\n    pub outfit: u8,\\n    pub day: u8,\\n    pub day_minutes: u32,\\n    pub total_stars: u32,\\n    pub stamps: u8,\\n    pub days_completed: u32,\\n    pub age: u8,\\n    pub skill: f32,\\n    ages: Vec<u8>,\\n    pub ever_played: Vec<String>,\\n    today_played: Vec<String>,\\n    bests: BTreeMap<String, f32>,\\n    ghosts: BTreeMap<String, Vec<GhostSample>>,\\n    flips: u8,\\n    pub golden: bool,\\n    flops: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\\n    pub free_play: bool,\\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\\n    ending: String,\\n    act: Option<Activity>,\\n    bal: BalanceCore,\\n    pub score: f32,\\n    pub stars: u8,\\n    focus: usize,\\n    page: usize,\\n    line_i: usize,\\n    reveal: f32,\\n    card_t: f32,\\n    idle: u32,\\n    pub world_time: f32,\\n    time_scale: f32,\\n    pub save_serial: u32,\\n    /// Calendar day supplied at boot. The sim never reads a clock.\\n    pub today: i64,\\n    pub last_day: i64,\\n    last_lean: Vec2,\\n    last_held: u32,\\n    last_pressed: u32,\\n    last_move: Vec2,\\n    device: u8,\\n    seen_real: bool,\\n    pub touch_only: bool,\\n    audio_unlocked: bool,\\n    song: u8,\\n    return_flow: Flow,\\n    paused_from: Flow,\\n    hub_mode: bool,\\n    hub_wait: bool,\\n    hub_done: bool,\\n    hub_stats: [f32; 3],\\n    medley_i: u8,\\n    together_n: u8,\\n    together_i: u8,\\n    together_scores: Vec<f32>,\\n    together_names: Vec<String>,\\n    podium: Vec<(String, f32)>,\\n    demo: bool,\\n    attract_i: u8,\\n    attract_t: f32,\\n    reset_arm: bool,\\n    ghost_id: Option<crate::entity::EntityId>,\\n    about_page: usize,\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            flow: Flow::Title,\\n            run: Run::Story,\\n            saved_run: Run::Story,\\n            rules: Rules::default(),\\n            settings: Settings::default(),\\n            slots: vec![Slot::default(); 4],\\n            slot: 0,\\n            continuing: false,\\n            name: \\\"Guest\\\".into(),\\n            skin: 0,\\n            outfit: 0,\\n            day: 1,\\n            day_minutes: 0,\\n            total_stars: 0,\\n            stamps: 0,\\n            days_completed: 0,\\n            age: 80,\\n            skill: 0.0,\\n            ages: Vec::new(),\\n            ever_played: Vec::new(),\\n            today_played: Vec::new(),\\n            bests: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            ghosts: BTreeMap::new(),\\n            flips: 0,\\n            golden: false,\\n            flops: Vec::new(),\\n            free_play: false,\\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\\n            ending: String::new(),\\n            act: None,\\n            bal: BalanceCore::default(),\\n            score: 0.0,\\n            stars: 0,\\n            focus: 0,\\n            page: 0,\\n            line_i: 0,\\n            reveal: 0.0,\\n            card_t: 0.0,\\n            idle: 0,\\n            world_time: 0.0,\\n            time_scale: 1.0,\\n            save_serial: 0,\\n            today: 0,\\n            last_day: 0,\\n            last_lean: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            last_held: 0,\\n            last_pressed: 0,\\n            last_move: Vec2::ZERO,\\n            device: 0,\\n            seen_real: false,\\n            touch_only: false,\\n            audio_unlocked: false,\\n            song: 0,\\n            return_flow: Flow::Title,\\n            paused_from: Flow::Title,\\n            hub_mode: false,\\n            hub_wait: false,\\n            hub_done: false,\\n            hub_stats: [0.0; 3],\\n            medley_i: 0,\\n            together_n: 2,\\n            together_i: 0,\\n            together_scores: Vec::new(),\\n            together_names: Vec::new(),\\n            podium: Vec::new(),\\n            demo: false,\\n            attract_i: 0,\\n            attract_t: 0.0,\\n            reset_arm: false,\\n            ghost_id: None,\\n            about_page: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Versioned save. Progress and settings only; attract never calls this.\\n    pub fn export_save(&mut self) -> String {\\n        self.write_slot();\\n        let dto = SaveDto {\\n            version: SAVE_VERSION,\\n            slots: self.slots.clone(),\\n            settings: self.settings.clone(),\\n            last_day: self.last_day,\\n        };\\n        serde_json::to_string(&dto).unwrap_or_else(|_| \\\"{}\\\".into())\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn import_save(&mut self, text: &str) -> bool {\\n        let Ok(dto) = serde_json::from_str::<SaveDto>(text) else { return false };\\n        if dto.version != SAVE_VERSION {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        self.slots = dto.slots;\\n        while self.slots.len() < 4 {\\n            self.slots.push(Slot::default());\\n        }\\n        self.slots.truncate(4);\\n        self.settings = dto.settings;\\n        self.last_day = dto.last_day;\\n        let i = self.slot as usize;\\n        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\\n            self.read_slot(i);\\n        }\\n        true\\n    }\\n\\n    fn write_slot(&mut self) {\\n        let i = (self.slot as usize).min(3);\\n        let s = &mut self.slots[i];\\n        s.used = true;\\n        s.name = self.name.clone();\\n        s.skin = self.skin;\\n        s.outfit = self.outfit;\\n        s.day = self.day;\\n        s.minutes = self.day_minutes;\\n        s.stars = self.total_stars;\\n        s.stamps = self.stamps;\\n        s.days_completed = self.days_completed;\\n        s.age = self.age;\\n        s.bests = self.bests.clone();\\n        s.played = self.ever_played.clone();\\n        s.ages = self.ages.clone();\\n        s.flips = self.flips;\\n        s.golden = self.golden;\\n        s.free_play = self.free_play;\\n        s.won = self.outcome == Outcome::Won;\\n        s.ghosts = self.ghosts.clone();\\n        s.ending = self.ending.clone();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn read_slot(&mut self, i: usize) {\\n        let s = self.slots[i].clone();\\n        self.slot = i as u8;\\n        self.name = s.name;\\n        self.skin = s.skin;\\n        self.outfit = s.outfit;\\n        self.day = s.day.max(1);\\n        self.day_minutes = s.minutes;\\n        self.total_stars = s.stars;\\n        self.stamps = s.stamps;\\n        self.days_completed = s.days_completed;\\n        self.age = s.age;\\n        self.bests = s.bests;\\n        self.ever_played = s.played;\\n        self.ages = s.ages;\\n        self.flips = s.flips;\\n        self.golden = s.golden;\\n        self.free_play = s.free_play;\\n        self.outcome = if s.won { Outcome::Won } else { Outcome::Playing };\\n        self.ghosts = s.ghosts;\\n        self.ending = s.ending;\\n        self.today_played.clear();\\n        self.flow = if self.free_play { Flow::Island } else { Flow::Wake };\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn reset_progress(&mut self) {\\n        let settings = self.settings.clone();\\n        let today = self.today;\\n        let last_day = self.last_day;\\n        let serial = self.save_serial;\\n        let slot = self.slot;\\n        let slots = self.slots.clone();\\n        let flops = self.flops.clone();\\n        let device = self.device;\\n        let seen = self.seen_real;\\n        let touch = self.touch_only;\\n        let audio = self.audio_unlocked;\\n        *self = Self::fresh();\\n        self.settings = settings;\\n        self.today = today;\\n        self.last_day = last_day;\\n        self.save_serial = serial;\\n        self.slot = slot;\\n        self.slots = slots;\\n        self.flops = flops;\\n        self.device = device;\\n        self.seen_real = seen;\\n        self.touch_only = touch;\\n        self.audio_unlocked = audio;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn touch_save(&mut self) {\\n        if self.demo || self.run == Run::Demo || self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\\n        self.write_slot();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn script(&self) -> &'static Script {\\n        script::script()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn goal(&self) -> u32 {\\n        match self.day {\\n            1 => 3,\\n            2 => 5,\\n            3 => 7,\\n            4 => 9,\\n            _ => 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn day_clear(&self) -> bool {\\n        if self.free_play || self.day >= 5 {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        let all = EventId::for_day(self.day).iter().all(|e| self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()));\\n        all && self.day_minutes >= self.goal()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn schedule_events(&self) -> Vec<EventId> {\\n        if self.free_play {\\n            EventId::ALL.into_iter().filter(|e| !matches!(e, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand)).collect()\\n        } else if self.day >= 5 {\\n            vec![EventId::BigStand]\\n        } else {\\n            EventId::for_day(self.day).to_vec()\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn screen_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let s = self.script();\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title => {\\n                let mut v = vec![(ACT_NEW, \\\"New Stay\\\".into())];\\n                if self.slots.iter().any(|sl| sl.used) {\\n                    v.push((ACT_CONTINUE, \\\"Continue\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_TOGETHER, \\\"Play Together\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_ABOUT, \\\"About\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_HOWTO, \\\"How to Stand\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used {\\n                        continue;\\n                    }\\n                    let label = if sl.used { format!(\\\"{} · day {}\\\", sl.name, sl.day) } else { format!(\\\"Hammock {} · empty\\\", i + 1) };\\n                    v.push((10 + i as u16, label));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => s.names.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (400 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Look => s.skins.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (500 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Outfit => s.outfits.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (520 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    let done = if self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()) { \\\" · done\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" };\\n                    v.push((100 + i as u16, format!(\\\"{}{done}\\\", e.title())));\\n                }\\n                if self.day_clear() {\\n                    v.push((ACT_END_DAY, \\\"End the day\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESULT_BACK, \\\"Back to the island\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_RETRY, \\\"Retry\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Together => vec![\\n                (ACT_G2, \\\"2 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G3, \\\"3 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G4, \\\"4 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\\n            Flow::Dev => self.dev_items(),\\n            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Podium => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back to the title\\\".into())],\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let m = self.settings.music;\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (610, format!(\\\"Music {:.0}%\\\", m * 100.0)),\\n                (611, format!(\\\"Effects {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sfx * 100.0)),\\n                (612, format!(\\\"Voices {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.voice * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \\\"Glyphs: Xbox\\\" } else { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\\n                (613, format!(\\\"Lean {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sensitivity * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => vec![\\n                (614, format!(\\\"Wobble assist {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.wobble_assist * 100.0)),\\n                (615, \\\"Rhythm offset\\\".into()),\\n                (616, format!(\\\"Text {:.1}\\\", self.settings.text_speed)),\\n                (ACT_FULLSCREEN, if self.settings.fullscreen { \\\"Fullscreen on\\\" } else { \\\"Fullscreen off\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_RESET_SAVE, if self.reset_arm { \\\"Confirm erase\\\" } else { \\\"Erase save\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_DEV_RESET, \\\"Reset feel\\\".into()),\\n                (7, \\\"Wardrobe\\\".into()), // remapped in activate via label... use a dedicated id\\n                (43, \\\"Wardrobe\\\".into()),\\n                (44, \\\"Calendar\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => {\\n                let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n                let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\\n                let start = (self.page - 1) * 4;\\n                let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = infos\\n                    .iter()\\n                    .enumerate()\\n                    .skip(start)\\n                    .take(4)\\n                    .map(|(i, info)| {\\n                        let label = match &info.value {\\n                            ParamValue::Float(f) => format!(\\\"{} {f:.2}\\\", info.path),\\n                            ParamValue::Int(n) => format!(\\\"{} {n}\\\", info.path),\\n                            _ => info.path.clone(),\\n                        };\\n                        (300 + i as u16, label)\\n                    })\\n                    .collect();\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn start_activity(&mut self, kind: EventId, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if let Some(id) = self.ghost_id.take() {\\n            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        let rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        let mut act = Activity::start(kind, &rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n        if matches!(kind, EventId::Step | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            for n in &mut act.notes {\\n                n[0] += self.settings.rhythm_offset;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.bal = BalanceCore::default();\\n        self.bal.amp = self.rules.wobble * (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        self.bal.phase = [0, 1, 2, 3].map(|_| sim.state.rng.f32() * std::f32::consts::TAU);\\n        self.act = Some(act);\\n        self.score = 0.0;\\n        self.stars = 0;\\n        self.maybe_ghost(sim, kind);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_ghost(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, kind: EventId) {\\n        if self.day < 3 || self.run != Run::Story {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let zone = zone_of(kind);\\n        let have = self.ghosts.keys().any(|k| EventId::from_key(k).map(zone_of) == Some(zone));\\n        if !have {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);\\n        let id = sim.spawn_npc(\\\"yesterday\\\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\\n        self.ghost_id = Some(id);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn kind_now(&self) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.kind)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn finish_play(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() else { return };\\n        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\\n                    *slot += self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\\n                    self.together_i += 1;\\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.podium = self\\n                        .together_names\\n                        .iter()\\n                        .cloned()\\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\\n                        .collect();\\n                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Story => {\\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\\n                    self.mark_played(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Reveal;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else if kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \\\"rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"extended\\\" }.into();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Ending;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Demo => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bank(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let first = !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == kind.key());\\n        if self.run == Run::Story && !matches!(kind, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            let add = if first { 1 + self.stars as u32 } else { 1 };\\n            self.day_minutes += add;\\n        }\\n        self.total_stars += self.stars as u32;\\n        self.mark_played(kind);\\n        if !matches!(kind, EventId::Check) && self.run == Run::Story {\\n            let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n            if !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == &key) {\\n                self.today_played.push(key);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        let best = self.bests.get(&key).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        if self.score >= best {\\n            self.bests.insert(key.clone(), self.score);\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                self.ghosts.insert(key, act.samples.clone());\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.touch_save();\\n    }\\n\\n    fn mark_played(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        if !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == &key) {\\n            self.ever_played.push(key);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sleep_advance(&mut self) {\\n        if self.day <= 4 {\\n            self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n            self.days_completed += 1;\\n        }\\n        if self.day < 5 {\\n            self.day += 1;\\n        }\\n        self.day_minutes = 0;\\n        self.today_played.clear();\\n        self.touch_save();\\n        self.flow = Flow::Wake;\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if id == ACT_BACK {\\n            self.go_back();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title => match id {\\n                ACT_NEW => {\\n                    self.continuing = false;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_CONTINUE => {\\n                    self.continuing = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_TOGETHER => {\\n                    self.run = Run::Together;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Together;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\\n                ACT_ABOUT => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::About;\\n                    self.about_page = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_HOWTO => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::HowTo;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n                if (10..14).contains(&id) {\\n                    let i = (id - 10) as usize;\\n                    if self.continuing {\\n                        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                            self.read_slot(i);\\n                        }\\n                    } else {\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\\n                        self.reset_progress();\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Name;\\n                        self.focus = 0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => {\\n                if let Some(n) = self.script().names.get((id as usize).saturating_sub(400)) {\\n                    self.name = n.clone();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Look;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Look => {\\n                self.skin = id.saturating_sub(500) as u8;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Outfit;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Outfit => {\\n                self.outfit = id.saturating_sub(520) as u8;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Intro;\\n                self.line_i = 0;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.touch_save();\\n            }\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                if id == ACT_END_DAY && self.day_clear() {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Sleep;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                } else if (100..180).contains(&id) {\\n                    let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                    if let Some(kind) = evs.get((id - 100) as usize).copied() {\\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if id == ACT_RETRY {\\n                    if let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() {\\n                        self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n                        self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                        self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    self.after_result();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Together => {\\n                let n = match id {\\n                    ACT_G2 => 2,\\n                    ACT_G3 => 3,\\n                    ACT_G4 => 4,\\n                    _ => 0,\\n                };\\n                if n > 0 {\\n                    self.begin_together(n);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev => match id {\\n                ACT_RESUME | ACT_BACK => self.flow = self.paused_from,\\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\\n                43 => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Wardrobe;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                44 => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Calendar;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Flow::Pause => {\\n                if id == ACT_RESUME {\\n                    self.flow = self.paused_from;\\n                } else if id == ACT_SETTINGS {\\n                    self.open_settings();\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Settings => self.activate_settings(id),\\n            Flow::Podium => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Title;\\n                self.run = Run::Story;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.go_back(),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn begin_together(&mut self, n: u8) {\\n        let names = self.script().names.clone();\\n        self.together_n = n.clamp(2, 4);\\n        self.together_i = 0;\\n        self.medley_i = 0;\\n        self.together_names = (0..self.together_n).map(|i| names.get(i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| format!(\\\"Guest {}\\\", i + 1))).collect();\\n        self.together_scores = vec![0.0; self.together_n as usize];\\n        self.run = Run::Together;\\n        self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn open_settings(&mut self) {\\n        self.return_flow = if self.flow == Flow::Settings { self.return_flow } else { self.flow };\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n            self.demo = false;\\n        }\\n        self.flow = Flow::Settings;\\n        self.page = 0;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.reset_arm = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate_settings(&mut self, id: u16) {\\n        match id {\\n            ACT_XBOX => self.settings.xbox = !self.settings.xbox,\\n            ACT_FULLSCREEN => self.settings.fullscreen = !self.settings.fullscreen,\\n            ACT_RESET_SAVE => {\\n                if self.reset_arm {\\n                    self.slots = vec![Slot::default(); 4];\\n                    self.reset_arm = false;\\n                    self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\\n                } else {\\n                    self.reset_arm = true;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ACT_BACK => self.go_back(),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn go_back(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.flow = match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Slots | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Settings | Flow::Podium => {\\n                if self.flow == Flow::Settings || self.flow == Flow::About || self.flow == Flow::HowTo {\\n                    let back = self.return_flow;\\n                    if back == Flow::Attract {\\n                        self.demo = true;\\n                    }\\n                    if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\\n                        self.run = Run::Story;\\n                    }\\n                    back\\n                } else if self.flow == Flow::Podium {\\n                    self.run = Run::Story;\\n                    Flow::Title\\n                } else {\\n                    Flow::Title\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Schedule => Flow::Island,\\n            Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => self.return_flow,\\n            Flow::Dev => self.paused_from,\\n            Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit => Flow::Title,\\n            _ => Flow::Title,\\n        };\\n    }\\n\\n    fn after_result(&mut self) {\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        if self.run == Run::Direct || self.hub_mode {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if self.run == Run::Together {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_slider(&mut self, id: u16, v: f32) {\\n        let v = v.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        match id {\\n            610 => self.settings.music = v,\\n            611 => self.settings.sfx = v,\\n            612 => self.settings.voice = v,\\n            613 => self.settings.sensitivity = 0.5 + v,\\n            614 => self.settings.wobble_assist = v,\\n            615 => self.settings.rhythm_offset = (v - 0.5) * 0.1,\\n            616 => self.settings.text_speed = 0.5 + v * 1.5,\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n        if !(300..400).contains(&id) {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\\n        let Some(info) = infos.get((id - 300) as usize) else { return };\\n        let path = info.path.clone();\\n        let value = match info.kind.clone() {\\n            ParamKind::Float { min, max } => ParamValue::Float((min + v * (max - min)) as f64),\\n            ParamKind::Int { min, max } => ParamValue::Int((min as f32 + v * (max - min) as f32).round() as i64),\\n            _ => return,\\n        };\\n        let _ = params::set(&mut self.rules, &path, value);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn talk(&self) -> Vec<(String, String)> {\\n        let s = self.script();\\n        let pull = |speaker: &str, tag: &str| -> Vec<(String, String)> {\\n            let n = s.count(speaker, tag);\\n            (0..n).filter_map(|i| s.line(speaker, tag, i).map(|t| (speaker.to_string(), t.to_string()))).collect()\\n        };\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Intro => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"intro\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Welcome ashore. The mat remembers nothing yet.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Wake => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                if self.last_day > 0 && self.today > self.last_day {\\n                    let d = self.today - self.last_day;\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"You were away {d} days. The mat kept your place.\\\")));\\n                }\\n                let tag = format!(\\\"wake{}\\\", self.day.min(5));\\n                v.extend(pull(\\\"Pip\\\", &tag));\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Morning. The deck is already warm.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"reveal\\\");\\n                v.insert(0, (\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"Balance Age {}}. Lower means the mat was calmer.\\\", self.age)));\\n                // fix accidental brace - I'll correct below if compile fails\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Sleep => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"sleep\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Stamp the day. The hammock is already on your side.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Ending => {\\n                let tag_line = if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" {\\n                    \\\"The rowboat is ready. You may check out, or stay and play.\\\"\\n                } else {\\n                    \\\"The week would like a little more of you. The hammock agrees. This is the Extended Stay.\\\"\\n                };\\n                vec![(\\\"Pip\\\".into(), tag_line.into())]\\n            }\\n            Flow::Credits => {\\n                let mut v = pull(\\\"Pip\\\", \\\"credits\\\");\\n                if v.is_empty() {\\n                    v.push((\\\"Pip\\\".into(), \\\"Tippy Cay keeps the light on.\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Pass => {\\n                let name = self.together_names.get(self.together_i as usize).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Guest\\\".into());\\n                vec![(\\\"Pip\\\".into(), format!(\\\"Pass the pad to {name}.\\\"))]\\n            }\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn talk_advance(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let n = self.talk().len().max(1);\\n        if self.line_i + 1 < n {\\n            self.line_i += 1;\\n            self.reveal = 0.0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n        self.reveal = 0.0;\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Intro => self.flow = Flow::Wake,\\n            Flow::Wake => {\\n                if self.today > 0 {\\n                    self.last_day = self.today;\\n                }\\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Check, sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => {\\n                if self.day >= 5 && !self.free_play {\\n                    self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Sleep => self.sleep_advance(),\\n            Flow::Ending => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Credits;\\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                self.free_play = true;\\n                self.touch_save();\\n            }\\n            Flow::Credits => {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n                self.free_play = true;\\n            }\\n            Flow::Pass => {\\n                self.medley_i = 0;\\n                self.start_activity(MEDLEY[0], sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                self.card_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn enter_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        self.saved_run = self.run;\\n        self.run = Run::Demo;\\n        self.demo = true;\\n        self.flow = Flow::Attract;\\n        self.attract_i = 0;\\n        self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n        self.idle = 0;\\n        self.arm_attract(sim);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn exit_attract(&mut self) {\\n        self.demo = false;\\n        self.run = if self.saved_run == Run::Demo { Run::Story } else { self.saved_run };\\n        self.flow = Flow::Title;\\n        self.act = None;\\n        self.focus = 0;\\n        self.idle = 0;\\n        self.attract_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn arm_attract(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let name = ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n        if let Some(kind) = EventId::from_key(name) {\\n            self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n        } else {\\n            self.act = None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn attract_len(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n            \\\"island\\\" => 8.0,\\n            \\\"title\\\" => 5.0,\\n            _ => 15.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn desired_song(&self) -> u8 {\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract || !self.audio_unlocked {\\n            return 0;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Credits | Flow::Ending => 6,\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown => match self.kind_now() {\\n                Some(EventId::Step) => 4,\\n                Some(EventId::BigStand) => 3,\\n                Some(EventId::Lap | EventId::Floatie) => 5,\\n                Some(EventId::Paddle | EventId::Tide | EventId::Cannon | EventId::Tray) => 2,\\n                _ => 1,\\n            },\\n            _ => 1,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn note_device(&mut self, input: &InputFrame) {\\n        if input.device != 0 {\\n            self.device = input.device;\\n        } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::PAUSE | buttons::MENU_DOWN | buttons::MENU_UP) {\\n            self.device = 2;\\n        }\\n        if self.device == 1 || self.device == 2 || self.device == 3 {\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n            self.touch_only = false;\\n        }\\n        if self.device == 4 && !self.seen_real {\\n            self.touch_only = true;\\n        }\\n        let touched = input.device == 4 && (input.any || input.ui.is_some());\\n        if (input.woke() && input.device != 4) || touched || input.pressed != 0 && input.device != 4 {\\n            self.audio_unlocked = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn pregame(&self) -> bool {\\n        !self.hub_mode\\n            && matches!(\\n                self.flow,\\n                Flow::Title | Flow::Slots | Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo\\n            )\\n    }\\n\\n    fn menu_flow(&self) -> bool {\\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Island | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tick_activity(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> bool {\\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        rules.wobble *= (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        let lean = (self.last_lean * self.settings.sensitivity).clamp_length_max(1.0);\\n        let held = self.last_held;\\n        let pressed = self.last_pressed;\\n        let mut act = self.act.take();\\n        let done = if let Some(act) = act.as_mut() {\\n            events::tick(act, &mut self.bal, sim, lean, held, pressed, dt, &rules, events);\\n            act.done\\n        } else {\\n            false\\n        };\\n        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\\n        self.act = act;\\n        done\\n    }\\n\\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\\n            }\\n            out.insert(id, f);\\n        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn press_bits(&self, sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let items = self.screen_items();\\n                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\\n                        && self\\n                            .schedule_events()\\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\\n                });\\n                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\\n                if self.focus == want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else if self.focus < want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_DOWN)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Title => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\\n            _ => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n        }\\n        .let_sim(sim)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Tiny adapter so the match above can ignore `sim` without a warning dance.\\ntrait LetSim {\\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self;\\n}\\nimpl<T> LetSim for T {\\n    fn let_sim(self, _sim: &Sim) -> Self {\\n        self\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn zone_of(kind: EventId) -> &'static str {\\n    match kind {\\n        EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose | EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank | EventId::Step | EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"studio\\\",\\n        EventId::Lap | EventId::Tray => \\\"path\\\",\\n        EventId::Floatie | EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"lagoon\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_speaker_count(speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n    script::script().speaker_count(speaker)\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_title_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().titles.len()\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_name_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().names.len()\\n}\\n\\n/// Builds Tippy Cay. `medley` is the hub course. `event/<key>` starts that activity's card.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/hub\\\", LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"tippy cay: {e}\\\"))?;\\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, \\\"fit\\\", def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 8.0;\\n    let mut game = FitGame::fresh();\\n    if let Ok(rules) = toml::from_str::<Rules>(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/rules\\\", RULES_TEXT)) {\\n        game.rules = rules;\\n    }\\n    if let Some(p) = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)) {\\n        game.flops = vec![\\n            [p.x + 2.2, p.z + 0.4],\\n            [p.x - 2.0, p.z + 1.2],\\n            [p.x + 1.2, p.z + 2.4],\\n            [p.x - 1.4, p.z - 1.6],\\n            [p.x + 3.0, p.z - 0.8],\\n        ];\\n    }\\n    match rest {\\n        Some(\\\"medley\\\") => {\\n            game.run = Run::Medley;\\n            game.hub_mode = true;\\n            game.medley_i = 0;\\n            game.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\\n            game.flow = Flow::Event;\\n        }\\n        Some(s) if let Some(key) = s.strip_prefix(\\\"event/\\\") => {\\n            let kind = EventId::from_key(key).unwrap_or(EventId::Breath);\\n            game.run = Run::Direct;\\n            game.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n            game.flow = Flow::Card;\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\\n    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for FitGame {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"fit\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let dts = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        self.note_device(input);\\n        let attract_woke = self.flow == Flow::Attract && input.device != 4 && input.woke();\\n        if attract_woke {\\n            self.exit_attract();\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && input.hub == 1 {\\n            self.hub_wait = true;\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && (input.hub == 2 || input.just(buttons::HUB_GO)) {\\n            self.hub_wait = false;\\n        }\\n        if !attract_woke {\\n            if let Some(ui) = input.ui {\\n                match ui {\\n                    UiEvent::Hover(id) => {\\n                        if let Some(i) = self.screen_items().iter().position(|(n, _)| *n == id) {\\n                            self.focus = i;\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                    UiEvent::Click(id) => {\\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Attract && id == ACT_SETTINGS {\\n                            self.open_settings();\\n                            self.return_flow = Flow::Attract;\\n                        } else if self.flow != Flow::Attract {\\n                            self.activate(id, sim);\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                    UiEvent::Slider(id, v) => {\\n                        if self.flow == Flow::Dev || self.flow == Flow::Settings {\\n                            self.apply_slider(id, v);\\n                        }\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\\n                self.paused_from = self.flow;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.page = 0;\\n                self.flow = if self.hub_mode { Flow::Pause } else { Flow::Dev };\\n            } else if input.just(buttons::PAUSE) && matches!(self.flow, Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause) {\\n                self.flow = self.paused_from;\\n            } else if self.menu_flow() {\\n                let n = self.screen_items().len();\\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_DOWN) {\\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + 1) % n;\\n                }\\n                if n > 0 && input.just(buttons::MENU_UP) {\\n                    self.focus = (self.focus + n - 1) % n;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_R) {\\n                    self.page += 1;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_L) {\\n                    self.page = self.page.saturating_sub(1);\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                if input.just(buttons::BACK) {\\n                    self.go_back();\\n                } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    if matches!(\\n                        self.flow,\\n                        Flow::Intro | Flow::Wake | Flow::Reveal | Flow::Sleep | Flow::Ending | Flow::Credits | Flow::Pass\\n                    ) {\\n                        self.talk_advance(sim);\\n                    } else if let Some((id, _)) = self.screen_items().get(self.focus).copied() {\\n                        self.activate(id, sim);\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Island && input.just(buttons::SCHEDULE) {\\n                self.flow = Flow::Schedule;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n                self.page = 0;\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Card {\\n                self.card_t += dts;\\n                if self.card_t >= 1.0 || input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Countdown;\\n                    self.card_t = 3.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Countdown {\\n                self.card_t -= dts;\\n                if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM) {\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                }\\n                if self.card_t <= 0.0 {\\n                    self.flow = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Check) { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\\n                }\\n            } else if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n                self.attract_t += dts;\\n                if self.attract_t >= self.attract_len() {\\n                    self.attract_t = 0.0;\\n                    self.attract_i = (self.attract_i + 1) % ATTRACT.len() as u8;\\n                    self.arm_attract(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.pregame() {\\n            let active = if input.device == 4 {\\n                matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_)))\\n            } else {\\n                input.woke() || matches!(input.ui, Some(UiEvent::Click(_) | UiEvent::Slider(_, _)))\\n            };\\n            if active {\\n                self.idle = 0;\\n            } else {\\n                self.idle += 1;\\n                if self.idle >= 600 {\\n                    self.enter_attract(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.reveal = (self.reveal + dts * 48.0 * self.settings.text_speed).min(400.0);\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract {\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                let (lean, bits) = events::bot(act, &self.bal, &self.rules);\\n                self.last_lean = lean;\\n                self.last_held = bits;\\n                self.last_pressed = bits;\\n                self.last_move = Vec2::ZERO;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.last_lean = input.lean;\\n            self.last_held = input.held;\\n            self.last_pressed = input.pressed;\\n            self.last_move = input.move_dir;\\n        }\\n        let song = self.desired_song();\\n        if song != self.song {\\n            self.song = song;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Music { song });\\n        }\\n        if self.menu_flow() {\\n            if let Some((_, text)) = self.talk().get(self.line_i) {\\n                if self.reveal as usize % 3 == 1 {\\n                    events.push(SimEvent::Syllable { speaker: 0, vowel: (self.line_i as u8) % 5, pitch: 1.15 });\\n                }\\n                let _ = text;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.drive_player(sim)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.apply_body(sim);\\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += dt;\\n                }\\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Attract => {\\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\\n            }\\n            Flow::Island => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += dt;\\n                }\\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        Vec::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let event = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.key()).unwrap_or(\\\"\\\");\\n        let hub_score: f32 = self.hub_stats.iter().sum();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"phase\\\": self.flow.name(),\\n            \\\"event\\\": event,\\n            \\\"score\\\": self.score,\\n            \\\"stars\\\": self.stars,\\n            \\\"outcome\\\": match self.outcome {\\n                Outcome::Playing => \\\"playing\\\",\\n                Outcome::Won => \\\"won\\\",\\n                Outcome::Lost => \\\"lost\\\",\\n            },\\n            \\\"stamps\\\": self.stamps,\\n            \\\"played\\\": self.ever_played,\\n            \\\"age\\\": self.age,\\n            \\\"world_time\\\": self.world_time,\\n            \\\"music\\\": self.settings.music,\\n            \\\"sfx\\\": self.settings.sfx,\\n            \\\"voice\\\": self.settings.voice,\\n            \\\"save_serial\\\": self.save_serial,\\n            \\\"demo\\\": self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            \\\"hub\\\": {\\n                \\\"score\\\": hub_score.clamp(0.0, 3000.0),\\n                \\\"label\\\": \\\"Inter-Resort Medley\\\",\\n                \\\"done\\\": self.hub_done,\\n                \\\"stats\\\": {\\\"paddle\\\": self.hub_stats[0], \\\"tide\\\": self.hub_stats[1], \\\"cannon\\\": self.hub_stats[2]},\\n                \\\"ghost\\\": self.hub_mode,\\n            },\\n            \\\"podium\\\": self.podium.iter().map(|(n, s)| json!({\\\"name\\\": n, \\\"score\\\": s})).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\\n            \\\"day\\\": self.day,\\n            \\\"minutes\\\": self.day_minutes,\\n            \\\"goal\\\": self.goal(),\\n            \\\"stiffness\\\": self.rules.stiffness,\\n            \\\"version\\\": SAVE_VERSION,\\n            \\\"name\\\": self.name,\\n            \\\"xbox\\\": self.settings.xbox,\\n            \\\"touch_card\\\": self.touch_only,\\n            \\\"ending\\\": self.ending,\\n            \\\"free_play\\\": self.free_play,\\n            \\\"golden\\\": self.golden,\\n            \\\"today\\\": self.today,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\\n        self.outcome\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        let (lean, bits) = self.press_bits(sim);\\n        InputFrame { lean, held: bits, pressed: bits, ..Default::default() }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\\n        if self.hub_wait {\\n            return true;\\n        }\\n        if self.hub_mode && self.flow == Flow::Pause {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Island | Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn fit_ui(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<FitUi> {\\n        let items_src = self.screen_items();\\n        let rects = fit_ui::stack_rects(items_src.len());\\n        let items = items_src\\n            .iter()\\n            .enumerate()\\n            .map(|(i, (id, label))| FitItem {\\n                id: *id,\\n                label: label.clone(),\\n                rect: rects.get(i).copied().unwrap_or([0.27, 0.4, 0.46, 0.09]),\\n            })\\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>();\\n        let focus_id = items.get(self.focus).map(|it| it.id).unwrap_or(0);\\n        let talk = self.talk();\\n        let (speaker, mut body) = talk.get(self.line_i).cloned().unwrap_or_else(|| (String::new(), String::new()));\\n        let shown = self.reveal as usize;\\n        if shown < body.len() {\\n            body.truncate(shown.max(1).min(body.len()));\\n        }\\n        let mut lines = Vec::new();\\n        if !body.is_empty() {\\n            lines.push(body);\\n        }\\n        let (title, big, extra) = self.banner();\\n        if !extra.is_empty() && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(extra);\\n        }\\n        if self.touch_only && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        let puck = if matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card) {\\n            Some([self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y, 0.34, 1.0])\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let yaw = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Lap) && self.flow == Flow::Event {\\n            Some(self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t * 0.35).unwrap_or(0.0))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let action = \\\"confirm\\\";\\n        Some(FitUi {\\n            screen: self.flow.name().into(),\\n            title: if title.is_empty() { TITLE.into() } else { title },\\n            lines,\\n            items,\\n            focus: focus_id,\\n            device: self.device,\\n            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\\n            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            action: action.into(),\\n            demo: self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            touch_card: self.touch_only,\\n            puck,\\n            big,\\n            footer: self.footer(),\\n            camera_yaw: yaw,\\n            prompt_kind: match self.device {\\n                2 => 1,\\n                3 => 2,\\n                4 => 3,\\n                _ => 0,\\n            },\\n        })\\n        .map(|mut ui| {\\n            if !speaker.is_empty() && ui.lines.first().is_some() {\\n                // Speaker stays in the title slot when the banner did not claim it.\\n                if ui.title == TITLE {\\n                    ui.title = speaker;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ui\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tint(&self, id: crate::entity::EntityId) -> Option<([f32; 3], f32)> {\\n        if self.ghost_id == Some(id) {\\n            Some(([0.62, 0.84, 1.0], 0.45))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn banner(&self) -> (String, String, String) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title | Flow::Attract => (TITLE.into(), if self.flow == Flow::Attract { \\\"DEMO\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" }.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Card => {\\n                let k = self.kind_now();\\n                (k.map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_default(), String::new(), k.map(|k| k.blurb().into()).unwrap_or_default())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Countdown => {\\n                let n = self.card_t.ceil().clamp(1.0, 3.0) as i32;\\n                (\\\"Ready\\\".into(), n.to_string(), String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                let title = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Mat\\\".into());\\n                let score = format!(\\\"{:.0}\\\", self.score);\\n                (title, score, String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                let t = script::rank_title(self.score);\\n                (t, format!(\\\"{} stars\\\", self.stars), format!(\\\"Score {:.0}\\\", self.score))\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => (\\\"Balance Age\\\".into(), self.age.to_string(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Ending => (\\n                if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" { \\\"Rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"Extended Stay\\\" }.into(),\\n                String::new(),\\n                String::new(),\\n            ),\\n            Flow::Credits => (\\\"Credits\\\".into(), TITLE.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Podium => (\\\"Podium\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Dev => (\\\"Dev Mode\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Sliders ride along. Reset restores the mat.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Settings => (\\\"Settings\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::About => (\\\"About\\\".into(), String::new(), about_page(self.about_page)),\\n            Flow::HowTo => (\\\"How to Stand\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Lean with the stick, the keys, or the mouse. Last one wins.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Island => (format!(\\\"Day {}\\\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\\\"{} / {} minutes\\\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\\n            Flow::Schedule => (\\\"Today\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            _ => (TITLE.into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn footer(&self) -> String {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"schedule\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \\\" schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"lean\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_body(&self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(ch) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) else { return };\\n        ch.anim.tilt_side = self.bal.cob.x * 14.0;\\n        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = self.bal.cob.y * 14.0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn collect_flops(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        if self.last_pressed & buttons::CONFIRM == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(feet) = sim.feet(id) else { return };\\n        for (i, p) in self.flops.iter().enumerate().take(5) {\\n            let bit = 1u8 << i;\\n            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\\n                continue;\\n            }\\n            let d = (feet.x - p[0]).hypot(feet.z - p[1]);\\n            if d < 1.2 {\\n                self.flips |= bit;\\n                events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 30, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + i as f32 * 0.05 });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\\n            self.golden = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\\n        \\\"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows.\\\",\\n        \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo.\\\",\\n        \\\"Testing Feedback: the stay, every event, and the medley are driven in the sim. Engine Feedback: one balance model, one synth, menus inside the tick. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships; the time-cut list does not.\\\",\\n        \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\",\\n    ];\\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod save_tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn save_round_trips_the_stay() {\\n        let mut g = FitGame::fresh();\\n        g.day = 3;\\n        g.age = 22;\\n        g.stamps = 2;\\n        g.name = \\\"Kai\\\".into();\\n        g.settings.music = 0.25;\\n        let blob = g.export_save();\\n        g.day = 1;\\n        g.age = 80;\\n        g.settings.music = 0.10;\\n        assert!(g.import_save(&blob));\\n        assert_eq!(g.day, 3);\\n        assert_eq!(g.age, 22);\\n        assert_eq!(g.stamps, 2);\\n        assert_eq!(g.name, \\\"Kai\\\");\\n        assert!((g.settings.music - 0.25).abs() < 1e-5);\\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\\\"{\\\"));\\n        assert!(!g.import_save(\\\"{\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\":9,\\\\\\\"slots\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settings\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"last_day\\\\\\\":0}\\\"));\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn script_has_the_cast() {\\n        assert!(script_speaker_count(\\\"Pip\\\") >= 80, \\\"pip {}\\\", script_speaker_count(\\\"Pip\\\"));\\n        for s in [\\\"Posey\\\", \\\"Kettle\\\", \\\"Bounce\\\", \\\"Gull\\\"] {\\n            assert!(script_speaker_count(s) >= 25, \\\"{s} {}\\\", script_speaker_count(s));\\n        }\\n        assert!(script_title_count() >= 30);\\n        assert!(script_name_count() >= 40);\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"fe8ec1a3-6874-4693-912a-8cc229e8d191"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_183","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A syntax error was intentionally noted.\n\nThe syntax error was an extra closing brace in a format string. The `fit_ui` function signature and `.map` usage were also verified as correct.\n\nThe `press_bits` match expression is valid. A format bug in `talk()` Reveal still needs fixing. `screen_items().get(self.focus).copied()` fails because the tuple contains a `String`, which does not implement `Copy`.\n\n`.cloned()` is needed instead of `.copied()` for the `String` tuple. The dev_items list contains a duplicate Wardrobe entry at ID 7, which is ACT_BACK and would trigger go_back if activated. That entry should be removed.\n\nThe name screen shows only six of forty preset names. TAB will page through the list. The bot confirms focus zero on page zero.\n\nThe Outfit screen also drops items with `take(6)`, leaving Golden and Swim hidden. Both the Outfit and Name screens will be made paginated so every item is reachable. The immediate priority is fixing the known compile errors first.\n\nThe `fit_ui` map is acceptable despite looking slightly awkward. Let chains in match guards are fully supported by Rust 1.98. The settings import test uses a minimal JSON payload with empty slots and an empty settings object, which serde defaults handle correctly.\n\nA potential syntax error was identified in the match guard. `if let` is not a valid boolean expression for match guards, since `let` is not a boolean value. Let chains are only permitted in `if` and `while` blocks, not inside match arms.\n\nThe match guard syntax error is confirmed to be a hard compile failure. The `if let` pattern inside the guard must be rewritten as an `if let` block within the match arm instead.\n\nThe dev page decrements safely because the catch-all match arm prevents underflow. The settings page is capped at one, so extra tabs are harmless. TAB on the title screen increments the page counter even though title items ignore it. Name screen IDs start at 400 and activate correctly. The bot presses CONFIRM on the name screen because Name is not a special flow in press_bits.\n\nThe bot confirms focus zero on the name screen to select the first preset. Look and outfit screens behave identically. The slots screen confirms the hammock at ID 10. Intro is handled by a default CONFIRM branch that calls talk_advance. Wake is correctly included in the talk list. A potential conflict between menu and talk checks was noted.\n\nTalk flows are checked before menu items. Pause opens the dev screen even on the title screen, which is expected by tests. During attract mode, pause enters dev without exiting attract, leaving demo state unchanged; this is an acceptable edge case. The pause and menu branches use an if-else chain, so a single tick cannot trigger both. A rare collision between a UI click and pause remains possible.\n\nThe idle attract logic is being checked for a fall-through bug. After entering attract mode, the code may still increment idle and trigger another transition on the same tick.\n\nThe idle attract logic is confirmed safe. Entering attract mode on the 600th step does not trigger a same-tick timer fall-through; attract runs on the next tick once demo becomes true. A second `impl FitGame` block for `banner` was also found as a compile error.\n\nThe `press_bits` method is correctly placed in the first `impl` block. The `LetSim` helper is slightly awkward but compiles, so it will be left as-is. The `match {}.let_sim(sim)` call is valid because the method belongs to the tuple type. In `events::tick`, the first argument is `&mut Activity`, which matches the signature. The local `act` variable and `self.bal` are separate, so taking `act` and borrowing `self.bal` simultaneously is safe.\n\nfinish_play stores the activity after tick_activity returns, and start_activity replaces it correctly. Ghost spawn during start uses the simulation object properly. Room parsing might fail, but that is expected. Rules TOML field names match the deserialized struct. Script TOML parsing in tests could fall back to a default line count if a line is malformed, which would cause test failure. The speaker name \"Kettle\" aligns with the coach name \"Big Kettle\", so pose counts resolve correctly. Posey, Bounce, and Gull are also set up properly.\n\nThe `camera_yaw` field is set correctly. The dev page will be trimmed to five items: Resume, Reset, Wardrobe, Calendar, and Settings. An About entry may be added later.\n\nThe dev page will remain at five items. The settings page has six entries. The name screen has six items and returns to the title via the BACK button. The bot will not press back. Outfit will be paginated to show all eight items. The `pre` confirmation branch also needs `.cloned()` instead of `.copied()` because the tuple contains a `String`. The `buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::PAUSE` bitwise OR is valid because `just` checks the bit mask.\n\nThe second `impl FitGame` block is valid. Rust allows methods in later impl blocks to be called by earlier ones, so `fit_ui` can invoke `self.banner()` even though `banner` is defined in the later block.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-38d5b95e-9268-4329-9760-48c48caf4ae3-88","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct Piece|rounded","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/level.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18724,"output_tokens":4337,"cache_read_input_tokens":174976,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"562f4b63-fba8-42ab-9c2e-85ce6dc9d0d2"}
