{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5ffd4bc9-43a4-468b-b5be-44d363a2c3af-97","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[114,117,115,116,99,32,49,46,57,57,46,48,32,40,98,57,52,48,48,56,52,100,55,32,50,48,50,54,45,48,57,45,50,56,41,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\nrustc 1.99.0 (b940084d7 2026-09-28)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"ls -d target 2>/dev/null | head -1; ls target/debug/.fingerprint/pav_core-* 2>/dev/null | head -3; rustc --version\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"See if the engine has a warm build cache\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-5ffd4bc9-43a4-468b-b5be-44d363a2c3af-97.log\",\"total_bytes\":36}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d05c44ce-40d1-458c-a6ec-dee5b7a9abb1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_187","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `ls -d target` command likely failed silently because it returned a non-zero exit code. The semicolon operator was used instead of `&&`, which allowed rustc to run regardless.\n\nNo target cache exists. The first compile will be slow because rapier and pav_core must be built from scratch. I will run cargo check with CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 in the engine directory. If offline mode fails, I will retry without it.\n\nThe cargo registry is likely warm from prior sessions, so dependencies should resolve quickly. A five-minute timeout may be too short for a cold rapier build. I will start the compilation in the background and write the integration test while it runs.\n\nThe test will be large and cover all verification items. If the code fails to compile, both the test and the implementation will be fixed together.\n\nI will log to scratch rather than /tmp. I noticed the Dev activate ACT_ABOUT was added correctly. I am checking a potential compile error in fit_ui involving Option mapping and semicolons. I also need to verify that character field access uses as_mut() on an Option<Box<Character>>.\n\nThe `as_mut` call on the character Option correctly yields `Option<&mut Box<Character>>`, so `ch.anim` derefs properly. I will launch cargo check in the background and write a smaller test first, since balance is already covered by existing lib tests. The full fit integration test will wait until compilation succeeds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f13d1699-1893-46ec-886c-5451f5a92453-98","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo check -p pav_core --locked --offline 2>&1","description":"Compile pav_core to surface game errors","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":305,"output_tokens":854,"cache_read_input_tokens":204288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"60ca1957-b286-4ddb-b7e4-d2ff0c520663"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f13d1699-1893-46ec-886c-5451f5a92453-98","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"ee4a041c-d178-4b22-8f32-192fe20bce68\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-f13d1699-1893-46ec-886c-5451f5a92453-98.log\",\"status\":\"running\",\"command\":\"CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo check -p pav_core --locked --offline 2>&1\",\"summary\":\"Background task ee4a041c-d178-4b22-8f32-192fe20bce68 started\",\"retrieval_hint\":\"Use get_command_or_subagent_output with task_ids=[\\\"ee4a041c-d178-4b22-8f32-192fe20bce68\\\"] when you need the output.\",\"pid\":4025776}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"887ace9d-1992-43b8-8db3-2cd4f80fe254"}
