{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_211","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Proceeding to implement fixes and tests.\n\nAnalyzing the tide mechanics. Shells accelerate toward pools at roughly 7 m/s² and reach terminal velocity near 2.2 m/s after about one second. Three shells can pot simultaneously without colliding. The 20-second window is sufficient.\n\nTide mechanics are confirmed sound. The bot reads pool positions each frame and aims accurately.\n\nPaddle gate timing is also verified. Gates are spaced every 8 meters. Lateral error closes in under half a second at the current speed. The finish line should be reached in roughly 17 seconds.\n\nGusts on the paddle do not affect boat position because the bot steers directly via lean.\n\nThe main fixes remaining are the cannon, tray idle, step window, and gust PD.\n\nSquat scoring is being checked. The bot holds confirm when the guide exceeds depth. Depth integrates upward while held and downward otherwise. A full cycle yields ten reps with full points if depth stays above 0.75. The completion condition is tricky and needs probing.\n\nBreath mechanics are verified. The bot sets pressed and held bits every tick, including during breath, and tick_breath uses held correctly.\n\nMenu transitions are also confirmed. Entering Card skips directly to countdown. After results, the bot returns to Island, opens Schedule, and confirms through unplayed entries.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f7e06e3-c76c-4638-914a-21dcc1952fee-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":544,"limit":110}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":510,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":125952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7d00a0c5-db53-4696-8954-9427c80025e9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8f7e06e3-c76c-4638-914a-21dcc1952fee-53","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"544→            Flow::Slots => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used {\\n                        continue;\\n                    }\\n550→                    let label = if sl.used { format!(\\\"{} · day {}\\\", sl.name, sl.day) } else { format!(\\\"Hammock {} · empty\\\", i + 1) };\\n                    v.push((10 + i as u16, label));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => s.names.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (400 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Look => s.skins.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (500 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Outfit => s.outfits.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (520 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n560→                let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    let done = if self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()) { \\\" · done\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" };\\n                    v.push((100 + i as u16, format!(\\\"{}{done}\\\", e.title())));\\n                }\\n                if self.day_clear() {\\n                    v.push((ACT_END_DAY, \\\"End the day\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n570→                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESULT_BACK, \\\"Back to the island\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_RETRY, \\\"Retry\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Together => vec![\\n                (ACT_G2, \\\"2 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G3, \\\"3 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G4, \\\"4 guests\\\".into()),\\n580→                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\\n            Flow::Dev => self.dev_items(),\\n            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Podium => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back to the title\\\".into())],\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n590→    }\\n\\n    fn settings_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let m = self.settings.music;\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (610, format!(\\\"Music {:.0}%\\\", m * 100.0)),\\n                (611, format!(\\\"Effects {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sfx * 100.0)),\\n                (612, format!(\\\"Voices {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.voice * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \\\"Glyphs: Xbox\\\" } else { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\\n600→                (613, format!(\\\"Lean {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sensitivity * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => vec![\\n                (614, format!(\\\"Wobble assist {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.wobble_assist * 100.0)),\\n                (615, \\\"Rhythm offset\\\".into()),\\n                (616, format!(\\\"Text {:.1}\\\", self.settings.text_speed)),\\n                (ACT_FULLSCREEN, if self.settings.fullscreen { \\\"Fullscreen on\\\" } else { \\\"Fullscreen off\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_RESET_SAVE, if self.reset_arm { \\\"Confirm erase\\\" } else { \\\"Erase save\\\" }.into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n610→            ],\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn dev_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_DEV_RESET, \\\"Reset feel\\\".into()),\\n                (43, \\\"Wardrobe\\\".into()),\\n620→                (44, \\\"Calendar\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_ABOUT, \\\"About\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            _ => {\\n                let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n                let infos = params::list(&mut rules);\\n                let start = (self.page - 1) * 4;\\n                let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = infos\\n                    .iter()\\n630→                    .enumerate()\\n                    .skip(start)\\n                    .take(4)\\n                    .map(|(i, info)| {\\n                        let label = match &info.value {\\n                            ParamValue::Float(f) => format!(\\\"{} {f:.2}\\\", info.path),\\n                            ParamValue::Int(n) => format!(\\\"{} {n}\\\", info.path),\\n                            _ => info.path.clone(),\\n                        };\\n                        (300 + i as u16, label)\\n640→                    })\\n                    .collect();\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn start_activity(&mut self, kind: EventId, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if let Some(id) = self.ghost_id.take() {\\n650→            sim.despawn(id);\\n        }\\n        let rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        let mut act = Activity::start(kind, &rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\",\"content_concise\":\"544→            Flow::Slots => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used