{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_216","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will split the event test so I can run one kind quickly.\n\nThe event test currently runs 130 full events in one go. A failure stops the rest. I'll add a temporary probe test to isolate failures faster.\n\nThe probe test will print each event's bot and idle scores. I'll run it with nocapture, then delete it to avoid doubling the suite time. The library unit tests can run separately.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bd88de1-9179-404e-a8ef-541cd3ef64c1-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs","old_string":"#[test]\nfn bot_earns_two_stars_and_idle_earns_none() {","new_string":"#[test]\nfn probe_scores() {\n    for kind in EVENTS {\n        let bot = play_direct(kind, 1, false);\n        let idle = play_direct(kind, 1, true);\n        eprintln!(\n            \"{kind} bot {:.1} stars {} idle {:.1} stars {}\",\n            bot[\"score\"].as_f64().unwrap_or(-1.0),\n            bot[\"stars\"],\n            idle[\"score\"].as_f64().unwrap_or(-1.0),\n            idle[\"stars\"]\n        );\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn bot_earns_two_stars_and_idle_earns_none() {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bd88de1-9179-404e-a8ef-541cd3ef64c1-68","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine\" && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo test -p pav_core --offline --locked --test fit probe_scores -- --test-threads=1 --nocapture --exact","description":"Probe one-seed bot and idle scores for every event","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1239,"output_tokens":802,"cache_