ents.rs:1129:113\\n     |\\n1129 | ... dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n     |                             ^^^^^^ help: if this is intentional, prefix it with an underscore: `_events`\\n     |\\n     = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n\\nwarning: `pav_core` (lib) generated 1 warning (run `cargo fix --lib -p pav_core` to apply 1 suggestion)\\n    Building [========================> ] 99/100: fit(test)                   \\r    Finished `test` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 1m 53s\\n     Running tests/fit.rs (target/debug/deps/fit-d770f13dba700c27)\\n\\nrunning 1 test\\ntest probe_scores ... check bot 953.4 stars 3 idle 351.3 stars 0\\nbreath bot 969.3 stars 3 idle 420.0 stars 1\\npose bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 132.0 stars 0\\nsquat bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 419.0 stars 1\\nplank bot 0.0 stars 0 idle 0.0 stars 0\\nstep bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\nfloatie bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\nlap bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\ntide bot 850.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\npaddle bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\ntray bot 1000.0 stars 3 idle 0.0 stars 0\\ncannon bot 971.4 stars 3 idle -0.0 stars 0\\nbigstand bot 987.1 stars 3 idle 338.7 stars 0\\nok\\n\\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 9 filtered out; finished in 1.55s\\n\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-2bd88de1-9179-404e-a8ef-541cd3ef64c1-68.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":8461}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ea493c14-8e47-4780-8bf2-94b37512b2c9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_220","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The check bot scored three stars. The idle bot scored zero.\n\nBreath and squat bots each scored one star. Their idle scores were 420 and 419. Both need to drop below 400.\n\nPlank bot scored zero stars. It flopped immediately.\n\nStep, floatie, lap, tide, paddle, tray, cannon, and bigstand all scored three stars for the bot and zero for idle.\n\nProbe finished in 1.55 seconds. That is roughly 40,000 steps per second. The full test suite should take about eight seconds for events plus story seeds.\n\nStory seeds should take roughly ten to twenty seconds each. The probe speed is plausible with opt-level 1 and small physics. To fix the breath idle score, the tick formula must be adjusted so the idle player no longer receives in-ring credit.\n\nThe idle tick averages about 0.51, which explains the 420 score. The spec requires the idle score to be below 400, so the in-ring weight must be reduced or tied to breathing.\n\nA new tick formula of 0.85 for `(1-err)` and 0.15 for `in_ring` would drop the idle breath score to about 295 while keeping the bot near 1000. The squat idle score of 419 likely comes from the squat rep scoring formula, which weights depth and timing.\n\nThe 419 squat idle score comes from the band bonus. It awards 0.3 points per rep even when no squat is attempted, because the hold never grows. The scoring formula must be changed so missed squats do not receive that full bonus.\n\nThe squat fix introduces a `moved` flag. The band bonus now only counts when the player actually moves, so idle scores about 95 and bots score near 1000. The plank bot's zero stars are being traced to its brace check.\n\nThe plank bot flops immediately because its held input during countdown is CONFIRM instead of brace. When the countdown ends and the flow switches to Event, the last_held value is already set from that CONFIRM tick, so the brace check fails on the first frame.\n\nThe plank fix is to skip the first post tick after a countdown transition, or have the bot hold brace during the card phase so last_held is correct on entry.\n\nA grace period of about half a second is being considered for plank so the first frame does not immediately trigger a flop. Recomputing last held values when leaving countdown was rejected as test-specific.\n\nA 0.75-second brace grace period was chosen for plank. The bot braces from tick two onward and survives the full sixty seconds for three stars. Idle flops at 0.6 seconds and scores zero stars. It is unclear whether other events share this first-frame failure.\n\nBreath and squat do not share the plank bug. The probe test will be removed from the official suite.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Most events already clear two stars. Breath and squats score too well when idle, and the plank flops on the first frame before the brace is held."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca5e550-df94-494a-a8a9-1fed45f0219d-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","old_string":"    let err = ((act.lungs - act.guide).abs() / 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    let in_ring = if bal.cob.length() < 0.35 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 };\n    let tick = 0.7 * (1.0 - err) + 0.3 * in_ring;","new_string":"    let err = ((act.lungs - act.guide).abs() / 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n    let in_ring = if bal.cob.length() < 0.35 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 };\n    // Standing in the ring without breathing is a low score. Following the guide is the activity.\n    let tick = 0.85 * (1.0 - err) + 0.15 * in_ring;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca5e550-df94-494a-a8a9-1fed45f0219d-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","old_string":"        let timing = (1.0 - (act.depth - 0.15).abs()).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        // The player should have been deep near the bottom. Use lungs field as \"was deep\".\n        let deep = if act.lungs > 0.75 { 1.0 } else { (act.lungs / 0.75).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\n        let band = if act.hold < 0.25 { 1.0 } else { 0.3 };\n        act.acc += 0.7 * deep.max(timing * 0.2) + 0.3 * band;","new_string":"        let timing = (1.0 - (act.depth - 0.15).abs()).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        // lungs keeps the deepest point of this rep. A rep that never left the top barely scores.\n        let deep = if act.lungs > 0.75 { 1.0 } else { (act.lungs / 0.75).clamp(0.0, 1.0) };\n        let band = if act.hold < 0.25 { 1.0 } else { 0.3 };\n        let moved = if deep > 0.2 { 0.25 * band } else { 0.0 };\n        act.acc += 0.75 * deep.max(timing * 0.12) + moved;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca5e550-df94-494a-a8a9-1fed45f0219d-76","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","old_string":"    if !braced(held) {\n        act.flopped = true;\n    }","new_string":"    // The card says brace. A fraction of a second covers the handoff from the countdown.\n    if act.t > 0.6 && !braced(held) {\n        act.flopped = true;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca5e550-df94-494a-a8a9-1fed45f0219d-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","old_string":"fn tick_big(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {","new_string":"fn tick_big(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, _events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca5e550-df94-494a-a8a9-1fed45f0219d-78","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs","old_string":"#[test]\nfn probe_scores() {\n    for kind in EVENTS {\n        let bot = play_direct(kind, 1, false);\n        let idle = play_direct(kind, 1, true);\n        eprintln!(\n            \"{kind} bot {:.1} stars {} idle {:.1} stars {}\",\n            bot[\"score\"].as_f64().unwrap_or(-1.0),\n            bot[\"stars\"],\n            idle[\"score\"].as_f64().unwrap_or(-1.0),\n            idle[\"stars\"]\n        );\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn bot_earns_two_stars_and_idle_earns_none() {","new_string":"#[test]\nfn bot_earns_two_stars_and_idle_earns_none() {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3289,"output_tokens":3507,"cache_read_input_tokens":151424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"60721551-cae1-47c9-bb11-e4a8f48a5efd"}
