{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_232","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will add a fit mode as a third layout in poll_gamepad.\n\nFit mode maps gamepad buttons to specific actions. South confirms, east goes back, west waves, and north opens schedule. L1 and R1 trigger step left and right. L2 and R2 do the same. The D-pad handles menu navigation. Start pauses unless Mode is held.\n\nKeyboard bindings for fit are also being planned. WASD or arrows will handle leaning. Space confirms. Q and E step left and right. F waves. Tab schedules. Esc pauses but conflicts with BACK.\n\nThe if-else structure prevents Esc from firing both pause and back in the same tick. The plan resolves the conflict by assigning Esc to pause only.\n\nEsc will open the dev menu rather than return to a previous screen. This is acceptable for a 10-foot game because the dev menu contains resume. Backspace may be used as an alternative back key.\n\nArrow keys will handle both menu navigation and leaning. WASD will control leaning only.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0287b694-fe54-4045-9067-969ff579b25c-109","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub tick","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0287b694-fe54-4045-9067-969ff579b25c-110","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/Cargo.toml"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0287b694-fe54-4045-9067-969ff579b25c-111","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/Cargo.toml"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":