{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_242","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a solid picture. I will examine the UI drawing section and Mixer struct start, then implement everything.\n\nImplementation will add a tick field to the status JSON. A has_ui helper will check for game content or HUD lines. A new fit.rs module will draw FitUi with Fredoka and Nunito fonts for both game and headless modes.\n\nI need to verify the egui 0.36 font API for loading the new fonts. I will add a `fit` boolean to Input and define fit-mode bindings: WASD and arrows for lean, Space/Enter for confirm, Escape for pause, Q/E for step left/right, F for wave, Tab for schedule, and Shift for focus.\n\nArrow keys will serve dual roles: lean and menu navigation. The bindings structure keeps directional keys separate from buttons, so Escape maps to PAUSE while Space and Enter map to CONFIRM.\n\nArrow keys will also map to menu navigation: down, left, and right arrows for MENU_DOWN, MENU_LEFT, and MENU_RIGHT. ShiftLeft will act as FOCUS. When Shift is held, the lean ramp will slow down to a fine jog.\n\nFor gamepad fit mode, South maps to CONFIRM, East to BACK, West to WAVE, and North to SCHEDULE. LeftTrigger and RightTrigger will handle STEP, while the D-pad drives menu navigation. Start will trigger PAUSE unless Mode is held.\n\nLeftTrigger2 and RightTrigger2 will also handle step inputs. Start will not open the engine menu during fit mode.\n\nFor fit-mode lean, raw left stick values will be stored separately to bypass the 0.18 deadzone and allow finer ramp shaping.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a55169-c556-4adb-ad6e-d8443b4707ef-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn pre\\(|last_lean|input\\.lean|input\\.device|fn play_pre","glob":"**/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a55169-c556-4adb-ad6e-d8443b4707ef-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","offset":120,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a55169-c556-4adb-ad6e-d8443b4707ef-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":1340,"limit":230}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92a55169-c556-4adb-ad6e-d8443b4707ef-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub IIFE|__gameBoot|Controller or keyboard|session\\.js|Verification","glob":"**/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11626,"output_tokens":1349,"cache_read_input_tokens":63232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"5d24657d-9228-4598-a529-4040b2b5978a"}
