{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_246","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking js-sys versions in Cargo.lock and workspace Cargo.toml dependencies.\n\nPlanning CameraRig yaw integration in session.rs sync_camera. Will add default fields to Input construction. Writing files carefully due to size.\n\nThe Fit UI yaw value is small in radians. It will be added to the room yaw as degrees rather than replacing it.\n\nCamera yaw must be set absolutely rather than accumulated, since sync_camera runs every step and could reset it. The implementation plan is now concrete: status tick in fit/mod.rs, has_ui, pav_ui/src/fit.rs painter with calls from game_lines and headless, plus Bindings::fit, Input.fit, poll_gamepad layout, and lean state.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bccbf23-6778-4fa1-a2e9-43202fc59c8d-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn new\\(|last_device|mouse_active|fn on_key|fn key_down","glob":"**/pav_app/src/input.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bccbf23-6778-4fa1-a2e9-43202fc59c8d-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/Cargo.lock","offset":1355,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bccbf23-6778-4fa1-a2e9-43202fc59c8d-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/camera.rs","offset":70,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bccbf23-6778-4fa1-a2e9-43202fc59c8d-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"js-sys","glob":"**/Cargo.toml"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bccbf23-6778-4fa1-a2e9-43202fc59c8d-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.