{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_247","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"js-sys 0.3.106 is present in the lockfile.\n\nAdding js-sys to pav_app's direct dependencies would change Cargo.lock. The --locked flag requires the lockfile to remain unchanged, so this approach fails.\n\nwasm_bindgen cannot set window properties without js-sys. The build script uses --locked, so updating the lockfile is not an option. A direct #[wasm_bindgen] call on window.__gameStatus is being considered instead.\n\n`#[wasm_bindgen]` extern blocks may be rejected as inline_js or module snippets. A getter method on `Window` for `__gameStatus` is unlikely to work. The focus is shifting toward a standard approach that avoids js-sys and inline_js entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46ac751c-c83f-4cbd-948e-8a19c54f8872-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"name = \\\"pav_app\\\"","glob":"**/engine/Cargo.lock"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46ac751c-c83f-4cbd-948e-8a19c54f8872-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":360,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46ac751c-c83f-4cbd-948e-8a19c54f8872-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/intent.rs","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46ac751c-c83f-4cbd-948e-8a19c54f8872-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct SimEvent|Sfx \\{|Syllable|Music \\{|BigSplash|Wake","glob":"**/pav_core/src/frame.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2739,"output_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":100480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":nul