nt\":\"200→        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n210→    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n220→        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n230→        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\n240→pub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\\n    pub quarters: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// A projectile as drawn (velocity lets the view interpolate).\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\",\"content_concise\":\"200→        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n210→    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n220→        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n230→        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\n240→pub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\\n    pub quarters: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// A projectile as drawn (velocity lets the view interpolate).\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    Pickup {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        rarity: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\\n    Travel {\\n        place: u32,\\n    },\\n    /// A named synthesized effect (Wobble Minutes). `id` indexes the game's sound list.\\n    Sfx {\\n        id: u16,\\n        gain: f32,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// One Animalese syllable. `speaker` and `vowel` pick the voice.\\n    Syllable {\\n        speaker: u8,\\n        vowel: u8,\\n        pitch: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// Start or change the music bed. `song == 0` stops.\\n    Music {\\n        song: u8,\\n    },\\n    /// A large water impact (cannonball). Bigger dents and spray than `Splash`.\\n    BigSplash {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n        size: f32,\\n    },\\n    /// A silent water dent (paddle wake). No sound, so it can fire often.\\n    Wake {\\n        pos: Vec3,\\n    },\\n}\\n\\n/// The room the player is in, for the HUD (info card, control guide, camera defaults).\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\npub struct RoomInfo {\\n    pub id: u16,\\n    pub key: String,\\n    pub def: std::sync::Arc<crate::room::RoomDef>,\\n    /// Quarter turns (clockwise from above) the room was rotated by when placed.\\n    pub quarters: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// A projectile as drawn (velocity lets the view interpolate).\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\n\",\"total_lines\":333}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"3b66ac72-be10-4a82-8934-95bb70aac16c"}
