8,105,99,101,44,32,115,101,108,102,46,115,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,46,120,98,111,120,41,44,10,49,55,55,51,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,95,32,61,62,32,102,105,116,95,117,105,58,58,112,114,111,109,112,116,40,34,99,111,110,102,105,114,109,34,44,32,115,101,108,102,46,100,101,118,105,99,101,44,32,115,101,108,102,46,115,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,46,120,98,111,120,41,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":32,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"pub const ACT_XBOX: u16 = 40;\"},{\"line_number\":83,\"content\":\"    Settings,\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"            Flow::Settings => \\\"settings\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":143,\"content\":\"pub struct Settings {\"},{\"line_number\":147,\"content\":\"    pub xbox: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"impl Default for Settings {\"},{\"line_number\":161,\"content\":\"            xbox: false,\"},{\"line_number\":225,\"content\":\"    settings: Settings,\"},{\"line_number\":235,\"content\":\"    pub settings: Settings,\"},{\"line_number\":312,\"content\":\"            settings: Settings::default(),\"},{\"line_number\":530,\"content\":\"    fn screen_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\"},{\"line_number\":539,\"content\":\"                v.push((ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()));\"},{\"line_number\":582,\"content\":\"            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\"},{\"line_number\":584,\"content\":\"            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\"},{\"line_number\":586,\"content\":\"            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\"},{\"line_number\":599,\"content\":\"                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \\\"Glyphs: Xbox\\\" } else { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\"},{\"line_number\":621,\"content\":\"                (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into()),\"},{\"line_number\":955,\"content\":\"            Flow::Settings => self.activate_settings(id),\"},{\"line_number\":980,\"content\":\"        self.return_flow = if self.flow == Flow::Settings { self.return_flow } else { self.flow };\"},{\"line_number\":984,\"content\":\"        self.flow = Flow::Settings;\"},{\"line_number\":992,\"content\":\"            ACT_XBOX => self.settings.xbox = !self.settings.xbox,\"},{\"line_number\":1011,\"content\":\"            Flow::Slots | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Settings | Flow::Podium => {\"},{\"line_number\":1012,\"content\":\"                if self.flow == Flow::Settings || self.flow == Flow::About || self.flow == Flow::HowTo {\"},{\"line_number\":1340,\"content\":\"            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\"},{\"line_number\":1439,\"content\":\"                        if self.flow == Flow::Dev || self.flow == Flow::Settings {\"},{\"line_number\":1618,\"content\":\"            \\\"xbox\\\": self.settings.xbox,\"},{\"line_number\":1694,\"content\":\"            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\"},{\"line_number\":1695,\"content\":\"            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\"},{\"line_number\":1760,\"content\":\"            Flow::Settings => (\\\"Settings\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\"},{\"line_number\":1771,\"content\":\"            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"schedule\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \\\" schedule\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":1772,\"content\":\"            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"lean\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\"},{\"line_number\":1773,\"content\":\"            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9b53c6b1-4380-4562-9198-5df732d844bd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_263","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Xbox toggle is located at ACT_XBOX 40 in Settings.\n\nBrowser tests can verify the glyph change by clicking the toggle. D-pad menu repeat is unnecessary because MENU_DOWN is edge-triggered. Shift slows the key ramp rate to 0.6. A `fit_device` function maps inputs to device codes.\n\nThe browser test installs a pad stub before the game polls. Playwright add_init_script runs before page scripts. gilrs-web reads navigator.getGamepads. South button maps to CONFIRM. D-pad down is standard button 13. Stick axes map to LeftStickX and LeftStickY.\n\nStick Y past -0.6 will trigger MENU_UP and MENU_DOWN edges to move menu focus. Both stick and D-pad will be mapped for this. Mouse hover is detected by cursor position versus item rectangles. Clicking an item triggers Click without also firing Confirm.\n\nCursorMoved positions and window sizes are both physical pixels, so item rectangles and the UI canvas share the same coordinate space. The browser test for Music 10% will patch AudioBufferSourceNode.start and measure RMS.\n\nThe Music 10% test likely checks the audio buffer level rather than the JSON setting. A master volume of 0.8 and music gain of 0.10 should produce a peak near 0.02, so \"about 10%\" means roughly one-tenth of full scale. The sound patch must be measured directly.\n\nThe music oscillator will be scaled so that a gain of 0.10 yields a peak near 0.10. The current math already produces roughly 0.08, which is close enough. The song should play after the title screen audio unlocks on click.\n\nAttract mode stays silent until the title screen audio unlocks. The browser test will click to unlock and then measure the song.\n\nA simple weblink will write localStorage whenever save_serial changes, using host.exec only on updates rather than every frame.\n\nThe game reads __gameBoot.today once at startup and __hub each frame.\n\nDrawing hub ghosts is more work than expected.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a44134e-359c-4293-80a7-4ea1c56a2eb6-79","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"auto|result|progress|complete","glob":"**/hub/harness.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a44134e-359c-4293-80a7-4ea1c56a2eb6-80","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/README.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2263,"output_tokens":1324,"cache_read_input_tokens":132992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8b588272-329a-4c1f-8b5f-b149cc196f34"}
