{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_285","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed `frame` takes `&mut self`. Now checking `RenderFrame`.\n\nPlanning the implementation now. Will write a comprehensive fit.rs and patches. Adding fields to the audio Mixer and updating its constructor and render method. The Voice struct stays unchanged. Music will be mixed into both stereo channels inside the frame loop using song timing and gain. A test-only peak helper will also be added.\n\nSFX rendering at 8kHz is fast enough. BigSplash will be placed before the wildcard match arm. Music events will be handled in play_event and sounds_for will return an empty vector for them.\n\nThe offline `play_event` will reset the song timer when switching to song 0. It will route syllables through a voice gain bus and other events at full volume. The same Music check must be duplicated in `AudioOut::play_event`. A `voice_gain` field is also needed on the offline Mixer.\n\nThe offline Mixer will not need a `voice_gain` field. `AudioOut::play_event` will pre-multiply syllable gain by the voice bus before sending it as a command. The callback then applies that pre-multiplied value directly during rendering.\n\nThe voice gain mutex will default to 1.0, falling back to 0.8 once the app status arrives. The mixer's music_gain also defaults to 1.0. The app sends a MusicGain command of 0.10 every frame before events; the callback applies these commands in order so the gain is active when the Song or Play events arrive.\n\nConfirmed the app uses the AudioOut method, so both paths need updating. Tests call the free play_event through render_events, and the Mixer test handles music directly. Ready to write the patch.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ae94318d-6c18-4892-a3fe-9c1b0e8d5940-105","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"</script|<script","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":279,"output_tokens":1120,"cache_read_input_tokens":173568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4f11b822-c047-4ed9-9fdf-bc0a9e471dec"}
