{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_292","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a UI reading test to the fit.rs Headless tests.\n\nThe UI integration test requires Sim and will run after the type test. I'll verify circle_stroke and circle_filled exist, then compile. Next up are input.rs, audio, and app changes.\n\nThe UI test asserts that each device's prompt appears in the rendered HUD text. Xbox requires settings.xbox.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-115","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs","old_string":"#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn type_holds_the_ten_foot_floor() {\n        let (title, body) = type_px(1920.0, 1080.0);\n        assert!(title >= 64.0 && body >= 34.0, \"{title} {body}\");\n        let (small_t, _) = type_px(320.0, 180.0);\n        assert!(small_t < 64.0 && small_t > 8.0, \"{small_t}\");\n    }\n}","new_string":"#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use pav_core::{InputFrame, Sim};\n\n    #[test]\n    fn type_holds_the_ten_foot_floor() {\n        let (title, body) = type_px(1920.0, 1080.0);\n        assert!(title >= 64.0 && body >= 34.0, \"{title} {body}\");\n        let (small_t, _) = type_px(320.0, 180.0);\n        assert!(small_t < 64.0 && small_t > 8.0, \"{small_t}\");\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn title_prompts_follow_the_device() {\n        let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).expect(\"fit\");\n        let cases = [(1u8, false, \"Cross\"), (1, true, \"A\"), (2, false, \"Space\"), (3, false, \"Click\")];\n        for (device, xbox, word) in cases {\n            {\n                let g = sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<pav_core::games::fit::FitGame>().unwrap();\n                g.settings.xbox = xbox;\n            }\n            sim.step(&InputFrame { device, ..Default::default() });\n            let frame = sim.frame();\n            let mut head = crate::headless::Headless::default();\n            let drawn = head.frame(None, &frame.hud, glam::Mat4::IDENTITY, 1920, 1080, Default::default());\n            let blob = drawn.reading.hud.iter().map(|t| t.text.as_str()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\" | \");\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"Wobble Minutes\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"New Stay\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(word), \"device {device} xbox {xbox}: {blob}\");\n        }\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-116","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/session.rs","old_string":"pub fn has_ui(frame: &RenderFrame) -> bool {\n    frame.game.is_some() || !frame.hud.lines.is_empty()\n}","new_string":"pub fn has_ui(frame: &RenderFrame) -> bool {\n    frame.game.is_some() || !frame.hud.lines.is_empty() || frame.hud.fit.is_some()\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-117","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/session.rs","old_string":"        self.sync_view();\n    }","new_string":"        if let Some(play) = self.sim.state.play.as_ref() {\n            if let Some(yaw) = play.fit_ui(&self.sim).and_then(|ui| ui.camera_yaw) {\n                self.camera.params.yaw = yaw as f64;\n            }\n        }\n        self.sync_view();\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-118","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {","new_string":"    fn status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-119","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            \"golden\": self.golden,\n            \"today\": self.today,\n        })","new_string":"            \"golden\": self.golden,\n            \"today\": self.today,\n            \"tick\": sim.state.tick,\n        })"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f4d31e-a5f7-4bc7-91a6-da96c0302592-120","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"fn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\n        \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows.\",\n        \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo.\",\n        \"Testing Feedback: the stay, every event, and the medley are driven in the sim. Engine Feedback: one balance model, one synth, menus inside the tick. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships; the time-cut list does not.\",\n        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",\n    ];\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\n}","new_string":"fn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\n        \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\",\n        \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Research followed the build plan and the engine source.\",\n        \"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\",\n        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",\n    ];\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":732,"output_tokens":2348,"cache_read_input_tokens":183040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"eeaa2f83-b9b0-4e17-8837-87dad13a9d7d"}
