{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_309","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed `b.size` exists. `fx.rs` was already patched.\n\nChecking BigSplash compilation and related types. Reviewing status JSON fields, export_save, InputFrame fields, and FitGame mutability. Also examining rewind_held, Backspace handling, and settings visibility. Starting to design app.rs patches with new struct fields for fit save state.\n\nFleshing out the app.rs patches. The new struct fields will initialize to `fit_save_serial: 0` and `fit_save_loaded: false`. After building the app, fonts are installed and a dummy egui run is performed. The `handle_key` function will intercept F11 when `self.input.fit` is active.\n\nF11 toggles borderless fullscreen in fit mode. F12 triggers a screenshot. Escape is blocked from opening the engine menu while fit is active. The keyboard handler still calls `input.key` for all events.\n\nF1 through F10 and digits are not system keys. They still reach `handle_key` and `input.key`, but fit mode returns early and ignores them. This prevents camera presets from firing.\n\nBackspace and H still reach `input.key` in fit mode. Rewind must be gated separately because it checks raw keys rather than `handle_key`.\n\nIn `frame()`, the start button only toggles the menu when `!self.input.fit`. If the menu is open while fit mode activates, it closes immediately.\n\nThe first frame of fit mode may briefly open the menu if start was pressed, since fit is set after frames(). The yaw and distance updates are gated behind `!self.input.fit`, so one-frame lag is acceptable. Rewind is gated by `!self.input.fit` alongside studio mode and held keys. Room rebinds happen earlier based on room changes.\n\nThe fit flag is set immediately before `buttons()` at line 1154. It reads `curr.hud.fit`, assigns it to `self.input.fit`, and switches bindings to the fit set. If the menu was open, `set_menu(false)` clears input state, which is acceptable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5078b38-b554-4d98-8c6d-a44abf5a1ee8-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct InputFrame|pub lean|pub any|pub ui:|pub hub|pub song_pos|pub device","glob":"**/pav_core/src/input.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5078b38-b554-4d98-8c6d-a44abf5a1ee8-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":370,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5078b38-b554-4d98-8c6d-a44abf5a1ee8-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1560,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5078b38-b554-4d98-8c6d-a44abf5a1ee8-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn rewind_held|Backspace|KeyCode::Backspace","glob":"**/pav_app/src/input.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5078b38-b554-4d98-8c6d-a44abf5a1ee8-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"settings\\.xbox|pub settings|struct Settings","glob":"**/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":51974,"output_tokens":1402,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"da76735e-52d6-4984-b9f9-ca927162d203"}
