6,111,114,97,103,101,96,32,111,102,32,105,116,115,32,111,119,110,44,32,115,111,10,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,95,95,120,51,53,49,49,50,100,47,119,111,114,107,47,87,111,98,98,108,101,32,77,105,110,117,116,101,115,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,100,111,99,115,47,72,73,83,84,79,82,89,46,109,100,10,51,52,55,55,58,45,32,42,42,83,101,99,111,110,100,97,114,121,32,77,111,116,105,111,110,42,42,32,40,96,115,101,99,111,110,100,97,114,121,96,41,58,32,119,111,98,98,108,101,32,100,105,97,108,44,32,116,97,105,108,32,108,101,110,103,116,104,115,44,32,97,110,116,101,110,110,97,101,44,32,115,112,105,110,110,105,110,103,32,112,108,97,116,102,111,114,109,115,44,10,51,52,56,52,58,119,111,98,98,108,101,45,115,99,97,108,101,100,32,119,97,103,41,44,32,102,111,111,116,32,73,75,32,111,110,32,115,116,101,112,115,44,32,104,105,116,45,114,101,99,111,105,108,32,115,112,114,105,110,103,44,32,99,117,116,111,117,116,32,108,111,111,107,32,43,32,102,97,99,101,45,99,97,109,101,114,97,32,108,101,97,110,44,32,78,80,67,115,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":43,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"You have won a five-day stay at Tippy Cay, a small wellness resort staffed entirely by talking gym equipment. You do not remember entering. Each morning a relentlessly pleasant wobble cushion tests your balance and gives you a Balance Age. Each day you walk the island, try short stillness, strength, cardio and balance events, and bank minutes in a giant clam. Checkout requires a Balance Age of 40 or better. Day 5 ends in the Big Stand, a finale whose last test is to do nothing at all for thirty seconds while the game tries to make you press something.\"},{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"| Equipment that talks: cheerful, polite, quietly rude | Pip, a talking wobble cushion, plus a whole staff of talking gear |\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"- Respect bodies: no weight, BMI, body-shape jokes or diet talk anywhere. Pip judges your wobble, your habits and your absences.\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"target = shaped lean input * reach + wobble(t)\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"Start with `stiffness 40`, `damping 8.5`, `reach 0.92`, `tip_time 0.35`. `wobble` is `amp * (0.7 * sin(2*pi*1.3*t + a) + 0.3 * sin(2*pi*2.9*t + b))` per axis, phases from `sim.state.rng`, base `amp 0.12`, scaled per event and by fatigue, plus a velocity kick of 0.1 units/s in a random direction every 1 to 2 seconds. Use sim time, never the clock.\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"**Pose Parade** (3 poses, 20 s each). Six hand-keyed poses with deadpan names: the Patient Heron, the Apologetic Lunge, the Tired Lighthouse, the Folded Deck Chair, the Reluctant Bridge, Seated Disappointment. Day 1 uses the first three. Posey holds the pose beside you. A target ring (radius 0.30 shrinking to 0.18) drifts on a slow Lissajous path (amplitude 0.35, 0.12 Hz). Inside the ring a streak multiplier climbs x1 to x4, one step per 2 s; leaving resets it. At 12 s of pose 2 a gull lands on your head and wobble is x1.6 for 5 s (\\\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird\\\"). A tip breaks the pose for 1.5 s. Score: time in ring weighted by multiplier. Bot: PD toward the ring centre.\"},{\"line_number\":133,\"content\":\"**Tempo Squats** (10 reps, about 50 s). Hold Action to go down (2 s to full depth), release to rise (1 s). A guide bar shows the tempo; a low bell marks the bottom. Keep the dot in a band |x| < 0.25; wobble grows 8% per rep. Rep score: `0.7 * timing + 0.3 * band`. Scrub `FIT/Squat` by depth. Gag: rep 10 is followed by \\\"Ten. Also eleven.\\\" Bot: follows the guide.\"},{\"line_number\":135,\"content\":\"**Plank Standoff** (up to 60 s). Hold Brace and keep the dot in a ring shrinking from 0.40 to 0.20. Releasing, or leaving the ring for more than 1 s, collapses you in a comic flop. Fatigue ramps wobble; at 30 s add tremble; at 45 s Kettle laughs at his own joke and the nudge shakes the screen. Score: seconds survived / 60. Stars at 25, 40 and 55 s. Kettle, who has no arms, plank-talks you through it. Base the pose on one frame of `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`. Bot: survives at least 45 s.\"},{\"line_number\":160,\"content\":\"3. Step Party for 16 bars with a marching band of guests, wobble on.\"},{\"line_number\":190,\"content\":\"- **Saves:** versioned JSON in `localStorage`: guest slots (name, look, day, minutes, stars, bests, ghosts, ages, flip-flops, unlocks) and global settings. Save on every change of day and every result.\"},{\"line_number\":198,\"content\":\"| **Pip** | Sky-blue round wobble cushion, two dot eyes (`blob` plan, scale 0.7, squash 2.0, plus a small valve) | Front desk and scorekeeper. Relentlessly pleasant. Keeps records of everything. Never technically insults you. Squeaky rubber voice |\"},{\"line_number\":215,\"content\":\"- Pip: \\\"You wobbled 41 times. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":367,\"content\":\"- **Tuning:** live sliders, generated from `impl Tunable for Rules` with `params::list` and `params::set`, grouped by core and by event, with **Reset to Defaults** per group and for all. Must include: stiffness, damping, wobble, tip time, stick curve, key rates, each event's main difficulty number, rhythm windows, spin band, gust strength, bounce gain, Big Stand gusts.\"},{\"line_number\":379,\"content\":\"**AI Hub session: mode `ghost`, 1 to 4 players.** Follow `lib/hub/README.md` in `michaelcrosato/ai-hub`. `ghost` is the choice because seeing friends wobble on the next mat is the fun of it, and it is barely more work than `parallel`; `shared-world` would need a host-run world this game does not need. Download `session.js`, `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js` from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/` to `hub/`; these URLs work without auth (verified).\"},{\"line_number\":500,\"content\":\"| `pav_app/src/app.rs` | When `hud.fit` is set: hide `boot_panel`, `stats_panel`, `guide_panel`, the room card, `hint_bar` and the F1 panel (verified necessary); route Esc and Options to PAUSE instead of `set_menu`; gate `handle_key`; call `weblink` each frame; apply Settings to audio buses; save to `localStorage` when the save serial changes; keep fit bindings in the room-change branch, which otherwise rebinds keys | Removes the engine demo's chrome and keys |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_render/src/scene.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":395,\"content\":\"    /// Heat haze wobble.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"    let painter = ctx.layer_painter(egui::LayerId::new(egui::Order::Foreground, egui::Id::new(\\\"wobble_minutes\\\")));\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":196,\"content\":\"    pub wobble: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"            wobble: 1.0,\"},{\"line_number\":404,\"content\":\"                wobble: 1.2,\"},{\"line_number\":460,\"content\":\"        v.float(\\\"wobble\\\", &mut self.wobble, 0.0, 2.0, \\\"Floppiness of tails and antennae\\\");\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/softbody.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":68,\"content\":\"    /// Damping ratio (0 = wobbles forever, 1 = no wobble).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/rig.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":418,\"content\":\"        let wobble = def.wobble.max(0.0);\"},{\"line_number\":419,\"content\":\"        let soft = |base: f32| (base / (0.3 + wobble * 0.7)).clamp(0.02, 1.0);\"},{\"line_number\":439,\"content\":\"                ChainKind::Tail => Quat::from_rotation_y((anim.time * 3.2).sin() * 0.28 * wobble * lively),\"},{\"line_number\":440,\"content\":\"                ChainKind::AntennaL | ChainKind::AntennaR => Quat::from_rotation_x((anim.time * 4.1).sin() * 0.12 * wobble),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":32,\"content\":\"pub const SAVE_VERSION: u32 = 1;\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"    pub wobble_assist: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":163,\"content\":\"            wobble_assist: 0.0,\"},{\"line_number\":604,\"content\":\"                (614, format!(\\\"Wobble assist {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.wobble_assist * 100.0)),\"},{\"line_number\":660,\"content\":\"        self.bal.amp = self.rules.wobble * (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\"},{\"line_number\":1054,\"content\":\"            614 => self.settings.wobble_assist = v,\"},{\"line_number\":1273,\"content\":\"        rules.wobble *= (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":392,\"content\":\"    let lean = (target - bal.wobble() - cancel - bal.vel * 0.15) / rules.reach.max(0.2);\"},{\"line_number\":568,\"content\":\"    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"    pub wobble: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"            wobble: 0.12,\"},{\"line_number\":85,\"content\":\"        v.float(\\\"wobble\\\", &mut self.wobble, 0.0, 0.4, \\\"Idle wander of the dot\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":146,\"content\":\"    pub fn wobble(&self) -> Vec2 {\"},{\"line_number\":156,\"content\":\"        let target = lean.clamp_length_max(1.0) * rules.reach + self.wobble();\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"- gives the game an empty `localStorage` and `sessionStorage` of its own, so\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/HISTORY.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3477,\"content\":\"- **Secondary Motion** (`secondary`): wobble dial, tail lengths, antennae, spinning platforms,\"},{\"line_number\":3484,\"content\":\"wobble-scaled wag), foot IK on steps, hit-recoil spring, cutout look + face-camera lean, NPCs\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c0502da6-2410-4a3f-998c-c827c5f79a43-34","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"420→                b.size = (0