drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8af24200-105c-4ca1-bdca-f29deb012d28"}
