{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_324","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Device 4 only resets idle state on Click.\n\nHover does not reset idle. Keyboard and mouse hover only wakes idle when movement exceeds 6 pixels.\n\nCoarse touch devices will not set any on tap. DOM clicks on settings reset idle for device 4. If a browser converts touch to mouse, PRIMARY clears when ui is Some.\n\nTaps outside items do not reset idle for device 4. Audio unlocks on hover or touch over an item. WASD on the title screen sets move_dir and wakes idle.\n\nHolding W resets idle on the title screen. The event system uses lean rather than move_dir, so both can coexist safely. On the island, keyboard and mouse may produce different move_dir values because fit_sample lean prefers the last writer while move_axis prioritizes keys over stick.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9854c9ad-0341-4de7-b675-f6147f51ab2a-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pressed = 0|input\\.pressed|clear_input|InputFrame::default","glob":"**/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9854c9ad-0341-4de7-b675-f6147f51ab2a-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.pressed","glob":"**/pav_app/src/simhost.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2581,"output_tokens":788,"cache_read_input_tokens":100480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7f046d2f-ee8d-4a66-88aa-d2f5eae70af9"}
