{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_328","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"pad_ui_active is false when the menu is closed, unless the guide is open.\n\nDPadDown won't open inventory without a game frame. pad_menus should be skipped when fit to avoid tap loss, but taps must be cleared once fit is detected. The editor update may also need gating during fit since it currently runs before the input lock.\n\nThe editor update will be skipped during fit to prevent it from clearing the primary input before it is read. The aim marker will also be skipped in that state. The input section will be restructured to include fit_on setup just before the window size check, and camera yaw will be placed just before rig.update. I am now ready to apply the patches.\n\nThe `curr` reference from `host.frames()` is safe to keep. The SAVE key will be `wobble-minutes-v1`. A race condition was spotted: `host.pump()` runs before the window's first `frame()`, so the simulation may advance before persist data is imported.\n\nThe first pump before import is harmless; it simply advances the simulation by one frame. The real issue is that `import_save` can set the flow to Wake or Island if a slot is already used, which would skip the title screen on a new visit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0049db99-2489-4579-86a5-d110fed63d04-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"import_save|export_save|Continue","glob":"**/pav_core/tests/fit.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":664,"output_tokens":792,"cache_read_input_tokens":107264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"91e82faf-54be-4f29-a44d-6121409be7c8"}
