{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_331","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The flow is private. import_save calls read_slot, which enters the stay.\n\nA new public `park_title` method would let the browser resume a saved slot while staying on the title screen. This is needed because the test expects `import_save` to immediately load day 3, which currently skips the title.\n\nA `recall_save` method would import the save and then reset `flow` to `Title`, `focus` to 0, and `line_i` to 0. This keeps the loaded slots and settings visible on the title screen. One concern is that `New Stay` might reset the live fields.\n\nSetting flow back to Title after import is safe. The live game state already holds the saved day, so Continue and New Stay behave correctly. Without this reset, the user would land in Wake morning of their saved day.\n\nTests use empty localStorage, so importing an empty save is a no-op and the title screen appears. Auto-resume only matters for returning players. I will add `pub fn load_browser_save(&mut self, text: &str, today: Option<i64>)` in fit/mod.rs.\n\nThe `load_browser_save` implementation resets `idle` to 0 and leaves `save_serial` unchanged so the save does not re-export immediately.\n\nIf the boot object lacks a `today` value, the browser can derive it from JavaScript's `Date.now()` in days since the Unix epoch. The host is responsible for setting this field.\n\nA `browser_today` helper will read the boot date first, then fall back to JavaScript's `Date.now()` via the existing `weblink.rs` bind module. This ensures absence tracking works across sessions even when the host omits the field.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aea3b8a1-83b7-44a2-baf6-3f2fd77252a9-71","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"last_day","glob":"**/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1352,"output_tokens":1388,"cache_read_input_tokens":110080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7922b211-dc26-492f-ad01-c395057aefdd"}
