{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_336","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The flow is public. The app can do:\n\nImporting a save will set the flow to Title. The focus and idle fields are private and need no manual reset. The logic will be placed directly in the exec closure in app.rs.\n\nA `date_now` helper will be added to get the current date. It uses a WASM `Date.now()` binding on the web and returns 0 elsewhere. The boot today value will take priority if set.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6365cf93-041c-40b0-987d-d021c0e69051-77","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn music_sample|fn render\\(|song_phase|Cmd::Song|Cmd::MusicGain","glob":"**/pav_audio/src/lib.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":303,"output_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":115456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7a207838-e110-44f7-ae1b-e59803e5e764"}
