{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_338","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Audio looks good. Now applying all app changes and the small fit boot helper.\n\nBoot logic will be inlined directly in the app. Adding date_now to weblink and checking headless.rs warmup validity before compiling. The app patches cover struct fields, constructor fields, on_touch, handle_key, and frame start.\n\nPatches 6 through 12 cover input, aim marker, audio, camera yaw, UI gates, publish timing, and mouse events. The panel UI will be hidden during fit mode. If fit mode is active, the panel will also be forced closed.\n\nThe feel panel will also be hidden during fit mode. The input replacement is being drafted from line 1146, using the existing UI pointer check.\n\nThe full input block will be replaced. The fit painter draws shapes without widgets, so egui_wants_pointer_input should stay false and left_tap won't be suppressed.\n\nCard clicks are safe because the fit painter draws shapes without widgets. Touch input will route to egui and mark touch taps, with left_tap coming from mouse events. The fit sample will use frame dt while the simulation steps at 60Hz.\n\nThe lean ramp uses the app frame dt, which is correct for shaping between samples. fit_sample calls held() after bindings are set and before buttons(), so it reads current keys without depending on button state. The mouse left tap injected into PRIMARY does not affect lean. buttons() clears key_taps and mouse_taps, but fit_sample relies on touch_tap and the clicked flag instead.\n\nleft_tap is captured before buttons() so DOM clicks can be merged into the input frame. Extra buttons from the stick menu are handled as edge triggers inside fit_sample. Stale vertical lean must be zeroed when leaving fit mode to prevent it from affecting later gameplay.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-219733ef-6980-40f1-b6b2-ed91077a031b-80","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub yaw","glob":"**/pav_view/src/camera.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1278,"output_tokens":1381,"cache_read_input_tokens":116480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"361f0f7c-e47a-4c33-9804-bac4ffa2d4af"}
