{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_357","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HudFrame is pav_core::frame::HudFrame.\n\nI'll write the helper functions next. I need to verify Gfx::size returns (u32, u32) and window.scale_factor exists. SimHost is crate::simhost::SimHost. FitGame and Flow need names in the wasm exec closure. apply_browser_save has a borrow conflict because it borrows host from self while also borrowing fit_save_loaded mutably.\n\nThe borrow conflict should be safe because `self.host.as_ref()` only borrows the host field. If NLL rejects it, I'll inline the helper instead. `self.gfx.as_mut()` is also borrowed mutably for `publish_stay`.\n\nThe borrow conflict is resolved by sequencing the calls: publish_stay releases its borrow before apply_browser_save needs the mutable fit field. I'll also gate guide.station and field_guide behind the fit state so they don't draw while fit is active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-032e9493-5032-4bfe-9cd3-f264a77f50a5-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","old_string":"            let here = hud.current.clone();\n            guide_out.extend(guide.station(&ctx, here.as_ref(), &mut root));\n            guide_out.extend(guide.field_guide(&ctx, &hud.entries));","new_string":"            if !fit_on {\n                let here = hud.current.clone();\n                guide_out.extend(guide.station(&ctx, here.as_ref(), &mut root));\n                guide_out.extend(guide.field_guide(&ctx, &hud.entries));\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-032e9493-5032-4bfe-9cd3-f264a77f50a5-122","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","old_string":"fn room_entries(sim: &Sim) -> Vec<RoomEntry> {","new_string":"fn publish_stay(gfx: &Gfx, hud: &pav_core::frame::HudFrame) {\n    let Some(status) = hud.status.as_deref() else { return };\n    let scale = (gfx.window.scale_factor() as f32).max(0.01);\n    let (pw, ph) = gfx.size();\n    let css_w = pw as f32 / scale;\n    let css_h = ph as f32 / scale;\n    let items = hud.fit.as_ref().map(|ui| {\n        ui.items\n            .iter()\n            .map(|it| {\n                serde_json::json!({\n                    \"id\": it.id,\n                    \"label\": it.label,\n                    \"x\": it.rect[0] * css_w,\n                    \"y\": it.rect[1] * css_h,\n                    \"w\": it.rect[2] * css_w,\n                    \"h\": it.rect[3] * css_h,\n                })\n            })\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n    });\n    let ui_json = serde_json::to_string(&items.unwrap_or_default()).unwrap_or_else(|_| \"[]\".into());\n    crate::weblink::publish(status, &ui_json);\n}\n\nfn apply_browser_save(host: &SimHost, status: Option<&str>, loaded: &mut bool, serial: &mut u32) {\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\n    {\n        let _ = (host, status, loaded, serial);\n    }\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \"wasm32\")]\n    {\n        let Some(status) = status else { return };\n        let Ok(v) = serde_json::from_str::<serde_json::Value>(status) else { return };\n        let now = v.get(\"save_serial\").and_then(|n| n.as_u64()).unwrap_or(0) as u32;\n        if !*loaded {\n            *loaded = true;\n            *serial = now;\n            let saved = crate::weblink::storage_get(\"wobble-minutes-v1\");\n            let today = crate::weblink::boot_parts().2.unwrap_or_else(crate::weblink::epoch_day);\n            if saved.is_some() || today != 0 {\n                host.exec(move |sim| {\n                    let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<pav_core::games::fit::FitGame>()) else {\n                        return;\n                    };\n                    if let Some(text) = saved {\n                        if g.import_save(&text) {\n                            g.flow = pav_core::games::fit::Flow::Title;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if today != 0 {\n                        g.today = today;\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        if now != *serial {\n            *serial = now;\n            if let Some(blob) = host\n                .query(|sim| {\n                    sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<pav_core::games::fit::FitGame>()).map(|g| g.export_save())\n                })\n                .flatten()\n            {\n                crate::weblink::storage_set(\"wobble-minutes-v1\", &blob);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn room_entries(sim: &Sim) -> Vec<RoomEntry> {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":775,"output_tokens":1576,"cache_read_input_tokens":144768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c077a924-e92d-465f-a9c7-8bd8df6f3a1f"}
