:38,\"content\":\"    pub big_gust: f32,\"},{\"line_number\":70,\"content\":\"            gust: 18.0,\"},{\"line_number\":72,\"content\":\"            big_gust: 22.0,\"},{\"line_number\":104,\"content\":\"        v.float(\\\"gust\\\", &mut self.gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Gust strength\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"        v.float(\\\"big_gust\\\", &mut self.big_gust, 0.0, 40.0, \\\"Big Stand gusts\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"    pub gust: Vec2,\"},{\"line_number\":139,\"content\":\"            gust: Vec2::ZERO,\"},{\"line_number\":157,\"content\":\"        let acc = (target - self.cob) * rules.stiffness - self.vel * rules.damping + self.gust;\"},{\"line_number\":248,\"content\":\"    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\"},{\"line_number\":253,\"content\":\"        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\"},{\"line_number\":259,\"content\":\"        assert!(tipped, \\\"gust should tip within 2s\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":260,\"content\":\"        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":391,\"content\":\"    let cancel = bal.gust / rules.stiffness.max(1.0);\"},{\"line_number\":570,\"content\":\"    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\"},{\"line_number\":571,\"content\":\"        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\"},{\"line_number\":573,\"content\":\"        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e2a3d1f3-52bf-4102-b7cd-96422c76c1fa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_369","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Plan line 108 states that a held full lean does not tip by itself, but a gust on top of it does.\n\nFull lean alone keeps the center of balance below 1.0. A gust on top pushes it above 1.0 and causes tipping. The test uses zero lean with a 30-unit gust, so the center of balance stays below 1.0 and no tip occurs.\n\nThe test name implies a 30-unit gust alone tips the plane, but the plan requires full lean plus a gust. The current test fails under correct physics. I will either align the test with the plan or use a stronger gust.\n\nThe test will be rewritten to hold full lean, apply a 30-unit gust on top, and verify the plane tips within two seconds. Releasing both forces should return the plane to center. This aligns with the plan and still validates the simulation loop.\n\nThe test now holds full lean for 180 steps to confirm the plane stays upright. It then applies a 30-unit gust and asserts the plane tips within two seconds. After releasing both forces, it checks that the center of balance returns to within 0.2 units of the origin. The simulation resets the center of balance to 0.72 and zero velocity when a tip occurs.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"A gust of 30 balances inside the disc when you stand still. The plan says a gust tips you only on top of a full lean, so I’ll align that test with the physics."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d24316d9-fc02-4774-8a30-c0631998d803-139","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs","old_string":"    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\n        let rules = Rules::default();\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\n        b.kicks = false;\n        b.amp = 0.0;\n        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\n        let mut tipped = false;\n        for _ in 0..120 {\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n            tipped |= b.tipped;\n        }\n        assert!(tipped, \"gust should tip within 2s\");\n        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\n        for _ in 0..180 {\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n        }\n        assert!(b.cob.length() < 0.2, \"returned to {}\", b.cob);\n    }","new_string":"    fn a_hard_gust_tips_and_a_release_returns() {\n        let rules = Rules::default();\n        let mut b = BalanceCore::default();\n        b.kicks = false;\n        b.amp = 0.0;\n        let lean = Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0);\n        for _ in 0..180 {\n            b.step_clean(lean, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n        }\n        assert!(!b.tipped, \"a full lean alone stays inside the disc\");\n        // A gust on top of a full lean pushes the equilibrium past the rim.\n        b.gust = Vec2::new(30.0, 0.0);\n        let mut tipped = false;\n        for _ in 0..120 {\n            b.step_clean(lean, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n            tipped |= b.tipped;\n        }\n        assert!(tipped, \"gust on a full lean should tip within 2s\");\n        b.gust = Vec2::ZERO;\n        for _ in 0..180 {\n            b.step_clean(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0, &rules);\n        }\n        assert!(b.cob.length() < 0.2, \"returned to {}\", b.cob);\n    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2188,"output_tokens":1629,"cache_read_input_tokens":167680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4ac0298a-0424-4835-8415-9195e6e7ae78"}
