{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_374","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The panic occurs when `drawn` is dropped at the end of a loop iteration, after the assertions.\n\nThe panic is in `Drop` at `textures.rs:337`. It is the test failure itself, not an assertion. The drop happens either after passing assertions or during `frame()`.\n\nThe panic likely comes from the warmup `ctx.run_ui(...)` call. That call drops a `FullOutput` containing a `TexturesDelta` from font installation, which triggers the `Drop` panic.\n\nThe fix is to capture the warmup output in a variable and call `textures_delta.clear()` on it before dropping.\n\nThe test must also clear `drawn.paint.textures` before dropping `Drawn`. Otherwise the stored font delta would still panic on drop. The warmup fix alone is not enough.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d86474d5-18d5-4a89-bc6b-d339c70e7db0-145","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/headless.rs","old_string":"        crate::fit::install_fonts(&ctx);\n        let _ = ctx.run_ui(egui::RawInput { screen_rect: Some(screen), ..Default::default() }, |_| {});","new_string":"        crate::fit::install_fonts(&ctx);\n        // Fonts land on the next pass. Clear that atlas delta; nothing paints the warmup.\n        let mut warm = ctx.run_ui(egui::RawInput { screen_rect: Some(screen), ..Default::default() }, |_| {});\n        warm.textures_delta.clear();"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d86474d5-18d5-4a89-bc6b-d339c70e7db0-146","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs","old_string":"            let drawn = head.frame(None, &frame.hud, glam::Mat4::IDENTITY, 1920, 1080, Default::default());\n            let blob = drawn.reading.hud.iter().map(|t| t.text.as_str()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\" | \");\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"Wobble Minutes\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"New Stay\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(word), \"device {device} xbox {xbox}: {blob}\");","new_string":"            let mut drawn = head.frame(None, &frame.hud, glam::Mat4::IDENTITY, 1920, 1080, Default::default());\n            let blob = drawn.reading.hud.iter().map(|t| t.text.as_str()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\" | \");\n            drawn.paint.textures.clear();\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"Wobble Minutes\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(\"New Stay\"), \"{blob}\");\n            assert!(blob.contains(word), \"device {device} xbox {xbox}: {blob}\");"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1156,"output_tokens":1145,"cache_read_input_tokens":176256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9e170d3a-a989-4b49-9a69-54b52e7fcf07"}
