{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_385","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to write web/index.html carefully.\n\nI am reviewing pack_single_html.py and hub/session.js to understand exact constraints and splicing requirements. I will check TASK.md for exit interview details and PLAN sections 16-18 for verification steps. The plan specifies a strict head order: meta charset, session.js, hub meta tags, about-data block, then the exact IIFE.\n\nThe packer requires exactly one title, description, theme-color, manifest link, and closing body tag. The touch card should show only on coarse-pointer devices without fine pointers. The no-WebGPU message must include both the controller requirement and the WebGPU dependency. I will remove #turn and fullscreen-on-tap while keeping the MutationObserver that hides #msg when the canvas appears. The players meta tag needs an en dash: \"1–4\".\n\nThe HTML meta tag will use a hyphen as specified in the plan. I am checking pack_single_html.py for script handling and verifying session.js contains no closing-script tags.\n\nI will read the packer, session.js header, and PLAN sections 14, 16, and 18 in parallel. I need to check how app.rs consumes __fitClick so the Settings button works. Ghost drawing is optional after the shell, but the plan requires it. I will check section 16 to see if verification only checks scores or also expects visual ghosts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db26dd3d-82e7-4d83-87d8-4638b4f16c2f-4","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"about-data|exit-interview|build-web|pack_single","glob":"**/{PLAN.md,TASK.md,STAGE.md}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db26dd3d-82e7-4d83-87d8-4638b4f16c2f-5","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/scripts/pack_single_html.py","limit":200}},{"type":"tool_u