nd, push crates, collect the coins.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"        about: \\\"Side-view platformer: jump gaps and spikes, stomp blobs, ride the lift, reach the goal.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"        about: \\\"Top-down shooter: survive waves of runners, shooters and brutes (mouse aims, hold fire).\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1316,\"content\":\"                    // Fit the text along the zone's long side (about 0.58 em per letter).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/look.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":78,\"content\":\"    pub fn about(self) -> &'static str {\"},{\"line_number\":229,\"content\":\"    pub about: String,\"},{\"line_number\":238,\"content\":\"    pub about: String,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/pavilion-lite/src/tools.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":168,\"content\":\"        help: \\\"Everything about one entity.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":609,\"content\":\"    Ok(Output::Json(json!(s.games.iter().map(|g| json!({ \\\"name\\\": g.name, \\\"about\\\": g.about })).collect::<Vec<_>>())))\"},{\"line_number\":1316,\"content\":\"        s.push_str(&format!(\\\"  {:<12} {}\\\\n\\\", g.name, g.about));\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/assets.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"    /// Turned `degrees` about +y: +yaw turns the asset's front (+z) toward +x, as room objects.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/water.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":185,\"content\":\"        // Damping the velocity by d per step shrinks the amplitude by about sqrt(d): square the\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/monsters.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":195,\"content\":\"/// A ghoul in its captured motion: shambling as it wanders, at about the walk's own pace;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/motion.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":223,\"content\":\"        // Each walker moves at its style's own pace, so the clip plays at about its own speed.\"},{\"line_number\":245,\"content\":\"                    assert!(ground < pace * 1.6, \\\"{} walks at about its style's pace: {ground} vs {pace}\\\", e.name);\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9a040d1e-83bb-4de9-b2e2-e5cc80b32da6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_387","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a large remaining task.\n\nNext steps are writing web/index.html with session.js, tests/run.sh, and tools/build.sh. The about screen also needs wiring so Rust reads the boot.about data block instead of hardcoded text.\n\nThe About screen needs to display the imported about-data block. Since the simulation cannot access JavaScript, the text must be passed from the host application at startup or overlaid by the UI layer.\n\nboot_parts currently only extracts scene, seed, and today. It needs to also return the about text. I will add an `about_text` field to FitGame and determine whether to pass it through host.query or a Game trait method.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b676294e-c558-453e-b851-9c0db8bbae2e-12","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn query|fn exec|apply_browser_save|fit_save|host\\.query","glob":"**/{app.rs,sim.rs,games/mod.rs,host.rs}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b676294e-c558-453e-b851-9c0db8bbae2e-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md","offset":1,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b676294e-c558-453e-b851-9c0db8bbae2e-14","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## Verification|checkbox|- \\[ \\]","glob":"**/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b676294e-c558-453e-b851-9c0db8bbae2e-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js","limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20028,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":48384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8402bc8a-6cd0-4730-ac03-3ec4dfbb6d0a"}
