{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_391","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan requires appending extra RenderObjects to clones of prev and curr before builder.build.\n\nCloning prev and curr requires reading window.__hub.ghosts. Ghost JSON includes area, position, facing, lean, clip id, clip time, and score. Only ghosts matching the current area should be drawn. The current status ghost uses area -1, so it sends a dummy pose instead of the real one. Other players likely share this area value, which would hide visual ghosts but probably does not affect harness protocol checks.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bc3c237-bc70-437a-b41d-3a725fd30c2f-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"enum EventId|fn key\\(|fn index","glob":"**/games/fit/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bc3c237-bc70-437a-b41d-3a725fd30c2f-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn get_mut|fn play\\(","glob":"**/pav_core/src/games/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bc3c237-bc70-437a-b41d-3a725fd30c2f-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js","offset":1,"limit":5}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5124,"output_tokens":442,"cache_read_input_tokens":81024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"43cde88c-b01d-44d2-a314-d9357ca6db92"}
