{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_398","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"RenderFrame does not derive Clone.\n\nArc makes cloning cheap, but RenderFrame is not Clone. Ghosts must be added in the view layer to keep the simulation deterministic. App::frame will need a workaround for the missing Clone implementation.\n\nDeriving Clone on RenderFrame is risky because StaticWorld, PuppetDef, and HudFrame might not implement it. A mutable copy before builder.build seems safer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-166c7029-9b3d-432c-b98e-71d0154f7916-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct StaticWorld|struct HudFrame|struct PuppetDef|struct RoomInfo","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-166c7029-9b3d-432c-b98e-71d0154f7916-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs","offset":460,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1296,"output_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":95104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"fc009913-4a55-47ac-945d-bbe335e388a5"}
