{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_402","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"RenderFrame already derives Clone and Debug.\n\nI will clone the previous and current frames before appending hub ghosts. The Arc-based statics make this cheap enough for this game.\n\nCloning every frame is wasteful when no hub ghosts exist. I will only clone when fit, wasm, and ghosts are nonempty. The owned clones must live long enough for build to use them.\n\nI will use the original frame references when no hub ghosts exist. When ghosts are present, I will clone them into local variables and paint the ghosts onto those owned frames before passing references to build.\n\nNative builds never clone frames because hub_ghosts returns an empty vector there. The paint logic will match each ghost to its current event using the area index, and seat colors will be pastel tints.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11141d98-87e6-427b-9cfb-7d443def480c-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tilt_side|tilt_fwd","glob":"**/puppet.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11141d98-87e6-427b-9cfb-7d443def480c-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/shape.rs","offset":1,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11141d98-87e6-427b-9cfb-7d443def480c-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn new\\(","glob":"**/pav_core/src/shape.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1150,"output_tokens":854,"cache_read_input_tokens":99968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"77c92024-91ac-4322-8a2c-8d8b41d8c158"}
