{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_403","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether EntityId is public and how to construct it.\n\nEntityId is `pub struct EntityId(pub u32)`. Visual::new exists. Quat comes from facing. Color might be a tuple struct. The current event area maps to an EventId index from the status JSON. Ghost data comes from JS as a full message object keyed by player ID. HubGhost will hold a seat field.\n\nHubGhost now includes area, pos, facing, and lean fields. The hub_ghosts function will use a #[cfg(wasm)] block to read from the JS hub object. Without js_sys, iterating the ghosts object requires either adding an Object.keys extern or finding another way to list keys.\n\nThe JS IIFE cannot be changed to store ghosts as an array. The chosen approach is a `#[wasm_bindgen]` extern declaration for `Object.keys`, which may not require adding js-sys to Cargo.toml if it is already a transitive dependency.\n\nChecking whether js-sys is already a transitive dependency in pav_app's Cargo.toml. The Object.keys extern will return a JsValue, and a new Arrayish type will expose the length getter to iterate the keys.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-097e6628-7740-45f1-bdc8-2c3933cb2d04-60","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.id\\s*=|players\\.push|me:","glob":"**/hub/session.js","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-097e6628-7740-45f1-bdc8-2c3933cb2d04-61","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/Cargo.toml","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1734,"output_tokens":975,"cache_read_input_tokens":100992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b59478c7-8e07-4f1d-9854-6c74205499f1"}
