e { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"offset\":540,\"limit\":60,\"raw_output\":\"                v.push((ACT_ABOUT, \\\"About\\\".into()));\\n                v.push((ACT_HOWTO, \\\"How to Stand\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, sl) in self.slots.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    if self.continuing && !sl.used {\\n                        continue;\\n                    }\\n                    let label = if sl.used { format!(\\\"{} · day {}\\\", sl.name, sl.day) } else { format!(\\\"Hammock {} · empty\\\", i + 1) };\\n                    v.push((10 + i as u16, label));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Name => s.names.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (400 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Look => s.skins.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (500 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Outfit => s.outfits.iter().enumerate().map(|(i, n)| (520 + i as u16, n.clone())).take(6).collect(),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let evs = self.schedule_events();\\n                let mut v = Vec::new();\\n                for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().take(4) {\\n                    let done = if self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()) { \\\" · done\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" };\\n                    v.push((100 + i as u16, format!(\\\"{}{done}\\\", e.title())));\\n                }\\n                if self.day_clear() {\\n                    v.push((ACT_END_DAY, \\\"End the day\\\".into()));\\n                }\\n                v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n                v\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => vec![\\n                (ACT_RESULT_BACK, \\\"Back to the island\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_RETRY, \\\"Retry\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Together => vec![\\n                (ACT_G2, \\\"2 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G3, \\\"3 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_G4, \\\"4 guests\\\".into()),\\n                (ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()),\\n            ],\\n            Flow::Settings => self.settings_items(),\\n            Flow::Dev => self.dev_items(),\\n            Flow::Pause => vec![(ACT_RESUME, \\\"Resume\\\".into()), (ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::About | Flow::HowTo | Flow::Wardrobe | Flow::Calendar => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Attract if self.touch_only => vec![(ACT_SETTINGS, \\\"Settings\\\".into())],\\n            Flow::Podium => vec![(ACT_BACK, \\\"Back to the title\\\".into())],\\n            _ => Vec::new(),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn settings_items(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n        let m = self.settings.music;\\n        match self.page {\\n            0 => vec![\\n                (610, format!(\\\"Music {:.0}%\\\", m * 100.0)),\\n                (611, format!(\\\"Effects {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.sfx * 100.0)),\\n                (612, format!(\\\"Voices {:.0}%\\\", self.settings.voice * 100.0)),\\n                (ACT_XBOX, if self.settings.xbox { \\\"Glyphs: Xbox\\\" } else { \\\"Glyphs: PlayStation\\\" }.into()),\\n\",\"total_lines\":1853}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"768078af-813f-4d7d-8038-508388dbeffa"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_405","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"TAB increments the page for all menu flows, including About.\n\nAbout page increments independently from the main page. Ghost status in status() requires player position via sim.feet(id) and sim.state.player. A set_about method needs to be added to FitGame, along with a boot_about call for web links. apply_browser_save already handles execution on first load.\n\nAbout will be injected inside the existing save-execution block. A one-shot `about_loaded` flag will ensure it loads exactly once even when no prior save exists.\n\n`about_blob` will be a public `String` field on `FitGame`, initialized in `fresh()`. The `about_page` helper becomes a method named `about_text()` for the Banner to call. The ghost helper will live in `app.rs` alongside `Visual` and `Color` imports.\n\nGhost puppet state will default to facing the player, with tilt derived from lean values scaled by 14. The feet offset is set to 0.9. Position calculation adds a seat-based horizontal offset when the ghost is near the player. Tint colors are defined as RGB triplets for each seat.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44824d0a-fec4-4d06-8abb-d116df927332-64","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44824d0a-fec4-4d06-8abb-d116df927332-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub use|mod events|pub mod events","glob":"**/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44824d0a-fec4-4d06-8abb-d116df927332-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub enum Color|struct Color","glob":"**/pav_core/src/color.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4118,"output_tokens":1052,"cache_read_input_t