{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_407","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll write a Python script to generate index.html and patch the Rust files.\n\nI'll write tests and supporting docs next. The About page will lead with a compact summary on page 0 that includes Source and feedback headings. Detail pages will follow for the remaining content.\n\nPage 0 will always include the Source line and, if a blob is present, its usage text. Pages 1 through 4 will hold testing feedback, engine details, prompt feedback, and credits respectively.\n\nI'll replace `about_page()` to return the new pages and substitute feedback bodies when a blob is present. I'm also fixing the tab behavior and adding a `ghost_json` method to serialize ghost state.\n\nI'm verifying the Rust types for the ghost JSON serialization. I confirmed that `Activity` has a `t` field, `Entity` exposes rotation, and `entities.get` accepts an `EntityId`. I also need to check whether the player field is public.\n\nI confirmed `sim.state.player` is already used in the game. I'm now writing the ghost drawing code in `app.rs` and adding a `boot_about` helper to read the boot configuration from the browser window.\n\nThe `boot_about` helper reads the `about` field from `__gameBoot` as a string. The JavaScript IIFE sets this value before returning early in solo mode, so both hub and solo builds include it. The hub script runs at parse time, before WebAssembly loads.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1ba035b7-6a52-4edc-a40f-a3e3c6212764-69","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"take_fit_click","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1ba035b7-6a52-4edc-a40f-a3e3c6212764-70","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":1180,"limit":110}}],"stop_reason":"tool