{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_420","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Running a Pavement capture command for the fit scene.\n\nThe capture command needs a separate binary build. Tests will run first, then the binary will be compiled. Parallel builds are avoided due to Cargo lock conflicts.\n\nCore tests will run twice. Then the native Pav binary will be built. Wasm and capture will follow sequentially. Two browser boots and two engine captures are required. The two captures of the same scene must agree.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0009233b-b1d4-4b88-bb3b-88caccd695cf-88","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1320,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1456,"output_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":132736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e7c6d89e-1af7-45c9-a8f2-4efe666cc5fd"}
