{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_421","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Event capture scenes begin at the card.\n\nCapture timing is being verified. The card auto-advances after one second, followed by a three-second countdown. Pav capture ticks should exceed 360 to pass the countdown phase. Title capture at tick 30 should show the title menu when UI is composited. Two captures must match. Blank images will be rejected using luminance standard deviation and color variance checks.\n\nI'll use the installed `magick` tool to check image quality. I'll write a substantial PROGRESS.md and add a note to decisions.md. The goal plan checklist will be updated only after verification.\n\nI'll flip the plan checklist items as each chunk is verified, rather than waiting until the end. The first completed items will be marked done immediately after confirmation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-911e23b4-4f30-4460-bc4e-b2c62a3f8efd-89","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js","offset":-15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1460,"output_tokens":743,"cache_read_input_tokens":134144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"0da3322a-3830-4409-975c-d2d54f2ed9eb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-911e23b4-4f30-4460-bc4e-b2c62a3f8efd-89","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"474→    try {\\n      return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(probeFn()));\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return { error: String((e && e.message) || e) };\\n    }\\n  };\\n480→\\n  /** The game cannot run here (no WebGL, failed load): the hub skips it. */\\n  hub.fail = function (message) {\\n    if (!hub.active) return;\\n    post('error', { message: String(message || 'error').slice(0, 500), fatal: true });\\n  };\\n\\n  root.AIHub = hub;\\n})(typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis);\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"474→    try {\\n      return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(probeFn()));\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return { error: String((e && e.message) || e) };\\n    }\\n  };\\n480→\\n  /** The game cannot run here (no WebGL, failed load): the hub skips it. */\\n  hub.fail = function (message) {\\n    if (!hub.active) return;\\n    post('error', { message: String(message || 'error').slice(0, 500), fatal: true });\\n  };\\n\\n  root.AIHub = hub;\\n})(typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis);\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"    try {\\n      return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(probeFn()));\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return { error: String((e && e.message) || e) };\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  /** The game cannot run here (no WebGL, failed load): the hub skips it. */\\n  hub.fail = function (message) {\\n    if (!hub.active) return;\\n    post('error', { message: String(message || 'error').slice(0, 500), fatal: true });\\n  };\\n\\n  root.AIHub = hub;\\n})(typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis);\\n\",\"total_lines\":488}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1