{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_434","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Songs live in the pav_audio mixer roots/BPMs and FitGame::desired_song.\n\nWriting the README in a batch. SFX IDs 1 through 32 will be noted briefly. Painter line wrapping and long labels are safe. The test flow handles UI correctly before the freeze return.\n\njust() correctly checks pressed state. Focus and flow change in the same tick after a click, so TAB on the next tick works. fit_ui adds an extra line for About because it has no talk text. UiEvent is Copy and fits into InputFrame. The test will use Click(5) to open About, which sets the flow and lets fit_ui render the about screen.\n\nAbout screen ID is 5. The stamp implementation in app.rs will use a ghost overlay version of the build call, replacing the previous prev and curr arguments. Cloning RenderFrame for ghost overlays is rare because it only happens at the hub.\n\nThe exact line number for the Clone derive on RenderObject is being verified, since the tool skips intermediate lines.\n\nThe `#[derive(Clone, Debug)]` on `RenderObject` is confirmed at line 26 in frame.rs.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The page is still the stock engine shell, and About never turns its pages. I’ll wire those, then run the sim tests before the browser build."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-104","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    reset_arm: bool,\n    ghost_id: Option<crate::entity::EntityId>,\n    about_page: usize,\n}","new_string":"    reset_arm: bool,\n    ghost_id: Option<crate::entity::EntityId>,\n    about_page: usize,\n    /// Plain About text from the page (`__gameBoot.about`). Empty in native tests.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub about_blob: String,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-105","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            reset_arm: false,\n            ghost_id: None,\n            about_page: 0,\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            reset_arm: false,\n            ghost_id: None,\n            about_page: 0,\n            about_blob: String::new(),\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-106","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"                if input.just(buttons::TAB_R) {\n                    self.page += 1;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_L) {\n                    self.page = self.page.saturating_sub(1);\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }","new_string":"                if input.just(buttons::TAB_R) {\n                    if self.flow == Flow::About {\n                        let n = self.about_len().max(1);\n                        self.about_page = (self.about_page + 1) % n;\n                    } else {\n                        self.page += 1;\n                        self.focus = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n                if input.just(buttons::TAB_L) {\n                    if self.flow == Flow::About {\n                        let n = self.about_len().max(1);\n                        self.about_page = (self.about_page + n - 1) % n;\n                    } else {\n                        self.page = self.page.saturating_sub(1);\n                        self.focus = 0;\n                    }\n                }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-107","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"                \"ghost\": {\"area\": -1},","new_string":"                \"ghost\": self.ghost_json(sim),"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            Flow::About => (\"About\".into(), String::new(), about_page(self.about_page)),","new_string":"            Flow::About => (\"About\".into(), format!(\"{}/{}\", self.about_page + 1, self.about_len().max(1)), self.about_text()),"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b97037f-4c72-4ecb-8534-f405f259226d-109","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"fn about_page(page: usize) -> String {\n    const PAGES: [&str; 4] = [\n        \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\",\n        \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Research followed the build plan and the engine source.\",\n        \"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\",\n        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",\n    ];\n    PAGES[page.min(PAGES.len() - 1)].into()\n}","new_string":"impl FitGame {\n    fn about_len(&self) -> usize {\n        self.about_lines().len()\n    }\n\n    fn about_text(&self) -> String {\n        let lines = self.about_lines();\n        if lines.is_empty() {\n            return String::new();\n        }\n        lines[self.about_page % lines.len()].clone()\n    }\n\n    fn about_lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\n        about_from_blob(&self.about_blob).unwrap_or_else(|| ABOUT_FALLBACK.iter().map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect())\n    }\n\n    /// What other seats should draw. Area -1 means \"not on a mat\".\n    fn ghost_json(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\n        let area = self.kind_now().map(|k| k as i32).unwrap_or(-1);\n        let facing = sim.player().and_then(|e| e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.anim.facing)).unwrap_or(0.0);\n        let p = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)).unwrap_or(Vec3::ZERO);\n        json!({\n            \"area\": area,\n            \"position\": [p.x, p.y, p.z],\n            \"facing\": facing,\n            \"lean\": [self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y],\n            \"clip\": 0,\n            \"clip_time\": self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t).unwrap_or(0.0),\n            \"score\": self.score,\n        })\n    }\n}\n\nconst ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&str; 4] = [\n    \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library.\",\n    \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\",\n    \"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\",\n    \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",\n];\n\nfn about_from_blob(blob: &str) -> Option<Vec<String>> {\n    if blob.trim().is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n    let v: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(blob).ok()?;\n    let src = v.get(\"sourceInformation\")?;\n    let usage = src.get(\"usage\").and_then(|x| x.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"added on import\");\n    let source = src.get(\"source\").and_then(|x| x.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"Wii Fit\");\n    let testing = join_feedback(v.get(\"testingFeedback\"));\n    let engine = join_feedback(v.get(\"engineFeedback\"));\n    let prompt = join_feedback(v.get(\"promptFeedback\"));\n    Some(vec![\n        format!(\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of {source} by Nintendo. Usage: {usage}. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen.\"),\n        \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\".into(),\n        format!(\"Testing Feedback: {testing}\"),\n        format!(\"Engine Feedback: {engine}\"),\n        format!(\"Prompt Feedback: {prompt}\"),\n        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\".into(),\n    ])\n}\n\nfn join_feedback(v: Option<&serde_json::Value>) -> String {\n    v.and_then(|x| x.as_array())\n        .map(|a| a.iter().filter_map(|s| s.as_str()).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\" \"))\n        .filter(|s| !s.is_empty())\n        .unwrap_or_else(|| \"unknown\".into())\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":661,"output_tokens":4756,"cache_read_input_tokens":150016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"983fa5b8-1961-41d1-b7e4-17e739d3ab49"}
