{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5342643c-3c34-4b2b-a886-9179644e6770-112","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1834→\\n    fn about_lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        about_from_blob(&self.about_blob).unwrap_or_else(|| ABOUT_FALLBACK.iter().map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect())\\n    }\\n\\n    /// What other seats should draw. Area -1 means \\\"not on a mat\\\".\\n1840→    fn ghost_json(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let area = self.kind_now().map(|k| k as i32).unwrap_or(-1);\\n        let facing = sim.player().and_then(|e| e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.anim.facing)).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        let p = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)).unwrap_or(Vec3::ZERO);\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"area\\\": area,\\n            \\\"position\\\": [p.x, p.y, p.z],\\n            \\\"facing\\\": facing,\\n            \\\"lean\\\": [self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y],\\n            \\\"clip\\\": 0,\\n1850→            \\\"clip_time\\\": self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t).unwrap_or(0.0),\\n            \\\"score\\\": self.score,\\n        })\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nconst ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&str; 4] = [\\n    \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\",\\n    \\\"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\\\",\\n    \\\"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed