{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_438","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether sim.play() exists on Sim.\n\nConfirmed sim.play() is available. Title menu click logic works for ACT_ABOUT without requiring the id to be in the list. Page 0 of TAB_R contains testing feedback words but not \"the bot caught a gust\".\n\nPage 2 of TAB_R contains the phrase. Two TAB_R presses from page 0 correctly reach page 2. The sim.play() method exists. EventId, PuppetState, and Visual::new are public. A potential compile error with RenderFrame clone and stamp was noted.\n\nPuppetFrame is public. The `prev.as_ref()` call on the Arc returns `&RenderFrame`, which matches what `unwrap_or` expects. The `boot_about` function uses `cfg` blocks for native and WASM targets.\n\nChecking that the `boot_about` function returns a value on every path. The WASM branch uses an `if` expression as its final statement, which should satisfy the return type.\n\nThe `boot_about` function has a compile bug. The WASM branch's final `if` expression is discarded as a statement, so the function never returns on that path. It needs an explicit `return` before the conditional.\n\n`hub_ghosts` is a valid pattern. Its WASM branch returns directly, so the native `Vec::new()` is the final expression and compiles correctly.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c324312c-6218-49c4-835d-12ec9bb4e4ae-119","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/weblink.rs","old_string":"        let s = v.as_string()?;\n        if s.trim().is_empty() { None } else { Some(s) }\n    }\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\n    None\n}","new_string":"        let s = v.as_string()?;\n        return if s.trim().is_empty() { None } else { Some(s) };\n    }\n    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\n    {\n        None\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c324312c-6218-49c4-835d-12ec9bb4e4ae-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TAB_R","glob":"**/pav_core/src/input.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4369,"output_tokens":1289,"cache_read_input_tokens":157952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8a5855ac-b7f8-4332-8907-64d8f46d7e2b"}
