{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_455","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the shell script: `local sum_code=$?`.\n\nThe `local sum_code=$?` pattern is actually correct. In bash, `$?` expands before the `local` command executes, so it captures the exit status of the previous command. The suspected bug does not exist.\n\nMid-function `local` declarations are valid in bash. The next steps are to start cargo, write the browser/hub module, run `write_index`, and set permissions. The integration test will take roughly eight seconds plus compilation time. Pav_app changes likely do not require pav_ui or pav_audio updates, but pav_core changes force recompilation of the library and integration tests. Pav_app is missing from the test command.\n\nCore tests will not compile pav_app. The wasm build will handle that. I will run `cargo check -p pav_app` after the tests finish but before the wasm build to catch any app.rs errors early.\n\nThe test command will be a sequential shell block: run the library, fit, and audio/ui tests first, then `cargo check -p pav_app -p pav_tools`. This compiles the app in one cargo queue. A failed check produces a non-zero exit code. The summarize script only reads test results, so it will not be affected.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-09fa1166-29a4-4f8e-8762-d52dc0593657-147","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tools/write_index.py\" && chmod +x \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/run.sh\" \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tools/build.sh\"","description":"Write the game page and m