irection\\\": \\\"The engine's cel look, high-key pastel, beach and wellness props. Library props only for generic dressing.\\\", \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Engine puppet, tilted about the feet by the balance dot. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\", \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Music, effects and voices are synthesized in code. No audio files. Seven music beds, default music gain 0.10. At least 30 effects. Animalese voices.\\\", \\\"online\\\": \\\"AI Hub ghost mode for 1–4 players. The round is the Inter-Resort Medley (Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup).\\\", \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Headless sim tests, Playwright Chromium with software WebGPU at 320×180, phone and tablet prof [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":505,\"content\":\"                                     about: document.getElementById('about-data')?.textContent ?? '' };\"},{\"line_number\":537,\"content\":\"<title>Wobble Minutes — Five days, one mat</title>\"},{\"line_number\":539,\"content\":\"<meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#f4e7d4\\\">\"},{\"line_number\":543,\"content\":\"<link rel=\\\"manifest\\\" href=\\\"manifest.webmanifest\\\">\"},{\"line_number\":565,\"content\":\"<div id=\\\"need\\\"><p>Controller or keyboard required</p><button type=\\\"button\\\" id=\\\"need-settings\\\">Settings</button></div>\"},{\"line_number\":582,\"content\":\"    msg.replaceChildren('Controller or keyboard required', document.createElement('br'),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a05cad13-2ff7-4829-ac6f-7f80e653b861"}
