{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_459","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cargo check completed successfully with exit code 0. Only warnings were present.\n\nTests passed across lib, fit, audio, and ui. Empty test binaries in pav_audio and pav_ui added zero to the totals. The total is 27 passed and 0 failed. Pav_app may have been excluded from the test command.\n\nThe raw cargo command was not run.sh. I will run tests/run.sh core twice and save the output to tests-core.log. The second runs should be fast.\n\nNative compilation succeeded. The wasm build is next and will take roughly two to three minutes. I will run the core tests twice in one command and tee the output to a scratch log. Pav_ui has seven tests including the title prompt test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d2dbe94-3170-4e66-8eec-3daeab63924d-154","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer\"\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\"\nmkdir -p \"$SCRATCH\"\n{\n  echo \"=== run 1 ===\"\n  \"$DEV/tests/run.sh\" core\n  echo \"=== run 2 ===\"\n  \"$DEV/tests/run.sh\" core\n} | tee \"$SCRATCH/tests-core.log\"","description":"Run the core test command twice"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5846,"output_tokens":853,"cache_read_input_tokens":197120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d1ba9b15-2f7f-4c97-b89c-68865d208369"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0d2dbe94-3170-4e66-8eec-3daeab63924d-154","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[61,61,61,32,114,117,110,32,49,32,61,61,61,10,50,55,32,112,97,115,115,101,100,44,32,48,32,102,97,105,108,101,100,10,61,61,61,32,114,117,110,32,50,32,61,61,61,10,50,55,32,112,97,115,115,101,100,44,32,48,32,102,97,105,108,101,100,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n=== run 1 ===\\n27 passed, 0 failed\\n=== run 2 ===\\n27 passed, 0 failed\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"SCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer\\\"\\nDEV=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\\\"\\nmkdir -p \\\"$SCRATCH\\\"\\n{\\n  echo \\\"=== run 1 ===\\\"\\n  \\\"$DEV/tests/run.sh\\\" core\\n  echo \\\"=== run 2 ===\\\"\\n  \\\"$DEV/tests/run.sh\\\" core\\n} | tee \\\"$SCRATCH/tests-core.log\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Run the core test command twice\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-0d2dbe94-3170-4e66-8eec-3daeab63924d-154.log\",\"total_bytes\":68}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4361a217-3700-4c07-8cce-a5a10628ef83"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_460","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Core tests passed twice with the same line.\n\nStarting the wasm build in the background. The script uses --locked without --offline, but cached crates should allow offline compilation.\n\nThe build script will run as written. I'll set a 6.5-minute timeout for the wasm compilation.\n\nI'll poll the background build while reviewing the index for issues. I spotted a weak hover check in the browser tests: the code searches for \"settings\" inside the status JSON, which could fail if that string appears elsewhere. I should fix this before running.\n\nThe hover check will fail because the status JSON does not contain \"settings\" while the phase is still title. Focus remains at index 2, so the test should verify menu_focus directly instead.\n\nThe hover check will be rewritten to compare menu_focus directly against the __gameUi item order. The attract wait will be extended to 20 seconds for safety.\n\nThe attract wait is now 25 seconds. I am checking whether gilrs will detect the pad stub and map button 13 to DPadDown. The keyboard ArrowDown should reach winit because the mutation observer keeps the canvas focused.\n\nMouse cursor events will reach winit because the desktop is not coarse. The settings click rectangle uses CSS pixels, which match physical pixels at DPR 1. The Xbox row label contains \"glyph\", so the hit test will find it. Returning from settings to the title screen is correct. The attract mode must idle for 600 ticks without input.\n\nThe back click resets the idle counter, so the 600-tick wait will run cleanly. Space exits attract via woke() before menu handling and returns to title without activating a menu item. Audio unlocks when space is pressed and the lobby song begins.\n\nThe browser patch reads AudioBufferSourceNode. The native test already proves the ratio, so a browser failure would be noted.\n\nThe iPhone 13 viewport is smaller than 1280x720. At 12fps, 600 ticks of attract mode take about 50 seconds. The 20-second wait may be too short.\n\nThe attract wait is raised to 45 seconds for the phone viewport. The touch settings button sets the correct fit flag once the game is running. WebKit checks for the required WebGPU and controller text. Captures must not overlap with the wasm build.\n\nThe four WebGPU iframes may exhaust memory. I will attempt the test and retry or note an earlyoom if necessary.\n\nThe 20-second ready timeout might be too short for unpacking 11 MB of data across four instances.\n\nI will edit browser.py to fix the hover assertion and attract wait while the wasm build runs. I am also checking the HTML index for structural issues and verifying the IIFE matches the plan text.\n\nThe IIFE placement in the HTML index is correct. The session.js byte match was already verified. The audio+ui test output showing zero tests is harmless and does not indicate a failure.\n\nThe content lint passed without scanning the HTML. The build script regenerates the index before compiling wasm, and cargo tests will not run concurrently. The packer uses python3 -I, which is acceptable. A String constructor failure would surface at compile time rather than pack time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a4f00ca-ce67-4897-ac72-32190c2c81c8-155","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"    page.mouse.move(8, 8)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(80)\n    page.mouse.move(40, 30)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(250)\n    s = status(page)\n    if s.get(\"prompt\") != \"Click\":\n        return fail(f\"mouse prompt {s.get('prompt')}\")\n    target = item_center(page, \"settings\")\n    if not target:\n        return fail(f\"no settings rect {page.evaluate('() => window.__gameUi')}\")\n    page.mouse.move(target[\"x\"], target[\"y\"])\n    page.wait_for_timeout(250)\n    s = status(page)\n    if \"settings\" not in str(s):\n        return fail(f\"hover did not land on settings focus {s.get('menu_focus')}\")","new_string":"    page.mouse.move(8, 8)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(80)\n    page.mouse.move(40, 30)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(250)\n    s = status(page)\n    if s.get(\"prompt\") != \"Click\":\n        return fail(f\"mouse prompt {s.get('prompt')}\")\n    target = item_center(page, \"settings\")\n    if not target:\n        return fail(f\"no settings rect {page.evaluate('() => window.__gameUi')}\")\n    page.mouse.move(target[\"x\"], target[\"y\"])\n    page.wait_for_timeout(300)\n    hovered = page.evaluate(\n        \"\"\"() => {\n          const s = JSON.parse(String(window.__gameStatus));\n          const items = window.__gameUi || [];\n          const it = items[s.menu_focus];\n          return it ? it.label : '';\n        }\"\"\"\n    )\n    if \"settings\" not in hovered.lower():\n        return fail(f\"hover landed on {hovered!r}\")"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a4f00ca-ce67-4897-ac72-32190c2c81c8-156","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"    attracted = False\n    for _ in range(30):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)","new_string":"    attracted = False\n    for _ in range(50):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a4f00ca-ce67-4897-ac72-32190c2c81c8-157","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"    attracted = False\n    for _ in range(40):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)","new_string":"    attracted = False\n    for _ in range(90):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)"}}