ue 0.1 MB)\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-9a4f00ca-ce67-4897-ac72-32190c2c81c8-158.log\",\"truncated\":true,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":25207}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-af4d419f-1972-4b7d-bd9f-d30be4d51efc-4","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,95,95,120,51,53,49,49,50,100,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,46,103,114,111,107,47,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,115,47,37,50,70,104,111,109,101,37,50,70,109,105,99,104,97,37,50,70,100,101,118,37,50,70,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,37,50,70,114,117,110,115,37,50,70,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,95,95,120,51,53,49,49,50,100,37,50,70,119,111,114,107,47,48,49,97,49,97,97,50,55,45,98,97,56,54,45,55,55,51,48,45,56,57,99,50,45,57,49,55,56,102,102,57,48,56,98,99,101,47,103,111,97,108,47,112,108,97,110,46,109,100,10,49,51,58,35,35,32,86,101,114,105,102,105,99,97,116,105,111,110,32,112,108,97,110,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-8