{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_473","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boot 1 timed out after 90 seconds waiting for __gameStatus.\n\nBoot 2 is also timing out. I will investigate the missing __gameStatus without launching another browser, since earlyoom is a concern. I plan to inspect the page source and WASM publish path directly. Likely causes include a WASM startup error, hung WebGPU initialization, a wrong status name, a JavaScript error, file:// restrictions, or a bug in the WASM status code.\n\nThe test only checks for page errors after status appears, so the root cause is hidden. I will kill the current test and run a shorter diagnostic script that captures console output immediately.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The first boot never published `__gameStatus`. I'll stop the rest of that run and look at the boot errors."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8365e5de-6e25-4534-97f3-879875e6d657-20","name":"kill_command_or_subagent","input":{"task_id":"3ab05757-43c7-4671-9fb7-7d215ce4f55a"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8365e5de-6e25-4534-97f3-879875e6d657-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__gameStatus|gameStatus","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine","glob":"*.{rs,html,js}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":562,"output_tokens":538,"cache_read_input_tokens":71680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cfb33c53-087a-4762-b770-750e89e93cdb"}
