{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_477","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A race condition exists in the module script. It awaits `window.loadGame`, but that function is defined much later after a large WASM blob.\n\nClassic scripts execute immediately. Module scripts are deferred until the document is parsed. This ordering explains why loadGame is defined after the module script that awaits it.\n\nThe boot module checks for window.loadGame before the classic script defines it. The glue module then sets window.gameGlue.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bad7a6af-77c1-4a9c-a959-35a0dfec4bda-27","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\nstart = text.find(\"(() => {\", 11550000)\n# the unpacker script\nend = text.find(\"</script>\", start)\nbody = text[start:end]\nprint(body)\nprint(\"---LEN\", len(body))\nPY","description":"Print the packed-page wasm loader script"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2748,"output_tokens":513,"cache_read_input_tokens":80256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e602313b-f204-4a07-990a-b14f6d119cc5"}
