{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_480","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The packer comment about running before index.html's module script is accurate for classic scripts versus deferred modules.\n\nThe loader sets loadGame first. Then modules run. The index module awaits loadGame. That resolves to glue. Glue is resolved by the next module. This creates a deadlock. The engine authors likely assumed modules run concurrently or that top-level await does not block subsequent scripts.\n\nThe HTML spec confirms module scripts are deferred and run in order. Top-level await returns a promise during evaluation. Chromium has a known issue with two module scripts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e9912f45-cbab-4e2c-9802-ed56ef601e18-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"loadGame|type=.module","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/web"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e9912f45-cbab-4e2c-9802-ed56ef601e18-33","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine\" && git show HEAD:web/index.html | rg -n \"loadGame|type=\\\"module\\\"|script\" | head -40","description":"See original engine index.html boot script"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3936,"output_tokens":625,"cache_read_input_tokens":87040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"14ea7cff-565f-4658-8d65-2b3055f78560"}
