2,32,100,111,99,117,109,101,110,116,46,98,111,100,121,46,97,112,112,101,110,100,40,109,115,103,41,59,10,32,32,32,32,125,10,32,32,125,10,60,47,115,99,114,105,112,116,62,10,60,47,98,111,100,121,62,10,60,47,104,116,109,108,62,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n  @keyframes fade { to { opacity: 0; } }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"msg\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\">Loading Shardfall…</div>\\n<div id=\\\"turn\\\">Turn your phone sideways for the best view</div>\\n<script type=\\\"module\\\">\\n  // Start in a demo room with ?room=NAME, or the pavilion with ?scene=world.\\n  // Messages name the game by the page title (a single-file build may retitle it).\\n  const name = document.title;\\n  const msg = document.getElementById('msg');\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) {\\n    msg.replaceChildren(`${name} needs WebGPU.`, document.createElement('br'),\\n      'Use a recent Chrome, Edge or Safari (iOS 26 or later) with hardware acceleration enabled.');\\n  } else {\\n    // The game hides this message once its canvas exists, and takes keyboard focus.\\n    new MutationObserver((_, obs) => {\\n      const c = document.querySelector('canvas');\\n      if (c) { c.setAttribute('aria-label', `${name} game`); msg.remove(); c.focus(); obs.disconnect(); }\\n    }).observe(document.body, { childList: true });\\n    // Phones and tablets: the first tap goes full screen and turns sideways, where the browser\\n    // allows it (Android; an iPhone keeps its bars, or plays full screen from the home screen).\\n    if (matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches) {\\n      addEventListener('pointerup', () => {\\n        const el = document.documentElement;\\n        if (!document.fullscreenElement && el.requestFullscreen) {\\n          el.requestFullscreen({ navigationUI: 'hide' })\\n            .then(() => screen.orientation && screen.orientation.lock && screen.orientation.lock('landscape'))\\n            .catch(() => {});\\n        }\\n      }, { once: true, capture: true });\\n    }\\n    try {\\n      // The game is shardfall.js and its .wasm beside this page. A single-file build\\n      // (scripts/pack_single_html.py) carries both inside the page and sets window.loadGame.\\n      if (window.loadGame) await window.loadGame();\\n      else await (await import('./shardfall.js')).default();\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      console.error(`${name} failed to load:`, error);\\n      msg.textContent = `${name} could not load. Please reload the page. If it still fails, check that WebGPU and hardware acceleration are enabled.`;\\n      document.body.append(msg);\\n    }\\n  }\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine\\\" && git show HEAD:web/index.html | sed -n '30,80p'\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Print original engine page boot module\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-81d3d03c-c3e0-4cc1-84e5-55eb0e48e51e-34.log\",\"total_bytes\":2266}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8caed956-acad-42a7-8ad4-67aeae0e3a0c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_482","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine's own page follows the same pattern. The packer is designed for it.\n\nThe boot timed out after 90 seconds with no game status. Possible causes include a deadlock, WASM panic, WebGPU hang, console error, slow unpacking, or a file:// module issue. I will test empirically.\n\nThe 90-second timeout might be caused by a missing navigator.gpu rather than a deadlock. The current flags may not expose WebGPU in headless mode, so the page shows a fallback message and never sets __gameStatus.\n\nI will write a short Playwright script to diagnose the boot failure. It will open the page and check navigator.gpu, error messages, and whether loadGame and canvas exist after 8 seconds. This avoids the 90-second timeout. I will also verify the Chromium version and GPU availability.\n\nThe diagnostic will check console output and page errors at 5 and 15 seconds. If navigator.gpu is missing, I will test additional flags such as `--use-angle=vulkan`, `--disable-vulkan-surface`, and `--enable-webgpu-developer-features`. The new headless shell in recent Playwright versions may also need different arguments.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da2c4388-67db-4401-8867-cc149da350f7-35","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nimport os\nos.environ.setdefault(\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\", \"ubuntu24.04-x64\")\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nHTML = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html\")\nFLAGS = [\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\"--use-angle=swiftshader\"]\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)\n    print(\"browser\", browser.version)\n    page = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\":320,\"height\":180}, device_scale_factor=1).new_page()\n    logs = []\n    page.on(\"console\", lambda m: logs.append(f\"console.{m.type}: {m.text[:300]}\"))\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: logs.append(f\"pageerror: {e}\"))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri(), wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=60000)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(8000)\n    info = page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => ({\n      gpu: !!navigator.gpu,\n      loadGame: typeof window.loadGame,\n      gameGlue: typeof window.gameGlue,\n      status: typeof window.__gameStatus,\n      canvas: !!document.querySelector('canvas'),\n      msg: (document.getElementById('msg')||{}).innerText || null,\n      title: document.title,\n    })\"\"\")\n    print(\"INFO\", info)\n    print(\"LOGS\", len(logs))\n    for line in logs[:30]:\n        print(line)\n    browser.close()\nPY","description":"Diagnose why the packed page never publishes status"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":800,"output_tokens":1153,"cache_read_input_tokens":91776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"fee4f493-c537-4123-842d-de1e3327b956"}
