{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_487","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The game booted and the canvas exists, but status is undefined after 8 seconds.\n\nThe scene is 'fit', so fit_on should be true. The frame loop may panic before publish_stay, or hud.status could be None. A weblink::publish panic is also possible. Boot logs show a 0x0 window initially, then 320x180.\n\nNo Rust WASM panic appeared in the logs. The frame loop may not be running. I will check the fit_on definition and whether status is set. A stamp_hub_ghosts panic before publish could also block it.\n\nhub_ghosts() returns empty on solo because the IIFE exits early when AIHub is inactive, so stamp never runs. The status JSON may be set but publish's Reflect.set could fail silently. A DomString constructor binding error might throw a JS exception that wasm_bindgen converts to a panic. That panic might be swallowed by the animation frame callback or appear as an unhandled rejection.\n\nI will listen for console errors and hook window.onerror. The diagnostic waited eight seconds after domcontentloaded, but boot finished at 0.8 seconds so frames should have started. If publish panics every frame, repeated errors would appear unless the loop stops after the first panic. I need to check how the frame loop handles errors. I will also add a diagnostic that inspects the descriptor for `__gameStatus` on the window object.\n\nThe diagnostic dump contained no errors. The `bind::set` call is wrapped in a catch block and its result is ignored, so any Reflect.set failure would be silently swallowed. I am now considering whether the target object might be non-extensible.\n\nI suspect the `DomString` constructor binding is wrong. If `new` throws, wasm_bindgen converts it to an uncaught panic that pageerror should catch. I will inspect the generated glue for the `weblink` String constructor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-290e3669-b722-4ba7-9d89-d7609e80f63e-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__wbg_String|js_name = String|wbg_new_.*[Ss]tring|__wbg_get_.*Object","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-290e3669-b722-4ba7-9d89-d7609e80f63e-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn status_json|hud.status|status:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1901,"output_tokens":1071,"cache_read_input_tokens":98688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ea66f783-c316-47b1-84eb-c495e236dedc"}
