{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_503","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the constructor class name.\n\nThe constructor uses the `js_class` attribute, not the type's `js_name`. Adding `#[wasm_bindgen(constructor, js_class = \"String\")]` to the constructor will generate `new String(...)` in JavaScript.\n\nConfirmed `js_class` is valid on extern constructors. A wasm rebuild is needed. The frame loop may be swallowing exceptions or skipping publish calls. The prior diagnostic showed no errors, so the fix might not surface status unless publish actually runs.\n\nThe constructor throws before publish runs, so status never gets set. The missing error might be swallowed by egui or winit's event loop. Only 18 logs were printed, suggesting the exception was likely lost.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f6a06f58-521a-4694-bf26-c9d913ebb946-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn fit_ui|fn status\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1561,"output_tokens":668,"cache_read_input_tokens":118272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"19722663-3b39-4b2a-8217-d735d6c0cc93"}
