{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_504","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I read fit_ui and the Game trait default.\n\nI suspect the browser silently drops exceptions thrown inside winit's animation frame callback. I'll run a quick diagnostic to count frames and capture errors, then prepare the fix.\n\nThe diagnostic should have caught a pageerror if it were uncaught. I'll check the Rust frame function's JS export for a try/catch block. I'll run the 10-second diagnostic and apply the js_class fix immediately after confirming. I'm also considering a simpler alternative: fixing only the extern definition to avoid the broken constructor.\n\nI ruled out `JsValue` and `Reflect.set` as workarounds. I'll apply the `js_class` fix and rebuild now. While rebuilding, I'm also considering browser test issues like phone DPR. I realized that a JS exception crossing into WASM becomes a Rust panic, which typically aborts the entire instance rather than just the frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1ea7425-8687-4f60-8eb9-dfd6a7fd5cfa-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"request_animation_frame|catch","path":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web","glob":"*.rs","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1ea7425-8687-4f60-8eb9-dfd6a7fd5cfa-64","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1590,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":884,"output_tokens":689,"cache_read_input_tokens":119808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"0790a48d-fcf2-4df9-9be8-1ed825b7dd69"}
