{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_505","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exact wasm_bindgen pattern needed is already used by winit.\n\nThe missing DomString error is likely caught silently, so the frame loop continues without setting status. The constructor needs fixing and a rebuild. Because publish happens after simulation steps, the sim advances each frame even when the panic occurs at the end.\n\nThe frame loop must keep running and status must update. If the panic aborts the entire exported function, winit might not reschedule the next animation frame. Requesting rAF at the start of each frame would let the loop survive a thrown exception.\n\nThe diagnostic did not verify whether ticks advance. The closure in animation_frame.rs is being inspected to confirm the loop dies on exception. The fix will be applied and the project rebuilt, which takes about two minutes. Cargo.toml incremental compilation settings will also be checked.\n\nIncremental rebuild of pav_app should take roughly 30 to 60 seconds. Cargo test will not run concurrently.\n\nAudioContext warnings are console warnings, not errors, so they will not fail the test. The Space key resumes audio after a user gesture. The patch modifies AudioBufferSourceNode.start.\n\nThe cpal audio path might use AudioWorklet or ScriptProcessor instead of BufferSource, so the patch may not catch any sound. I will fix weblink.rs and rebuild. I also need to verify whether `js_class` requires a string literal or an identifier; the parser expects a literal.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d67fa7fb-7d92-49c4-aa4f-2098109b7fdb-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"JsClass","path":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/wasm-bindgen-macro-support-0.2.129/src","glob":"*.rs","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d67fa7fb-7d92-49c4-aa4f-2098109b7fdb-66","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web/cursor.rs","offset":510,"limit":25}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2301,"output_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":120576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e7d474b9-f12e-46f4-8069-46a19a69a92d"}
