{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_511","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Status works, but there is a caveat.\n\nThe title screen is frozen. The game does not tick there. Tick stays at 5. The prompt also shows Space instead of Cross.\n\nThe test expects tick to advance while the title screen is frozen. The frozen() function returns true for the title flow, yet tick++ might still execute before that check. I need to read step_inner to verify.\n\nTick stayed at 5 for 400ms. At 60fps that would be roughly 24 ticks higher if the loop were running. Either the freeze check skips tick++ or the frame loop stopped entirely. The boot sequence reached tick 5 during initialization, then froze and halted.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c37633dc-9695-471f-8241-59e91af34735-74","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn step_inner|frozen|play_pre|tick \\+=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":690,"output_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":133504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"1e8ad8de-8b31-41b6-9401-e3bf6e71ff26"}
