{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_516","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The animation frame fired 43,737 times in one second. The tick counter remained stuck at 5.\n\nThe wrapper counts every requestAnimationFrame call, not every callback. The simulation is likely not stepping because frame() is not being called.\n\nThe runaway loop might be caused by callbacks re-requesting animation frames before returning, or by headless running them immediately. The stuck tick could mean the callbacks are not the game's redraw, frame() is not stepping the simulation, or the status tick is not updating.\n\nframe() might be returning early before stepping the simulation. The about_to_wait function could also be triggering requestAnimationFrame in a spin loop, which would explain the runaway callback count.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc69220e-339d-4f22-9c7b-97085b552dbb-80","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn frame\\(|host\\.step|sim\\.step|fn step\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1266,"output_tokens":553,"cache_read_input_tokens":138496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c80a1ca0-efb1-47e2-b1e8-48d667324342"}
