{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_526","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking what poll_strategy is, since Poll uses Schedule.\n\nPolling stops if the schedule drops. The event loop might leak from a JS exception at the end of run_app, though spawn_app could throw to keep it alive. The loop should still be scheduled via closures. A JS exception during early frames could kill the loop, but none were caught. Three status updates then stop.\n\nA panic on the fourth frame could abort the WASM instance and drop the schedule closure. That would explain why status stops updating after three successful sets. The browser may still panic from unapplied egui textures, unlike the headless native fix.\n\nFonts are not ready on the first frames, so text is not drawn yet. A later frame queues a texture delta that the browser path fails to apply. The next frame panics in epaint when the delta drops, killing the event loop and leaving tick stuck.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d8738f9-c830-4332-840f-d8d7886c2bcd-93","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"textures_delta|free_textures|update_texture","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d8738f9-c830-4332-840f-d8d7886c2bcd-94","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web/event_loop/runner.rs","offset":520,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1386,"output_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":155776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b6127d08-a758-44b6-a755-a2c3cf99107e"}
