()`] for [`SystemTime`]\"},{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"//! Using `-Ctarget-feature=+nontrapping-fptoint` will improve the performance\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"//! [`Date.now()`]: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Date/now\"},{\"line_number\":122,\"content\":\"//! [`performance.now()`]: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Performance/now\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"//! [`Performance` object]: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/performance_property\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/web-time-1.1.0/src/time/js.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"\\tfn performance(this: &Global) -> JsValue;\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"\\tpub(super) fn now(this: &Performance) -> f64;\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"\\t\\tlet performance = global.performance();\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"\\t\\tif performance.is_undefined() {\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"\\t\\t\\tperformance.unchecked_into()\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/web-time-1.1.0/src/time/system_time.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"\\tpub fn now() -> Self {\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"\\t\\tlet ms = js_sys::Date::now() as i64;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/web-time-1.1.0/src/time/instant.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\"\\t/// [`Performance` object]: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/performance_property\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"\\tpub fn now() -> Self {\"},{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"\\t\\tlet now = PERFORMANCE.with(|performance| {\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"\\t\\t\\treturn ORIGIN.with(|origin| performance.now() + origin);\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"\\t\\t\\tperformance.now()\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session