{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_533","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"web_time uses performance.now().\n\nThe 49 callbacks suggest the animation loop ran for about a second. A panic in frame() might not have killed the loop, since apply_control_flow could still schedule the next callback.\n\nThe 49 callbacks might be redraw requests rather than poll ticks. Distinguishing the two is difficult without instrumentation. Logging from Rust every 60 frames would be the most reliable way to verify actual tick activity.\n\nThe UI still shows the title screen, so the last frame likely froze rather than crashed. The animation loop is active: `about_to_wait` triggers `request_redraw`, which schedules a new animation frame, and `apply_control_flow` schedules the next poll task.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d452bafc-c550-412a-93d7-5dcf4a192ef5-103","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web/web_sys/canvas.rs","offset":430,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d452bafc-c550-412a-93d7-5dcf4a192ef5-104","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web/web_sys/animation_frame.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1260,"output_tokens":676,"cache_read_input_tokens":168576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ddaa2229-1032-4d49-8f00-e80f44d33dae"}
