{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_535","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"request_redraw is only called inside about_to_wait.\n\nThe tick freeze is caused by Poll scheduling a redraw that gets cancelled by the next poll. After boot, postTask storms cancel remaining rAFs forever. GPU async yields allow a few frames during boot before the freeze. The fix is to use ControlFlow::Wait on wasm instead of Poll.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0bede8a3-8d9f-4626-b404-02c3ebbaa283-107","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn request_redraw","path":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/winit-0.30.13/src/platform_impl/web","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2079,"output_tokens":324,"cache_read_input_tokens":171264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d5b2acac-5dfd-470e-9450-1c23eda42663"}
