{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_542","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"gilrs uses navigator.getGamepads.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58c00659-4bbb-438d-b60f-f6f70fa31e11-117","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":587,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58c00659-4bbb-438d-b60f-f6f70fa31e11-118","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs","offset":30,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1301,"output_tokens":268,"cache_read_input_tokens":180736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b218fd31-7935-4f5c-a48a-9eff350e84da"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58c00659-4bbb-438d-b60f-f6f70fa31e11-117","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"587→    /// Reads gamepad events and state (first connected pad).\\n    pub fn poll_gamepad(&mut self) {\\n        use gilrs::{Axis, Button};\\n590→        let mut activity = false;\\n        let mut taps = Vec::new();\\n        // One pad state from the first connected pad, or from the pad script while it runs.\\n        let mut state: Option<PadState> = None;\\n        if let Some(g) = &mut self.gilrs {\\n            while let Some(ev) = g.next_event() {\\n                match ev.event {\\n                    gilrs::EventType::ButtonPressed(b, _) => {\\n                        taps.push(b);\\n                        activity = true;\\n600→                    }\\n                    gilrs::EventType::AxisChanged(_, v, _) if v.abs() > 0.4 => activity = true,\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Connected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad connected\\\"),\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Disconnected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad disconnected\\\"),\\n                    _ => {}\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if let Some((_, gp)) = g.gamepads().next() {\\n                const ALL: [Button; 15] = [\\n                    Button::South,\\n610→                    Button::East,\\n                    Button::North,\\n                    Button::West,\\n                    Button::LeftTrigger,\\n                    Button::RightTrigger,\\n                    Button::Select,\\n                    Button::Start,\\n                    Button::DPadUp,\\n                    Button::DPadDown,\\n                    Button::DPadLeft,\\n620→                    Button::DPadRight,\\n                    Button::LeftThumb,\\n                    Button::RightThumb,\\n                    Button::Mode,\\n                ];\\n                let trig = |b: Button| gp.button_data(b).map(|d| d.value()).unwrap_or(0.0) > 0.35;\\n                state = Some(PadState {\\n                    left: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::LeftStickX), gp.value(Axis::LeftStickY)),\\n                    right: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::RightStickX), gp.value(Axis::RightStickY)),\\n                    held: ALL.into_iter().filter(|b| gp.is_pressed(*b)).collect(),\\n630→                    lt2: trig(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                    rt2: trig(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(script) = &mut self.pad_script {\\n            if let Some((st, first)) = script.next() {\\n                if first {\\n                    taps.extend(st.tap.iter().copied());\\n                }\\n640→                activity = true;\\n                state = Some(PadState { left: st.left, right: st.right, held: st.hold.clone(), lt2: false, rt2: false });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let start = taps.contains(&Button::Start);\\n        let map = taps.contains(&Button::DPadLeft);\\n        let mut pad = Pad { start_pressed: start && !self.fit, map_pressed: map && !self.fit, taps, any_activity: activity, ..Default::default() };\\n        if let Some(st) = state {\\n            let is = |b: Button| st.held.contains(&b);\\n            pad.raw_left = st.left;\\n650→            pad.left = if self.fit { st.left } else { deadzone(st.left, 0.18) };\\n            pad.right = deadzone(st.right, 0.25);\\n            let mut held = 0;\\n            let layout: &[(Button, u32)] = if self.fit {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::BACK),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::WAVE),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::STEP_L),\\n660→                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::STEP_R),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::MENU_UP),\\n                    (Button::DPadDown, buttons::MENU_DOWN),\\n                    (Button::DPadLeft, buttons::MENU_LEFT),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::MENU_RIGHT),\\n                ]\\n            } else if self.game {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::PRIMARY),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SECONDARY),\\n670→                    (Button::East, buttons::SKILL3),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::SKILL4),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::SKILL5),\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::DODGE),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::POTION),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            } else {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::JUMP),\\n680→                    (Button::East, buttons::CROUCH),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::CRAWL),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::USE),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            };\\n            for (btn, action) in layout {\\n                if is(*btn) {\\n                    held |= action;\\n                }\\n690→            }\\n            if self.fit {\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_L;\\n                }\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_R;\\n                }\\n                if is(Button::Start) && !is(Button::Mode) {\\n                    held |= buttons::PAUSE;\\n700→                }\\n            } else {\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= if self.game { buttons::SKILL6 } else { buttons::USE };\\n                }\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            pad.held = held;\\n710→            pad.rotate = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::RightTrigger) as i32 - is(Button::LeftTrigger) as i32) as f32 };\\n            // In the game the D-pad is potion / use / map / panels, not zoom.\\n            pad.zoom = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::DPadDown) as i32 - is(Button::DPadUp) as i32) as f32 };\\n            pad.a_held = is(Button::South);\\n            pad.x_held = is(Button::West);\\n            pad.y_held = is(Button::North);\\n            pad.back_held = is(Button::Select);\\n            if pad.left.length() > 0.3 || pad.right.length() > 0.3 || held != 0 {\\n                pad.any_activity = true;\\n            }\\n720→        }\\n        if pad.any_activity {\\n            self.last_device = Device::Gamepad;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        self.pad = pad;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Screen-space movement (x right, y up) from keys and stick, length <= 1.\\n    pub fn move_axis(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n730→        let k = |codes: &[KeyCode]| codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) as i32 as f32;\\n        let b = &self.bindings;\\n        let kb = Vec2::new(k(&b.right) - k(&b.left), k(&b.up) - k(&b.down));\\n        let v = if kb != Vec2::ZERO { kb.normalize() } else { self.pad.left };\\n        v.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Held game buttons from all devices.\\n    pub fn held(&self) -> u32 {\\n        let mut b = self.pad.held;\\n740→        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) {\\n                b |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            b |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            b |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n750→        }\\n        b\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Returns (held, newly pressed since the last call).\\n    pub fn buttons(&mut self) -> (u32, u32) {\\n        let held = self.held();\\n        let mut pressed = held & !self.prev_held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.key_taps.contains(c)) {\\n760→                pressed |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\",\"content_concise\":\"587→    /// Reads gamepad events and state (first connected pad).\\n    pub fn poll_gamepad(&mut self) {\\n        use gilrs::{Axis, Button};\\n590→        let mut activity = false;\\n        let mut taps = Vec::new();\\n        // One pad state from the first connected pad, or from the pad script while it runs.\\n        let mut state: Option<PadState> = None;\\n        if let Some(g) = &mut self.gilrs {\\n            while let Some(ev) = g.next_event() {\\n                match ev.event {\\n                    gilrs::EventType::ButtonPressed(b, _) => {\\n                        taps.push(b);\\n                        activity = true;\\n600→                    }\\n                    gilrs::EventType::AxisChanged(_, v, _) if v.abs() > 0.4 => activity = true,\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Connected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad connected\\\"),\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Disconnected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad disconnected\\\"),\\n                    _ => {}\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if let Some((_, gp)) = g.gamepads().next() {\\n                const ALL: [Button; 15] = [\\n                    Button::South,\\n610→                    Button::East,\\n                    Button::North,\\n                    Button::West,\\n                    Button::LeftTrigger,\\n                    Button::RightTrigger,\\n                    Button::Select,\\n                    Button::Start,\\n                    Button::DPadUp,\\n                    Button::DPadDown,\\n                    Button::DPadLeft,\\n620→                    Button::DPadRight,\\n                    Button::LeftThumb,\\n                    Button::RightThumb,\\n                    Button::Mode,\\n                ];\\n                let trig = |b: Button| gp.button_data(b).map(|d| d.value()).unwrap_or(0.0) > 0.35;\\n                state = Some(PadState {\\n                    left: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::LeftStickX), gp.value(Axis::LeftStickY)),\\n                    right: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::RightStickX), gp.value(Axis::RightStickY)),\\n                    held: ALL.into_iter().filter(|b| gp.is_pressed(*b)).collect(),\\n630→                    lt2: trig(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                    rt2: trig(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(script) = &mut self.pad_script {\\n            if let Some((st, first)) = script.next() {\\n                if first {\\n                    taps.extend(st.tap.iter().copied());\\n                }\\n640→                activity = true;\\n                state = Some(PadState { left: st.left, right: st.right, held: st.hold.clone(), lt2: false, rt2: false });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let start = taps.contains(&Button::Start);\\n        let map = taps.contains(&Button::DPadLeft);\\n        let mut pad = Pad { start_pressed: start && !self.fit, map_pressed: map && !self.fit, taps, any_activity: activity, ..Default::default() };\\n        if let Some(st) = state {\\n            let is = |b: Button| st.held.contains(&b);\\n            pad.raw_left = st.left;\\n650→            pad.left = if self.fit { st.left } else { deadzone(st.left, 0.18) };\\n            pad.right = deadzone(st.right, 0.25);\\n            let mut held = 0;\\n            let layout: &[(Button, u32)] = if self.fit {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::BACK),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::WAVE),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::STEP_L),\\n660→                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::STEP_R),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::MENU_UP),\\n                    (Button::DPadDown, buttons::MENU_DOWN),\\n                    (Button::DPadLeft, buttons::MENU_LEFT),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::MENU_RIGHT),\\n                ]\\n            } else if self.game {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::PRIMARY),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SECONDARY),\\n670→                    (Button::East, buttons::SKILL3),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::SKILL4),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::SKILL5),\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::DODGE),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::POTION),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            } else {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::JUMP),\\n680→                    (Button::East, buttons::CROUCH),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::CRAWL),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::USE),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            };\\n            for (btn, action) in layout {\\n                if is(*btn) {\\n                    held |= action;\\n                }\\n690→            }\\n            if self.fit {\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_L;\\n                }\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_R;\\n                }\\n                if is(Button::Start) && !is(Button::Mode) {\\n                    held |= buttons::PAUSE;\\n700→                }\\n            } else {\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= if self.game { buttons::SKILL6 } else { buttons::USE };\\n                }\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            pad.held = held;\\n710→            pad.rotate = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::RightTrigger) as i32 - is(Button::LeftTrigger) as i32) as f32 };\\n            // In the game the D-pad is potion / use / map / panels, not zoom.\\n            pad.zoom = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::DPadDown) as i32 - is(Button::DPadUp) as i32) as f32 };\\n            pad.a_held = is(Button::South);\\n            pad.x_held = is(Button::West);\\n            pad.y_held = is(Button::North);\\n            pad.back_held = is(Button::Select);\\n            if pad.left.length() > 0.3 || pad.right.length() > 0.3 || held != 0 {\\n                pad.any_activity = true;\\n            }\\n720→        }\\n        if pad.any_activity {\\n            self.last_device = Device::Gamepad;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        self.pad = pad;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Screen-space movement (x right, y up) from keys and stick, length <= 1.\\n    pub fn move_axis(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n730→        let k = |codes: &[KeyCode]| codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) as i32 as f32;\\n        let b = &self.bindings;\\n        let kb = Vec2::new(k(&b.right) - k(&b.left), k(&b.up) - k(&b.down));\\n        let v = if kb != Vec2::ZERO { kb.normalize() } else { self.pad.left };\\n        v.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Held game buttons from all devices.\\n    pub fn held(&self) -> u32 {\\n        let mut b = self.pad.held;\\n740→        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) {\\n                b |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            b |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            b |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n750→        }\\n        b\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Returns (held, newly pressed since the last call).\\n    pub fn buttons(&mut self) -> (u32, u32) {\\n        let held = self.held();\\n        let mut pressed = held & !self.prev_held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.key_taps.contains(c)) {\\n760→                pressed |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs\",\"offset\":587,\"limit\":180,\"raw_output\":\"    /// Reads gamepad events and state (first connected pad).\\n    pub fn poll_gamepad(&mut self) {\\n        use gilrs::{Axis, Button};\\n        let mut activity = false;\\n        let mut taps = Vec::new();\\n        // One pad state from the first connected pad, or from the pad script while it runs.\\n        let mut state: Option<PadState> = None;\\n        if let Some(g) = &mut self.gilrs {\\n            while let Some(ev) = g.next_event() {\\n                match ev.event {\\n                    gilrs::EventType::ButtonPressed(b, _) => {\\n                        taps.push(b);\\n                        activity = true;\\n                    }\\n                    gilrs::EventType::AxisChanged(_, v, _) if v.abs() > 0.4 => activity = true,\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Connected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad connected\\\"),\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Disconnected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad disconnected\\\"),\\n                    _ => {}\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if let Some((_, gp)) = g.gamepads().next() {\\n                const ALL: [Button; 15] = [\\n                    Button::South,\\n                    Button::East,\\n                    Button::North,\\n                    Button::West,\\n                    Button::LeftTrigger,\\n                    Button::RightTrigger,\\n                    Button::Select,\\n                    Button::Start,\\n                    Button::DPadUp,\\n                    Button::DPadDown,\\n                    Button::DPadLeft,\\n                    Button::DPadRight,\\n                    Button::LeftThumb,\\n                    Button::RightThumb,\\n                    Button::Mode,\\n                ];\\n                let trig = |b: Button| gp.button_data(b).map(|d| d.value()).unwrap_or(0.0) > 0.35;\\n                state = Some(PadState {\\n                    left: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::LeftStickX), gp.value(Axis::LeftStickY)),\\n                    right: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::RightStickX), gp.value(Axis::RightStickY)),\\n                    held: ALL.into_iter().filter(|b| gp.is_pressed(*b)).collect(),\\n                    lt2: trig(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                    rt2: trig(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(script) = &mut self.pad_script {\\n            if let Some((st, first)) = script.next() {\\n                if first {\\n                    taps.extend(st.tap.iter().copied());\\n                }\\n                activity = true;\\n                state = Some(PadState { left: st.left, right: st.right, held: st.hold.clone(), lt2: false, rt2: false });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let start = taps.contains(&Button::Start);\\n        let map = taps.contains(&Button::DPadLeft);\\n        let mut pad = Pad { start_pressed: start && !self.fit, map_pressed: map && !self.fit, taps, any_activity: activity, ..Default::default() };\\n        if let Some(st) = state {\\n            let is = |b: Button| st.held.contains(&b);\\n            pad.raw_left = st.left;\\n            pad.left = if self.fit { st.left } else { deadzone(st.left, 0.18) };\\n            pad.right = deadzone(st.right, 0.25);\\n            let mut held = 0;\\n            let layout: &[(Button, u32)] = if self.fit {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::BACK),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::WAVE),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::STEP_L),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::STEP_R),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::MENU_UP),\\n                    (Button::DPadDown, buttons::MENU_DOWN),\\n                    (Button::DPadLeft, buttons::MENU_LEFT),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::MENU_RIGHT),\\n                ]\\n            } else if self.game {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::PRIMARY),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SECONDARY),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::SKILL3),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::SKILL4),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::SKILL5),\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::DODGE),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::POTION),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            } else {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::JUMP),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::CROUCH),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::CRAWL),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::USE),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            };\\n            for (btn, action) in layout {\\n                if is(*btn) {\\n                    held |= action;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if self.fit {\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_L;\\n                }\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_R;\\n                }\\n                if is(Button::Start) && !is(Button::Mode) {\\n                    held |= buttons::PAUSE;\\n                }\\n            } else {\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= if self.game { buttons::SKILL6 } else { buttons::USE };\\n                }\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            pad.held = held;\\n            pad.rotate = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::RightTrigger) as i32 - is(Button::LeftTrigger) as i32) as f32 };\\n            // In the game the D-pad is potion / use / map / panels, not zoom.\\n            pad.zoom = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::DPadDown) as i32 - is(Button::DPadUp) as i32) as f32 };\\n            pad.a_held = is(Button::South);\\n            pad.x_held = is(Button::West);\\n            pad.y_held = is(Button::North);\\n            pad.back_held = is(Button::Select);\\n            if pad.left.length() > 0.3 || pad.right.length() > 0.3 || held != 0 {\\n                pad.any_activity = true;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if pad.any_activity {\\n            self.last_device = Device::Gamepad;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        self.pad = pad;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Screen-space movement (x right, y up) from keys and stick, length <= 1.\\n    pub fn move_axis(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n        let k = |codes: &[KeyCode]| codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) as i32 as f32;\\n        let b = &self.bindings;\\n        let kb = Vec2::new(k(&b.right) - k(&b.left), k(&b.up) - k(&b.down));\\n        let v = if kb != Vec2::ZERO { kb.normalize() } else { self.pad.left };\\n        v.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Held game buttons from all devices.\\n    pub fn held(&self) -> u32 {\\n        let mut b = self.pad.held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) {\\n                b |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            b |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            b |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n        }\\n        b\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Returns (held, newly pressed since the last call).\\n    pub fn buttons(&mut self) -> (u32, u32) {\\n        let held = self.held();\\n        let mut pressed = held & !self.prev_held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.key_taps.contains(c)) {\\n                pressed |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":802}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58c00659-4bbb-438d-b60f-f6f70fa31e11-118","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"30→    pub big: String,\\n    pub footer: String,\\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\\n40→    match action {\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"A\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad => \\\"Cross\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" => \\\"Space\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"B\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad => \\\"Circle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Y\\\".into(),\\n50→        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad => \\\"Triangle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" => \\\"Tab\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"X\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad => \\\"Square\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" => \\\"F\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Menu\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad => \\\"Options\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad => \\\"L1\\\".into(),\\n60→        \\\"step_l\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Left click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" => \\\"Q\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"RB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad => \\\"R1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" => \\\"E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LT+RT\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad => \\\"L2+R2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" => \\\"Q+E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if pad => \\\"Left stick\\\".into(),\",\"content_concise\":\"30→    pub big: String,\\n    pub footer: String,\\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\\n40→    match action {\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"A\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad => \\\"Cross\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" => \\\"Space\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"B\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad => \\\"Circle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Y\\\".into(),\\n50→        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad => \\\"Triangle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" => \\\"Tab\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"X\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad => \\\"Square\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" => \\\"F\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Menu\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad => \\\"Options\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad => \\\"L1\\\".into(),\\n60→        \\\"step_l\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Left click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" => \\\"Q\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"RB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad => \\\"R1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" => \\\"E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LT+RT\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad => \\\"L2+R2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" => \\\"Q+E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if pad => \\\"Left stick\\\".into(),\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs\",\"offset\":30,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    pub big: String,\\n    pub footer: String,\\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\\n    /// 0 pad, shown as PlayStation unless `xbox`. 1 keyboard. 2 mouse. 3 touch.\\n    pub prompt_kind: u8,\\n}\\n\\n/// Glyph label for an action. `device`: 1 pad, 2 keyboard, 3 mouse, 4 touch.\\npub fn prompt(action: &str, device: u8, xbox: bool) -> String {\\n    let pad = device == 1 || device == 0;\\n    match action {\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"A\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if pad => \\\"Cross\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" if device == 3 || device == 4 => \\\"Click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"confirm\\\" => \\\"Space\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"B\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if pad => \\\"Circle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"back\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Y\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" if pad => \\\"Triangle\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"schedule\\\" => \\\"Tab\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"X\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" if pad => \\\"Square\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"wave\\\" => \\\"F\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"Menu\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" if pad => \\\"Options\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"pause\\\" => \\\"Esc\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if pad => \\\"L1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Left click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_l\\\" => \\\"Q\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"RB\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if pad => \\\"R1\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" if device == 3 => \\\"Right click\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"step_r\\\" => \\\"E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad && xbox => \\\"LT+RT\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" if pad => \\\"L2+R2\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"brace\\\" => \\\"Q+E\\\".into(),\\n        \\\"lean\\\" if pad => \\\"Left stick\\\".into(),\\n\",\"total_lines\":90}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d782262d-c6be-4354-8f01-6974c9b2602b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_543","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Standard gamepad button index 13 corresponds to the D-pad down.\n\nThe Wait fix is critical for the press to be sampled. The boot prompt should default to Gamepad so it shows Cross. A stubbed gamepad that appears connected immediately but has no buttons will leave last_device at its default value.\n\nThe connected event only logs state without triggering activity. The default Gamepad prompt remains correct for both the test stub and a real page. A zero-length stick means no initial activity, so the prompt stays Cross until button 13 is pressed to set MENU_DOWN and move focus. The next step is to implement the Wait after gfx init and rebuild for a quick retest before the full browser suite.\n\nThe stubbed gamepad is ready before gilrs initializes, so button indices should match the standard mapping. Audio will resume after the first user gesture and remain silent until then. The phone attract loop will run for roughly ten seconds at sixty frames per second.\n\nThe phone viewport may run slower than expected. The event loop will keep polling until finish_init completes. The about_to_wait function is being updated to take the pending gfx resource and finish initialization.\n\nThe event loop now switches to Wait once the GPU finishes initializing. Polling faster than a frame would cancel the pending animation frame and prevent simulation ticks, so waiting for that frame is necessary. After initialization, the code requests a redraw on the graphics window.\n\nThe first about_to_wait that sees the completed graphics will request a redraw after switching to Wait. This prevents an extra poll because apply_control_flow will use Wait. The animation frame scheduled at the end of the current iteration will fire normally. One concern remains: previous polls may have already queued a postTask.\n\nThe extra poll that may queue a postTask is harmless. It schedules a new animation frame, and the Wait control flow prevents further polling. The simulation will survive one additional poll.\n\nIf many postTasks are queued, they will all run and cancel animation frames. The last one schedules a new frame, and Wait prevents further polling. The loop stabilizes once the queue drains. Ticks may stall during the drain but resume when the animation frame fires. The test waits ninety seconds for status before checking ticks over four hundred milliseconds.\n\nThe postTask queue is only one task deep, so the storm drains instantly. The default last_device change must also be checked against tests that expect a keyboard prompt at boot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-872b5c2b-4706-49f1-b7cc-29f7ccc9bd57-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"prompt|Cross|Space|device","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-872b5c2b-4706-49f1-b7cc-29f7ccc9bd57-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"title_prompts|Cross|device","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2809,"output_tokens":1461,"cache_read_input_tokens":182016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"6886b5ed-412d-4803-89e3-e24f9ff64b3f"}
