{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_557","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The first failure is that clicking the glyph row in settings failed to enable the Xbox toggle.\n\nThe second failure is that the pad did not move focus. Boot 1 reached settings but failed on the Xbox toggle, while boot 2 failed at pad focus. This inconsistency suggests pad behavior may be unpredictable.\n\nThe iPad page closed due to a browser crash, likely from earlyoom during tablet testing. The test may have continued despite the exception. The Xbox toggle logic found and clicked the glyph rectangle, yet the setting remained false.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-beeb9dc6-f30d-4836-8820-988ce64505a2-138","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"glyph|xbox|Settings","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"*.rs","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-beeb9dc6-f30d-4836-8820-988ce64505a2-139","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["c6ae79e9-43de-4ff3-913f-cf44e2e58517"],"timeout_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":592,"output_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":201344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7e15010c-2385-454c-8ac8-775ba5152b31"}
