{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_558","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A test found a label containing \"glyph\".\n\nThe \"Glyphs: PlayStation\" settings item failed to toggle the Xbox setting. Possible causes include a missed click, an off-screen row, or stale status data.\n\nEgui likely swallowed the mouse tap. The fit UI covers the screen, so `over_ui` blocks the game from receiving the click event. Hover still works because it relies on cursor position rather than taps.\n\nThe glyph row might not be a standard button that toggles on click. It could require focus or a specific item ID to activate. I will check the settings activation logic and which items appear in the first six rows.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6a8d4634-9a15-4059-bb22-3d127d6840a8-140","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":560,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6a8d4634-9a15-4059-bb22-3d127d6840a8-141","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":930,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1629,"output_tokens":664,"cache_read_input_tokens":201856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"009ddf8d-2995-4846-9eff-1499dce54102"}
