{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_566","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The painter uses `layer_painter`, which does not create interactive widgets. The fit UI should not receive pointer input from egui.\n\nEgui should not intercept pointer input from the fit painter. The missing xbox click may be caused by a coordinate mismatch: `__gameUi` publishes CSS pixels, but the click coordinates might need scaling.\n\nThe viewport uses device_scale_factor 1, so CSS and physical pixels match exactly. Overlapping items and rapid state resets are unlikely causes.\n\nThe click might be intercepted by the focused item instead of the glyph row. If hover did not update focus before the click, CONFIRM could activate the wrong item while Click(id) toggles xbox.\n\nIf hover already focused the glyph row, CONFIRM would fire on that same frame. It toggles xbox again and turns it back off. Click is processed first, so the toggle succeeds once, but CONFIRM immediately undoes it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-becfe287-f4e0-4f8b-80e0-7502e9f42932-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn buttons\\(|CONFIRM|MouseButton::Left|PRIMARY","glob":"**/pav_app/src/input.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-becfe287-f4e0-4f8b-80e0-7502e9f42932-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"CONFIRM|PRIMARY","glob":"**/pav_core/src/input.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5030,"output_tokens":765,"cache_read_input_tokens":49792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b6fc7978-d455-4463-a261-76fd39d1ce1e"}
