{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_567","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The left mouse button sets the PRIMARY selection rather than CONFIRM.\n\nThe Rust code explicitly excludes PRIMARY from held and pressed states when UI events occur. This confirms the double-toggle bug is not caused by mouse clicks acting as CONFIRM. The test flow is being re-examined to locate the actual trigger.\n\nThe click may fail to register because the cursor is not over the target rectangle when sampled, or because Playwright's CSS pixel coordinates do not match the game's physical pixel hit test.\n\nThe viewport is 320 by 180 with a device scale factor of 1, so CSS and physical pixels should align. The canvas origin and browser device pixel ratio are being checked as remaining causes for coordinate mismatches. The fit painter uses the Foreground layer, which does not allocate widgets, so it should not block pointer input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-70f6b655-46db-4f5b-bd6e-15cc1dabe05c-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fit::draw|pav_ui::fit","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-70f6b655-46db-4f5b-bd6e-15cc1dabe05c-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":620,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1275,"output_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":54784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a47185af-dcad-49f8-95e1-65fb2cc6f4c0"}
