{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_570","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The title screen contains five items: New Stay, Play Together, Settings, About, and How to Stand.\n\nSettings is index 2. The Settings page has 6 items, so the cursor lands on the Effects row (index 2) rather than Glyphs (index 3). A raw click without a prior move and wait hits the wrong element. The settings click worked only after an explicit move and wait.\n\nPlaywright's click() sends a move event before the button down. If the game processes window events before sampling input, the cursor updates and the tap registers correctly. The glyph failure may instead stem from winit on web delivering those events in separate frames.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3c1d34e1-aea2-43b3-a812-081cc7d64829-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"CursorMoved|MouseInput|note_pointer","glob":"**/pav_app/src/app.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2522,"output_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":62464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"50d26ab1-aba6-43f4-9218-bf50afa474e0"}
