{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_581","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Captures exist and have reasonable file sizes.\n\nThe captures are recent and appear valid. The iPad resolution is small enough to fit in 10GB of free space, so memory exhaustion is unlikely. The \"target closed\" error may instead stem from a page navigation, GPU crash, earlyoom kill, or an unclosed context.\n\nThe exception is caught inside `touch_profile`'s `page.evaluate`. The crash likely occurs during WebGPU initialization on the larger canvas. A device context mismatch seems unlikely because the context was created successfully.\n\nA WASM panic on touch devices is unlikely to close the page. The iPad canvas is roughly 3.4 times larger than the phone canvas that passed, so it may exceed SwiftShader limits or time out.\n\nThe crash likely stems from a cumulative GPU context leak across multiple WebGPU pages in the same browser process. The fix is to launch a fresh browser for each touch profile, or at least close the previous browser before testing iPad.\n\nA fresh browser will be tried first without shrinking the viewport. If the iPad still crashes, the height will be capped. The full suite will run after fixing the test harness. Captures should pass again since they already succeeded. Images will be checked while editing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11b323d3-6903-4970-834d-b223d911055a-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/capture-title-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11b323d3-6903-4970-834d-b223d911055a-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/capture-pose-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-11b323d3-6903-4970-834d-b223d911055a-48","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"coarse|touch_only|seen_real","glob":"**/pav_app/src/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3749,"output_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":81920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8e672286-f922-4a3a-adf7-3bc6de5e6eb3"}
