{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_595","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The shm flag must also be added to hub.py.\n\nStarting the build. Fixing a retry bug where logical failures skip retries but exceptions trigger browser restarts. The outer try/finally correctly closes the reassigned browser.\n\nSwallowing close() errors to prevent retry skips when the browser crashes.\n\nConfirmed the test count logic is sound for both passing attempts and retries. Verified `fit_on` is in scope at the `over_ui` line. Now running cargo build.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-31bd4ce9-f10b-43e8-b977-b8e13bc73e89-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/hub.py","old_string":"    \"--disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows\",\n]","new_string":"    \"--disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows\",\n    \"--disable-dev-shm-usage\",\n]"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-31bd4ce9-f10b-43e8-b977-b8e13bc73e89-72","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"            except Exception as e:\n                    print(f\"{tag}: {e}\")\n                    touch_browser.close()\n                    touch_browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)","new_string":"            except Exception as e:\n                    print(f\"{tag}: {e}\")\n                    try:\n                        touch_browser.close()\n                    except Exception:\n                        pass\n                    touch_browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-31bd4ce9-f10b-43e8-b977-b8e13bc73e89-73","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"pgrep -