{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_597","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is another agent's engine directory clone.\n\nOther engine targets are fine to use. I'll wait for their cargo test to finish before building wasm, since parallel compilation could exhaust the 10GB RAM.\n\nI'll start the wasm build now. The separate engine target avoids conflicts, and the other test is light enough to run in parallel.\n\nI also need to double-check the retry counting bug in main() and verify Python syntax.\n\nRetry counting is correct. The outer check does not increment on exception, and the inner check increments passed only on success. No double-counting occurs.\n\nI will compile the test file with python3 -m py_compile.\n\n`fit_on` is defined earlier in the same function, so the over_ui change is safe.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9307b18b-1f37-44ef-ba9d-703fc0a485f3-75","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 -m py_compile tests/browser.py tests/hub.py && echo PY_OK","description":"Syntax-check browser and hub harnesses","block_until_ms":20000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":501,"output_tokens":560,"cache_read_input_tokens":118016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4897227b-d227-4a24-8b15-59e6a1bf2030"}
