{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_613","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exit code was 0, but the output shows 4 passed and 2 failed.\n\nThe `tee` pipe swallowed the Python script's exit code, so `run.sh` returned 0 even though the tests failed. The suite failed two tests: pad focus did not move on one boot, and iPad attract mode stalled at 336 ticks after 45 seconds.\n\nThe \"Click\" prompt is correct for touch devices too. The iPad stall likely stems from a reset idle counter or insufficient time to reach 600 ticks.\n\nThe iPad stall is caused by a 7.5 Hz frame rate from the expensive canvas, not the catch-up cap. The attract test should wait longer or check for a 600-tick increase instead of a fixed timeout.\n\nThe iPad viewport is 810×1080, which explains the slower frame rate compared to the phone. The retry path only triggers on exceptions, not logical failures like attract mode not starting, so shrinking the viewport may be necessary to reach 600 ticks within 45 seconds.\n\nA 100-second wait is the preferred fix for the iPad stall. This should allow enough ticks to reach attract mode at the full viewport. A smaller viewport is a fallback if the browser dies. The full resolution better matches the tablet profile requirements.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"One boot never saw the pad because the sim stalled, and the iPad canvas only reached tick 336 before the attract wait ended. I'll hold the button across real ticks and give the tablet longer."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4931d922-8869-428a-884b-3cce801dc57b-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"    page.evaluate(\"() => window.__setPad([0,0,0,0], [13])\")\n    s = wait_status_pred(page, lambda st: st.get(\"menu_focus\") == 1, ms=2500)\n    page.evaluate(\"() => window.__setPad([0,0,0,0], [])\")","new_string":"    page.evaluate(\"() => window.__setPad([0,0,0,0], [13])\")\n    base_tick = (status(page) or {}).get(\"tick\") or 0\n    s = None\n    # Hold D-pad down until a sim tick actually samples it. A stalled frame is not a miss.\n    for _ in range(40):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(200)\n        s = status(page)\n        if s and s.get(\"menu_focus\") == 1:\n            break\n        if s and (s.get(\"tick\") or 0) > base_tick + 40:\n            break\n    page.evaluate(\"() => window.__setPad([0,0,0,0], [])\")"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4931d922-8869-428a-884b-3cce801dc57b-95","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"        attracted = False\n        for _ in range(90):\n            page.wait_for_timeout(500)\n            s = status(page)\n            if s and (s.get(\"phase\") == \"attract\" or s.get(\"demo\") is True):\n                attracted = True\n                break\n        if not attracted:\n            return fail(f\"{device_name} attract did not keep running: {status(page)}\")","new_string":"        attracted = False\n        base_tick = (status(page) or {}).get(\"tick\") or 0\n        # Software WebGPU on a tablet canvas runs well under 60. Attract is 600 sim ticks.\n        for _ in range(200):\n            page.wait_for_timeout(500)\n            s = status(page)\n            if s and (s.get(\"phase\") == \"attract\" or s.get(\"demo\") is True):\n                attracted = True\n                break\n            if s and (s.get(\"tick\") or 0) > base_tick + 800:\n                break\n        if not attracted:\n            return fail(f\"{device_name} attract did not keep running: {status(page)}\")"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":990,"output_tokens":3302,"cache_read