{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_614","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The iPad at 7.5 Hz needs 80 seconds to complete 600 ticks.\n\nThe 100-second limit should reach about 750 ticks, so the 600-tick attract threshold is safe. The iPad needs only 8 seconds or 40 ticks.\n\nThe button-sampling window is 40 ticks, so a failure after that is correct if the mapping never happens. The test suite should run with unbuffered Python output and proper exit-code handling. Total runtime could reach roughly five to six minutes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-123ac8da-63b5-4fbd-8ecc-af6b57e1ca68-96","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\" && python3 -u tests/browser.py > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-browser.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-browser.log\"","description":"Re-run browser suite, keep its exit code","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3561,"output_tokens":629,"cache_read_input_tokens":137344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"0f3572e0-1484-4190-987d-5bb5a76a6e1c"}
