1,50,95,95,120,51,53,49,49,50,100,47,119,111,114,107,47,87,111,98,98,108,101,32,77,105,110,117,116,101,115,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,99,114,97,116,101,115,47,112,97,118,95,99,111,114,101,47,115,114,99,47,103,97,109,101,115,47,109,111,100,46,114,115,10,51,48,49,58,32,32,32,32,112,117,98,40,99,114,97,116,101,41,32,102,110,32,112,108,97,121,95,112,114,101,40,38,109,117,116,32,115,101,108,102,44,32,105,110,112,117,116,58,32,38,73,110,112,117,116,70,114,97,109,101,44,32,100,116,58,32,102,51,50,44,32,101,118,101,110,116,115,58,32,38,109,117,116,32,86,101,99,60,83,105,109,69,118,101,110,116,62,41,32,45,62,32,66,84,114,101,101,77,97,112,60,69,110,116,105,116,121,73,100,44,32,73,110,112,117,116,70,114,97,109,101,62,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":2,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/arpg/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":395,\"content\":\"    pub(crate) fn game_pre(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":301,\"content\":\"    pub(crate) fn play_pre(&mut self, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4b2cec3a-f7d4-47f7-99e2-2d1dfb44cf1e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_627","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking play_pre and whether ui events are lost because the input frame's ui field isn't copied via the Copy trait.\n\nInputFrame and UiEvent are both Copy, so UI events are preserved. I'll write a probe to test item IDs and __fitClick. The settings rows may ignore clicks because volume uses left/right controls. The glyph row's published rect center might sit outside its hit rect due to a coordinate mismatch between physical pixels and CSS pixels.\n\nHover coordinates match, so the cursor should hit the glyph row. Focus reaching the glyph label must have come from hover, not keyboard or pad navigation. The click should therefore register.\n\nA one-frame cursor lag may cause the click to register at the old position on the settings screen. That would hit the Effects row instead of the glyph, so no xbox change occurs. Hover then restores focus to the glyph before the next read.\n\nReconsidering the one-frame lag theory. The cursor should already be at the glyph when click_label starts, so the tap ought to register there. The mousedown from mouse.click() might process before its own move event, but that still leaves the cursor at the glyph.\n\nHover confirms the cursor is at the glyph, so lost hover moves are not the cause. The focus now shifts to whether Playwright's click path resets the mouse position in a way the game cannot see as a move, or if the mousedown uses a stale cursor from the previous settings click. The fit_sample hit test and cursor space are being compared.\n\nI will probe __fitClick and log the xbox state before and after each mouse click. If __fitClick works, the mouse tap itself is likely broken. I will add a practical fix so that clicking while fit focuses the item under the cursor without double-firing. The intended design already treats a mouse tap as the sole action when the cursor is over an item, so the probe should reveal whether this is actually firing.\n\nChecking for a CSS-to-canvas coordinate mismatch. The game hit test uses physical pixels, while Playwright clicks use CSS pixels. Hover works in CSS coordinates, so the cursor and hit test likely share the same space despite potential scaling differences.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8173a053-8b33-41ab-af7b-c7c0f6a9ff0c-114","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/probe_click.py","new_string":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"See whether a settings-row click and __fitClick toggle Xbox glyphs.\"\"\"\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nos.environ.setdefault(\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\", \"ubuntu24.04-x64\")\nHTML = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html\")\nFLAGS = [\n    \"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\n    \"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\n    \"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\n    \"--use-angle=swiftshader\",\n    \"--disable-background-timer-throttling\",\n    \"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\",\n    \"--disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows\",\n    \"--disable-dev-shm-usage\",\n]\n\ndef status(page):\n    return page.evaluate(\n        \"\"\"() => {\n          const raw = window.__gameStatus;\n          if (!raw) return null;\n          const s = JSON.parse(String(raw));\n          const items = window.__gameUi || [];\n          const it = items[s.menu_focus] || {};\n          return { phase: s.phase, xbox: s.xbox, focus: s.menu_focus, label: it.label || '', tick: Number(raw.tick), items: items.map(i => ({id: i.id, label: i.label, x: i.x, y: i.y, w: i.w, h: i.h})) };\n        }\"\"\"\n    )\n\ndef main():\n    from playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)\n        context = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\": 320, \"height\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1)\n        page = context.new_page()\n        page.goto(HTML.as_uri())\n        page.wait_for_function(\"() => window.__gameStatus\", timeout=90000)\n        page.wait_for_timeout(800)\n        s = status(page)\n        print(\"BOOT\", {k: s[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        settings = next(i for i in s[\"items\"] if \"settings\" in i[\"label\"].lower())\n        page.mouse.move(settings[\"x\"] + settings[\"w\"] / 2, settings[\"y\"] + settings[\"h\"] / 2)\n        page.wait_for_timeout(400)\n        page.mouse.click(settings[\"x\"] + settings[\"w\"] / 2, settings[\"y\"] + settings[\"h\"] / 2)\n        page.wait_for_timeout(600)\n        s = status(page)\n        print(\"AFTER SETTINGS CLICK\", {k: s[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        print(\"ITEMS\", s[\"items\"])\n        glyph = next(i for i in s[\"items\"] if \"glyph\" in i[\"label\"].lower())\n        cx, cy = glyph[\"x\"] + glyph[\"w\"] / 2, glyph[\"y\"] + glyph[\"h\"] / 2\n        page.mouse.move(cx, cy)\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)\n        print(\"HOVER\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        page.mouse.click(cx, cy)\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\n        print(\"AFTER GLYPH CLICK\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        page.evaluate(\"(id) => { window.__fitClick = id; }\", glyph[\"id\"])\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\n        print(\"AFTER FITCLICK\", glyph[\"id\"], {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        # Second fit click should toggle back.\n        page.evaluate(\"(id) => { window.__fitClick = id; }\", glyph[\"id\"])\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\n        print(\"AFTER FITCLICK 2\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\"phase\", \"xbox\", \"focus\", \"label\", \"tick\")})\n        context.close()\n        browser.close()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":409,"output_tokens":2066,"cache_read_input_tokens":155392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"7ccc4f5f-5293-41ca-bb20-411c523953d1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8173a053-8b33-41ab-af7b-c7c0f6a9ff0c-114","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"See whether a settings-row click and __fitClick toggle Xbox glyphs.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nos.environ.setdefault(\\\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\\\", \\\"ubuntu24.04-x64\\\")\\nHTML = Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html\\\")\\nFLAGS = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-background-timer-throttling\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-dev-shm-usage\\\",\\n]\\n\\ndef status(page):\\n    return page.evaluate(\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n          const raw = window.__gameStatus;\\n          if (!raw) return null;\\n          const s = JSON.parse(String(raw));\\n          const items = window.__gameUi || [];\\n          const it = items[s.menu_focus] || {};\\n          return { phase: s.phase, xbox: s.xbox, focus: s.menu_focus, label: it.label || '', tick: Number(raw.tick), items: items.map(i => ({id: i.id, label: i.label, x: i.x, y: i.y, w: i.w, h: i.h})) };\\n        }\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    )\\n\\ndef main():\\n    from playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)\\n        context = browser.new_context(viewport={\\\"width\\\": 320, \\\"height\\\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1)\\n        page = context.new_page()\\n        page.goto(HTML.as_uri())\\n        page.wait_for_function(\\\"() => window.__gameStatus\\\", timeout=90000)\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(800)\\n        s = status(page)\\n        print(\\\"BOOT\\\", {k: s[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        settings = next(i for i in s[\\\"items\\\"] if \\\"settings\\\" in i[\\\"label\\\"].lower())\\n        page.mouse.move(settings[\\\"x\\\"] + settings[\\\"w\\\"] / 2, settings[\\\"y\\\"] + settings[\\\"h\\\"] / 2)\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(400)\\n        page.mouse.click(settings[\\\"x\\\"] + settings[\\\"w\\\"] / 2, settings[\\\"y\\\"] + settings[\\\"h\\\"] / 2)\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(600)\\n        s = status(page)\\n        print(\\\"AFTER SETTINGS CLICK\\\", {k: s[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        print(\\\"ITEMS\\\", s[\\\"items\\\"])\\n        glyph = next(i for i in s[\\\"items\\\"] if \\\"glyph\\\" in i[\\\"label\\\"].lower())\\n        cx, cy = glyph[\\\"x\\\"] + glyph[\\\"w\\\"] / 2, glyph[\\\"y\\\"] + glyph[\\\"h\\\"] / 2\\n        page.mouse.move(cx, cy)\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)\\n        print(\\\"HOVER\\\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        page.mouse.click(cx, cy)\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\\n        print(\\\"AFTER GLYPH CLICK\\\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        page.evaluate(\\\"(id) => { window.__fitClick = id; }\\\", glyph[\\\"id\\\"])\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\\n        print(\\\"AFTER FITCLICK\\\", glyph[\\\"id\\\"], {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        # Second fit click should toggle back.\\n        page.evaluate(\\\"(id) => { window.__fitClick = id; }\\\", glyph[\\\"id\\\"])\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(700)\\n        print(\\\"AFTER FITCLICK 2\\\", {k: status(page)[k] for k in (\\\"phase\\\", \\\"xbox\\\", \\\"focus\\\", \\\"label\\\", \\\"tick\\\")})\\n        context.close()\\n        browser.close()\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/probe_click.py has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/probe_click.py has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/probe_click.py\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"See whether a settings-row click and __fitClick toggle Xbox glyphs.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nos.environ.setdefault(\\\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\\\", \\\"ubuntu24.04-x64\\\")\\nHTML = Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html\\\")\\nFLAGS = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-background-timer-throttling\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-renderer-backgrounding\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-backgrounding-occluded-windows\\\",\\n    \\\"--disable-dev-shm-usage\\\",\\n]\\n\\ndef status(page):\\n    return page.evaluate(\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n          const raw = window.__gameStatus;\\n          if (!raw) return null;\\n          const s = JSON.parse(String(raw));\\n          const items = window.__gameUi || [];\\n          const it = items[s.menu_focus] || {};\\n          return { phase: s.phase, xbox: s.xbox, focus: s.menu_focus, label: it.label || '', tick: Number(raw.tick),