{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bd847ced-f5a6-49b2-9673-516c4c26e08c-130","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→(node:200560) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\ntick did not advance 6 -> 6\\ntick did not advance 7 -> 7\\n4 passed, 2 failed\\nEXIT:1\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→(node:200560) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\ntick did not advance 6 -> 6\\ntick did not advance 7 -> 7\\n4 passed, 2 failed\\nEXIT:1\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-browser.log\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"(node:200560) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\ntick did not advance 6 -> 6\\ntick did not advance 7 -> 7\\n4 passed, 2 failed\\nEXIT:1\\n\",\"total_lines\":6}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c9aeb837-d7a0-4f5f-af85-eb5a9cb38acf"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_641","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both boots failed to advance ticks even after a 4-second wait.\n\nThe probe advanced ticks successfully, but the suite's open_page stalls at ticks 6 and 7. The suite adds PAD and AUDIO init scripts that the probe lacks. The AUDIO patch wraps AudioBufferSourceNode.start, which should not stop rAF.\n\nThe gamepad stub replaces navigator.getGamepads. gilrs calls it every frame. A panic from the fake gamepad would abort the Rust frame callback and freeze the clock at tick 6. The probe avoids this by using the real empty list.\n\nEarlier runs with the same stub advanced ticks successfully, so the gamepad panic is intermittent. A race condition where gilrs reads the pad before buttons are fully formed could explain the freeze. The probe advanced 56 ticks in about 1.4 seconds, but the suite saw zero ticks after four seconds. That suggests a total stop rather than slowness.\n\nThe fake gamepad stub returns plain objects for buttons and mapping. web_sys expects a GamepadMappingType enum and GamepadButton objects. This type mismatch could cause gilrs to panic when reading the pad. That would abort the WASM frame callback and freeze the clock.\n\nThe axes are fine. A panic in the event loop would freeze redraws and stop ticks after the first poll. Earlier runs with the same stub reached tick 100, so the panic is not guaranteed. Both boots stuck deterministically this time, which suggests something changed. The simhost fix does not touch gilrs, and a new wasm panic seems unlikely.\n\nThe fake gamepad is present from init, so the successful xbox run cannot be explained by a missing pad. A browser backgrounding issue is unlikely because the probe used identical flags and advanced ticks minutes ago. The test and probe also call page.goto with the same HTML URI without wait_until.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12554f73-5946-4c86-89a3-1053be0c7825-131","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/probe_tick.py","old_string":"        page = context.new_page()\n        errors = []\n        page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: errors.append(\"pageerror \" + str(e)))\n        page.on(\"console\", lambda msg: errors.append(msg.type + \" \" + msg.text) if msg.type in (\"error\", \"warning\") else None)\n        page.goto(HTML.as_uri())","new_string":"        page = context.new_page()\n        errors = []\n        page.add_init_script(\"\"\"\nconst btn = () => ({ pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 });\nconst pad = { id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller (STANDARD GAMEPAD)', index: 0, connected: true, mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 1,\n              axes: [0, 0, 0, 0], buttons: Array.from({ length: 17 }, btn) };\nnavigator.getGamepads = () => [pad, null, null, null];\n\"\"\")\n        page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: errors.append(\"pageerror \" + str(e)))\n        page.on(\"console\", lambda msg: errors.append(msg.type + \" \" + msg.text) if msg.type in (\"error\", \"warning\") else None)\n        page.goto(HTML.as_uri())"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":304,"output_tokens":1224,"cache_read_input_tokens":172672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"085c3141-43a2-4e1b-955c-9f2ef93760e7"}
