{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_643","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"With the pad stub, the tick remained at 7 for roughly three seconds before jumping to 23.\n\nThe 4-second test window was too short. Both boots stalled longer than that. The probe's 8-second window caught the jump at the last sample. The fix is to wait 8 seconds for the first tick advance.\n\nThe tick wait is being increased to 12 seconds. A stalled clock may still fail, but a bursty one should pass.\n\nThe loop is being updated from 20 to 60. The worst-case delay is now 24 seconds, but the loop breaks early if the clock moves. If both boots still stall at 12 seconds, the clock is dead and a different fix is needed. The gilrs warning should not block for seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-83aa3295-3530-421b-ac87-d78ddc58267a-133","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","old_string":"    # Shader compile and a busy machine can stall the first frames. The clock still has to move.\n    for _ in range(20):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(200)","new_string":"    # Shader compile and a busy machine can stall the first frames. The clock still has to move.\n    for _ in range(60):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(200)"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":424,"output_tokens":756,"cache_read_input_tokens":174208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e08f365f-78de-4898-a7d8-fac035dd8779"}
