{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_655","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The 4-player hub failed. The card asked players to press a key, but the ready state triggered without one.\n\nPlayer 3 failed to reach ready state. The round did not start. Memory pressure likely delayed the fourth game instance. A bug in the fourth seat auto-ready is another possibility.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The 4-player hub run failed because seat 3 never became ready. I'll trace how that ready flag is set."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12cf15d5-da42-4f0f-8c73-0a351acf4fe6-152","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ready without a key|card asks","glob":"**/*.{js,html,rs}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12cf15d5-da42-4f0f-8c73-0a351acf4fe6-153","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub_wait|hub_mode|ready","glob":"**/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":585,"output_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":189312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4c56fbc1-6839-4903-b45a-9bffa8d5a938"}
