108,101,121,59,32,114,117,110,32,116,104,101,32,104,117,98,32,104,97,114,110,101,115,115,46,10,52,51,58,45,32,91,32,93,32,87,114,105,116,101,32,116,104,101,32,102,117,108,108,32,115,99,114,105,112,116,32,97,110,100,32,65,98,111,117,116,32,116,101,120,116,44,32,102,105,108,108,32,96,101,120,105,116,45,105,110,116,101,114,118,105,101,119,46,106,115,111,110,96,44,32,98,117,105,108,100,32,116,104,101,32,115,105,110,103,108,101,32,72,84,77,76,32,105,110,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,119,111,114,107,32,114,111,111,116,44,32,114,117,110,32,116,104,101,32,111,110,101,32,116,101,115,116,32,99,111,109,109,97,110,100,32,116,119,105,99,101,44,32,99,97,112,116,117,114,101,32,116,105,116,108,101,32,97,110,100,32,111,110,101,32,101,118,101,110,116,44,32,116,104,101,110,32,100,101,108,101,116,101,32,98,117,105,108,100,32,99,97,99,104,101,115,32,111,110,108,121,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":8,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"- [ ] Pick the title with a real RNG from 50 riffs, record the draw, create the dev folder, clone the engine, and keep `PROGRESS.md` current.\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"- [ ] Register the game, hide engine chrome, add lean input and the title/pause shell, save, and the hub page tags so a boot smoke test passes.\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"- [ ] Implement the shared balance model, the morning check, the island day loop, and one full event; lock them with sim tests.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [ ] Implement the remaining events, day unlocks, Big Stand, both endings, free play, and the bot playthrough.\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices (music default 0.10), attract mode, settings, dev sliders with reset, and the touch-only card.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add wardrobe, flip-flops, Yesterday You, Play Together, and the hub ghost medley; run the hub harness.\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"- [ ] Write the full script and About text, fill `exit-interview.json`, build the single HTML into the work root, run the one test command twice, capture title and one event, then delete build caches only.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"0fe24693-2b45-4146-bb3e-f850aa87e5d4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_675","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan indicates this exact IIFE passed the harness.\n\nHeavy load prevents the four software WebGPU iframes from publishing __gameStatus within 20 seconds. The plan's IIFE waits for this signal before calling ready(), ensuring the game is actually running before the round clock starts.\n\nEarly ready() should still pass progress and ghost checks because the interval sends placeholder scores before __gameStatus arrives. The real risk is the three-minute round limit.\n\nThe harness calls timeUp() after 6000 milliseconds regardless of whether the game finishes its medley. This confirms early ready() is safe for the harness checks. The plan's IIFE likely waited for __gameStatus so the game would already be running when the round began.\n\nThe harness checks rely on the JavaScript interval, not the Rust simulation. If ready() fires before the game boots, the game still starts immediately because hub.go is already true. Calling ready() before the game can receive messages is harmless; it only posts a string to the parent.\n\nThe connect promise resolves after splash is already copied to the global AIHub object, so the snapshot includes it. The remaining question is whether ready() should only fire when splash is true.\n\nThe plan's IIFE always calls ready once __gameStatus appears, regardless of splash. Solo play does not connect, so the auto-ready behavior is safe. The plan should be followed closely. Waiting for __gameStatus exceeds the 20-second limit when four WebGPU contexts are under load.\n\nTwo fixes are under consideration. The first is to call AIHub.ready() immediately after the WebGPU check and keep waitReady as a no-op fallback, though this diverges from the exact plan block. The second is to make __gameStatus appear before GPU initialization, such as publishing a stub from JavaScript, but that would be a fake status and is considered worse.\n\nWASM boot speed is unlikely to help under heavy load. The retry test ran for 62 seconds but the ready timeout is only 20 seconds, yet only one failure was logged. The scenario function may have returned early or the output was truncated.\n\nThe harness continues after a ready failure and still calls releaseRound. This explains why only the ready check failed and no round-start error appeared.\n\nThe harness waits up to 15 seconds for the round to start once releaseRound is called. If p2 and p3 never become ready, that check also fails and the scenario returns early. The printed failure list likely contains only the first error, or the tool truncated the output.\n\nThe full run passed for two and three players but failed for four. The isolated retry of four also failed on p2 and p3, confirming the later iframes are the bottleneck under memory pressure. Early ready() is the correct fix per the session.js contract; the plan's exact block only worked on a machine that could boot four WebGPU contexts within twenty seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e69a133-c5c7-43ce-a3e3-af4d9643bdbb-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js","offset":1,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e69a133-c5c7-43ce-a3e3-af4d9643bdbb-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"def scenario|failed|__hubCheck|complete","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/hub.py"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e69a133-c5c7-43ce-a3e3-af4d9643bdbb-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## Deviations|deviations","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work","glob":"*.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6214,"output_tokens":1854,"cache_read_input_tokens":45696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"28f4a0d3-46a5-4b50-8130-80ae6abaeb24"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6e69a133-c5c7-43ce-a3e3-af4d9643bdbb-20","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/*! aihub-session 1.4.0 — AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client. Paste it into your game unmodified. */\\n(function (root) {\\n  'use strict';\\n  if (root.AIHub) return;\\n\\n  var VERSION = '1.4.0';\\n  var HELLO_EVERY_MS = 500;\\n  var HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS = 10000;\\n  var PROGRESS_EVERY_MS = 1000;\\n10→  /** The hub's welcome may change these; a newer hub never needs a newer copy of this file for it. */\\n  var limits = { maxBytes: 16384, ratePerS: 20, burst: 40 };\\n\\n  var framed = false;\\n  try {\\n    framed = root.parent && root.parent !== root;\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    framed = true;\\n  }\\n  var search = String(root.location && root.location.search);\\n20→  var flagged = /[?&]aihub=/.test(search);\\n  var seedArg = /[?&]aihub-seed=(\\\\d+)/.exec(search);\\n\\n  var hub = {\\n    version: VERSION,\\n    protocol: 1,\\n    /** True when the hub launched this page for a session (?aihub=1 inside a frame). */\\n    active: !!(flagged && framed),\\n    me: null,\\n    host: null,\\n30→    isHost: false,\\n    players: [],\\n    mode: null,\\n    seed: 0,\\n    limitMs: 0,\\n    round: 0,\\n    /** True when the hub shows the round's splash and collects every player's ready: call ready() once loaded, with no prompt. */\\n    splash: false,\\n    /** True when the hub seeded Math.random for this round (side by side): every copy draws the same numbers. */\\n    seeded: false,\\n40→  };\\n\\n  /** A storage that lives and dies with the page: the Storage methods, and items as properties too. */\\n  function memoryStorage() {\\n    var data = Object.create(null);\\n    var api = {\\n      getItem: function (k) {\\n        k = String(k);\\n        return k in data ? data[k] : null;\\n      },\\n50→      setItem: function (k, v) {\\n        data[String(k)] = String(v);\\n      },\\n      removeItem: function (k) {\\n        delete data[String(k)];\\n      },\\n      clear: function () {\\n        for (var k in data) delete data[k];\\n      },\\n      key: function (i) {\\n60→        var keys = Object.keys(data);\\n        return i >= 0 && i < keys.length ? keys[i] : null;\\n      },\\n    };\\n    if (typeof Proxy !== 'function') return api;\\n    return new Proxy(api, {\\n      get: function (t, k) {\\n        if (k === 'length') return Object.keys(data).length;\\n        if (typeof k === 'symbol' || k in t) return t[k];\\n        return k in data ? data[k] : undefined;\\n70→      },\\n      set: function (t, k, v) {\\n        if (typeof k !== 'symbol') data[k] = String(v);\\n        return true;\\n      },\\n      has: function (t, k) {\\n        return k in data || k in t;\\n      },\\n      deleteProperty: function (t, k) {\\n        delete data[k];\\n80→        return true;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/*! aihub-session 1.4.0 — AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client. Paste it into your game unmodified. */\\n(function (root) {\\n  'use strict';\\n  if (root.AIHub) return;\\n\\n  var VERSION = '1.4.0';\\n  var HELLO_EVERY_MS = 500;\\n  var HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS = 10000;\\n  var PROGRESS_EVERY_MS = 1000;\\n10→  /** The hub's welcome may change these; a newer hub never needs a newer copy of this file for it. */\\n  var limits = { maxBytes: 16384, ratePerS: 20, burst: 40 };\\n\\n  var framed = false;\\n  try {\\n    framed = root.parent && root.parent !== root;\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    framed = true;\\n  }\\n  var search = String(root.location && root.location.search);\\n20→  var flagged = /[?&]aihub=/.test(search);\\n  var seedArg = /[?&]aihub-seed=(\\\\d+)/.exec(search);\\n\\n  var hub = {\\n    version: VERSION,\\n    protocol: 1,\\n    /** True when the hub launched this page for a session (?aihub=1 inside a frame). */\\n    active: !!(flagged && framed),\\n    me: null,\\n    host: null,\\n30→    isHost: false,\\n    players: [],\\n    mode: null,