{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_678","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"build-web.sh will rebuild the WASM module.\n\nChecking if build-web.sh is incremental. The engine target is cached so rebuilds should be fast. Need to verify no cargo process is running for this engine. Also need to check if the script uses the generated index.html.\n\nA cheaper path may exist: write the HTML with write_index.py, then pack it with build-web.sh. If the WASM is already built, the pack step might only inline the bindgen output.\n\nThe IIFE change deviates from the plan. The failure occurs because p2 and p3 do not call ready within 20 seconds. __gameStatus is published by Rust only after GPU initialization.\n\nA minimal `__gameStatus` JSON object set in the IIFE before WASM loads could satisfy `waitReady` without changing the IIFE block. Rust would overwrite it later. The interval loop would then send early zero scores and negative area, matching the original `ready()` behavior.\n\nThe fake `__gameStatus` idea was rejected because it would trick solo tests into reading a stale tick of zero before Rust updates it. The honest fix is to call `AIHub.ready()` early when `info.splash` is present, matching the pattern in session.js line 36.\n\nThe early `ready()` call is safe because `welcomeMessage` resolves before the promise, so `welcomed` is already true. The check is also gated by `info.splash`, so non-splash rounds remain unaffected. The harness sets `gate: true`, ensuring splash is present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd8b06fe-b258-454d-8d64-e01ae7325da7-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"KEEP","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/session.js","-A":8}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd8b06fe-b258-454d-8d64-e01ae7325da7-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"cargo","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/scripts/build-web.sh"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1479,"output_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":57600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a942ea34-eee2-442e-8c04-69d0a62458a8"}
