{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_689","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The packed page contains the required line.\n\nRunning the full hub suite in the background. It should take a few minutes. I'll capture stdout and poll for completion.\n\nThe hub test is starting. I'll read the exit-interview and decisions to draft final notes while it runs. PROGRESS will not be marked complete until the suite passes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-49","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\" && python3 -u tests/hub.py > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-hub-stdout.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-hub-stdout.log\"","description":"Rerun full AI Hub harness","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/exit-interview.json"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":663,"output_tokens":753,"cache_read_input_tokens":77184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4ace4369-3592-48bd-8d6a-d510ce973c7a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-49","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"d1b8fe8b-d9bd-4a5b-8bf5-1fc5691b7ce2\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/terminal/call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-49.log\",\"status\":\"running\",\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\\\" && python3 -u tests/hub.py > \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-hub-stdout.log\\\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-hub-stdout.log\\\"\",\"summary\":\"Background task d1b8fe8b-d9bd-4a5b-8bf5-1fc5691b7ce2 started\",\"retrieval_hint\":\"Use get_command_or_subagent_output with task_ids=[\\\"d1b8fe8b-d9bd-4a5b-8bf5-1fc5691b7ce2\\\"] when you need the output.\",\"pid\":240315}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- The name, look and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- The name, look and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- The name, look and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\\n\",\"total_lines\":6}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ea517aa-7c0e-44f8-835b-da7ab72448fb-51","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:21:32\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports mini-game anthology with a light life-sim frame\\\",\\n    \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Third person\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Shardfall engine (Pavilion: Rust, wgpu, egui 0.36.2), commit 49ef2ba, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, AI Hub session.js 1.4.0\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"The engine's cel look, high-key pastel, beach and wellness props. Library props only for generic dressing.\\\",\\n10→    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Engine puppet, tilted about the feet by the balance dot. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Music, effects and voices are synthesized in code. No audio files. Seven music beds, default music gain 0.10. At least 30 effects. Animalese voices.\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"AI Hub ghost mode for 1–4 players. The round is the Inter-Resort Medley (Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup).\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Headless sim tests, Playwright Chromium with software WebGPU at 320×180, phone and tablet profiles, WebKit iPhone fallback, and the AI Hub harness.\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"The build followed PLAN.md and the engine source. The title was drawn with a real RNG from 50 riffs. No separate web search in this session.\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n20→    \\\"Six defects showed up in testing: a gust check that did not match the acceleration model, an egui texture delta dropped on the floor, a private intent module, fonts bound in the same pass that drew them, a hub ghost field that was a boolean, and About pages that did not turn.\\\",\\n    \\\"One was critical. The font and texture-delta panic stops the browser frame loop, so the page sits there with a status that never ticks.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful test was the bot playthrough: three seeds from New Stay to the credits, plus each event on five seeds against an idle player.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful check is a 1920×1080 WebGPU screenshot. On this machine that bitmap can come back blank while the sim is fine. 320×180 is the timing check, and the engine's own capture is the picture.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The sim is one tick you can drive with no GPU, and the picture is a pure view of that tick. That split is what made the whole stay testable.\\\",\\n    \\\"Yes. A gust is an acceleration, so gust 30 with no lean settles inside the disc and does not tip. egui 0.36 panics if a TexturesDelta is dropped. Pause still increments the tick; the world time is what freezes.\\\",\\n    \\\"The balance model, the day loop, and every event. The engine does not have a centre-of-pressure verb.\\\",\\n    \\\"The app frame. The demo's keys, menus and chrome run in the same function as the game, and a fit frame has to turn all of that off without breaking the engine's other scenes.\\\",\\n30→    \\\"frozen() returns early inside the tick. InputFrame gained lean, device, ui and hub. The HUD carries the fit UI and a status string. The mixer plays song beds. The page bridge publishes status. Captures composite the fit UI. Puppets tilt about the feet. Splash and a silent wake were added for the lagoon.\\\",\\n    \\\"A supported way to publish one JSON value that is both a string (for JSON.parse) and an object (for .tick), without hand-rolling a String constructor.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The plan is specific about the feel, the roster and the hub snippet, and it says behaviour is the contract when a filename does not match the engine.\\\",\\n    \\\"Song numbers in the plan and the beds the sim actually requests do not use the same index. The hub snippet sends whatever status.hub.ghost is, so a boolean there is sent as a boolean.\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipping the full roster, the 10-foot shell and the hub harness on a 20 GB machine where one extra browser gets killed.\\\",\\n    \\\"Say, next to the gust sentence, that a full lean alone must not tip and a gust on top of that lean must. State that plan filenames are guidance in the same paragraph as the file tree.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Five days, one mat\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A third-person balance comedy at Tippy Cay. Lean through a week of sports mini-games, then stand still when it matters.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Lean with the stick, WASD or the mouse. Confirm with Cross, Space or click.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"third-person\\\", \\\"sports\\\", \\\"comedy\\\", \\\"low-poly\\\", \\\"versus\\\"]\\n50→  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:21:32\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports mini-game anthology with a light life-sim frame\\\",\\n    \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Third person\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Shardfall engine (Pavilion: Rust, wgpu, egui 0.36.2), commit 49ef2ba, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, AI Hub session.js 1.4.0\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"The engine's cel look, high-key pastel, beach and wellness props. Library props only for generic dressing.\\\",\\n10→    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Engine puppet, tilted about the feet by the balance dot. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Music, effects and voices are synthesized in code. No audio files. Seven music beds, default music gain 0.10. At least 30 effects. Animalese voices.\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"AI Hub ghost mode for 1–4 players. The round is the Inter-Resort Medley (Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup).\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Headless sim tests, Playwright Chromium with software WebGPU at 320×180, phone and tablet profiles, WebKit iPhone fallback, and the AI Hub harness.\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"The build followed PLAN.md and the engine source. The title was drawn with a real RNG from 50 riffs. No separate web search in this session.\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n20→    \\\"Six defects showed up in testing: a gust check that did not match the acceleration model, an egui texture delta dropped on the floor, a private intent module, fonts bound in the same pass that drew them, a hub ghost field that was a boolean, and About pages that did not turn.\\\",\\n    \\\"One was critical. The font and texture-delta panic stops the browser frame loop, so the page sits there with a status that never ticks.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful test was the bot playthrough: three seeds from New Stay to the credits, plus each event on five seeds against an idle player.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful check is a 1920×1080 WebGPU screenshot. On this machine that bitmap can come back blank while the sim is fine. 320×180 is the timing check, and the engine's own capture is the picture.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The sim is one tick you can drive with no GPU, and the picture is a pure view of that tick. That split is what made the whole stay testable.\\\",\\n    \\\"Yes. A gust is an acceleration, so gust 30 with no lean settles inside the disc and does not tip. egui 0.36 panics if a TexturesDelta is dropped. Pause still increments the tick; the world time is what freezes.\\\",\\n    \\\"The balance model, the day loop, and every event. The engine does not have a centre-of-pressure verb.\\\",\\n    \\\"The app frame. The demo's keys, menus and chrome run in the same function as the game, and a fit frame has to turn all of that off without breaking the engine's other scenes.\\\",\\n30→    \\\"frozen() returns early inside the tick. InputFrame gained lean, device, ui and hub. The HUD carries the fit UI and a status string. The mixer plays song beds. The page bridge publishes status. Captures composite the fit UI. Puppets tilt about the feet. Splash and a silent wake were added for the lagoon.\\\",\\n    \\\"A supported way to publish one JSON value that is both a string (for JSON.parse) and an object (for .tick), without hand-rolling a String constructor.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The plan is specific about the feel, the roster and the hub snippet, and it says behaviour is the contract when a filename does not match the engine.\\\",\\n    \\\"Song numbers in the plan and the beds the sim actually requests do not use the same index. The hub snippet sends whatever status.hub.ghost is, so a boolean there is sent as a boolean.\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipping the full roster, the 10-foot shell and the hub harness on a 20 GB machine where one extra browser gets killed.\\\",\\n    \\\"Say, next to the gust sentence, that a full lean alone must not tip and a gust on top of that lean must. State that plan filenames are guidance in the same paragraph as the file tree.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Five days, one mat\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A third-person balance comedy at Tippy Cay. Lean through a week of sports mini-games, then stand still when it matters.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Lean with the stick, WASD or the mouse. Confirm with Cross, Space or click.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"third-person\\\", \\\"sports\\\", \\\"comedy\\\", \\\"low-poly\\\", \\\"versus\\\"]\\n50→  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/