{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_695","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default ServerClass is ThreadingHTTPServer.\n\nThe browser was overloaded by heavy WebGPU teardown after four iframes. Navigation timed out because the process could not keep up. A fresh page with a longer timeout should fix it. The old page must be closed first to release GPU contexts. Otherwise multiple contexts may overlap briefly.\n\nI will raise the solo goto timeout and page.close timeout to 120 seconds for consistency. I am editing hub.py now and will rerun the full suite. I may also run a quick isolated host-leave test first to verify scenario logic.\n\nThe timeout change is test-only; the shipped game already passed all player counts. I am applying the edit and starting the full hub run. I also verified that browser.close() runs in the finally block after exceptions, so Chromium processes are reliably cleaned up.\n\nI will update decisions.md with the splash deviation now. It is a real divergence and does not depend on host-leave. I am also noting other candidates from the summary: gust test wording, wasm constructor js_class, and wasm Poll starved rAF.\n\nI will record only one spec gap in the dev notes: the splash ready() call diverges from the exact IIFE. Engine workarounds like js_class, Wait versus Poll, and UI clearing are already documented in engine feedback.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2f1d08dd-60b0-4814-81d5-96d6820bf8d9-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/hub.py","old_string":"def scenario(page, query):\n    url = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{query[0]}/harness.html?{query[1]}\"\n    page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n    page.wait_for_function(\"() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\", timeout=180000)","new_string":"def scenario(page, query):\n    # Four software-WebGPU copies can stall the next navigation past the 30s default.\n    page.set_default_navigation_timeout(120_000)\n    url = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{query[0]}/harness.html?{query[1]}\"\n    page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=120_000)\n    page.wait_for_function(\"() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\", timeout=180000)"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2f1d08dd-60b0-4814-81d5-96d6820bf8d9-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/hub.py","old_string":"            browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)\n            context = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\": 320, \"height\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1)\n            page = context.new_page()\n            for q in queries:\n                try:\n                    check(scenario(page, q), q[1])\n                except Exception as e:\n                    log_lines.append(f\"FAIL {q[1]} {e}\")\n                    print(f\"{q[1]}: {e}\")\n                    failed += 1\n            context.close()\n            solo_page = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\": 320, \"height\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1).new_page()\n            errors = []\n            solo_page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: errors.append(str(e)))\n            solo_page.goto(f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}/{HTML_NAME.replace(' ', '%20')}\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")","new_string":"            browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=FLAGS)\n            context = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\": 320, \"height\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1)\n            for q in queries:\n                page = context.new_page()\n                try:\n                    check(scenario(page, q), q[1])\n                except Exception as e:\n                    log_lines.append(f\"FAIL {q[1]} {e}\")\n                    print(f\"{q[1]}: {e}\")\n                    failed += 1\n                finally:\n                    try:\n                        page.close(timeout=20_000)\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        print(f\"close {q[1]}: {e}\")\n            context.close()\n            solo_page = browser.new_context(viewport={\"width\": 320, \"height\": 180}, device_scale_factor=1).new_page()\n            errors = []\n            solo_page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: errors.append(str(e)))\n            solo_page.set_default_navigation_timeout(120_000)\n            solo_page.goto(\n                f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}/{HTML_NAME.replace(' ', '%20')}\",\n                wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\",\n                timeout=120_000,\n            )"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2f1d08dd-60b0-4814-81d5-96d6820bf8d9-61","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md","old_string":"- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.","new_string":"- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\n- On a splash round the page calls `AIHub.ready()` when connect resolves. Waiting for `__gameStatus` left the fourth software-WebGPU copy past the harness's 20s ready gate. A later `ready()` is a no-op."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":476,"output_tokens":2174,"cache_read_input_tokens":87168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b9ee9206-ac48-4c5a-8d88-41e7c65e68d1"}
