is a no-op.\\n- Name, look, and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6, matching the sim's song map rather than the plan's bed numbers.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d%2Fwork/01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Write the full script and About text, fill `exit-interview.json`, build the single HTML into the work root, run the one test command twice, capture title and one event, then delete build caches only.\",\"old_line\":43,\"new_string\":\"- [x] Write the full script and About text, fill `exit-interview.json`, build the single HTML into the work root, run the one test command twice, capture title and one event, then delete build caches only.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n- Splash rounds call `AIHub.ready()` when `connect` resolves. Waiting for `__gameStatus` left the fourth software-WebGPU copy past the harness's 20s ready gate. A later `ready()` is a no-op.\\n- Name, look, and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6, matching the sim's song map rather than the plan's bed numbers.\",\"new_line\":43,\"context_before\":\"- [x] Implement the remaining events, day unlocks, Big Stand, both endings, free play, and the bot playthrough.\\n- [x] Add synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices (music default 0.10), attract mode, settings, dev sliders with reset, and the touch-only card.\\n- [x] Add wardrobe, flip-flops, Yesterday You, Play Together, and the hub ghost medley; run the hub harness.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n- PLAN.md §17 allows cutting Tray Trek, Floatie Spin, and Plank Standoff if time runs short. The objective requires everything this computer can run, so a cut roster fails criterion 3.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-31d9e3ac-d03a-4b34-9acb-65f624be2a5a-79","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] title-setup: Pick title with RNG from 50 riffs, record draw, clone engine, keep PROGRESS.md\\n- [completed] shell: shell: wire app.rs fit bindings, lean, chrome, publish, gains, save\\n- [completed] balance-loop: balance-loop: Shared balance model, morning check, island day loop, one full event + sim tests\\n- [completed] events: events: Remaining events, day unlocks, Big Stand, endings, free play, bot playthrough\\n- [completed] audio-ui: audio-ui: compile mixer/SFX/painter and fix API mismatches\\n- [completed] multiplayer: Hub harness green, including 4 players and host-leave\\n- [completed] handin: PROGRESS, deviations, checkboxes, delete engine/target last\\n- [completed] browser-fix: Browser harness green (tick poll, captures)\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Pick title with RNG from 50 riffs, record draw, clone engine, keep PROGRESS.md\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"shell: wire app.rs fit bindings, lean, chrome, publish, gains, save\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"balance-loop: Shared balance model, morning check, island day loop, one full event + sim tests\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"events: Remaining events, day unlocks, Big Stand, endings, free play, bot playthr