{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_711","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tests look honest and drive the real simulator.\n\nChecking if the tests are gaming the system. The star-earning test may use hardcoded stars instead of real scores. The seed-credit test may auto-complete rather than simulate actual play. The pause test appears to skip the pause menu and jump straight to Dev Mode.\n\nThe pause test may be a bug or simply a mislabelled menu. The save test mutates internal state directly rather than testing actual save behavior.\n\nThe save test is not necessarily a refutation. The criterion's verification plan explicitly calls for a save round-trip, and the test covers that.\n\nThe attract test only checks the demo flag and phase. It does not verify that the attract sequence actually cycles.\n\nCriterion 4 still requires the attract sequence to loop even though the test does not assert it. A missing loop would be a defect regardless of test coverage. The shipped code must be read to verify core behaviors.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41d97384-5924-49ac-b4a7-95a5aec77545-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"todo!|unimplemented!|TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"*.{rs,toml}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41d97384-5924-49ac-b4a7-95a5aec77545-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn stars|fn score|enum Flow|enum Phase|fn run_bot|demo","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","head_limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41d97384-5924-49ac-b4a7-95a5aec77545-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.