c(\\\"yesterday\\\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\"},{\"line_number\":779,\"content\":\"            self.day_minutes += add;\"},{\"line_number\":815,\"content\":\"        self.day_minutes = 0;\"},{\"line_number\":1160,\"content\":\"                if self.day >= 5 && !self.free_play {\"},{\"line_number\":1172,\"content\":\"                self.free_play = true;\"},{\"line_number\":1177,\"content\":\"                self.free_play = true;\"},{\"line_number\":1627,\"content\":\"            \\\"minutes\\\": self.day_minutes,\"},{\"line_number\":1637,\"content\":\"            \\\"free_play\\\": self.free_play,\"},{\"line_number\":1780,\"content\":\"            Flow::Island => (format!(\\\"Day {}\\\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\\\"{} / {} minutes\\\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\"},{\"line_number\":1809,\"content\":\"            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\"},{\"line_number\":1814,\"content\":\"                self.flips |= bit;\"},{\"line_number\":1818,\"content\":\"        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b415659d-d0fe-4b92-aaa1-362490a1ecbc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_718","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking for more decisive bugs.\n\nFree play only shows the first 4 schedule events. The remaining events are inaccessible after credits. This contradicts PLAN.md, which requires every event to be open in free play.\n\nDirect scene names allow starting the remaining events, but the Schedule screen itself is incomplete. It hardcodes `take(4)` and never implements paging, so only four of eleven events appear after credits.\n\nDev mode is missing jump, cheats, and time scale controls.\n\nThe name menu only displays six of forty possible names. The page increment exists but the Name flow ignores it, so TAB_R cannot reveal more options. This contradicts PLAN.md's promise of about forty choices and is a named feature of New Stay.\n\nOutfits list eight items but only six appear. Skins are complete.\n\nThe pause menu lacks Schedule, How to Play, and Quit to Title.\n\nBig Stand uses Iron Waltz instead of Band of Guests. The credits correctly use song six.\n\nThe Big Stand song mismatch is not a decisive bug because the numbered criteria do not require specific songs.\n\nThe Tray bonus is always zero. Five glasses at 200 points each already reach the 1000-point maximum, so the no-spill bonus cannot add anything meaningful.\n\nThe bot playthrough test may pass because world_time only advances during events, checks, and island time. Menu and dialogue time is excluded, so the simulation can finish under sixty minutes without actually playing through every screen.\n\nThe bot may be fast-forwarding through events rather than playing them. If it merely calls start_activity without real interaction, the per-event star tests could pass while the events were never actually played.\n\nPose scoring caps at 1000 points, so the formula is sound.\n\nBreath score uses 0.85 and 0.15 coefficients instead of the planned 0.7 and 0.3. PLAN.md permits design tweaks only if they fail in play, so this deviation does not constitute a bug.\n\nThe Check eyes-closed state does not dim the screen or hide the puck in the simulation, suggesting it may be view-only.\n\nThe Long Stillness prompt might not display a skip option even though the code forfeits after fifteen seconds if any button is pressed.\n\nThe Hub ready() function returns early because the HTML page JavaScript differs from the required snippet, but hub tests passed so it works.\n\nChecking whether the island is a real scene or a stub the bot skips. The world might remain empty if the schedule loop is used without island exploration.\n\nVisual engine captures need inspection for blank PNGs, since the verification plan treats blank output as a failure.\n\nThe exit-interview.json structure and HTML filename requirements also need review.\n\nIt remains unclear whether localStorage saves are actually wired or only exported in-memory.\n\nThe about text contains a Nintendo reference that may violate the banned-word test if the word is split across lines.\n\nA potential bug exists in tick_big phase zero: it calls tick_breath, which increments act.t and sets done and score, then immediately resets act.t to a pre-increment value.\n\nThe tick_big phase-zero reset may double-count or finish early, but the bot test still awards two stars so it likely does not break gameplay.\n\ntick_step inside Big Stand sets done when t >= 64 seconds and tick_step_window undoes that flag, yet score is still computed, so this may be acceptable.\n\nThe plank bot correctly holds STEP_L and STEP_R continuously to perform a brace.\n\nA potential bug was spotted in menu_flow: it explicitly includes Flow::Attract in its non-menu match list, which could cause unexpected behavior during attract mode.\n\nAttract mode is correctly excluded from menu_flow. Pause during attract enters Dev mode but preserves the demo state, resuming to Attract on exit. The pregame flow properly includes Name, Look, and Outfit screens.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e9c8012-c538-44d8-a252-2ff8822c7a7d-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1288,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e9c8012-c538-44d8-a252-2ff8822c7a7d-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn (drive_player|collect_flops|press_bits|talk_advance|apply_slider|open_settings)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e9c8012-c538-44d8-a252-2ff8822c7a7d-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/capture-title-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e9c8012-c538-44d8-a252-2ff8822c7a7d-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/capture-pose-1.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4490,"output_tokens":2260,"cache_read_input_tokens":97280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"038a8ec6-5d06-4945-aa3b-48a6bca44453"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e9c8012-c538-44d8-a252-2ff8822c7a7d-42","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1288→        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\\n1290→        self.act = act;\\n        done\\n    }\\n\\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\\n1300→            }\\n            out.insert(id, f);\\n        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn press_bits(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n1310→            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let items = self.screen_items();\\n                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\\n                        && self\\n                            .schedule_events()\\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\\n                });\\n1320→                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\\n                if self.focus == want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else if self.focus < want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_DOWN)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n1330→            Flow::Title => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n1340→                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\\n            _ => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n1350→fn zone_of(kind: EventId) -> &'static str {\\n    match kind {\\n        EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose | EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank | EventId::Step | EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"studio\\\",\\n        EventId::Lap | EventId::Tray => \\\"path\\\",\\n        EventId::Floatie | EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"lagoon\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_speaker_count(speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n    script::script().speaker_count(speaker)\\n1360→}\\n\\npub fn script_title_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().titles.len()\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_name_count() -> usize {\\n    script::script().names.len()\\n}\\n\\n1370→/// Builds Tippy Cay. `medley` is the hub course. `event/<key>` starts that activity's card.\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/hub\\\", LEVEL)).map_err(|e| anyhow!(\\\"tippy cay: {e}\\\"))?;\\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, \\\"fit\\\", def);\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 8.0;\\n    let mut game = FitGame::fresh();\\n    if let Ok(rules) = toml::from_str::<Rules>(&crate::games::level_text(\\\"fit/rules\\\", RULES_TEXT)) {\\n        game.rules = rules;\\n    }\\n    if let Some(p) = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)) {\\n1380→        game.flops = vec![\\n            [p.x + 2.2, p.z + 0.4],\\n            [p.x - 2.0, p.z + 1.2],\\n            [p.x + 1.2, p.z + 2.4],\\n            [p.x - 1.4, p.z - 1.6],\\n            [p.x + 3.0, p.z - 0.8],\\n        ];\\n    }\",\"content_concise\":\"1288→        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\\n1290→        self.act = act;\\n        done\\n    }\\n\\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\\n1300→            }\\n            out.insert(id, f);\\n        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn press_bits(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n1310→            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let items = self.screen_items();\\n                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\\n                        && self\\n                            .schedule_events()\\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\\n                });\\n1320→                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\\n                if self.focus == want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\