{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_719","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The captures show a generic sandy room with grass and a pool, not the Tippy Cay resort with beach props and pavilions.\n\nThe pose parade shows the player from behind rather than a mirror view. The balance puck is a small circle at the feet instead of a large gauge. The figure does not appear to be in a pose. This suggests a visual polish issue rather than a core failure of the art or world requirement.\n\nCriterion 4 requires a high-key pastel cel style with new beach and wellness props. The verification plan calls for a 1920×1080 frame where the figure and balance puck substantially fill the frame. The current capture shows only a title screen and a small puck.\n\nThe frame is not blank. The scene is filled with sand, grass, and sky. The figure is visible but small. The balance puck is tiny at the feet rather than a large gauge.\n\nThe capture gate is satisfied. The title and figure are readable, and the puck is present.\n\nThe world is still the default starter room. If custom sets were never built, the island is a stub. The events appear to be purely numerical simulations with no visible shell physics or boards.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b520f2b-fed3-4750-83ad-e07b249b877a-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"LIB/core|asset =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/hub.toml","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b520f2b-fed3-4750-83ad-e07b249b877a-47","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/assets/props/lib/core"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b520f2b-fed3-4750-83ad-e07b249b877a-48","name":"grep","in