{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_721","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the puck drawing and fit_ui model to determine puck size.\n\nDev mode jump and cheat tools appear absent. A bug may prevent events from matching finished mini-games. The numerical simulation events are playable via lean. Criterion 3 requires shipped, directly startable twists with named mechanics. Those mechanics exist in tick functions despite thin visuals.\n\nCriterion 4 is explicitly refuted. Live sliders and reset are present. Jump and cheats are absent. Time scale exists but is never exposed.\n\nCriterion 2 is refuted. Free play is enabled in code, but the UI only displays the first four story events, leaving the rest unreachable.\n\nDirect scene routing still starts events, but the menu cannot reach Paddle Slalom for players who finished the game. The island has no event mats, so schedule is the only path; take(4) ignores pagination and relies on mod.rs bugs. Criterion 4 names are limited to six of roughly forty selectable options; PLAN.md section 2 documents this deviation, and derived criteria may clarify without narrowing the objective.\n\nCriterion 4's requirement for new beach and wellness props is absent. The hub contains no assets, fit.json is missing, and the capture shows only generic grass and a pool. This is a content gap rather than a fidelity issue.\n\nThe puck is drawn as a small circle in fit.rs lines 89-94. The day unlock mechanics exist in the schedule even though the visual set does not change per pavilion; this may be bundled with the props gap rather than treated as a separate room requirement.\n\nLong stillness UI and eyes-closed dimming are being checked against the code. Music bed mismatches were considered but skipped as minor deviations since they do not break functionality. Hub readiness tests passed.\n\nThe later-ready() deviation is accepted because the harness approved it and the tests passed. The wardrobe screen shows only a Back button, so gear changes appear non-functional. Criterion 5 lists wardrobe under pause menu features, though its main focus is saves, multiplayer, and AI Hub.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-293f5b73-a7c8-439b-b9a6-ab9384b9a1e2-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1680,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-293f5b73-a7c8-439b-b9a6-ab9384b9a1e2-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs","limit":110}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-293f5b73-a7c8-439b-b9a6-ab9384b9a1e2-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"forfeit|Inner Peace|skip|eyes|dim|DEMO|puck","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5957,"output_tokens":1454,"cache_read_input_tokens":109696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a08ed6d8-1157-4953-8c5b-ef44066cda10"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-293f5b73-a7c8-439b-b9a6-ab9384b9a1e2-53","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1680→            body.truncate(shown.max(1).min(body.len()));\\n        }\\n        let mut lines = Vec::new();\\n        if !body.is_empty() {\\n            lines.push(body);\\n        }\\n        let (title, big, extra) = self.banner();\\n        if !extra.is_empty() && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(extra);\\n        }\\n1690→        if self.touch_only && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        let puck = if matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card) {\\n            Some([self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y, 0.34, 1.0])\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let yaw = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Lap) && self.flow == Flow::Event {\\n            Some(self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t * 0.35).unwrap_or(0.0))\\n1700→        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let action = \\\"confirm\\\";\\n        Some(FitUi {\\n            screen: self.flow.name().into(),\\n            title: if title.is_empty() { TITLE.into() } else { title },\\n            lines,\\n            items,\\n            focus: focus_id,\\n1710→            device: self.device,\\n            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\\n            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            action: action.into(),\\n            demo: self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            touch_card: self.touch_only,\\n            puck,\\n            big,\\n            footer: self.footer(),\\n            camera_yaw: yaw,\\n1720→            prompt_kind: match self.device {\\n                2 => 1,\\n                3 => 2,\\n                4 => 3,\\n                _ => 0,\\n            },\\n        })\\n        .map(|mut ui| {\\n            if !speaker.is_empty() && ui.lines.first().is_some() {\\n                // Speaker stays in the title slot when the banner did not claim it.\\n1730→                if ui.title == TITLE {\\n                    ui.title = speaker;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ui\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tint(&self, id: crate::entity::EntityId) -> Option<([f32; 3], f32)> {\\n        if self.ghost_id == Some(id) {\\n1740→            Some(([0.62, 0.84, 1.0], 0.45))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn banner(&self) -> (String, String, String) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n1750→            Flow::Title | Flow::Attract => (TITLE.into(), if self.flow == Flow::Attract { \\\"DEMO\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" }.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Card => {\\n                let k = self.kind_now();\\n                (k.map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_default(), String::new(), k.map(|k| k.blurb().into()).unwrap_or_default())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Countdown => {\\n                let n = self.card_t.ceil().clamp(1.0, 3.0) as i32;\\n                (\\\"Ready\\\".into(), n.to_string(), String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n1760→                let title = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Mat\\\".into());\\n                let score = format!(\\\"{:.0}\\\", self.score);\\n                (title, score, String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                let t = script::rank_title(self.score);\\n                (t, format!(\\\"{} stars\\\", self.stars), format!(\\\"Score {:.0}\\\", self.score))\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => (\\\"Balance Age\\\".into(), self.age.to_string(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Ending => (\\n1770→                if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" { \\\"Rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"Extended Stay\\\" }.into(),\\n                String::new(),\\n                String::new(),\\n            ),\\n            Flow::Credits => (\\\"Credits\\\".into(), TITLE.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Podium => (\\\"Podium\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Dev => (\\\"Dev Mode\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Sliders ride along. Reset restores the mat.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Settings => (\\\"Settings\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::About => (\\\"About\\\".into(), format!(\\\"{}/{}\\\", self.about_page + 1, self.about_len().max(1)), self.about_text()),\\n            Flow::HowTo => (\\\"How to Stand\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Lean with the stick, the keys, or the mouse. Last one wins.\\\".into()),\\n1780→            Flow::Island => (format!(\\\"Day {}\\\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\\\"{} / {} minutes\\\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\\n            Flow::Schedule => (\\\"Today\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            _ => (TITLE.into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn footer(&self) -> String {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"schedule\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \\\" schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"lean\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n1790→            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_body(&self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(ch) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) else { return };\\n        ch.anim.tilt_side = self.bal.cob.x * 14.0;\\n        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = self.bal.cob.y * 14.0;\\n    }\\n1800→\\n    fn collect_flops(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        if self.last_pressed & buttons::CONFIRM == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(feet) = sim.feet(id) else { return };\\n        for (i, p) in self.flops.iter().enumerate().take(5) {\\n            let bit = 1u8 << i;\\n            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\\n1810→                continue;\\n            }\\n            let d = (feet.x - p[0]).hypot(feet.z - p[1]);\\n            if d < 1.2 {\\n                self.flips |= bit;\\n                events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 30, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + i as f32 * 0.05 });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\\n            self.golden = true;\\n1820→        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn about_len(&self) -> usize {\\n        self.about_lines().len()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn about_text(&self) -> String {\\n1830→        let lines = self.about_lines();\\n        if lines.is_empty() {\\n            return String::new();\\n        }\\n        lines[self.about_page % lines.len()].clone()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn about_lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        about_from_blob(&self.about_blob).unwrap_or_else(|| ABOUT_FALLBACK.iter().map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect())\\n    }\\n1840→\\n    /// What other seats should draw. Area -1 means \\\"not on a mat\\\".\\n    fn ghost_json(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let area = self.kind_now().map(|k| k as i32).unwrap_or(-1);\\n        let facing = sim.player().and_then(|e| e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.anim.facing)).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        let p = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)).unwrap_or(Vec3::ZERO);\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"area\\\": area,\\n            \\\"position\\\": [p.x, p.y, p.z],\\n            \\\"facing\\\": facing,\\n1850→            \\\"lean\\\": [self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y],\\n            \\\"clip\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"clip_time\\\": self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t).unwrap_or(0.0),\\n            \\\"score\\\": self.score,\\n        })\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nconst ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&str; 4] = [\\n    \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\",\",\"content_concise\":\"1680→            body.truncate(shown.max(1).min(body.len()));\\n        }\\n        let mut lines = Vec::new();\\n        if !body.is_empty() {\\n            lines.push(body);\\n        }\\n        let (title, big, extra) = self.banner();\\n        if !extra.is_empty() && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(extra);\\n        }\\n1690→        if self.touch_only && lines.len() < 2 {\\n            lines.push(\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\".into());\\n        }\\n        let puck = if matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card) {\\n            Some([self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y, 0.34, 1.0])\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let yaw = if self.kind_now() == Some(EventId::Lap) && self.flow == Flow::Event {\\n            Some(self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t * 0.35).unwrap_or(0.0))\\n1700→        } else {\\n            None\\n        };\\n        let action = \\\"confirm\\\";\\n        Some(FitUi {\\n            screen: self.flow.name().into(),\\n            title: if title.is_empty() { TITLE.into() } else { title },\\n            lines,\\n            items,\\n            focus: focus_id,\\n1710→            device: self.device,\\n            xbox: self.settings.xbox,\\n            glyph: fit_ui::prompt(action, self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n            action: action.into(),\\n            demo: self.demo || self.flow == Flow::Attract,\\n            touch_card: self.touch_only,\\n            puck,\\n            big,\\n            footer: self.footer(),\\n            camera_yaw: yaw,\\n1720→            prompt_kind: match self.device {\\n                2 => 1,\\n                3 => 2,\\n                4 => 3,\\n                _ => 0,\\n            },\\n        })\\n        .map(|mut ui| {\\n            if !speaker.is_empty() && ui.lines.first().is_some() {\\n                // Speaker stays in the title slot when the banner did not claim it.\\n1730→                if ui.title == TITLE {\\n                    ui.title = speaker;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            ui\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn tint(&self, id: crate::entity::EntityId) -> Option<([f32; 3], f32)> {\\n        if self.ghost_id == Some(id) {\\n1740→            Some(([0.62, 0.84, 1.0], 0.45))\\n        } else {\\n            None\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn banner(&self) -> (String, String, String) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n1750→            Flow::Title | Flow::Attract => (TITLE.into(), if self.flow == Flow::Attract { \\\"DEMO\\\" } else { \\\"\\\" }.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Card => {\\n                let k = self.kind_now();\\n                (k.map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_default(), String::new(), k.map(|k| k.blurb().into()).unwrap_or_default())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Countdown => {\\n                let n = self.card_t.ceil().clamp(1.0, 3.0) as i32;\\n                (\\\"Ready\\\".into(), n.to_string(), String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n1760→                let title = self.kind_now().map(|k| k.title().into()).unwrap_or_else(|| \\\"Mat\\\".into());\\n                let score = format!(\\\"{:.0}\\\", self.score);\\n                (title, score, String::new())\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                let t = script::rank_title(self.score);\\n                (t, format!(\\\"{} stars\\\", self.stars), format!(\\\"Score {:.0}\\\", self.score))\\n            }\\n            Flow::Reveal => (\\\"Balance Age\\\".into(), self.age.to_string(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Ending => (\\n1770→                if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" { \\\"Rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"Extended Stay\\\" }.into(),\\n                String::new(),\\n                String::new(),\\n            ),\\n            Flow::Credits => (\\\"Credits\\\".into(), TITLE.into(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Podium => (\\\"Podium\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::Dev => (\\\"Dev Mode\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Sliders ride along. Reset restores the mat.\\\".into()),\\n            Flow::Settings => (\\\"Settings\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            Flow::About => (\\\"About\\\".into(), format!(\\\"{}/{}\\\", self.about_page + 1, self.about_len().max(1)), self.about_text()),\\n            Flow::HowTo => (\\\"How to Stand\\\".into(), String::new(), \\\"Lean with the stick, the keys, or the mouse. Last one wins.\\\".into()),\\n1780→            Flow::Island => (format!(\\\"Day {}\\\", self.day), String::new(), format!(\\\"{} / {} minutes\\\", self.day_minutes, self.goal())),\\n            Flow::Schedule => (\\\"Today\\\".into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n            _ => (TITLE.into(), String::new(), String::new()),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn footer(&self) -> String {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Island => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"schedule\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox) + \\\" schedule\\\",\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"lean\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n1790→            _ => fit_ui::prompt(\\\"confirm\\\", self.device, self.settings.xbox),\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn apply_body(&self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(ch) = sim.state.entities.get_mut(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) else { return };\\n        ch.anim.tilt_side = self.bal.cob.x * 14.0;\\n        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = self.bal.cob.y * 14.0;\\n    }\\n1800→\\n    fn collect_flops(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        if self.last_pressed & buttons::CONFIRM == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let Some(id) = sim.state.player else { return };\\n        let Some(feet) = sim.feet(id) else { return };\\n        for (i, p) in self.flops.iter().enumerate().take(5) {\\n            let bit = 1u8 << i;\\n            if self.flips & bit != 0 {\\n1810→                continue;\\n            }\\n            let d = (feet.x - p[0]).hypot(feet.z - p[1]);\\n            if d < 1.2 {\\n                self.flips |= bit;\\n                events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 30, gain: 0.7, pitch: 1.0 + i as f32 * 0.05 });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.flips == 0b1_1111 {\\n            self.golden = true;\\n1820→        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl FitGame {\\n    fn about_len(&self) -> usize {\\n        self.about_lines().len()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn about_text(&self) -> String {\\n1830→        let lines = self.about_lines();\\n        if lines.is_empty() {\\n            return String::new();\\n        }\\n        lines[self.about_page % lines.len()].clone()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn about_lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\\n        about_from_blob(&self.about_blob).unwrap_or_else(|| ABOUT_FALLBACK.iter().map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect())\\n    }\\n1840→\\n    /// What other seats should draw. Area -1 means \\\"not on a mat\\\".\\n    fn ghost_json(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let area = self.kind_now().map(|k| k as i32).unwrap_or(-1);\\n        let facing = sim.player().and_then(|e| e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.anim.facing)).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        let p = sim.state.player.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)).unwrap_or(Vec3::ZERO);\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"area\\\": area,\\n            \\\"position\\\": [p.x, p.y, p.z],\\n            \\\"facing\\\": facing,\\n1850→            \\\"lean\\\": [self.bal.cob.x, self.bal.cob.y],\\n            \\\"clip\\\": 0,\\n            \\\"clip_time\\\": self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.t).unwrap_or(0.0),\\n            \\\"score\\\": self.score,\\n        })\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nconst ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&st