{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_722","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug exists between puck drawing and capture.\n\nThe UI puck radius is 0.0544 times screen height, about 59 pixels at 1080p. The plan specifies a 340 pixel diameter. The capture description shows a small circle at the character's feet, possibly a world-space indicator or the UI puck.\n\nThe 340 pixel diameter is a feel note, not a hard requirement. The 118 pixel diameter at 1080p is too small for reading from ten feet. The puck is present but likely too small.\n\nThe 59 pixel radius is acceptable for a gauge. The ring multiplier shrinks it slightly, but this is a fidelity issue rather than a hard bug.\n\nA fake skip prompt is missing. The forfeit logic triggers after fifteen seconds, yet no UI text appears telling the player to press Cross to skip.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db660d93-09c5-4322-a361-be23a4e7983a-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"skip|forfeit|Inner Peace|stillness|Press","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"*.{rs,toml}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db660d93-09c5-4322-a361-be23a4e7983a-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"eyes|dim|blind|puck","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db660d93-09c5-4322-a361-be23a4e7983a-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/exit-interview.json","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db660d93-09c5-4322-a361-be23a4e7983a-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub:session|about-data|AIHub.ready|Wobble Minutes","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132.html","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5694,"output_tokens":884,"cache_read_input_tokens":115584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"eaf7fa48-af9a-4a5f-95aa-b1baf49ad013"}
