"about-data\\\" type=\\\"application/json\\\">{\\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:21:32\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\", \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\", \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports mini-game anthology with a light life-sim frame\\\", \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Third person\\\", \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Shardfall engine (Pavilion: Rust, wgpu, egui 0.36.2), commit 49ef2ba, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, AI Hub session.js 1.4.0\\\", \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"The engine's cel look, high-key pastel, beach and wellness props. Library props only for generic dressing.\\\", \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Engine puppet, tilted about the feet by the balance dot. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\", \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Music, effects and voices are synthesized in code. No audio files. Seven music beds, default music gain 0.10. At least 30 effects. Animalese voices.\\\", \\\"online\\\": \\\"AI Hub ghost mode for 1–4 players. The round is the Inter-Resort Medley (Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup).\\\", \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Headless sim tests, Playwright Chromium with software WebGPU at 320×180, phone and tablet prof [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":505,\"content\":\"                                     about: document.getElementById('about-data')?.textContent ?? '' };\"},{\"line_number\":516,\"content\":\"    if (info.splash) AIHub.ready();\"},{\"line_number\":519,\"content\":\"    const waitReady = () => (window.__gameStatus ? AIHub.ready() : setTimeout(waitReady, 50));\"},{\"line_number\":540,\"content\":\"<title>Wobble Minutes — Five days, one mat</title>\"},{\"line_number\":566,\"content\":\"<div id=\\\"msg\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\">Loading Wobble Minutes…</div>\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a28f7b71-b0d6-42ed-af57-6c5b383a2424"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_723","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Long Stillness fake \"press to skip\" prompt is not shown in the UI.\n\nThe forfeit logic exists in code, but the fake skip prompt is missing. Without it, players cannot be tempted to press, so the feature is not shipped.\n\nThe HUD during Long Stillness only shows the title and score. It never vanishes, so the fake skip prompt cannot appear. The BigStand event also lacks a music fade to silence in phase 5. This leaves the finale as an incomplete core feature.\n\nThe Eyes-closed check is also incomplete. The puck remains visible during the check, so the screen never dims and the puck does not vanish as planned. The required \"eyes-closed tone\" is missing, leaving only a stillness metric. I need to verify whether a tone sound effect fires during phase 2.\n\nThe eyes-closed tone is confirmed absent. Phase 2 tick_check only accumulates stillness without sound effects or pitch variation. The mechanic is functionally just a second stillness test.\n\nDev mode jump and time-scale cheats are missing, violating criterion 4. Free play only runs four events instead of the required five. The name list is also shorter than PLAN.md specifies.\n\nThe 34 missing names may not be a core objective gap. The game remains playable with six names, and the plan only specified about forty. The deviation was an intentional truncation to six visible items without adding paging.\n\nThe missing names are a shortcut that violates the specification. I will include it only if stronger bugs exist.\n\nProps and poses are a criterion 4 failure. The capture shows a bare room with no fit.json or new props. The exit interview art direction claim is false. This is a criterion 4 gap.\n\nThe Pose Parade is missing its six hand-keyed pose clips. The figure only tilts and never holds a pose. The drifting pose ring and gull are also absent, leaving the parade as a bare ring with no animation.\n\nThe gull is only an audio multiplier, not a visible bird. The event banner never displays the line \"There is a bird on you.\" The wobble spike exists, but the named mechanic is thin. Missing polish is not a valid refutation.\n\nThe invisible gull is polish, not a core mechanic. The wobble multiplier alone satisfies the drift requirement.\n\nPose Parade is functionally a balance ring game without pose clips. Scoring does not depend on them. The plan's core intent was to keep the figure in the ring while holding poses. The code only meets the placeholder floor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79de93a-d806-40b2-85a4-093ce05ae025-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":490,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79de93a-d806-40b2-85a4-093ce05ae025-61","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1648,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79de93a-d806-40b2-85a4-093ce05ae025-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"play_clip|clip_t|FIT/|pose","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79de93a-d806-40b2-85a4-093ce05ae025-63","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/title-draw.json","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79de93a-d806-40b2-85a4-093ce05ae025-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn list|fn set","path":"/home/m