,101,99,60,80,97,114,97,109,73,110,102,111,62,32,123,10,50,53,48,58,112,117,98,32,102,110,32,115,101,116,40,116,58,32,38,109,117,116,32,100,121,110,32,84,117,110,97,98,108,101,44,32,112,97,116,104,58,32,38,115,116,114,44,32,118,97,108,117,101,58,32,80,97,114,97,109,86,97,108,117,101,41,32,45,62,32,82,101,115,117,108,116,60,40,41,44,32,83,116,114,105,110,103,62,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":2,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/params.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":131,\"content\":\"pub fn list(t: &mut dyn Tunable) -> Vec<ParamInfo> {\"},{\"line_number\":250,\"content\":\"pub fn set(t: &mut dyn Tunable, path: &str, value: ParamValue) -> Result<(), String> {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"38d342ed-db64-4a88-8cce-0ed10b5025ba"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_724","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking a path indexing bug in params::list.\n\nConfirmed slider IDs map correctly to original indices. The test targets page 0, but sliders only appear on pages 1 and above.\n\nThe slider handler runs for Dev and Settings flows regardless of page. It sets the first parameter. The test does not prove UI reachability. The code path works if the event is sent directly.\n\nSliders are reachable via TAB_R from page 1 onward. Dev page 0 is the menu; later pages show sliders plus Back. The missing cheat, jump, and time scale features are confirmed solid. Free play take(4) is also solid. Now verifying the EventId::ALL ordering.\n\nFree play incorrectly allows every event to open. After the story, day 3 and 4 events cannot start or replay from the schedule because no mats exist. Day 4 has four events during the story, and day 5 only Big Stand. The schedule screen ignores page changes during TAB navigation, so the list never updates.\n\nThe long stillness prompt is missing. The eyes-closed tone is absent from audio and will be included in the morning check gap. Exercise poses and new props are also missing; apply_body only tilts the body without clips.\n\nPose Parade does not change the puppet pose. The missing art is a core fidelity issue, not polish; the capture shows a standing idle figure rather than a yoga pose. Only six of eight outfits are available.\n\nDev mode missing jump is the clearest criterion miss outside of art. Plank scoring logic checks out: 60-second survival yields 1000 points and three stars, while flopping after 0.6 seconds yields zero stars. The Tray no-spill bonus is dead code because five glasses already max out at 1000 points, so it cannot be used to refute the objective.\n\nBig Stand's final age calculation is missing. The plan specifies reducing morning age by final_score divided by 100, up to ten years, but the code only checks whether the current age is forty or below to choose the rowboat or extended ending. The finale bonus that should lower age is absent.\n\nFive stamps are confirmed across days one through five. The Big Stand finale age bug will be cited with its formula source in PLAN.md.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56d09bfd-289f-4e3d-a1f2-6f0217fb1120-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__hub|ghosts|PuppetFrame","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src","glob":"*.rs","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56d09bfd-289f-4e3d-a1f2-6f0217fb1120-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"eyes.closed|Eyes Closed|tone|Sfx \\{ id:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56d09bfd-289f-4e3d-a1f2-6f0217fb1120-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/tests/browser.py","offset":200,"limit":250}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4472,"output_tokens":1871,"cache_read_input_tokens":124544,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e584e022-e5aa-4645-9266-7eb85a481a30"}
