new() };\"},{\"line_number\":120,\"content\":\"    let Ok(ghosts) = bind::get(&hub, &\\\"ghosts\\\".into()) else { return Vec::new() };\"},{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"    if ghosts.is_null() || ghosts.is_undefined() {\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"    let keys = bind::object_keys(&ghosts);\"},{\"line_number\":131,\"content\":\"        let Ok(data) = bind::get(&ghosts, &JsValue::from_str(&key)) else { continue };\"},{\"line_number\":162,\"content\":\"        let Ok(hub) = bind::get(win.as_ref(), &\\\"__hub\\\".into()) else { return 0 };\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1342,\"content\":\"        let ghosts = crate::weblink::hub_ghosts();\"},{\"line_number\":1345,\"content\":\"        if !ghosts.is_empty() {\"},{\"line_number\":1348,\"content\":\"            stamp_hub_ghosts(&mut p, &ghosts);\"},{\"line_number\":1349,\"content\":\"            stamp_hub_ghosts(&mut c, &ghosts);\"},{\"line_number\":2411,\"content\":\"fn stamp_hub_ghosts(frame: &mut pav_core::RenderFrame, ghosts: &[crate::weblink::HubGhost]) {\"},{\"line_number\":2424,\"content\":\"    for (i, g) in ghosts.iter().enumerate() {\"},{\"line_number\":2441,\"content\":\"            puppet: Some(pav_core::frame::PuppetFrame {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-56d09bfd-289f-4e3d-a1f2-6f0217fb1120-66","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,50,49,51,50,95,95,120,51,53,49,49,50,100,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,52,3