{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_729","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The input path never constructs UiEvent::Slider.\n\nThe test injects UiEvent::Slider. Player cannot move sliders. Confirm on music and SFX rows does nothing. activate_settings only handles xbox, fullscreen, reset save, and back. Glyphs, fullscreen, and reset-save work via confirm. This is a decisive bug for criterion 4.\n\nThe test is dishonest. It injects UiEvent::Slider directly into sim.step, bypassing the real input path. This is theater: it passes against a wrong implementation by asserting on mocks or internal state instead of exercising the actual entry point.\n\nThe simulation unit handles UiEvent::Slider correctly when the event is provided. The real defect is that the application never emits it. Driving an internal flag or helper proves the mechanism exists, not that the wired-up feature works. Reset is reachable via Click(60), which maps to ACT_DEV_RESET and resets rules to defaults. Sliders remain unreachable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0359415f-9a86-44d1-b0dd-243bc3d24184-76","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0359415f-9a86-44d1-b0dd-243bc3d24184-77","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn fit_sample|ui:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2011,"output_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":142464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d6dcc3c6-061c-4a2d-8654-877a64