   {\\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs:1198\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Big Stand phase 5 forfeits on any press after 15s but never shows the fake Press-to-skip prompt; the event HUD keeps the score and song bed 3 never goes silent. Criterion 2 requires that prompt.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs:757\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Big Stand ending uses the morning age only. PLAN.md final age (morning minus score/100, cap 10) is never applied, so a 41–50 morning age cannot check out by rowboat after a good finale.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs:666\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Morning-check eyes-closed phase only averages cob distance. It never plays a pitch tone or hides the puck, so it is a second stillness test. Criterion 2 names the eyes-closed tone.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs:560\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Name and outfit menus .take(6) and ignore page, so 34 of the 40 script names and the Swim/Golden outfits cannot be selected. TAB changes page but screen_items does not.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/hub.toml:20\\\", \\\"detail\\\": \\\"No beach/wellness props and no hand-keyed poses. One sand/grass room is every set; apply_body only tilts the idle puppet; anim/fit.json does not exist. Pose Parade capture is a standing figure, not a pose. Wardrobe and Calendar flows are Back-only stubs.\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"fit.rs bot/hub/browser logs pass