(`mod.rs:618`) is Resume, Reset feel, Wardrobe, Calendar, Settings, About, then parameter labels. There is no jump (day, event, finale phase, attract, medley), no cheats, and no time-scale row. `time_scale` is set to `1.0` at init and never assigned again. Criterion 4 requires jump, cheats, and time scale.\\n\\n## Free play does not open the roster (criterion 2)\\n\\n`schedule_events` in free play returns every event except the check and Big Stand (`mod.rs:525`). `screen_items` for Schedule then `.take(4)` (`mod.rs:567`) and does not read `page`. The only room (`hub.toml`) has a player marker and no mats. After credits the schedule can start Breath Bloom, Pose Parade, Tempo Squats, and Plank Standoff only. Step Party, Floatie Spin, Morning Lap, Tide Table, Paddle Slalom, Tray Trek, and Cannonball Cup are stuck off the menu. `fit/event/<name>` still boots them for tests; that is not the stay.\\n\\n## Long Stillness has no fake skip (criterion 2)\\n\\n`tick_big` phase 4 (`events.rs:1198`) sets `forfeit` if `pressed != 0` after 15s and then halves that phase. Nothing puts “Press Cross to skip” (or any skip line) on the HUD. `banner` for `Flow::Event` always shows the score (`mod.rs:1759`). `desired_song` keeps Big Stand on bed 3 (`mod.rs:1235`) and never fades to silence. The temptation prompt the criterion names is absent.\\n\\n## Finale does not move Balance Age\\n\\n`finish_play` for Big Stand (`mod.rs:757`) banks the event and picks `rowboat` iff `self.age <= 40`. It never subtracts `final_score / 100` (cap 10) from the morning age. A morning age of 41–50 that the finale should have brought to 40 or under still gets the Extended Stay.\\n\\n## Eyes-closed check is a second stillness test\\n\\n`tick_check` phase 2 (`events.rs:666`) only accumulates `cob` length for 6 seconds. No syllable or `Sfx` tracks the offset. `fit_ui` keeps the puck up for the whole check (`mod.rs:1693`). Criterion 2’s eyes-closed tone is not there, so the micro-test is identical to stand-still with the dot visible.\\n\\n## Name and outfit lists are capped at six\\n\\n`script.toml` has 40 names and 8 outfits. `Flow::Name` and `Flow::Outfit` both `.take(6)` (`mod.rs:560`, `mod.rs:562`). `page` increments on TAB for every menu, but those screens ignore it. Swim and Golden, and 34 names, cannot be chosen. `script_name_count >= 40` only counts the file.\\n\\n## One room, no new poses, stub wardrobe and calendar (criterion 4)\\n\\n`hub.toml` is a single sand/grass deck with a pool. `assets/props/lib/core/` has no palm, mat, kettlebell, raft, or other new beach/wellness props. There is no `engine/anim/fit.json`, and `apply_body` only writes `tilt_side` / `tilt_fwd`. Pose Parade’s capture (`capture-pose-1.png`) is the idle puppet standing in that room with a small puck, not a hand-keyed pose. `Flow::Wardrobe` and `Flow::Calendar` menu items are only Back (`mod.rs:589`), so those pause entries are stubs.\\n\\nHand-in files that do match the brief: `PROGRESS.md`, parseable `exit-interview.json` with `usage` `added on import` and `aiHub.players` `1–4`, title `Wobble Minutes` on the page and in `aiHub.name`, and the packed HTML beside the dev folder. Those do not clear the play holes above.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-1-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-1-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-1-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic verdict: Refuted\\n\\nSim, browser, and hub logs in the implementer scratch dir do show `27 passed, 0 failed` twice, `6 passed, 0 failed` for the browser, and `6 passed, 0 failed` for the hub. The title capture is a readable Wobble Minutes menu. Those passes do not cover the holes below. The plan diff did not delete acceptance criteria; the recorded deviations do not satisfy them.\\n\\n## Unwired sliders (criterion 4)\\n\\n`FitInput::fit_sample` (`engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs:536`) only builds `UiEvent::Hover` or `UiEvent::Click`. A repo-wide search finds `UiEvent::Slider` constructed only in `tests/fit.rs`, which injects `Slider(300, 1.0)` straight into `sim.step`. `activate_settings` (`mod.rs:994`) ignores the Music, Effects, Voices, Lean, Wobble, Rhythm, and Text rows (`610`–`616`). Confirm on those rows is `_ => {}`. A player cannot change a live tunable or a settings gain. Reset Feel (`ACT_DEV_RESET`) is a real confirm. The slider test must drive the same buttons or pointer the app actually emits, after that path exists.\\n\\n## Dev Mode is a slider list, not the required tools\\n\\nPause sets `flow = Dev` (`mod.rs:1453`). `dev_items` (`mod.rs:618`) is Resume, Reset feel, Wardrobe, Calendar, Settings, About, then parameter labels. There is no jump (day, event, finale phase, attract, medley), no cheats, and no time-scale row. `time_scale` is set to `1.0` at init and never assigned again. Criterion 4 requires jump, cheats, and time scale.\\n\\n## Free play does not open the roster (criterion 2)\\n\\n`schedule_events` in free play returns every event except the check and Big Stand (`mod.rs:525`). `screen_items` for Schedule then `.take(4)` (`mod.rs:567`) and does not read `page`. The only room (`hub.toml`) has a player marker and no mats. After credits the schedule can start Breath Bloom, Pose Parade, Tempo Squats, and Plank Standoff only. Step Party, Floatie Spin, Morning Lap, Tide Table, Paddle Slalom, Tray Trek, and Cannonball Cup are stuck off the menu. `fit/event/<name>` still boots them for tests; that is not the stay.\\n\\n## Long Stillness has no fake skip (criterion 2)\\n\\n`tick_big` phase 4 (`events.rs:1198`) sets `forfeit` if `pressed != 0` after 15s and then halves that phase. Nothing puts “Press Cross to skip” (or any skip line) on the HUD. `banner` for `Flow::Event` always shows the score (`mod.rs:1759`). `desired_song` keeps Big Stand on bed 3 (`mod.rs:1235`) and never fades to silence. The temptation prompt the criterion names is absent.\\n\\n## Finale does not move Balance Age\\n\\n`finish_play` for Big Stand (`mod.rs:757`) banks the event and picks `rowboat` iff `self.age <= 40`. It never subtracts `final_score / 100` (cap 10) from the morning age. A morning age of 41–50 that the finale should have brought to 40 or under still gets the Extended Stay.\\n\\n## Eyes-closed check is a second stillness test\\n\\n`tick_check` phase 2 (`events.rs:666`) only accumulates `cob` length for 6 seconds. No syllable or `Sfx` tracks the offset. `fit_ui` keeps the puck up for the whole check (`mod.rs:1693`). Criterion 2’s eyes-closed tone is not there, so the micro-test is identical to stand-still with the dot visible.\\n\\n## Name and outfit lists are capped at six\\n\\n`script.toml` has 40 names and 8 outfits. `Flow::Name` and `Flow::Outfit` both `.take(6)` (`mod.rs:560`, `mod.rs:562`). `page` increments on TAB for every menu, but those screens ignore it. Swim and Golden, and 34 names, cannot be chosen. `script_name_count >= 40` only counts the file.\\n\\n## One room, no new poses, stub wardrobe and calendar (criterion 4)\\n\\n`hub.toml` is a single sand/grass deck with a pool. `assets/props/lib/core/` has no palm, mat, kettlebell, raft, or other new beach/wellness props. There is no `engine/anim/fit.json`, and `apply_body` only writes `tilt_side` / `tilt_fwd`. Pose Parade’s capture (`capture-pose-1.png`) is the idle puppet standing in that room with a small puck, not a hand-keyed pose. `Flow::Wardrobe` and `Flow::Calendar` menu items are only Back (`mod.rs:589`), so those pause entries are stubs.\\n\\nHand-in files that do match the brief: `PROGRESS.md`, parseable `exit-interview.json` with `usage` `added on import` and `aiHub.players` `1–4`, title `Wobble Minutes` on the page and in `aiHub.name`, and the packed HTML beside the dev folder. Those do not clear the play holes above.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"34926555-0d44-4e06-a98e-2be8a4df9e0d"}
