{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_733","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing work on the game.\n\nVerification was rejected. Live sliders are unreachable because `fit_sample` never emits `UiEvent::Slider`. Dev Mode also lacks jump, cheats, and time-scale controls.\n\nFree-play schedule is truncated to four exercises and ignores pagination, so Step Party through Cannonball Cup are unreachable. Big Stand phase 5 forfeits on any press after fifteen seconds but never shows the required Press-to-skip prompt, and song bed three never stops.\n\nBig Stand final age never applies the PLAN.md formula, so a 41–50 morning age cannot check out by rowboat after a good finale. Morning-check eyes-closed only averages cob distance and never plays the required pitch tone or hides the puck. Name and outfit menus are also truncated to six entries per page, blocking selection of the remaining script names and Swim or Golden outfits.\n\nThe TAB key changes pages but `screen_items` does not. Beach and wellness props are missing, hand-keyed poses are absent, and `anim/fit.json` is missing. Pose Parade captures a standing figure rather than a pose. Wardrobe and Calendar flows are Back-only stubs. I will read PLAN.md and the current code to implement fixes and run targeted tests. The engine target directory was deleted, so a rebuild is required.\n\nHTML must be repacked after changes. Tests need updating to drive the real input path. I will read PLAN.md and the cited code in parallel, then plan the work carefully.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The hub check is green, but the review found real play gaps: sliders, Dev Mode, free-play events, Big Stand, age, the eyes-closed tone, menus, and poses. I’ll read those paths and fix them in the shipped game."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4efc8e83-0c29-4e2b-b50c-8e479e6e91b3-81","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"sliders","content":"Wire live sliders through real pad/drag input and test that path","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"devmode","content":"Dev Mode: jump, cheats, time scale, plus sliders","status":"pending"},{"id":"schedule","content":"Free-play schedule pages all events, not take(4)","status":"pending"},{"id":"bigstand","content":"Big Stand skip prompt, silent bed, final age formula","status":"pending"},{"id":"eyes","content":"Morning check eyes-closed tone and hidden puck","status":"pending"},{"id":"menus","content":"Name and outfit menus page past the first six","status":"pending"},{"id":"props","content":"Beach/wellness props, poses, wardrobe and calendar","status":"pending"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Retest, recapture, repack HTML, refresh PROGRESS","status":"pending"}],"merge":false}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4efc8e83-0c29-4e2b-b50c-8e479e6e91b3-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Dev Mode|time scale|time_scale|Press to skip|final age|eyes-closed|eyes closed|wardrobe|Calendar|slider|Jump|cheat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4efc8e83-0c29-4e2b-b50c-8e479e6e91b3-83","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn fit_sample|UiEvent::Slider|Slider\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":93227,"output_tokens":1278,"cache_read_input_tokens":13696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d4ce6063-8002-4393-8c79-78a81b7a6727"}
