18,101,32,115,108,105,100,101,114,115,44,32,114,101,115,101,116,32,124,32,49,49,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":20,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"- **Numbers** are starting values. Tune them with the dev sliders and the bot. The structure is decided; change it only if it fails in play.\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"- **Genre:** sports mini-game anthology with a light life-sim frame (daily ritual, unlocks, wardrobe). Catalogue genre: Sports.\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"| The daily ritual: calendar stamps, banked minutes that unlock more | Calendar stamps and the Minute Clam |\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"4. When the day's minute goal is met, Pip says so. Sleep at your cabana (or choose End Day in the Schedule). A big stamp lands on the Calendar. Next day.\"},{\"line_number\":183,\"content\":\"- **Minute Clam:** a giant clam at reception that gulps banked minutes with a gibberish burp. Totals unlock wardrobe items.\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"- **Calendar:** five big days, a stamp per completed day, then real days in free play. No tables.\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\"**Tippy Cay** is about 64 x 48 m: reception at the centre (Pip's desk, Calendar wall, Minute Clam), a ring path for jogging, four pavilions around it, a row of cabanas, a pier, a diving tower and a water channel in the distance. Palms, grass, sand terraces, sea on all sides, circling gulls.\"},{\"line_number\":287,\"content\":\"**Library clips to use:** `MESH2MOTION/Jog`, `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`, `MESH2MOTION/Jumping Jacks`, `CMU/Hop_One_Foot_Loop`, `STYLE100/Balance_Walk`, `CMU/Wave_Hello`, `CMU/Stretch_Yawn`, `MESH2MOTION/Cheering_Two_Hands`, `MESH2MOTION/Victory`, `MESH2MOTION/Sitting_Idle`, `QUATERNIUS/Dance_Loop`. Search with `clips find=word`. There are no yoga or hula clips.\"},{\"line_number\":346,\"content\":\"| Guest select, wardrobe | Big cards, live figure on a turntable |\"},{\"line_number\":353,\"content\":\"| Calendar | Five big days and stamps |\"},{\"line_number\":354,\"content\":\"| Pause | Resume, Schedule, Calendar, Wardrobe, Settings, How to Play, About, Dev Mode, Quit to Title |\"},{\"line_number\":363,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode** (from Pause, not shown in hub sessions). Big rows, pad-navigable, in tabs:\"},{\"line_number\":364,\"content\":\"- **Jump:** any day, any event, any finale phase, attract, medley.\"},{\"line_number\":367,\"content\":\"- **Tuning:** live sliders, generated from `impl Tunable for Rules` with `params::list` and `params::set`, grouped by core and by event, with **Reset to Defaults** per group and for all. Must include: stiffness, damping, wobble, tip time, stick curve, key rates, each event's main difficulty number, rhythm windows, spin band, gust strength, bounce gain, Big Stand gusts.\"},{\"line_number\":567,\"content\":\"- Pause freezes the world. Settings: music defaults to 0.10. Dev sliders change values and reset. Dev jump lands where it says.\"},{\"line_number\":589,\"content\":\"4. **Island and voice.** `hub` set and props, walking, interactables, dialogue with syllables, audio buses, Lobby Bossa, Pip, the Morning Check, Balance Age, Calendar, Clam.\"},{\"line_number\":591,\"content\":\"6. **Meta.** Days, unlocks, titles, wardrobe, flip-flops, Yesterday You, absence comments, all songs and SFX.\"},{\"line_number\":593,\"content\":\"8. **Shell.** Attract, Settings, Dev Mode, touch-only card, How to Play, About.\"},{\"line_number\":595,\"content\":\"10. **Polish.** Write the script to full length, feel pass on every event using the sliders, extra set dressing, particles, transitions, stingers.\"},{\"line_number\":626,\"content\":\"| Dev mode from pause, live sliders, reset | 11 |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4efc