:\"    pub fn for_day(day: u8) -> &'static [EventId] {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"6eeaeb52-699e-47a0-bbe0-88f141d63b34"}
