{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_742","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand Activity fields for the pose clip and HUD prompt.\n\nSong 0 may be silence or a track. Returning it during Long Stillness could play nothing or the title bed. The mixer needs checking. During Big Stand phase 4, the score should be hidden.\n\nA \"Press Cross to skip\" prompt should appear after 15 seconds. The puck stays visible while the score and other HUD elements hide. Music silence requires setting the song to zero or a silent bed. For the eyes-closed phase, the screen dims, the puck vanishes, and tone pitch indicates the offset. If FitUi lacks a dimming field, it can be added via the banner extra or a new field.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87528c2d-62d7-402f-8a02-e97a80e1026d-106","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct FitUi|struct FitItem|pub puck|pub dim","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87528c2d-62d7-402f-8a02-e97a80e1026d-107","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"enum SimEvent|Sfx","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87528c2d-62d7-402f-8a02-e97a80e1026d-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs","offset":100,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87528c2d-62d7-402f-8a02-e97a80e1026d-109","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-