{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_749","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clip files are embedded at build time from the anim/ directory via build.rs.\n\nChecking build.rs to see which files are embedded. Verifying whether the hub room parser supports objects for props. Wardrobe and calendar need real screens instead of Back-only; wardrobe will list outfits and gear, calendar will show five days with stamps. Name and outfit selection will page six items per screen.\n\nThe island currently lacks event mats, so only four events are reachable after credits. The schedule's take(4) limit is the main bug. Adding interactable mats that start events on proximity confirmation will fix this. Paged schedules will also make all events reachable.\n\nBoth issues need fixing together. The island event mats will be placed in a ring and drawn as static markers in hub.toml or code.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18c943cf-f5c1-4cd3-92b9-1af0595b0905-129","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/rooms/_template.toml","offset":120,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18c943cf-f5c1-4cd3-92b9-1af0595b0905-130","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"anim_data|anim/","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core","glob":"build.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18c943cf-f5c1-4cd3-92b9-1af0595b0905-131","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs","offset":180,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3032,"output_tokens":700,"