{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_752","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking bot_big to ensure it does not press during stillness, which would forfeit.\n\nTests need public access to prompt text, song, time_scale, eyes tone, puck visibility, and schedule items. tick_check will emit Sfx events for the eyes-closed tone. FitUi lacks a dim property.\n\nThe title line will indicate eyes-closed status. The puck will be hidden. A dim field can be added to FitUi with a default value, since the game constructs the struct directly and the painter reads it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de51a2b7-7b8d-41d6-b5f3-a91ad9cd7c13-137","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FitUi \\{|ui\\.puck|ui\\.big","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de51a2b7-7b8d-41d6-b5f3-a91ad9cd7c13-138","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":490,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1749,"output_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":171392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9102e835-2571-4d86-85fc-8b0f3982a833"}
