{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_763","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation step function does not return events.\n\nThe tone pitch will be stored as `tone_pitch` on the game or activity and exposed in status. Tests can assert this value changes with lean. Emitting `SimEvent::Sfx` triggers the actual sound path.\n\nThe tone pitch will be computed as `0.7 + bal.cob.length() * 2.5` and stored in `act.guide`. The `SimEvent::Sfx` is pushed during the tick check phase, and the status field is populated from that same activity field.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b50dc4b-f4fb-4a6c-a0c5-731167f791df-156","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/anim","limit":5}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b50dc4b-f4fb-4a6c-a0c5-731167f791df-157","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\"hips\"","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/anim","glob":"*.json","head_limit":5}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3352,"output_tokens":602,"cache_read_input_tokens":188288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8d85a03f-2553-4174-826f-243336438351"}
