{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_773","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Rules field is tunable, so list walks fields in declaration order.\n\nStiffness likely appears first in the Rules field, so id 300 maps to it. The slider_norm logic indexes into the rules list by subtracting 300 and normalizes float values using their min and max bounds. Settings 610 music is normalized directly from its own value, while sensitivity at 613 is normalized as sensitivity minus 0.5.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-97fda7ef-10d1-4ad4-92ec-d6b3ba7eea05-170","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"stiffness","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/core.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-97fda7ef-10d1-4ad4-92ec-d6b3ba7eea05-171","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/params.rs","offset":1,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":780,"output_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":201856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"253deb0d-22bc-4380-9676-64ca6e27e44f"}
