{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_774","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Stiffness is 40. The range is 5 to 80. One-tenth of the range equals 7.\n\nMenu right moves the value by 7.5. Boolean parameters are skipped during nudging. The `dim` field will be added to FitUi. Eyes closed mode dims the UI to 0.92 and shifts pitch higher. Puck hiding is gated by a check action in phase two. A big stand HUD is planned.\n\nThe banner returns an empty big text for still poses. Extra skip prompt text appears when the sub is at least fifteen. The footer shows \"Press Cross to skip\" after fifteen seconds. Song zero uses the desired song.\n\nPhase four mid-event updates the next pre song. Silence triggers a Music event with song zero. The test must press a key to unlock audio before checking the song. This lets the song change from three during the big stand to zero during stillness. Directly jumping to stillness may leave the song at zero because audio_unlocked is false until a key press.\n\nThe test will jump directly to the big stand and then to stillness. This avoids a long pose event. The status song field will be added. Pose events will be verified by checking the character animation clip. The wardrobe test will open the dev menu, select the Sun cap, and assert the puppet gear.\n\nThe calendar lists \"Day 1\" and \"Day 5\". The name page shows the seventh entry when TAB is pressed. Entering the name menu resets the page index to zero to avoid leftover values. Outfit pages hold six items each, so the second page contains Swim and Golden. The look menu has exactly six skins and needs no pagination.\n\nIsland mats will use paging for consistency. They are stored as relative offsets at build time and trigger an event when the player confirms near a mat. A footer prompt will appear when near a mat. The hub layout origin is [-8, 0, -6]. The player starts around column six row six.\n\nThe player marker is at column seven, row six. Layout coordinates map x to column and z to row. The island objects will be placed near the player: mat at [8, 0.05, 8], rowboat at [12, 0, 10], bench at [3, 0, 8], lamp at [4, 0, 4], stall at [11, 0, 3], table at [5, 0, 10], clam sphere at [9, 0.4, 5], and calendar board box at [2, 1, 6].","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e8d7789c-9c05-470e-bb38-a31cdfbf00dd-172","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":155,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1546,"output_tokens":1573,"cache_read_input_tokens":202624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b400e7fb-eb91-4fd4-9a51-63743c6d1535"}
