{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_798","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a clear implementation plan.\n\nI'll split the large mod.rs edits into multiple search_replace operations. I'm verifying that params::set, clips::find, and HelmKind are public. I'm also checking whether Activity is constructed outside start() and whether tick_check has callers beyond tick(). For the eyes-closed test, the bot plays check after card and countdown, taking roughly 1380 ticks plus about 200 for setup; a 2500-tick cap is safe.\n\nThe 2500-step test should finish in a few seconds without dev-menu speedup. A 30-tick lean stays within phase 2, so the bot stops before the phase changes. Puck's fit_ui is None during check phase 2 with dim > 0.5 and lines containing \"eyes\". Tone comes from act.guide: it starts near cob 0 and pitch ~0.55 at phase start, then rises after the lean.\n\nStiffness 40 means a full 30-tick lean should shift cob.x well past zero. Pitch rises by roughly 0.05 over that span. The test will check the stored tone field rather than sim.events, since events may be cleared each frame.\n\nThe stillness test will jump to that phase via dev menu. The song should be zero immediately because desired_song returns 0 for phase >= 4. I'll add an `act_sub` field to status so the test can wait until sub reaches 15 without guessing.\n\nI'm adding `act_phase`, `tone`, `time_scale`, and `clip` to the status struct as well. I'm also writing test helpers to navigate the UI by focusing labels.\n\nThe UI navigation helper now drives the real menu with down, up, and tab buttons. The slider test will enter Tuning, confirm stiffness is first, move right to adjust it, then confirm Reset feel.\n\nThe Tuning page will hold three sliders, a \"Reset these\" button for that group, a \"Reset feel\" button for all settings, and Back. This keeps the page to six items. The slider test still starts at stiffness because it remains first.\n\nI'll use three parameters per tuning page. That leaves room for both reset buttons and Back on the same page, so no extra reset page is needed.\n\nThe schedule test will boot fit, pause into dev mode, navigate to Cheats, unlock all, return to root, jump to Island, open the schedule, select Cannonball, and assert phase is card with event set to cannon. Unlock all leaves the menu unchanged, while Back returns to the dev root.\n\nThe schedule test will use TAB to reach the later \"Cannonball\" entry. Unlock all must run before opening the schedule because free_play is required for that card to appear.\n\nThe name test will boot fit, confirm \"New Stay\", select the first slot, assert the phase name, press TAB, confirm a skin, assert the outfit phase, and select \"Golden\". I'll add an outfit field to status. Focus resets to zero on TAB.\n\nThe name test will confirm \"Gray\" as the first skin, then move down to \"Golden\" and assert outfit index 7. The wardrobe test will open Wardrobe, select \"Sun cap,\" and verify the helm is a Cap. The calendar test will open Calendar and check that fit_ui items contain \"Day.\" The pose test will boot into the pose event, step until the clip is non-zero, and confirm the \"FIT/Tree\" clip exists.\n\nThe pose test will be a unit test in pav_core that calls clips::find directly, since the animation is embedded at compile time. It boots the pose event and steps the bot for ten ticks once the phase reaches \"event\".","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dde5410-fdd2-409e-a8f0-31965142a5b9-81","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub prop|pub struct Entity","glob":"**/entity.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dde5410-fdd2-409e-a8f0-31965142a5b9-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub fn set\\(","glob":"**/params.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dde5410-fdd2-409e-a8f0-31965142a5b9-83","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/mod.rs","offset":270,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":656,"output_tokens":2410,"cache_read_input_tokens":145024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"28db1b3a-2604-45db-b678-960792d78fff"}
