{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_804","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The player character receives a puppet definition at spawn on line 397.\n\nThe render frame clones the character's puppet Arc, not config.puppet. Updating the visible helm requires replacing that Arc. The wear_gear function will edit both sim.config.puppet.gear and the player's puppet Arc.\n\nThe `edit` closure would be called twice and might toggle the gear. A new `set_gear` function will assign the gear directly to both `config.puppet.gear` and the player's puppet Arc.\n\nThe test will assert the helm matches Cap. Outfit is stored on FitGame.outfit, not the puppet shirt.\n\nChanging FitGame.outfit is enough for the outfit index test. An apply_outfit_look function will map each outfit index to a specific shirt color on the puppet.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2ac9315b-6295-4f3b-8326-97330e429271-94","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":990,"limit":100}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10334,"output_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":161280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"007a1728-c881-4ff4-84f1-8eb4c66e797d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2ac9315b-6295-4f3b-8326-97330e429271-94","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"990→            invuln,\\n            model: crate::params::ChoiceParam::name(self.config.movement.model).to_string(),\\n            physics: self.physics_stats(),\\n            view: c.view.clone(),\\n            view_serial: c.view_serial,\\n            boss: self.boss_bar(),\\n            pad_note: c.pad_note.clone(),\\n            lines: self.play_hud(),\\n            status: self.play().map(|g| g.status(self).to_string()),\\n            camera_yaw: None,\\n1000→            fit: None,\\n        };\\n        if let Some(ui) = self.play().and_then(|g| g.fit_ui(self)) {\\n            hud.camera_yaw = ui.camera_yaw;\\n            hud.fit = Some(std::sync::Arc::new(ui));\\n        }\\n        RenderFrame {\\n            tick: self.state.tick,\\n            time: self.time(),\\n            dt: self.dt(),\\n1010→            live_edit_ticket: self.live_edit_ticket,\\n            objects: self\\n                .state\\n                .entities\\n                .iter()\\n                .filter_map(|e| {\\n                    let puppet = e.character.as_ref().filter(|c| c.riding.is_none()).map(|c| PuppetFrame {\\n                        state: c.anim,\\n                        feet_offset: c.height() * 0.5,\\n                        def: c.puppet.clone(),\\n1020→                        rig: c.rig.as_ref().map(|r| r.view()),\\n                        tint: self\\n                            .state\\n                            .play\\n                            .as_ref()\\n                            .and_then(|g| g.tint(e.id))\\n                            .or_else(|| self.state.game.as_ref().and_then(|g| g.tint(e.id))),\\n                    });\\n                    if e.visual.is_none() && puppet.is_none() {\\n                        return None;\\n1030→                    }\\n                    let mut visual = e.visual.clone().unwrap_or(Visual::new(Shape::Sphere { radius: 0.0 }, Color::WHITE));\\n                    if e.health.as_ref().is_some_and(|h| h.flash > 0.0) {\\n                        // Hit flash.\\n                        visual.color = Color::WHITE;\\n                        visual.emissive = visual.emissive.max(0.45);\\n                    }\\n                    let pulse = e.bomb.as_ref().map(|b| b.fuse).unwrap_or(-1.0);\\n                    let soft = e.soft.as_ref().and_then(|s| {\\n                        let h = s.handle?;\\n1040→                        let radius = match &s.def.shape {\\n                            crate::softbody::SoftShape::Rope { radius, .. } => *radius,\\n                            _ => 0.0,\\n                        };\\n                        Some(crate::frame::SoftView {\\n                            points: self.state.physics.soft_positions(h),\\n                            surface: s.surface.clone(),\\n                            segments: s.segments.clone(),\\n                            radius,\\n                            two_sided: matches!(s.def.shape, crate::softbody::SoftShape::Cloth { .. }),\\n1050→                        })\\n                    });\\n                    let vehicle = e.vehicle.as_ref().map(|v| v.view());\\n                    let cone = self.guard_cone(e);\\n                    let scenery = e.character.is_none()\\n                        && matches!(e.body_kind, BodyKind::None | BodyKind::Fixed)\\n                        && matches!(e.behavior, Behavior::None)\\n                        && e.bomb.is_none()\\n                        && e.health.is_none()\\n                        && e.vehicle.is_none()\\n1060→                        && e.soft.is_none()\\n                        && e.lifetime.is_none()\\n                        && !self.state.game.as_ref().is_some_and(|g| g.actors.contains_key(&e.id));\\n                    Some(RenderObject {\\n       