22132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"    /// Own look (NPCs); None = `RenderFrame::puppet_def`.\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"    pub puppet_def: PuppetDef,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1402,\"content\":\"                    let def = p.def.as_deref().unwrap_or(&curr.puppet_def);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1082,\"content\":\"            puppet_def: self.config.puppet.clone(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/prop_preview.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":289,\"content\":\"            puppet_def: config.puppet.clone(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/creature_preview.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":307,\"content\":\"        puppet_def: config.puppet.clone(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/animation_preview.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":321,\"content\":\"            puppet_def: (*self.puppet).clone(),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"aa1912c1-1499-4013-9bf1-1dfd92d94bbe"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_807","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Working on a Rust pattern to unwrap an optional definition and fall back to the current value.\n\nUpdating both puppet paths so the gear config works whether the player has a puppet or not. Will batch file writes and add HelmKind and GearLook imports.\n\nNo need to store morning age separately. The age field already holds it until the finale updates it.\n\nThe reveal flow sets age and runs three talk advances to start Big Stand on day five or later. The test records age at reveal before the finale.\n\nThe reveal phase needs three confirms. The bot will press Card and confirm through the countdown. A 12000 tick cap is safe.\n\nThe reveal phase will use a 4000 tick cap. The check script lasts about 510 ticks. Jumping to day five clears today_played and sets the day. The age formula ignores time scale so 4x persists through check and finale. The bot will attempt the check first. If the resulting age is too young it will idle instead.\n\nWorking out the morning age range needed for the finale rowboat. A bot score of 800 with a cut of 8 requires morning age at most 48. A score of 1000 with a cut of 10 requires morning age at most 50.\n\nA bot score of 650 with a cut of 6 requires morning age at most 46. The test will assert the age equals morning minus the cut, capped at 18. It will also verify the ending is rowboat when age is 40 or below, and extended otherwise. If the morning age lands between 41 and 50, it will require a finale score of at least 500 to push that age into checkout.\n\nA skill of 0.55 with zero days and stars yields an age near 24, confirming the check can land in the desired 41–50 morning band.\n\nSkill 0.55 yields morning age 47, which is at the edge of the target band. A cut of 6 still leaves age at 41, so the finale score must reach at least 700 to push that age into checkout. Skill 0.6 gives age 44, leaving a comfortable margin for a cut of 5.\n\nA morning age of 43 is the target. That yields an age near 40 after a six-point cut. The skill formula weights still, targets, blind, and steps at 0.30, 0.25, 0.25, and 0.20. Idle play should keep still and blind high while targets and steps stay low. A bot with real play would score too high.\n\nIdle play with moderate wobble yields a morning age near 54, which is too high. Perfect centering would land near 47, but wobble makes the exact value uncertain. The plan is to store a fixed morning age of 45 and then run the real finale to verify the formula and rowboat.\n\nThe test will run a real check and finale, then assert the age formula against whatever morning age the check produced. It will also verify rowboat when that age falls in the target band. The stored morning age of 45 is only for reference; the actual check result determines the assertion.\n\nThe plan now favors a single shorter test. It boots into Story with age 80, sets the stored morning age to 45, jumps to Big Stand while keeping the run as Story, and plays through the finale. This proves the rowboat path without running the check phase.\n\nThe stored morning age will be set directly via `get_mut` in the test. This avoids a hard-coded value and treats the morning as an input boundary, since no menu exists to change it.\n\nThe test will not hard-code the ending or score. The bot should already earn at least two stars on Big Stand, so the finale rowboat should trigger automatically. A full run takes about 2130 ticks and roughly five to fifteen seconds of CPU time. Skipping to phase four would save time but might yield a lower score.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fef8b275-e35b-4d28-a156-f6061d2b58bd-98","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub mod puppet|pub use puppet","glob":"**/pav_core/src/lib.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1049,"output_tokens":2667,"cache_read_input_tokens":174208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"375c5a7e-034b-4a31-bb2c-fcbfe1921631"}
