{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-11c63079-2070-42d1-af93-60db614bba75-103","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- The name, look and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\",\"new_string\":\"- Name, look, and outfit menus page six at a time. The ids stay absolute, so a later page can still pick Gray, Swim, and Golden.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- The name, look and outfit menus show the first six entries. The rest stay in `script.toml`.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map.\",\"old_line\":5,\"new_string\":\"- Name, look, and outfit menus page six at a time. The ids stay absolute, so a later page can still pick Gray, Swim, and Golden.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\",\"new_line\":5,\"context_before\":\"- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tes