{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_816","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to add an `activate_dev` method near `open_settings` or after `go_back`.\n\nAlso need to implement `desired_song`, `ending talk`, `pre changes`, `post`, `status`, `fit_ui`, `banner`, `footer`, `apply_body`, `build`, and free functions. Calendar confirm currently falls through to `go_back` for any id including day rows, which is acceptable for the UI test.\n\n`activate_dev` is being implemented with resume, tab switching, and wardrobe navigation.\n\n`activate_dev` now routes calendar, reset, settings, about, and how-to navigation.\n\n`activate_dev` now handles the remaining dev subtabs: jump-to, cheat, time controls, and reset rules. `go_back` will return to the root Dev screen when a subtab is active.\n\n`go_back` now resets the active dev subtab to root when leaving a subtab. `desired_song` returns 0 for BigStand if the actor phase is at least 4, otherwise 3. The ending talk text for Flow::Ending is being drafted.\n\nThe ending talk text is now complete. Pre-changes will reset the dev tab and page when pause opens dev, make TAB act as STEP, add slider nudging before confirm, skip lines, island confirm, autoplay, step_once, and set no_tips in tick_activity so mid-event cheats work.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-264d8909-ab7e-457f-b29b-89da3e6820bd-128","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn open_settings(&mut self) {","new_string":"    fn activate_dev(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\n        if self.dev_tab == 0 {\n            match id {\n                ACT_RESUME => self.flow = self.paused_from,\n                200 => self.open_dev_tab(1),\n                201 => self.open_dev_tab(2),\n                202 => self.open_dev_tab(3),\n                203 => self.open_dev_tab(4),\n                43 => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Wardrobe;\n                    self.page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                44 => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::Calendar;\n                    self.page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\n                ACT_ABOUT => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::About;\n                    self.about_page = 0;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                ACT_HOWTO => {\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Dev;\n                    self.flow = Flow::HowTo;\n                    self.focus = 0;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        match self.dev_tab {\n            1 => self.jump_to(id, sim),\n            2 => self.cheat(id, sim),\n            3 => self.set_time(id),\n            4 => match id {\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\n                ACT_DEV_RESET_GROUP => self.reset_rules(false),\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn open_settings(&mut self) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-264d8909-ab7e-457f-b29b-89da3e6820bd-129","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn go_back(&mut self) {\n        self.focus = 0;\n        self.flow = match self.flow {","new_string":"    fn go_back(&mut self) {\