{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_823","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking character.rs around line 1180 to understand clip overwrite. Also reviewing EventId ALL order and titles.\n\nFinishing the age formula in finish_play. Gray is index 6, so page 0 holds names 400–405 and page 1 starts with Gray at id 406. Page wrapping must use modulo to cycle TAB_R between pages; currently it increments unbounded.\n\nOutfit selection tests confirm the first look is selected without TAB, then TAB_R and MENU_DOWN select Golden (id 7). Skins fit on one page, but outfits span two pages with Swim at id 526 and Golden at id 527.\n\nSchedule test: PAUSE, Cheats, Unlock all, Back, Jump, Island, SCHEDULE, TAB/focus Cannonball, CONFIRM. Phase card and event key should be cannon.\n\nDev tab 0 page 0 has six items: Jump, Cheats, Time, Tuning, Wardrobe, Resume. Cheats is index 1. After PAUSE focus starts at Jump. One MENU_DOWN then CONFIRM opens Cheats.\n\nUnlock all is id 233. Cheat rows are No tips, Autoplay, Give minutes, Unlock all.\n\nAfter opening Cheats, MENU_DOWN is pressed three times then CONFIRM. The Back button resets focus to 0 and returns to tab 0. Jump tab has 13 events split into pages of four. Island is id 246 and must be located within the page layout.\n\nThe full EventId::ALL list contains 25 items. Island is index 19, which falls on page 4 alongside Long stillness, Attract, and Medley.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b7bdd82b-58d9-418e-978c-2d2ff3c5f84b-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":1,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b7bdd82b-58d9-418e-978c-2d2ff3c5f84b-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-2221