{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_836","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"pav_core::glam::Vec2 works. Now writing all edits.\n\nVerified all method signatures and borrow rules. The island confirm will be inserted into the menu else-if chain. Reviewing the exact pre code for the patch.\n\nSettings input will not conflict with menu navigation. Page controls will be combined to prevent double paging. Pause reset logic for dev_tab is being drafted.\n\nPause reset now clears focus, page, and dev_tab before switching flow. Confirm input will skip dialogue lines when enabled. Autoplay logic is being added for Event and Check flows.\n\nAutoplay now calls the bot to generate lean and button states. The step_once path advances the simulation by one frame, updates world time, applies physics, and returns to the previous flow if tick_activity completes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca70fe5-c8cc-4920-bad7-b48bdddbdca0-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FitUi \\{","glob":"**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1092,"output_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":108288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"4fcd49e1-9de3-4831-8490-24a7115361b8"}
