{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_837","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only one constructor exists. I will check goal plan deviations after the code works.\n\nCode will be written before compiling. The skip_line prompt correctly shows \"Press Cross to skip\" and the test accepts this. After menu navigation, the device becomes keyboard and the skip prompt updates to \"Press Space to skip\". Both prompts satisfy the test requirements.\n\nThe eyes line test will use case-insensitive matching. I am writing the code now and will update goal plan deviations after tests pass.\n\nThe first-six deviations will be removed once paging works. The tuning menu layout fits six items on page zero, so the reset feel option stays on that same page.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-569928f0-7c83-44f6-9ff8-cba4872d3571-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs","offset":70,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1202,"output_tokens":1016,"cache_read_input_tokens":109312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"f07b4367-891e-4c81-afc2-bea839da52e7"}
