{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_856","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking for other cargo processes running in this engine tree before starting.\n\nOther agents' cargo on different trees will be left alone. The test suite requires a cold rebuild of pav_core, which may take several minutes. The age test is headless and fast, but the full fit test suite includes multiple story runs and many event seeds.\n\nI'll run a targeted compile of the new tests first to fail fast. The full suite is slow and previously passed. I'll use CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 with --offline and --locked from the engine directory.\n\nI'll verify rustc and the target directory exist before starting cargo. The test run will be backgrounded with block_until_ms 0 and a monitor watching for errors or results. I must wait for compilation to finish.\n\nI'll set block_until_ms to 0 and use a long timeout to wait for the build. I need to check whether `choice_enum` derives PartialEq and whether `sim.player()` returns Option before compiling.\n\nChecking for borrow checker issues in the pre-step logic. The mutable events vector is consumed by tick_activity and freed before later pushes, so the borrow is valid. Also verifying that step_once advances activity while paused and that page_next handles menu navigation correctly.\n\nChecking menu navigation edge cases. TAB_R advances the page and resets focus correctly. The Tuning tab also uses page indexing properly.\n\nThe wardrobe test flow is sound. After the Sun cap item is selected, wear() sets the flow to Dev while keeping dev_tab at 0. Calendar seek works as expected.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ef623fcd-0b5e-4b5d-bc45-a40d92995878-96","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"anim/","glob":"**/pav_core/build.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ef623fcd-0b5e-4b5d-bc45-a40d92995878-97","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ps -ef | awk '/cargo/ && !/awk/ {print}' | head -40; ls -d \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/target\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO_TARGET\"","description":"Check cargo processes and whether target exists"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3018,"output_tokens":1135,"cache_read_input_tokens":144896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"24813dc6-27f7-4aae-8de0-53502894fea8"}
