bers. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\",\"new_line\":38,\"context_before\":\"\\n## Task checklist\\n- [x] Pick the title with a real RNG from 50 riffs, record the draw, create the dev folder, clone the engine, and keep `PROGRESS.md` current.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n- PLAN.md §17 allows cutting Tray Trek, Floatie Spin, and Plank Standoff if time runs short. The objective requires everything this computer can run, so a cut roster fails criterion 3.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"aa0fcf62-203f-4665-8d06-232ca2fe6f57"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_866","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will wait for the monitor to notify me instead of polling.\n\nDeviation update is complete. Credits bot and story timing are correct. Menu page labels and name screen navigation work properly. I will check tick_check phase 2 for sound effects emitted every frame.\n\nCob stiffness is 40, so the 0.5-second hard lean will move cob significantly. The equilibrium position equals lean multiplied by reach.\n\nThe tone should change after the 0.5-second hard lean because cob will not remain at the same pitch. I also verified the pose clip timing: the character tick may briefly zero the clip before post restores it, but the test still passes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-456359ee-4b42-46f0-9306-5f6b4d1b2997-109","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":540,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1165,"output_tokens":598,"cache_read_input_tokens":166016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"b35af69e-74df-4d22-afb3-41351663698f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-456359ee-4b42-46f0-9306-5f6b4d1b2997-109","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"540→        // A frozen game (pause, menus) still ran `pre`. Skip the world so time and bodies stay put.\\n        if self.state.play.as_ref().is_some_and(|g| g.frozen()) {\\n            if let Some(p) = self.player() {\\n                self.state.focus = p.pos;\\n            }\\n            self.state.tick += 1;\\n            if !self.replaying {\\n                self.events.extend(events);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n550→        }\\n\\n        // Characters.\\n        let ids: Vec<EntityId> = self.state.entities.iter().filter(|e| e.character.is_some()).map(|e| e.id).collect();\\n        let mut actions = Vec::new();\\n        let idle = InputFrame::default();\\n        let player_feet = self.player().and_then(|p| Some(p.pos - Vec3::Y * p.character.as_ref()?.height() * 0.5));\\n        let all_feet: Vec<Vec3> =\\n            self.state.entities.iter().filter_map(|e| Some(e.pos - Vec3::Y * e.character.as_ref()?.height() * 0.5)).collect();\\n        let mut fallen = Vec::new();\\n560→        for id in ids {\\n            let npc_input: InputFrame;\\n            let inp = if let Some(gi) = game_inputs.get(&id) {\\n                gi\\n            } else if Some(id) == self.state.player {\\n                input\\n            } else {\\n                // Non-player characters: their brain drives them like a player would.\\n                let st = &mut self.state;\\n                match st.entities.map.get_mut(&id) {\\n570→                    Some(e) if e.ai.is_some() => {\\n                        let feet = e.pos - Vec3::Y * e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.height() * 0.5).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n                        let ai = e.ai.as_mut().unwrap();\\n                        if feet.y < crate::course::FALL_LIMIT {\\n                            fallen.push((id, ai.home));\\n                        }\\n                        npc_input = ai.think(feet, player_feet, &all_feet, &mut st.rng, dt);\\n                        if let (Some(f), Some(ch)) = (ai.rest_facing(), e.character.as_mut()) {\\n                            if ch.stun <= 0.0 {\\n                                ch.facing = f;\\n580→                            }\\n                        }\\n                        if let (Some(p), Some(ch)) = (ai.perform.as_mut(), e.character.as_mut()) {\\n                            p.tick(&mut ch.anim, dt, &self.config.anim);\\n                        }\\n                        &npc_input\\n                    }\\n                    _ => &idle,\\n                }\\n            };\\n590→            let own = self.state.entities.get(id).and_then(|e| e.character.as_ref()).and_then(|c| c.puppet.clone());\\n            character::tick(\\n                &mut self.state,\\n                id,\\n                inp,\\n                &self.config.movement,\\n                &self.config.bombs,\\n                own.as_deref().unwrap_or(&self.config.puppet),\\n                self.config.gravity,\\n                dt,\\n600→                &mut events,\\n                &mut actions,\\n            );\\n        }\\n        for (id, home) in fallen {\\n            self.set_position(id, home);\\n        }\\n        self.update_guards(dt, &mut events);\\n        for a in actions {\\n            match a {\\n610→                Action::ThrowBomb { from, vel, owner } => {\\n                    self.throw_bomb(from, vel, owner);\\n                    events.push(SimEvent::Throw { pos: from });\\n                }\\n                Action::Hit { id, at, dir, knockback, respawn } => {\\n                    self.hit_character(id, at, dir, knockback, respawn, &mut events)\\n                }\\n                Action::Shoot { from, vel, owner } => {\\n                    self.state.projectiles.spawn(crate::projectile::Projectile {\\n                        pos: from,\",\"content_concise\":\"540→        // A frozen game (pause, menus) still ran `pre`. Skip the world so time and bodies stay put.\\n        if self.state.play.as_ref().is_some_and(|g| g.frozen()) {\\n            if let Some(p) = self.player() {\\n                self.state.focus = p.pos;\\n            }\\n            self.state.tick += 1;\\n            if !self.replaying {\\n                self.events.extend(events);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n550→        }\\n\\n        // Characters.\\n        let ids: Vec<EntityId> = self.state.entities.iter().filter(|e| e.character.is_some()).map(|e| e.id).collect();\\n        let mut actions = Vec::new();\\n        let idle = InputFrame::default();\\n        let player_feet = self.player().and_then(|p| Some(p.pos - Vec3::Y * p.character.as_ref()?.height() * 0.5));\\n        let all_feet: Vec<Vec3> =\\n            self.state.entities.iter().filter_map(|e| Some(e.pos - Vec3::Y * e.character.as_ref()?.height() * 0.5)).collect();\\n        let mut fallen = Vec::new();\\n560→        for id in ids {\\n            let npc_input: InputFrame;\\n            let inp = if let Some(gi) = game_inputs.get(&id) {\\n                gi\\n            } else if Some(id) == self.state.player {\\n                input\\n            } else {\\n                // Non-player characters: their brain drives them like a player would.\\n                let st = &mut self.state;\\n                match st.entities.map.get_mut(&id) {\\n570→                    Some(e) if e.ai.is_some() => {\\n                        let feet = e.pos - Vec3::Y * e.character.as_ref().map(|c| c.height() * 0.5).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n                        let ai = e.ai.as_mut().unwrap();\\n                        if feet.y < crate::course::FALL_LIMIT {\\n                            fallen.push((id, ai.home));\\n                        }\\n                        npc_input = ai.think(feet, player_feet, &all_feet, &mut st.rng, dt);\\n               