{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_868","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"game_post runs after the character tick.\n\nPost applies the pose clip after character tick. The renderer sees the pose at t=0. Next frame the character advances clip_t and the pose animates. If idle logic overwrites the clip before post, post restores it. Tests pass. Waiting for monitor notification.\n\nThe turn can be ended now. The monitor notification will wake me in the next turn. I could also review fit.json for format issues that would break clip parsing.\n\nChecking the clip parser for required keys. fit.json is baked into the binary at compile time via include_str, so editing it after compilation requires a rebuild.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-322612fe-b086-4e60-ad27-7503b2136b90-111","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"deny_unknown_fields|format.*1|fn parse","glob":"**/clips.rs","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":329,"output_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":168576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c28ab008-28a8-4730-9bec-b98421ebd505"}
