{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_871","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reading STAGE.md to begin the workflow.","signature":"oNqmfAdpk4ywT1PmSfXTiC7wgBMZ1rMUFnPDEx16xqAqJas8tYTyyfrfHc3n5iS4MjOqlrhpiyyJZNE6inEj53hC97q6zpK8x3yIBudOgs1TRbB4PVBOgjR9jJBF1PKueBIDQ+sHXTmwcm06q+XATGKR/lNTiZ4N4m5oWjRBw0MELktQ2Z/475Svfbvgy0seGdbyhror8C8qsxA/ERUn7TH1eHewo6MPUEIESzLmkeVN4XhW3KPf4jIyt0XAfohwHMeKfOo/xbOUr8FMnA"},{"type":"text","text":"The eight panel gaps are wired into the sim, and a cold build of the real-path tests is running.\n\nMenus page past the first screen, pad left/right moves the live sliders, and Dev Mode can jump, cheat, and change the clock. Big Stand goes silent and shows the fake skip line, the finale age drops with the score, and the eyes-closed check hides the puck and plays a tone. Poses, wardrobe, calendar, beach props, and island mats are in the same build.\n\nThe name, outfit, schedule, slider, eyes, stillness, finale, pose, and mat tests drive those menus and buttons. I'll fix whatever that run reports, then run the full sim suite."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":696,"output_tokens":180,"cache_read_input_tokens":172032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cd10fc80-a8c4-4a83-8b8f-cf1ee4f48433"}
