{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_876","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 11 targeted tests passed, including the finale.\n\nThe simulation finished in 52 seconds. Next I will run the full fit test suite twice, plus the pav_app slider and pav_audio/pav_ui tests. Then I will handle browser, captures, repack HTML, hub tests, static hand-in, PROGRESS, and delete target last.\n\nI will run the full fit suite next. It includes bot_earns_two_stars across many events and seeds plus three story playthroughs, so it may take a while. I will also kill the monitor process if it is still running.\n\nI will read the verification plan in PLAN.md and the goal plan while the full suite runs. The two full test runs will be sequential cargo invocations in one shell.\n\nThe full fit suite should finish in under a minute. I will also run the pav_core lib save tests, since they are part of the in-repo tests.\n\nI will skip the full pav_core library tests to keep the run focused. I will check PLAN.md verification steps and kill the monitor before starting the cargo suite.\n\nThe eight gaps are now verified at the simulation level. The full suite will catch regressions in credits bot, story, and medley. I am starting the two sequential runs now and reading the verification plan in parallel. I need to ensure both runs log as identical \"N passed, 0 failed\" results.\n\nI will run the tests without `-q` so failure names are visible in the log. The suite is only 18 tests, so the output will be short.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3c132ad-c68a-439b-ac73-9de333a384a4-118","name":"kill_command_or_subagent","input":{"task_id":"b9d7dc60-c314-4768-b0f4-ab1cf40658a4"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3c132ad-c68a-439b-ac73-9de333a384a4-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## Verification","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112