,32,111,117,116,46,32,96,83,101,115,115,105,111,110,58,58,114,101,110,100,101,114,95,117,105,96,32,97,110,100,32,96,114,101,97,100,95,117,105,96,32,100,111,32,116,104,101,32,119,111,114,107,59,32,96,114,101,110,100,101,114,96,32,115,116,97,121,115,32,119,105,116,104,111,117,116,32,85,73,32,40,102,105,108,109,115,116,114,105,112,115,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":30,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":289,\"content\":\"**Hand-keyed clips (verified feasible).** Write readable key poses into `engine/anim/fit.json`. Test without rebuilding: in `pav repl` run `anim_reload`, then `animsheet clip=FIT/Tree frames=1 size=300 out=out/tree.png`. The build embeds every `anim/*.json`. A tree pose, a warrior lunge and a squat were recognisable at the first attempt:\"},{\"line_number\":304,\"content\":\"**Make:** Breath, Squat, Tree (Heron), Warrior (Lunge), Lighthouse, DeckChair, Bridge, Seated, ArmFlail (upper body), Stumble, StepL, StepR, HipCircle, CarryTray, Tuck, DiveEntry, Flop, Bow, Sleep, Wake, Sigh. Check motion with `filmstrip` and `animsheet`.\"},{\"line_number\":335,\"content\":\"**Route: egui in `pav_ui`, painter-drawn, no default windows.** This was verified at 1920x1080: rounded fonts, soft-shadow cards and painted glyphs look right and appear in headless `pav capture`. Keep all UI state in the sim (section 14), so tests can drive it.\"},{\"line_number\":526,\"content\":\"- `pav capture ... width=1920 height=1080`: about 0.5 s. `pav play bot=true seeds=5`: under 1 s.\"},{\"line_number\":578,\"content\":\"**Second player:** the harness's copies, the only multi-player check possible on one computer. **TV:** judge 1920x1080 `pav capture`s.\"},{\"line_number\":580,\"content\":\"**Screenshots** only for what scripts cannot check: `pav capture` for composition, `filmstrip` and `animsheet` for motion, one 1080p sheet per set at the end. Do not use subagents or workflows to debate, review, judge or audit.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"The island is one room, `hub.toml`, placed by `build()`. A new mat is another cluster of props in that file (or a second room whose origin sits 200 m away, the way `RoomDef` placement already works). Give the zone a water colour if it is a pool. Do not put the set in `engine/rooms/`: that folder feeds the pavilion demo. `pav capture scene=fit` shows the result.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"parameters, rewind, record and replay, capture screenshots, filmstrips and audio, benchmark):\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/AGENTS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":164,\"content\":\"pav capture scene=test ticks=300 out=out/a.png\"},{\"line_number\":174,\"content\":\"  `filmstrip` tiles N frames into one PNG: the cheapest way to check motion and animation.\"},{\"line_number\":195,\"content\":\"  `turntable`, `animsheet`, and `campaign from=1 to=12 wall=300` (the bot plays down through the\"},{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"room_reset room_check room_reload stream signal filmstrip camera_bench course feel audio_capture`;\"},{\"line_number\":205,\"content\":\"loot_roll give inventory game_cmd ui tree tree_map genome bestiary boss turntable animsheet level\"},{\"line_number\":227,\"content\":\"`pav room_check path=rooms/<key>.toml`; look at it with `pav capture scene=<key>` (the room alone,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/scripts/smoke-animation-studio.py\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":176,\"content\":\"            client.call(\\\"filmstrip\\\", {\\\"frames\\\": 8, \\\"every\\\": 12, \\\"columns\\\": 4, \\\"width\\\": 240, \\\"height\\\": 240,\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"                                      \\\"out\\\": str(out / \\\"filmstrip.png\\\")}, image=out / \\\"filmstrip.png\\\")\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"            checks.append(\\\"MCP returns a filmstrip from the same studio renderer\\\")\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/PROGRESS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"  `animsheet`).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/START_HERE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":54,\"content\":\"./target/debug/pav capture scene=world ticks=60 width=640 height=360 out=out/pavilion.png\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/scripts/package-animation-studio.py\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"Inspect before each edit and use the returned revision. Capture a filmstrip\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/ESCALATIONS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"  be rebuilt from `animsheet` sheets with `scripts/review_page.py` when the user wants it.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/DESIGN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":150,\"content\":\"  - capture: screenshots, filmstrips (many frames tiled into one image), timing reports and `.wav` audio;\"},{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"   - filmstrip capture.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/GAME.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"- `pav_tools` adds the game tools: `hero`, `give`, `monster`, `turntable`, `animsheet`,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/COOP_PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":409,\"content\":\"- *Unverified:* that every clip plays on all three heroes' puppets. Check with `animsheet` in\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/MAKE_A_GAME.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"pav capture scene=starter ticks=120 width=640 height=360 out=out/starter.png\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"| What's on screen? | `capture width=640 height=360 out=out/a.png`; `filmstrip` for motion in one image; to watch the bot, repeat `play bot=true ticks=30` and `capture` in a `pav repl` |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/CREATURE_STUDIO.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":107,\"content\":\"| `filmstrip` | Capture several stage frames in one image. |\"},{\"line_number\":302,\"content\":\"For a motion sheet, set `playing=true` and call `filmstrip` with `frames` and `every`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/docs/HISTORY.md\",\"matc