11,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":8,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2416,\"content\":\"        self.about_lines().len()\"},{\"line_number\":2420,\"content\":\"        let lines = self.about_lines();\"},{\"line_number\":2427,\"content\":\"    fn about_lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\"},{\"line_number\":2428,\"content\":\"        about_from_blob(&self.about_blob).unwrap_or_else(|| ABOUT_FALLBACK.iter().map(|s| (*s).to_string()).collect())\"},{\"line_number\":2448,\"content\":\"const ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&str; 4] = [\"},{\"line_number\":2449,\"content\":\"    \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":2452,\"content\":\"    \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":2472,\"content\":\"        \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\".into(),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"787bcaf0-0bcd-4d43-a16a-2a86793001eb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_907","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No test asserts the exact credits string.\n\nUpdating credits to mention hand-keyed exercise poses and the exit-interview. Will run fit tests first to confirm 18 pass, then wasm pack. The shipped text lint skips mod.rs.\n\nCredits will read \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed. Coaches are original.\" The animation description and first testingFeedback line are also being updated.\n\nThe first testingFeedback line lists six defects: a gust check mismatch, an egui texture delta on the floor, a private intent module, fonts bound in the same draw pass, a boolean hub ghost field, and About pages that did not turn.\n\nEight more build defects were found: sliders that never moved, Dev Mode with no jump, missing cheats or time scale, a stuck free-play schedule, a Big Stand that kept its song, an eyes-closed check with no tone, name and outfit lists capped at six, and a beach missing props and exercise poses. A drag path failed to compile because a set lookup wanted a reference. The second testingFeedback line flags three critical issues: the font panic and texture-delta panic both stop the browser frame loop.\n\nThe exit-interview credits now note that seven events could not be started, and a morning age of 41 to 50 could not reach the rowboat even after a strong finale.\n\ntestingFeedback[2] will keep its bot-playthrough wording. testingFeedback[3] keeps the 1080p line.\n\nengineFeedback[4] is being appended with \"Fit pointer drags emit slider values. Hand-keyed clips play the exercise poses.\"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The slider drag test passed. I’ll correct the About credits line and the interview so they match the poses, then rebuild."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-25","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library.\",\n    \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\",\n    \"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\",\n    \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\",","new_string":"    \"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed.\",\n    \"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\",\n    \"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\",\n    \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed. Coaches are original.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-26","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\".into(),","new_string":"        \"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed. Coaches are original.\".into(),"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-27","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"animation\": \"Engine puppet, tilted about the feet by the balance dot. Motion clips are the engine library.\",","new_string":"    \"animation\": \"The engine puppet tilts about the feet from the balance dot. Exercise poses are hand-keyed clips on that puppet: Tree, Warrior, Fold, Squat, Plank and Bloom.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-28","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Six defects showed up in testing: a gust check that did not match the acceleration model, an egui texture delta dropped on the floor, a private intent module, fonts bound in the same pass that drew them, a hub ghost field that was a boolean, and About pages that did not turn.\",\n    \"One was critical. The font and texture-delta panic stops the browser frame loop, so the page sits there with a status that never ticks.\",\n    \"The most helpful test was the bot playthrough: three seeds from New Stay to the credits, plus each event on five seeds against an idle player.\",","new_string":"    \"Fifteen defects showed up in testing. The first six were a gust check that did not match the acceleration model, an egui texture delta dropped on the floor, a private intent module, fonts bound in the same pass that drew them, a hub ghost field that was a boolean, and About pages that did not turn. A review of that build found eight more: sliders that never moved, Dev Mode with no jump, cheats or time scale, a free-play schedule stuck on the first four events, a Big Stand that kept its song and never showed the fake skip or the final age cut, an eyes-closed check with no tone, name and outfit lists that stopped at six, and a beach with no props or exercise poses. The drag path then failed to compile because a set lookup wanted a reference.\",\n    \"Three were critical. The font and texture-delta panic stops the browser frame loop, so the page sits there with a status that never ticks. After credits, seven events could not be started. A morning age of 41 to 50 could not reach the rowboat even after a strong finale.\",\n    \"The most helpful test was the bot playthrough: three seeds from New Stay to the credits, plus each event on five seeds against an idle player. The later menu tests drive the real pad and pointer path, including a held pointer on a slider row.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-29","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"frozen() returns early inside the tick. InputFrame gained lean, device, ui and hub. The HUD carries the fit UI and a status string. The mixer plays song beds. The page bridge publishes status. Captures composite the fit UI. Puppets tilt about the feet. Splash and a silent wake were added for the lagoon.\",","new_string":"    \"frozen() returns early inside the tick. InputFrame gained lean, device, ui and hub. The HUD carries the fit UI and a status string. The mixer plays song beds. The page bridge publishes status. Captures composite the fit UI. Puppets tilt about the feet. Splash and a silent wake were added for the lagoon. Fit pointer drags emit slider values. Hand-keyed clips play the exercise poses. The beach room gained dressing with no collision.\","}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2173,"output_tokens":2347,"cache_read_input_tokens":79232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"8f375f00-ad46-4eec-9c18-2683b77fe765"}
