on clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\",\",\"old_line\":2449,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Source: a balance-and-wellness resort, in the spirit of Wii Fit by Nintendo. Usage: added on import. Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are on this screen. Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed.\\\",\\n    \\\"Five days, one mat, no scales. Lean, and the dot follows. No scales, no meal plans, no body scores.\\\",\\n    \\\"Testing Feedback: three seeds reach the credits with every stamp; each event is scored on five seeds; attract, pause, sliders, save, medley and the podium run in the sim. Browser checks use Playwright. A blank 1080p WebGPU photo is a readback limit; 320 by 180 is the timing check. Engine Feedback: one balance model, pause returns inside the tick, and music is the same mixer. Fonts must be installed a pass before they are drawn. Prompt Feedback: the full roster ships. The plan's time-cut list was not used. Plan filenames were guidance.\\\",\\n    \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed. Coaches are original.\\\",\",\"new_line\":2449,\"context_before\":\"}\\n\\nconst ABOUT_FALLBACK: [&str; 4] = [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"];\\n\\nfn about_from_blob(blob: &str) -> Option<Vec<String>> {\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0d985d44-136b-4827-a16e-41c60f8383d2-26","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Motion clips are the engine library. Coaches are original.\\\".into(),\",\"new_string\":\"        \\\"Fredoka and Nunito are SIL OFL. Exercise poses are hand-keyed. Coaches are original.\\\".into(),\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"too