{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_917","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"View and Save are real PLAN requirements.\n\nSave will reset the current guest slot's progress and write it. View will show lean and button inputs in the HUD, plus a dot trace of recent cob positions.\n\nEngine stats overlay, free camera, and ghost lanes are also required. The plan is to add menu rows that toggle flags in FitGame and FitUi, then verify state changes through the simulation test. The painter must render the dot trace and stats overlay to satisfy visual criteria.\n\nView and Save are deferred until verification finishes. The current acceptance criterion is Pause freezing the world and opening Dev Mode with jump, cheats, time scale, live sliders for PLAN.md §11 tunables, and reset to defaults.\n\nStarting browser.py now. It will log to tests-browser.log and run with python3 -u. Other agents are compiling, so the browser may be killed by earlyoom. View and Save remain deferred until verification finishes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b677d2dd-8bb6-4224-a5de-17d027f4560e-45","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"sliders","content":"sliders: Wire live sliders through real pad/drag input and test that path","status":"completed"},{"id":"reverify","content":"reverify: Retest, recapture, repack HTML, refresh PROGRESS","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b677d2dd-8bb6-4224-a5de-17d027f4560e-46","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"LOG=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-browser.log\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132\"\ncd \"$DEV\" || exit 1\n{\n  echo \"=== browser $(date -Is) ===\"\n  python3 -u tests/browser.py\n  echo EXIT:$?\n} > \"$LOG\" 2>&1\necho SHELL:$? >> \"$LOG\"","description":"Run browser and capture checks","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4991,"output_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":101504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"6ff3a8a7-ba9e-48f0-8018-d7d74e4ed037"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b677d2dd-8bb6-4224-a5de-17d027f4560e-45","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] sliders: sliders: Wire live sliders through real pad/drag input and test that path\\n- [completed] devmode: devmode: Dev Mode: jump, cheats, time scale, plus sliders\\n- [completed] schedule: schedule: Free-play schedule pages all events, not take(4)\\n- [completed] bigstand: bigstand: Big Stand skip prompt, silent bed, final age formula\\n- [completed] eyes: eyes: Morning check eyes-closed tone and hidden puck\\n- [completed] menus: menus: Name and outfit menus page past the first six\\n- [completed] props: props: Beach/wellness props, poses, wardrobe and calendar\\n- [in_progress] reverify: reverify: Retest, recapture, repack HTML, refresh PROGRESS\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"sliders: Wire live sliders through real pad/drag input and test that path\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"devmode: Dev Mode: jump, cheats, time scale, plus sliders\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"schedule: Free-play schedule pages all events, not take(4)\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"bigstand: Big Stand skip prompt, silent bed, final age formula\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"eyes: Morning check eyes-closed tone and hidden puck\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"menus: Name and outfit menus page past the first six\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"props: Beach/wellness props, poses, wardrobe and calendar\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"reverify: Retest, recapture, repack HTML, refresh PROGRESS\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"sliders\":{\"content\":\"sliders: Wire live sliders through real