{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_927","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hub tests passed all six cases, including byte-match, 2/3/4 players, host-leave, and solo.\n\nI will update PROGRESS.md and the goal plan checkboxes for re-passed steps. I will delete engine/target last. I may generate a filmstrip from the pose captures to strengthen evidence.\n\nThe filmstrip must be generated before deleting target. I will check if the pav binary exists and use it directly to capture four pose frames.\n\nI will capture pose frames at ticks 200, 420, 700, and 1000 using the pav binary. I will verify session.js is 16707 bytes. I will check the goal plan file in the session goal folder to mark completed steps.\n\nThe shared balance model, remaining events, synthesized music, wardrobe, and full script are all verified as done. View and Save remain unimplemented.\n\nThe final checklist item is complete except for deleting the build cache. View and Save tabs are missing from the dev shell per PLAN §11, so those checkboxes will remain unchecked.\n\nI am weighing whether to implement the missing View and Save tabs. They are not in the goal plan acceptance criteria, so I could skip them. Adding them would require code changes, tests, repacking WASM, and rerunning browser and hub tests. That is roughly fifteen minutes of work with risk of breaking the green build. The next check is the eight gaps.\n\nThe eight gaps are fixed and verified. View and Save were not in the rejection criteria, so they are now included in the remaining PLAN.md work. The dev page is full with six items, so adding View and Save tabs will require fitting them into the existing layout.\n\nA third dev page could hold View and Save. The home menu uses a fixed two-page array, so a third page must be added.\n\nRealizing View would need several features: an input viewer showing lean position and buttons, a dot trace of recent cob points drawn by the painter, engine stats like tick and time scale on the HUD, and a free camera mode.\n\nI decided not to implement the missing View and Save tabs. Adding them would require camera, painter, and HUD changes that risk breaking the green browser test. I will document this omission in notes/decisions.md instead.\n\nI will check notes/decisions.md for any existing note about leaving View and Save out. The goal requires doing everything in PLAN.md that can be done, so omitting those tabs could violate the goal. I also confirmed that using Dev mode as a pause menu is an accepted deviation.\n\nI will check the camera code to gauge how risky adding View and Save would be. If it requires more than about a hundred lines of risky changes, I will ship the verified build as-is and honestly record the gap in PROGRESS.md. I will not claim the game is finished until verification actually holds.\n\nThe verification plan steps do not require View or Save tabs. The evaluator will only check the eight gaps and the verified features. I will ship the build as-is.\n\nI will implement the missing View and Save dev tabs. Leaving them out would violate the goal of doing everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80bee95-5323-4a29-b128-bdd19f240cb6-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn sync_camera|free_cam|fn draw\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80bee95-5323-4a29-b128-bdd19f240cb6-63","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":597,"output_tokens":2007,"cache_read_input_tokens":119936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"pa