e/crates/pav_render/src/fx.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":644,\"content\":\"    pub fn draw(&self, pass: &mut wgpu::RenderPass<'_>) -> bool {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_render/src/upscale.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":119,\"content\":\"    pub(crate) fn draw(&mut self, device: &wgpu::Device, encoder: &mut wgpu::CommandEncoder, target: &wgpu::TextureView) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/touch.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":406,\"content\":\"    pub fn draw(&mut self, ctx: &egui::Context, v: &View) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"pub fn draw(ctx: &egui::Context, ui: &FitUi) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/session.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":212,\"content\":\"    pub fn sync_camera(&mut self) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/gfx.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":141,\"content\":\"    pub fn draw(&mut self, scene: &Scene, ui: Option<(&[egui::ClippedPrimitive], &mut egui::TexturesDelta, f32)>) -> bool {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2203,\"content\":\"    fn draw(builder: &mut ViewBuilder, o: &RenderObject) -> Scene {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/import/raster.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":128,\"content\":\"pub fn draw(tris: &[Tri], view: &View, win: &Window) -> Image {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d80bee95-5323-4a29-b128-bdd19f240cb6-63","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- Name, look, and outfit menus page six at a time. The ids stay absolute, so a later page can still pick Gray, Swim, and Golden.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\\n- On a splash round the page calls `AIHub.ready()` when connect resolves. Waiting for `__gameStatus` left the fourth software-WebGPU copy past the harness's 20s ready gate. A later `ready()` is a no-op.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- Name, look, and outfit menus page six at a time. The ids stay absolute, so a later page can still pick Gray, Swim, and Golden.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\\n- On a splash round the page calls `AIHub.ready()` when connect resolves. Waiting for `__gameStatus` left the fourth software-WebGPU copy past the harness's 20s ready gate. A later `ready()` is a no-op.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/notes/decisions.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"- Last input device wins. Touch does not leave attract and does not count as a real controller.\\n- Hub ghosts are drawn in the view from `window.__hub.ghosts`. The sim only publishes its own sample, so a session stays deterministic.\\n- Long tests set `history_seconds` to 0. A normal boot keeps 8 seconds of rewind.\\n- About text comes from `#about-data` when the page sets it. Native runs keep a readable fallback with the same headings.\\n- Name, look, and outfit menus page six at a time. The ids stay absolute, so a later page can still pick Gray, Swim, and Golden.\\n- Big Stand uses music bed 3 and the credits use bed 6. That is the sim's song map. Long Stillness is song 0, which stops the bed.\\n- On a splash round the page calls `AIHub.ready()` when connect resolves. Waiting for `__gameStatus` left the fourth software-WebGPU copy past the harness's 20s ready gate. A later `ready()` is a no-op.\\n\",\"total_lines\":7}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ae343482-0078-49b7-b68e-f3385d167e15"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_928","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"View and Save are still missing.\n\nThe verification plan and eight gaps are complete. Adding View and Save now would invalidate the packed HTML and browser/hub proof, so a next skeptic would flag them. The plan is to implement a focused version, re-run targeted tests and one fit suite, repack, and re-run browser and hub checks. Alternatively, View could be built as menu toggles affecting published status and the fit UI without a full camera rewrite.\n\nAdding View and Save would require repacking the WASM binary. Browser tests must recapture poses after repack because the proof must match the shipped HTML. The total cost is roughly 13 minutes: implementation and a simulation test, repacking, browser recapture, and hub verification.\n\nThe plan is to proceed with the smallest correct implementation. FitGame will gain five boolean fields for view toggles, and Dev tabs 5 and 6 will map to View and Save. The home menu needs a new page with View, Save, and Back options, though existing tab increment logic and story bot behavior must be handled carefully.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8ae90c85-067d-4161-9713-aa37ecbdf008-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"camera|look_at|orbit","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3212,"output_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":120448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ee996177-6c17-4b0e-a16d-6ce03e88f1f1"}
