{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_932","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only one FitUi literal exists. Optional fields with defaults can be added using `..`.\n\nFitUi lacks Default, so adding fields requires updating the single literal. I'll read the ghost spawn logic and status JSON to add view flags for test assertions. This is the remaining PLAN item to implement. I'll re-verify the HTML after changes. Next, I'll examine the spawn function, status function, and test helpers to write a pause-to-view test.\n\nThe test will toggle input viewer, dot trace, stats, free camera, and ghost lanes. It will assert status and UI state. Then it will open Save, reset the guest, and verify day and score are cleared. I need to check how pause is opened in tests and how status is built. For ghost lanes, the flag should still appear in status even without a ghost. I can spawn a ghost by setting day >= 3 and a ghost sample.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f38bc35d-53df-4035-b57d-6c554be29f1c-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":800,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f38bc35d-53df-4035-b57d-6c554be29f1c-73","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn status\\(|\\\"time_scale\\\"|\\\"clip\\\"","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":587,"output_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":131840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9d5926c2-2aed-4633-a261-be5f7a8a8625"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f38bc35d-53df-4035-b57d-6c554be29f1c-72","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"800→    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_ghost(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, kind: EventId) {\\n        if self.day < 3 || self.run != Run::Story {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let zone = zone_of(kind);\\n        let have = self.ghosts.keys().any(|k| EventId::from_key(k).map(zone_of) == Some(zone));\\n        if !have {\\n            return;\\n810→        }\\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);\\n        let id = sim.spawn_npc(\\\"yesterday\\\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\\n        self.ghost_id = Some(id);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn kind_now(&self) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.kind)\\n    }\\n\\n820→    fn finish_play(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() else { return };\\n        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n830→                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n840→                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\",\"content_concise\":\"800→    }\\n\\n    fn maybe_ghost(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, kind: EventId) {\\n        if self.day < 3 || self.run != Run::Story {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let zone = zone_of(kind);\\n        let have = self.ghosts.keys().any(|k| EventId::from_key(k).map(zone_of) == Some(zone));\\n        if !have {\\n            return;\\n810→        }\\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);\\n        let id = sim.spawn_npc(\\\"yesterday\\\", feet, 0.0, PuppetDef::default(), None, None);\\n        self.ghost_id = Some(id);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn kind_now(&self) -> Option<EventId> {\\n        self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.kind)\\n    }\\n\\n820→    fn finish_play(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        let Some(kind) = self.kind_now() else { return };\\n        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n830→                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n840→                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/d