{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_933","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ghost already spawns at an offset lane.\n\nThe lane effect shifts the ghost further right when active. Testing this requires toggling lanes and spawning a ghost, which is too heavy. A simpler test approach is preferable.\n\nThe plan covers three tests: toggling dev menu rows to verify status flags, confirming free camera yaw during events, and checking that save resets day and stamps. I need to inspect the Slot struct and write_slot to determine what reset clears.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3356ad03-48ae-43ce-934a-b425204a8a93-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":180,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3356ad03-48ae-43ce-934a-b425204a8a93-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":2140,"limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3356ad03-48ae-43ce-934a-b425204a8a93-76","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn write_slot|struct Slot|fn read_slot","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1351,"output_tokens":672,"cache_read_input_tokens":132352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ccc8ecf6-41fd-43dc-9ce7-9f3b7588eda8"}
