{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_935","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A `reset_progress` function already exists.\n\nDrafting a `reset_guest` method that clears the current slot's progress while preserving the guest's name, skin, and outfit.\n\nThe reset clears all progress fields: day, stars, stamps, completed days, age, bests, played history, flips, golden status, free play, ghosts, ending, today's plays, score, and stars.\n\nThe reset method also clears the active action and increments the save serial before writing the slot.\n\nTrace recording needs to be added at balance update points like `play_post` or `tick_activity`, capped at 32 entries.\n\nThe camera yaw for free view mode should add 0.8 to the existing yaw value.\n\nAn overlay string is being built from bits.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-30b9d7cc-d355-4374-ad7a-c3b240fb32e8-79","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn play_post|fn post\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1922,"output_tokens":844,"cache_read_input_tokens":135680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"17ce1608-53fb-4d52-9d92-146bb32761cc"}
