{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-45801914-6ac7-47f7-8f6e-55d73cc135fc-80","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"2116→    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.apply_body(sim);\\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        match self.flow {\\n2120→            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Attract => {\\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\\n2130→            }\\n            Flow::Island => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n2140→\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        Vec::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\",\"content_concise\":\"2116→    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.apply_body(sim);\\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        match self.flow {\\n2120→            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Attract => {\\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\\n2130→            }\\n            Flow::Island => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n2140→\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        Vec::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"offset\":2116,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"    fn post(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n        self.apply_body(sim);\\n        let scaled = dt * self.time_scale.max(0.0);\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                if self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events) && self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.finish_play(sim);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Attract => {\\n                let _ = self.tick_activity(sim, scaled, events);\\n            }\\n            Flow::Island => {\\n                if self.run != Run::Demo {\\n                    self.world_time += scaled;\\n                }\\n                self.collect_flops(sim, events);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        Vec::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n\",\"total_lines\":2518}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-45801914-6ac7-47f7-8f6e-55d73cc135fc-81","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Headless Tippy Cay. These tests drive the shipped sim, not a copy of it.\\n\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::FitGame;\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::TITLE;\\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\\nuse pav_core::glam::Vec2;\\nuse pav_core::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\\nuse pav_core::puppet::HelmKind;\\nuse pav_core::sim::Sim;\\n10→use serde_json::Value;\\n\\nfn boot(scene: &str, seed: u64) -> Sim {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(scene, seed).unwrap_or_else(|e| panic!(\\\"boot {scene}: {e:#}\\\"));\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    sim\\n}\\n\\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> Value {\\n    sim.play().expect(\\\"game\\\").status(sim)\\n20→}\\n\\nfn phase(sim: &Sim) -> String {\\n    status(sim)[\\\"phase\\\"].as_str().unwrap_or(\\\"\\\").to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_until(sim: &mut Sim, pred: impl Fn(&Sim) -> bool, cap: u64) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..cap {\\n        if pred(sim) {\\n            return true;\\n30→        }\\n        let input = sim.bot_input();\\n        sim.step(&input);\\n    }\\n    pred(sim)\\n}\\n\\nfn press(bits: u32) -> InputFrame {\\n    InputFrame { pressed: bits, held: bits, ..Default::default() }\\n}\\n40→\\nfn label_hit(label: &str, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    if needle.ends_with('x') && needle.chars().next().is_some_and(|c| c.is_ascii_digit()) {\\n        label.split_whitespace().any(|word| word == needle)\\n    } else {\\n        label.contains(needle)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ui_of(sim: &Sim) -> pav_core::fit_ui::FitUi {\\n50→    sim.play().unwrap().fit_ui(sim).unwrap()\\n}\\n\\n/// Move focus onto `needle` with the pad. Pages with the shoulder when the row is off-screen.\\nfn seek(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..48 {\\n        let ui = ui_of(sim);\\n        let labels: Vec<String> = ui.items.iter().map(|it| it.label.clone()).collect();\\n        let focus = ui.items.iter().find(|it| it.id == ui.focus).map(|it| it.label.clone()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if label_hit(&focus, needle) {\\n60→            return true;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = labels.iter().position(|label| label_hit(label, needle)) {\\n            let fi = ui.items.iter().position(|it| it.id == ui.focus).unwrap_or(0);\\n            let bits = if fi < i { buttons::MENU_DOWN } else { buttons::MENU_UP };\\n            sim.step(&press(bits));\\n        } else {\\n            sim.step(&press(buttons::TAB_R));\\n        }\\n    }\\n70→    false\\n}\\n\\nfn pick(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) {\\n    assert!(seek(sim, needle), \\\"missing {needle} on {}\\\", phase(sim));\\n    sim.step(&press(buttons::CONFIRM));\\n}\\n\\nconst EVENTS: [&str; 13] = [\\n    \\\"check\\\", \\\"breath\\\", \\\"pose\\\", \\\"squat\\\", \\\"plank\\\", \\\"step\\\", \\\"floatie\\\", \\\"lap\\\", \\\"tide\\\", \\\"paddle\\\", \\\"tray\\\", \\\"cannon\\\", \\\"bigstand\\\",\\n80→];\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Headless Tippy Cay. These tests drive the shipped sim, not a copy of it.\\n\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::FitGame;\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::TITLE;\\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\\nuse pav_core::glam::Vec2;\\nuse pav_core::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\\nuse pav_core::puppet::HelmKind;\\nuse pav_core::sim::Sim;\\n10→use serde_json::Value;\\n\\nfn boot(scene: &str, seed: u64) -> Sim {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(scene, seed).unwrap_or_else(|e| panic!(\\\"boot {scene}: {e:#}\\\"));\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    sim\\n}\\n\\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> Value {\\n    sim.play().expect(\\\"game\\\").status(sim)\\n20→}\\n\\nfn phase(sim: &Sim) -> String {\\n    status(sim)[\\\"phase\\\"].as_str().unwrap_or(\\\"\\\").to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_until(sim: &mut Sim, pred: impl Fn(&Sim) -> bool, cap: u64) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..cap {\\n        if pred(sim) {\\n            return true;\\n30→        }\\n        let input = sim.bot_input();\\n        sim.step(&input);\\n    }\\n    pred(sim)\\n}\\n\\nfn press(bits: u32) -> InputFrame {\\n    InputFrame { pressed: bits, held: bits, ..Default::default() }\\n}\\n40→\\nfn label_hit(label: &str, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    if needle.ends_with('x') && needle.chars().next().is_some_and(|c| c.is_ascii_digit()) {\\n        label.split_whitespace().any(|word| word == needle)\\n    } else {\\n        label.contains(needle)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ui_of(sim: &Sim) -> pav_core::fit_ui::FitUi {\\n50→    sim.play().unwrap().fit_ui(sim).unwrap()\\n}\\n\\n/// Move focus onto `needle` with the pad. Pages with the shoulder when the row is off-screen.\\nfn seek(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..48 {\\n        let ui = ui_of(sim);\\n        let labels: Vec<String> = ui.items.iter().map(|it| it.label.clone()).collect();\\n        let focus = ui.items.iter().find(|it| it.id == ui.focus).map(|it| it.label.clone()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if label_hit(&focus, needle) {\\n60→            return true;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = labels.iter().position(|label| label_hit(label, needle)) {\\n            let fi = ui.items.iter().position(|it| it.id == ui.focus).unwrap_or(0);\\n            let bits = if fi < i { buttons::MENU_DOWN } else { buttons::MENU_UP };\\n            sim.step(&press(bits));\\n        } else {\\n            sim.step(&press(buttons::TAB_R));\\n        }\\n    }\\n70→    false\\n}\\n\\nfn pick(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) {\\n    assert!(seek(sim, needle), \\\"missing {needle} on {}\\\", phase(sim));\\n    sim.step(&press(buttons::CONFIRM));\\n}\\n\\nconst EVENTS: [&str; 13] = [\\n    \\\"check\\\", \\\"breath\\\", \\\"pose\\\", \\\"squat\\\", \\\"plank\\\", \\\"step\\\", \\\"floatie\\\", \\\"lap\\\", \\\"tide\\\", \\\"paddle\\\", \\\"tray\\\", \\\"cannon\\\", \\\"bigstand\\\",\\n80→];\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"//! Headless Tippy Cay. These tests drive the shipped sim, not a copy of it.\\n\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::FitGame;\\nuse pav_core::games::fit::TITLE;\\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\\nuse pav_core::glam::Vec2;\\nuse pav_core::input::{buttons, InputFrame, UiEvent};\\nuse pav_core::puppet::HelmKind;\\nuse pav_core::sim::Sim;\\nuse serde_json::Value;\\n\\nfn boot(scene: &str, seed: u64) -> Sim {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(scene, seed).unwrap_or_else(|e| panic!(\\\"boot {scene}: {e:#}\\\"));\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    sim\\n}\\n\\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> Value {\\n    sim.play().expect(\\\"game\\\").status(sim)\\n}\\n\\nfn phase(sim: &Sim) -> String {\\n    status(sim)[\\\"phase\\\"].as_str().unwrap_or(\\\"\\\").to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn bot_until(sim: &mut Sim, pred: impl Fn(&Sim) -> bool, cap: u64) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..cap {\\n        if pred(sim) {\\n            return true;\\n        }\\n        let input = sim.bot_input();\\n        sim.step(&input);\\n    }\\n    pred(sim)\\n}\\n\\nfn press(bits: u32) -> InputFrame {\\n    InputFrame { pressed: bits, held: bits, ..Default::default() }\\n}\\n\\nfn label_hit(label: &str, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    if needle.ends_with('x') && needle.chars().next().is_some_and(|c| c.is_ascii_digit()) {\\n        label.split_whitespace().any(|word| word == needle)\\n    } else {\\n        label.contains(needle)\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn ui_of(sim: &Sim) -> pav_core::fit_ui::FitUi {\\n    sim.play().unwrap().fit_ui(sim).unwrap()\\n}\\n\\n/// Move focus onto `needle` with the pad. Pages with the shoulder when the row is off-screen.\\nfn seek(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) -> bool {\\n    for _ in 0..48 {\\n        let ui = ui_of(sim);\\n        let labels: Vec<String> = ui.items.iter().map(|it| it.label.clone()).collect();\\n        let focus = ui.items.iter().find(|it| it.id == ui.focus).map(|it| it.label.clone()).unwrap_or_default();\\n        if label_hit(&focus, needle) {\\n            return true;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(i) = labels.iter().position(|label| label_hit(label, needle)) {\\n            let fi = ui.items.iter().position(|it| it.id == ui.focus).unwrap_or(0);\\n            let bits = if fi < i { buttons::MENU_DOWN } else { buttons::MENU_UP };\\n            sim.step(&press(bits));\\n        } else {\\n            sim.step(&press(buttons::TAB_R));\\n        }\\n    }\\n    false\\n}\\n\\nfn pick(sim: &mut Sim, needle: &str) {\\n    assert!(seek(sim, needle), \\\"missing {needle} on {}\\\", phase(sim));\\n    sim.step(&press(buttons::CONFIRM));\\n}\\n\\nconst EVENTS: [&str; 13] = [\\n    \\\"check\\\", \\\"breath\\\", \\\"pose\\\", \\\"squat\\\", \\\"plank\\\", \\\"step\\\", \\\"floatie\\\", \\\"lap\\\", \\\"tide\\\", \\\"paddle\\\", \\\"tray\\\", \\\"cannon\\\", \\\"bigstand\\\",\\n];\\n\",\"total_lines\":515}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9e6c0436-5b4a-4140-9891-bc863e9ac089"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_937","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a trace push at the start of the post when view_trace is active and the flow is Event, Check, or Attract.\n\nGhost offset will shift feet x based on view_lanes. Painter draws an overlay top-left and trace dots around the puck center. Tests go at the end of fit.rs. Seek uses TAB_R to cycle pages; View is on page 2, so it tabs until there. Labels are \"Input viewer on/off\" for \"Input\" and \"Dot trace on/off\" for \"Dot\".\n\nFour more dev menu labels are planned: Engine stats, Free camera, Ghost lanes, and Reset this guest. The test will verify a new JSON status object with boolean flags for input, trace, stats, free, and lanes. The overlay will display \"Lean\" when input is active. The trace test flow pauses the fit, opens the View menu, picks Input, resumes, steps a few times, and confirms the trace length exceeds zero.\n\nThe remaining dev menu toggles are Dot, Engine, Free, and Ghost. After selecting them, the test presses BACK to root, then picks Save and Reset this guest. It asserts that day equals 1 and stamps equals 0. To prove the reset clears state, it first sets day to 4, stamps to 3, and minutes to 10 before triggering the reset through the menu confirm. The test sequence is: set progress, pause, toggle view items, save, then reset.\n\nSetting prior progress before pausing is acceptable setup. The trace test will boot into an event or pose, pause, enable dot trace, resume, and step ten times with zero input to verify the trace buffer is populated. The overlay will also be checked for stats when that toggle is active.\n\nThe tests will be combined into a single test. After toggling the five view items, the reset guest action clears game progress but leaves the dev view flags untouched, since reset_guest does not call fresh().","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b95b29c6-06c2-4118-bb61-4e10a3cc2580-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn jump_to","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1426,"output_tokens":990,"cache_read_input_tokens":138496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"c8e0ac16-27fc-4b2e-beb3-262e5c72df01"}
