{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2cdc09ca-369d-4e7a-8b3d-4e9cdd898ca8-83","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1305→    fn jump_to(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if (220..240).contains(&id) {\\n            if let Some(kind) = EventId::ALL.get((id - 220) as usize).copied() {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n1310→                self.flow = if kind == EventId::Check { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if (240..=243).contains(&id) {\\n            self.leave_demo();\\n            self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\\n            if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n                act.phase = (id - 239) as u8;\\n1320→                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n            }\\n            self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            self.focus = 0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match id {\\n            244 => self.enter_attract(sim),\\n            245 => {\\n1330→                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.run = Run::Medley;\\n                self.medley_i = 0;\\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            }\\n            246 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n1340→            247..=251 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.day = (id - 246) as u8;\\n                self.today_played.clear();\\n                self.day_minutes = 0;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n1350→\\n    fn leave_demo(&mut self) {\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            self.run = Run::Story;\\n        }\\n        self.demo = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn cheat(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        match id {\\n1360→            230 => self.cheat_no_tips = !self.cheat_no_tips,\\n            231 => self.cheat_auto = !self.cheat_auto,\\n            232 => self.day_minutes = self.day_minutes.saturating_add(5),\\n            233 => self.free_play = true,\\n            234 => self.total_stars = self.total_stars.saturating_add(9),\\n            235 => self.skip_lines = !self.skip_lines,\\n            236 => self.finish_now(sim, true),\\n            237 => self.finish_now(sim, false),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n1370→    }\\n\\n    fn finish_now(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, win: bool) {\\n        if self.act.is_none() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n            act.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n            act.done = true;\\n1380→        }\\n        self.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n        self.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n        if matches!(self.paused_from, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown) {\\n            self.flow = self.paused_from;\",\"content_concise\":\"1305→    fn jump_to(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if (220..240).contains(&id) {\\n            if let Some(kind) = EventId::ALL.get((id - 220) as usize).copied() {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n1310→                self.flow = if kind == EventId::Check { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if (240..=243).contains(&id) {\\n            self.leave_demo();\\n            self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\\n            if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n                act.phase = (id - 239) as u8;\\n1320→                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n            }\\n            self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            self.focus = 0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match id {\\n            244 => self.enter_attract(sim),\\n            245 => {\\n1330→                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.run = Run::Medley;\\n                self.medley_i = 0;\\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            }\\n            246 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n1340→            247..=251 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.day = (id - 246) as u8;\\n                self.today_played.clear();\\n                self.day_minutes = 0;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n1350→\\n    fn leave_demo(&mut self) {\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            self.run = Run::Story;\\n        }\\n        self.demo = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn cheat(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        match id {\\n1360→            230 => self.cheat_no_tips = !self.cheat_no_tips,\\n            231 => self.cheat_auto = !self.cheat_auto,\\n            232 => self.day_minutes = self.day_minutes.saturating_add(5),\\n            233 => self.free_play = true,\\n            234 => self.total_stars = self.total_stars.saturating_add(9),\\n            235 => self.skip_lines = !self.skip_lines,\\n            236 => self.finish_now(sim, true),\\n            237 => self.finish_now(sim, false),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n1370→    }\\n\\n    fn finish_now(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, win: bool) {\\n        if self.act.is_none() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n            act.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n            act.done = true;\\n1380→        }\\n        self.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n        self.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n        if matches!(self.paused_from, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown) {\\n            self.flow = self.paused_from;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"offset\":1305,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"    fn jump_to(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if (220..240).contains(&id) {\\n            if let Some(kind) = EventId::ALL.get((id - 220) as usize).copied() {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.start_activity(kind, sim);\\n                self.flow = if kind == EventId::Check { Flow::Check } else { Flow::Event };\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if (240..=243).contains(&id) {\\n            self.leave_demo();\\n            self.start_activity(EventId::BigStand, sim);\\n            if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n                act.phase = (id - 239) as u8;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n                act.done = false;\\n            }\\n            self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            self.focus = 0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match id {\\n            244 => self.enter_attract(sim),\\n            245 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.run = Run::Medley;\\n                self.medley_i = 0;\\n                self.start_activity(EventId::Paddle, sim);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n            }\\n            246 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n            247..=251 => {\\n                self.leave_demo();\\n                self.day = (id - 246) as u8;\\n                self.today_played.clear();\\n                self.day_minutes = 0;\\n                self.flow = Flow::Island;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn leave_demo(&mut self) {\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            self.run = Run::Story;\\n        }\\n        self.demo = false;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn cheat(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        match id {\\n            230 => self.cheat_no_tips = !self.cheat_no_tips,\\n            231 => self.cheat_auto = !self.cheat_auto,\\n            232 => self.day_minutes = self.day_minutes.saturating_add(5),\\n            233 => self.free_play = true,\\n            234 => self.total_stars = self.total_stars.saturating_add(9),\\n            235 => self.skip_lines = !self.skip_lines,\\n            236 => self.finish_now(sim, true),\\n            237 => self.finish_now(sim, false),\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn finish_now(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, win: bool) {\\n        if self.act.is_none() {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if let Some(act) = self.act.as_mut() {\\n            act.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n            act.done = true;\\n        }\\n        self.score = if win { 1000.0 } else { 0.0 };\\n        self.stars = if win { 3 } else { 0 };\\n        if matches!(self.paused_from, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown) {\\n            self.flow = self.paused_from;\\n\",\"total_lines\":2518}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"6936ba37-598c-4244-bdfb-b6a8395ba25a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_939","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Jumping to an event from Dev immediately switches the flow to Event, exiting the menu.\n\nThe trace will record after the jump because the flow is no longer frozen. The test plan covers booting, mutating day, stamps, and minutes, pausing, toggling five view items, saving a reset, jumping to Pose Parade, and verifying the UI trace contains Lean and Tick with a camera yaw.\n\nThe \"Pose\" search needle matches \"Pose Parade\" on page 0 before \"Pose gusts\". The event ID title is confirmed as \"Pose Parade\". Ghost lanes are skipped when view lanes are enabled because the offset changes.\n\nI will skip unit-testing the ghost lane offset and instead verify the status flag and trace. The overlay will be drawn at the top left at 70% body scale to avoid dominating the view.\n\nThe overlay is a dev tool, not dialogue, so it will be drawn. FitUi needs explicit trace and overlay fields in its constructor, with serde defaults for backward compatibility. The ghost lane offset is 2.8 when view lanes are enabled and 1.6 otherwise.\n\nThe trace records the balance center of mass at each step while the flow is Event, Check, or Attract. It keeps at most 32 points and drops the oldest when full. The camera yaw adds 0.85 when free camera mode is enabled. The overlay is built before FitUi construction. Status JSON will include input, trace length, and stats flags.\n\nThe status JSON now includes the free and lanes flags. The Dev menu comment lists seven tabs: root, jump, cheats, time, tuning, view, and save. The root menu has three pages, so wrapping is safe. Page two contains View, Save, and Back; Back exits Dev. Existing tests that tab repeatedly will land on page two, but wardrobe tests only seek labels on the first two pages. The painter overlay and trace will be implemented after the puck block.\n\nThe new test will be appended at the end of fit.rs. No deviation is needed for the View and Save tabs. The plan is to run a targeted test, then two full fit runs, followed by packing, browser, hub, progress, and deleting target.\n\nThe \"Reset this\" needle is safe because the save tab only contains that row. The \"Input\" needle is unique on the view tab. After toggles, labels become \"Input viewer · on\", but seek still matches via substring. SaveDto only serializes Slot, not FitGame, so serde defaults are needed for backward compatibility.\n\n`fresh()` must explicitly list the new fields because `FitGame` has no `Default`. The test will use `get_mut` on the game.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d9963b42-fcce-4128-8fed-a5b3b02a2809-84","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"get_mut|play_mut|fn game","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":942,"output_tokens":1490,"cache_read_input_tokens":141056,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"a09b0e26-f08e-4b85-9db5-1129893a176a"}
