{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_940","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed that day, stamps, and day_minutes are public.\n\nThe PAUSE button constant is set. After reset, the flow remains Dev on the save tab; BACK returns to tab 0, then Jump and Pose are selected. Stepping with empty input 12 times should grow the trace if post runs, since view_trace is enabled and the flow is Event. The overlay contains \"Lean\" and \"Tick\", status shows view.input true, and day, stamps, and minutes are zero. A label assertion before leaving the view is unnecessary because status suffices. The ghost lanes flag becomes true after toggling.\n\nThe test avoids requiring the label to read \"on\" because status is checked directly. After five toggles the view tab remains active, so BACK returns to page 0 and the save page is reached via TAB_R twice. The save page contains a \"Reset this\" option.\n\n\"Save\" is unlikely to match other UI elements. The Painter draws the overlay text and trace points using the puck position, ring size, and trace coordinates.\n\nThe painter draws trace points as semi-transparent yellow circles. A collision was found between ACT_BACK and the reset guest constant 255, since Jump already occupies 250–255.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The eight gaps are verified. Dev Mode is still missing the View and Save tabs from the plan, so I’ll add those and retest before calling the build done."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-85","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs","old_string":"    /// Full-screen dim, 0 clear, 1 black. The eyes-closed check uses this.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub dim: f32,\n}","new_string":"    /// Full-screen dim, 0 clear, 1 black. The eyes-closed check uses this.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub dim: f32,\n    /// Recent balance dots (cob x, cob y) when the dev trace is on.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub trace: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n    /// Corner line for the dev input viewer and engine stats. Empty when both are off.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub overlay: String,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-86","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    /// Event mats on the island: key, world x, world z.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    mats: Vec<(String, f32, f32)>,\n}","new_string":"    /// Event mats on the island: key, world x, world z.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    mats: Vec<(String, f32, f32)>,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    view_input: bool,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    view_trace: bool,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    view_stats: bool,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    view_free: bool,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    view_lanes: bool,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    trace: Vec<[f32; 2]>,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-87","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            step_once: false,\n            mats: Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            step_once: false,\n            mats: Vec::new(),\n            view_input: false,\n            view_trace: false,\n            view_stats: false,\n            view_free: false,\n            view_lanes: false,\n            trace: Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            4 => self.tuning_rows(),\n            _ => {\n                let pages: [&[(u16, &str)]; 2] = [\n                    &[\n                        (200, \"Jump\"),\n                        (201, \"Cheats\"),\n                        (202, \"Time\"),\n                        (203, \"Tuning\"),\n                        (43, \"Wardrobe\"),\n                        (ACT_RESUME, \"Resume\"),\n                    ],\n                    &[\n                        (44, \"Calendar\"),\n                        (ACT_DEV_RESET, \"Reset feel\"),\n                        (ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\"),\n                        (ACT_ABOUT, \"About\"),\n                        (ACT_HOWTO, \"How to Stand\"),\n                        (ACT_BACK, \"Back\"),\n                    ],\n                ];","new_string":"            4 => self.tuning_rows(),\n            5 => self.view_rows(),\n            6 => self.save_rows(),\n            _ => {\n                let pages: [&[(u16, &str)]; 3] = [\n                    &[\n                        (200, \"Jump\"),\n                        (201, \"Cheats\"),\n                        (202, \"Time\"),\n                        (203, \"Tuning\"),\n                        (43, \"Wardrobe\"),\n                        (ACT_RESUME, \"Resume\"),\n                    ],\n                    &[\n                        (44, \"Calendar\"),\n                        (ACT_DEV_RESET, \"Reset feel\"),\n                        (ACT_SETTINGS, \"Settings\"),\n                        (ACT_ABOUT, \"About\"),\n                        (ACT_HOWTO, \"How to Stand\"),\n                        (ACT_BACK, \"Back\"),\n                    ],\n                    &[(204, \"View\"), (205, \"Save\"), (ACT_BACK, \"Back\")],\n                ];"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-89","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn open_dev_tab(&mut self, tab: u8) {","new_string":"    fn view_rows(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\n        let on = |flag: bool| if flag { \"on\" } else { \"off\" };\n        vec![\n            (280, format!(\"Input viewer {}\", on(self.view_input))),\n            (281, format!(\"Dot trace {}\", on(self.view_trace))),\n            (282, format!(\"Engine stats {}\", on(self.view_stats))),\n            (283, format!(\"Free camera {}\", on(self.view_free))),\n            (284, format!(\"Ghost lanes {}\", on(self.view_lanes))),\n            (ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into()),\n        ]\n    }\n\n    fn save_rows(&self) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\n        vec![(285, format!(\"Reset {}\", self.name)), (ACT_BACK, \"Back\".into())]\n    }\n\n    fn open_dev_tab(&mut self, tab: u8) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-90","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(1.6, 0.0, 0.4);","new_string":"        let lane = if self.view_lanes { 2.8 } else { 1.6 };\n        let feet = sim.state.spawn + Vec3::new(lane, 0.0, 0.4);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-91","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"                203 => self.open_dev_tab(4),","new_string":"                203 => self.open_dev_tab(4),\n                204 => self.open_dev_tab(5),\n                205 => self.open_dev_tab(6),"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616233eb-c7c2-41e4-a965-1b359e9afc21-92","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","old_string":"            4 => match id {\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\n                ACT_DEV_RESET_GROUP => self.reset_rules(false),\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            4 => match id {\n                ACT_DEV_RESET => self.rules = Rules::default(),\n                ACT_DEV_RESET_GROUP => self.reset_rules(false),\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            5 => match id {\n                280 => self.view_input = !self.view_input,\n                281 => {\n                    self.view_trace = !self.view_trace;\n                    if !self.view_trace {\n                        self.trace.clear();\n                    }\n                }\n                282 => self.view_stats = !self.view_stats,\n                283 => self.view_free = !self.view_free,\n                284 => self.view_lanes = !self.view_lanes,\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            6 => {\n                if id == 285 {\n                    self.reset_guest();\n                }\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// Clears this guest's stay and writes the slot. Name, look and settings stay.\n    fn reset_guest(&mut self) {\n        self.day = 1;\n        self.day_minutes = 0;\n        self.total_stars = 0;\n        self.stamps = 0;\n        self.days_completed = 0;\n        self.age = 80;\n        self.skill = 0.0;\n        self.bests.clear();\n        self.ever_played.clear();\n        self.today_played.clear();\n        self.ages.clear();\n        self.flips = 0;\n        self.golden = false;\n        self.free_play = false;\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n        self.ending.clear();\n        self.ghosts.clear();\n        self.score = 0.0;\n        self.stars = 0;\n        self.act = None;\n        self.save_serial = self.save_serial.wrapping_add(1);\n        self.write_slot();\n    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1759,"output_tokens":3315,"cache_read_input_tokens":141952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"882bb5c0-9e94-49e9-b432-18fa28e8e99d"}
