{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_947","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The wardrobe test selects Wardrobe from the dev root page 0. It returns to Dev after the Sun cap.\n\nCalendar is on page 1 and still works with a third page. A new test changes the stay by picking View, Input, Dot, Engine, Free, and Ghost tabs.\n\nThe test verifies the stay is saved. It asserts that input, stats, free, and lanes are all true. Then it resets Gray and checks that day, stamps, and minutes are zero. It also confirms the viewer state was cleared.\n\nThe test selects Jump and Pose Parade. It asserts the event is pose. It steps eight frames. It checks the dot trace stayed empty. It verifies Lean and Tick appear in the overlay. It confirms camera yaw exists. It checks the trace view count is positive. It questions whether InputFrame::default exists.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c62eec7b-eee2-4d7f-a00c-888b1d3fb5ac-107","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Pose Parade|fn title","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c62eec7b-eee2-4d7f-a00c-888b1d3fb5ac-108","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"BACK:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src","glob":"**/buttons*"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":805,"output_tokens":833,"cache_read_input_tokens":153600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"ecec262c-ee91-4b3e-8aec-f3d38ac7e79e"}
