{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_973","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tests look substantial and passed.\n\nI need to verify the implementations are real, not stubs. I will inspect ten critical code paths: fit_sample slider drag, MENU_RIGHT adjustments, dev mode cheats, schedule paging, stillness prompts, age adjustment, eye tones, name and outfit paging, props and wardrobe, and captures. I also need to check whether the tests use pick() to click labels instead of exercising the actual app interaction paths.\n\nThe slider test uses MENU_RIGHT, which is the real player path. The app also emits Slider on drag, and input.rs has a unit test to check. The core log shows 19 tests passed twice after the view/save addition. Two issues remain: whether MENU_RIGHT changes music in settings or only passes via a special case, and whether the finale age test mutates age directly before jumping to big stand.\n\nI also need to check if age adjustments are hardcoded to 45. The long stillness jump might set song zero and a prompt without being phase four of the real event. Eyes closed tone could be a status field rather than actual audio. Pose clips may report in status without playing on the puppet. Beach props might be a single dummy item. Schedule paging could only work after an unlock cheat, leaving normal free play after credits broken.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The new tests claim the eight gaps are closed. I’ll read the input, schedule, finale, and pose paths to see whether those tests actually drive them."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8888db42-14cc-4249-b408-4745057a95b6-89","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":500,"limit":360}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8888db42-14cc-4249-b408-4745057a95b6-90","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":530,"limit":280}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":28021,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":166912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"983bb35c-e015-4af8-8910-dd5716c3ce94"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8888db42-14cc-4249-b408-4745057a95b6-89","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"500→        }\\n        if held_dir.length() > 0.0 {\\n            self.lean_from = 2;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_travel > 6.0 && !self.coarse {\\n            self.lean_from = 3;\\n        }\\n        let lean = match self.lean_from {\\n            1 => stick,\\n510→            3 => {\\n                let offset = Vec2::new(self.cursor.x - size.x * 0.5, size.y * 0.5 - self.cursor.y);\\n                mouse_lean(offset, size.y)\\n            }\\n            _ => self.lean_ramp,\\n        };\\n        let mut extra = 0u32;\\n        if stick.y > 0.55 && self.stick_y <= 0.55 {\\n            extra |= buttons::MENU_UP;\\n        }\\n520→        if stick.y < -0.55 && self.stick_y >= -0.55 {\\n            extra |= buttons::MENU_DOWN;\\n        }\\n        self.stick_y = stick.y;\\n        let mut ui = None;\\n        let travel = self.mouse_travel;\\n        self.mouse_travel = 0.0;\\n        let tap = clicked || self.touch_tap;\\n        self.touch_tap = false;\\n        if size.x > 1.0 && size.y > 1.0 {\\n530→            for (id, rect) in items {\\n                let x = rect[0] * size.x;\\n                let y = rect[1] * size.y;\\n                let w = rect[2] * size.x;\\n                let h = rect[3] * size.y;\\n                if self.cursor.x >= x && self.cursor.x <= x + w && self.cursor.y >= y && self.cursor.y <= y + h {\\n                    let slider = (*id >= 300 && *id < 400) || (610..=616).contains(id);\\n                    let dragging = self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) && !tap && w > 1.0;\\n                    ui = Some(if tap {\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Click(*id)\\n540→                    } else if dragging && slider {\\n                        let along = ((self.cursor.x - x) / w).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Slider(*id, along)\\n                    } else {\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Hover(*id)\\n                    });\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let device = if self.coarse && !self.seen_real {\\n550→            4\\n        } else if self.last_device == Device::Gamepad {\\n            1\\n        } else if self.lean_from == 3 {\\n            3\\n        } else if self.last_device == Device::Touch {\\n            4\\n        } else {\\n            2\\n        };\\n560→        let any = !self.coarse && (self.pad.any_activity || travel > 6.0 || stick.length() > 0.3 || lean.length() > 0.3);\\n        FitSample { lean, device, any, ui, extra }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn key(&mut self, code: KeyCode, state: ElementState) {\\n        self.last_device = Device::KeyboardMouse;\\n        self.seen_real = true;\\n        match state {\\n            ElementState::Pressed => {\\n                self.keys.insert(code);\\n570→                self.key_taps.insert(code);\\n            }\\n            ElementState::Released => {\\n                self.keys.remove(&code);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn mouse_button(&mut self, b: MouseButton, state: ElementState) {\\n        self.last_device = Device::KeyboardMouse;\\n580→        self.mouse_active = true;\\n        match state {\\n            ElementState::Pressed => {\\n                self.mouse.insert(b);\\n                self.mouse_taps.insert(b);\\n            }\\n            ElementState::Released => {\\n                self.mouse.remove(&b);\\n            }\\n        }\\n590→    }\\n\\n    pub fn clear(&mut self) {\\n        self.keys.clear();\\n        self.mouse.clear();\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Reads gamepad events and state (first connected pad).\\n    pub fn poll_gamepad(&mut self) {\\n        use gilrs::{Axis, Button};\\n600→        let mut activity = false;\\n        let mut taps = Vec::new();\\n        // One pad state from the first connected pad, or from the pad script while it runs.\\n        let mut state: Option<PadState> = None;\\n        if let Some(g) = &mut self.gilrs {\\n            while let Some(ev) = g.next_event() {\\n                match ev.event {\\n                    gilrs::EventType::ButtonPressed(b, _) => {\\n                        taps.push(b);\\n                        activity = true;\\n610→                    }\\n                    gilrs::EventType::AxisChanged(_, v, _) if v.abs() > 0.4 => activity = true,\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Connected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad connected\\\"),\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Disconnected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad disconnected\\\"),\\n                    _ => {}\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if let Some((_, gp)) = g.gamepads().next() {\\n                const ALL: [Button; 15] = [\\n                    Button::South,\\n620→                    Button::East,\\n                    Button::North,\\n                    Button::West,\\n                    Button::LeftTrigger,\\n                    Button::RightTrigger,\\n                    Button::Select,\\n                    Button::Start,\\n                    Button::DPadUp,\\n                    Button::DPadDown,\\n                    Button::DPadLeft,\\n630→                    Button::DPadRight,\\n                    Button::LeftThumb,\\n                    Button::RightThumb,\\n                    Button::Mode,\\n                ];\\n                let trig = |b: Button| gp.button_data(b).map(|d| d.value()).unwrap_or(0.0) > 0.35;\\n                state = Some(PadState {\\n                    left: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::LeftStickX), gp.value(Axis::LeftStickY)),\\n                    right: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::RightStickX), gp.value(Axis::RightStickY)),\\n                    held: ALL.into_iter().filter(|b| gp.is_pressed(*b)).collect(),\\n640→                    lt2: trig(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                    rt2: trig(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(script) = &mut self.pad_script {\\n            if let Some((st, first)) = script.next() {\\n                if first {\\n                    taps.extend(st.tap.iter().copied());\\n                }\\n650→                activity = true;\\n                state = Some(PadState { left: st.left, right: st.right, held: st.hold.clone(), lt2: false, rt2: false });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let start = taps.contains(&Button::Start);\\n        let map = taps.contains(&Button::DPadLeft);\\n        let mut pad = Pad { start_pressed: start && !self.fit, map_pressed: map && !self.fit, taps, any_activity: activity, ..Default::default() };\\n        if let Some(st) = state {\\n            let is = |b: Button| st.held.contains(&b);\\n            pad.raw_left = st.left;\\n660→            pad.left = if self.fit { st.left } else { deadzone(st.left, 0.18) };\\n            pad.right = deadzone(st.right, 0.25);\\n            let mut held = 0;\\n            let layout: &[(Button, u32)] = if self.fit {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::BACK),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::WAVE),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::STEP_L),\\n670→                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::STEP_R),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::MENU_UP),\\n                    (Button::DPadDown, buttons::MENU_DOWN),\\n                    (Button::DPadLeft, buttons::MENU_LEFT),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::MENU_RIGHT),\\n                ]\\n            } else if self.game {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::PRIMARY),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SECONDARY),\\n680→                    (Button::East, buttons::SKILL3),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::SKILL4),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::SKILL5),\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::DODGE),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::POTION),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            } else {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::JUMP),\\n690→                    (Button::East, buttons::CROUCH),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::CRAWL),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::USE),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            };\\n            for (btn, action) in layout {\\n                if is(*btn) {\\n                    held |= action;\\n                }\\n700→            }\\n            if self.fit {\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_L;\\n                }\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_R;\\n                }\\n                if is(Button::Start) && !is(Button::Mode) {\\n                    held |= buttons::PAUSE;\\n710→                }\\n            } else {\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= if self.game { buttons::SKILL6 } else { buttons::USE };\\n                }\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            pad.held = held;\\n720→            pad.rotate = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::RightTrigger) as i32 - is(Button::LeftTrigger) as i32) as f32 };\\n            // In the game the D-pad is potion / use / map / panels, not zoom.\\n            pad.zoom = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::DPadDown) as i32 - is(Button::DPadUp) as i32) as f32 };\\n            pad.a_held = is(Button::South);\\n            pad.x_held = is(Button::West);\\n            pad.y_held = is(Button::North);\\n            pad.back_held = is(Button::Select);\\n            if pad.left.length() > 0.3 || pad.right.length() > 0.3 || held != 0 {\\n                pad.any_activity = true;\\n            }\\n730→        }\\n        if pad.any_activity {\\n            self.last_device = Device::Gamepad;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        self.pad = pad;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Screen-space movement (x right, y up) from keys and stick, length <= 1.\\n    pub fn move_axis(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n740→        let k = |codes: &[KeyCode]| codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) as i32 as f32;\\n        let b = &self.bindings;\\n        let kb = Vec2::new(k(&b.right) - k(&b.left), k(&b.up) - k(&b.down));\\n        let v = if kb != Vec2::ZERO { kb.normalize() } else { self.pad.left };\\n        v.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Held game buttons from all devices.\\n    pub fn held(&self) -> u32 {\\n        let mut b = self.pad.held;\\n750→        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) {\\n                b |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            b |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            b |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n760→        }\\n        b\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Returns (held, newly pressed since the last call).\\n    pub fn buttons(&mut self) -> (u32, u32) {\\n        let held = self.held();\\n        let mut pressed = held & !self.prev_held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.key_taps.contains(c)) {\\n770→                pressed |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n        }\\n        self.key_taps.clear();\\n780→        self.mouse_taps.clear();\\n        self.prev_held = held;\\n        // A tap shorter than a frame still counts as held for that frame.\\n        (held | pressed, pressed)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// True if `b` was pressed since the last call (consumes the tap).\\n    pub fn take_mouse_tap(&mut self, b: MouseButton) -> bool {\\n        self.mouse_taps.remove(&b)\\n    }\\n790→\\n    pub fn rewind_held(&self) -> bool {\\n        self.keys.contains(&KeyCode::Backspace) || self.pad.back_held\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[cfg(test)]\\nmod pad_script_tests {\\n    use super::*;\\n\\n800→    #[test]\\n    fn pad_scripts_parse_and_play() {\\n        let mut p = PadScript::parse(\\\"# open the bag\\\\n2\\\\n1 tap=DPadDown\\\\n3 left=0.5,-1 hold=A,Y\\\\n\\\").unwrap();\\n        assert_eq!(p.steps.len(), 3);\\n        let frames: Vec<(PadStep, bool)> = std::iter::from_fn(|| p.next()).collect();\\n        assert_eq!(frames.len(), 6);\\n        assert!(frames[2].1 && frames[2].0.tap == vec![gilrs::Button::DPadDown]);\\n        assert_eq!(frames[3].0.hold, vec![gilrs::Button::South, gilrs::Button::North]);\\n        assert_eq!(frames[5].0.left, Vec2::new(0.5, -1.0));\\n        assert!(PadScript::parse(\\\"x tap=A\\\").is_err());\\n810→        assert!(PadScript::parse(\\\"1 tap=Q\\\").is_err());\\n    }\\n\\n    #[test]\\n    fn a_held_pointer_on_a_slider_row_drags_it() {\\n        let mut input = Input::new();\\n        input.cursor = Vec2::new(100.0, 40.0);\\n        input.mouse.insert(MouseButton::Left);\\n        let items = [(610u16, [0.0, 0.0, 0.5, 0.2])];\\n        let sample = input.fit_sample(1.0 / 60.0, Vec2::new(400.0, 400.0), &items, false);\\n820→        match sample.ui {\\n            Some(pav_core::input::UiEvent::Slider(610, v)) => assert!((v - 0.5).abs() < 0.02, \\\"{v}\\\"),\\n            other => panic!(\\\"expected a slider drag, got {other:?}\\\"),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"500→        }\\n        if held_dir.length() > 0.0 {\\n            self.lean_from = 2;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_travel > 6.0 && !self.coarse {\\n            self.lean_from = 3;\\n        }\\n        let lean = match self.lean_from {\\n            1 => stick,\\n510→            3 => {\\n                let offset = Vec2::new(self.cursor.x - size.x * 0.5, size.y * 0.5 - self.cursor.y);\\n                mouse_lean(offset, size.y)\\n            }\\n            _ => self.lean_ramp,\\n        };\\n        let mut extra = 0u32;\\n        if stick.y > 0.55 && self.stick_y <= 0.55 {\\n            extra |= buttons::MENU_UP;\\n        }\\n520→        if stick.y < -0.55 && self.stick_y >= -0.55 {\\n            extra |= buttons::MENU_DOWN;\\n        }\\n        self.stick_y = stick.y;\\n        let mut ui = None;\\n        let travel = self.mouse_travel;\\n        self.mouse_travel = 0.0;\\n        let tap = clicked || self.touch_tap;\\n        self.touch_tap = false;\\n        if size.x > 1.0 && size.y > 1.0 {\\n530→            for (id, rect) in items {\\n                let x = rect[0] * size.x;\\n                let y = rect[1] * size.y;\\n                let w = rect[2] * size.x;\\n                let h = rect[3] * size.y;\\n                if self.cursor.x >= x && self.cursor.x <= x + w && self.cursor.y >= y && self.cursor.y <= y + h {\\n                    let slider = (*id >= 300 && *id < 400) || (610..=616).contains(id);\\n                    let dragging = self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) && !tap && w > 1.0;\\n                    ui = Some(if tap {\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Click(*id)\\n540→                    } else if dragging && slider {\\n                        let along = ((self.cursor.x - x) / w).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Slider(*id, along)\\n                    } else {\\n                        pav_core::input::UiEvent::Hover(*id)\\n                    });\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let device = if self.coarse && !self.seen_real {\\n550→            4\\n        } else if self.last_device == Device::Gamepad {\\n            1\\n        } else if self.lean_from == 3 {\\n            3\\n        } else if self.last_device == Device::Touch {\\n            4\\n        } else {\\n            2\\n        };\\n560→        let any = !self.coarse && (self.pad.any_activity || travel > 6.0 || stick.length() > 0.3 || lean.length() > 0.3);\\n        FitSample { lean, device, any, ui, extra }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn key(&mut self, code: KeyCode, state: ElementState) {\\n        self.last_device = Device::KeyboardMouse;\\n        self.seen_real = true;\\n        match state {\\n            ElementState::Pressed => {\\n                self.keys.insert(code);\\n570→                self.key_taps.insert(code);\\n            }\\n            ElementState::Released => {\\n                self.keys.remove(&code);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn mouse_button(&mut self, b: MouseButton, state: ElementState) {\\n        self.last_device = Device::KeyboardMouse;\\n580→        self.mouse_active = true;\\n        match state {\\n            ElementState::Pressed => {\\n                self.mouse.insert(b);\\n                self.mouse_taps.insert(b);\\n            }\\n            ElementState::Released => {\\n                self.mouse.remove(&b);\\n            }\\n        }\\n590→    }\\n\\n    pub fn clear(&mut self) {\\n        self.keys.clear();\\n        self.mouse.clear();\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Reads gamepad events and state (first connected pad).\\n    pub fn poll_gamepad(&mut self) {\\n        use gilrs::{Axis, Button};\\n600→        let mut activity = false;\\n        let mut taps = Vec::new();\\n        // One pad state from the first connected pad, or from the pad script while it runs.\\n        let mut state: Option<PadState> = None;\\n        if let Some(g) = &mut self.gilrs {\\n            while let Some(ev) = g.next_event() {\\n                match ev.event {\\n                    gilrs::EventType::ButtonPressed(b, _) => {\\n                        taps.push(b);\\n                        activity = true;\\n610→                    }\\n                    gilrs::EventType::AxisChanged(_, v, _) if v.abs() > 0.4 => activity = true,\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Connected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad connected\\\"),\\n                    gilrs::EventType::Disconnected => log::info!(\\\"gamepad disconnected\\\"),\\n                    _ => {}\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if let Some((_, gp)) = g.gamepads().next() {\\n                const ALL: [Button; 15] = [\\n                    Button::South,\\n620→                    Button::East,\\n                    Button::North,\\n                    Button::West,\\n                    Button::LeftTrigger,\\n                    Button::RightTrigger,\\n                    Button::Select,\\n                    Button::Start,\\n                    Button::DPadUp,\\n                    Button::DPadDown,\\n                    Button::DPadLeft,\\n630→                    Button::DPadRight,\\n                    Button::LeftThumb,\\n                    Button::RightThumb,\\n                    Button::Mode,\\n                ];\\n                let trig = |b: Button| gp.button_data(b).map(|d| d.value()).unwrap_or(0.0) > 0.35;\\n                state = Some(PadState {\\n                    left: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::LeftStickX), gp.value(Axis::LeftStickY)),\\n                    right: Vec2::new(gp.value(Axis::RightStickX), gp.value(Axis::RightStickY)),\\n                    held: ALL.into_iter().filter(|b| gp.is_pressed(*b)).collect(),\\n640→                    lt2: trig(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                    rt2: trig(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n                });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if let Some(script) = &mut self.pad_script {\\n            if let Some((st, first)) = script.next() {\\n                if first {\\n                    taps.extend(st.tap.iter().copied());\\n                }\\n650→                activity = true;\\n                state = Some(PadState { left: st.left, right: st.right, held: st.hold.clone(), lt2: false, rt2: false });\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let start = taps.contains(&Button::Start);\\n        let map = taps.contains(&Button::DPadLeft);\\n        let mut pad = Pad { start_pressed: start && !self.fit, map_pressed: map && !self.fit, taps, any_activity: activity, ..Default::default() };\\n        if let Some(st) = state {\\n            let is = |b: Button| st.held.contains(&b);\\n            pad.raw_left = st.left;\\n660→            pad.left = if self.fit { st.left } else { deadzone(st.left, 0.18) };\\n            pad.right = deadzone(st.right, 0.25);\\n            let mut held = 0;\\n            let layout: &[(Button, u32)] = if self.fit {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n                    (Button::East, buttons::BACK),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::WAVE),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::STEP_L),\\n670→                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::STEP_R),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::MENU_UP),\\n                    (Button::DPadDown, buttons::MENU_DOWN),\\n                    (Button::DPadLeft, buttons::MENU_LEFT),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::MENU_RIGHT),\\n                ]\\n            } else if self.game {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::PRIMARY),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::SECONDARY),\\n680→                    (Button::East, buttons::SKILL3),\\n                    (Button::RightTrigger, buttons::SKILL4),\\n                    (Button::LeftTrigger, buttons::SKILL5),\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::DODGE),\\n                    (Button::DPadUp, buttons::POTION),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            } else {\\n                &[\\n                    (Button::South, buttons::JUMP),\\n690→                    (Button::East, buttons::CROUCH),\\n                    (Button::North, buttons::CRAWL),\\n                    (Button::West, buttons::USE),\\n                    (Button::DPadRight, buttons::INTERACT),\\n                ]\\n            };\\n            for (btn, action) in layout {\\n                if is(*btn) {\\n                    held |= action;\\n                }\\n700→            }\\n            if self.fit {\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_L;\\n                }\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::STEP_R;\\n                }\\n                if is(Button::Start) && !is(Button::Mode) {\\n                    held |= buttons::PAUSE;\\n710→                }\\n            } else {\\n                if st.rt2 {\\n                    held |= if self.game { buttons::SKILL6 } else { buttons::USE };\\n                }\\n                if st.lt2 {\\n                    held |= buttons::FOCUS;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            pad.held = held;\\n720→            pad.rotate = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::RightTrigger) as i32 - is(Button::LeftTrigger) as i32) as f32 };\\n            // In the game the D-pad is potion / use / map / panels, not zoom.\\n            pad.zoom = if self.game || self.fit { 0.0 } else { (is(Button::DPadDown) as i32 - is(Button::DPadUp) as i32) as f32 };\\n            pad.a_held = is(Button::South);\\n            pad.x_held = is(Button::West);\\n            pad.y_held = is(Button::North);\\n            pad.back_held = is(Button::Select);\\n            if pad.left.length() > 0.3 || pad.right.length() > 0.3 || held != 0 {\\n                pad.any_activity = true;\\n            }\\n730→        }\\n        if pad.any_activity {\\n            self.last_device = Device::Gamepad;\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n        }\\n        self.pad = pad;\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Screen-space movement (x right, y up) from keys and stick, length <= 1.\\n    pub fn move_axis(&self) -> Vec2 {\\n740→        let k = |codes: &[KeyCode]| codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) as i32 as f32;\\n        let b = &self.bindings;\\n        let kb = Vec2::new(k(&b.right) - k(&b.left), k(&b.up) - k(&b.down));\\n        let v = if kb != Vec2::ZERO { kb.normalize() } else { self.pad.left };\\n        v.clamp_length_max(1.0)\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Held game buttons from all devices.\\n    pub fn held(&self) -> u32 {\\n        let mut b = self.pad.held;\\n750→        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.keys.contains(c)) {\\n                b |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            b |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            b |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n760→        }\\n        b\\n    }\\n\\n    /// Returns (held, newly pressed since the last call).\\n    pub fn buttons(&mut self) -> (u32, u32) {\\n        let held = self.held();\\n        let mut pressed = held & !self.prev_held;\\n        for (bit, codes) in &self.bindings.buttons {\\n            if codes.iter().any(|c| self.key_taps.contains(c)) {\\n770→                pressed |= bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Left) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::PRIMARY;\\n        }\\n        if self.game && self.mouse_taps.contains(&MouseButton::Right) {\\n            pressed |= buttons::SECONDARY;\\n        }\\n        self.key_taps.clear();\\n780→        self.mouse_taps.clear();\\n        self.prev_held = held;\\n        // A tap shorter than a frame still counts as held for 