{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_979","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether FIT clips are defined as animation data.\n\nChecking clip registration, hub.toml props, and whether apply_body runs each tick. Verifying if Sfx 31 is a continuous tone. Examining the skip prompt logic in fit_ui: extra lines are appended only when total lines remain below two.\n\nThe skip prompt logic is sound: it appends a second line whenever the body line count remains below two. The next step is to inspect what the Event arm of talk() returns.\n\nScore is hidden during long_still because the banner returns an empty big. Song selection correctly returns zero at phase four and pre() pushes a Music event on change; the test jumping directly to phase four exercises real wiring. The forfeit path in tick_big is confirmed: it halves the phase score when sub >= 15 and pressed != 0, though the current test does not press after the prompt.\n\nThe prior gap was the missing fake Press-to-skip prompt, score hiding, and bed 3 silence. The forfeit logic was already present in round 1. The code now shows the prompt and the test asserts it. No new test is needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aca9c43e-7a83-4561-b246-366ee236d2d8-14","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\"FIT/","glob":"**/*.{rs,json,toml}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aca9c43e-7a83-4561-b246-366ee236d2d8-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","offset":480,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aca9c43e-7a83-4561-b246-366ee236d2d8-16","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn sfx_patch|id == 31|31 =>","glob":"**/pav_audio/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aca9c43e-7a83-4561-b246-366ee236d2d8-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"apply_body","glob":"**/games/