{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_991","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug candidate was found: `left_tap || dom.is_some()` is passed as `clicked` to `fit_sample`.\n\nA DOM click overwrites a Slider event with a Click. Keyboard arrow keys may also need wiring to slider nudge bindings.\n\nThe pad-to-menu mapping is correct. D-pad presses register as just-pressed events, while left and right nudge come from held bits. The slider drag chain from app frame through fit_sample to apply_slider is complete. Unit tests cover fit_sample, and sim tests cover MENU_RIGHT to apply_slider.\n\nThe DOM click overwriting slider is a harness issue, not a player bug. I will check captures and logs for regressions. Calendar activation triggers go_back for any ID including day rows, which may be acceptable. Wardrobe wear returns to return_flow Dev. Props are tested by counting entities with prop.is_some().","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ebe4cf26-0f19-42ac-8ebf-f5e6671c0a0a-48","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"anim\\.clip|clip_w|clip_t","glob":"**/pav_core/src/**/*.rs","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ebe4cf26-0f19-42ac-8ebf-f5e6671c0a0a-49","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn fit\\(","glob":"**/pav_app/src/input.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2633,"output_tokens":706,"cache_read_input_tokens":104320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"3cbe5ea1-2feb-4931-9140-9775e6de36d0"}
