{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_994","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The captures look genuinely good. The raised arms tree pose, beach props, and readable title menu are all present.\n\nThe prior visual gap is fixed. The pose is visible in the capture, confirming the renderer sees it. I am checking character.rs to ensure locomotion does not overwrite the FIT clip during gameplay.\n\nThe capture confirms the pose is not overwritten before rendering. A possible UI bug was spotted: the title footer may show \"Cross Cross\" as a duplicated confirmation prompt.\n\nThe \"Cross Cross\" footer is likely a visible defect, but it may have been present in round 1. I will not raise the bar unless it is a real criterion failure.\n\nThe \"Cross Cross\" footer is not a new regression, so it will be skipped. I am now checking tests-core.log, browser and hub timestamps, PLAN changes, and regressions for real defects. I also verified that page_labels correctly uses TAB and shoulder triggers for paging, and that shoulder buttons are disabled during events.\n\nSTEP_R paging on the name screen is acceptable. The settings page two options are reachable via shoulder triggers, keyboard brackets, or TAB, so d-pad-only players can still access them.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8347a070-1d62-42c1-b629-f5cd42ecc7b7-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1620,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8347a070-1d62-42c1-b629-f5cd42ecc7b7-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/character.rs","offset":1160,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id"