{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1002","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will write the verdict files.\n\nThe verdict is \"Not Refuted\" with empty findings and high confidence. I will write the details markdown with path:line evidence, then emit only the terminal token.\n\nThe forfeit-on-press prompt is now asserted by the test. Song silence and score banner clearing are confirmed fixed. The eyes tone may be a retriggered blip rather than a continuous pitch.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The eight prior gaps are present on the live paths, and the later captures and test logs match that code. I'll record a not-refuted verdict."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-05cdfb12-45f1-41cd-8060-912e26944915-77","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-verdict-b3947fd4d9d9-2-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"fit.rs 19 passed twice (tests-core.log EXIT6) after pack; fit_sample Slider at input.rs:536 and MENU_RIGHT nudge at mod.rs:2081; desired_song phase>=4 returns 0 at mod.rs:1780; age cut at mod.rs:928; eyes-closed Sfx pitch at events.rs:676; pose capture shows raised arms; browser 6 and hub 6 after the 03:19 HTML.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"# Delta re-check (skeptic 0, round 2)\\n\\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is on the player path, covered by a test that drives `Sim::step` or `fit_sample`, and the packed page was launched after that code.\\n\\nSources are older than the evidence: `fit/mod.rs` 03:14, `events.rs` and `fit.json` 02:30, `input.rs` 02:54. `tests-core.log` fit runs 5–6 print `19 passed; 0 failed` (EXIT6:0, 03:16). Pack 2 wrote the HTML at 03:17–03:19 (11.9 MB). `tests-browser.log` (03:21) is `6 passed, 0 failed`. `tests-hub.log` (03:24) is `6 passed, 0 failed` including session.js byte-match, 2–4 players, host-leave, and solo. Title and Pose Parade captures at 03:21 agree with each other.\\n\\n## Prior gaps\\n\\n1. **Sliders.** `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the left button is held inside a 300–399 or 610–616 row (`input.rs:536-544`). `App::frame` copies that into the sim input (`app.rs:1260-1276`). `pre` applies it in Dev and Settings (`mod.rs:2037-2040`) and D-pad / arrow left-right call `nudge_focused_slider` (`mod.rs:2081-2086`, pad map `input.rs:673-674`). `a_held_pointer_on_a_slider_row_drags_it` asserts `Slider(610, ~0.5)`. `music_defaults_quiet_and_a_dev_slider_resets` presses `MENU_RIGHT` and sees music 0.10→0.20 and stiffness move, then Reset feel restores it.\\n\\n2. **Dev Mode.** Pause opens Dev. Rows include Jump, Cheats, Time, Tuning (`mod.rs:647-677`). Time sets 0.25/1/2/4/pause/step (`set_time` `mod.rs:1475-1486`) and `post` scales the event clock by `time_scale` (`mod.rs:2202-2208`). Cheats toggle no-tips, autoplay, minutes, unlock, stars, skip, win/lose (`mod.rs:1442-1453`). The stillness and schedule tests open these rows with `pick`.\\n\\n3. **Free play and mats.** `schedule_rows` pages 4 at a time and ids are the original index (`mod.rs:681-694`). `schedule_events` lists every event except Check and Big Stand once `free_play` is set (`mod.rs:563-570`), and credits set that flag (`mod.rs:1714-1722`). Eleven mats are placed in `build` (`mod.rs:1968-1981`); `try_mat` starts the nearest (`mod.rs:1552-1571`). Tests reach Cannonball from the schedule and Floatie from a walked mat.\\n\\n4. **Long Stillness.** Phase `>= 4` is the last phase. `desired_song` returns 0 there (`mod.rs:1780-1781`); the mixer is silent at song 0 (`pav_audio` `lib.rs:214-215`). After 15s the line and footer are `Press {glyph} to skip` (`mod.rs:2351-2352`, `2475`, `1584-1586`) and the score banner is cleared (`mod.rs:2442-2443`). Any press sets `forfeit` and drops the bonus (`events.rs:1210-1226`). `long_stillness_goes_quiet_and_offers_a_fake_skip` jumps via the dev menu, waits until `act_sub >= 15` at 4x, and asserts song 0, the skip line, an empty score, and a puck.\\n\\n5. **Finale age.** Story Big Stand does `age = age.saturating_sub(floor(score/100).min(10)).max(18)` and rowboat iff age `<= 40` (`mod.rs:925-930`). `a_good_finale_can_rowboat_from_a_middle_age` sets morning age 45, bots the real finale to Ending, and checks that formula (rowboat when score `>= 500`).\\n\\n6. **Eyes closed.** Phase 2 sets `guide` from cob distance and pushes `Sfx { id: 31, pitch }` every tick (`events.rs:674-678`). The puck is omitted and dim is 0.92 (`mod.rs:2354-2359`, `2405`); the painter fills the screen from `dim` (`pav_ui/fit.rs:47-49`). The test hides the puck, requires dim `> 0.5`, and moves the status tone with a full lean.\\n\\n7. **Name and outfit pages.** `page_labels` uses `page` and the original index (`mod.rs:599-601`, `1914-1918`). Shoulders and bracket keys step `page` (`mod.rs:2060-2070`). Confirm stores `names[id-400]` and `outfit = id-520` (`mod.rs:1046-1062`). The test TABs to Gray and then to outfit 7.\\n\\n8. **Props and poses.** `anim/fit.json` is a FIT set with Tree, Warrior, Fold, Squat, Plank, and Bloom keys (`armL` matches the clip schema). `apply_body` assigns that clip and weight (`mod.rs:2481-2498`); locomotion does not steal a non-idle clip (`character.rs:1226-1236`). `hub.toml` dresses the beach (rowboat, lamp, stall, bench, lagoon, mats). Wardrobe sets a cap; Calendar lists Day 1–5. `pose_parade_plays_the_tree_clip` asserts the player clip is `FIT/Tree`. Both pose captures show arms overhead, one knee up, the balance puck, the lagoon, the boat, the lamp, and the stall. Both title captures show the Wobble Minutes menu on that beach.\\n\\n## Contract and plan\\n\\n`PLAN_CHANGES` only checks off the task list and records two deviations (splash `AIHub.ready()`, song beds 3/6 and stillness as song 0). No criterion text was weakened. The older bot, credits, attract, pause, medley, podium, save, and about tests are in the same 19 and still passed. `engine/target` is absent. `exit-interview.json` parses with usage `added on import`, genre Sports, players `1–4`, name Wobble Minutes.\\n\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-05cdfb12-45f1-41cd-8060-912e26944915-78","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-2-skeptic-0.md","content":"# Delta re-check (skeptic 0, round 2)\n\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is on the player path, covered by a test that drives `Sim::step` or `fit_sample`, and the packed page was launched after that code.\n\nSources are older than the evidence: `fit/mod.rs` 03:14, `events.rs` and `fit.json` 02:30, `input.rs` 02:54. `tests-core.log` fit runs 5–6 print `19 passed; 0 failed` (EXIT6:0, 03:16). Pack 2 wrote the HTML at 03:17–03:19 (11.9 MB). `tests-browser.log` (03:21) is `6 passed, 0 failed`. `tests-hub.log` (03:24) is `6 passed, 0 failed` including session.js byte-match, 2–4 players, host-leave, and solo. Title and Pose Parade captures at 03:21 agree with each other.\n\n## Prior gaps\n\n1. **Sliders.** `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the left button is held inside a 300–399 or 610–616 row (`input.rs:536-544`). `App::frame` copies that into the sim input (`app.rs:1260-1276`). `pre` applies it in Dev and Settings (`mod.rs:2037-2040`) and D-pad / arrow left-right call `nudge_focused_slider` (`mod.rs:2081-2086`, pad map `input.rs:673-674`). `a_held_pointer_on_a_slider_row_drags_it` asserts `Slider(610, ~0.5)`. `music_defaults_quiet_and_a_dev_slider_resets` presses `MENU_RIGHT` and sees music 0.10→0.20 and stiffness move, then Reset feel restores it.\n\n2. **Dev Mode.** Pause opens Dev. Rows include Jump, Cheats, Time, Tuning (`mod.rs:647-677`). Time sets 0.25/1/2/4/pause/step (`set_time` `mod.rs:1475-1486`) and `post` scales the event clock by `time_scale` (`mod.rs:2202-2208`). Cheats toggle no-tips, autoplay, minutes, unlock, stars, skip, win/lose (`mod.rs:1442-1453`). The stillness and schedule tests open these rows with `pick`.\n\n3. **Free play and mats.** `schedule_rows` pages 4 at a time and ids are the original index (`mod.rs:681-694`). `schedule_events` lists every event except Check and Big Stand once `free_play` is set (`mod.rs:563-570`), and credits set that flag (`mod.rs:1714-1722`). Eleven mats are placed in `build` (`mod.rs:1968-1981`); `try_mat` starts the nearest (`mod.rs:1552-1571`). Tests reach Cannonball from the schedule and Floatie from a walked mat.\n\n4. **Long Stillness.** Phase `>= 4` is the last phase. `desired_song` returns 0 there (`mod.rs:1780-1781`); the mixer is silent at song 0 (`pav_audio` `lib.rs:214-215`). After 15s the line and footer are `Press {glyph} to skip` (`mod.rs:2351-2352`, `2475`, `1584-1586`) and the score banner is cleared (`mod.rs:2442-2443`). Any press sets `forfeit` and drops the bonus (`events.rs:1210-1226`). `long_stillness_goes_quiet_and_offers_a_fake_skip` jumps via the dev menu, waits until `act_sub >= 15` at 4x, and asserts song 0, the skip line, an empty score, and a puck.\n\n5. **Finale age.** Story Big Stand does `age = age.saturating_sub(floor(score/100).min(10)).max(18)` and rowboat iff age `<= 40` (`mod.rs:925-930`). `a_good_finale_can_rowboat_from_a_middle_age` sets morning age 45, bots the real finale to Ending, and checks that formula (rowboat when score `>= 500`).\n\n6. **Eyes closed.** Phase 2 sets `guide` from cob distance and pushes `Sfx { id: 31, pitch }` every tick (`events.rs:674-678`). The puck is omitted and dim is 0.92 (`mod.rs:2354-2359`, `2405`); the painter fills the screen from `dim` (`pav_ui/fit.rs:47-49`). The test hides the puck, requires dim `> 0.5`, and moves the status tone with a full lean.\n\n7. **Name and outfit pages.** `page_labels` uses `page` and the original index (`mod.rs:599-601`, `1914-1918`). Shoulders and bracket keys step `page` (`mod.rs:2060-2070`). Confirm stores `names[id-400]` and `outfit = id-520` (`mod.rs:1046-1062`). The test TABs to Gray and then to outfit 7.\n\n8. **Props and poses.** `anim/fit.json` is a FIT set with Tree, Warrior, Fold, Squat, Plank, and Bloom keys (`armL` matches the clip schema). `apply_body` assigns that clip and weight (`mod.rs:2481-2498`); locomotion does not steal a non-idle clip (`character.rs:1226-1236`). `hub.toml` dresses the beach (rowboat, lamp, stall, bench, lagoon, mats). Wardrobe sets a cap; Calendar lists Day 1–5. `pose_parade_plays_the_tree_clip` asserts the player clip is `FIT/Tree`. Both pose captures show arms overhead, one knee up, the balance puck, the lagoon, the boat, the lamp, and the stall. Both title captures show the Wobble Minutes menu on that beach.\n\n## Contract and plan\n\n`PLAN_CHANGES` only checks off the task list and records two deviations (splash `AIHub.ready()`, song beds 3/6 and stillness as song 0). No criterion text was weakened. The older bot, credits, attract, pause, medley, podium, save, and about tests are in the same 19 and still passed. `engine/target` is absent. `exit-interview.json` parses with usage `added on import`, genre Sports, players `1–4`, name Wobble Minutes.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1192,"output_tokens":3772,"cache_read_input_tokens":147072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"56f92070-3819-48e2-84ef-7b9d28e5eb19"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-05cdfb12-45f1-41cd-8060-912e26944915-77","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"fit.rs 19 passed twice (tests-core.log EXIT6) after pack; fit_sample Slider at input.rs:536 and MENU_RIGHT nudge at mod.rs:2081; desired_song phase>=4 returns 0 at mod.rs:1780; age cut at mod.rs:928; eyes-closed Sfx pitch at events.rs:676; pose capture shows raised arms; browser 6 and hub 6 after the 03:19 HTML.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"# Delta re-check (skeptic 0, round 2)\\\\n\\\\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is on the player path, covered by a test that drives `Sim::step` or `fit_sample`, and the packed page was launched after that code.\\\\n\\\\nSources are older than the evidence: `fit/mod.rs` 03:14, `events.rs` and `fit.json` 02:30, `input.rs` 02:54. `tests-core.log` fit runs 5–6 print `19 passed; 0 failed` (EXIT6:0, 03:16). Pack 2 wrote the HTML at 03:17–03:19 (11.9 MB). `tests-browser.log` (03:21) is `6 passed, 0 failed`. `tests-hub.log` (03:24) is `6 passed, 0 failed` including session.js byte-match, 2–4 players, host-leave, and solo. Title and Pose Parade captures at 03:21 agree with each other.\\\\n\\\\n## Prior gaps\\\\n\\\\n1. **Sliders.** `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the left button is held inside a 300–399 or 610–616 row (`input.rs:536-544`). `App::frame` copies that into the sim input (`app.rs:1260-1276`). `pre` applies it in Dev and Settings (`mod.rs:2037-2040`) and D-pad / arrow left-right call `nudge_focused_slider` (`mod.rs:2081-2086`, pad map `input.rs:673-674`). `a_held_pointer_on_a_slider_row_drags_it` asserts `Slider(610, ~0.5)`. `music_defaults_quiet_and_a_dev_slider_resets` presses `MENU_RIGHT` and sees music 0.10→0.20 and stiffness move, then Reset feel restores it.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Dev Mode.** Pause opens Dev. Rows include Jump, Cheats, Time, Tuning (`mod.rs:647-677`). Time sets 0.25/1/2/4/pause/step (`set_time` `mod.rs:1475-1486`) and `post` scales the event clock by `time_scale` (`mod.rs:2202-2208`). Cheats toggle no-tips, autoplay, minutes, unlock, stars, skip, win/lose (`mod.rs:1442-1453`). The stillness and schedule tests open these rows with `pick`.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Free play and mats.** `schedule_rows` pages 4 at a time and ids are the original index (`mod.rs:681-694`). `schedule_events` lists every event except Check and Big Stand once `free_play` is set (`mod.rs:563-570`), and credits set that flag (`mod.rs:1714-1722`). Eleven mats are placed in `build` (`mod.rs:1968-1981`); `try_mat` starts the nearest (`mod.rs:1552-1571`). Tests reach Cannonball from the schedule and Floatie from a walked mat.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Long Stillness.** Phase `>= 4` is the last phase. `desired_song` returns 0 there (`mod.rs:1780-1781`); the mixer is silent at song 0 (`pav_audio` `lib.rs:214-215`). After 15s the line and footer are `Press {glyph} to skip` (`mod.rs:2351-2352`, `2475`, `1584-1586`) and the score banner is cleared (`mod.rs:2442-2443`). Any press sets `forfeit` and drops the bonus (`events.rs:1210-1226`). `long_stillness_goes_quiet_and_offers_a_fake_skip` jumps via the dev menu, waits until `act_sub >= 15` at 4x, and asserts song 0, the skip line, an empty score, and a puck.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Finale age.** Story Big Stand does `age = age.saturating_sub(floor(score/100).min(10)).max(18)` and rowboat iff age `<= 40` (`mod.rs:925-930`). `a_good_finale_can_rowboat_from_a_middle_age` sets morning age 45, bots the real finale to Ending, and checks that formula (rowboat when score `>= 500`).\\\\n\\\\n6. **Eyes closed.** Phase 2 sets `guide` from cob distance and pushes `Sfx { id: 31, pitch }` every tick (`events.rs:674-678`). The puck is omitted and dim is 0.92 (`mod.rs:2354-2359`, `2405`); the painter fills the screen from `dim` (`pav_ui/fit.rs:47-49`). The test hides the puck, requires dim `> 0.5`, and moves the status tone with a full lean.\\\\n\\\\n7. **Name and outfit pages.** `page_labels` uses `page` and the original index (`mod.rs:599-601`, `1914-1918`). Shoulders and bracket keys step `page` (`mod.rs:2060-2070`). Confirm stores `names[id-400]` and `outfit = id-520` (`mod.rs:1046-1062`). The test TABs to Gray and then to outfit 7.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Props and poses.** `anim/fit.json` is a FIT set with Tree, Warrior, Fold, Squat, Plank, and Bloom keys (`armL` matches the clip schema). `apply_body` assigns that clip and weight (`mod.rs:2481-2498`); locomotion does not steal a non-idle clip (`character.rs:1226-1236`). `hub.toml` dresses the beach (rowboat, lamp, stall, bench, lagoon, mats). Wardrobe sets a cap; Calendar lists Day 1–5. `pose_parade_plays_the_tree_clip` asserts the player clip is `FIT/Tree`. Both pose captures show arms overhead, one knee up, the balance puck, the lagoon, the boat, the lamp, and the stall. Both title captures show the Wobble Minutes menu on that beach.\\\\n\\\\n## Contract and plan\\\\n\\\\n`PLAN_CHANGES` only checks off the task list and records two deviations (splash `AIHub.ready()`, song beds 3/6 and stillness as song 0). No criterion text was weakened. The older bot, credits, attract, pause, medley, podium, save, and about tests are in the same 19 and still passed. `engine/target` is absent. `exit-interview.json` parses with usage `added on import`, genre Sports, players `1–4`, name Wobble Minutes.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-verdict-b3947fd4d9d9-2-0.json has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-verdict-b3947fd4d9d9-2-0.json has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matr