 the lagoon, the boat, the lamp, and the stall. Both title captures show the Wobble Minutes menu on that beach.\\n\\n## Contract and plan\\n\\n`PLAN_CHANGES` only checks off the task list and records two deviations (splash `AIHub.ready()`, song beds 3/6 and stillness as song 0). No criterion text was weakened. The older bot, credits, attract, pause, medley, podium, save, and about tests are in the same 19 and still passed. `engine/target` is absent. `exit-interview.json` parses with usage `added on import`, genre Sports, players `1–4`, name Wobble Minutes.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-2-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-2-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-2-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Delta re-check (skeptic 0, round 2)\\n\\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is on the player path, covered by a test that drives `Sim::step` or `fit_sample`, and the packed page was launched after that code.\\n\\nSources are older than the evidence: `fit/mod.rs` 03:14, `events.rs` and `fit.json` 02:30, `input.rs` 02:54. `tests-core.log` fit runs 5–6 print `19 passed; 0 failed` (EXIT6:0, 03:16). Pack 2 wrote the HTML at 03:17–03:19 (11.9 MB). `tests-browser.log` (03:21) is `6 passed, 0 failed`. `tests-hub.log` (03:24) is `6 passed, 0 failed` including session.js byte-match, 2–4 players, host-leave, and solo. Title and Pose Parade captures at 03:21 agree with each other.\\n\\n## Prior gaps\\n\\n1. **Sliders.** `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the left 