line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"1. **gating:** Add in-repo tests that construct the shipped game from a fresh start (no browser, no GPU) and drive its real update loop. Assert criterion 2’s bot run (3 seeds), criterion 3’s per-event bot and idle results (5 seeds), balance-model settle and tip timing, age direction and 18–99 bounds, attract start at 600 idle ticks plus exit without saving, pause freezing world time, music default 0.10, a dev slider changing a live value and resetting, save round-trip, medley determinism for the same seed and inputs, and Play Together reaching a podium. Lint shipped text for `TODO`, placeholder copy, weight/BMI/diet talk, and Nintendo names outside the About source line. Put them behind one command that prints only failures and a final `N passed, 0 failed` line. Run that command twice; both runs must print the same pass line. Save the log to `{SCRATCH}/tests-core.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"4. **gating:** Static hand-in check. `exit-interview.json` parses as one object with the TASK.md keys; `usage` is `added on import`; `aiHub.name` equals the title screen. The HTML filename and dev-folder name match criterion 1. The page’s about-data block includes Source Information and the three feedback lists. `PROGRESS.md` exists. Dev-folder notes contain the 50 titles and the RNG output. Confirm no audio files are referenced by the game.\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"## Non-goals\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"## Assumed scope\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"## Implementation approach\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"## Deviations\"},{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"## Risks / Contradictions\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"- PLAN.md §17 allows cutting Tray Trek, Floatie Spin, and Plank Standoff if time runs short. The objective requires everything this computer can run, so a cut roster fails criterion 3.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cdb007a6-5b68-43f4-bae7-7def67f5a5a3"}
