v_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":315,\"content\":\"    skip_lines: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":413,\"content\":\"            skip_lines: false,\"},{\"line_number\":687,\"content\":\"        for (i, e) in evs.iter().enumerate().skip(start).take(per) {\"},{\"line_number\":724,\"content\":\"            (235, format!(\\\"Skip dialogue {}\\\", on(self.skip_lines))),\"},{\"line_number\":753,\"content\":\"            .skip(start)\"},{\"line_number\":917,\"content\":\"                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\"},{\"line_number\":928,\"content\":\"                    let cut = (self.score / 100.0).floor().min(10.0) as u8;\"},{\"line_number\":930,\"content\":\"                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \\\"rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"extended\\\" }.into();\"},{\"line_number\":1449,\"content\":\"            235 => self.skip_lines = !self.skip_lines,\"},{\"line_number\":1584,\"content\":\"    fn skip_line(&self) -> String {\"},{\"line_number\":1586,\"content\":\"        format!(\\\"Press {g} to skip\\\")\"},{\"line_number\":1660,\"content\":\"                let tag_line = if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" {\"},{\"line_number\":1661,\"content\":\"                    \\\"The rowboat is ready. You may check out, or stay and play.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":1918,\"content\":\"    names.iter().enumerate().skip(start).take(per).map(|(i, name)| (id0 + i as u16, name.clone())).collect()\"},{\"line_number\":1925,\"content\":\"    let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = rows.iter().skip(start).take(per).cloned().collect();\"},{\"line_number\":2094,\"content\":\"                        if self.skip_lines {\"},{\"line_number\":2352,\"content\":\"            lines.push(self.skip_line());\"},{\"line_number\":2456,\"content\":\"                if self.ending == \\\"rowboat\\\" { \\\"Rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"Extended Stay\\\" }.into(),\"},{\"line_number\":2475,\"content\":\"            Flow::Event | Flow::Check if self.long_still() && self.act.as_ref().is_some_and(|a| a.sub >= 15.0) => self.skip_line(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":73,\"content\":\"    let t = (score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 0.999);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"    pub forfeit: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":296,\"content\":\"            forfeit: false,\"},{\"line_number\":1212,\"content\":\"                act.forfeit = true;\"},{\"line_number\":1222,\"content\":\"                if !act.forfeit {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"cc8680b8-6775-4b6b-aba1-8d5e5646fd39"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1013","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nNeed to verify MENU_RIGHT maps to the real slider in mod.rs rather than a special case. Dev mode features appear wired, but time scale must actually affect simulation speed. Schedule pages need confirmation that they are used.I need to verify the remaining prior gaps more carefully.\n\nThe schedule test selects \"Cannonball\" without explicit paging. I need to verify the screen_items code and test logs to confirm this succeeds.\n\nFor Big Stand phase 5, I must check whether the fake skip prompt appears in the events code or if the test bypasses it via Dev Mode.\n\nLive slider dragging and menu nudging are implemented with existing\n\nThe test likely bypasses tests. I need to confirm phase 5 by jumping  those tests exerciseto \"Long stillness\"  the real pad or dragvia Dev Mode. I need paths rather than injecting to confirm the fake Slider events directly. skip prompt is rendered\n\nDev Mode pause freezes by the real phase logic world time by skipping rather than hardcoded. The test checks song silence and prompt text, but it may not post() updates, while time_scale scales elapsed time during active events. verify that any press actually forfeits the bonus.\n\nThe finale test injects age directly into the game struct rather than through the morning check. This may miss the PLAN.md final age formula that subtracts score/100 and caps at 10. The ending code needs inspection to\n\nFree-play schedule pages and island mat population need verification. Big Stand phase 5 timing, age cut logic, and eyes-closed tone audio must be checked in events.rs. confirm the formula is applied.\n\nThe rowboat condition requires a score of at least 500. If the bot scores lower, the test passes without verifying the rowboat transition.\n\nThe eyes-closed test appears genuine, but the tone change must be verified as an actual pitch rather than a numeric value. The name and outfit page tests need confirmation that Gray is on page two and Golden is outfit seven; the tests-core.log should reveal whether they actually executed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88ba538e-612f-4ec0-a516-cfce2c9e51b1-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":860,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88ba538e-612f-4ec0-a516-cfce2c9e51b1-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":620,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88ba538e-612f-4ec0-a516-cfce2c9e51b1-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":1100,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88ba538e-612f-4ec0-a516-cfce2c9e51b1-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|fn test_|slider|dev_mode|free_play|eyes_closed|long_still|rowboat|page|pose|wardrobe|mat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core","glob":"**/fit*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7748,"output_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":51968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"67ec6c7f-c38e-4c3e-8de0-36afc310af87"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-88ba538e-612f-4ec0-a516-cfce2c9e51b1-15","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"860→        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n870→            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n880→                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\\n                    *slot += self.score;\\n890→                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\\n                    self.together_i += 1;\\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\\n900→                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.podium = self\\n                        .together_names\\n                        .iter()\\n                        .cloned()\\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\\n                        .collect();\\n910→                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Story => {\\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\\n920→                    self.mark_played(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Reveal;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else if kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n                    let cut = (self.score / 100.0).floor().min(10.0) as u8;\\n                    self.age = self.age.saturating_sub(cut).max(18);\\n930→                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \\\"rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"extended\\\" }.into();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Ending;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n940→            }\\n            Run::Demo => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bank(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let first = !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == kind.key());\\n        if self.run == Run::Story && !matches!(kind, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            let add = if first { 1 + self.stars as u32 } else { 1 };\\n            self.day_minutes += add;\\n950→        }\\n        self.total_stars += self.stars as u32;\\n        self.mark_played(kind);\\n        if !matches!(kind, EventId::Check) && self.run == Run::Story {\\n            let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n            if !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == &key) {\\n                self.today_played.push(key);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n960→        let best = self.bests.get(&key).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        if self.score >= best {\\n            self.bests.insert(key.clone(), self.score);\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                self.ghosts.insert(key, act.samples.clone());\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.touch_save();\\n    }\\n\\n970→    fn mark_played(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        if !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == &key) {\\n            self.ever_played.push(key);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sleep_advance(&mut self) {\\n        if self.day <= 4 {\\n            self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\",\"content_concise\":\"860→        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n870→            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n880→                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\\n                    *slot += self.score;\\n890→                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\\n                    self.together_i += 1;\\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\\n900→                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.podium = self\\n                        .together_names\\n                        .iter()\\n                        .cloned()\\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\\n                        .collect();\\n910→                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Story => {\\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\\n920