p: a throne about 160 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: tall banners about 250 cm high\\\", \\\"prop: a long runner rug\\\", \\\"material: stone slabs for the floor\\\", \\\"clip: a king's commanding hand gesture\\\"]\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"text = \\\"\\\"\\\"A sailor hauls a rowboat about 300 cm long up onto a sandy beach. Nearby sit two crates about 60 cm wide, a coil of rope, and a palm tree about 400 cm tall. The sailor waves at a ship offshore.\\\"\\\"\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"  {role = \\\"tilled soil\\\", kind = \\\"material\\\", count = 1},\"},{\"line_number\":87,\"content\":\"needs = [\\\"prop: a scarecrow about 190 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a haystack about 150 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a low wooden fence about 250 cm long\\\", \\\"prop: a wheelbarrow\\\", \\\"material: tilled soil for the ground\\\", \\\"clip: a farmer's looping hoeing motion\\\"]\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"  {role = \\\"walkway surface\\\", kind = \\\"material\\\", count = 1},\"},{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"needs = [\\\"prop: a hut on stilts about 300 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a plank walkway about 250 cm long\\\", \\\"prop: a glowing mushroom cluster about 60 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a hanging lantern\\\", \\\"material: mossy rotten planks\\\"]\"},{\"line_number\":126,\"content\":\"  {role = \\\"sand ground\\\", kind = \\\"material\\\", count = 1},\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"needs = [\\\"prop: straw practice dummies about 170 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a bench about 150 cm long\\\", \\\"prop: a barrel holding wooden swords\\\", \\\"material: packed sand for the ground\\\", \\\"clip: a one-handed sword swing\\\"]\"},{\"line_number\":140,\"content\":\"  {role = \\\"platform floor\\\", kind = \\\"material\\\", count = 1},\"},{\"line_number\":143,\"content\":\"needs = [\\\"prop: a timber watchtower about 300 cm tall\\\", \\\"prop: a signal beacon about 100 cm tall that gives light\\\", \\\"prop: a ladder about 300 cm long\\\", \\\"material: snow-dusted plank