{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1024","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" discourages raising new nits.\n\nThe 18-test run included the new gap tests. The 19th test, view_and_save, was added afterward. Prior gaps did not require it; wardrobe coverage already addressed Back-only stubs. PLAN.md §11 should be checked to confirm required dev features.The long_stillness test passed, including the pick(\"Back\") action after four iterations.\n\nChecking whether View and Save are required by PLAN.md. The test exists but was missing from the captured run, so I will inspect the code for bugs.\n\nA potential name-menu page-wrapping issue was spotted: TAB_R increments without modulo while page_labels uses modulo, though the logic appears to work in practice. I need to verify that Gray is actually on page 1.\n\nTrying to understand how \"Back\" is found after four \"4x\" picks on the time tab, since labels don't contain it and the page likely hasn't changed.\n\nThe name-menu page-wrapping logic is confirmed correct. Gray is at index 6, matching the test's first selection after one TAB_R.\n\nOutfit selection also works as expected. After TAB_R and MENU_DOWN, the focused item is outfit 7, which the test asserts.\n\nSchedule search correctly locates \"Cannonball\" via substring matching on event titles.\n\nTAB_R on the time tab cycles through two pages of six items each, neither containing Back. If menu_flow were disabled for Dev sub-tabs, seek would fail to find Back and the test would fail. Since it passed, Back must be present on screen, the source code\n\nThe eyes-closed test differs from what was passed. Leaning for executed, or a hidden 30 frames moved the code path adds it. cob and raised the tone above 0.05 while remaining in phase 2. The puck is hidden via eyes_closed(). The open question is\n\nRe-examining the `page_rows` whether the pitch tone function to see if  actually plays audioit appends a \"Back\"  or merely updates aentry after slicing  status number.rows. Only the start of that function was visible earlier, so the rest needs inspection.\n\nChecking whether Sfx 31 is a real tone or just a status number by looking for its mixer entry.\n\nThe Big Stand prompt and forfeit logic both work. The test confirms desired_song returns 0 and the prompt appears after 15 seconds of silence. Any button press triggers forfeit, which aligns with the prompt's skip instruction.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b97b6d16-5132-465a-8450-4bd9144f4d3c-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1760,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b97b6d16-5132-465a-8450-4bd9144f4d3c-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/fit_ui.rs","limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b97b6d16-5132-465a-8450-4bd9144f4d3c-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/hub.toml","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9253,"output_tokens":875,"cache_read_input_tokens":90496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"579e27b6-6a9e-4837-b24f-f8a4bd40a269"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b97b6d16-5132-465a-8450-4bd9144f4d3c-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1760→            self.act = None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn attract_len(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n            \\\"island\\\" => 8.0,\\n            \\\"title\\\" => 5.0,\\n            _ => 15.0,\\n        }\\n1770→    }\\n\\n    fn desired_song(&self) -> u8 {\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract || !self.audio_unlocked {\\n            return 0;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Credits | Flow::Ending => 6,\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown => match self.kind_now() {\\n                Some(EventId::Step) => 4,\\n1780→                Some(EventId::BigStand) => {\\n                    if self.act.as_ref().is_some_and(|a| a.phase >= 4) { 0 } else { 3 }\\n                }\\n                Some(EventId::Lap | EventId::Floatie) => 5,\\n                Some(EventId::Paddle | EventId::Tide | EventId::Cannon | EventId::Tray) => 2,\\n                _ => 1,\\n            },\\n            _ => 1,\\n        }\\n    }\\n1790→\\n    fn note_device(&mut self, input: &InputFrame) {\\n        if input.device != 0 {\\n            self.device = input.device;\\n        } else if input.just(buttons::CONFIRM | buttons::PAUSE | buttons::MENU_DOWN | buttons::MENU_UP) {\\n            self.device = 2;\\n        }\\n        if self.device == 1 || self.device == 2 || self.device == 3 {\\n            self.seen_real = true;\\n            self.touch_only = false;\\n1800→        }\\n        if self.device == 4 && !self.seen_real {\\n            self.touch_only = true;\\n        }\\n        let touched = input.device == 4 && (input.any || input.ui.is_some());\\n        if (input.woke() && input.device != 4) || touched || input.pressed != 0 && input.device != 4 {\\n            self.audio_unlocked = true;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n1810→    fn pregame(&self) -> bool {\\n        !self.hub_mode\\n            && matches!(\\n                self.flow,\\n                Flow::Title | Flow::Slots | Flow::Name | Flow::Look | Flow::Outfit | Flow::About | Flow::HowTo\\n            )\\n    }\\n\\n    fn menu_flow(&self) -> bool {\\n        !matches!(self.flow, Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Island | Flow::Attract | Flow::Countdown | Flow::Card)\\n1820→    }\\n\\n    fn tick_activity(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> bool {\\n        let mut rules = self.rules.clone();\\n        rules.wobble *= (1.0 - self.settings.wobble_assist).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        let lean = (self.last_lean * self.settings.sensitivity).clamp_length_max(1.0);\\n        let held = self.last_held;\\n        let pressed = self.last_pressed;\\n        let mut act = self.act.take();\\n        let done = if let Some(act) = act.as_mut() {\\n1830→            act.no_tips = self.cheat_no_tips;\\n            events::tick(act, &mut self.bal, sim, lean, held, pressed, dt, &rules, events);\\n            act.done\\n        } else {\\n            false\\n        };\\n        self.score = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(self.score);\\n        self.stars = act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(self.stars);\\n        self.act = act;\\n        done\\n1840→    }\\n\\n    fn drive_player(&self, sim: &Sim) -> BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let mut out = BTreeMap::new();\\n        if let Some(id) = sim.state.player {\\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n            if self.flow == Flow::Island && !self.hub_wait {\\n                f.move_dir = self.last_move;\\n            }\\n            out.insert(id, f);\\n1850→        }\\n        out\\n    }\\n\\n    fn press_bits(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> (Vec2, u32) {\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check => self.act.as_ref().map(|a| events::bot(a, &self.bal, &self.rules)).unwrap_or((Vec2::ZERO, 0)),\\n            Flow::Island => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::SCHEDULE),\\n            Flow::Schedule => {\\n                let items = self.screen_items();\\n1860→                let unplayed = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| {\\n                    (100..180).contains(id)\\n                        && self\\n                            .schedule_events()\\n                            .get((id - 100) as usize)\\n                            .map(|e| !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == e.key()))\\n                            .unwrap_or(false)\\n                });\\n                let end = items.iter().position(|(id, _)| *id == ACT_END_DAY);\\n                let want = unplayed.or(end).unwrap_or(0);\\n1870→                if self.focus == want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else if self.focus < want {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_DOWN)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Title => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n1880→                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Result => {\\n                if self.focus == 0 {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM)\\n                } else {\\n                    (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::MENU_UP)\\n1890→                }\\n            }\\n            Flow::Dev | Flow::Pause | Flow::Settings | Flow::About => (Vec2::ZERO, 0),\\n            _ => (Vec2::ZERO, buttons::CONFIRM),\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn pose_clip_id(id: u32) -> bool {\\n    if id == 0 {\\n1900→        return false;\\n    }\\n    const NAMES: [&str; 7] = [\\n        \\\"FIT/Tree\\\",\\n        \\\"FIT/Warrior\\\",\\n        \\\"FIT/Fold\\\",\\n        \\\"FIT/Squat\\\",\\n        \\\"FIT/Plank\\\",\\n        \\\"FIT/Bloom\\\",\\n        \\\"MESH2MOTION/Jog\\\",\\n1910→    ];\\n    NAMES.iter().any(|name| crate::clips::find(name) == Some(id))\\n}\\n\\nfn page_labels(names: &[String], id0: u16, page: usize, per: usize) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n    let per = per.max(1);\\n    let pages = (names.len().max(1) + per - 1) / per;\\n    let start = (page % pages) * per;\\n    names.iter().enumerate().skip(start).take(per).map(|(i, name)| (id0 + i as u16, name.clone())).collect()\\n}\\n1920→\\nfn page_rows(rows: &[(u16, String)], page: usize, per: usize) -> Vec<(u16, String)> {\\n    let per = per.max(1);\\n    let pages = (rows.len().max(1) + per - 1) / per;\\n    let start = (page % pages) * per;\\n    let mut v: Vec<(u16, String)> = rows.iter().skip(start).take(per).cloned().collect();\\n    v.push((ACT_BACK, \\\"Back\\\".into()));\\n    v\\n}\\n\\n1930→fn zone_of(kind: EventId) -> &'static str {\\n    match kind {\\n        EventId::Breath | EventId::Pose | EventId::Squat | EventId::Plank | EventId::Step | EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand => \\\"studio\\\",\\n        EventId::Lap | EventId::Tray => \\\"path\\\",\\n        EventId::Floatie | EventId::Tide | EventId::Paddle | EventId::Cannon => \\\"lagoon\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn script_speaker_count(speaker: &str) -> usize {\\n    script::script().speaker_count(speaker)\",\"content_concise\":\"1760→            self.act = None;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn attract_len(&self) -> f32 {\\n        match ATTRACT.get(self.attract_i as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n            \\\"island\\\" => 8.0,\\n            \\\"title\\\" => 5.0,\\n            _ => 15.0,\\n        }\\n1770→    }\\n\\n    fn desired_song(&self) -> u8 {\\n        if self.flow == Flow::Attract || !self.audio_unlocked {\\n            return 0;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Credits | Flow::Ending => 6,\\n            Flow::Event | Flow::Check | Flow::Card | Flow::Countdown => match