{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1025","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe age formula at line 929 needs review to confirm whether the score/100 cut is capped at 10 and applied only at the big stand ending.\n\nThe Tuning page slider test works correctly. MENU_RIGHT nudges the focused slider, and the fit_sample drag path emits Slider events.The time tab includes a Back button.\n\nSlider IDs are global, not page-local. The fit_sample detection logic correctly covers the 300–399 range and the 610–616 range. The nudge_focused_slider implementation still needs review to confirm it updates live balance model values rather than just a display copy.\n\nTests passed twice. Now investigating a real bug in name paging. Page 0 shows Avery through Finley. The next step is to confirm whether the expected name \"Gray\" appears\n\nThe settings music on page 1. slider test passed, confirming the 610 ID works correctly. The beach props test asserts that props are now present in the room, so hub.toml must be checked to see if these are pre-existing engine entities or newly added room items.\n\nName paging tests passed. Page 1 shows\n\nThe pose parade capture Gray through Lane,  should be checked toand selecting Gray succeeds. confirm the puppet is actually playing  Outfit paging also the clip, not merelyworks correctly. All reporting it in status. 40 names are reachable\n\nMats now exist on  because the page counterthe island and the wardrobe wraps modulo the total test asserts they include the cannon mat. The page count. prior gap requiring only four post-credits exercises is satisfied. Whether later events can be started without cheats after credits remains unclear because free_play may be set during the credits sequence.\n\nThe test unlocks all via cheat before jumping to the island, so it does not verify whether free_play is set after a normal credits sequence. The prior bug combining schedule truncation\n\nSchedule paging tests with missing mats appears passed. The 11 events fixed in code, but  split into 3 pages,the bot playthrough  and the test locatesmay need to confirm  Cannonball correctlyfree_play is actually by cycling through  enabled post-credits.pages. Event IDs are generated from the full list index rather than the page index, so paging does not corrupt them.\n\nThe name menu test passes even with only seven names, so script.toml must be checked to confirm it contains forty names and the Swim and Golden outfits. The jump menu assigns IDs 220 through 232 to thirteen events.\n\nIsland mat placement needs verification. The test only checks that at least 11 mats exist and the cannon is present, not that every event has one.\n\nThe Big Stand age fix uses a saturating subtraction formula. However, the test injects age 45 directly into the game struct and bypasses the morning sequence entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2c50af5-639b-40d4-9c6f-dbddd76a1cb3-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":860,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2c50af5-639b-40d4-9c6f-dbddd76a1cb3-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1100,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2c50af5-639b-40d4-9c6f-dbddd76a1cb3-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1760,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3811,"output_tokens":2612,"cache_read_input_tokens":79616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"d0e3ece7-16c7-448f-bcdb-6fdc45c75d93"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c2c50af5-639b-40d4-9c6f-dbddd76a1cb3-30","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"860→        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n870→            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                if i < 3 {\\n                    self.hub_stats[i] = self.score;\\n                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n880→                    self.flow = Flow::Event;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.hub_done = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Together => {\\n                if let Some(slot) = self.together_scores.get_mut(self.together_i as usize) {\\n                    *slot += self.score;\\n890→                }\\n                self.medley_i += 1;\\n                if (self.medley_i as usize) < MEDLEY.len() {\\n                    let next = MEDLEY[self.medley_i as usize];\\n                    self.start_activity(next, sim);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Card;\\n                    self.card_t = 0.0;\\n                } else if self.together_i + 1 < self.together_n {\\n                    self.together_i += 1;\\n                    self.medley_i = 0;\\n900→                    self.flow = Flow::Pass;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                } else {\\n                    self.podium = self\\n                        .together_names\\n                        .iter()\\n                        .cloned()\\n                        .zip(self.together_scores.iter().copied())\\n                        .collect();\\n910→                    self.podium.sort_by(|a, b| b.1.partial_cmp(&a.1).unwrap_or(std::cmp::Ordering::Equal));\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Podium;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            Run::Story => {\\n                if kind == EventId::Check {\\n                    self.skill = (self.score / 1000.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                    self.age = balance_age(self.skill, self.days_completed, self.total_stars);\\n                    self.ages.push(self.age);\\n920→                    self.mark_played(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Reveal;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else if kind == EventId::BigStand {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n                    let cut = (self.score / 100.0).floor().min(10.0) as u8;\\n                    self.age = self.age.saturating_sub(cut).max(18);\\n930→                    self.ending = if self.age <= 40 { \\\"rowboat\\\" } else { \\\"extended\\\" }.into();\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Ending;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                    self.line_i = 0;\\n                    self.touch_save();\\n                } else {\\n                    self.bank(kind);\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n940→            }\\n            Run::Demo => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bank(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let first = !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == kind.key());\\n        if self.run == Run::Story && !matches!(kind, EventId::Check | EventId::BigStand) {\\n            let add = if first { 1 + self.stars as u32 } else { 1 };\\n            self.day_minutes += add;\\n950→        }\\n        self.total_stars += self.stars as u32;\\n        self.mark_played(kind);\\n        if !matches!(kind, EventId::Check) && self.run == Run::Story {\\n            let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n            if !self.today_played.iter().any(|p| p == &key) {\\n                self.today_played.push(key);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n960→        let best = self.bests.get(&key).copied().unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        if self.score >= best {\\n            self.bests.insert(key.clone(), self.score);\\n            if let Some(act) = &self.act {\\n                self.ghosts.insert(key, act.samples.clone());\\n            }\\n        }\\n        self.touch_save();\\n    }\\n\\n970→    fn mark_played(&mut self, kind: EventId) {\\n        let key = kind.key().to_string();\\n        if !self.ever_played.iter().any(|k| k == &key) {\\n            self.ever_played.push(key);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn sleep_advance(&mut self) {\\n        if self.day <= 4 {\\n            self.stamps = self.stamps.saturating_add(1);\\n980→            self.days_completed += 1;\\n        }\\n        if self.day < 5 {\\n            self.day += 1;\\n        }\\n        self.day_minutes = 0;\\n        self.today_played.clear();\\n        self.touch_save();\\n        self.flow = Flow::Wake;\\n        self.line_i = 0;\\n990→        self.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn activate(&mut self, id: u16, sim: &mut Sim) {\\n        if id == ACT_BACK {\\n            self.go_back();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.flow {\\n            Flow::Title => match id {\\n1000→                ACT_NEW => {\\n                    self.continuing = false;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_CONTINUE => {\\n                    self.continuing = true;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Slots;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n1010→                ACT_TOGETHER => {\\n                    self.run = Run::Together;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::Together;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_SETTINGS => self.open_settings(),\\n                ACT_ABOUT => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::About;\\n                    self.about_page = 0;\\n1020→                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                ACT_HOWTO => {\\n                    self.return_flow = Flow::Title;\\n                    self.flow = Flow::HowTo;\\n                    self.focus = 0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            Flow::Slots => {\\n1030→                if (10..14).contains(&id) {\\n                    let i = (id - 10) as usize;\\n                    if self.continuing {\\n                        if self.slots.get(i).map(|s| s.used).unwrap_or(false) {\\n                            self.read_slot(i);\\n                        }\\n                    } else {\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\\n                        self.reset_progress();\\n                        self.slot = i as u8;\",\"content_concise\":\"860→        self.score = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.score).unwrap_or(0.0);\\n        self.stars = self.act.as_ref().map(|a| a.stars).unwrap_or(0);\\n        if self.run == Run::Demo {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        match self.run {\\n            Run::Direct => {\\n                self.bank(kind);\\n                self.flow = Flow::Result;\\n                self.focus = 0;\\n870→            }\\n            Run::Medley => {\\n                let i = self.medley_i as usize;\\n                i