{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1026","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe Big Stand age test is valid. It sets up the morning age state and lets the real bot loop reach the ending, so the final formula runs correctly.\n\nA potential weakness exists: the rowboat assertion is skipped when score is below 500. A bot might not score enough to trigger it, yet the test still passes. This is a weaker test, but it does assert that the final age equals 45.I need to examine jump_to more carefully for id overlap and the long\n\nThe age formula is stillness jump. validated by the expected age value. If the subtraction were missing, the test would fail unless the score was below 100. The rowboat assertion only runs when the score reaches at least 500. I need to check what a typical Big Stand bot scores to confirm whether that branch was actually exercised.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-90baa887-6f57-4d73-8e10-4d70933f311e-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1340,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-90baa887-6f57-4d73-8e10-4d70933f311e-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"free_play|fn apply_body|clip","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-90baa887-6f57-4d73-8e10-4d70933f311e-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/hub.toml","limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8065,"output_tokens"