{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1027","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe Big Stand rowboat assertion was likely exercised. A two-star Big Stand score is at least 650, which triggers the age cut and confirms the rowboat check ran. The gap is fixed.\n\nPhase two of the eyes-closed animation plays sfx 31 with a pitch based on cob length, hides the puck, dims the screen, and shows an eyes-related line.\n\nA potential bug remains in the eyes-closed tone. The code pushes Sfx 31 every tick, which may produce a choppy or stacked blip rather than a continuous pitch. The prior gap was that no pitch tone played at all.A bug in jump_to for Long stillness was \n\nThe long stillness prompt test passed. Phase four triggers song zero, the skip footer appears afterfound. fifteen seconds, and any press forfeits. The jump to long stillness correctly sets phase to four.\n\nThe phase mapping \n\nThe long stillness test also verifies the score and title for Long stillness isHUDs stay empty. The slider tests passed for music and stiffness, but the app frame may not forward FitSample.ui to the simulation, so dragging might still correct. The event  be broken.IDs are 220 plus the index.\n\nThe age formula is\n\nThe app maps D-pad left and right to MENU_LEFT correct. Free play  and MENU_RIGHT in poll_gamepad. Keyboard arrows might not trigger slider unlocks at both endings.nudges if they are bound to lean instead. Criterion 4 requires pad, keyboard, and mouse to share  The apply_body clipthe same slider controls. path is verified. Beach props in hub.toml may still spawn as entities even when body is none.\n\nThe test asserts the real input path by calling MENU_RIGHT directly on InputFrame. The app merges keyboard key bindings into held() through OR logic, so a separate keyboard binding for menu right may be needed to avoid conflicting with lean.\n\nPose capture requires fit.json to contain","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1cd44913-2a67-4787-92af-31ff9a0b72bc-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fit_sample|FitSample|\\.ui","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_app/src","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1cd44913-2a67-4787-92af-31ff9a0b72bc-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FIT/Tree|fn find","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine","glob":"**/*.{rs,json}","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1cd44913-2a67-4787-92af-31ff9a0b72bc-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"self\\.mats|mats\\.push|place_mats|spots","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5080,"output_tokens":2182,"cache_read_input_tokens":99712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"02e0b040-50f0-46c9-96cc-b77cdcda1862"}
