115,32,109,97,116,99,104,32,98,121,32,97,114,101,97,46,10,53,57,51,58,56,46,32,42,42,83,104,101,108,108,46,42,42,32,65,116,116,114,97,99,116,44,32,83,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,44,32,68,101,118,32,77,111,100,101,44,32,116,111,117,99,104,45,111,110,108,121,32,99,97,114,100,44,32,72,111,119,32,116,111,32,80,108,97,121,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,46,10,53,57,53,58,49,48,46,32,42,42,80,111,108,105,115,104,46,42,42,32,87,114,105,116,101,32,116,104,101,32,115,99,114,105,112,116,32,116,111,32,102,117,108,108,32,108,101,110,103,116,104,44,32,102,101,101,108,32,112,97,115,115,32,111,110,32,101,118,101,114,121,32,101,118,101,110,116,32,117,115,105,110,103,32,116,104,101,32,115,108,105,100,101,114,115,44,32,101,120,116,114,97,32,115,101,116,32,100,114,101,115,115,105,110,103,44,32,112,97,114,116,105,99,108,101,115,44,32,116,114,97,110,115,105,116,105,111,110,115,44,32,115,116,105,110,103,101,114,115,46,10,54,50,54,58,124,32,68,101,118,32,109,111,100,101,32,102,114,111,109,32,112,97,117,115,101,44,32,108,105,118,101,32,115,108,105,100,101,114,115,44,32,114,101,115,101,116,32,124,32,49,49,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":20,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"- **Numbers** are starting values. Tune them with the dev sliders and the bot. The structure is decided; change it only if it fails in play.\"},{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"**New Stay:** choose one of 4 guest slots, pick a name from a list of about 40 funny preset names (no on-screen keyboard), pick a look (6 skin tones, 8 outfits). Then a short intro with Pip at reception, skippable.\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"**Pose Parade** (3 poses, 20 s each). Six hand-keyed poses with deadpan names: the Patient Heron, the Apologetic Lunge, the Tired Lighthouse, the Folded Deck Chair, the Reluctant Bridge, Seated Disappointment. Day 1 uses the first three. Posey holds the pose beside you. A target ring (radius 0.30 shrinking to 0.18) drifts on a slow Lissajous path (amplitude 0.35, 0.12 Hz). Inside the ring a streak multiplier climbs x1 to x4, one step per 2 s; leaving resets it. At 12 s of pose 2 a gull lands on your head and wobble is x1.6 for 5 s (\\\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird\\\"). A tip breaks the pose for 1.5 s. Score: time in ring weighted by multiplier. Bot: PD toward the ring centre.\"},{\"line_number\":135,\"content\":\"**Plank Standoff** (up to 60 s). Hold Brace and keep the dot in a ring shrinking from 0.40 to 0.20. Releasing, or leaving the ring for more than 1 s, collapses you in a comic flop. Fatigue ramps wobble; at 30 s add tremble; at 45 s Kettle laughs at his own joke and the nudge shakes the screen. Score: seconds survived / 60. Stars at 25, 40 and 55 s. Kettle, who has no arms, plank-talks you through it. Base the pose on one frame of `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`. Bot: survives at least 45 s.\"},{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"2. A pose under rising gusts, 20 s.\"},{\"line_number\":162,\"content\":\"5. **The Long Stillness:** 30 s of nothing. Music fades to silence, the HUD vanishes except the Puck. At 15 s a fake prompt offers \\\"Press Cross to skip\\\". Pressing anything forfeits the Inner Peace bonus. Then Pip, quietly: \\\"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":190,\"content\":\"- **Saves:** versioned JSON in `localStorage`: guest slots (name, look, day, minutes, stars, bests, ghosts, ages, flip-flops, unlocks) and global settings. Save on every change of day and every result.\"},{\"line_number\":289,\"content\":\"**Hand-keyed clips (verified feasible).** Write readable key poses into `engine/anim/fit.json`. Test without rebuilding: in `pav repl` run `anim_reload`, then `animsheet clip=FIT/Tree frames=1 size=300 out=out/tree.png`. The build embeds every `anim/*.json`. A tree pose, a warrior lunge and a squat were recognisable at the first attempt:\"},{\"line_number\":296,\"content\":\"\\\"Warrior\\\":{\\\"clip\\\":\\\"Warrior\\\",\\\"dur\\\":2.0,\\\"loop\\\":true,\\\"tags\\\":[\\\"pose\\\"],\\\"desc\\\":\\\"Deep lunge, arms out.\\\",\\\"keys\\\":[\"},{\"line_number\":354,\"content\":\"| Pause | Resume, Schedule, Calendar, Wardrobe, Settings, How to Play, About, Dev Mode, Quit to Title |\"},{\"line_number\":355,\"content\":\"| Settings | Music (default 10%), SFX, Voices, Glyphs, Lean Sensitivity, Wobble Assist, Rhythm Offset, Text Speed, Fullscreen, Reset Save (with confirm) |\"},{\"line_number\":363,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode** (from Pause, not shown in hub sessions). Big rows, pad-navigable, in tabs:\"},{\"line_number\":367,\"content\":\"- **Tuning:** live sliders, generated from `impl Tunable for Rules` with `params::list` and `params::set`, grouped by core and by event, with **Reset to Defaults** per group and for all. Must include: stiffness, damping, wobble, tip time, stick curve, key rates, each event's main difficulty number, rhythm windows, spin band, gust strength, bounce gain, Big Stand gusts.\"},{\"line_number\":368,\"content\":\"- **View:** input viewer, dot trace, engine stats overlay, free camera, ghost lanes.\"},{\"line_number\":369,\"content\":\"- **Save:** reset this guest.\"},{\"line_number\":567,\"content\":\"- Pause freezes the world. Settings: music defaults to 0.10. Dev sliders change values and reset. Dev jump lands where it says.\"},{\"line_number\":568,\"content\":\"- Save round trip and version. Medley on a seed gives the same score for the same inputs. Play Together completes. Ghosts match by area.\"},{\"line_number\":593,\"content\":\"8. **Shell.** Attract, Settings, Dev Mode, touch-only card, How to Play, About.\"},{\"line_number\":595,\"content\":\"10. **Polish.** Write the script to full length, feel pass on every event using the sliders, extra set dressing, particles, transitions, stingers.\"},{\"line_number\":626,\"content\":\"| Dev mode from pause, live sliders, reset | 11 |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-71201ce0-8130-4ad8-b02c-b3ebed635ad0-41","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"set\\\": \\\"FIT\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Tippy Cay poses\\\",\\n  \\\"format\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"credit\\\": \\\"Original key poses for Wobble Minutes. Not a capture.\\\",\\n  \\\"fps\\\": 30,\\n  \\\"clips\\\": {\\n    \\\"Tree\\\": {\\\"clip\\\": \\\"Tree\\\", \\\"dur\\\": 2.0, \\\"loop\\\": true, \\\"desc\\\": \\\"One knee lifted, both arms overhead\\\", \\\"keys\\\": [\\n      {\\\"t\\\": 0, \\\"hips\\\": [0, 0, 100], \\\"body\\\": [0, 0, 6], \\\"chest\\\": [0, -6, 0], \\\"head\\\": [0, 8, 0],\\n10→        \\\"armL\\\": [0, 18, 100, 14, 0], \\\"armR\\\": [0, 18, 100, 14, 0],\\n        \\\"legL\\\": [-4, 4, -100, 6, 0], \\\"legR\\\": [55, 22, -10, 95, 8],\\n        \\\"footL\\\": [0, 0, 0], \\\"footR\\\": [20, 8, 0]},\\n      {\\\"t\\\": 2.0, \\\"hips\\\": [0, 0, 100], \\\"body\\\": [0, 0, 4], \\\"chest\\\": [0, -4, 0], \\\"head\\\": [0, 6, 0],\\n        \\\"armL\\\": [0, 16, 98, 16, 0], \\\"armR\\\": [0, 16, 98, 16, 0],\\n        \\\"legL\\\": [-4, 4, -100, 6, 0], \\\"legR\\\": [52, 20, -12, 92, 8],\\n        \\\"footL\\\": [0, 0, 0], \\\"footR\\\": [18, 8, 0]}\\n    ]},\\n    \\\"Warrior\\\": {\\\"clip\\\": \\\"Warrior\\\", \\\"dur\\\": 2.0, \\\"loop\\\": true, \\\"desc\\\": \\\"A long lunge with the arms in a wide line\\\", \\\"keys\\\": [\\n      {\\\"t\\\": 0, \\\"hips\\\": [12, 0, 90], \\\"body\\\": [0, 10, 0], \\\"chest\\\": [8, -4, 0], \\\"head\\\": [-6, 4, 0],\\n20→        \\\"armL\\\": [0, 96, 8, 4, 0], \\\"armR\\\": [70, 30, 12, 6, 0],\\n        \\\"legL\\\": [48, 16, -72, 22, 0], \\\"legR\\\": [-36, 22, -78, 28, 0],\\n        \\\"footL\\\": [8, 6, 0], \\\"footR\\\": [12, 4, 0]},\\n      {\\\"t\\\": 2.0, \\\"hips\\\": [12, 0, 91], \\\"body\\\": [0, 8, 0], \\\"chest\\\": [6, -2, 0], \\\"head\\\": [-4, 2, 0],\\n        \\\"armL\\\": [0,