{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1039","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe eyes-closed event now combines stillness with a tone, which differs from the prior gap description that treated it as a second stillness test. Schedule filtering and page mapping were also reviewed.The view/save test passed. 19 tests ran total,\n\nThe age formula is verified against the with 18 filtered out. plan. Morning age minus score divided by one hundred, capped at ten, correctly yields a rowboat threshold of forty.\n\nThe suite is green. The new test passed alongside the earlier 18, and the code compiles. I will now look for a real bug in the shipped\n\nThe age formula holds for high morning ages. A test set age to 45 before the big stand, but in real play the morning check sets  fixes.the starting value first.\n\nOnly the morning check and the big stand event modify age, so other events cannot corrupt it.\n\nThere is a potential double-count of stamps: the big stand finish adds one stamp while sleep_advance may add another. This is harmless because the big stand is day five and does not trigger sleep.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3a6a5c4e-bb52-4e0b-80a3-9198e99edda2-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":520,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3a6a5c4e-bb52-4e0b-80a3-9198e99edda2-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Flow::Schedule|100\\.\\.","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3a6a5c4e-bb52-4e0b-80a3-9198e99edda2-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.buil