{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1040","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nBot test asserts five stamps. Passed.\n\nSlider drag id range `(610..=616).contains(id)` but id is &u16, contains works. 300..400. Good.\n\n8. **Bug in fit_sample: slider detection uses `*id >= 300 && *id < 400` OR 610..=616**. Dev jump ids are 220+.Checking schedule activation Not sliders. Good.\n\n and a potential page9. **Confirm on a tuning row**: activate_dev overflow bug on name tab 4 only handles  selection.reset ids, else {}. So confirm is no-op, left/right nudges. That's the intended fix. Good.\n\n10. **Does MENU_RIGHT during an event also try to nudge?** menu_flow is false during event, so nudge only in menus. During event, MENU_RIGHT might be unused. Good.\n\n11.\n\nDev tab page indices reset to zero when the menu opens. The time page fits within the six-item stack limit. Tuning rows build their own list with reset and back buttons, so no duplicate Back appears. The cheat menu is eight items, which pages four per screen, and the Unlock all option sits on the first page.\n\nThe jump menu correctly maps event titles to their IDs. The floatie test passed, confirming walking and mat collision work. Picking wardrobe from dev mode and selecting a sun cap returns the\n\nBot_big phase 2 uses player to the return flow. bot_step against time-shifted notes. The age test passed. All 11 tests finished in 0.52s.\n\nCalendar sits on dev page one, so the flow correctly advances to that page after wardrobe and then selects it. The next checks are browser test honesty, HTML existence, TODOs, and whether the long-stillness song zero is gated by audio_unlocked.\n\nThe event reached its ending. A typical big stand bot score likely averages over 500 across the five phases. The conditional rowboat check would have fired if the score had met that threshold.\n\nThe test passed because the PAUSE press unlocks audio before the big stand event begins. The harness sets pressed to non-zero while leaving device at zero, so the unlock condition is satisfied and song 3 is returned.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d81654a0-70c0-4aa4-8bdc-04803a6ee6fc-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn stars|stars_for|400|650|850","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d81654a0-70c0-4aa4-8bdc-04803a6ee6fc-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1040,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d81654a0-70c0-4aa4-8bdc-04803a6ee6fc-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs","offset":100,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3033,"output_tokens":765,"cache_read_input_tokens":111744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"e23e4ef0-535b-4120-8ca2-e6823ce30c72"}
