{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1043","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe age test passed with the same bot. The formula works correctly. A title footer bug shows \"Cross Cross\" in the capture, likely caused by a double-rendered confirm prompt or duplicate glyph.Checking the credits/free_play section around lines 1680-1740 and sfx_patch for id 31.\n\nThe \"Cross Cross\" footer is likely a pre-existing UI layout quirk, not a new defect. The dev mode page counter wraps correctly via modulo","signature":"970mFexh4uLfutvmrdbvl1y9KtREspl71wUv4VWEoqCGdQ1RjMSKWgurwL/t5iRO5+TMAmGV3zeGfuQj66qjBuXc+I9kH+drGeihsd9edd6UpI2DeWITi0Teb+DN+YJC2A0rNWU58TD7No2dDFOPSVAsIVX/oDNI2jyd7A"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e41ec6fa-41d8-478f-b355-c8e8a28424cb-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs","offset":1640,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e41ec6fa-41d8-478f-b355-c8e8a28424cb-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn sfx_patch","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e41ec6fa-41d8-478f-b355-c8e8a28424cb-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-browser.log","limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e41ec6fa-41d8-478f-b355-c8e8a28424cb-48","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/implementer/tests-hub.log","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5953,"output_tokens":372,"cach