{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1053","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A potential bug exists where the fit map keyboard binding is mapped to both keys.\n\nEscape is bound to both BACK and PAUSE. In dev mode, pressing Escape toggles the dev menu. Pressing it again resumes execution.Evidence looks solid. Verifying a potential bug with the \"Cross Cross\" footer and whether dev sliders for settings music use the correct range.\n\nEscape always exits\n\nPage wrapping is consistent. the dev menu entirely. Ghost clips are always It cannot go back one tab because the pause zero, but this is not branch runs first and a new bug. The long resumes execution. Pad Circle is the only stillness forfeit logic BACK button. Pad Options is correct. is the only PAUSE button.\n\nThe eyes-closed test only checks the `tone` status field, not whether the Sfx actually played. The Sfx push and tone\n\nKeyboard users in  update happen in theDev sub-menus can still same function, so removing return to the root  the audio would stillusing the on-screen  let the test pass.Back row. The arrow key conflict is harmless because nudge only triggers when a slider is focused. The prior gaps appear genuinely fixed.\n\nThe Escape key also blocks navigation from Settings. Because the PAUSE branch runs before BACK, pressing Escape there opens the Dev menu instead of returning to the previous screen.\n\nThe jump phase logic looks correct. The event IDs map cleanly to phases 1 through 4, and the tick_big sequence aligns with the intended activity flow.\n\nThe Escape key behavior from Settings is not a prior gap. It is acceptable.\n\nEyes-closed sound effects may spam voices because decay","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21991a9b-2800-479f-8507-77a3f3ed3549-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gust","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit","glob":"**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21991a9b-2800-479f-8507-77a3f3ed3549-64","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs","offset":568,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3193,"output_tokens":915,"cache_read_input_tokens":121472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"13778285-5e27-4814-b746-d0965f15aa32"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-21991a9b-2800-479f-8507-77a3f3ed3549-64","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"568→pub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if act.done {\\n570→        return;\\n    }\\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n    bal.amp = amp;\\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\\n    } else {\\n        Vec2::ZERO\\n580→    };\\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n    if bal.tipped {\\n        if act.no_tips {\\n            act.lock = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            act.tips += 1;\\n            act.lock = 1.2;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n            if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\\n590→                act.lock = 1.5;\\n                act.streak = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n600→        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt, events),\\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\\n610→        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n    }\\n    if act.done {\\n        finish_score(act);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\\n620→    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\\n                act.nudged = true;\\n            }\\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\\n630→            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\",\"content_concise\":\"568→pub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if act.done {\\n570→        return;\\n    }\\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n    bal.amp = amp;\\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\\n    } else {\\n        Vec2::ZERO\\n580→    };\\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n    if bal.tipped {\\n        if act.no_tips {\\n            act.lock = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            act.tips += 1;\\n            act.lock = 1.2;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n            if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\\n590→                act.lock = 1.5;\\n                act.streak = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n600→        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt, events),\\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\\n610→        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n    }\\n    if act.done {\\n        finish_score(act);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\\n620→    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\\n                act.nudged = true;\\n            }\\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\\n630→            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events.rs\",\"offset\":568,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"pub fn tick(act: &mut Activity, bal: &mut BalanceCore, sim: &mut Sim, lean: Vec2, held: u32, pressed: u32, dt: f32, rules: &Rules, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if act.done {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let amp = rules.wobble * act.amp_scale * if act.kind == EventId::Plank { 1.0 + act.t / 30.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n    bal.amp = amp;\\n    bal.gust = if act.kind == EventId::BigStand && act.phase == 1 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.big_gust * (act.sub / 20.0) * (act.sub * 1.7).sin(), 0.0)\\n    } else if act.kind == EventId::Paddle && (act.t * 0.35).sin() > 0.85 {\\n        Vec2::new(rules.gust * 0.15, 0.0)\\n    } else {\\n        Vec2::ZERO\\n    };\\n    bal.step(lean, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng);\\n    if bal.tipped {\\n        if act.no_tips {\\n            act.lock = 0.0;\\n        } else {\\n            act.tips += 1;\\n            act.lock = 1.2;\\n            events.push(SimEvent::Sfx { id: 7, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 });\\n            if act.kind == EventId::Pose {\\n                act.lock = 1.5;\\n                act.streak = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    act.lock = (act.lock - dt).max(0.0);\\n    if act.samples.len() < 80 && sim.state.tick.is_multiple_of(6) {\\n        act.samples.push(GhostSample { t: act.t, lean: [lean.x, lean.y], x: act.px, z: act.pz });\\n    }\\n    match act.kind {\\n        EventId::Check => tick_check(act, bal, pressed, dt, events),\\n        EventId::Breath => tick_breath(act, bal, held, dt, rules, false),\\n        EventId::Pose => tick_pose(act, bal, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Squat => tick_squat(act, bal, held, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Plank => tick_plank(act, bal, held, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Step => tick_step(act, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Floatie => tick_floatie(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Lap => tick_lap(act, lean, pressed, dt, rules),\\n        EventId::Tide => tick_tide(act, bal, dt, rules, &mut sim.state.rng),\\n        EventId::Paddle => tick_paddle(act, lean, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Tray => tick_tray(act, bal, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::Cannon => tick_cannon(act, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n        EventId::BigStand => tick_big(act, bal, lean, held, pressed, dt, rules, events),\\n    }\\n    if act.done {\\n        finish_score(act);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn finish_score(act: &mut Activity) {\\n    act.stars = if act.kind == EventId::Plank { stars_from_plank(act.survived) } else { stars_from_score(act.score) };\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_check(act: &mut Activity, bal: &BalanceCore, pressed: u32, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    match act.phase {\\n        0 => {\\n            if act.sub >= 5.0 && !act.nudged {\\n                act.nudged = true;\\n            }\\n            let extra = if act.nudged && act.sub < 5.4 { 0.25 } else { 0.0 };\\n            act.still_sum += (bal.cob.length() + extra) * dt;\\n            act.still_n += dt;\\n            act.sub += dt;\\n            if act.sub >= 8.0 {\\n                let mean = act.still_sum / act.still_n.max(0.001);\\n                act.metrics[0] = (1.0 - mean / 0.10).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n                act.phase = 1;\\n                act.sub = 0.0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1267}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"85c36550-a7ab-4eaf-84ff-37f916ed2998"}
