sts-view.log` and in the 19-test suite.\\n\\n`tests-core.log` runs 5 and 6: `19 passed; 0 failed` twice. Browser `6 passed`. Hub `6 passed` (2–4 players, loss/jitter, host-leave, solo). Title and Pose Parade captures match across both takes and are not blank.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"032609f9-dae2-4fd2-ae2d-c9efa7ea643b"}
