{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1060","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-53344e94-0fb5-4e57-94ef-69e415655f39-64","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-verdict-b3947fd4d9d9-2-2.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"fit.rs drives pad MENU_RIGHT, dev jump/cheats/time, paged schedule and names, eyes-closed tone, silent Big Stand skip, age cut, mats, and FIT/Tree; tests-core.log EXIT5/EXIT6 are 19 passed twice; drag test EXIT_APP 0; title and pose captures show the beach and a raised-arm pose.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"All eight prior gaps are fixed on the shipped path and covered by tests that drive the sim, not a copy of it.\\n\\n- Sliders: `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the pointer is held on ids 300–399 and 610–616 (`input.rs`), and the app forwards that event. Pad and arrow left/right call `nudge_focused_slider`. `music_defaults_quiet_and_a_dev_slider_resets` moves music 0.10→0.20 and stiffness, then reset. The shardfall drag test passed after the `&MouseButton` fix (`tests-core.log` EXIT_APP 0).\\n- Dev Mode from pause has Jump, Cheats, time scale (0–4x, used as `dt * time_scale`), tuning sliders, and reset. Long-stillness reaches 15s inside 400 frames only if 4x is applied.\\n- Free-play schedule pages the full roster (`schedule_rows` / `page_rows`); credits set `free_play`. Cannonball is started from the schedule. Eleven island mats exist; walking onto the floatie mat opens that event.\\n- Big Stand phase ≥ 4 sets song 0, clears the score banner, and after 15s shows “Press … to skip”; a press forfeits rather than skipping.\\n- Finale age is morning age minus `floor(score/100)` capped at 10, floored at 18, and `<= 40` is the rowboat. A seeded bot from age 45 reaches that ending.\\n- Eyes-closed (check phase 2) hides the puck, dims, and emits pitched sfx 31 from centre-of-pressure distance. The tone status moves when the player leans.\\n- Name and outfit lists page (`page_labels`); Gray and Golden are selectable. Wardrobe and Calendar are real rows. `anim/fit.json` hand-keys Tree/Warrior/Fold/Squat/Plank/Bloom. Pose capture shows arms overhead; title capture shows the menu, lagoon, boat, lamp, stall, and bench.\\n\\nGating logs: fit sim 19 passed, 0 failed, twice; browser 6 passed; hub 6 passed (2–4 players, latency/jitter/loss, host-leave, solo, session.js byte match). Hand-in files are in the work root.\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-53344e94-0fb5-4e57-94ef-69e415655f39-65","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/tmp/grok-goal-b3947fd4d9d9/goal-classifier-b3947fd4d9d9-2-skeptic-2.md","content":"# Skeptic round 2\n\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is fixed on the shipped path, and the captured tests drive that path.\n\n## Prior gaps\n\n- **Sliders.** `fit_sample` emits `UiEvent::Slider` while the pointer is held on tuning ids 300–399 and settings ids 610–616. The app frame forwards that event. D-pad and arrow left/right call `nudge_focused_slider`. `music_defaults_quiet_and_a_dev_slider_resets` moves music from 0.10 to about 0.20 and moves stiffness, then reset restores it. The shardfall held-pointer test passed (`tests-core.log`, EXIT_APP 0) after the `MouseButton` borrow fix.\n- **Dev Mode.** Pause opens Dev with Jump, Cheats, time scale (0.25x–4x and a frozen clock), tuning sliders, and reset. World step uses `dt * time_scale`. The long-stillness test only reaches 15s inside 400 frames if 4x is live.\n- **Free play and mats.** The schedule pages every non-check, non-finale event. Credits set `free_play`. The schedule test starts Cannonball. Eleven mats are placed; walking onto the floatie mat and confirming opens that event.\n- **Big Stand.** Phase 4 or later requests song 0, clears the score banner, and after 15s shows “Press … to skip”. A press sets forfeit and does not skip the phase.\n- **Final age.** Ending age is morning age minus `floor(score/100)`, capped at 10 and floored at 18. Age 40 or under is the rowboat. A bot from a morning age of 45 reaches that ending.\n- **Eyes closed.** Check phase 2 hides the puck, dims the view, and emits pitched sfx 31 from how far the dot is from centre. Leaning moves the tone.\n- **Names and outfits.** Lists page. The pad test selects Gray and the Golden outfit.\n- **Beach and poses.** `anim/fit.json` hand-keys Tree, Warrior, Fold, Squat, Plank, and Bloom. Pose Parade plays `FIT/Tree`. The pose capture shows arms overhead and the balance puck. The title capture shows the menu plus lagoon, boat, lamp, stall, and bench. Wardrobe and Calendar are real rows, not Back-only stubs.\n\n## Gating evidence\n\n- Fit sim: 19 passed, 0 failed, twice (`tests-core.log` EXIT5 and EXIT6).\n- Browser: 6 passed, 0 failed.\n- Hub: 6 passed, 0 failed, including session.js byte match, 2–4 players with latency, jitter, and loss, host-leave, and solo.\n- `PROGRESS.md`, `exit-interview.json` (`usage` is `added on import`, genre Sports, players 1–4, name Wobble Minutes), and the HTML page are in the work root.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5385,"output_tokens":2991,"cache_read_input_tokens":134912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"496932b6-3254-4119-9bbf-550134fb3cc2"}
