,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":12,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/hub/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":86,\"content\":\"  then deals it only when every player's browser has WebGPU.\"},{\"line_number\":229,\"content\":\"- `AIHub.fail(message)`: the game cannot run in this browser. From the host\"},{\"line_number\":327,\"content\":\"Then open `http://localhost:8000/harness.html?game=GAME.html&players=2&auto=1`.\"},{\"line_number\":388,\"content\":\"| `AIHub.fail(message)` | the game cannot run in this browser |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"Play Shardfall in the browser from one self-contained file: `scripts/build-web.sh\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"Run `scripts/animation-studio.sh` or `shardfall.exe --animation-studio` to open Animation Studio.\"},{\"line_number\":73,\"content\":\"Browser: serve the web build (below) and open it in a recent Chrome or Edge; add `?room=drift`\"},{\"line_number\":120,\"content\":\"scripts/build-web.sh          # browser build -> target/web (WebAssembly + WebGPU)\"},{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"python3 -m http.server -d target/web 8000   # then open http://localhost:8000\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"scripts/build-web.sh --single-file   # -> target/web/shardfall.html, runs from file://\"},{\"line_number\":140,\"content\":\"the address for the tech demo or `?room=drift` for a particular room. Saves stay in each browser's local\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-222132__x35112d/work/Wobble Minutes-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-222132/engine/pavilion-lite/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"> `cargo test` passing, and tell me how to play it.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa27-ba86-7730-89c2-9178ff908bce","uuid":"9dcfd137-6d8f-483c-b4f0-11da71552ab8"}
